values
  ('524841832954897737', 'Save and Protect', 1990, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Persov, Aleksandr Sokurov, Tatyana Komarova', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Cécile Zervudacki, Robert Vaab, Aleksandr Cherednik, Dariya Shpalikova, Evgeny Yufit, Igor Bezrukov, Sergey Vinokurov, Pavel Fetisov', null, 'Inspired by Flaubert’s Madame Bovary, Sokurov’s Save and Protect recalls the most crucial events of Emma’s decline and fall: affairs with the aristocratic Rodolphe and the student Leon, the humiliation that follows her husband’s botching of the operation on the stable boy’s clubfoot. The universality of the theme of eternal struggle between the soul and the flesh is conveyed through the absence of specific reference to time or place: although the film seems to begin in 1840, its surreal mode effortlessly accommodates an automobile and the strains of “When the Saints Go Marching In” on an off-screen radio. Focusing on passion from a woman’s perspective and downplaying plot, Sokurov explores his subject in exquisite detail, capturing not only the heat of passion but also the quiet moments before and after and the innocent sensuousness of the body.', 'Inspired by Flaubert’s Madame Bovary, Sokurov’s Save and Protect recalls the most crucial events of Emma’s decline and fall: affairs with the aristocratic Rodolphe and the student Leon, the humiliation that follows her husband’s botching of the operation on the stable boy’s clubfoot. The universality of the theme of eternal struggle between the soul and the flesh is conveyed through the absence of specific reference to time or place: although the film seems to begin in 1840, its surreal mode effortlessly accommodates an automobile and the strains of “When the Saints Go Marching In” on an off-screen radio. Focusing on passion from a woman’s perspective and downplaying plot, Sokurov explores his subject in exquisite detail, capturing not only the heat of passion but also the quiet moments before and after and the innocent sensuousness of the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M1CFe4YqkoFUtVjY4inzVD0hcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155403'),
  ('192364334138437069', 'Save Me', 1994, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Debra Rodman, Ilan Rosenberg, Steve Rockmael', 'Neil Ronco', 'Harry Hamlin, Lysette Anthony, Michael Ironside, Steve Railsback, Olivia Hussey, Bill Nunn, Joseph Campanella, Neil Ronco', null, 'An accountant beleaguered by personal and professional problems gets involved with a femme fatale and her mysterious psychiatrist.', 'An accountant beleaguered by personal and professional problems gets involved with a femme fatale and her mysterious psychiatrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Df1aeTtxDH6jQsXLAFvwEBslpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30361'),
  ('212170281288665525', 'Save Me', 2008, 'Drama', 'Robert Cary', 'Robert Desiderio', 'Chad Allen, Robert Gant, Jeremy Glazer, David Petruzzi, Arron Shiver, Stephen Lang, Judith Light, Colin Jones', null, 'A sex and drug addicted young man who is forced into a Christian-run ministry in an attempt to cure him of his "gay affliction", where instead he is faced with the truth in his heart and spirit.', 'A sex and drug addicted young man who is forced into a Christian-run ministry in an attempt to cure him of his "gay affliction", where instead he is faced with the truth in his heart and spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4DNfo5r0Btb2sJgORd5uVwOriY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27440'),
  ('553796188211830086', 'Save Me from Everything', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ryan Lacen, Anthony Baldino', null, 'Paige Henderson', null, 'This elevated horror tale follows the emotionally unstable Emmy, who is led to Ireland where a Stranger guides her investigation of a family curse and its sinister origins.', 'This elevated horror tale follows the emotionally unstable Emmy, who is led to Ireland where a Stranger guides her investigation of a family curse and its sinister origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JZptJxKpme0FVYwdfYc7wLD31y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015261'),
  ('609247082082883228', 'Save Our School', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Hakim Zouhani, Antoine Monod, Carine May', 'Carine May, Hakim Zouhani', 'Rachida Brakni, Anaïde Rozam, Disiz, Mourad Boudaoud, Gilbert Melki, Sébastien Chassagne, Léonie Simaga, Raphaël Quenard', null, 'A delightful and ebullient comedy on Paris’ first suburban “green school”.', 'A delightful and ebullient comedy on Paris’ first suburban “green school”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XoeOsas43eWRLMIIqHkZcuXt1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957382'),
  ('31912704958859508', 'Save Raffi!', 2015, 'Comedy, Family', 'Thomas Benesch, Arend Agthe', 'Arend Agthe, Bettina Kupfer', 'Nicolaus von der Recke, Sophie Lindenberg, Henriette Heinze, Claes Bang, Bettina Kupfer, Rainer Strecker, Dirk Martens, Michael Ihnow', null, 'Dr. Henry Wiese went to the Afghan front, his wife Helen, also MD, refused to follow and even threatened with divorce. Kid son Samuel ''Sammi'' now clings completely to the hamster Raffi he received from dad. He even gets the vet to perform expensive surgery on the pet rodent, but on the way home it gets accidentally kidnapped by Rocky, a just paroled car thief. Caught in her own lies, Sammi''s mean sister Molly and her nice boyfriend Jochen must help search for Raffi, who wanders into adventures and a TV studio ''show starring'' door-choosing hamsters, arousing enmity.', 'Dr. Henry Wiese went to the Afghan front, his wife Helen, also MD, refused to follow and even threatened with divorce. Kid son Samuel ''Sammi'' now clings completely to the hamster Raffi he received from dad. He even gets the vet to perform expensive surgery on the pet rodent, but on the way home it gets accidentally kidnapped by Rocky, a just paroled car thief. Caught in her own lies, Sammi''s mean sister Molly and her nice boyfriend Jochen must help search for Raffi, who wanders into adventures and a TV studio ''show starring'' door-choosing hamsters, arousing enmity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmvL0o02OI0KHOCWmiMJf77Tyis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385501'),
  ('551078537525048364', 'Save the Cinema', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sara Sugarman, Hamish Doyne-Ditmas, Matt Poynter', 'Piers Ashworth', 'Samantha Morton, Tom Felton, Jonathan Pryce, Owain Yeoman, Susan Wokoma, Jason Hughes, Rhod Gilbert, Thaer Al-Shayei', 'NR', 'The true story of Liz Evans, a hairdresser and leader of a youth theatre in Carmarthen, Wales, who began a campaign in 1993 to save the Lyric theatre from closure. Alongside then Mayor of Carmarthen Richard Goodridge, they enlisted the help of Steven Spielberg, securing a special premiere of Jurassic Park.', 'The true story of Liz Evans, a hairdresser and leader of a youth theatre in Carmarthen, Wales, who began a campaign in 1993 to save the Lyric theatre from closure. Alongside then Mayor of Carmarthen Richard Goodridge, they enlisted the help of Steven Spielberg, securing a special premiere of Jurassic Park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRYbrkvHV2TCt2dT0G8aGoFK2hR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790386'),
  ('268206083183438731', 'Save the Date', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Mohan, Elisha Christian', 'Michael Mohan, Jeffrey Brown', 'Lizzy Caplan, Alison Brie, Martin Starr, Mark Webber, Geoffrey Arend, Melonie Díaz, Timothy Busfield, Gigi Bermingham', 'R', 'After breaking up with her boyfriend, a bookstore manager resists a seemingly perfect guy''s attempts to woo her.', 'After breaking up with her boyfriend, a bookstore manager resists a seemingly perfect guy''s attempts to woo her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSNMz9BRpEfVvpKIv3fROd2bLOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84333'),
  ('478155933820372479', 'Save the Green Planet!', 2003, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Hong Kyung-pyo, Jang Joon-hwan, Kim Min-soo', 'Jang Joon-hwan', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Baek Yoon-sik, Hwang Jeong-min, Lee Jae-yong, Lee Joo-hyun, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Dong-hyun, Kim Kwang-shik', null, 'A young man believes that his country''s leaders are actually toxic reptilian aliens sent down to launch a takeover of his beloved Earth. So he decides to abduct them and force the truth out on camera in his basement that doubles as a film studio and torture chamber.', 'A young man believes that his country''s leaders are actually toxic reptilian aliens sent down to launch a takeover of his beloved Earth. So he decides to abduct them and force the truth out on camera in his basement that doubles as a film studio and torture chamber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kou9TDjveVwBhWnxCRUT88RUVCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11297'),
  ('931192070317718687', 'Save the Last Dance', 2001, 'Drama, Family, Romance, Music', 'Robbie Greenberg, Thomas Carter, Jon Mallard', 'Duane Adler, Cheryl Edwards', 'Julia Stiles, Sean Patrick Thomas, Kerry Washington, Fredro Starr, Terry Kinney, Bianca Lawson, Vince Green, Garland Whitt', 'PG-13', 'After the death of her mother, Sara moves to the South Side of Chicago to live with her father and gets transferred to a majority-black school. Her life takes a turn for the better when befriends Chenille and her brother Derek, who helps her with her dancing skills.', 'After the death of her mother, Sara moves to the South Side of Chicago to live with her father and gets transferred to a majority-black school. Her life takes a turn for the better when befriends Chenille and her brother Derek, who helps her with her dancing skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sV8GIxT3BjHIiwgKUNwk1S8VSLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9816'),
  ('392063713062139310', 'Save the Last Dance 2', 2006, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'David Petrarca, David A. Makin', null, 'Izabella Miko, Columbus Short, Jacqueline Bisset, Maria Brooks, Aubrey Dollar, Ian Brennan, Tre Armstrong, Seana McKenna', 'PG-13', 'Sara joins Julliard in New York to fulfill her and her mother''s dream of becoming the Prima ballerina of the school. She befriends her roommates, Zoe and Miles, who teach hip-hop classes. She has ballet classes with the rigid and famous Monique Delacroix that she idolizes - Monique requires full commitment, discipline and hard work from her students. When Miles, who is a composer, invites Sara to help him compose the music for the dance choreography Sara''s passion for hip-hop is sparked and she also falls in love with Miles. When she is assigned to perform Giselle in an important event, she feels divided between the technique of the ballet and the creative work offered by Miles.', 'Sara joins Julliard in New York to fulfill her and her mother''s dream of becoming the Prima ballerina of the school. She befriends her roommates, Zoe and Miles, who teach hip-hop classes. She has ballet classes with the rigid and famous Monique Delacroix that she idolizes - Monique requires full commitment, discipline and hard work from her students. When Miles, who is a composer, invites Sara to help him compose the music for the dance choreography Sara''s passion for hip-hop is sparked and she also falls in love with Miles. When she is assigned to perform Giselle in an important event, she feels divided between the technique of the ballet and the creative work offered by Miles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc9Ymn4p7hdjZdKwgtfGGlStFTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9817'),
  ('347053320099556141', 'Save the Tiger', 1973, 'Drama', 'John G. Avildsen, James Crabe, Christopher N. Seiter', 'Steve Shagan', 'Jack Lemmon, Jack Gilford, Laurie Heineman, Norman Burton, Patricia Smith, Thayer David, William Hansen, Harvey Jason', 'R', 'A businessman''s professional struggles begin to conflict with his personal life over the course of two days.', 'A businessman''s professional struggles begin to conflict with his personal life over the course of two days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htLwmbIc8L2ufP5g4Wv5OWCOYMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38714'),
  ('234910463569039220', 'Save The Tree', 2021, 'Animation', 'Iker Alvarez, Haizea Pastor', null, null, null, 'In the forests of the Pyrenees, there are still people who tell stories of trees... of fantastic beings with powers beyond our imagination. And with those trees, from the very moment in which their seeds sprout, a pixie becomes their inseparable companion.', 'In the forests of the Pyrenees, there are still people who tell stories of trees... of fantastic beings with powers beyond our imagination. And with those trees, from the very moment in which their seeds sprout, a pixie becomes their inseparable companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdzUP6mV5VlSWVffA4Y18k4LK62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886896'),
  ('582706782207926493', 'Save Yourselves!', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alex Huston Fischer, Eleanor Wilson, Matt Clegg', 'Alex Huston Fischer, Eleanor Wilson', 'Sunita Mani, John Reynolds, Ben Sinclair, John Early, Jo Firestone, Gary Richardson, Johanna Day, Stephen Koepfer', 'R', 'A young Brooklyn couple head upstate to disconnect from their phones and reconnect with themselves. Cut off from their devices, they miss the news that the planet is under attack.', 'A young Brooklyn couple head upstate to disconnect from their phones and reconnect with themselves. Cut off from their devices, they miss the news that the planet is under attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvNwVJ3Wh6KeE28TMIczJD6OEPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653569'),
  ('152480039834113711', 'Saved By the Bell: Hawaiian Style', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Don Barnhart', 'Bennett Tramer', 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Mario López, Dustin Diamond, Elizabeth Berkley, Lark Voorhies, Dean Jones, Dennis Haskins', 'NR', 'Kelly''s grandpa invites the whole gang to his little hotel "The Hideaway" in Hawaii for summer vacation. They expect a marvelous time at the beach - without Belding. Upon arriving, they quickly learn that not only is Belding there, but they also have to help Kelly''s grandpa from losing his hotel. Meanwhile Zack meets (again) the love of his life, Jessie and Slater bet with Lisa that they won''t fight, and Screech gets kidnapped by the Pupuku clan.', 'Kelly''s grandpa invites the whole gang to his little hotel "The Hideaway" in Hawaii for summer vacation. They expect a marvelous time at the beach - without Belding. Upon arriving, they quickly learn that not only is Belding there, but they also have to help Kelly''s grandpa from losing his hotel. Meanwhile Zack meets (again) the love of his life, Jessie and Slater bet with Lisa that they won''t fight, and Screech gets kidnapped by the Pupuku clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpUVeuVpeX2cNrA7GL0j2jxL9xC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37022'),
  ('621604151099076411', 'Saved By the Bell: Wedding in Las Vegas', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jeff Melman', null, 'Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Mario López, Dustin Diamond, Lark Voorhies, Dennis Haskins, Elizabeth Berkley, Bob Golic', 'NR', 'In this conclusion of the long running series it finally happens: Kelly and Zack will marry. Zack''s parents are against the early commitment and Kelly''s parents can''t afford it, so only the gang travels to Las Vegas for the wedding. However, before the wedding can happen, they have to live through many adventures, including Zack losing his hard earned money, Kelly becoming jealous and Slater being chased by mobsters.', 'In this conclusion of the long running series it finally happens: Kelly and Zack will marry. Zack''s parents are against the early commitment and Kelly''s parents can''t afford it, so only the gang travels to Las Vegas for the wedding. However, before the wedding can happen, they have to live through many adventures, including Zack losing his hard earned money, Kelly becoming jealous and Slater being chased by mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7u6rh2HcfdtHp6QopXk8cDPPMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37020'),
  ('848291451457606910', 'Saved by the Belle', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Charley Chase', null, 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, LeRoy Mason, Carmen Laroux, Gino Corrado, Manuel París, Vernon Dent', 'NR', 'The stooges are traveling salesmen stranded in Valeska, a tropical country prone to earthquakes. Having no luck selling fur coats to the natives they are arrested when they receive a telegram instructing them to "get rid of present wardrobe" and an official thinks they are planning to assassinate president Ward Robey. With the help of Rita, a beautiful revolutionary, the boys escape a firing squad, and are sent on a mission to deliver important plans to the revolutionary leader. When they deliver a rolled up calendar by mistake, they are once again heading for a firing squad but are spared when Rita arrives with the real plans.', 'The stooges are traveling salesmen stranded in Valeska, a tropical country prone to earthquakes. Having no luck selling fur coats to the natives they are arrested when they receive a telegram instructing them to "get rid of present wardrobe" and an official thinks they are planning to assassinate president Ward Robey. With the help of Rita, a beautiful revolutionary, the boys escape a firing squad, and are sent on a mission to deliver important plans to the revolutionary leader. When they deliver a rolled up calendar by mistake, they are once again heading for a firing squad but are spared when Rita arrives with the real plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kNi6v4TDRQnEhtdxzdSxxk43Yd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115926'),
  ('291600482944128320', 'Saved!', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Brian Dannelly, Pete Whyte, Scott J. Ateah', 'Brian Dannelly, Michael Urban', 'Jena Malone, Mandy Moore, Macaulay Culkin, Patrick Fugit, Eva Amurri, Heather Matarazzo, Martin Donovan, Mary-Louise Parker', 'PG-13', 'Mary is a good Christian girl who goes to a good Christian high school where she has good Christian friends and a perfect Christian boyfriend. Her life seems perfect, until the day that she finds out that her boyfriend may be gay — and that she’s pregnant.', 'Mary is a good Christian girl who goes to a good Christian high school where she has good Christian friends and a perfect Christian boyfriend. Her life seems perfect, until the day that she finds out that her boyfriend may be gay — and that she’s pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmf2tFTcRJZVEQ9e3mgLH5gAQYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13193'),
  ('140026559383470037', 'Saverio Raimondo: Il Satiro Parlante', 2019, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Saverio Raimondo', 'PG-13', 'Italian comic and satirist Saverio Raimondo regales a Milan crowd with tales of online antics, awkward injuries and white-knuckle flights.', 'Italian comic and satirist Saverio Raimondo regales a Milan crowd with tales of online antics, awkward injuries and white-knuckle flights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjFRvGj2uuGkAG6XBajZVwlwQsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602891'),
  ('1051668862381402674', 'Savi', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Chinmay Salaskar, Abhinay Deo, Javed Karim', 'Abhinay Deo', 'Divya Khossla, Anil Kapoor, Harshvardhan Rane, Himanshi Choudhry, Mairaj Kakkar, M. K. Raina, Raageshwari, Lee Nicholas Harris', null, 'Savi, a simple housewife, attempts a daring jailbreak to get her husband out of one of England''s high-security prisons consisting of 400 inmates, 75 armed guards, and 60 surveillance cameras.', 'Savi, a simple housewife, attempts a daring jailbreak to get her husband out of one of England''s high-security prisons consisting of 400 inmates, 75 armed guards, and 60 surveillance cameras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adI8MKbKMViJe4KACtRhKufxNiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264800'),
  ('412642589777634012', 'Saving Bikini Bottom: The Sandy Cheeks Movie', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Liza Johnson, Greg Gardiner', null, 'Carolyn Lawrence, Tom Kenny, Clancy Brown, Bill Fagerbakke, Mr. Lawrence, Rodger Bumpass, Johnny Knoxville, Craig Robinson', 'G', 'When Bikini Bottom is scooped from the ocean, scientific squirrel Sandy Cheeks and her pal SpongeBob SquarePants saddle up for Texas to save their town.', 'When Bikini Bottom is scooped from the ocean, scientific squirrel Sandy Cheeks and her pal SpongeBob SquarePants saddle up for Texas to save their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30YnfZdMNIV7noWLdvmcJS0cbnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831815'),
  ('425356803039895131', 'Saving Capitalism', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Sari Gilman, Jacob Kornbluth, Jesse Dana', 'Robert Reich', 'Robert Reich, Dave Brat, Dan Burton, John McCain', null, 'Former Secretary of Labor Robert Reich meets with Americans from all walks of life as he chronicles a seismic shift in the nation''s economy.', 'Former Secretary of Labor Robert Reich meets with Americans from all walks of life as he chronicles a seismic shift in the nation''s economy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klxZFkVYV0bmOdeLI8YQ8GcE26m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483010'),
  ('1007899451942642721', 'Saving Christmas', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Darren Doane, Andy Patch', 'Cheston Hervey, Darren Doane', 'Kirk Cameron, Darren Doane, Bridgette Cameron, Raphi Henly, Ben Kientz, David Shannon, Michael Pina', 'PG', 'Kirk is enjoying the annual Christmas party extravaganza thrown by his sister until he realizes he needs to help out Christian, his brother-in-law who has a bad case of the bah-humbugs.', 'Kirk is enjoying the annual Christmas party extravaganza thrown by his sister until he realizes he needs to help out Christian, his brother-in-law who has a bad case of the bah-humbugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MLSD1OYGDWkCk05m7vA1xCrfKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295884'),
  ('268996991409098023', 'Saving Christmas Spirit', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Rivera, Wendy Faraone', 'Joelle Sellner', 'Ashley Newbrough, James Robinson, Jake Satow, Louis Emerick, Layla Burns, Tibu Fortes, Joanne Randle, Nicholas Karimi', null, 'When brilliant and sharp-witted archaeologist Lucy Stewart decides to spend her Christmas break in the Scottish Highlands, she goes on a quest to find the ruins of a shrine to ancient goddess Beira the Queen of Winter.', 'When brilliant and sharp-witted archaeologist Lucy Stewart decides to spend her Christmas break in the Scottish Highlands, she goes on a quest to find the ruins of a shrine to ancient goddess Beira the Queen of Winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kPktUvAB5V71ISAAHKxPkLo0ZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957803'),
  ('205709833583454696', 'Saving Face', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Alice Wu, Harlan Bosmajian, Carrie Fix', 'Alice Wu', 'Joan Chen, Michelle Krusiec, Lynn Chen, Jin Wang, Guang Lan Koh, Ato Essandoh, Nathanel Geng, Mao Zhao', 'R', 'A Chinese-American lesbian and her traditionalist mother are reluctant to go public with secret loves that clash against cultural expectations.', 'A Chinese-American lesbian and her traditionalist mother are reluctant to go public with secret loves that clash against cultural expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XbbgkKi4nEMOu9iwiANXpjKKhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19316'),
  ('234242115423610054', 'Saving Flora', 2019, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Mark Drury Taylor', 'Mark Drury Taylor, David Moss', 'Jenna Ortega, Martin Martinez, David Arquette, Leonor Varela, Galen Howard, Tom Arnold, Rhea Perlman, Guilford Adams', 'NR', 'Flora is a circus elephant who can no longer perform her tricks. The night before she''s scheduled to be euthanized, the circus owner''s 14-year old daughter, Dawn, sneaks Flora from the circus. All that stands between them and the safety of the elephant preserve is two hundred kilometers of woods, one raging river, two elephant hunters and the fear of not making it.', 'Flora is a circus elephant who can no longer perform her tricks. The night before she''s scheduled to be euthanized, the circus owner''s 14-year old daughter, Dawn, sneaks Flora from the circus. All that stands between them and the safety of the elephant preserve is two hundred kilometers of woods, one raging river, two elephant hunters and the fear of not making it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txFQFgjVQmQYFYvEFCbUlTJMYcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570488'),
  ('1100864411098873434', 'Saving General Yang', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Ronny Yu, Chan Chi-Ying, Kong Lingping', 'Ronny Yu, Scarlett Liu, Edmond Wong Chi-Mun', 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Wu Chun, Vic Chou, Xu Fan, Jerry Lee, Raymond Lam Fung, Apollo Yu', null, 'When a rival nation sends troops to invade the Song Dynasty, the emperor sends general Yang Ye (Adam Cheng) to defend the nation. However, Yang''s place in the court is shaky due to a feud with Pan Renmei caused by the accidental death of his son at the hands of one of Yang''s sons. At the battle, Yang is abandoned by Pan''s troops, leaving him trapped in the face of an attack by Yeli Yuan (Shao Bing), an enemy general who wants to kill Yang to avenge his father. After learning about their father''s predicament, Yang Ye''s seven sons set out to rescue their father at any cost.', 'When a rival nation sends troops to invade the Song Dynasty, the emperor sends general Yang Ye (Adam Cheng) to defend the nation. However, Yang''s place in the court is shaky due to a feud with Pan Renmei caused by the accidental death of his son at the hands of one of Yang''s sons. At the battle, Yang is abandoned by Pan''s troops, leaving him trapped in the face of an attack by Yeli Yuan (Shao Bing), an enemy general who wants to kill Yang to avenge his father. After learning about their father''s predicament, Yang Ye''s seven sons set out to rescue their father at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOaXWW8ihwrSqYtSJdz77IeAVbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181009'),
  ('885494968189122505', 'Saving Grace', 2000, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Nigel Cole, John de Borman', 'Craig Ferguson, Mark Crowdy', 'Brenda Blethyn, Craig Ferguson, Martin Clunes, Tchéky Karyo, Jamie Foreman, Bill Bailey, Valerie Edmond, Tristan Sturrock', 'R', 'Unexpectedly widowed, prim and proper housewife Grace Trevethyn finds herself in dire financial straits when she inherits massive debts her late husband had been accruing for years. Faced with losing her house, she decides to use her talent for horticulture and hatches a plan to grow potent marijuana which can be sold at an astronomical price, thus solving her financial crisis.', 'Unexpectedly widowed, prim and proper housewife Grace Trevethyn finds herself in dire financial straits when she inherits massive debts her late husband had been accruing for years. Faced with losing her house, she decides to use her talent for horticulture and hatches a plan to grow potent marijuana which can be sold at an astronomical price, thus solving her financial crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ml8XwUomPfisNsKmluP8TIZOR89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2360'),
  ('805511455025831288', 'Saving Leningrad', 2019, 'Drama, War', 'Alexey Kozlov, Alexey Doronkin, Gleb Vavilov', 'Alexey Kozlov', 'Mariya Melnikova, Andrey Mironov-Udalov, Gela Meskhi, Anastasiya Melnikova, Sergey Zharkov, Natalya Tkachenko, Ivan Lyrchikov, Valeriy Degtyar', null, 'September, 1941. In a turn of events, young lovebirds Kostya and Nastya find themselves on board a barge that will evacuate people from the sieged Leningrad. At night the barge gets into the storm. When it starts sinking, enemy planes — but not rescuers — were the first to arrive at the scene.', 'September, 1941. In a turn of events, young lovebirds Kostya and Nastya find themselves on board a barge that will evacuate people from the sieged Leningrad. At night the barge gets into the storm. When it starts sinking, enemy planes — but not rescuers — were the first to arrive at the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHtfl6iKoyD6LQuXBjYOJIwZJS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571419'),
  ('366080423225120940', 'Saving Mr. Banks', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'John Lee Hancock, John Schwartzman, Ronna Kress', 'Kelly Marcel, Sue Smith', 'Emma Thompson, Tom Hanks, Colin Farrell, Paul Giamatti, Ruth Wilson, Jason Schwartzman, Bradley Whitford, Annie Rose Buckley', 'PG-13', 'Author P.L. Travers looks back on her childhood while reluctantly meeting with Walt Disney, who seeks to adapt her Mary Poppins books for the big screen.', 'Author P.L. Travers looks back on her childhood while reluctantly meeting with Walt Disney, who seeks to adapt her Mary Poppins books for the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RkcUe5PKnYvrCwMjk8giUAoID7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140823'),
  ('744955280016842123', 'Saving Mr. Wu', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ding Sheng, Chen Chen, Ding Yu', 'Ding Sheng', 'Andy Lau, Liu Ye, Wang Qianyuan, Cai Lu, Lam Suet, Wu Ruofu, Sang Ping, Lu Peng', null, 'Mr. Wu, a Hong Kong movie star, is kidnapped in Beijing by Zhang Hua''s gang. The police quickly form a task force and begin the search, ignoring that detectives in charge have only twenty hours before the deadline.', 'Mr. Wu, a Hong Kong movie star, is kidnapped in Beijing by Zhang Hua''s gang. The police quickly form a task force and begin the search, ignoring that detectives in charge have only twenty hours before the deadline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anGZgk3iSWxnL2KOgw1SYQwv0ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362154'),
  ('393076966907235370', 'Saving My Hubby', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hyeon Nam-Seob', 'Hyeon Nam-Seob', 'Bae Doona, Kim Tae-woo, Joo Hyun, Goh Doo-shim, Lee Chan-Min, Han Ji-hye, Na Moon-hee, Ki Joo-bong', null, 'Geum-soon, once a top-ranked volleyball player, is now a common housewife with a six-month old daughter and a clumsy husband. On the first day her husband goes to work, she spends the day taking care of her little daughter who never stops crying. While Gum-soon is busy cleaning her house upon hearing her parents-in-law are coming on the next day, she gets a phone call from a club that they''ve arrested her husband for an unpaid bill. Amidst the merciless threatening of the gang in the club, Geum-soon rushes out into the night streets, still carrying her baby on her back. It''s past midnight with less than three hours to go before her in-laws arrive. In the seediest part of Seoul, Geum-soon''s husband is practically being held for ransom for the alcohol he didn''t drink, Geum-soon has no clue where the bar is, two rival gangs are chasing after her, the pot is boiling at home, and her daughter is wailing while Geum-soon is leaping over trash cans in a dark alley.', 'Geum-soon, once a top-ranked volleyball player, is now a common housewife with a six-month old daughter and a clumsy husband. On the first day her husband goes to work, she spends the day taking care of her little daughter who never stops crying. While Gum-soon is busy cleaning her house upon hearing her parents-in-law are coming on the next day, she gets a phone call from a club that they''ve arrested her husband for an unpaid bill. Amidst the merciless threatening of the gang in the club, Geum-soon rushes out into the night streets, still carrying her baby on her back. It''s past midnight with less than three hours to go before her in-laws arrive. In the seediest part of Seoul, Geum-soon''s husband is practically being held for ransom for the alcohol he didn''t drink, Geum-soon has no clue where the bar is, two rival gangs are chasing after her, the pot is boiling at home, and her daughter is wailing while Geum-soon is leaping over trash cans in a dark alley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xmVmtYHz9BBtDf0XI7DXukLoXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88016'),
  ('826057528871722905', 'Saving Private Pérez', 2011, 'Action, Comedy', 'Beto Gómez, Carlos Lagunas, Daniel Jacobs', 'Francisco Payó González', 'Miguel Rodarte, Jesús Ochoa, Joaquín Cosío, Gerardo Taracena, Rodrigo Oviedo, Jaime Camil, Adal Ramones, Isela Vega', null, 'La vida ha llevado a Julián Pérez por caminos equivocados, pero el destino le presentará a este hombre la oportunidad de encontrar su redención cuando es enviado a la misión más peligrosa y noble de toda su vida, una misión ordenada por la única autoridad que todavía respeta, su madre, Doña Elvira. Julián debe viajar hasta el otro extremo del mundo, a un lugar llamado Irak, a traer de vuelta vivo, a su hermano menor el soldado de infantería Juan Pérez. Con la promesa hecha, Julián Pérez regresa a su natal Sinaloa donde reclutará a un comando de elite, destinado a cumplir una misión suicida: viajar a Irak y salvar al soldado Pérez.', 'La vida ha llevado a Julián Pérez por caminos equivocados, pero el destino le presentará a este hombre la oportunidad de encontrar su redención cuando es enviado a la misión más peligrosa y noble de toda su vida, una misión ordenada por la única autoridad que todavía respeta, su madre, Doña Elvira. Julián debe viajar hasta el otro extremo del mundo, a un lugar llamado Irak, a traer de vuelta vivo, a su hermano menor el soldado de infantería Juan Pérez. Con la promesa hecha, Julián Pérez regresa a su natal Sinaloa donde reclutará a un comando de elite, destinado a cumplir una misión suicida: viajar a Irak y salvar al soldado Pérez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylXmX9vcP1W9La9FtOpV9OtXtMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66607'),
  ('229335117810787347', 'Saving Private Ryan', 1998, 'War, Drama, History', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Daniel T. Dorrance', 'Robert Rodat', 'Tom Hanks, Tom Sizemore, Edward Burns, Barry Pepper, Adam Goldberg, Vin Diesel, Giovanni Ribisi, Jeremy Davies', 'R', 'As U.S. troops storm the beaches of Normandy, three brothers lie dead on the battlefield, with a fourth trapped behind enemy lines. Ranger captain John Miller and seven men are tasked with penetrating German-held territory and bringing the boy home.', 'As U.S. troops storm the beaches of Normandy, three brothers lie dead on the battlefield, with a fourth trapped behind enemy lines. Ranger captain John Miller and seven men are tasked with penetrating German-held territory and bringing the boy home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqx37cS8cpHg8U35f9U5IBlrCV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857'),
  ('216952794439965465', 'Saving Santa', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Aaron Seelman, Leon Joosen', 'Ricky Roxburgh', 'Martin Freeman, Tim Curry, Tim Conway, Pam Ferris, Ashley French, Joan Collins, David Cowgill, Noel Clarke', 'G', 'A lowly stable elf finds that he is the only one who can stop an invasion of the North Pole by using the secret of Santa''s Sleigh, a TimeGlobe, to travel back in time to Save Santa - twice.', 'A lowly stable elf finds that he is the only one who can stop an invasion of the North Pole by using the secret of Santa''s Sleigh, a TimeGlobe, to travel back in time to Save Santa - twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luIe2Qe7dYmlJ37CvDaLp2sKxc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238302'),
  ('139207799420659341', 'Saving Sarah Cain', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael Landon Jr., Mitchell Bock, Donald Hauer', 'Cindy Kelley, Brian Bird', 'Abigail Mason, Lisa Pepper, Elliott Gould, Yolanda Stange, Jennifer O''Dell, Tom Tate, Carl Nelson, Tom Markus', 'PG', 'When Sarah Cain, a self-involved big-city newspaper columnist, travels to Pennsylvania for the funeral of her Amish sister, she soon discovers that she is the legal guardian of her five Amish nieces and nephews. Rather than choose to move to Lancaster County to finish raising them there herself, or let them be separated by the foster care system, Sarah decides to take them with her back to Portland where she believes she can make a new life for them. However, she soon realizes that the modern world has forced them to compromise who they are, and that she has moved them there for all the wrong reasons - a motive which is soon exposed - because secrets can really never be kept secret. In order to find her own redemption, she knows she must make a choice to give them back their lives in Amish Country. And whether she remains part of their lives will have a lot to do with how much she has grown to love them.', 'When Sarah Cain, a self-involved big-city newspaper columnist, travels to Pennsylvania for the funeral of her Amish sister, she soon discovers that she is the legal guardian of her five Amish nieces and nephews. Rather than choose to move to Lancaster County to finish raising them there herself, or let them be separated by the foster care system, Sarah decides to take them with her back to Portland where she believes she can make a new life for them. However, she soon realizes that the modern world has forced them to compromise who they are, and that she has moved them there for all the wrong reasons - a motive which is soon exposed - because secrets can really never be kept secret. In order to find her own redemption, she knows she must make a choice to give them back their lives in Amish Country. And whether she remains part of their lives will have a lot to do with how much she has grown to love them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6s9fCd0cKkOuWBawFPOT4YoDyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45757'),
  ('656117429822344151', 'Saving Silverman', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Dennis Dugan, Arthur Albert, Daniel Silverberg', 'Hank Nelken, Greg DePaul', 'Steve Zahn, Jack Black, Jason Biggs, Amanda Peet, Amanda Detmer, R. Lee Ermey, Neil Diamond, Kyle Gass', 'PG-13', 'A pair of buddies conspire to save their best friend from marrying the wrong woman, a cold-hearted beauty who snatches him from them and breaks up their Neil Diamond cover band.', 'A pair of buddies conspire to save their best friend from marrying the wrong woman, a cold-hearted beauty who snatches him from them and breaks up their Neil Diamond cover band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mq8J11266ZL7HCOwDGXoaU6eIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10878'),
  ('510233552053874849', 'Saving Zoë', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Cory Geryak, Jeffrey G. Hunt', 'Leeanne H. Adams, Brian J. Adams', 'Laura Marano, Vanessa Marano, Chris Tavarez, Giorgia Whigham, Nathaniel Buzolic, Evan Castelloe, Michael Provost, Annie Jacob', 'R', 'A year after the murder of her sister Zoë, Echo is determined to uncover the truth. With Zoë''s diary as her guide, Echo finds herself pulled into the darkness of her sister''s secret life and she uncovers how one small decision can lead to tragic consequences.', 'A year after the murder of her sister Zoë, Echo is determined to uncover the truth. With Zoë''s diary as her guide, Echo finds herself pulled into the darkness of her sister''s secret life and she uncovers how one small decision can lead to tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7M3KQLBDkNrbLD1UHA6cvGkqa5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602198'),
  ('421945983296155791', 'Savior', 1998, 'History, Drama, War', 'Predrag Antonijević, Ian Wilson', 'Robert Orr', 'Dennis Quaid, Pascal Rollin, Catlin Foster, Stellan Skarsgård, John Maclaren, Nataša Ninković, Nastassja Kinski, Sergej Trifunović', 'R', 'A hardened mercenary in the Foreign Legion begins to find his own humanity when confronted with atrocities during the fighting in Bosnia.', 'A hardened mercenary in the Foreign Legion begins to find his own humanity when confronted with atrocities during the fighting in Bosnia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qMfDjUTEvLg5640CUAddk2BNpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2042'),
  ('1101617536334714401', 'Saviors in the Night', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ludi Boeken, Daniel Schneor', 'Otto Jägersberg, Imo Moszkowicz, Heidrun Schleef', 'Veronica Ferres, Armin Rohde, Margarita Broich, Martin Horn, Lia Hoensbroech, Luisa Mix, Tjard Krusius, Kilian Schüler', null, 'Drama, based on the book "Retter in der Nacht", in which Marga Spiegel tells her memories: In Westfalia of 1943 Marga Spiegel, her husband and her daughter are about to be deported. Yet westfalian farmers help the jewish family, grant Marga and her daughter refuge under false names and hide her husband.', 'Drama, based on the book "Retter in der Nacht", in which Marga Spiegel tells her memories: In Westfalia of 1943 Marga Spiegel, her husband and her daughter are about to be deported. Yet westfalian farmers help the jewish family, grant Marga and her daughter refuge under false names and hide her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qtCzEwwvUMC69c4b1PR8meLrbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37980'),
  ('30728618554018047', 'Saviour of the Soul', 1991, 'Action, Fantasy', 'David Lai Tai-Wai, Corey Yuen, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Wong Kar-Wai', 'Andy Lau, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Aaron Kwok, Carina Lau, Kenny Bee, Corey Yuen, Danny Poon Wang-Ban', null, 'A woman blinds a martial arts master and his pupil vows revenge on her. She is forced to abandon her loved ones without explanation in order to protect them from her ill-intentioned pursuer.', 'A woman blinds a martial arts master and his pupil vows revenge on her. She is forced to abandon her loved ones without explanation in order to protect them from her ill-intentioned pursuer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54ZtnQhMBsFrdCHbZeuAiUPVJqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45394'),
