  ('505946635219624605', 'Savulun Battal Gazi Geliyor', 1973, 'Adventure', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Natuk Baytan, Duygu Sağıroğlu', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Zuhal Aktan, Reha Yurdakul, Kazım Kartal, Doğan Tamer, Atıf Kaptan, Oktay Yavuz, Tarık Şimşek', null, 'After his family is killed in front of his eyes, a little boy grows up to be the nightmare of Byzantine''s Black Knighthood.', 'After his family is killed in front of his eyes, a little boy grows up to be the nightmare of Byzantine''s Black Knighthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y3iFuwUdIz2Rr863KM3ugE9U5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452978'),
