  ('944877018842923043', 'Saw', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Wan, Marty Smith, Ben Grogan', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Leigh Whannell, Paul Moder, Katrina Mathers, Dean Francis', null, 'David, an orderly at a hospital, tells his horrific story of being kidnapped and forced to play a vile game of survival.', 'David, an orderly at a hospital, tells his horrific story of being kidnapped and forced to play a vile game of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dfaedyVvHli1pmm9HHcoVTDOCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246355'),
  ('148182764611380976', 'Saw', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'David A. Armstrong, James Wan, Daniel J. Heffner', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Tobin Bell, Cary Elwes, Leigh Whannell, Danny Glover, Monica Potter, Ken Leung, Makenzie Vega, Michael Emerson', 'R', 'Two men wake up to find themselves shackled in a grimy, abandoned bathroom. As they struggle to comprehend their predicament, they discover a disturbing tape left behind by the sadistic mastermind known as Jigsaw. With a chilling voice and cryptic instructions, Jigsaw informs them that they must partake in a gruesome game in order to secure their freedom.', 'Two men wake up to find themselves shackled in a grimy, abandoned bathroom. As they struggle to comprehend their predicament, they discover a disturbing tape left behind by the sadistic mastermind known as Jigsaw. With a chilling voice and cryptic instructions, Jigsaw informs them that they must partake in a gruesome game in order to secure their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLNSOudrayDBo1uqXjrhxcjODIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176'),
  ('930142257502681550', 'Saw 3D', 2010, 'Horror, Crime', 'Kevin Greutert, Brian Gedge, David McAree', 'Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan', 'Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Cary Elwes, Sean Patrick Flanery, Chad Donella, Chester Bennington, Gina Holden', 'R', 'As a deadly battle rages over Jigsaw''s brutal legacy, a group of Jigsaw survivors gathers to seek the support of self-help guru and fellow survivor Bobby Dagen, a man whose own dark secrets unleash a new wave of terror.', 'As a deadly battle rages over Jigsaw''s brutal legacy, a group of Jigsaw survivors gathers to seek the support of self-help guru and fellow survivor Bobby Dagen, a man whose own dark secrets unleash a new wave of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHCZ6LjtmqWDfXXN28TlIC9OppK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41439'),
  ('896246642635523770', 'Saw II', 2005, 'Horror', 'David A. Armstrong, Darren Lynn Bousman, Dwight Hendrickson', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Leigh Whannell', 'Tobin Bell, Donnie Wahlberg, Shawnee Smith, Erik Knudsen, Franky G, Glenn Plummer, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Beverley Mitchell', 'R', 'The chilling and relentless Jigsaw killer returns to terrorize the city once again. When a gruesome murder victim emerges with unmistakable traces of Jigsaw''s sinister methods, Detective Eric Matthews is thrust into a high-stakes investigation. To his surprise, apprehending Jigsaw seems almost too easy, but what he doesn''t realize is that being caught is merely another piece of Jigsaw''s intricate puzzle.', 'The chilling and relentless Jigsaw killer returns to terrorize the city once again. When a gruesome murder victim emerges with unmistakable traces of Jigsaw''s sinister methods, Detective Eric Matthews is thrust into a high-stakes investigation. To his surprise, apprehending Jigsaw seems almost too easy, but what he doesn''t realize is that being caught is merely another piece of Jigsaw''s intricate puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTnaTysN8HsvVQqTRUh8m35mmUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215'),
  ('206817651964588445', 'Saw III', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, David A. Armstrong, David Hackl', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Tobin Bell, Shawnee Smith, Angus Macfadyen, Bahar Soomekh, Donnie Wahlberg, Dina Meyer, Leigh Whannell, Mpho Koaho', 'R', 'Jigsaw has disappeared. Along with his new apprentice Amanda, the puppet-master behind the cruel, intricate games that have terrified a community and baffled police has once again eluded capture and vanished. While city detectives scrambles to locate him, Doctor Lynn Denlon and Jeff Reinhart are unaware that they are about to become the latest pawns on his vicious chessboard.', 'Jigsaw has disappeared. Along with his new apprentice Amanda, the puppet-master behind the cruel, intricate games that have terrified a community and baffled police has once again eluded capture and vanished. While city detectives scrambles to locate him, Doctor Lynn Denlon and Jeff Reinhart are unaware that they are about to become the latest pawns on his vicious chessboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iO9n24Rb10peXV0JH2EldIOrAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214'),
  ('1082818112497164216', 'Saw IV', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, David A. Armstrong, Elizabeth Scherberger', 'Marcus Dunstan, Patrick Melton', 'Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Scott Patterson, Betsy Russell, Lyriq Bent, Athena Karkanis, Louis Ferreira, Simon Reynolds', 'R', 'Despite Jigsaw''s death, and in order to save the lives of two of his colleagues, Lieutenant Rigg is forced to take part in a new game, which promises to test him to the limit.', 'Despite Jigsaw''s death, and in order to save the lives of two of his colleagues, Lieutenant Rigg is forced to take part in a new game, which promises to test him to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ku1QdCXOU4ckz3zxLLlis8MIJVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663'),
  ('463766653776792477', 'Saw V', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'David Hackl, Jane Rogers, Steve Webb', 'Marcus Dunstan, Patrick Melton', 'Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Scott Patterson, Betsy Russell, Julie Benz, Meagan Good, Mark Rolston, Carlo Rota', 'R', 'Following Jigsaw''s grisly demise, Detective Mark Hoffman is commended as a hero, but Agent Strahm is suspicious, and delves into Hoffman''s past. Meanwhile, another group of people are put through a series of gruesome tests.', 'Following Jigsaw''s grisly demise, Detective Mark Hoffman is commended as a hero, but Agent Strahm is suspicious, and delves into Hoffman''s past. Meanwhile, another group of people are put through a series of gruesome tests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKl79KqLXg60KFyKsLe4wSSjQ08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11917'),
  ('467594002117204396', 'Saw VI', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kevin Greutert, Sarah Buell, David A. Armstrong', 'Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan', 'Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Mark Rolston, Betsy Russell, Shawnee Smith, Peter Outerbridge, Athena Karkanis, Samantha Lemole', 'R', 'Special Agent Strahm is dead, and Detective Hoffman has emerged as the unchallenged successor to Jigsaw''s legacy. However, when the FBI draws closer to Hoffman, he is forced to set a game into motion, and Jigsaw''s grand scheme is finally understood.', 'Special Agent Strahm is dead, and Detective Hoffman has emerged as the unchallenged successor to Jigsaw''s legacy. However, when the FBI draws closer to Hoffman, he is forced to set a game into motion, and Jigsaw''s grand scheme is finally understood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JtluosCbioSXJSABZByaODyPpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22804'),
  ('431255152008683547', 'Saw X', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Renan Bendersky, Andrea Salgado, Barbara Jane Cole', 'Pete Goldfinger, Josh Stolberg', 'Tobin Bell, Shawnee Smith, Synnøve Macody Lund, Steven Brand, Renata Vaca, Joshua Okamoto, Octavio Hinojosa Martínez, Paulette Hernández', 'R', 'Between the events of ''Saw'' and ''Saw II'', a sick and desperate John Kramer travels to Mexico for a risky and experimental medical procedure in hopes of a miracle cure for his cancer, only to discover the entire operation is a scam to defraud the most vulnerable. Armed with a newfound purpose, the infamous serial killer returns to his work, turning the tables on the con artists in his signature visceral way through devious, deranged, and ingenious traps.', 'Between the events of ''Saw'' and ''Saw II'', a sick and desperate John Kramer travels to Mexico for a risky and experimental medical procedure in hopes of a miracle cure for his cancer, only to discover the entire operation is a scam to defraud the most vulnerable. Armed with a newfound purpose, the infamous serial killer returns to his work, turning the tables on the con artists in his signature visceral way through devious, deranged, and ingenious traps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7Lp1Hi8aBS73jv4KRMIv5aK4ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951491'),
  ('1022581332500349182', 'Saw: Rebirth', 2005, 'Animation, Horror', 'Daniel Viney, Jeff Shuter', 'Kris Oprisko', 'George Williams, Whit Anderson, Stan Kirsch, Jeff Shuter', null, 'This animated comic goes back in time to explore the events that spurred the transformation of mild-mannered John Kramer into the monstrous Jigsaw.', 'This animated comic goes back in time to explore the events that spurred the transformation of mild-mannered John Kramer into the monstrous Jigsaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpB9rcOcyOQZUsiuIOCQfb90zxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168891'),
  ('324976775556864253', 'Sawako Decides', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuya Ishii, Yukihiro Okimura, Naoki Ohtani', 'Yuya Ishii', 'Hikari Mitsushima, Masashi Endô, Kotaro Shiga, Ryo Iwamatsu, Kira Aihara, Ryu Morioka, Miyoko Inagawa, Maki Meguro', null, 'After 5 years in Tokyo, 5 part-time jobs, 5 boyfriends, Sawako''s life is going nowhere. When her father gets seriously ill, she has to take over his struggling factory. Gradually she becomes the decider of her own life.', 'After 5 years in Tokyo, 5 part-time jobs, 5 boyfriends, Sawako''s life is going nowhere. When her father gets seriously ill, she has to take over his struggling factory. Gradually she becomes the decider of her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgTiZGBfmCKUcdQb4BdbBf9eLbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80976'),
  ('643593632503485295', 'Sawdust and Tinsel', 1953, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist, Hilding Bladh', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Åke Grönberg, Harriet Andersson, Hasse Ekman, Anders Ek, Gudrun Brost, Annika Tretow, Erik Strandmark, Gunnar Björnstrand', null, 'A number of complicated relationships develop between a circus ringmaster, his estranged wife and his lover.', 'A number of complicated relationships develop between a circus ringmaster, his estranged wife and his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1LGjSnibRtFuoBXrttm6pueNiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47721'),
  ('1072565767441526611', 'Sawsawan', 2026, 'Drama', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr.', null, 'Karen Lopez, Rhian Rivera, Allen Legazpi, Amor Lapus, Jio Yoshida, Joko Rivera, Aeron Henry Cruz', null, 'Karen plays Dolor, a street food vendor with big dreams. Men flock Dolor''s stall not just for her dipping sauce but for the secret pleasure that comes with it.', 'Karen plays Dolor, a street food vendor with big dreams. Men flock Dolor''s stall not just for her dipping sauce but for the secret pleasure that comes with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6L9hxSBK7JNISnvhrnnHb4BYRd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1658217'),
  ('433090854486473284', 'Say ''I Love You''', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Asako Hyuga, Yuta Tsukinaga, Atsushi Unno', 'Asako Hyuga', 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Sota Fukushi, Tomohiro Ichikawa, Rika Adachi, Tasuku Nagase, Rima Nishizaki, Ryosuke Yamamoto, Alissa Yagi', null, 'Mei Tachibana is a high school student. Due to a traumatic incident when she was a kid, Mei has been unable to make friends or have boyfriends. By mistake, Mei then injures the most popular male student named Yamato Kurosawa. Somehow, Yamato Kurosawa likes Mei Tachibana and tells everyone unilaterally that Mei is his friend. One day, Yamato Kurosawa saves Mei Tachibana from a stalker by kissing her. From that kiss, their love story begins.', 'Mei Tachibana is a high school student. Due to a traumatic incident when she was a kid, Mei has been unable to make friends or have boyfriends. By mistake, Mei then injures the most popular male student named Yamato Kurosawa. Somehow, Yamato Kurosawa likes Mei Tachibana and tells everyone unilaterally that Mei is his friend. One day, Yamato Kurosawa saves Mei Tachibana from a stalker by kissing her. From that kiss, their love story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1GbBp5YrwPrKN1I2rIMkRQUWHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277806'),
  ('369816342318992640', 'Say a Word for the Poor Hussar', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Aleksandr Pogosyan', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Grigori Gorin', 'Stanislav Sadalskiy, Oleg Basilashvili, Evgeni Leonov, Valentin Gaft, Irina Mazurkevich, Zinoviy Gerdt, Aleksandr Belyavskiy, Natalya Gundareva', null, 'The small town agog Hussars entry. Love between cornet and the young actress suddenly faces intrigue made by a St. Petersburg bureaucrat. The actress father dies after being involved in this game and perspectives look dark... But evil will eventually be defeated by the nobility, loyalty and love.', 'The small town agog Hussars entry. Love between cornet and the young actress suddenly faces intrigue made by a St. Petersburg bureaucrat. The actress father dies after being involved in this game and perspectives look dark... But evil will eventually be defeated by the nobility, loyalty and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlUvdZBN4n7h7NXID7ZkYlpi0IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37175'),
  ('252007101531553680', 'Say Anything...', 1989, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Cameron Crowe, László Kovács, Bruce Crone', 'Cameron Crowe', 'John Cusack, Ione Skye, John Mahoney, Lili Taylor, Amy Brooks, Pamela Adlon, Jason Gould, Loren Dean', 'PG-13', 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane''s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it''s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.', 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane''s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it''s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkucKciFGSRalw6dJtsglWqOXMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2028'),
  ('828122276876791604', 'Say Cheese', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Marine Benoit, Anastasia Lamprou, César Chabrol', 'François Uzan', 'Jacques Gamblin, Pascale Arbillot, Pablo Pauly, Agnès Hurstel, Ludovik, Nicolas Politis, Manos Gavras, Despoina Hariati', null, 'Thierry is convinced that the best is behind him. When Claire, his wife, tired of «it was better before», announced that she is leaving him, Thierry, devastated, decided to go back to Greece where they spend their best family holidays 20 years ago. Officially, he wants to spend one last week with their children before announcing their separation. Unofficially, he hopes to win back his wife... By trying to rekindle the flame of his couple, Thierry may well set his family on fire...', 'Thierry is convinced that the best is behind him. When Claire, his wife, tired of «it was better before», announced that she is leaving him, Thierry, devastated, decided to go back to Greece where they spend their best family holidays 20 years ago. Officially, he wants to spend one last week with their children before announcing their separation. Unofficially, he hopes to win back his wife... By trying to rekindle the flame of his couple, Thierry may well set his family on fire...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBJWTNFwa8vuyz9XvdDoJYJ0HuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893730'),
  ('526437253399836366', 'Say Hello for Me', 2007, 'Romance', 'Yuichiro Hirakawa, Jun Shiozaki', null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Masami Nagasawa, Keiko Kitagawa, Takashi Tsukamoto, Ryoko Kuninaka, Fumiyo Kohinata', null, '"Say Hello for Me" is a love story and talks about three people''s childhood friendship and their reunion after 15 years of separation.', '"Say Hello for Me" is a love story and talks about three people''s childhood friendship and their reunion after 15 years of separation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOjIgi4U0c6rg5LJOaSRuLxeJkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113997'),
  ('307673263575468674', 'Say I Do', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Juan Calvo, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Juan Calvo', 'Santi Millán, Paz Vega, Constantino Romero, Chus Lampreave, Santiago Segura, Ornella Muti, José Luis Torrijo, Pepe Viyuela', null, 'An unlikely couple fake a relationship to win a TV game show prize. Wannabe actress Estrella dreams of becoming a hostess on a romance reality-TV show presented by Amador Rosales. Meanwhile, movie usher and film buff Victor, who hates such reality shows, is being pressured by his mother to be a contestant.', 'An unlikely couple fake a relationship to win a TV game show prize. Wannabe actress Estrella dreams of becoming a hostess on a romance reality-TV show presented by Amador Rosales. Meanwhile, movie usher and film buff Victor, who hates such reality shows, is being pressured by his mother to be a contestant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7jsSdQny3p2ay61SbrJpePWzZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5594'),
  ('823220678165908321', 'Say I Do to Me', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kiwi Chow Kwun-Wai, Danny Szeto Yat-Lui', 'Kiwi Chow Kwun-Wai, Isis Tso Yin-Sin, Frankie Wang-Kit Chung', 'Sabrina Ng, Chan Kin-Long, Candy Lo Hau-Yam, Mixson Wong, Isabel Chan Yat-Ning, Gregory Wong Chung-Yiu, J Lou, Jacky Tong', null, '“I want to marry myself!” To plan for a solo wedding, to marry myself, to declare my forever love for myself to the world! Attractive comedienne Ping vows to become a viral Youtuber. She concocts a plan to put on a show of marrying herself in what was meant to secure both money and likes! However, the scam ultimately ended up in the discovery of her true self in this coming-of-age fairy tale comedy. To love others, I must love myself. Simple enough, right? But who am I? In a pageant of love, four contest as lovers, each one goodhearted in their own right. Does Ping want all four or none at all? By marrying herself, can she figure out who she really is? And who she really loves? Ping will tell it all on the day of the solo wedding… In this satire of marriage and the individual self, nothing is left untouched: women, men, organised religion, homosexuality, the filthy rich, not to mention ye good old mother! Love yourself in Say I do to me, won’t you?', '“I want to marry myself!” To plan for a solo wedding, to marry myself, to declare my forever love for myself to the world! Attractive comedienne Ping vows to become a viral Youtuber. She concocts a plan to put on a show of marrying herself in what was meant to secure both money and likes! However, the scam ultimately ended up in the discovery of her true self in this coming-of-age fairy tale comedy. To love others, I must love myself. Simple enough, right? But who am I? In a pageant of love, four contest as lovers, each one goodhearted in their own right. Does Ping want all four or none at all? By marrying herself, can she figure out who she really is? And who she really loves? Ping will tell it all on the day of the solo wedding… In this satire of marriage and the individual self, nothing is left untouched: women, men, organised religion, homosexuality, the filthy rich, not to mention ye good old mother! Love yourself in Say I do to me, won’t you?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utRyStWR4LkrapehHWLLHU2YMTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071238'),
  ('377361459284185402', 'Say It Isn''t So', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'J.B. Rogers, Mark Irwin', 'Gerry Swallow, Peter Gaulke', 'Chris Klein, Heather Graham, Orlando Jones, Sally Field, Richard Jenkins, John Rothman, Jack Plotnick, Eddie Cibrian', 'R', 'Boy meets girl; boy falls in love (and had wild, non-stop sex) with girl; boy loses girl... when they discover they are brother and sister! But when he learns that he''s the victim of the ultimate case of mistaken identity, the lovesick young man -- whom everyone still thinks is after some taboo thrills -- must race across the country to stop her from marrying another man.', 'Boy meets girl; boy falls in love (and had wild, non-stop sex) with girl; boy loses girl... when they discover they are brother and sister! But when he learns that he''s the victim of the ultimate case of mistaken identity, the lovesick young man -- whom everyone still thinks is after some taboo thrills -- must race across the country to stop her from marrying another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHEI41EWj9dEscfEiKgw6a2uUez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20309'),
  ('438557682532960022', 'Say It Loud', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Guido Chiesa, Emanuele Pasquet', 'Guido Chiesa, Diego Ayala', 'Valentina Lodovini, Neri Marcorè, Libero De Rienzo, Dino Abbrescia, Andrea Pisani, Nicola Nocella, Flora Canto, Chiara Spoletini', null, 'A woman seeking treatment for her stress, suddenly finds herself unable to filter herself when she speaks.', 'A woman seeking treatment for her stress, suddenly finds herself unable to filter herself when she speaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OaT8xxEtKqR2vAQtNNxbQ7xcMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648619'),
  ('1096588927414238820', 'Say Less', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Kellman, J. Zachary Thurman', 'Michael Kellman', 'Philip Casnoff, Roxanne Hart, Jenny Lange, Matt Linton, Genevieve Thomas', 'Not Rated', 'Teen siblings Cassie and Max find themselves home alone for the weekend after their parents leave town. Cassie hopes to invite her crush, Blake, over for a study date, while Max plans an intimate evening with his girlfriend, Sky.', 'Teen siblings Cassie and Max find themselves home alone for the weekend after their parents leave town. Cassie hopes to invite her crush, Blake, over for a study date, while Max plans an intimate evening with his girlfriend, Sky.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F5%2Fgracenote%2F55d0a9974f9ee39d25a073c0d98a2107.jpg', 'plex:movie:say-less-2026'),
  ('459061981586962466', 'Say Yes', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-hong', 'Hye-young Yeo', 'Park Joong-hoon, Chu Sang-mi, Kim Joo-hyuk, Ki Joo-bong, Lee Seok-ku, Lee Yoon-geon, Kim Jong-min, Jung Ho-bin', null, 'Young married couple Yoon-hee and Jung-hyun go on a road trip, and along the way they pick up a lone drifter, M. M turns out to be a violent and sadistic psychopath who terrorises the couple at every turn. After capturing Jung-hyun, Em gives him a choice: submit to torture or allow Em to kill Yoon-hee.', 'Young married couple Yoon-hee and Jung-hyun go on a road trip, and along the way they pick up a lone drifter, M. M turns out to be a violent and sadistic psychopath who terrorises the couple at every turn. After capturing Jung-hyun, Em gives him a choice: submit to torture or allow Em to kill Yoon-hee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgRHgXP9FSc2mJYr9dLnT3kVQ55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49881'),
  ('781269569248868784', 'Say Yes', 2013, 'Romance', 'Leste Chen', null, 'Huang Bo, Lin Chi-ling, Godfrey Gao, Qin Hailu, Tetsuya Takeda, Jiang Xi-Wen', null, 'Huang Da is a down on his luck ordinary guy who has desperate for love and tries to propose to a beautiful young cellist. His attempts to propose are complicated by a rich, charming and handsome rival who is determined to win the girl’s hand at all costs. Can Huang Da with his heart of gold triumph in love over a man who has everything he does not?', 'Huang Da is a down on his luck ordinary guy who has desperate for love and tries to propose to a beautiful young cellist. His attempts to propose are complicated by a rich, charming and handsome rival who is determined to win the girl’s hand at all costs. Can Huang Da with his heart of gold triumph in love over a man who has everything he does not?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLQjFnRGfb0tO6wulTmrBQE1lA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168998'),
  ('480866740251595779', 'Saýara', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Umut Turan, Can Evrenol', 'Can Evrenol', 'Duygu Kocabıyık, Emre Kızılırmak, Özgül Koşar, Doğan Barış Yaşar, Caner Atacan, Batuhan Büyükacaroğlu, Levent İnal, Furkan R. Demirel', null, 'When her sister is murdered by a group of politically connected rich kids, Sayara, a quiet gym cleaner from Turkmenistan, begins to follow in her father''s footsteps, seeking a path of revenge.', 'When her sister is murdered by a group of politically connected rich kids, Sayara, a quiet gym cleaner from Turkmenistan, begins to follow in her father''s footsteps, seeking a path of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFBX605AuHV27IeIzlSLpFgz3IJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140191'),
  ('662631121058531319', 'Sayen', 2023, 'Action, Adventure', 'Alexander Witt, Rosario Espinosa, Ignacio Prieto', 'Carla Stagno, Patricio Lynch', 'Rallén Montenegro, Arón Piper, Enrique Arce, Roberto García Ruiz, Loreto Aravena, Alejandro Trejo, Eduardo Paxeco, Camilo Arancibia', null, 'Sayen is hunting down the men who murdered her grandmother. Using her training and knowledge of nature, she is able to turn the tables on them, learning of a conspiracy from a corporation that threatens her people''s ancestral lands.', 'Sayen is hunting down the men who murdered her grandmother. Using her training and knowledge of nature, she is able to turn the tables on them, learning of a conspiracy from a corporation that threatens her people''s ancestral lands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCy61aU7BMG7SfhkaAaasS0KzUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850871'),
  ('383580407089017644', 'Sayen: Desert Road', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alexander Witt, Daniel Santa Ana, Eduardo Paxeco', 'Paula del Fierro, Leticia Akel', 'Rallén Montenegro, Enrique Arce, Jorge López, Katalina Sanchez, Claudio Riveros, Alfredo Castro, Eyal Meyer, Camilo Arancibia', null, 'Sayen follows a lead to the picturesque desolation of the Atacama Desert. There, she reluctantly teams up with a young Atacameño girl, Quimal, looking to clear her father’s name and save her town from becoming an arid wasteland due to Acteon’s exploitative water usage.', 'Sayen follows a lead to the picturesque desolation of the Atacama Desert. There, she reluctantly teams up with a young Atacameño girl, Quimal, looking to clear her father’s name and save her town from becoming an arid wasteland due to Acteon’s exploitative water usage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mQd4twCtANzQGlPNJ7aKued7a4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850880'),
  ('356737360324234727', 'Sayen: The Huntress', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alexander Witt, Rodrigo Ramirez V', 'Patricio Lynch', 'Rallén Montenegro, Aarón Díaz, Eva De Dominici, Alfredo Castro, Eyal Meyer, Amalia Kassai, Dindi Jane, Steevens Benjamin', null, 'Realizing that she cannot take down Fisk alone, Sayen teams up with an underground resistance group with a plan to expose and end Fisk''s unchecked plundering once and for all.', 'Realizing that she cannot take down Fisk alone, Sayen teams up with an underground resistance group with a plan to expose and end Fisk''s unchecked plundering once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upKD8UbH8vQ798aMWgwMxV8t4yk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850888'),
  ('636415309781455553', 'Sayonara', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Logan, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Paul Osborn', 'Marlon Brando, Patricia Owens, James Garner, Martha Scott, Miiko Taka, Miyoshi Umeki, Red Buttons, Kent Smith', 'NR', 'Air Force Major Lloyd Gruver is reassigned to a Japanese air base and is confronted with US racial prejudice against the Japanese people. The issue is compounded because a number of the soldiers become romantically involved with Japanese women, in defiance of US military policy. Ordinarily, a by-the-book officer, Gruver must take a position when a buddy of his, an enlisted man, Joe Kelly, falls in love with a Japanese woman, Katsumi, and marries her. Gruver risks his position by serving as best man at the wedding ceremony.', 'Air Force Major Lloyd Gruver is reassigned to a Japanese air base and is confronted with US racial prejudice against the Japanese people. The issue is compounded because a number of the soldiers become romantically involved with Japanese women, in defiance of US military policy. Ordinarily, a by-the-book officer, Gruver must take a position when a buddy of his, an enlisted man, Joe Kelly, falls in love with a Japanese woman, Katsumi, and marries her. Gruver risks his position by serving as best man at the wedding ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSXJDamf9vSb1qOiBhOMjB2soDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40885'),
  ('776800852752165168', 'Sayonara', 2015, 'Drama', 'Koji Fukada, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Koji Fukada', 'Bryerly Long, Hirofumi Arai, Geminoid F., Makiko Murata, Nijiro Murakami, Yuko Kibiki, Irène Jacob, Jérôme Kircher', null, 'The world''s first human-android acting duo, called Android Theater Project, is the collaborative brainchild of noted Japanese playwright Oriza Hirata and the leading robotics scientist Hiroshi Ishiguro. "Sayonara" is a remakable android play and has been adapted to feature film by the acclaimed filmmaker Koji Fukada (Hospitalité, Au revoir l’été). In this film project the setting of the story is largely expanded, depicting time and space in a way which can only be achieved in film, examining life and death though the communication between dying human and immortal android.', 'The world''s first human-android acting duo, called Android Theater Project, is the collaborative brainchild of noted Japanese playwright Oriza Hirata and the leading robotics scientist Hiroshi Ishiguro. "Sayonara" is a remakable android play and has been adapted to feature film by the acclaimed filmmaker Koji Fukada (Hospitalité, Au revoir l’été). In this film project the setting of the story is largely expanded, depicting time and space in a way which can only be achieved in film, examining life and death though the communication between dying human and immortal android.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwHcqalROrV9ywWYtp5Nu5r8seT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365948'),
  ('1046528475243115748', 'Sazen Tange and The Secret of the Urn', 1966, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Hideo Gosha, Kei Tasaka', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Keiko Awaji, Isao Kimura, Seizaburō Kawazu, Tetsuro Tamba, Wakaba Irie, Ryutaro Otomo, Bin Amatsu', null, 'Loyal samurai Samanosuke is attacked, mutilated, and left for dead while carrying out a mission for his clan. He recovers but has lost an eye and an arm. Taking a new identity as Tange Sazen, he searches for a stolen urn which has hidden significance to his clan. But Tange Sazen has his own reasons for seeking the urn.', 'Loyal samurai Samanosuke is attacked, mutilated, and left for dead while carrying out a mission for his clan. He recovers but has lost an eye and an arm. Taking a new identity as Tange Sazen, he searches for a stolen urn which has hidden significance to his clan. But Tange Sazen has his own reasons for seeking the urn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4gdMXd4PSd2Ila9UHuCQCHRjbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58285'),
  ('1118591989917362736', 'Sbirri', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Roberto Burchielli', 'Duccio Camerini, Roberto Burchielli', 'Raoul Bova, Luca Angeletti, Simonetta Solder, Alessandro Sperduti, Massimiliano Vado', null, '"Sbirri", Italian slang for the police, is the story of a well-known TV journalist who after the death of his son through ecstasy, decides to follow the drug squad in their fight against drug trafficking in Milan. The film takes us on his "real" journey in the world of drugs and his desperate search to find a valid reason, someone to blame for his son''s pointless death and at the same time, for his sense of inadequacy as a parent. It''s a journey in this incredible underworld where people from all social classes and thousands of young people are being constantly entrapped and where unknown heroes every day put their lives at risk in their battle against crime. All that is shown in the film is true.', '"Sbirri", Italian slang for the police, is the story of a well-known TV journalist who after the death of his son through ecstasy, decides to follow the drug squad in their fight against drug trafficking in Milan. The film takes us on his "real" journey in the world of drugs and his desperate search to find a valid reason, someone to blame for his son''s pointless death and at the same time, for his sense of inadequacy as a parent. It''s a journey in this incredible underworld where people from all social classes and thousands of young people are being constantly entrapped and where unknown heroes every day put their lives at risk in their battle against crime. All that is shown in the film is true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6LlScMP5FEYJGsQmeoBepvJuJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32541'),
  ('802308820380492440', 'Scabbard Samurai', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto, Kensuke Shiga, Ryuto Kondo', 'Hitoshi Matsumoto', 'Takaaki Nomi, Sea Kumada, Itsuji Itao, Tokio Emoto, Jun Kunimura, Pistol Takehara, Ryo, Masatô Ibu', null, 'Kanjuro Nomi is an aging samurai who only has a scabbard. Deserting his lord to wander the land with his daughter Tae, Kanjuro is captured and sentenced to an unusual punishment: he has 30 days to bring a smile to the sad prince who has lost his mother — or else he must die.', 'Kanjuro Nomi is an aging samurai who only has a scabbard. Deserting his lord to wander the land with his daughter Tae, Kanjuro is captured and sentenced to an unusual punishment: he has 30 days to bring a smile to the sad prince who has lost his mother — or else he must die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OpxJGrVQnwBEJpuBuYR3jVNuYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80801'),
  ('991702739334611419', 'Scalawag', 1973, 'Adventure, Western', 'Kirk Douglas, Jack Cardiff, Zoran Čalić', 'Albert Sidney Fleischman, Albert Maltz, Kirk Douglas', 'Kirk Douglas, Mark Lester, George Eastman, Lesley-Anne Down, Danny DeVito, Neville Brand, Don Stroud, Mel Blanc', 'G', 'A crew of land locked pirates, led by the aptly named Peg, go in search of buried treasure hidden by the treacherous Mudhook and his twin brother. They meet up with good natured landowner, Don Aragon, who goes along for the ride with his sister and a young boy, Jamie. Along the way, Peg and Jamie form a father son relationship that is put to the test due to Peg''s naturally dishonest ways.', 'A crew of land locked pirates, led by the aptly named Peg, go in search of buried treasure hidden by the treacherous Mudhook and his twin brother. They meet up with good natured landowner, Don Aragon, who goes along for the ride with his sister and a young boy, Jamie. Along the way, Peg and Jamie form a father son relationship that is put to the test due to Peg''s naturally dishonest ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNIha4NdstR9y6Xg9nmVUJMN3vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157687'),
  ('1138100777171487754', 'Scale', 2022, 'Animation', 'Joseph Pierce, Vanessa Whyte', 'Joseph Pierce, Nicolas Pleskof', 'Sam Spruell', null, 'Driving along the motorway, Will loses his sense of scale. As his crippling drug addiction deepens, he struggles to unpick the sequence of events that led to his predicament, before he''s lost forever.', 'Driving along the motorway, Will loses his sense of scale. As his crippling drug addiction deepens, he struggles to unpick the sequence of events that led to his predicament, before he''s lost forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUgpxwwsJEFpSYdr4TPYOQ79EYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950825'),
  ('33541053414185300', 'Scalps', 1983, 'Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Cynthia Webster', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Richard Hench, Roger Maycock, Frank McDonald, Carol Sue Flockhart, Jo-Ann Robinson, Barbara Magnusson, Kirk Alyn, Carroll Borland', 'R', 'Silly group of college science students go an dig around in an indian burial ground for artifacts. Unfortunately, one of them becomes possessed by the evil spirit of Black Claw so he must therefore slaughter all of his friends.', 'Silly group of college science students go an dig around in an indian burial ground for artifacts. Unfortunately, one of them becomes possessed by the evil spirit of Black Claw so he must therefore slaughter all of his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWAef4geukiEEiuD2Zi0UYi6Rif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5733'),
  ('310570999768069111', 'Scalps', 1987, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Claudio Fragasso, Bruno Mattei', 'José María Cunillés', 'Vassili Karis, Mapi Galán, Charly Bravo, Beni Cardoso, Alberto Farnese, Lola Forner, José Canalejas, Emilio Linder', null, 'The commander of a Texan fort in the Civil War refuses to surrender to the Northerners, and tries to buy the local Indian tribe chief''s daughter. The sage man refuses, and the Southerners massacre the tribe and abduct the young squaw anyway. The noble squaw manages to escape, and hides out with a rough rancher, who dislikes Indians, but hates the Southerners more. The odd couple joins forces, and tactics, to exert ultimate vengeance on the men at the fort.', 'The commander of a Texan fort in the Civil War refuses to surrender to the Northerners, and tries to buy the local Indian tribe chief''s daughter. The sage man refuses, and the Southerners massacre the tribe and abduct the young squaw anyway. The noble squaw manages to escape, and hides out with a rough rancher, who dislikes Indians, but hates the Southerners more. The odd couple joins forces, and tactics, to exert ultimate vengeance on the men at the fort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IrBuNkb5exTxypzDkeYJ91j80u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114174'),
  ('725076258946041795', 'Scandal', 1950, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Toshio Ubukata', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yoshiko Yamaguchi, Yōko Katsuragi, Noriko Sengoku, Eitarō Ozawa, Takashi Shimura, Shinichi Himori, Kōji Mitsui', null, 'A celebrity photograph sparks a court case as a tabloid magazine spins a scandalous yarn over a painter and a famous singer.', 'A celebrity photograph sparks a court case as a tabloid magazine spins a scandalous yarn over a painter and a famous singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIpDB30mVA37o7ezno4vaiYpJ88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32690'),
  ('46001052476797911', 'Scandal', 1989, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Mike Molloy', 'Michael Thomas', 'John Hurt, Joanne Whalley, Bridget Fonda, Ian McKellen, Leslie Phillips, Britt Ekland, Daniel Massey, Roland Gift', 'R', 'An English bon-vivant osteopath is enchanted with a young exotic dancer and invites her to live with him. He serves as friend and mentor, and through his contacts and parties she and her friend meet and date members of the Conservative Party. Eventually a scandal occurs when her affair with the Minister of War goes public, threatening their lifestyles and their freedom.', 'An English bon-vivant osteopath is enchanted with a young exotic dancer and invites her to live with him. He serves as friend and mentor, and through his contacts and parties she and her friend meet and date members of the Conservative Party. Eventually a scandal occurs when her affair with the Minister of War goes public, threatening their lifestyles and their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30hZ9Yn7q7OSTrnBQAXggs011VQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32261'),
  ('1102548757955156887', 'SCANDAL Documentary film HELLO WORLD', 2015, 'Music, Documentary', 'Chie Okazawa, Yu Ogura', null, 'HARUNA, TOMOMI, MAMI, RINA', null, 'The documentary film follows the group as they perform in countries across Europe, North America and Asia. It includes live and behind-the-scenes footage of their sold-out performances at the O2 Academy Islington in London, Le Bataclan in Paris and House of Blues in Los Angeles among others, bringing audiences closer to HARUNA, MAMI, TOMOMI, and RINA of SCANDAL like never before.', 'The documentary film follows the group as they perform in countries across Europe, North America and Asia. It includes live and behind-the-scenes footage of their sold-out performances at the O2 Academy Islington in London, Le Bataclan in Paris and House of Blues in Los Angeles among others, bringing audiences closer to HARUNA, MAMI, TOMOMI, and RINA of SCANDAL like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpUyAJN5fiAmVLFDZmdjmibL3jy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351430'),
  ('1034163004746721767', 'Scandal in Sorrento', 1955, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Luisa Alessandri, Franco Montemurro', 'Ettore Maria Margadonna', 'Vittorio De Sica, Sophia Loren, Tina Pica, Lea Padovani, Antonio Cifariello, Mario Carotenuto, Yoka Berretty, Virgilio Riento', 'NR', 'Back to his hometown, a former marshal finds his house occupied by a young woman working as a fishwife.', 'Back to his hometown, a former marshal finds his house occupied by a young woman working as a fishwife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfxyltBi5FNoN38KLo491QzdiBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56287'),
  ('618493131418810500', 'Scandal in the Family', 1975, 'Drama', 'Bruno Gaburro', 'Carlo Romano', 'Michele Placido, Simonetta Stefanelli, Jenny Tamburi, Juliette Mayniel, Gastone Pescucci, Corrado Olmi, Edy Williams, Renzo Montagnani', null, 'The industrialist Carlo arrives at his villa in the Piacenza area to spend his holidays with his wife Piera and his daughter Francesca. They will soon be joined by their nephew Milo who will woo and seduce all the women of villa including the busty cook Doris lover of uncle Carlo.', 'The industrialist Carlo arrives at his villa in the Piacenza area to spend his holidays with his wife Piera and his daughter Francesca. They will soon be joined by their nephew Milo who will woo and seduce all the women of villa including the busty cook Doris lover of uncle Carlo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5MSI0UNHLEk8GNXBuqScGlUnNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195830'),
  ('530125887101012192', 'Scandal Makers', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Jang-mi, Lee Sung-jae, Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Lee Byeong-heon, Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Park Bo-young, Wang Seok-hyeon, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Im Ji-gyu, Lim Seung-dae, Jung Won-joong, Kim Ki-bang', null, 'Former teen idol Nam Hyeon-soo is now in his thirties and working as a radio DJ. One day a young woman named Jeong-nam shows up and claims to be his own daughter. She also has a son whom she claims to be Hyeon-soo''s grandson. Their relation is proven via DNA tests by Hyeon-soo''s brother. This leads to Hyeon-soo attempting to avoid a scandal concerning him having children "unknown" to the media.', 'Former teen idol Nam Hyeon-soo is now in his thirties and working as a radio DJ. One day a young woman named Jeong-nam shows up and claims to be his own daughter. She also has a son whom she claims to be Hyeon-soo''s grandson. Their relation is proven via DNA tests by Hyeon-soo''s brother. This leads to Hyeon-soo attempting to avoid a scandal concerning him having children "unknown" to the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DHrv3dQpLX3x2GBbBRd05VX3dG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18384'),
  ('313312359504554343', 'Scandal Sheet', 1952, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Phil Karlson, Burnett Guffey, Frederick Briskin', 'Eugene Ling, Ted Sherdeman, James Poe', 'Broderick Crawford, Donna Reed, John Derek, Rosemary DeCamp, Henry O''Neill, Harry Morgan, James Millican, Griff Barnett', 'NR', 'A tabloid editor assigns a young reporter to solve a murder the editor committed himself.', 'A tabloid editor assigns a young reporter to solve a murder the editor committed himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvQKSEt3m3kZzvBDDlnQRGY10HE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26009'),
  ('867629667506992381', 'Scandalous Sex', 2004, 'Drama', 'S. Oaks, Rex Ryder, Vincent Ray', null, 'Jessica Drake, Summer Fields, Felicia Fox, Julia Kruis, Beverly Lynne, Brad Bartram, Glen Meadows, Rick Patton', null, 'A daughter seeks to restore the reputation of her disgraced father, a wronged college professor. With help of a professional student, she must overcome an ambitious sorority bitch and corrupt college dean.', 'A daughter seeks to restore the reputation of her disgraced father, a wronged college professor. With help of a professional student, she must overcome an ambitious sorority bitch and corrupt college dean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eH2ben4ZuvDKxkgAgrPAVOsuJGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518244'),
  ('1062475728977651210', 'Scanner Cop', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Pierre David, Jacques Haitkin', 'John Bryant Hedberg, George Saunders', 'Daniel Quinn, Darlanne Fluegel, Richard Grove, Mark Rolston, Richard Lynch, Hilary Shepard, James Horan, Gary Hudson', 'R', 'Rookie cop Sam Staziak has a unique gift: he is a Scanner, which gives him the power to read the thoughts of others, and also to inflict great bodily harm. When a mad scientist begins using mind control to murder police officers, Sam realizes that only he and his unique gift can put an end to the mayhem.', 'Rookie cop Sam Staziak has a unique gift: he is a Scanner, which gives him the power to read the thoughts of others, and also to inflict great bodily harm. When a mad scientist begins using mind control to murder police officers, Sam realizes that only he and his unique gift can put an end to the mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq244J5sLVw4R6J1EJqvCeTrWjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30921'),
  ('256127092381402073', 'Scanner Cop II', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Steve Barnett, Tom Jewett, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Mark Sevi', 'Daniel Quinn, Patrick Kilpatrick, Khrystyne Haje, Stephen Mendel, Robert Forster, Brenda Swanson, Jerry Potter, Jewel Shepard', 'R', 'When other Scanners in the Los Angeles area are left drained of life, Sam is forced back into action in a desperate attempt to stop Volkin, who is determined to become the most powerful - and ruthless - of his kind.', 'When other Scanners in the Los Angeles area are left drained of life, Sam is forced back into action in a desperate attempt to stop Volkin, who is determined to become the most powerful - and ruthless - of his kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqESJkWhsqZYZ7muZZZgF5FaI0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87700'),
  ('286146611494105106', 'Scanners', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'David Cronenberg, Mark Irwin, Michael A. Williams', 'David Cronenberg', 'Stephen Lack, Jennifer O''Neill, Michael Ironside, Patrick McGoohan, Lawrence Dane, Robert A. Silverman, Lee Broker, Mavor Moore', 'R', 'After a man with extraordinary, and frighteningly destructive, telepathic abilities is nabbed by agents from a mysterious rogue corporation, he discovers he is far from the only possessor of such strange powers. Some of the other “scanners” have their minds set on world domination, while others are trying to stop them.', 'After a man with extraordinary, and frighteningly destructive, telepathic abilities is nabbed by agents from a mysterious rogue corporation, he discovers he is far from the only possessor of such strange powers. Some of the other “scanners” have their minds set on world domination, while others are trying to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VTqLdveNXxGsIAZL5I4RliTTt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9538'),
  ('673311758411179699', 'Scanners II: The New Order', 1991, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Christian Duguay, Rodney Gibbons', 'B.J. Nelson', 'David Hewlett, Deborah Raffin, Yvan Ponton, Isabelle Mejias, Tom Butler, Raoul Max Trujillo, Vlasta Vrana, Murray Westgate', 'R', 'A breed of humans with dangerously powerful telepathic abilities -- the scanners -- are being recruited by a corrupt police commander, John Forrester, in his crusade to take over the city.', 'A breed of humans with dangerously powerful telepathic abilities -- the scanners -- are being recruited by a corrupt police commander, John Forrester, in his crusade to take over the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vHebWuKWnAW4iT7mKsufcCTY1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24331'),
  ('1066101811271692239', 'Scanners III: The Takeover', 1992, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Christian Duguay, Hugues de Haeck', 'David Preston, B.J. Nelson, Julie Richard', 'Steve Parrish, Liliana Komorowska, Valérie Valois, Colin Fox, Daniel Pilon, Peter Wight, Sith Sekae, Claire Cellucci', 'R', 'A young scanner with extraordinary telepathic powers transforms into a lethal killing machine after taking one of her father''s experimental drugs.', 'A young scanner with extraordinary telepathic powers transforms into a lethal killing machine after taking one of her father''s experimental drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrgsczCSUfbaeYJnvMSEmKcGV4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33305'),
  ('211972745900666399', 'Scappo a casa', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Lando, Massimo Schiavon', 'Valerio Bariletti, Morgan Bertacca, Aldo Baglio', 'Aldo Baglio, Jacky Ido, Fatou N''Diaye, Angela Finocchiaro, Hassani Shapi, Giovanni Esposito, Dino Longo Sabanovic, Lana Vlady', null, 'Michele is a superficial man with nothing but contempt for other people and who lives only to show off his wealth on social media, until he finds himself mistaken for a North African immigrant in Eastern Europe and deported.', 'Michele is a superficial man with nothing but contempt for other people and who lives only to show off his wealth on social media, until he finds himself mistaken for a North African immigrant in Eastern Europe and deported.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slsw86Px8Vw2dPhW6O2swivjRdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583248'),
  ('758728647366497539', 'Scar', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Jed Weintrob, Toshiaki Ozawa, John Penhall', 'Zack Ford', 'Angela Bettis, Kirby Bliss Blanton, Devon Graye, Ben Cotton, Al Sapienza, Monika MarLee, Brittney Wilson, Tegan Moss', 'NR', 'Joan Burrows returns to her hometown for her niece''s graduation, only to be confronted by the serial killer she thought she offed years ago -- after he kidnapped and tormented her and her best friend.', 'Joan Burrows returns to her hometown for her niece''s graduation, only to be confronted by the serial killer she thought she offed years ago -- after he kidnapped and tormented her and her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGriXcu1LouvATDIE5AqUvEcs1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24499'),
  ('594527871532570475', 'Scaramouche', 1923, 'History, Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Rex Ingram, John F. Seitz, Curt Rehfeld', 'Rafael Sabatini, Willis Goldbeck', 'Ramon Novarro, Alice Terry, Lewis Stone, Lloyd Ingraham, Julia Swayne Gordon, William Humphrey, Otto Matieson, George Siegmann', 'NR', 'A law student becomes an outlaw French revolutionary when he decides to avenge the unjust killing of his friend. To get close to the aristocrat who has killed his friend, the student adopts the identity of Scaramouche the clown.', 'A law student becomes an outlaw French revolutionary when he decides to avenge the unjust killing of his friend. To get close to the aristocrat who has killed his friend, the student adopts the identity of Scaramouche the clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnJoBk1axXEcUYlfHnf3YD7h6Ok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97716'),
  ('1124785351459195259', 'Scaramouche', 1952, 'Adventure, Romance', 'George Sidney, Charles Rosher, George Rhein', 'Ronald Millar, George Froeschel', 'Stewart Granger, Eleanor Parker, Janet Leigh, Mel Ferrer, Henry Wilcoxon, Nina Foch, Richard Anderson, Robert Coote', 'NR', 'In 18th-century France, a young man masquerades as an actor to avenge his friend''s murder.', 'In 18th-century France, a young man masquerades as an actor to avenge his friend''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yALSC7jqOsmMtfSPp6ThCuNGjiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33454'),
  ('90466577703955131', 'Scarborn', 2024, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Łukasz Sikora, Katarzyna Wiśniowska, Paweł Maślona', 'Michał A. Zieliński', 'Bartosz Bielenia, Jacek Braciak, Jason Mitchell, Agnieszka Grochowska, Robert Więckiewicz, Piotr Pacek, Łukasz Simlat, Matylda Giegżno', null, 'Spring of 1794, Poland is in a state of unrest. General Tadeusz ‘Kos’ Kościuszko returns to the country, planning to ignite an uprising against the Russians by mobilising Polish gentry and peasants. He is accompanied by his faithful friend and former slave, Domingo. Kościuszko is being tracked down by a merciless Russian cavalry captain, Dunin, who wants to do whatever it takes to capture the general before he starts a national revolt.', 'Spring of 1794, Poland is in a state of unrest. General Tadeusz ‘Kos’ Kościuszko returns to the country, planning to ignite an uprising against the Russians by mobilising Polish gentry and peasants. He is accompanied by his faithful friend and former slave, Domingo. Kościuszko is being tracked down by a merciless Russian cavalry captain, Dunin, who wants to do whatever it takes to capture the general before he starts a national revolt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4cZ2vg2NuGfe9YKhfYEHk2WNjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047917'),
  ('1086086994987232827', 'Scarce', 2008, 'Horror', 'John Geddes, Jesse Thomas Cook', 'John Geddes, Jesse Thomas Cook', 'Steve Warren, Gary Fischer, Chris Warrilow, Thomas Webb, John Geddes, Jesse Thomas Cook, Stephanie Banting, Matt Griffin', null, 'SCARCE depicts the gruesome fate of three lost snowboarders trapped at an isolated forest cabin owned by two menacing locals who harvest human flesh. As the day of the slaughter nears, they attempt to escape barefoot through the frozen wilderness.', 'SCARCE depicts the gruesome fate of three lost snowboarders trapped at an isolated forest cabin owned by two menacing locals who harvest human flesh. As the day of the slaughter nears, they attempt to escape barefoot through the frozen wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFcd1DQqd08Z7yFgU2uEK00ZUKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36587'),
  ('330776138675614889', 'Scare Campaign', 2016, 'Horror', 'Andrew Power, Roman Meyer, Colin Cairnes', 'Colin Cairnes, Cameron Cairnes', 'Meegan Warner, Ian Meadows, Olivia DeJonge, Josh Quong Tart, Patrick Harvey, Cassandra Magrath, Steve Mouzakis, John Brumpton', null, 'A popular prank TV show, Scare Campaign, has been entertaining audiences for the last 5 years with its mix of old school scares and hidden camera fun. But as we enter a new age of online TV, the producers find themselves up against a new hard edged web series that makes their show look decidedly quaint. It''s time to up the ante, but will the team go too far this time, and are they about to prank the wrong guy?', 'A popular prank TV show, Scare Campaign, has been entertaining audiences for the last 5 years with its mix of old school scares and hidden camera fun. But as we enter a new age of online TV, the producers find themselves up against a new hard edged web series that makes their show look decidedly quaint. It''s time to up the ante, but will the team go too far this time, and are they about to prank the wrong guy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/580zJpaTf30ckeu1FrPFLr6p56I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370178'),
  ('665623332568265884', 'Scare Me', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Josh Ruben, Brendan H. Banks', 'Josh Ruben', 'Aya Cash, Josh Ruben, Chris Redd, Rebecca Drysdale, Lauren Sick', 'NR', 'During a power outage, two strangers tell scary stories. The more Fred and Fanny commit to their tales, the more the stories come to life in the dark of a Catskills cabin. The horrors of reality manifest when Fred confronts his ultimate fear: Fanny is the better storyteller.', 'During a power outage, two strangers tell scary stories. The more Fred and Fanny commit to their tales, the more the stories come to life in the dark of a Catskills cabin. The horrors of reality manifest when Fred confronts his ultimate fear: Fanny is the better storyteller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrOtmvhe9gF7RLDeadKyFLciNO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653643'),
  ('514376155110129038', 'Scare Out', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Fu Xiaojie', 'Chen Liang, Zhang Yimou', 'Jackson Yee, Zhu Yilong, Song Jia, Lei Jiayin, Yang Mi, Zhang Yi, Liu Shishi, Liu Yaowen', null, 'After a critical intelligence leak, a national security unit launches an intensive investigation. But successive setbacks in their arrest operations reveal a shocking truth: the trail leads back to within the unit itself. Amidst a storm of trust and betrayal, a silent battle begins to unfold...', 'After a critical intelligence leak, a national security unit launches an intensive investigation. But successive setbacks in their arrest operations reveal a shocking truth: the trail leads back to within the unit itself. Amidst a storm of trust and betrayal, a silent battle begins to unfold...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs7YjSkD2lv6d0efg3EiqeMsqOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1447971'),
  ('263776521145879012', 'Scare Package', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Spencer Rollins, Sonja Tsypin, Kalilah Robinson', 'Anthony Cousins, Emily Hagins, Noah Segan', 'Jeremy King, Byron Brown, Hawn Tran, Jon Michael Simpson, Zoe Graham, Noah Segan, Toni Trucks, Chase Williamson', 'NR', 'Chad Buckley is super crazy about horror movies, but also very lonely. He mostly spends his days in his small movie shop having wild discussions with his only returning customer, Sam.', 'Chad Buckley is super crazy about horror movies, but also very lonely. He mostly spends his days in his small movie shop having wild discussions with his only returning customer, Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRf46QmAsSKoHPKNTnCdyPIo1bG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636891'),
  ('748382925251664324', 'Scare Package II: Rad Chad’s Revenge', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Anthony Cousins, Alexandra Barreto, Rachele Wiggins', 'Aaron B. Koontz, Cameron Burns, Jed Shepherd', 'Jeremy King, Zoe Graham, Byron Brown, Rich Sommer, Kelli Maroney, Graham Skipper, Maria Olsen, Shakira Ja''nai Paye', 'NR', 'Following the events of the original with the survivors attending the funeral of “Rad Chad” Buckley, which quickly devolves into an elaborate series of death traps centered around Chad’s favorite films, forcing the guests to band together and use the rules of horror to survive the bloody game.', 'Following the events of the original with the survivors attending the funeral of “Rad Chad” Buckley, which quickly devolves into an elaborate series of death traps centered around Chad’s favorite films, forcing the guests to band together and use the rules of horror to survive the bloody game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQLCI3GOvb55Th7rzes38nXoBdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915968'),
  ('1123787141851665051', 'Scarecrow', 1973, 'Drama', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Vilmos Zsigmond, Charles Bonniwell', 'Garry Michael White', 'Gene Hackman, Al Pacino, Dorothy Tristan, Ann Wedgeworth, Richard Lynch, Eileen Brennan, Penelope Allen, Richard Hackman', 'R', 'Two drifters bum around, visit earthy women and discuss opening a car wash in Pittsburgh.', 'Two drifters bum around, visit earthy women and discuss opening a car wash in Pittsburgh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jK0e8jLl0pp59yX6AYMyyJPnMVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31587'),
  ('152152967548235597', 'Scarecrow', 1983, 'Family, Drama', 'Rolan Bykov, Anatoliy Mukasey, Aleksandr Khait', 'Vladimir Zheleznikov, Rolan Bykov', 'Kristina Orbakayte, Yuriy Nikulin, Yelena Sanayeva, Mitya Yegorov, Kseniya Filippova, Anna Tolmachyova, Marina Martanova, Konstantin Chekhovsky', null, 'A twelve years old girl Lena who has come to live with her grandfather in a small Russian town is being bullied by her classmates. She took the rap of being a class traitor because she was in love with the boy who had betrayed his classmates when they were bunking off and going to cinema instead of a literature lesson. The class is penalized for that, not being allowed to go to Moscow for fall holidays with the rest of the school. Lena is being ostracized, "boycotted" however not telling the truth, waiting that the boy himself would confess to be guilty.', 'A twelve years old girl Lena who has come to live with her grandfather in a small Russian town is being bullied by her classmates. She took the rap of being a class traitor because she was in love with the boy who had betrayed his classmates when they were bunking off and going to cinema instead of a literature lesson. The class is penalized for that, not being allowed to go to Moscow for fall holidays with the rest of the school. Lena is being ostracized, "boycotted" however not telling the truth, waiting that the boy himself would confess to be guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dh2uZhItHiR3cqpbRfYVuffLzRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63573'),
  ('1136803646800877811', 'Scarecrow', 2002, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Emmanuel Itier, Byron Werner, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Emmanuel Itier, Bill Cunningham, Jason White', 'Todd Rex, Tim Young, Tiffany Shepis, Roxanna Bina, Jen Richey, John Moore, Richard Elfman, Jason Simon', null, 'A high school outcast who lives in a trailer with his mother finally meets a friend. He wants to ask her if they can go the next step, but then sees her kissing another boy at a party. He runs home only to find his mother having sex with a drunk. He starts yelling, but is countered by the drunk when he suffocates him and makes him look like he hung himself. The scarecrow comes in when the boy''s soul is pushed into it. He goes out for revenge.', 'A high school outcast who lives in a trailer with his mother finally meets a friend. He wants to ask her if they can go the next step, but then sees her kissing another boy at a party. He runs home only to find his mother having sex with a drunk. He starts yelling, but is countered by the drunk when he suffocates him and makes him look like he hung himself. The scarecrow comes in when the boy''s soul is pushed into it. He goes out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjwMFZMEzsUr0P8uIWCZHgZ5p3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48314'),
  ('874352338427877604', 'Scarecrow', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Sheldon Wilson, Eric J. Goldstein, Kevin Leslie', 'Rick Suvalle', 'Lacey Chabert, Brittney Wilson, Julia Maxwell, Nicole Muñoz, Robin Dunne, Iain Belcher, Richard Harmon, Carlo Marks', 'R', 'For generations, it was an urban legend that lived in the nightmares of children. Now, the season to rejuvenate the tale will revive a town''s darkest fears. With the Scarecrow Festival on the horizon, school teacher Aaron Harris is doling out punishment for six students serving detention. Their task: help Aaron''s girlfriend Amanda fix her family farm before it''s sold. But the cornfields circling the farm come with a legend and Tyler takes macabre delight in recounting the tale: It never sleeps, it never dies, it can''t be stopped, hear their cries.', 'For generations, it was an urban legend that lived in the nightmares of children. Now, the season to rejuvenate the tale will revive a town''s darkest fears. With the Scarecrow Festival on the horizon, school teacher Aaron Harris is doling out punishment for six students serving detention. Their task: help Aaron''s girlfriend Amanda fix her family farm before it''s sold. But the cornfields circling the farm come with a legend and Tyler takes macabre delight in recounting the tale: It never sleeps, it never dies, it can''t be stopped, hear their cries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FNlOE060DyeT3T5hcR133lYebv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226948'),
  ('275601788964689352', 'Scarecrows', 1988, 'Horror', 'William Wesley, Peter Deming', 'William Wesley, Richard Jefferies', 'Ted Vernon, Michael David Simms, Richard Vidan, Kristina Sanborn, Victoria Christian, David James Campbell, B.J. Turner, Tony Santory', 'R', 'Five men heist the Camp Pendleton payroll and kidnap a pilot and his daughter, who are forced to fly them to Mexico. Enroute a double cross has one of the thieves parachute with the loot into an abandoned farm surrounded by strange scarecrows. The rest of the team jump after their loot and their former partner. Everything happens during the course of one very dark night.', 'Five men heist the Camp Pendleton payroll and kidnap a pilot and his daughter, who are forced to fly them to Mexico. Enroute a double cross has one of the thieves parachute with the loot into an abandoned farm surrounded by strange scarecrows. The rest of the team jump after their loot and their former partner. Everything happens during the course of one very dark night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaUdO29mwujiz2NcicSAk4u1NIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40168'),
  ('782024834694173409', 'Scared', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Piyanuch Trakulsajawat, Pooksawart Sirivechchapan, Monaiya Tharasak', 'Pakphum Wongjinda', 'Nonthapun Jaikunta, Napapa Tantrakul, Chidjun Hung, Sirilapas Kongtrakarn, Sumonrat Wattanaselarat, Thanothai Euamornrat, Thewin Khunarattanawat, Sudprach Aungtakul', null, 'A group of freshmen on a road trip survive an accident, only to end up in an abandoned town where they are hunted down and killed one by one.', 'A group of freshmen on a road trip survive an accident, only to end up in an abandoned town where they are hunted down and killed one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcwvKQPFnkzXKKcAxAfsD5V1QLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75561'),
