  ('297825042431961902', 'Scared Stiff', 1953, 'Music, Comedy, Horror', 'George Marshall, Ernest Laszlo, Charles C. Coleman', 'Herbert Baker, Walter DeLeon', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Lizabeth Scott, Carmen Miranda, George Dolenz, Dorothy Malone, William Ching, Paul Marion', 'NR', 'A nightclub singer and his partner escape mobsters by fleeing to Cuba with a beautiful heiress, who has inherited a haunted castle on an isolated island. The trio hunt for a hidden treasure and encounter a ghost, a zombie, and a mysterious killer...', 'A nightclub singer and his partner escape mobsters by fleeing to Cuba with a beautiful heiress, who has inherited a haunted castle on an isolated island. The trio hunt for a hidden treasure and encounter a ghost, a zombie, and a mysterious killer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnglxMYB0912uje2gC2VfMZRywo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33754'),
  ('634248699957247718', 'Scared Stiff', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lau Kar-Wing, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Yuen Wah', 'Sze-To Cheuk-Hon', 'Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Emily Chu Bo-Yee, Woo Fung, Chow Yun-Fat, Phillip Ko Fai, Yuen Wah, Anita Mui Yim-Fong', null, 'Alan and Halley are partners in a pest control company. Handsome Alan gets the girls and puffy Halley gets nothing. One night the two are injured in a car crash. Halley suffers slight injuries but Alan is dead for all purposes except his brain wave which still works actively.', 'Alan and Halley are partners in a pest control company. Handsome Alan gets the girls and puffy Halley gets nothing. One night the two are injured in a car crash. Halley suffers slight injuries but Alan is dead for all purposes except his brain wave which still works actively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxmM4VYoVVKOaMRNto4J9oMEtw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300980'),
  ('490572809138653097', 'Scared Straight!', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Arnold Shapiro', 'Arnold Shapiro', 'Peter Falk', null, 'The filmed depiction of a program where convicts tell troubled kids about the horrors of prison life. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'The filmed depiction of a program where convicts tell troubled kids about the horrors of prison life. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZsuFndUZlf12g71enRaO3y7vjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92215'),
  ('734628977511790458', 'Scared to Death', 1947, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'Christy Cabanne, Marcel Le Picard', 'Walter Abbott', 'Bela Lugosi, George Zucco, Nat Pendleton, Molly Lamont, Joyce Compton, Gladys Blake, Roland Varno, Angelo Rossitto', 'NR', 'A woman is married to the son of a doctor, the proprietor of a private sanatorium, where she is under unwilling treatment. Both the son and the doctor indicate they want the marriage dissolved. Arriving at the scene is a mysterious personage identified as the doctor''s cousin who formerly was a stage magician in Europe. He is accompanied by a threatening dwarf.', 'A woman is married to the son of a doctor, the proprietor of a private sanatorium, where she is under unwilling treatment. Both the son and the doctor indicate they want the marriage dissolved. Arriving at the scene is a mysterious personage identified as the doctor''s cousin who formerly was a stage magician in Europe. He is accompanied by a threatening dwarf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymaIo6NbBbQeNgzQBP8zHTn21ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23622'),
  ('852777941928421576', 'Scared to Death', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Malone, Patrick Prince', 'William Malone', 'John Stinson, Diana Davidson, Jonathan David Moses, Toni Jannotta, Walker Edmiston, Pamela Bowman, Mike Muscat, Freddie Dawson', 'R', 'A series of hideous murders is taking place, and Inspector Capell and cop-turned-novelist Lonergan are investigating. The murders are found to be the work of an out-of-control experiment in genetic engineering. The two men must descend into the city''s sewer systems to destroy the horrific miscreation. It won''t be hard to find, as it''s already looking for its next victims...', 'A series of hideous murders is taking place, and Inspector Capell and cop-turned-novelist Lonergan are investigating. The murders are found to be the work of an out-of-control experiment in genetic engineering. The two men must descend into the city''s sewer systems to destroy the horrific miscreation. It won''t be hard to find, as it''s already looking for its next victims...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSW42sBxRslex2OUAtr6OMSjiR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97942'),
  ('784352417028119545', 'Scared to Death', 2026, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Paul Boyd, Steven Poster', 'Paul Boyd', 'Bill Moseley, Olivier Paris, Victoria Konefal, Jade Chynoweth, B.J. Minor', 'Not Rated', 'Jasper, a young filmmaker, seizes a chance to direct when his crew attends a seance in a haunted children''s shelter. Trapped inside, they''re haunted by ghostly orphans and a sinister force.', 'Jasper, a young filmmaker, seizes a chance to direct when his crew attends a seance in a haunted children''s shelter. Trapped inside, they''re haunted by ghostly orphans and a sinister force.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F42fbfbb3fe024d69cde4f008fb2d0e41.jpg', 'plex:movie:scared-to-death-2026'),
  ('581366455256748428', 'Scaredy Cat', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Porky Pig and Sylvester the Cat spend the night in an old dark house, whose horrors only Sylvester sees.', 'Porky Pig and Sylvester the Cat spend the night in an old dark house, whose horrors only Sylvester sees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qayyUvsmjw1i2DvhcM0Wtbwcei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84594'),
  ('1131066891157699088', 'Scarface', 1932, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Lee Garmes, Gus Arnheim', 'Ben Hecht', 'Paul Muni, Ann Dvorak, Karen Morley, Osgood Perkins, C. Henry Gordon, George Raft, Vince Barnett, Boris Karloff', null, 'In 1920s Chicago, Italian immigrant and notorious thug, Antonio ''Tony'' Camonte, aka Scarface, shoots his way to the top of the mobs while trying to protect his sister from the criminal life.', 'In 1920s Chicago, Italian immigrant and notorious thug, Antonio ''Tony'' Camonte, aka Scarface, shoots his way to the top of the mobs while trying to protect his sister from the criminal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4E5oRiHMTFkEB12IIcpbKbKzDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877'),
  ('862429224349601307', 'Scarface', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Brian De Palma, John A. Alonzo, David Dreyfuss', 'Ben Hecht, Howard Hawks', 'Al Pacino, Steven Bauer, Michelle Pfeiffer, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Robert Loggia, Miriam Colon, F. Murray Abraham, Paul Shenar', 'R', 'After getting a green card in exchange for assassinating a Cuban government official, Tony Montana stakes a claim on the drug trade in Miami. Viciously murdering anyone who stands in his way, Tony eventually becomes the biggest drug lord in the state, controlling nearly all the cocaine that comes through Miami. But increased pressure from the police, wars with Colombian drug cartels and his own drug-fueled paranoia serve to fuel the flames of his eventual downfall.', 'After getting a green card in exchange for assassinating a Cuban government official, Tony Montana stakes a claim on the drug trade in Miami. Viciously murdering anyone who stands in his way, Tony eventually becomes the biggest drug lord in the state, controlling nearly all the cocaine that comes through Miami. But increased pressure from the police, wars with Colombian drug cartels and his own drug-fueled paranoia serve to fuel the flames of his eventual downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ5ztdjvteGeboxtmRdXEChJOHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111'),
  ('1016332610562213691', 'Scarfies', 1999, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Robert Sarkies, Stephen Downes, Axel Paton', 'Robert Sarkies, Duncan Sarkies', 'Willa O''Neill, Taika Waititi, Charlie Bleakley, Neill Rea, Ashleigh Seagar, Jon Brazier, Mark Neilson, David Kilgour', null, 'This dark comedy is set in Dunedin, New Zealand. A university student finds an old "abandoned" house and proceeds to invite other students to share. It even has running electricity. But what is the catch?', 'This dark comedy is set in Dunedin, New Zealand. A university student finds an old "abandoned" house and proceeds to invite other students to share. It even has running electricity. But what is the catch?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpA3BziC2xPK9eLFaKTEDrYmVKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13892'),
  ('657605166954554441', 'Scarlet', 2023, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Pietro Marcello, Marco Graziaplena, Olivier Bouffard', 'Geneviève Brisac', 'Raphaël Thiéry, Juliette Jouan, Noémie Lvovsky, Louis Garrel, Yolande Moreau, François Négret, Ernst Umhauer, Natascha Wiese', null, 'A French widower and WWI veteran returns home after the war to raise his newborn daughter.', 'A French widower and WWI veteran returns home after the war to raise his newborn daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6kr3P8OuskO4g4yqSAhb1hR8Uk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840111'),
  ('529115673864403471', 'Scarlet', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Keiichi Sawa, Takaaki Yamashita', 'Mamoru Hosoda', 'Mana Ashida, Masaki Okada, Yutaka Matsushige, Kotaro Yoshida, Koji Yakusho, Masachika Ichimura, Yuki Saito, Shota Sometani', 'PG-13', 'After failing to avenge her father''s murder, Princess Scarlet, wakes up in the "Land of the Dead." In this world filled with madness, if she does not achieve her revenge against her nemesis and reach the "No End Place," she will become "Void" and cease to exist. Can Scarlet find a way to live at the end of her endless journey?', 'After failing to avenge her father''s murder, Princess Scarlet, wakes up in the "Land of the Dead." In this world filled with madness, if she does not achieve her revenge against her nemesis and reach the "No End Place," she will become "Void" and cease to exist. Can Scarlet find a way to live at the end of her endless journey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2O2tOyS4kvO9GtFPHpWmbXvfRQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1406657'),
  ('431220020423000054', 'Scarlet Diva', 2000, 'Drama', 'Asia Argento', 'Asia Argento', 'Asia Argento, Jean Shepard, Herbert Fritsch, Gianluca Arcopinto, Vera Gemma, Daria Nicolodi, Francesca D''Aloja, Joe Coleman', null, 'A young Italian actress embarks on a self-destructive spree of sex, drugs and other excess while doing some soul searching to find the path for redemption.', 'A young Italian actress embarks on a self-destructive spree of sex, drugs and other excess while doing some soul searching to find the path for redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zo2uucPQ9FaGCwRG2tRV4V2KBVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23990'),
  ('172838620324240219', 'Scarlet Innocence', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Yim Pil-sung, Lee Seong-je, Lee Byeong-hoon', 'Jang Yoon-mi', 'Jung Woo-sung, Esom, Park So-young, Kim Hie-won, Park Seo-yeon, Park So-dam, Yoon Se-a, Han Joo-young', null, 'A university professor gradually succumbing to blindness is entranced by an obsessive love, in this modern-day adaptation of a classic Korean fairy tale.', 'A university professor gradually succumbing to blindness is entranced by an obsessive love, in this modern-day adaptation of a classic Korean fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejaHQQKp5J2tD6ubprDMmIRGKnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287649'),
  ('542108235657049174', 'Scarlet Sails', 1961, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Viktor Yakushev, Gennadi Tsekavyi', 'Aleksandr Yurovsky, Aleksei Nagornyj', 'Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Vasili Lanovoy, Ivan Pereverzev, Sergei Martinson, Nikolai Volkov St., Sergei Romodanov, Oleg Anofriev, Pavel Volkov', null, 'A little girl Assol met a wizard and it has been foretold: "... it will be a fine sunny day when a beautiful ship under scarlet sail comes and the noble prince will take you away from here. He''ll take you to the world of your dreams, where you will be loved and happy." The neighbours told jokes about her, children teased her, but she waited for her prince. She trusted in the miracles and waited. Arthur Gray''s rule was "if you can make a miracle, do it!". And he made a miracle for the wonderful romantic girl.', 'A little girl Assol met a wizard and it has been foretold: "... it will be a fine sunny day when a beautiful ship under scarlet sail comes and the noble prince will take you away from here. He''ll take you to the world of your dreams, where you will be loved and happy." The neighbours told jokes about her, children teased her, but she waited for her prince. She trusted in the miracles and waited. Arthur Gray''s rule was "if you can make a miracle, do it!". And he made a miracle for the wonderful romantic girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCUlJ1Xaxv0bCsjXuFreyeKDhTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83422'),
  ('730747375788081320', 'Scarlet Street', 1945, 'Drama, Crime', 'Fritz Lang, Milton Krasner, Melville Shyer', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Edward G. Robinson, Joan Bennett, Dan Duryea, Margaret Lindsay, Jess Barker, Rosalind Ivan, Charles Kemper, Anita Sharp-Bolster', 'NR', 'Cashier and part-time starving artist Christopher Cross is absolutely smitten with the beautiful Kitty March. Kitty plays along, but she''s really only interested in Johnny, a two-bit crook. When Kitty and Johnny find out that art dealers are interested in Chris''s work, they con him into letting Kitty take credit for the paintings. Cross allows it because he is in love with Kitty, but his love will only let her get away with so much.', 'Cashier and part-time starving artist Christopher Cross is absolutely smitten with the beautiful Kitty March. Kitty plays along, but she''s really only interested in Johnny, a two-bit crook. When Kitty and Johnny find out that art dealers are interested in Chris''s work, they con him into letting Kitty take credit for the paintings. Cross allows it because he is in love with Kitty, but his love will only let her get away with so much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGEDor1BWSQGaLtOntPHUSqNzRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17058'),
  ('816562587682855965', 'Scarlet Week', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Markus, Matti Kassila, Osmo Harkimo', 'Matti Kassila', 'Gunvor Sandkvist, Matti Oravisto, Toivo Mäkelä, Paavo Hukkinen, Kauko Laurikainen, Juhani Kumpulainen, Kaarlo Saarnio, Leo Jokela', null, 'After a weekend of dancing and camping on a recreation island near the city, a young factory worker decides to stay and cut work for a day. Walking around the now deserted island, he meets a beautiful woman camping alone and sunbathing in the nude on the beach. A hot romance flares up between the worker and the more upper-class married lady, lasting through the light-filled nights of the whole summer week until the woman''s much older husband returns to the island the next weekend.', 'After a weekend of dancing and camping on a recreation island near the city, a young factory worker decides to stay and cut work for a day. Walking around the now deserted island, he meets a beautiful woman camping alone and sunbathing in the nude on the beach. A hot romance flares up between the worker and the more upper-class married lady, lasting through the light-filled nights of the whole summer week until the woman''s much older husband returns to the island the next weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ8L5oZlNGG90K53MvffKO4eavl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251657'),
  ('676853758178608315', 'Scarlett', 2020, 'Action', 'John Lyde, John Lyde', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Melanie Stone, Brian Krause, Musa Aden, Isaac Akers, Gabriel Casdorph, Demetrius Daniels, Deven Davenport, Mason D. Davis', null, 'A college student must draw upon all the skills her spy-father taught her to protect herself and save her father from weapons dealers.', 'A college student must draw upon all the skills her spy-father taught her to protect herself and save her father from weapons dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDOxuzoRcDa9RoNDu8zNdLUtTeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816614'),
  ('248006848955752454', 'Scarred City', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ken Sanzel, Michael Slovis', 'Ken Sanzel', 'Tia Carrere, Renée Estevez, Chazz Palminteri, Stephen Baldwin, Jeffrey Buehl, Michael Rispoli, Cort Hessler, Heidi Jo Markel', 'R', 'A young cop gets thrown in with a special police squad who are acting as assassins against hoods and who don''t care who gets in the way.', 'A young cop gets thrown in with a special police squad who are acting as assassins against hoods and who don''t care who gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxthJTOUHsmLne60zVhOif2fiHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70190'),
  ('626894223776471294', 'Scars', 2005, 'Drama', 'Paco del Toro', 'Verónica Maldonado, Paco del Toro', 'Nora Salinas, Rodrigo Abed, Bryan Rangel, Joana Brito, Marta Aura', null, 'The story of a dysfunctional couple, whose problems will inevitably deteriorate their marriage and their son''s life.', 'The story of a dysfunctional couple, whose problems will inevitably deteriorate their marriage and their son''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ng63oUTS61vxMeuHdsEQvXFcPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74078'),
  ('833799294580464667', 'Scars of Dracula', 1970, 'Horror', 'Roy Ward Baker, Moray Grant, Derek Whitehurst', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Christopher Lee, Dennis Waterman, Jenny Hanley, Christopher Matthews, Patrick Troughton, Michael Gwynn, Wendy Hamilton, Michael Ripper', 'R', 'The Prince of Darkness casts his undead shadow once more over the cursed village of Kleinenberg when his ashes are splashed with bat''s blood and Dracula is resurrected. And two innocent victims search for a missing loved one... loved to death by Dracula''s mistress. But after they discover his blood-drained corpse in Dracula''s castle necropolis, the Vampire Lord''s lustful vengeance begins.', 'The Prince of Darkness casts his undead shadow once more over the cursed village of Kleinenberg when his ashes are splashed with bat''s blood and Dracula is resurrected. And two innocent victims search for a missing loved one... loved to death by Dracula''s mistress. But after they discover his blood-drained corpse in Dracula''s castle necropolis, the Vampire Lord''s lustful vengeance begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yS06u6RqaY3saimoVr6ZVZP9K7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34479'),
  ('337104740820745830', 'Scars We Love', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Raphaël Jouzeau', 'Raphaël Jouzeau, Pierre le Gall', 'Fanny Sidney, Quentin Dolmaire', null, 'Gaspard is still very much in love with Leïla. They meet in a crowded bar a month after she left him. The conversation turns awry and Gaspard seeks refuge under the tablecloth, away from prying eyes and closer to his memories.', 'Gaspard is still very much in love with Leïla. They meet in a crowded bar a month after she left him. The conversation turns awry and Gaspard seeks refuge under the tablecloth, away from prying eyes and closer to his memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FkN7dUs0UXPnp3t2ksddmdCVsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279225'),
  ('592095646405423881', 'Scary Godmother: Halloween Spooktakular', 2003, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Jill Thompson, Heath Corson', 'Garry Chalk, Noel Callahan, Alex Doduk, Britt Irvin, Britt McKillip, Danny McKinnon, Scott McNeil, Adam Pospíšil', 'PG', 'Scary Godmother is the whimsical all-ages story that follows the first trick-or-treating adventure of Hannah Marie, a young girl whose rotten older cousin is babysitting her one dark Halloween. Unhappy to be saddled with Hannah, her cousin cooks up a scheme to frighten her. But his scheme backfires when Hannah gets help from her Scary Godmother.', 'Scary Godmother is the whimsical all-ages story that follows the first trick-or-treating adventure of Hannah Marie, a young girl whose rotten older cousin is babysitting her one dark Halloween. Unhappy to be saddled with Hannah, her cousin cooks up a scheme to frighten her. But his scheme backfires when Hannah gets help from her Scary Godmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmmL7DZmCVM5ORsgI4HHj5B6soY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48567'),
  ('770796302733900155', 'Scary Godmother: The Revenge of Jimmy', 2005, 'Animation', 'Ezekiel Norton', 'Ian Boothby', 'Dexter Bell, Garry Chalk, Britt Irvin, Alexander Ludwig, Britt McKillip, Scott McNeil, Tabitha St. Germain, Nathan Tipple', null, 'Halloween is an exciting time of year for Hannah Marie who is joined by her Scary Godmother and all sorts of new friends including kooky monsters, friendly vampires and silly skeletons. It''s a journey to the Fright Side she''ll never forget as Hannah and her friends must foil her cousin Jimmy''s plans to ruin Halloween for everyone!', 'Halloween is an exciting time of year for Hannah Marie who is joined by her Scary Godmother and all sorts of new friends including kooky monsters, friendly vampires and silly skeletons. It''s a journey to the Fright Side she''ll never forget as Hannah and her friends must foil her cousin Jimmy''s plans to ruin Halloween for everyone!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1mofVad0vz4IAY0PfjvJ8LZQf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76789'),
  ('682637170403342331', 'Scary Movie', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Erickson, Ivan Bigley', 'Mark Voges, Daniel Erickson, David Lane Smith', 'John Hawkes, Jason Waller, Suzanne Aldrich, Virginia Pratt, Mark Voges, Butch Patrick, Zane Rockenbaugh, Ev Lunning', null, 'On Halloween night, big-time nerd Warren attends a spookhouse in a small Texas town. But is the haunted house as harmless as it seems, or has a psychotic mental patient found a new stomping ground?', 'On Halloween night, big-time nerd Warren attends a spookhouse in a small Texas town. But is the haunted house as harmless as it seems, or has a psychotic mental patient found a new stomping ground?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yDwgtGkfPXjRgFPWfZNKva3Ilr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4242'),
  ('701518071336302793', 'Scary Movie', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Francis Kenny, David Hay', 'Shawn Wayans, Buddy Johnson, Phil Beauman', 'Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Jon Abrahams, Lochlyn Munro, Shannon Elizabeth, Dave Sheridan', 'R', 'A familiar-looking group of teenagers find themselves being stalked by a more-than-vaguely recognizable masked killer! As the victims begin to pile up and the laughs pile on, none of your favorite scary movies escape the razor-sharp satire of this outrageously funny parody!', 'A familiar-looking group of teenagers find themselves being stalked by a more-than-vaguely recognizable masked killer! As the victims begin to pile up and the laughs pile on, none of your favorite scary movies escape the razor-sharp satire of this outrageously funny parody!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVQFPRuw3yWXojYDJvA5EoFjUOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4247'),
  ('1036711668447622563', 'Scary Movie', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Tiddes, Michael J. Moore, Amir R. Khan', 'Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Damon Wayans Jr., Gregg Wayans, Kim Wayans, Benny Zielke', null, 'Twenty-six years after outrunning a suspiciously familiar masked killer, the Core Four are back in the killer''s crosshairs and no horror movie IP is safe.', 'Twenty-six years after outrunning a suspiciously familiar masked killer, the Core Four are back in the killer''s crosshairs and no horror movie IP is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUPE82BWRZwq6M5Xc9UNuf8AffK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273221'),
  ('415489374861942025', 'Scary Movie 2', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Steven Bernstein, Daniel Novotny', 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Alyson Fouse', 'Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Christopher Masterson, Kathleen Robertson, David Cross, James Woods', 'R', 'While the original parodied slasher flicks like Scream, Keenen Ivory Wayans''s sequel to Scary Movie takes comedic aim at haunted house movies. A group of students visit a mansion called "Hell House," and murderous high jinks ensue.', 'While the original parodied slasher flicks like Scream, Keenen Ivory Wayans''s sequel to Scary Movie takes comedic aim at haunted house movies. A group of students visit a mansion called "Hell House," and murderous high jinks ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Eb1JWK0Cb0rbfsYjwfc9g0PbQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4248'),
  ('177358981840984981', 'Scary Movie 3', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mark Irwin, David Zucker, Alex Kameniczky', 'Pat Proft, Craig Mazin', 'Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Simon Rex, Anthony Anderson, Charlie Sheen, Leslie Nielsen, Kevin Hart, Jeremy Piven', 'R', 'In the third installment of the Scary Movie franchise, news anchorwoman Cindy Campbell has to investigate mysterious crop circles and killing video tapes, and help the President stop an alien invasion in the process.', 'In the third installment of the Scary Movie franchise, news anchorwoman Cindy Campbell has to investigate mysterious crop circles and killing video tapes, and help the President stop an alien invasion in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpNG1nx67rvYze1b1R9q0YoSzrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4256'),
  ('1109301723089643605', 'Scary Movie 4', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Thomas E. Ackerman, David Zucker, Andrew Emde', 'Craig Mazin, Jim Abrahams, Pat Proft', 'Anna Faris, Regina Hall, Craig Bierko, Bill Pullman, Anthony Anderson, Leslie Nielsen, Molly Shannon, Michael Madsen', 'PG-13', 'Cindy finds out the house she lives in is haunted by a little boy and goes on a quest to find out who killed him and why. Also, Alien "Tr-iPods" are invading the world and she has to uncover the secret in order to stop them.', 'Cindy finds out the house she lives in is haunted by a little boy and goes on a quest to find out who killed him and why. Also, Alien "Tr-iPods" are invading the world and she has to uncover the secret in order to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEqFdw1wLtY94RKCSPolsHWzn6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4257'),
  ('22959825635788552', 'Scary Movie 5', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Steve Battaglia, Phil Dornfeld', 'David Zucker, Pat Proft', 'Ashley French, Simon Rex, Charlie Sheen, Gracie Whitton, Ava Kolker, Heather Locklear, Molly Shannon, Josh Robert Thompson', 'PG-13', 'Home with their newly-formed family, happy parents Dan and Jody are haunted by sinister, paranormal activities. Determined to expel the insidious force, they install security cameras and discover their family is being stalked by an evil dead demon.', 'Home with their newly-formed family, happy parents Dan and Jody are haunted by sinister, paranormal activities. Determined to expel the insidious force, they install security cameras and discover their family is being stalked by an evil dead demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBqLLxE6GaAPhO6v9EFvFbLZ7Ap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4258'),
  ('761120165706865869', 'Scary or Die', 2012, 'Horror', 'Bob Badway, Michael Emanuel', 'Michael Emanuel, Bob Badway', 'Bill Oberst Jr., Corbin Bleu, Shawn-Caulin Young, Elizabeth Di Prinzio, Kellie Cockrell', null, 'The creation of filmmaker Michael Emanuel, SCARY OR DIE tells five interwoven horror stories that take place in and around the “City of Angles”. A flesh-eating clown desperately trying to protect the person he craves the most; a dirty cop and a hit gone wrong with a vengeful Necromancer; a beautiful but mysterious woman and a lonely man looking for love in all the wrong places; a gruesome, blood-splattered uprising of illegal Mexican zombies; and a Cajun conjurer grandfather whose gift of never-ending love goes terribly awry…SCARY OR DIE is a unique experience in horror filmmaking certain to fulfill all your twisted horror film experience needs.', 'The creation of filmmaker Michael Emanuel, SCARY OR DIE tells five interwoven horror stories that take place in and around the “City of Angles”. A flesh-eating clown desperately trying to protect the person he craves the most; a dirty cop and a hit gone wrong with a vengeful Necromancer; a beautiful but mysterious woman and a lonely man looking for love in all the wrong places; a gruesome, blood-splattered uprising of illegal Mexican zombies; and a Cajun conjurer grandfather whose gift of never-ending love goes terribly awry…SCARY OR DIE is a unique experience in horror filmmaking certain to fulfill all your twisted horror film experience needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbuk1KcxIvMVy42EwpHPFnsrKS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131916'),
  ('927389466115744422', 'Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'André Øvredal, Nicholas Müller-Osborne, Rory James', 'Dan Hageman, Kevin Hageman', 'Zoe Colletti, Dean Norris, Michael Garza, Gabriel Rush, Gil Bellows, Natalie Ganzhorn, Austin Abrams, Austin Zajur', 'PG-13', 'Mill Valley, Pennsylvania, Halloween night, 1968. After playing a joke on a school bully, Stella and her friends decide to sneak into a supposedly haunted house that once belonged to the powerful Bellows family, unleashing dark forces that they will be unable to control.', 'Mill Valley, Pennsylvania, Halloween night, 1968. After playing a joke on a school bully, Stella and her friends decide to sneak into a supposedly haunted house that once belonged to the powerful Bellows family, unleashing dark forces that they will be unable to control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uy0dNFbhRhHBLwpOGpcTw9UEwdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417384'),
  ('700634322643474157', 'Scarygirl', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Tania Vincent, Ricard Cussó, Tania Vincent', 'Matt Everitt, Les Turner, Polly Watkins', 'Jillian Nguyen, Remy Hii, Sam Neill, Rob Collins, Tim Minchin, Anna Torv, Liv Hewson, Deborah Mailman', 'PG', 'As her world is shrouded in darkness, a young girl must overcome her fears and travel to a mysterious city of light, save her father from a dangerous scientist and prevent the destruction of her planet.', 'As her world is shrouded in darkness, a young girl must overcome her fears and travel to a mysterious city of light, save her father from a dangerous scientist and prevent the destruction of her planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tcLXVaXFG9OObnCN3a5KrymrQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502345'),
  ('692922361507223988', 'Scat Cats', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, null, 'Spike''s owner is going out of town and leaves Spike and Tyke in charge.', 'Spike''s owner is going out of town and leaves Spike and Tyke in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZII0snIrekqTqc9EwgHDOPKm4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235025'),
  ('258086187247203057', 'Scavenger Hunt', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Michael Schultz, Ken Lamkin', 'Steven Vail, Henry Harper', 'Richard Benjamin, James Coco, Scatman Crothers, Ruth Gordon, Cloris Leachman, Cleavon Little, Roddy McDowall, Robert Morley', 'PG', 'An eccentric games inventor dies and leaves behind an inheritance worth hundreds of millions of dollars - which will only be given to the person or team, amongst his family and hired help, who wins a madcap scavenger hunt.', 'An eccentric games inventor dies and leaves behind an inheritance worth hundreds of millions of dollars - which will only be given to the person or team, amongst his family and hired help, who wins a madcap scavenger hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/in8CHWcEoLyPCJvb624x5PmVGEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23050'),
  ('194230573925217240', 'Scene of the Crime', 1949, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Paul Vogel, Roy Rowland, Jack Greenwood', 'Charles Schnee', 'Van Johnson, Arlene Dahl, Gloria DeHaven, Tom Drake, Leon Ames, John McIntire, Donald Woods, Norman Lloyd', null, 'A cop investigates the shooting of another policeman... that may have been involved in crooked activities.', 'A cop investigates the shooting of another policeman... that may have been involved in crooked activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLKT3qon0ZtIlUVt0jmlWPnVnTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38395'),
  ('595561574203091491', 'Scene of the Crime', 1986, 'Drama, Crime', 'André Téchiné, Pascal Marti', 'André Téchiné, Pascal Bonitzer, Olivier Assayas', 'Catherine Deneuve, Wadeck Stanczak, Nicolas Giraudi, Danielle Darrieux, Victor Lanoux, Jean Bousquet, Claire Nebout, Jean-Claude Adelin', null, 'In the woods, a 13-year-old boy is grabbed by an escaped convict and told to bring money later that day. The boy does as he''s told, only to be attacked by the convict''s partner. A murder ensues, and through happenstance, the murderer and the boy''s mother form an alliance. All this takes place in four days during which the boy has his first communion, his separated parents face each other amidst grandmother''s hopes they''ll reunite, the grandfather just wants to go fishing, the school''s chaplain complains about the boy''s behavior, and the convicts'' shared girlfriend comes, gun in hand, to help them escape to Tangier. The mother''s surprising decisions complete the story.', 'In the woods, a 13-year-old boy is grabbed by an escaped convict and told to bring money later that day. The boy does as he''s told, only to be attacked by the convict''s partner. A murder ensues, and through happenstance, the murderer and the boy''s mother form an alliance. All this takes place in four days during which the boy has his first communion, his separated parents face each other amidst grandmother''s hopes they''ll reunite, the grandfather just wants to go fishing, the school''s chaplain complains about the boy''s behavior, and the convicts'' shared girlfriend comes, gun in hand, to help them escape to Tangier. The mother''s surprising decisions complete the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evizkMMwafIFdr8kEaFQXe53tPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63691'),
  ('200050720702497737', 'Scenery', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Alberto Vázquez, Khris Cembe', 'Alberto Vázquez', 'Josep Ramos, Mireia Faura, Ángel Gómez, Alberto Vázquez, Kepa Cueto, Txema Regalado, Miguel Martín, Sacha Criado', null, 'The world is a wonderful stage, but its characters are disgraceful.', 'The world is a wonderful stage, but its characters are disgraceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usEYA6nusYJiopsvAFv0XGDKRW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398810'),
  ('802332907217977540', 'Scenes from a Mall', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Paul Mazursky, Fred Murphy, Scott Chambliss', 'Paul Mazursky, Roger L. Simon', 'Bette Midler, Woody Allen, Bill Irwin, Daren Firestone, Rebecca Nickels, Paul Mazursky, Joan Delaney, Gregory Moore', 'R', 'A comedy about a married couple -- he''s a sports lawyer, she''s a psychologist -- which takes place on their 16th wedding anniversary, when they make some startling confessions.', 'A comedy about a married couple -- he''s a sports lawyer, she''s a psychologist -- which takes place on their 16th wedding anniversary, when they make some startling confessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roF5MQlNBFSV0K3s9ThBPIBglO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47762'),
  ('709302855720241485', 'Scenes from the Class Struggle in Beverly Hills', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Paul Bartel, Steven Fierberg', 'Bruce Wagner', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Ray Sharkey, Robert Beltran, Mary Woronov, Ed Begley Jr., Wallace Shawn, Arnetia Walker, Rebecca Schaeffer', null, 'A wealthy Beverly Hills resident who has just become a widow, Clare Lipkin temporarily takes on her friend Lisabeth as a house guest. As the two women deal with their upper-class woes, Clare''s driver, Frank, and Lisabeth''s servant, Juan, make a wager to see who can be the first to seduce the other''s boss.', 'A wealthy Beverly Hills resident who has just become a widow, Clare Lipkin temporarily takes on her friend Lisabeth as a house guest. As the two women deal with their upper-class woes, Clare''s driver, Frank, and Lisabeth''s servant, Juan, make a wager to see who can be the first to seduce the other''s boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Q8yE7ijikNXWItWnAJkjt9yWvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60276'),
  ('95803840092768242', 'Scenes from the Life of Andy Warhol: Friendships & Intersections', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Jonas Mekas', null, 'Andy Warhol, John Cale, Allen Ginsberg, Mick Jagger, John F. Kennedy, Jr., John Lennon, Gerard Malanga, Sterling Morrison', null, 'Jonas Mekas’s intimate diary film spans 1963 to 1990, capturing Andy Warhol alongside friends and collaborators from the New York avant-garde. Featuring figures such as Allen Ginsberg, John Lennon, Yoko Ono, and George Maciunas—as well as rare footage of the Velvet Underground’s first performance—it offers a personal portrait of Warhol’s world and his intersections with art, music, and counterculture.', 'Jonas Mekas’s intimate diary film spans 1963 to 1990, capturing Andy Warhol alongside friends and collaborators from the New York avant-garde. Featuring figures such as Allen Ginsberg, John Lennon, Yoko Ono, and George Maciunas—as well as rare footage of the Velvet Underground’s first performance—it offers a personal portrait of Warhol’s world and his intersections with art, music, and counterculture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avHpCWc17IYJZqifb7bSQI2OqC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227297'),
  ('778076196252980220', 'Scenes from Under Childhood, Section One', 1968, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A visualization of the inner world of foetal beginnings, the infant, the baby, the child - a shattering of the "myths of childhood" through revelation of the extremes of violent terror and overwhelming joy of that world darkened to most adults by their sentimental remembering of it ... a "tone poem" for the eye - very inspired by the music of Oliver Messiaen.', 'A visualization of the inner world of foetal beginnings, the infant, the baby, the child - a shattering of the "myths of childhood" through revelation of the extremes of violent terror and overwhelming joy of that world darkened to most adults by their sentimental remembering of it ... a "tone poem" for the eye - very inspired by the music of Oliver Messiaen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjem2JP4p1stoWbivejpRHEMlAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102389'),
  ('389365864023188433', 'Scenes of a Sexual Nature', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ed Blum, David Meadows', 'Aschlin Ditta', 'Holly Aird, Eileen Atkins, Hugh Bonneville, Tom Hardy, Douglas Hodge, Adrian Lester, Andrew Lincoln, Ewan McGregor', 'R', 'Sex and love. Some seek it, some need it, some spurn it and some pay for it, but we''re all involved in it. Set on one afternoon on Hampstead Heath in north-west London, the film investigates the minutiae of seven couples. What makes us tick?', 'Sex and love. Some seek it, some need it, some spurn it and some pay for it, but we''re all involved in it. Set on one afternoon on Hampstead Heath in north-west London, the film investigates the minutiae of seven couples. What makes us tick?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyDQY4mileMV4C1O1T4Ux6Mtuwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18558'),
  ('57613827932128628', 'Scenes of the Crime', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Dominique Forma, James R. Bagdonas, David Allen Cluck', 'Dominique Forma, Amit Mehta, Daniel Golka', 'Jon Abrahams, Peter Greene, Jeff Bridges, Mädchen Amick, R. Lee Ermey, Morris Chestnut, Henry Rollins, Kerri Randles', 'R', 'A young man about to get married earns extra cash by driving a local mobster, but things go awry when the mobster is shot dead by a rival crime boss.', 'A young man about to get married earns extra cash by driving a local mobster, but things go awry when the mobster is shot dead by a rival crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7I0lFUX3Eb0MKzI25Dd4AhrzC3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31008'),
  ('293515758609009531', 'Scenes with Beans', 1976, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Ottó Foky', 'József Nepp', null, null, 'Watching from the stars, an all-seeing creature observes a society of sentient beans — the joys, triumphs, and tragedies of day-to-day life on their planet — until the busy inhabitants finally notice the watcher’s leering gaze.', 'Watching from the stars, an all-seeing creature observes a society of sentient beans — the joys, triumphs, and tragedies of day-to-day life on their planet — until the busy inhabitants finally notice the watcher’s leering gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueWne8mLq1RGkjWcg1P21O6EZqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570968'),
  ('824770602934949224', 'Scenic Route', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kevin Goetz, Michael Goetz, Sean O''Dea', 'Kyle Killen', 'Josh Duhamel, Dan Fogler, Miracle Laurie, Christie Burson, Peter Michael Goetz, Jamie Donovan, Ethan Maher', 'R', 'Stranded on an isolated desert road, two life-long friends fight for survival as their already strained relationship spirals into knife-wielding madness.', 'Stranded on an isolated desert road, two life-long friends fight for survival as their already strained relationship spirals into knife-wielding madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLR1XII83u0zMPcW5sSR3XBxwYC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172847'),
  ('834429567058990078', 'Scent of a Woman', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Claudio Risi, Claudio Cirillo', 'Dino Risi, Ruggero Maccari', 'Vittorio Gassman, Alessandro Momo, Agostina Belli, Moira Orfei, Franco Ricci, Elena Veronese, Lorenzo Piani, Stefania Spugnini', 'R', 'An army cadet accompanies an irascible, blind captain on a week-long trip from Turin to Naples.', 'An army cadet accompanies an irascible, blind captain on a week-long trip from Turin to Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfjOK5n0eaS04MMCiNz43xbbydc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47848'),
  ('30891855122262092', 'Scent of a Woman', 1992, 'Drama', 'Martin Brest, Donald E. Thorin, Amy Sayres', 'Bo Goldman', 'Al Pacino, Chris O''Donnell, James Rebhorn, Gabrielle Anwar, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Richard Venture, Bradley Whitford, Ron Eldard', 'R', 'Charlie Simms is a student at a private preparatory school who comes from a poor family. To earn the money for his flight home to Gresham, Oregon for Christmas, Charlie takes a job over Thanksgiving looking after retired U.S. Army officer Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade, a cantankerous middle-aged man who lives with his niece and her family.', 'Charlie Simms is a student at a private preparatory school who comes from a poor family. To earn the money for his flight home to Gresham, Oregon for Christmas, Charlie takes a job over Thanksgiving looking after retired U.S. Army officer Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade, a cantankerous middle-aged man who lives with his niece and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4adI7IaveWb7EidYXfLb3MK3CgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9475'),
  ('243596834144486814', 'Scent of Love', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Jeong-wook, Won Myeong-jun, Lee Hu-kon', 'Kim Hee-jae, Lee Jeong-wook', 'Jang Jin-young, Park Hae-il, Song Sun-mi, Kim Yu-seok, Ahn Nae-sang, Byun Hee-bong, Kim Hae-sook, Lee Sun-kyun', null, 'After much trials and tribulations, a man marries his first love. But when she gets pregnant, they find out that she has cancer.', 'After much trials and tribulations, a man marries his first love. But when she gets pregnant, they find out that she has cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/391lp6iwxhoWKoIX4f083KnUgy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29978'),
  ('1094754361810064289', 'Scent of Passion', 1991, 'Drama', 'Pasquale Fanetti', null, 'Malù, Ángeles López Barea, Giancarlo Teodori, Zvonko Zrnčić, Suada Herak', null, 'A man who is a theater director and music composer picks up a young homeless woman off the street. But as soon as she starts living with him she becomes his object of desire. Soon his ex-girlfriend finds out about his new lover in his life and decides to seduce his new lover.', 'A man who is a theater director and music composer picks up a young homeless woman off the street. But as soon as she starts living with him she becomes his object of desire. Soon his ex-girlfriend finds out about his new lover in his life and decides to seduce his new lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvruxAQHfiyQetP9FsRfXnWoFag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91257'),
  ('672524038419105311', 'Scent-imental Over You', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Striving to be like all the high-class dogs in their fine coats, a little hairless pooch borrows a black and white fur coat of her owner, not realizing it makes her appear to be a skunk. Once she has it on, she finds everyone fleeing from her - everyone, that is, except for the amorous Pepé Le Pew.', 'Striving to be like all the high-class dogs in their fine coats, a little hairless pooch borrows a black and white fur coat of her owner, not realizing it makes her appear to be a skunk. Once she has it on, she finds everyone fleeing from her - everyone, that is, except for the amorous Pepé Le Pew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2q2JU8fY5lxjvNhRi4HJOvesOZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237135'),
  ('127579878457579588', 'Scent-imental Romeo', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A hungry cat disguises herself as a skunk to get in on feeding time at the zoo, but amorous Pepé thinks she''s the real thing and pours on his Maurice Chevalier impression to win her over.', 'A hungry cat disguises herself as a skunk to get in on feeding time at the zoo, but amorous Pepé thinks she''s the real thing and pours on his Maurice Chevalier impression to win her over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdl4jUdewQYTjyIrHLNA3QbltGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145946'),
  ('1148707523173460434', 'Scents and Sensibility', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Brian Brough, Ephraim Smith, Lindsay Chag', 'Jennifer Jan, Brittany Wiscombe', 'Ashley Williams, Nick Zano, Brad Johnson, Marla Sokoloff, Danielle Chuchran, Jason Celaya, Jaclyn Hales, JJ Neward', null, 'In this modern adaptation of Jane Austen’s Sense and Sensibility, Elinor and Marianne find themselves penniless after their father’s fortune is taken away. As they look for ways to pay the bills, they encounter people who judge them and try to keep them down in the dumps. Add falling in love into the mix, and determining whom to trust becomes a mine field. Can the sisters find a balance between relying on their hearts and using good sense without losing everything they hold dear?', 'In this modern adaptation of Jane Austen’s Sense and Sensibility, Elinor and Marianne find themselves penniless after their father’s fortune is taken away. As they look for ways to pay the bills, they encounter people who judge them and try to keep them down in the dumps. Add falling in love into the mix, and determining whom to trust becomes a mine field. Can the sisters find a balance between relying on their hearts and using good sense without losing everything they hold dear?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3GmYNiAULM3Hb5IH59Uaj1Yhhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104109'),
  ('669751300031892996', 'Schalcken the Painter', 1979, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Leslie Megahey, John Hooper', 'Leslie Megahey', 'Jeremy Clyde, Maurice Denham, Cheryl Kennedy, John Justin, Charles Gray, Anthony Sharp, Anne Tirard, Val Penny', null, 'Can Schalcken save his love, Rose, from the clutches of a ghastly suitor before it is too late?', 'Can Schalcken save his love, Rose, from the clutches of a ghastly suitor before it is too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5l75RLmMiVHlb6K5DMnybNgmdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214641'),
  ('501993521293037960', 'Scham', 2026, 'Drama', 'Lukas Röder, Louis Dickhaut', 'Lukas Röder', 'Til Schindler, Heike Hanold-Lynch', null, 'Aaron had a traumatic childhood. He was constantly beaten by his mother Susanne, who repeatedly used both physical and psychological violence against him. At the age of seven, he was sexually abused by a stranger. He then began having sex with other children of the same age. Today, as a young adult, he is still traumatized and deeply ashamed. When he visits his mother again after four years of silence, he is ready to break his silence.', 'Aaron had a traumatic childhood. He was constantly beaten by his mother Susanne, who repeatedly used both physical and psychological violence against him. At the age of seven, he was sexually abused by a stranger. He then began having sex with other children of the same age. Today, as a young adult, he is still traumatized and deeply ashamed. When he visits his mother again after four years of silence, he is ready to break his silence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fo6NAPaRjb7rxnhfI2tJmzkdfDJs.jpg', 'plex:movie:scham-2026'),
  ('1021848794691153278', 'Scheherazade, Tell Me a Story', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mostafa El Faramawy, Samir Bahzan, Omar Zohairy', 'Wahid Hamid', 'Mona Zaki, Hassan El Raddad, Mahmoud Hemida, Sawsan Badr, Mohamed Ramadan, Rehab El Gamal, Nesreen Amin, Nahed El Sebai', null, 'Heba is a TV presenter interested in broadcasting stories that touch on the everyday secret lives of women and the social injustices they face. Her frank style in broadcasting puts her husband''s job and consequently her marriage in jeopardy.', 'Heba is a TV presenter interested in broadcasting stories that touch on the everyday secret lives of women and the social injustices they face. Her frank style in broadcasting puts her husband''s job and consequently her marriage in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZvdtedtXy3JxfNIuPUJnHU9LMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44096'),
  ('262466820731199962', 'Schemes in Antiques', 2021, 'Adventure, Mystery, Action, Comedy', 'Derek Kwok Chi-Kin', 'Derek Kwok Chi-Kin, Fan Wenwen', 'Lei Jiayin, Li Xian, Ge You, Xin Zhilei, Wang Qingxiang, Qin Yan, Guo Tao, Alan Aruna', null, 'Despite his family’s famed expertise on ancient relics, Xu Yuan makes a simple living as the owner of an electronics shop, eager to distinguish himself from a disgraced ancestor who was executed for treason after stealing a Chinese artifact for Japan. But when a descendant offers to return the relic to China, Xu Yuan uncovers a decades-old mystery and soon embarks on a journey that could finally restore his family’s reputation—and may also cost him his life.', 'Despite his family’s famed expertise on ancient relics, Xu Yuan makes a simple living as the owner of an electronics shop, eager to distinguish himself from a disgraced ancestor who was executed for treason after stealing a Chinese artifact for Japan. But when a descendant offers to return the relic to China, Xu Yuan uncovers a decades-old mystery and soon embarks on a journey that could finally restore his family’s reputation—and may also cost him his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwmUJOR9W9eD8EbssZddbUfLtSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820099'),
  ('800706089842037661', 'Scherzo', 1939, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'Norman McLaren made Scherzo early after his arrival in North America in 1939, but the film was subsequently lost. In 1984 the original materials were found and the hand-drawn images and sound were reconstituted. Picture and sound dance triple-quick in this animated version of a musical scherzo. A film without words.', 'Norman McLaren made Scherzo early after his arrival in North America in 1939, but the film was subsequently lost. In 1984 the original materials were found and the hand-drawn images and sound were reconstituted. Picture and sound dance triple-quick in this animated version of a musical scherzo. A film without words.', null, 'tmdb:movie:236222'),
  ('962262972050610536', 'Schindler', 1983, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Jon Blair', 'Jon Blair', 'Dirk Bogarde, Irena Schek, Mojesz Pantirer, Solomon Urbach, Emilie Schindler, Eva Kisza, Leopold Pfefferberg, Ruth Kalder', null, 'The true story of German-Czech businessman Oskar Schindler (1908-74) as told by some of the Jews — more than a thousand people — whose lives he saved from extermination during World War II.', 'The true story of German-Czech businessman Oskar Schindler (1908-74) as told by some of the Jews — more than a thousand people — whose lives he saved from extermination during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vphiF1zeEwaEcv5ZPJ6spwxKaN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532169'),
