  ('161135076612272388', 'Schlitter: Evil in the Woods', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Solenne Hervé, Stéphane Bidault, Joseph Zins', 'Nicolas Robin, Pierre Mouchet', 'Louka Meliava, Côme Levin, Gilles David, Lena Lapres, Bernard Eylenbosch, Marie-Paule Kumps, Antime Calbrie Ekeloo, Nelson Maerten', null, 'Lucas returns to his native village lost in the mountains to bury his parents. Traumatised as a kid by the death of his best friend when he was eight, he wants to put the past behind him. However, the father of the deceased friend discovers Marc might be responsible for his son’s death and relentlessly goes after him for revenge.', 'Lucas returns to his native village lost in the mountains to bury his parents. Traumatised as a kid by the death of his best friend when he was eight, he wants to put the past behind him. However, the father of the deceased friend discovers Marc might be responsible for his son’s death and relentlessly goes after him for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyefyMUqKvhWedMOlKA54QOv7zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105736'),
  ('967529081613227288', 'Schlock', 1973, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Landis, Robert E. Collins', 'John Landis', 'John Landis, Saul Kahan, Joseph Piantadosi, Eliza Roberts, Tom Alvich, Walter Levine, Harriet Medin, Eric Sinclair', 'PG', 'A quiet suburb in Southern California is terrorized by a mysterious murderous monster living in a cave. As the bodies pile up -- with incriminating banana peels always near by the crime scene -- a group of teens stumble on the guilty party: a 20-million-year-old Schlockthropus, an ape-like creature with a sense of the absurd.', 'A quiet suburb in Southern California is terrorized by a mysterious murderous monster living in a cave. As the bodies pile up -- with incriminating banana peels always near by the crime scene -- a group of teens stumble on the guilty party: a 20-million-year-old Schlockthropus, an ape-like creature with a sense of the absurd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr9DXClc5hHJDUZ7iCmMbmqHXur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54123'),
  ('86575024011170847', 'Schmidts Katze', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Marc Schlegel', 'Stephanie Toewe-Rimkeit, Marc Schlegel, Julie Alfonsi', 'Michael Lott, Christiane Seidel, Michael Kessler, Franziska Traub, Alexander E. Fennon, Volker Michalowski, Georg Alfred Wittner, Désirée Nick', null, 'After the death of his mother, shy Werner Schmidt finally starts looking for a partner. But on his dates, the electronics-enthusiastic, organized single man unfortunately only comes across as a bore - and consequently has no luck when it comes to love. The quiet man therefore relieves his stress at night by setting things on fire. He prefers to blow up luxury cars using his bomb-making skills and a remote-controlled car.', 'After the death of his mother, shy Werner Schmidt finally starts looking for a partner. But on his dates, the electronics-enthusiastic, organized single man unfortunately only comes across as a bore - and consequently has no luck when it comes to love. The quiet man therefore relieves his stress at night by setting things on fire. He prefers to blow up luxury cars using his bomb-making skills and a remote-controlled car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ba32CHdh9CHIVNzly8yJRSWMOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360270'),
  ('344444739581042948', 'Schmitke', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Štěpán Altrichter, Cristian Pirjol, Peter Baumann', 'Štěpán Altrichter, Jan Fusek, Tomáš Končinský', 'Peter Kurth, Johann Jürgens, Helena Dvořáková, Jakub Žáček, Petr Vršek, Lana Cooper, Stephan Grossmann, Johanka Schmidtmajerová', null, 'Schmitke is an old German wind turbine engineer. One day, he is dispatched to the Czech side of the Ore Mountains to fix an old squeaking wind turbine. His colleague disappears and mysterious things begin to happen in the forest.', 'Schmitke is an old German wind turbine engineer. One day, he is dispatched to the Czech side of the Ore Mountains to fix an old squeaking wind turbine. His colleague disappears and mysterious things begin to happen in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twvzkhm2ac0aZFwu7HssB9Yh2un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314635'),
  ('43637441554675935', 'Schmoedipus', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Barry Davis', 'Dennis Potter', 'Anna Cropper, Tim Curry, John Carson, Bob Hoskins, Carol MacReady, John Horsley', null, 'Glen, a complete stranger, appears at the door of Elizabeth Carter, a middle-aged woman, and claims to be the illegitimate son she gave away at birth.', 'Glen, a complete stranger, appears at the door of Elizabeth Carter, a middle-aged woman, and claims to be the illegitimate son she gave away at birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejU1AL6DZC1yUTWpTBLNFUGbN2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141215'),
  ('357606801847908204', 'Schneider vs. Bax', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Tom Erisman, Alex van Warmerdam', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Tom Dewispelaere, Maria Kraakman, Alex van Warmerdam, Pierre Bokma, Annet Malherbe, Gene Bervoets, Loes Haverkort, Eva van de Wijdeven', null, 'On his birthday, a hitman reluctantly takes on the easy task of killing a writer, only to find the job a lot more difficult than expected.', 'On his birthday, a hitman reluctantly takes on the easy task of killing a writer, only to find the job a lot more difficult than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dFuGHEnofYo8TLwmFcyD83qnaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333555'),
  ('256264890830201994', 'Schnitzel Paradise', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Martin Koolhoven, Guido van Gennep', 'Marco van Geffen', 'Noah Valentyn, Mimoun Oaïssa, Frank Lammers, Bracha van Doesburgh, Tygo Gernandt, Sanne Vogel, Ruben van der Meer, Gürkan Küçüksentürk', null, 'Schnitzel Paradise is a Dutch film about a young Moroccan man working in the kitchen of popular Dutch restaurant.', 'Schnitzel Paradise is a Dutch film about a young Moroccan man working in the kitchen of popular Dutch restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6rrJY8pGq7pWZOQeD0UdI0D51o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:908'),
  ('842547730552397656', 'School Dance', 2014, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Nick Cannon', 'Nick Cannon, Nile Evans', 'Patrick Warburton, Wilmer Valderrama, Efren Ramirez, Mike Epps, Bobb''e J. Thompson, George López, Katt Williams, Liana Mendoza', 'R', 'High schooler Jason has found his dream girl—the gorgeous Anastacia. There’s just one problem: she doesn’t know he exists. If he can win a spot on the school’s hottest dance crew, Jason might have a shot. But before he does, he’ll have to overcome his battle-ax of a mother, survive Anastacia’s gangsta brother, and pass the crew’s initiation—in this fresh, sexy, and outrageously funny comedy.', 'High schooler Jason has found his dream girl—the gorgeous Anastacia. There’s just one problem: she doesn’t know he exists. If he can win a spot on the school’s hottest dance crew, Jason might have a shot. But before he does, he’ll have to overcome his battle-ax of a mother, survive Anastacia’s gangsta brother, and pass the crew’s initiation—in this fresh, sexy, and outrageously funny comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nplQTnjWiE4mGP1eeaDmNqaF0oR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271467'),
  ('1125853033830858767', 'School Day of the Dead', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Tetsuo Shinohara, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Tamami Yamada, Teruo Abe', 'Kyoko Fukada, Masaya Katō, Thane Camus, Shuntaro Hani, Tomoka Hayashi, Ito Yozaburo, Yôsuke Kawamura, Yû Kurosawa', null, 'Some students decide to set up a play written by one of their classmates, who has commited suicide. The play is based on a tragic and mysterious legend about a love affair between two teachers at the school long ago. Some girls then accidentally stumble over some information about the legend, and the girl who commited suicide. Shortly after, the girls start turning up dead in seeming accidents.', 'Some students decide to set up a play written by one of their classmates, who has commited suicide. The play is based on a tragic and mysterious legend about a love affair between two teachers at the school long ago. Some girls then accidentally stumble over some information about the legend, and the girl who commited suicide. Shortly after, the girls start turning up dead in seeming accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5y2UX8OBgzQ4Z4jDuk5s7d6welF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84004'),
  ('815092349872172201', 'School Days', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Angelo Filippini, Ettore Arena', 'Francesco Milizia, Marino Onorati, Franco Mercuri', 'Lilli Carati, Michele Gammino, Alvaro Vitali, Giacomo Rizzo, Ria De Simone, Gianfranco Barra, Gastone Pescucci, Gianfranco D''Angelo', 'R', 'When the local science teacher hurts herself during a failed experiment and ends up in hospital, she is replaced by young and sexy Stevania Marini. Barely out of school herself, Stefania finds herself the object of affection for several men, including a young baron and and even most of her male students. One of these, Andrea Balsamo is part of the family with whom Stefania is staying and as such has a stronger foothold than most of the other men in town', 'When the local science teacher hurts herself during a failed experiment and ends up in hospital, she is replaced by young and sexy Stevania Marini. Barely out of school herself, Stefania finds herself the object of affection for several men, including a young baron and and even most of her male students. One of these, Andrea Balsamo is part of the family with whom Stefania is staying and as such has a stronger foothold than most of the other men in town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2X9quDDtn9fSROb9xn0PloJbfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151027'),
  ('889939790201595365', 'School Days with a Pig', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tetsu Maeda, Takahito Kasai, Kojiro Hashimoto', 'Hirotoshi Kobayashi', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Ren Osugi, Tomoko Tabata, Narushi Ikeda, Mieko Harada, Yūko Genkaku, Ryohei Kondo, Runa Natsui', null, 'A school teacher suggests to his class that they ought to raise a pig together and eat it when it grows up.', 'A school teacher suggests to his class that they ought to raise a pig together and eat it when it grows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOqxvYdmupS9MCGEtafwxcUNfKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197077'),
