  ('1043721539616967993', 'Schwabenkinder', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Jo Baier, Nicole Front, Jan Bennemann', 'Jo Baier', 'Vadim Glowna, Tobias Moretti, Jürgen Tarrach, Hary Prinz, Thomas Unterkircher, Naomi Krauss, Andrea Eckert, Eva Marie Fleissner', null, 'A film about a piece of Germany''s dark past at the end of the 19th century.', 'A film about a piece of Germany''s dark past at the end of the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhf437PnhsIKY1vwwERBh2PXcek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81851'),
  ('79081745952080813', 'Schwechater', 1958, null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, null, null, 'In 1957, Peter Kubelka was hired to make a short commercial for Schwechater beer. The beer company undoubtedly thought they were commissioning a film that would help them sell their beers; Kubelka had other ideas. He shot his film with a camera that did not even have a viewer, simply pointing it in the general direction of the action. He then took many months to edit his footage, while the company fumed and demanded a finished product. Finally he submitted a film, 90 seconds long, that featured extremely rapid cutting (cutting at the limits of most viewers'' perception) between images washed out almost to the point of abstraction — in black-and-white positive and negative and with red tint — of dimly visible people drinking beer and of the froth of beer seen in a fully abstract pattern.', 'In 1957, Peter Kubelka was hired to make a short commercial for Schwechater beer. The beer company undoubtedly thought they were commissioning a film that would help them sell their beers; Kubelka had other ideas. He shot his film with a camera that did not even have a viewer, simply pointing it in the general direction of the action. He then took many months to edit his footage, while the company fumed and demanded a finished product. Finally he submitted a film, 90 seconds long, that featured extremely rapid cutting (cutting at the limits of most viewers'' perception) between images washed out almost to the point of abstraction — in black-and-white positive and negative and with red tint — of dimly visible people drinking beer and of the froth of beer seen in a fully abstract pattern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFZNrbNn9Sken5t6kIS2fb02N8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144886'),
  ('329368940125822422', 'Schweinskopf al dente', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ed Herzog, Philipp Sichler', 'Stefan Betz, Kerstin Schmidbauer, Ed Herzog', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Simon Schwarz, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Gregor Bloéb, Enzi Fuchs, Eisi Gulp, Gerhard Wittmann, Sigi Zimmerschied', null, 'As he tries to win back his ex-girlfriend, a lethargic Lower Bavarian police officer gets sidetracked by a panicky boss and an escaped psychopath.', 'As he tries to win back his ex-girlfriend, a lethargic Lower Bavarian police officer gets sidetracked by a panicky boss and an escaped psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2qzsWnc4NPLcVjZmtQvVHN2do4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350160'),
  ('990475891603136709', 'Sci-fighters', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Peter Svatek, Barry Gravelle', 'Mark Sevi', 'Roddy Piper, Jayne Heitmeyer, Billy Drago, Tyrone Benskin, Richard Raybourne, Karen Elkin, Ricky Mabe, Richard Zeman', 'R', 'A renegade police officer tracks a rapist spreading a deadly virus around 2009 Boston.', 'A renegade police officer tracks a rapist spreading a deadly virus around 2009 Boston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XVGR0gukyldUBkOyGu2Hxgtmzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53310'),
  ('1028300730817367505', 'Science Fiction Volume One: The Osiris Child', 2016, 'Science Fiction', 'Shane Abbess, Carl Robertson, Tom Gleeson', 'Shane Abbess, Brian Cachia', 'Kellan Lutz, Daniel MacPherson, Isabel Lucas, Luke Ford, Rachel Griffiths, Temuera Morrison, Bren Foster, Luke Hemsworth', 'NR', 'Set in the future in a time of interplanetary colonization, an unlikely pair race against an impending global crisis and are confronted by the monsters that live inside us all.', 'Set in the future in a time of interplanetary colonization, an unlikely pair race against an impending global crisis and are confronted by the monsters that live inside us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sx69bH2n2tgvknvq2VROJ6lEXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354282'),
  ('14418180504217957', 'Science Friction', 1959, 'Animation', 'Stan VanDerBeek', null, null, null, 'This film uses stop motion animation of still photographs to convey images of politics and science in the nuclear era. The advancement of science allows man to do things he never would have been able to do without, for good or bad. Politicians are either behind the scenes manipulating those scientists or are using that science for their own goals, primarily in the space race. Everyday items and people are projected upwards - many in the form of rockets - followed by iconic structures, such as the Empire State Building, the US Capitol, the Washington Monument, the Eiffel Tower and the Kremlin, being rocketed skyward as visual representations of that race into space.', 'This film uses stop motion animation of still photographs to convey images of politics and science in the nuclear era. The advancement of science allows man to do things he never would have been able to do without, for good or bad. Politicians are either behind the scenes manipulating those scientists or are using that science for their own goals, primarily in the space race. Everyday items and people are projected upwards - many in the form of rockets - followed by iconic structures, such as the Empire State Building, the US Capitol, the Washington Monument, the Eiffel Tower and the Kremlin, being rocketed skyward as visual representations of that race into space.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147986'),
  ('321955809157243386', 'Scipio Africanus: The Defeat of Hannibal', 1937, 'War, Drama, History', 'Carmine Gallone, Romolo Marcellini, Giorgio Mannini', 'Camillo Mariani Dell''Aguillara, Sebastiano Luciani, Carmine Gallone', 'Camillo Pilotto, Annibale Ninchi, Fosco Giachetti, Francesca Braggiotti, Marcello Giorda, Guglielmo Barnabò, Isa Miranda, Memo Benassi', null, 'A story of the Second Punic Wars, beginning with Scipio''s futile pleas to the Roman Senate to build an army to battle Hannibal, that climaxes with the battle of Zama.', 'A story of the Second Punic Wars, beginning with Scipio''s futile pleas to the Roman Senate to build an army to battle Hannibal, that climaxes with the battle of Zama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUCaSpHAhAu4CdzkcIad2USSvO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80087'),
  ('65693678496289334', 'Scipio the African', 1971, 'History, Comedy', 'Maurizio Mein, Luigi Magni, Arturo Zavattini', 'Luigi Magni', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Ruggero Mastroianni, Turi Ferro, Woody Strode, Silvana Mangano, Vittorio Gassman, Fosco Giachetti, Ben Ekland', null, 'Years after the Second Punic War, Scipio Africanus finds himself generally unliked, despite his defeat of Hannibal Barca. He and his brother, Scipio Asiaticus, are accused by Marcus Porcius Cato of the theft of 500 talents intended for Rome.', 'Years after the Second Punic War, Scipio Africanus finds himself generally unliked, despite his defeat of Hannibal Barca. He and his brother, Scipio Asiaticus, are accused by Marcus Porcius Cato of the theft of 500 talents intended for Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inw9I7e4b4haA3RYgtMLhGlfnct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273868'),
  ('245592370931397002', 'Scissors', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Frank De Felitta, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Frank De Felitta', 'Sharon Stone, Steve Railsback, Ronny Cox, Michelle Phillips, Vicki Frederick, Larry Moss, Austin Kelly, Albert Popwell', 'R', 'A woman trying to recover from a sexual attack is locked in a posh apartment with a corpse of the very man she''s been dreaming would murder her. She tries to hang on to reality when objects around her seem to come to life.', 'A woman trying to recover from a sexual attack is locked in a posh apartment with a corpse of the very man she''s been dreaming would murder her. She tries to hang on to reality when objects around her seem to come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xADMLeSZjGCYddcDFyYrRGqyuog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41793'),
  ('355712873357171493', 'Scoob!', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'Tony Cervone', 'Chiranjiv Makwana, Matt Lieberman, Adam Sztykiel', 'Will Forte, Frank Welker, Mark Wahlberg, Jason Isaacs, Ken Jeong, Amanda Seyfried, Gina Rodriguez, Zac Efron', 'PG', 'In Scooby-Doo’s greatest adventure yet, see the never-before told story of how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and how they joined forces with young detectives Fred, Velma, and Daphne to form the famous Mystery Inc. Now, with hundreds of cases solved, Scooby and the gang face their biggest, toughest mystery ever: an evil plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to stop this global “dogpocalypse,” the gang discovers that Scooby has a secret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone ever imagined.', 'In Scooby-Doo’s greatest adventure yet, see the never-before told story of how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and how they joined forces with young detectives Fred, Velma, and Daphne to form the famous Mystery Inc. Now, with hundreds of cases solved, Scooby and the gang face their biggest, toughest mystery ever: an evil plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to stop this global “dogpocalypse,” the gang discovers that Scooby has a secret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHo2M1OiH9Re33jYtUQdfzPeUkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385103'),
  ('204555625838770979', 'Scooby Goes Hollywood', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ray Patterson, Bill Keil, Jay Sarbry', 'Dick Robbins, Duane Poole', 'Casey Kasem, Don Messick, Frank Welker, Heather North, Patricia Stevens, Ginny McSwain, Marilyn Schreffler, Joan Gerber', 'NR', 'Shaggy and Scooby-Doo quit their Saturday morning TV series in pursuit of Hollywood stardom.', 'Shaggy and Scooby-Doo quit their Saturday morning TV series in pursuit of Hollywood stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0DDWZVOyRjrpotc2qOvcFsRryp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36972'),
  ('611090503711460791', 'Scooby-Doo', 2002, 'Mystery, Adventure, Comedy', 'David Eggby, Raja Gosnell, Roger Lanser', 'James Gunn', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Sarah Michelle Gellar, Matthew Lillard, Linda Cardellini, Neil Fanning, Rowan Atkinson, Isla Fisher, Miguel A. Núñez Jr.', 'PG', 'When the Mystery Inc. gang is invited to Spooky Island, a popular amusement park, they soon discover that the attractions aren''t the only things that are spooky. Strange things are happening, and it''s up to Scooby, Shaggy, Fred, Daphne, and Velma to uncover the truth behind the mysterious happenings.', 'When the Mystery Inc. gang is invited to Spooky Island, a popular amusement park, they soon discover that the attractions aren''t the only things that are spooky. Strange things are happening, and it''s up to Scooby, Shaggy, Fred, Daphne, and Velma to uncover the truth behind the mysterious happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTAiBJGg8mqEfnYHHbi37ZoRSZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9637'),
  ('262066601565185475', 'Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed', 2004, 'Mystery, Adventure, Comedy', 'Raja Gosnell, Oliver Wood, Shepherd Frankel', 'James Gunn', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Sarah Michelle Gellar, Matthew Lillard, Linda Cardellini, Neil Fanning, Seth Green, Peter Boyle, Tim Blake Nelson', 'PG', 'A masked villain wreaks mayhem on the city of Coolsville with a monster machine that creates real-life versions of Mystery Inc.''s former foes like The 10,000 Volt Ghost, The Cotton Candy Glob, The Skelemen and The Pterodactyl Ghost. Fred, Daphne, Shaggy, Velma and Scooby-Doo launch an investigation into the monster outbreak that leaves Shaggy and Scooby questioning their roles in Mystery Inc. Eager to prove their detective skills, the ever-ravenous duo comes up with a secret plan to solve the mystery all by themselves. Can the gang unravel their most challenging case?', 'A masked villain wreaks mayhem on the city of Coolsville with a monster machine that creates real-life versions of Mystery Inc.''s former foes like The 10,000 Volt Ghost, The Cotton Candy Glob, The Skelemen and The Pterodactyl Ghost. Fred, Daphne, Shaggy, Velma and Scooby-Doo launch an investigation into the monster outbreak that leaves Shaggy and Scooby questioning their roles in Mystery Inc. Eager to prove their detective skills, the ever-ravenous duo comes up with a secret plan to solve the mystery all by themselves. Can the gang unravel their most challenging case?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BrXCJrs22bR5KR6mLHluYo6y4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11024'),
  ('231373113740596804', 'Scooby-Doo and the Alien Invaders', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Jim Stenstrum', 'Davis Doi, Lance Falk', 'Scott Innes, Mary Kay Bergman, B.J. Ward, Frank Welker, Candi Milo, Neil Ross, Jennifer Hale, Jeff Bennett', null, 'A cosmic case of flying saucers, intergalactic intrigue and out-of-this-world romance launches Scooby-Doo! and the Mystery Inc., Gang into their most unearthly adventure ever.', 'A cosmic case of flying saucers, intergalactic intrigue and out-of-this-world romance launches Scooby-Doo! and the Mystery Inc., Gang into their most unearthly adventure ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5E440uHsNU9XTfyK8KXYbRJGVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20410'),
  ('1053096160248713081', 'Scooby-Doo and the Cyber Chase', 2001, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jim Stenstrum', 'Mark Turosz', 'Scott Innes, Grey DeLisle, B.J. Ward, Frank Welker, Gary Anthony Sturgis, Joe Alaskey, Bob Bergen, Tom Kane', 'PG', 'When Scooby and the gang get trapped in a video game created for the gang, they must fight against the ''Phantom Virus.'' To escape the game they must go level by level and defeat the game once and for all.', 'When Scooby and the gang get trapped in a video game created for the gang, they must fight against the ''Phantom Virus.'' To escape the game they must go level by level and defeat the game once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKmFscYvGLMnZ5TslwxCge5oELO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15601'),
  ('977076754171443822', 'Scooby-Doo and the Ghoul School', 1988, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Charles August Nichols, James T. Walker, Ray Patterson', 'Glenn Leopold', 'Casey Kasem, Don Messick, Glynis Johns, Susan Blu, Patty Maloney, Pat Musick, Marilyn Schreffler, Russi Taylor', 'NR', 'Scooby, Shaggy and Scrappy are on their way to a Miss Grimwood''s Finishing School for Girls, where they''ve been hired as gym teachers. Once there, however, they find that not only is it actually an all-girl school of famous monsters'' daughters but there''s a villainess out to enslave the girls.', 'Scooby, Shaggy and Scrappy are on their way to a Miss Grimwood''s Finishing School for Girls, where they''ve been hired as gym teachers. Once there, however, they find that not only is it actually an all-girl school of famous monsters'' daughters but there''s a villainess out to enslave the girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duMdoHLQvnzRDZm2CD66DT4PvS5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13350'),
  ('796976892936348746', 'Scooby-Doo, Where Are You Now!', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Stern, Mac Whiting, Dan Adlerstein', 'Jonathan Stern', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci, Janel Parrish, Jerry Beck, David Silverman, Seth Green', null, 'After 52 years of solving mysteries, the Scooby gang reunite at Warner Bros. Studios to reminisce about their favorite cases and how they were filmed. But it turns out that the back lot may have its OWN monster problem. Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy, and Scooby-Doo investigate this mystery while celebrating the legacy of the franchise.', 'After 52 years of solving mysteries, the Scooby gang reunite at Warner Bros. Studios to reminisce about their favorite cases and how they were filmed. But it turns out that the back lot may have its OWN monster problem. Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy, and Scooby-Doo investigate this mystery while celebrating the legacy of the franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXaFwcbXYpmG5QAhM3qezr7mp8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833516'),
  ('858418084326933863', 'Scooby-Doo! & Batman: The Brave and the Bold', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Family, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Girardi, Jake Castorena', null, 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, Diedrich Bader, Jeff Bennett, Jeffrey Combs, John DiMaggio', 'PG', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang meet up with Batman and other friends to defeat evil villains and save the day.', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang meet up with Batman and other friends to defeat evil villains and save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uImdPC9V5L4uSWA6HV6Q6nxc8Ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484862'),
  ('883170669807926028', 'Scooby-Doo! Abracadabra-Doo', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', null, 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Danica McKellar, James Patrick Stuart, Crystal Scales, Brian Posehn', 'G', 'The gang goes on a trip to check on Velma''s younger sister, Madelyn. She''s been studying stage magic at the Whirlen Merlin Magic Academy, where apparently there have been sightings of a giant griffin. The gang decides to investigate.', 'The gang goes on a trip to check on Velma''s younger sister, Madelyn. She''s been studying stage magic at the Whirlen Merlin Magic Academy, where apparently there have been sightings of a giant griffin. The gang decides to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDfQ3DqU5fWKZinIGgo2psvLh4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32916'),
  ('148226597990332193', 'Scooby-Doo! Adventures: The Mystery Map', 2013, 'Family, Comedy, Mystery, Animation', 'David Rudman', 'Adam Rudman', 'Frank Welker, Stephanie D''Abruzzo, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, John Rhys-Davies, Dee Bradley Baker, Jeff Bennett', null, 'When Shaggy and Scooby find a mysterious pirate''s treasure map in their triple-extra-large Scooby snack pizza, the whole Mystery Inc. gang sets out from their treehouse to find the lost booty of Gnarlybeard and the Phantom Parrot, encountering some suspicious individuals along the way who are also involved in the hunt. The tale is told in brand-new way to see the Scooby-Doo series: entirely through puppets! Pilot for unproduced puppet series based on "A Pup Named Scooby-Doo", released direct-to-DVD.', 'When Shaggy and Scooby find a mysterious pirate''s treasure map in their triple-extra-large Scooby snack pizza, the whole Mystery Inc. gang sets out from their treehouse to find the lost booty of Gnarlybeard and the Phantom Parrot, encountering some suspicious individuals along the way who are also involved in the hunt. The tale is told in brand-new way to see the Scooby-Doo series: entirely through puppets! Pilot for unproduced puppet series based on "A Pup Named Scooby-Doo", released direct-to-DVD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pulFY8KAuF6BiySNkVHgAN7cI0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210769'),
  ('270604757442140590', 'Scooby-Doo! and Krypto, Too!', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Mystery, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jinhyun Choi, Kyoung-Soo Lee, Gyungsang Yoo', 'T.K. O''Brian', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, P.J. Byrne, Victoria Grace, Charles Halford, Nolan North', 'NR', 'When the Justice League goes missing and villains overrun Metropolis, there''s only one team that can solve this mystery: Scooby-Doo and the gang! But wait, there''s a new dog in town – Krypto – Superman''s Superdog with Super Powers. Mystery Inc. will need all the help it can get when phantoms menace the Justice League''s headquarters.', 'When the Justice League goes missing and villains overrun Metropolis, there''s only one team that can solve this mystery: Scooby-Doo and the gang! But wait, there''s a new dog in town – Krypto – Superman''s Superdog with Super Powers. Mystery Inc. will need all the help it can get when phantoms menace the Justice League''s headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntMOnvlYYnio7Fx3xqBu9B1Sz7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146348'),
  ('502120006262015668', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Beach Beastie', 2015, 'Family, Mystery, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Victor Cook', 'Candie Langdale, Doug Langdale', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Mindy Cohn, Melissa Rauch, Beth Tapper, Daran Norris, Adam West', null, 'Scooby-Doo and the gang investigates a new ghost at a water park resort.', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang investigates a new ghost at a water park resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tqBzcWJ1MVeP2emyVEHTQHPyJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340884'),
  ('914100906400921947', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Curse of the 13th Ghost', 2019, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Adventure, Mystery', 'Cecilia Aranovich', 'Tim Sheridan', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, Noshir Dalal, David Herman, Maurice LaMarche, Nolan North', null, 'Mystery Inc. withdraws from solving crimes after botching a case. When Vincent Van Ghoul contacts the gang about an unfinished investigation from Daphne, Shaggy and Scooby''s past, the gang springs into action to finish the job that involves catching the 13th Ghost that escaped from the Chest of Demons and is still at large.', 'Mystery Inc. withdraws from solving crimes after botching a case. When Vincent Van Ghoul contacts the gang about an unfinished investigation from Daphne, Shaggy and Scooby''s past, the gang springs into action to finish the job that involves catching the 13th Ghost that escaped from the Chest of Demons and is still at large.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKxlzUtwyEMZDmj58ijQqr5PoZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560066'),
  ('722194834383312986', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Goblin King', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Joe Sichta', 'Joe Sichta', 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Lauren Bacall, Tim Curry, Jim Belushi, Wayne Knight', 'G', 'Scooby-Doo and Shaggy must go into the underworld ruled by The Goblin King in order to stop a mortal named The Amazing Krudsky who wants power and is a threat to their pals: Fred, Velma, and Daphne.', 'Scooby-Doo and Shaggy must go into the underworld ruled by The Goblin King in order to stop a mortal named The Amazing Krudsky who wants power and is a threat to their pals: Fred, Velma, and Daphne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jscb7MiWTYBjKlAb9TuNnFMSR81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12903'),
  ('747580920884351463', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Gourmet Ghost', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Doug Murphy', 'Tim Sheridan', 'Audrey Wasilewski, Frank Welker, Giada De Laurentiis, Salli Saffioti, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci, Bobby Flay', 'G', 'The Scooby gang visits a culinary resort run by Fred''s uncle, Bobby Flay. While enjoying the sights, a ghost attacks the guests and destroys the resort, leaving the gang to put a stop to its threat.', 'The Scooby gang visits a culinary resort run by Fred''s uncle, Bobby Flay. While enjoying the sights, a ghost attacks the guests and destroys the resort, leaving the gang to put a stop to its threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtHngeqD4K1Oj01ulWc1aDJhU8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533592'),
