  ('516178307142288053', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Loch Ness Monster', 2004, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Scott Jeralds, Joe Sichta', 'George Doty IV, Ed Scharlach, Mark Turosz', 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Michael Bell, Jeff Bennett, John DiMaggio, Phil LaMarr', 'G', 'While the gang travel to Scotland to visit Daphne''s cousin and witness the annual Highland Games, they find themselves terrorized by the legendary Loch Ness Monster.', 'While the gang travel to Scotland to visit Daphne''s cousin and witness the annual Highland Games, they find themselves terrorized by the legendary Loch Ness Monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmeJnofknkSnczzN3J7Wvfn7OGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12902'),
  ('153088755285188774', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Monster of Mexico', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'Scott Jeralds', 'Douglas Wood', 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Heather North, Nicole Jaffe, Candi Milo, Maria Canals-Barrera, Jesse Borrego, Brandon Gonzales', 'G', 'A friend of Fred''s, Alejo Otero, invites the Scooby gang to Veracruz, Mexico. There they find a monster, El Chupacabra, terrorizing the town.', 'A friend of Fred''s, Alejo Otero, invites the Scooby gang to Veracruz, Mexico. There they find a monster, El Chupacabra, terrorizing the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fv4e6pGhl4fDUdRt2WIDLDgEq7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21956'),
  ('1116911547087493298', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Reluctant Werewolf', 1988, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Mystery, Comedy', 'Ray Patterson, Ray Patterson', 'Jim Ryan', 'Casey Kasem, Don Messick, B.J. Ward, Hamilton Camp, Pat Musick, Rob Paulsen, Frank Welker, Jim Cummings', 'NR', 'Shaggy is turned into a werewolf, and it''s up to Scooby, Scrappy and Shaggy''s girlfriend to help him win a race against other monsters, and become human again.', 'Shaggy is turned into a werewolf, and it''s up to Scooby, Scrappy and Shaggy''s girlfriend to help him win a race against other monsters, and become human again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXUQuHnNBxFSZAmYfogMfrcvMk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37211'),
  ('658420486197389458', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Samurai Sword', 2009, 'Family, Mystery, Animation, Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'Christopher Berkeley', 'Joe Sichta', 'Casey Kasem, Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Kelly Hu, Kevin Michael Richardson, Brian Cox, Sab Shimono', 'G', 'The Mystery Inc. gang takes a trip to Japan and finds themselves circling Asia and the Pacific in a treasure hunt, racing against the vengeful Black Samurai and his Ninja warriors to find the legendary Sword of Fate, an ancientblade fabled to possess extraordinary supernaturalpowers.', 'The Mystery Inc. gang takes a trip to Japan and finds themselves circling Asia and the Pacific in a treasure hunt, racing against the vengeful Black Samurai and his Ninja warriors to find the legendary Sword of Fate, an ancientblade fabled to possess extraordinary supernaturalpowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ0UlWWrBn2fnAg4SifTJbDUuaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16390'),
  ('340934827345354263', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Spooky Scarecrow', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Mystery, Comedy', 'Michael Goguen', 'Paul Religion, Misty Lee, Len Uhley', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Josh Keaton, Wendie Malick, Kelly Hu, Jeff Bennett', 'NR', 'Scooby-Doo and the rest of the ghost-busting gang visit a quiet farm town where everyone is preparing for the annual Halloween harvest celebration.', 'Scooby-Doo and the rest of the ghost-busting gang visit a quiet farm town where everyone is preparing for the annual Halloween harvest celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tq2Xc3fp47F0nQsFGsnxmX8H2NS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286387'),
  ('346908228023229310', 'Scooby-Doo! and the Witch''s Ghost', 1999, 'Comedy, Mystery, Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Jim Stenstrum, Satoshi Saga, Kentaro Mizuno', 'Rick Copp, David A. Goodman, Glenn Leopold', 'Scott Innes, Mary Kay Bergman, Frank Welker, B.J. Ward, Tim Curry, Kimberly Brooks, Jennifer Hale, Jane Wiedlin', 'NR', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Gang visit Oakhaven, Massachusetts to seek strange goings on involving a famous horror novelist and his ancestor who is rumored to have been a witch.', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Gang visit Oakhaven, Massachusetts to seek strange goings on involving a famous horror novelist and his ancestor who is rumored to have been a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QdF1SKEIBtlkJZtkWM4qekwEtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17681'),
  ('209623435402017622', 'Scooby-Doo! and WWE: Curse of the Speed Demon', 2016, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Mystery', 'Tim Divar', 'Ernie Altbacker', 'Saraya Bevis, Mike Mizanin, Kate Micucci, Grey DeLisle, Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Mark Calaway, Stephen Farrelly', 'PG', 'When Scooby and Mystery Inc. visit an off-road racing competition, it''s not long before strange events start to occur. A mysterious phantom racer, known only as Inferno, is causing chaos and is determined to sabotage the race. It''s up to Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their new driving partner, The Undertaker, to save the race and solve the mystery.', 'When Scooby and Mystery Inc. visit an off-road racing competition, it''s not long before strange events start to occur. A mysterious phantom racer, known only as Inferno, is causing chaos and is determined to sabotage the race. It''s up to Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their new driving partner, The Undertaker, to save the race and solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRrvPis7C8YfbOBuuyUoZel7MC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409122'),
  ('272469963406911302', 'Scooby-Doo! Curse of the Lake Monster', 2010, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Brian Levant, Dean Cundey, Todd Hilyard', 'Steven Altiere, Daniel Altiere', 'Frank Welker, Kate Melton, Hayley Kiyoko, Nick Palatas, Robbie Amell, Marion Ross, Beverly Sanders, Ted McGinley', 'PG', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang are on the case when a mysterious lake monster starts scaring the guests at a summer resort in Erie Point, where Fred, Daphne, Velma and Shaggy have taken on seasonal jobs to pay for a barn they accidentally burned down. But in addition to sneaking suspicions, there''s some romance in the air.', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang are on the case when a mysterious lake monster starts scaring the guests at a summer resort in Erie Point, where Fred, Daphne, Velma and Shaggy have taken on seasonal jobs to pay for a barn they accidentally burned down. But in addition to sneaking suspicions, there''s some romance in the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fui9A4s6Rr26pFdTVV4EGNmYm5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47533'),
  ('366782399448436418', 'Scooby-Doo! Frankencreepy', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Mystery, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Paul McEvoy', 'Jim Krieg', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Dee Bradley Baker, Diedrich Bader, Susanne Blakeslee, Eric Bauza', 'NR', 'Velma discovers she''s inherited her great-great-uncle''s cursed castle in Transylvania, Pennsylvania. The team decide to go there on a spooky adventure.', 'Velma discovers she''s inherited her great-great-uncle''s cursed castle in Transylvania, Pennsylvania. The team decide to go there on a spooky adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ql1KEdLPr0bl5503qFiUscDT1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284995'),
  ('800045129016719924', 'Scooby-Doo! Ghastly Goals', 2014, 'Family, Mystery, Animation, Comedy', 'Victor Cook', 'Erin Maher, Kay Reindl', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Gabriel Iglesias, Carlos Alazraqui, Andrew Kishino, Rob Paulsen', 'NR', 'While on vacation in Brazil, Scooby-Doo and the gang encounter a mythical beast at a game of soccer.', 'While on vacation in Brazil, Scooby-Doo and the gang encounter a mythical beast at a game of soccer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlpVgPDZRKwPGDyRQnryKTHinR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297102'),
  ('426330341164964745', 'Scooby-Doo! Haunted Holidays', 2012, 'Mystery, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Victor Cook', 'Michael Ryan', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Dee Bradley Baker, Carlos Alazraqui, Crispin Freeman, Fred Tatasciore', 'G', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang participate in a toy store''s holiday parade where they discover the abandoned haunted clock tower with a troubled past. A sinister snowman haunts the streets and accompanied with a large blizzard, threatens to close down the toy store for good.', 'Scooby-Doo and the gang participate in a toy store''s holiday parade where they discover the abandoned haunted clock tower with a troubled past. A sinister snowman haunts the streets and accompanied with a large blizzard, threatens to close down the toy store for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCnHwIKptAzm2V5Ho9qko3VpMvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245881'),
  ('832383045259845115', 'Scooby-Doo! in Arabian Nights', 1994, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, TV Movie, Music, Mystery, Adventure', 'Jun Falkenstein, Joanna Romersa', 'Gordon Kent', 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Jennifer Hale, Nick Jameson, Tony Jay, Greg Burson, Kath Soucie, Allan Melvin', 'G', 'Scooby-Doo and Shaggy travel to Arabia to become the Caliph''s Royal Food Tasters. But they bite off more than they can chew and are forced to run for their lives! It''s a wild magic carpet ride as Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their genie (Yogi Bear) and a jolly sailor named Sinbad (Magilla Gorilla) take you on an adventure of mistaken identities, exotic locations and fun-filled action and surprises!', 'Scooby-Doo and Shaggy travel to Arabia to become the Caliph''s Royal Food Tasters. But they bite off more than they can chew and are forced to run for their lives! It''s a wild magic carpet ride as Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their genie (Yogi Bear) and a jolly sailor named Sinbad (Magilla Gorilla) take you on an adventure of mistaken identities, exotic locations and fun-filled action and surprises!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCQ4e2iogfvLqWsfYLQedcOUgeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13351'),
  ('774430943251204831', 'Scooby-Doo! in Where''s My Mummy?', 2005, 'Mystery, Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Joe Sichta', 'Joe Sichta, Ed Scharlach, George Doty IV', 'Casey Kasem, Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Christine Baranski, Ajay Naidu, Ron Perlman, Jeremy Piven', 'G', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang become involved in a supernatural mystery in Egypt.', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang become involved in a supernatural mystery in Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9CpKZmgDfQvHe8WzFsvxxKCNyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20558'),
  ('235228860031898280', 'Scooby-Doo! Legend of the Phantosaur', 2011, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Family', 'Ethan Spaulding', 'Doug Langdale', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Cathy Cavadini, John DiMaggio, Michael Gough, Matthew Gray Gubler', 'NR', 'A relaxing spa getaway evolves into a prehistoric panic when Scooby-Doo and the gang uncover the horrible Phantosaur, an ancient legend come to life to protect hidden treasures buried in secret desert caves. But this scare-a-saurus doesn’t stand a chance with Shaggy around, after he finds his inner hero with the help of new-age hypnosis. Like, it makes him more brave and less hungry!', 'A relaxing spa getaway evolves into a prehistoric panic when Scooby-Doo and the gang uncover the horrible Phantosaur, an ancient legend come to life to protect hidden treasures buried in secret desert caves. But this scare-a-saurus doesn’t stand a chance with Shaggy around, after he finds his inner hero with the help of new-age hypnosis. Like, it makes him more brave and less hungry!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zER4fuEw6qlMkC3mBGcht0r2Iqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67900'),
  ('598969832332449469', 'Scooby-Doo! Mask of the Blue Falcon', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Mystery', 'Michael Goguen', null, 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Diedrich Bader, Dee Bradley Baker, Jeff Bennett, Gregg Berger', 'G', 'The Mega Mondo Pop Cartoon-a-Con in sunny California marks the spot for mystery in this all-new original Scooby-Doo adventure! The Mystery Inc. pals -- Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy and Scooby -- head to the annual convention, but they''re not there to crack their next case. They want to meet their favorite comic book characters and see a megabucks movie premiere, an explosive big-screen remake of the classic cartoon The Adventures of Blue Falcon, featuring Shaggy and Scooby''s favorite superheroes: caped avenger Blue Falcon and his trusty but bumbling robo-pup, Dynomutt.', 'The Mega Mondo Pop Cartoon-a-Con in sunny California marks the spot for mystery in this all-new original Scooby-Doo adventure! The Mystery Inc. pals -- Fred, Daphne, Velma, Shaggy and Scooby -- head to the annual convention, but they''re not there to crack their next case. They want to meet their favorite comic book characters and see a megabucks movie premiere, an explosive big-screen remake of the classic cartoon The Adventures of Blue Falcon, featuring Shaggy and Scooby''s favorite superheroes: caped avenger Blue Falcon and his trusty but bumbling robo-pup, Dynomutt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcSjTyzy1IOt2W7nR4X3uWUx2xj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151535'),
  ('165776060361448490', 'Scooby-Doo! Mecha Mutt Menace', 2013, 'Family, Comedy, Mystery, Animation', 'Michael Goguen', 'Rick Copp', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Julie Bowen, Lacey Chabert, Alan Rachins, Paul Reubens', 'G', 'Mecha Mutt, a revolutionary remote-controlled lunar rover resembling a large canine, goes rogue at Houston''s Annual Science Expo. Scooby-Doo! Mecha Mutt Menace is the fourth in a series of direct-to-video short films.', 'Mecha Mutt, a revolutionary remote-controlled lunar rover resembling a large canine, goes rogue at Houston''s Annual Science Expo. Scooby-Doo! Mecha Mutt Menace is the fourth in a series of direct-to-video short films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qLU4vChPzCFEkQnrZDlAYLX9BC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314387'),
  ('770364176724873567', 'Scooby-Doo! Meets the Boo Brothers', 1987, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Mystery, Comedy', 'Paul Sommer, Carl Urbano, James T. Walker', 'Jim Ryan', 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Sorrell Booke, William Callaway, Victoria Carroll, Jerry Houser, Arte Johnson, Rob Paulsen', 'NR', 'After the death of Shaggy''s Uncle Beaureguard, he, Scooby and Scrappy arrive at the late uncle''s Southern plantation to collect the inheritance. But as soon as they arrive, they find it is haunted by the ghost of a Confederate soldier. With this spook on their tails while they solve riddles in search of the inheritance, they seek help from the Boo Brothers, a trio of ghost-exterminators to help catch this nasty ghoul.', 'After the death of Shaggy''s Uncle Beaureguard, he, Scooby and Scrappy arrive at the late uncle''s Southern plantation to collect the inheritance. But as soon as they arrive, they find it is haunted by the ghost of a Confederate soldier. With this spook on their tails while they solve riddles in search of the inheritance, they seek help from the Boo Brothers, a trio of ghost-exterminators to help catch this nasty ghoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jKmHNGED3cUyXd6oge5uuHYh3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24787'),
  ('530890721825435853', 'Scooby-Doo! Moon Monster Madness', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Paul McEvoy', 'Mark Banker', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Mark Hamill, Diedrich Bader, Malcolm McDowell, Fred Tatasciore', 'PG', 'It''s one giant step for dog-kind as Scooby-Doo and the Gang blast off for an epic, other-worldly adventure in this all-new original movie! After winning the last 5 seats in a lottery, Scooby-Doo, Shaggy, Fred, Daphne and Velma are off to space in billionaire Sly Baron''s brand new ship, the Sly Star One. It''s all gravity-free fun until a mysterious alien begins destroying the ship! As the ship breaks down, the crew is forced to land on Sly Baron''s base... on the dark side of the moon! Will the gang unravel this alien mystery? Will Scooby-Doo and Shaggy find snacks on the moon? Will Fred ever take his space helmet off?! Journey to the outer limits with Scooby-Doo to find out!', 'It''s one giant step for dog-kind as Scooby-Doo and the Gang blast off for an epic, other-worldly adventure in this all-new original movie! After winning the last 5 seats in a lottery, Scooby-Doo, Shaggy, Fred, Daphne and Velma are off to space in billionaire Sly Baron''s brand new ship, the Sly Star One. It''s all gravity-free fun until a mysterious alien begins destroying the ship! As the ship breaks down, the crew is forced to land on Sly Baron''s base... on the dark side of the moon! Will the gang unravel this alien mystery? Will Scooby-Doo and Shaggy find snacks on the moon? Will Fred ever take his space helmet off?! Journey to the outer limits with Scooby-Doo to find out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwyT0ljh8mVViwO6N5p4ACcIsW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302960'),
  ('170006795615702847', 'Scooby-Doo! Music of the Vampire', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Mystery, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'David Block', 'Tom Sheppard', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Obba Babatundé, Jeff Bennett, Julianne Buescher, Christian Campbell', 'G', 'Scooby and the gang have their first musical mystery in “Scooby Doo: Music of the Vampire.” It begins when they take a sing-a-long road trip into bayou country to attend the “Vampire-Palooza Festival” – an outdoor fair dedicated to all things Draculian. At first it looks as if they’re in for some fun and lots of Southern snacks, but events soon turn scary when a real live vampire comes to life, bursts from his coffin and threatens all the townsfolk. On top of that, this baritone blood sucker seems intent on taking Daphne as his vampire bride! Could the vampire be a descendant of a famous vampire hunter who is trying to sell his book? Or perhaps he’s the local politician, who has been trying to make his name in the press by attacking the vampires as downright unwholesome. The answers are to be found in a final song-filled showdown in the swamp in which our heroes unmask one of their most macabre monsters yet.', 'Scooby and the gang have their first musical mystery in “Scooby Doo: Music of the Vampire.” It begins when they take a sing-a-long road trip into bayou country to attend the “Vampire-Palooza Festival” – an outdoor fair dedicated to all things Draculian. At first it looks as if they’re in for some fun and lots of Southern snacks, but events soon turn scary when a real live vampire comes to life, bursts from his coffin and threatens all the townsfolk. On top of that, this baritone blood sucker seems intent on taking Daphne as his vampire bride! Could the vampire be a descendant of a famous vampire hunter who is trying to sell his book? Or perhaps he’s the local politician, who has been trying to make his name in the press by attacking the vampires as downright unwholesome. The answers are to be found in a final song-filled showdown in the swamp in which our heroes unmask one of their most macabre monsters yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgbshmGOSWmMx8G9H0OD2q1Z7Mr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81900'),
  ('418284550450516093', 'Scooby-Doo! Pirates Ahoy!', 2006, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery, Adventure', 'Chuck Sheetz', 'Margaret M. Dean, Jed Elinoff, Scott Alan Thomas', 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Ron Perlman, Freddy Rodríguez, Tim Conway, Edie McClurg', 'NR', 'It''s horror on the high seas when Scooby-Doo and the gang take a creepy cruise into one of the world''s most mysterious places, the Bermuda Triangle! If Scooby, Shaggy and the gang can''t solve this mystery, they may have to walk the plank.', 'It''s horror on the high seas when Scooby-Doo and the gang take a creepy cruise into one of the world''s most mysterious places, the Bermuda Triangle! If Scooby, Shaggy and the gang can''t solve this mystery, they may have to walk the plank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1xNRp1oqPAKxPJgJ1F90jvHMGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13355'),
  ('208744843354959375', 'Scooby-Doo! Return to Zombie Island', 2019, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Mystery, Horror', 'Cecilia Aranovich, Ethan Spaulding', 'Jeremy Adams', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, David Herman, Janell Cox, Cassandra Peterson, Roger Rose', null, 'Scooby-Doo and his pals win an all-expense paid vacation and embark on a trip of a lifetime to a tropical paradise. Their destination however, turns out to be Zombie Island. As soon as they arrive, they realize the place looks strangely familiar and is reminiscent of a trip they took years ago, in which they became wrapped up in a mystery involving zombies. The gang soon learns that their trip to paradise comes with a price when the zombies re-emerge and attack their hotel. Will Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang finally solve the mystery behind Zombie Island?', 'Scooby-Doo and his pals win an all-expense paid vacation and embark on a trip of a lifetime to a tropical paradise. Their destination however, turns out to be Zombie Island. As soon as they arrive, they realize the place looks strangely familiar and is reminiscent of a trip they took years ago, in which they became wrapped up in a mystery involving zombies. The gang soon learns that their trip to paradise comes with a price when the zombies re-emerge and attack their hotel. Will Scooby-Doo and the Mystery Inc. gang finally solve the mystery behind Zombie Island?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd0oIoWhEm8o7EpS0kV7RaV0Flf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615774'),
  ('815101717156215644', 'Scooby-Doo! Shaggy''s Showdown', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Mystery, Comedy, Western', 'Matt Peters', 'Doug Langdale, Candie Langdale', 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, Carlos Alazraqui, Max Charles, Gary Cole, Jessica DiCicco', 'PG', 'When the Scooby gang visits a dude ranch, they discover that it and the nearby town have been haunted by a ghostly cowboy, Dapper Jack, who fires real fire from his fire irons. The mystery only deepens when it’s discovered that the ghost is also the long lost relative of Shaggy Rogers!', 'When the Scooby gang visits a dude ranch, they discover that it and the nearby town have been haunted by a ghostly cowboy, Dapper Jack, who fires real fire from his fire irons. The mystery only deepens when it’s discovered that the ghost is also the long lost relative of Shaggy Rogers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqw4Cis6dliACGzaejR5icXjA52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427564'),
  ('1138657110427407807', 'Scooby-Doo! Spooky Games', 2012, 'Mystery, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Curt Geda', 'Mark Banker', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Robin Atkin Downes, Troy Baker, Josh Keaton, Janet Montgomery', 'NR', 'Shaggy is selected to participate in the World Invitational Games in London, England.', 'Shaggy is selected to participate in the World Invitational Games in London, England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zlCZ6n5XTQkw0uU9qwJoCcR73t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284908'),
  ('736530867378492874', 'Scooby-Doo! Stage Fright', 2013, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Victor Cook', 'Doug Langdale', 'Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Isabella Acres, Troy Baker, Eric Bauza, Jeff Bennett', 'PG', 'Join Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and the Mystery Inc. crew as they head to Chicago for Talent Star, a hit talent show in which Fred and Daphne are finalists with some high hopes. Unlucky for them, the competition is frightful as the show is being broadcast from an opera house with a history of horrors and a particularly vengeful phantom that has cursed the show''s production.', 'Join Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and the Mystery Inc. crew as they head to Chicago for Talent Star, a hit talent show in which Fred and Daphne are finalists with some high hopes. Unlucky for them, the competition is frightful as the show is being broadcast from an opera house with a history of horrors and a particularly vengeful phantom that has cursed the show''s production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yI12z4mrNDl75no6zxQS2pBswG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203696'),
  ('496185324383790831', 'Scooby-Doo! The Mystery Begins', 2009, 'Mystery, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Brian Levant, Jan Kiesser, Carl Mason', 'Daniel Altiere, Steven Altiere', 'Nick Palatas, Hayley Kiyoko, Frank Welker, Robbie Amell, Kate Melton, Benita Ha, Shawn Macdonald, C. Ernst Harth', 'PG', 'Unjustly accused of staging a spooky practical joke complete with ghosts, Daphne, Velma, Fred and Shaggy are suspended from Coolsville High. To clear their names, they team up to solve the supernatural mystery…and head straight into nonstop laughs and adventure.', 'Unjustly accused of staging a spooky practical joke complete with ghosts, Daphne, Velma, Fred and Shaggy are suspended from Coolsville High. To clear their names, they team up to solve the supernatural mystery…and head straight into nonstop laughs and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUbx2NFwRTmRMtwcTbzEd804WQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22620'),
  ('462171095207588587', 'Scooby-Doo! The Sword and the Scoob', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Maxwell Atoms, Melchior Zwyer, Christina Sotta', 'Jeremy Adams, Maxwell Atoms', 'Matthew Lillard, Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci, Jason Isaacs, Nick Frost, Greg Ellis, Spike Brandt', 'NR', 'An evil sorceress transports the gang back to the age of chivalrous knights, spell-casting wizards, and fire-breathing dragons.', 'An evil sorceress transports the gang back to the age of chivalrous knights, spell-casting wizards, and fire-breathing dragons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCoG0ibohbPrnyomtzegSuBL40L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682254'),
  ('670259666533899172', 'Scooby-Doo! WrestleMania Mystery', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery', 'Brandon Vietti', 'Michael Ryan', 'Frank Welker, Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, April Jeanette Mendez, Mary McCormack, John Cena, Michael Coulthard', 'PG', 'The mystery begins when Shaggy and Scooby win tickets to "WrestleMania" and convince the crew to go with them to WWE City. But this city harbors a spooky secret - a ghastly Ghost Bear holds the town in his terrifying grip! To protect the coveted WWE Championship Title, the gang gets help from WWE Superstars like John Cena, Triple H, Sin Cara, Brodus Clay, AJ Lee, The Miz and Kane. Watch Scooby and the gang grapple with solving this case before it''s too late.', 'The mystery begins when Shaggy and Scooby win tickets to "WrestleMania" and convince the crew to go with them to WWE City. But this city harbors a spooky secret - a ghastly Ghost Bear holds the town in his terrifying grip! To protect the coveted WWE Championship Title, the gang gets help from WWE Superstars like John Cena, Triple H, Sin Cara, Brodus Clay, AJ Lee, The Miz and Kane. Watch Scooby and the gang grapple with solving this case before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgnxicD1qvhTrh4db9F7hJLoOaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258893'),
