  ('852507756800455283', 'Scorched Earth', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Thomas Arslan, Ulrike Müller, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Thomas Arslan', 'Mišel Matičević, Marie Leuenberger, Alexander Fehling, Tim Seyfi, Bilge Bingul, Marie-Lou Sellem, Katrin Röver, Anja Schneider', null, 'Professional criminal Trojan returns to Berlin in search of a new job after a failed coup. He cannot refuse the lucrative offer of a painting theft. But the meticulously planned action soon gets out of hand and it''s all about survival.', 'Professional criminal Trojan returns to Berlin in search of a new job after a failed coup. He cannot refuse the lucrative offer of a painting theft. But the meticulously planned action soon gets out of hand and it''s all about survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8NIymZvkh0Yu6VPaisgj3lIOs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232422'),
  ('229629083111313352', 'Scorcher', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'James Seale, Maximo Munzi, Mitch Kelleher', 'Rebecca Morrison, Graham Winter', 'Mark Dacascos, John Rhys-Davies, Tamara Davies, Mark Rolston, Rutger Hauer, Rayne Marcus, G.W. Bailey, Thomas F. Duffy', null, 'The only hope for humanity to survive a natural disaster is to detonate a nuclear bomb in Los Angeles.', 'The only hope for humanity to survive a natural disaster is to detonate a nuclear bomb in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkyMlHqPwWFSSuDwuQLRlIhlWiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5965'),
  ('817226406445997991', 'Scorchers', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Beaird, Peter Deming', 'David Beaird', 'Faye Dunaway, Denholm Elliott, James Earl Jones, Emily Lloyd, Jennifer Tilly, Luke Perry, James Wilder, Anthony Geary', 'R', 'Bayou La Teche, Louisiana sizzles as the Cajun town celebrates the wedding of Splendid and Dolan. The trouble comes on the wedding night when Splendid is determined to maintain her innocence. On the other side of town Splendids'' cousin has her own problems. Her man has been sleeping with Thais, the town hooker. She heads to the Tiger Cafe with gun in hand to get back her man.', 'Bayou La Teche, Louisiana sizzles as the Cajun town celebrates the wedding of Splendid and Dolan. The trouble comes on the wedding night when Splendid is determined to maintain her innocence. On the other side of town Splendids'' cousin has her own problems. Her man has been sleeping with Thais, the town hooker. She heads to the Tiger Cafe with gun in hand to get back her man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDtl4KDrm3IBiygpqWYiiuthy7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61144'),
  ('985335812909430641', 'Scorchy', 1976, 'Action, Crime', 'Howard Avedis, László Pal', 'Howard Avedis', 'Connie Stevens, Cesare Danova, William Smith, Norman Burton, John Davis Chandler, Joyce Jameson, Greg Evigan, Nick Dimitri', 'R', 'Seattle undercover narc Jackie Parker is out to bust the drug smuggling ring commanded by Philip Bianco.', 'Seattle undercover narc Jackie Parker is out to bust the drug smuggling ring commanded by Philip Bianco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQBNYFZKEIKik0zd37iw8BeVO7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89385'),
  ('241946075853599745', 'Scordato', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rocco Papaleo, Simone D''Onofrio, Giuseppe Costantino', 'Walter Lupo, Rocco Papaleo', 'Rocco Papaleo, Giorgia, Simone Corbisiero, Angela Curri, Giuseppe Ragone, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Manola Rotunno, Antonio Petrocelli', null, 'The life of Orlando, a gentle piano tuner, tormented by back pain, changes when he meets Olga, a charming physiotherapist, who diagnoses him with an emotional contracture and asks him to bring her a photo of himself as a young man, so that she can help him resolve his problems. The unusual request will push Orlando to travel and to relive, almost like a spectator, the events of his life that made him the solitary and contracted man he has become.', 'The life of Orlando, a gentle piano tuner, tormented by back pain, changes when he meets Olga, a charming physiotherapist, who diagnoses him with an emotional contracture and asks him to bring her a photo of himself as a young man, so that she can help him resolve his problems. The unusual request will push Orlando to travel and to relive, almost like a spectator, the events of his life that made him the solitary and contracted man he has become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaNHMCr11hpWHmLppvPoyvstIij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860947'),
  ('1138008153501144650', 'Score: A Film Music Documentary', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Matt Schrader, Kenny Holmes, Nate Gold', 'Matt Schrader', 'Hans Zimmer, Danny Elfman, Quincy Jones, Randy Newman, James Cameron, Mark Mothersbaugh, Bear McCreary, Howard Shore', 'PG', 'Music is an integral part of most films, adding emotion and nuance while often remaining invisible to audiences. Matt Schrader shines a spotlight on the overlooked craft of film composing, gathering many of the art form’s most influential practitioners, from Hans Zimmer and Danny Elfman to Quincy Jones and Randy Newman, to uncover their creative process. Tracing key developments in the evolution of music in film, and exploring some of cinema’s most iconic soundtracks, ''Score'' is an aural valentine for film lovers.', 'Music is an integral part of most films, adding emotion and nuance while often remaining invisible to audiences. Matt Schrader shines a spotlight on the overlooked craft of film composing, gathering many of the art form’s most influential practitioners, from Hans Zimmer and Danny Elfman to Quincy Jones and Randy Newman, to uncover their creative process. Tracing key developments in the evolution of music in film, and exploring some of cinema’s most iconic soundtracks, ''Score'' is an aural valentine for film lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlass0Pq1j6WD6JAucH3mXBoWo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426410'),
  ('1057809608459473996', 'Scorned', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andrew Stevens, Tony Schwartz, Christian Sebaldt', 'Barry Avrich', 'Shannon Tweed, Andrew Stevens, Kim Morgan Greene, Daniel McVicar, Michael D. Arenz, Stephen Young, Perla Walter, Paul Carr', 'R', 'A vengeful widow worms her way into the home of the man she holds responsible for her husband''s suicide.', 'A vengeful widow worms her way into the home of the man she holds responsible for her husband''s suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/latrrZjz5kwVz3Am3ajLaCrJ1LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64084'),
