  ('989113576786893980', 'Scorpio Nights 2', 1999, 'Drama', 'Erik Matti', 'Erik Matti, Lore Reyes', 'Albert Martinez, Joyce Jimenez, Daisy Reyes, Janus Del Prado, Manny Castañeda, Bibeth Orteza, Jaime Fabregas, Cherry Pie Picache', null, 'Andrew is meticulous almost to the point of obsession. From the way he carries his clothes to the manner he delivers his Physics lectures, Andrew is methodical in everything he does. But his ordered existence is suddenly disrupted when one sexually adventurous student, Valerie, starts seducing him. Andrew gives in to the temptation, and soon, the two are caught in an explosive relationship that knows no bounds.', 'Andrew is meticulous almost to the point of obsession. From the way he carries his clothes to the manner he delivers his Physics lectures, Andrew is methodical in everything he does. But his ordered existence is suddenly disrupted when one sexually adventurous student, Valerie, starts seducing him. Andrew gives in to the temptation, and soon, the two are caught in an explosive relationship that knows no bounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDIlHEoNcifFVA3C7wcSVZQtukZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111653'),
  ('8775536358712449', 'Scorpio Nights 3', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Lawrence Fajardo', null, 'Christine Bermas, Mark Anthony Fernandez, Gold Aceron, Sheree, Allison Smith, Julio Díaz, Amanda Avecilla, Aica Veloso', null, 'A young couple''s sex acts are witnessed by a young man through a hole. When the wife seduces him, they engage in an illicit affair. Chaos ensues when the husband learns about them.', 'A young couple''s sex acts are witnessed by a young man through a hole. When the wife seduces him, they engage in an illicit affair. Chaos ensues when the husband learns about them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uBbhfM8Co57T4Fn5flo0tMn5NC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990485'),
  ('1008222491163688921', 'Scorpio Nights 4', 2026, 'Drama', 'Bobby Bonifacio, Mark Joshua Tirona, Jackie Lyn Barcebal', 'Arvin Belarmino, Bobby Bonifacio', 'Apphle Celso, Sahara Bernales, Albie Casiño, Marco Mora, Rolando Toralba, Christian Paolo Lat, Renz Tantoco, Ian Sicat', null, 'A countryside boy rents a room from a couple and discovers a hole exposing their secrets. His voyeurism leads into tangled affairs with two women, unraveling a twisted game of lust and betrayal.', 'A countryside boy rents a room from a couple and discovers a hole exposing their secrets. His voyeurism leads into tangled affairs with two women, unraveling a twisted game of lust and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhgGvrHkwu9mtNeAhzaG828boH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1658214'),
