  ('15951994581865466', 'Scorpion', 2007, 'Action, Thriller', 'Julien Seri, Michel Taburiaux', 'Cédric Jimenez, Julien Seri, Sylvie Verheyde', 'Clovis Cornillac, Karole Rocher, Jérôme Le Banner, Francis Renaud, Caroline Proust, Olivier Marchal, Tony Harrisson, Hicham Nazzal', null, 'Featuring a mix of Thai Boxing and Ultimate Fighting, SCORPION has been dubbed The French Fight Club. It stars Jerome Le Banner, who is also known as Hyper Battle Cyborg and The Bulldog of Paris, a true kickboxer, famous for his aggressive style - 43 of his 57 wins have come by knockout.', 'Featuring a mix of Thai Boxing and Ultimate Fighting, SCORPION has been dubbed The French Fight Club. It stars Jerome Le Banner, who is also known as Hyper Battle Cyborg and The Bulldog of Paris, a true kickboxer, famous for his aggressive style - 43 of his 57 wins have come by knockout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hXVirgzusYnjmy2x3jo0i0Ig9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54554'),
  ('862717550438436402', 'Scorpion in Love', 2013, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Santiago A. Zannou', 'Carlos Bardem, Santiago A. Zannou', 'Álex González, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Carlos Bardem, Judith Diakhate, Hovik Keuchkerian, Javier Bardem, Juan Carlos Vellido, Luis Mottola', null, 'Julian (Álex González) and his friend Luis (Miguel Angel Silvestre) are two neighborhood boys who are part of a gang of violent neo-Nazis, led by Solis (Javier Bardem). After start training in a gym, Julian is transformed gradually thanks to the discipline of boxing, the nobility of his coach (Carlos Bardem) and the love of a young latin girl (Judith Diakhate). All of this takes away from the group, but Luis is not ready to accept that leave the "herd".', 'Julian (Álex González) and his friend Luis (Miguel Angel Silvestre) are two neighborhood boys who are part of a gang of violent neo-Nazis, led by Solis (Javier Bardem). After start training in a gym, Julian is transformed gradually thanks to the discipline of boxing, the nobility of his coach (Carlos Bardem) and the love of a young latin girl (Judith Diakhate). All of this takes away from the group, but Luis is not ready to accept that leave the "herd".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nA9YI2PEsiiJ4paaOg0LCkPEKnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166089'),
  ('279390118781017180', 'Scorpion King: Book of Souls', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Don Michael Paul, Hein de Vos', 'Frank DeJohn, David Alton Hedges', 'Zach McGowan, Peter Mensah, Pearl Thusi, Mayling Ng, Katy Louise Saunders, Inge Beckmann, Stephanie Schildknecht, Howard Charles', 'PG-13', 'The Scorpion King teams up with a female warrior named Tala, who is the sister of The Nubian King. Together they search for a legendary relic known as The Book of Souls, which will allow them to put an end to an evil warlord.', 'The Scorpion King teams up with a female warrior named Tala, who is the sister of The Nubian King. Together they search for a legendary relic known as The Book of Souls, which will allow them to put an end to an evil warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSviUMejPmerwoQxdj7wR4Ky1Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522417'),
  ('489990645763605123', 'Scorpion Thunderbolt', 1984, 'Horror, Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Raymond Chang', 'Godfrey Ho', 'Richard Harrison, Juliet Chan, Tsui Shou-ping, Lin Nan-Shi, Kuk Jeong-Seok', 'NR', 'A female journalist transforms into a snake demon and goes on murderous rampages.Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1983 Taiwanese film "人頭蛇" (Snake Woman) with new scenes.', 'A female journalist transforms into a snake demon and goes on murderous rampages.Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1983 Taiwanese film "人頭蛇" (Snake Woman) with new scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LAHZtDnd6YoTrR6IPSeJJ4ym6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89477'),
  ('771495171064797245', 'Scorpion with Two Tails', 1982, 'Horror', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Massimo Manasse', 'Mara Maryl, Jacques Leitienne, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Elvire Audray, Paolo Malco, Claudio Cassinelli, Marilù Tolo, Wandisa Guida, Gianfranco Barra, John Saxon, Van Johnson', null, 'An archeologist''s wife has recurring nightmares about ritual killings in an Etruscan tomb while her husband is away excavating a lost temple. After a phone call where she is forced to listen to him being murdered, she travels to the excavation site to solve the mystery of his death.', 'An archeologist''s wife has recurring nightmares about ritual killings in an Etruscan tomb while her husband is away excavating a lost temple. After a phone call where she is forced to listen to him being murdered, she travels to the excavation site to solve the mystery of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NOma5H3Y9kNQWdFyxa2Z0f0TJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64666'),
