  ('945688524481089349', 'Scream', 1996, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Wes Craven, Mark Irwin, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Kevin Williamson', 'David Arquette, Neve Campbell, Courteney Cox, Skeet Ulrich, Matthew Lillard, Rose McGowan, Jamie Kennedy, W. Earl Brown', 'R', 'A year after the murder of her mother, a teenage girl is terrorized by a masked killer who targets her and her friends by using scary movies as part of a deadly game.', 'A year after the murder of her mother, a teenage girl is terrorized by a masked killer who targets her and her friends by using scary movies as part of a deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr9ZIrmuwVmZhpZuTCW8D9g0ZJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4232'),
  ('404745226071204016', 'Scream', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Scott Oberholzer, Tyler Gillett, Matt Bettinelli-Olpin', 'James Vanderbilt, Guy Busick', 'Melissa Barrera, Jenna Ortega, Mason Gooding, Jasmin Savoy Brown, Jack Quaid, Mikey Madison, Courteney Cox, David Arquette', 'R', 'Twenty-five years after a streak of brutal murders shocked the quiet town of Woodsboro, a new killer has donned the Ghostface mask and begins targeting a group of teenagers to resurrect secrets from the town’s deadly past.', 'Twenty-five years after a streak of brutal murders shocked the quiet town of Woodsboro, a new killer has donned the Ghostface mask and begins targeting a group of teenagers to resurrect secrets from the town’s deadly past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m3W6cpgwuIyjtg5nSnPx7yFkXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646385'),
  ('539847253453366115', 'Scream 2', 1997, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Wes Craven, Peter Deming, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Neve Campbell, Courteney Cox, David Arquette, Jerry O''Connell, Timothy Olyphant, Jamie Kennedy, Laurie Metcalf, Elise Neal', 'R', 'Two years after the Woodsboro murders, Sidney Prescott acclimates to college life while someone donning the Ghostface costume begins a new string of killings.', 'Two years after the Woodsboro murders, Sidney Prescott acclimates to college life while someone donning the Ghostface costume begins a new string of killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dORlVasiaDkJXTqt9bdH7nFNs6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4233'),
