  ('587674122106392184', 'Screamers', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction, War', 'Rodney Gibbons, Christian Duguay, Bruno Philip', 'Miguel Tejada-Flores, Dan O''Bannon', 'Peter Weller, Jennifer Rubin, Roy Dupuis, Andrew Lauer, Liliana Komorowska, Michael Caloz, Jason Cavalier, Ron White', 'R', 'SIRIUS 6B, Year 2078. On a distant mining planet ravaged by a decade of war, scientists have created the perfect weapon: a blade-wielding, self-replicating race of killing devices known as Screamers designed for one purpose only -- to hunt down and destroy all enemy life forms.', 'SIRIUS 6B, Year 2078. On a distant mining planet ravaged by a decade of war, scientists have created the perfect weapon: a blade-wielding, self-replicating race of killing devices known as Screamers designed for one purpose only -- to hunt down and destroy all enemy life forms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqgBf791rMZG7ywHfObpXeMpiRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9102'),
