  ('695289095010103659', 'Screamplay', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Rufus Butler Seder', 'Rufus Butler Seder, Ed Greenberg', 'Rufus Butler Seder, Eugene Seder, George Kuchar, Cheryl Hirshman, James McCann, Lonny McDougall, George Cordeiro, Ed Callahan', null, 'A talented writer, Edgar Allen, arrives in Hollywood with big dreams but is quickly pulled into a world of madness and depravity. A detective investigating a series of murders discovers that they are similar to the murders that occur in the new script by Edgar. Who will survive and what parts will be left for them?', 'A talented writer, Edgar Allen, arrives in Hollywood with big dreams but is quickly pulled into a world of madness and depravity. A detective investigating a series of murders discovers that they are similar to the murders that occur in the new script by Edgar. Who will survive and what parts will be left for them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIv6isF1HpBK1UugVTX0Emwjipd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83282'),
  ('418007630306555702', 'Screams of a Winter Night', 1979, 'Horror', 'James L. Wilson, Robert E. Rogers', 'Richard H. Wadsack', 'Matt Borel, Gil Glasgow, Mary Agen Cox, Robin Bradley, Ray Gaspard, Beverly Allen, Brandy Barrett, Charles Rucker', 'PG', 'Ten college friends take a winter weekend camping trip to Lake Durand. The group holes up in an old cabin where the original owners were once found dead, with local Native Americans suspecting they were the victims of a spirit called Shataba. As the group nestles in for the night, they start telling each other scary stories.', 'Ten college friends take a winter weekend camping trip to Lake Durand. The group holes up in an old cabin where the original owners were once found dead, with local Native Americans suspecting they were the victims of a spirit called Shataba. As the group nestles in for the night, they start telling each other scary stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OQgF8ZvYa2xNdBb1ZKwQBXP3ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83820'),
