  ('151075328329330160', 'Screwed', 2000, 'Action, Comedy', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski, Robert Brinkmann', 'Larry Karaszewski, Scott Alexander', 'Norm Macdonald, Dave Chappelle, Danny DeVito, Elaine Stritch, Daniel Benzali, Sherman Hemsley, Sarah Silverman, Malcolm Stewart', 'R', 'A chauffeur kidnaps his rich boss''s dog to hold it for ransom, but when she accidentally gets the dog back, she thinks that it''s the chauffeur who''s been kidnapped.', 'A chauffeur kidnaps his rich boss''s dog to hold it for ransom, but when she accidentally gets the dog back, she thinks that it''s the chauffeur who''s been kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6FfMbH1ga1Kp5QI9Nm0ETOIG64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19419'),
