  ('222601176982596391', 'Scribe', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alex Lamarque, Thomas Kruithof', 'Aurélie Valat, Marc Syrigas, Thomas Kruithof', 'François Cluzet, Denis Podalydès, Sami Bouajila, Simon Abkarian, Alba Rohrwacher, Philippe Résimont, Daniel Hanssens, Bruno Georis', null, 'Two years after a burn-out, Duval is still unemployed. Contacted by an enigmatic businessman, he is offered a simple and well-paid job: transcribing telephone tapping. Duval accepts financially without questioning the purpose of the organization that employs him. Precipitated at the heart of a political plot, he must face the brutal mechanics of the underground world of the secret services.', 'Two years after a burn-out, Duval is still unemployed. Contacted by an enigmatic businessman, he is offered a simple and well-paid job: transcribing telephone tapping. Duval accepts financially without questioning the purpose of the organization that employs him. Precipitated at the heart of a political plot, he must face the brutal mechanics of the underground world of the secret services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rRE78rZk07WNhWAHiNj3WaMkJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482114'),
  ('461944387600514903', 'Scrooge', 1935, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Henry Edwards, Sydney Blythe, William Luff', 'H. Fowler Mear', 'Seymour Hicks, Donald Calthrop, Robert Cochran, Mary Glynne, Garry Marsh, Oscar Asche, Athene Seyler, Maurice Evans', 'NR', 'Ebenezer Scrooge, the ultimate Victorian miser, hasn''t a good word for Christmas, though his impoverished clerk Cratchit and nephew Fred are full of holiday spirit. In the night, Scrooge is visited by spirits of the past, present, and future.', 'Ebenezer Scrooge, the ultimate Victorian miser, hasn''t a good word for Christmas, though his impoverished clerk Cratchit and nephew Fred are full of holiday spirit. In the night, Scrooge is visited by spirits of the past, present, and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqRuJyux0KEr4vojK9ytXIrEU46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41118'),
