  ('947770216157338263', 'Scum of the Earth', 1963, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'William Kerwin, Allison Louise Downe, Lawrence J. Aberwood, Sandra Sinclair, Mal Arnold, Craig Maudslay Jr., Christina Castel, Christy Foushee', null, 'An innocent teenager is blackmailed into nude modeling for a photographer in league with a gang boss who sells illicit photos of terrorized young women.', 'An innocent teenager is blackmailed into nude modeling for a photographer in league with a gang boss who sells illicit photos of terrorized young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoZkC7DdT7ulREeYRjajjJHUsYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28175'),
  ('69025525956015029', 'Scuola di seduzione', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Giovanni Canevari, Alessandro Specchio', 'Carlo Verdone, Pasquale Plastino, Luca Mastrogiovanni', 'Carlo Verdone, Karla Sofía Gascón, Lino Guanciale, Vittoria Puccini, Beatrice Arnera, Euridice Axén, Romano Reggiani, Elisa Di Eusanio', null, 'A love coach helps six different people navigate their insecurities and emotional difficulties, guiding them toward greater emotional awareness.', 'A love coach helps six different people navigate their insecurities and emotional difficulties, guiding them toward greater emotional awareness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQtgFAT7GALLn5LJonQMcbBMjT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1523067'),
  ('311062623454890831', 'Scurry', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Luke Sparke, Wade Muller, Carly Sparke', 'Tom Evans', 'Jamie Costa, Emalia, Indianna Sparke, Brooke Marsden, Jet Tranter, Geoff Imrie', null, 'Two strangers find themselves trapped underground when the city is attacked by a monstrous threat. Badly injured with limited resources they must navigate a treacherous, narrowing tunnel in hopes of finding an exit.', 'Two strangers find themselves trapped underground when the city is attacked by a monstrous threat. Badly injured with limited resources they must navigate a treacherous, narrowing tunnel in hopes of finding an exit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fFM39XbhBPOlrhkIEKSsld1Ts9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1332316'),
  ('142643801868068834', 'Scurvy', 2026, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Vladimir Golovnev, Artem Anisimov', 'Vladimir Golovnev, Evgeny Grigoryev', 'Nikita Efremov, Evgeniya Mandzhieva, Dmitriy Podnozov', null, 'Novice Fyodor accompanies father Pyotr on an official mission to the Polar Urals. Ahead of the missionaries is the farthest northern camp, which the locals cautiously call "the edge of the earth." And travelers are not at all welcome here.', 'Novice Fyodor accompanies father Pyotr on an official mission to the Polar Urals. Ahead of the missionaries is the farthest northern camp, which the locals cautiously call "the edge of the earth." And travelers are not at all welcome here.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1FoTTnHW9cpv51kgNJBEoEnRELf.jpg', 'plex:movie:tsinga'),
  ('1099027362723631672', 'SDI: Secret Department of Intervention', 2024, 'Action', 'Sébastien Baccala, Thomas Khawam', 'Sébastien Baccala, Thomas Khawam', 'Thomas Khawam, Aurore Planas, Pierre André, Laurent Leca', null, 'Secret agents Mike, Stan, and Chloé, tasked with retrieving a stolen briefcase, discover it holds a secret map to hidden World War II treasures. Betrayed by their own French Minister of Defense and hunted by a former Marine, Vogel, the team faces internal conflicts and danger. As alliances shift, secrets unravel, and battles ensue, they must thwart Vogel''s plan to claim the treasures, setting the stage for an international treasure hunt filled with unexpected twists and unresolved romantic entanglements.', 'Secret agents Mike, Stan, and Chloé, tasked with retrieving a stolen briefcase, discover it holds a secret map to hidden World War II treasures. Betrayed by their own French Minister of Defense and hunted by a former Marine, Vogel, the team faces internal conflicts and danger. As alliances shift, secrets unravel, and battles ensue, they must thwart Vogel''s plan to claim the treasures, setting the stage for an international treasure hunt filled with unexpected twists and unresolved romantic entanglements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owX06DajHa0TIqYt5z57x4nIGWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389147'),
  ('748687124582437827', 'SDU: Sex Duties Unit', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Gary Mak Wing-Lun', 'Luk Yee-Sum', 'Chapman To Man-Chat, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung, Liu Ling''er, Jim Chim Sui-Man, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Nan Yik-Pong', null, 'The Special Duties Unit (SDU) is an elite paramilitary tactical unit of the Hong Kong Police Force and is considered one of the world''s finest in its role. But being the best carries its own burdens. Like everyone else, they go through troubles with love, with family and with their jobs. And sometimes they get horny. This touching story is about Special Duties Unit Team B and their trip to Macau for a weekend of unadulterated debauchery.', 'The Special Duties Unit (SDU) is an elite paramilitary tactical unit of the Hong Kong Police Force and is considered one of the world''s finest in its role. But being the best carries its own burdens. Like everyone else, they go through troubles with love, with family and with their jobs. And sometimes they get horny. This touching story is about Special Duties Unit Team B and their trip to Macau for a weekend of unadulterated debauchery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4eon2UYGgDKgiAth6zf38UACqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210498'),
  ('441217874846800538', 'Se c’è un aldilà sono fottuto - Vita e cinema di Claudio Caligari', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Simone Isola, Fausto Trombetta, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Simone Isola, Fausto Trombetta', 'Emanuel Bevilacqua, Mauro Bonanni, Alessandro Borghi, Maurizio Calvesi, Marco Caramella, Laura Casalini, Francesca D''Aloja, Silvia D''Amico', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7Hsax1vAXkSfHBHvAmPxrqUuyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618376'),
  ('828805085536567125', 'Se devo essere sincera', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Fabio Cianchetti, Fabio Simonelli, Davide Ferrario', 'Luciana Littizzetto, Anna Pavignano', 'Luciana Littizzetto, Dino Abbrescia, Neri Marcorè, Donatella Finocchiaro, Fabio Troiano, Alessandro Adriano, Mia Benedetta, Lidia Biondi', null, 'Adelaide is a 40-year-old literature teacher married with children. One day, she learns about the murder of a wealthy and arrogant co-worker of hers, strangled in her own home. Adelaide meets Gaetano, the charming inspector dealing with the case and decides to help him in the investigation, much to her husband''s chagrin.', 'Adelaide is a 40-year-old literature teacher married with children. One day, she learns about the murder of a wealthy and arrogant co-worker of hers, strangled in her own home. Adelaide meets Gaetano, the charming inspector dealing with the case and decides to help him in the investigation, much to her husband''s chagrin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6TV4pniDZ5wqiuvyzz7l72GxpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73870'),
  ('878844887369062897', 'Se mi lasci non vale', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Pesci, Vincenzo Salemme', 'Paolo Genovese, Martino Coli, Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Paolo Calabresi, Carlo Buccirosso, Serena Autieri, Tosca D''Aquino, Carlo Giuffrè, Veronica Mazza, Mirea Flavia Stellato', null, 'Two aging men bond over their respective heartbreaks, but it may not be over yet...', 'Two aging men bond over their respective heartbreaks, but it may not be over yet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wklFM45fPjKV2iXdVQT1T35oila.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378569'),
  ('488795154333035987', 'Se Puder... Dirija!', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Paulo Fontenelle, Paula Horta, Nonato Estrela', 'Paulo Fontenelle', 'Luiz Fernando Guimarães, Leandro Hassum, Lavínia Vlasak, Bárbara Paz, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Eri Johnson, Antonio Pedro, Gabriel Palhares', null, 'A valet parking attendant borrows a client''s car to spend the day with his son, but gets into unexpected trouble.', 'A valet parking attendant borrows a client''s car to spend the day with his son, but gets into unexpected trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13WWIX5WtPAlvKVLpUc9LmEDXVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218528'),
  ('837016674349874605', 'Se sei così, ti dico sì', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Eugenio Cappuccio', 'Claudio Piersanti, Eugenio Cappuccio, Guia Soncini', 'Emilio Solfrizzi, Belén Rodríguez, Iaia Forte, Roberto De Francesco, Totò Onnis, Salvatore Marino, Pinuccio Sinisi, Eleonora Albrecht', null, 'Piero Cicala is an adult singer who leads a modest life in the shadow of the only moment of glory lived in the eighties, thanks to a song that earned him a million records sold. Just when it seems that fame is definitively confined to the past, Piero receives the proposal to conduct a broadcast in Rome. Accepted the offer, he goes to the capital, where he will meet the famous Tatia Cortès, an irrepressible showgirl...', 'Piero Cicala is an adult singer who leads a modest life in the shadow of the only moment of glory lived in the eighties, thanks to a song that earned him a million records sold. Just when it seems that fame is definitively confined to the past, Piero receives the proposal to conduct a broadcast in Rome. Accepted the offer, he goes to the capital, where he will meet the famous Tatia Cortès, an irrepressible showgirl...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zy6tXW2ZKvXVgLEFd92mOmlTWCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61942'),
  ('220656870363636198', 'Se7en', 1995, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Darius Khondji, David Fincher, Michael Alan Kahn', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Morgan Freeman, Brad Pitt, Gwyneth Paltrow, John Cassini, Peter Crombie, Reg E. Cathey, R. Lee Ermey, Daniel Zacapa', 'R', 'Two homicide detectives are on a desperate hunt for a serial killer whose crimes are based on the "seven deadly sins" in this dark and haunting film that takes viewers from the tortured remains of one victim to the next. The seasoned Det. Somerset researches each sin in an effort to get inside the killer''s mind, while his novice partner, Mills, scoffs at his efforts to unravel the case.', 'Two homicide detectives are on a desperate hunt for a serial killer whose crimes are based on the "seven deadly sins" in this dark and haunting film that takes viewers from the tortured remains of one victim to the next. The seasoned Det. Somerset researches each sin in an effort to get inside the killer''s mind, while his novice partner, Mills, scoffs at his efforts to unravel the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/191nKfP0ehp3uIvWqgPbFmI4lv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807'),
  ('1057959028642215927', 'Sea Ballerinas', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'Two kinds of starfish, the brittle and the feather. The brittle star moves its arms alone, without the aid of suckers. Underneath is a single opening. Stalks move food close to the mouth and move waste away. We see vents, used in reproduction and breathing. We watch the hatched young expelled into the water. The camera shows us brittle stars'' intricate patters. We observe feather stars in clusters, like ferns. One turns over slowly; arms have branches with stalks for breathing and gathering microscopic food. Reproductive organs are inside branches. We see eggs develop at 1,400 nature''s speed. Larvae emerge, 0.1 mm long. They grow. A feather star takes a walk.', 'Two kinds of starfish, the brittle and the feather. The brittle star moves its arms alone, without the aid of suckers. Underneath is a single opening. Stalks move food close to the mouth and move waste away. We see vents, used in reproduction and breathing. We watch the hatched young expelled into the water. The camera shows us brittle stars'' intricate patters. We observe feather stars in clusters, like ferns. One turns over slowly; arms have branches with stalks for breathing and gathering microscopic food. Reproductive organs are inside branches. We see eggs develop at 1,400 nature''s speed. Larvae emerge, 0.1 mm long. They grow. A feather star takes a walk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBXWuLK2jOSQFg9KJyQ3PZTDWii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163223'),
  ('403433761586204199', 'Sea Beast', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Thriller, Action', 'Paul Ziller, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Neil Elman, Paul Ziller', 'Corin Nemec, Miriam McDonald, Camille Sullivan, Christie Laing, Gary Hudson, Daniel Wisler, Gwynyth Walsh, Brent Stait', null, 'In the fishing village of Cedar Bay, terror lies within the water. And now it has surfaced in search of something more substantial to devour than marine life: human flesh. A captain and a sea biologist must wage a terrifying battle against the deadly creatures in order to save mankind from total extinction.', 'In the fishing village of Cedar Bay, terror lies within the water. And now it has surfaced in search of something more substantial to devour than marine life: human flesh. A captain and a sea biologist must wage a terrifying battle against the deadly creatures in order to save mankind from total extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta56QLWqHo5G3u9tQw2cS5NEMsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21922'),
  ('898672481683799821', 'Sea Countrymen', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta', 'Vittorio De Seta', null, null, 'Sicily, Granitola, 1955. At the first light of dawn, the fishermen set out in their boats for open water, timing the rhythm of their oars to murmured chants. They set their nets in the sea, regulate the cords, organize the boats in a square. The men’s work becomes increasingly harder as the tuna are hoisted onto the boats, wriggling, beating their tails until death arrives and the water is tinged with blood.', 'Sicily, Granitola, 1955. At the first light of dawn, the fishermen set out in their boats for open water, timing the rhythm of their oars to murmured chants. They set their nets in the sea, regulate the cords, organize the boats in a square. The men’s work becomes increasingly harder as the tuna are hoisted onto the boats, wriggling, beating their tails until death arrives and the water is tinged with blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5RI1Z3sVUf61SiljRe3DN8mPOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222226'),
  ('970925315687771992', 'Sea Devils', 1953, 'Action, Adventure', 'Raoul Walsh, Wilkie Cooper', 'Borden Chase', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Rock Hudson, Maxwell Reed, Denis O''Dea, Michael Goodliffe, Bryan Forbes, Jacques Brunius, Ivor Barnard', 'NR', 'Gilliatt, a fisherman-turned-smuggler on the isle of Guernsey, agrees to transport a beautiful woman to the French coast in the year 1800. She tells him she hopes to rescue her brother from the guillotine. Gilliatt finds himself falling in love and so feels betrayed when he later learns this woman is a countess helping Napoleon plan an invasion of England. In reality, however, the "countess" is an English agent working to thwart this invasion. When Gilliatt finds this out, he returns to France to rescue the woman who''s true purpose has been discovered by the French.', 'Gilliatt, a fisherman-turned-smuggler on the isle of Guernsey, agrees to transport a beautiful woman to the French coast in the year 1800. She tells him she hopes to rescue her brother from the guillotine. Gilliatt finds himself falling in love and so feels betrayed when he later learns this woman is a countess helping Napoleon plan an invasion of England. In reality, however, the "countess" is an English agent working to thwart this invasion. When Gilliatt finds this out, he returns to France to rescue the woman who''s true purpose has been discovered by the French.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kegu3GsUvsVVFp91VUEZ2ClIaHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128048'),
  ('220351444232382057', 'Sea Fever', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Ken O''Sullivan, Jonathan Quinlan, Neasa Hardiman', 'Neasa Hardiman', 'Hermione Corfield, Ardalan Esmaili, Olwen Fouéré, Jack Hickey, Elie Bouakaze, Dougray Scott, Connie Nielsen, Dag Malmberg', null, 'The crew of a West of Ireland trawler—marooned at sea—struggle for their lives against a growing parasite in their water supply.', 'The crew of a West of Ireland trawler—marooned at sea—struggle for their lives against a growing parasite in their water supply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4cPVVNPZUHVeoF6dH2grBvSEKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507441'),
  ('627793915509651030', 'Sea Fog', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Shim Sung-bo, Moon Dae-young, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Bong Joon Ho, Shim Sung-bo', 'Kim Yun-seok, MICKY Yoochun, Han Ye-ri, Lee Hee-jun, Moon Sung-keun, Kim Sang-ho, Yoo Seung-mok, Jo Kyung-sook', null, 'A fishing-boat crew takes on a dangerous commission to smuggle a group of illegal immigrants from China to Korea.', 'A fishing-boat crew takes on a dangerous commission to smuggle a group of illegal immigrants from China to Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnqv8hSNKfNZXKsJXMxJocDVGK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272691'),
  ('182685377927989327', 'Sea Monsters: A Prehistoric Adventure', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Sean MacLeod Phillips, Sean MacLeod Phillips, T.C. Christensen', 'Mose Richards', 'Liev Schreiber, Jerry Hoffman, Toni Dodd, Chris Glaze, Cheryl Hunter, Doug Kisgen, Frank Novak, Jeffrey Staab', 'NR', 'Journey 80 million years back in time to an age when mighty dinosaurs dominated the land - and an equally astonishing assortment of ferocious creatures swam, hunted, and fought for survival beneath the vast, mysterious prehistoric seas.', 'Journey 80 million years back in time to an age when mighty dinosaurs dominated the land - and an equally astonishing assortment of ferocious creatures swam, hunted, and fought for survival beneath the vast, mysterious prehistoric seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/key1ASCobqzA6d4z62C1IVz7p0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16322'),
  ('545396054619708537', 'Sea of Death', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, TV Movie, Action', 'Hans Horn, Bernhard Jasper', 'Günter Knarr, Philipp Weinges', 'Lavinia Wilson, Hugo Grimm, Fahri Yardım, Xaver Hutter, Katja Weitzenböck, Sieruan Casey, Carolin Pohl, Johanna Dürolf', null, 'In the German North Sea a new cellular life form endangers mankind.', 'In the German North Sea a new cellular life form endangers mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsHkUzDzmwG9Z8PUmyugyetlhS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54778'),
  ('794654850761354717', 'Sea of Love', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Ronnie Taylor, Harold Becker, Dick Ziker', 'Richard Price', 'Al Pacino, Ellen Barkin, John Goodman, Michael Rooker, William Hickey, Richard Jenkins, Paul Calderon, Gene Canfield', 'R', 'Seen-it-all New York detective Frank Keller is unsettled - he has done twenty years on the force and could retire, and he hasn''t come to terms with his wife leaving him for a colleague. Joining up with an officer from another part of town to investigate a series of murders linked by the lonely hearts columns he finds he is getting seriously and possibly dangerously involved with Helen, one of the main suspects.', 'Seen-it-all New York detective Frank Keller is unsettled - he has done twenty years on the force and could retire, and he hasn''t come to terms with his wife leaving him for a colleague. Joining up with an officer from another part of town to investigate a series of murders linked by the lonely hearts columns he finds he is getting seriously and possibly dangerously involved with Helen, one of the main suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJ88WmJ12eAK9CRb3cggn9CJthH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12150'),
  ('282036442936353088', 'Sea of Sand', 1958, 'Drama, War', 'Guy Green, Wilkie Cooper', 'Robert Westerby', 'Richard Attenborough, John Gregson, Michael Craig, Vincent Ball, Percy Herbert, Ray McAnally, Barry Foster, George Murcell', null, 'A small British army team is sent deep behind enemy lines to destroy a German petrol dump as part of the preparation for a major attack in the North African campaign. Sea of Sand was distributed in the US in a shortened version, Desert Patrol.', 'A small British army team is sent deep behind enemy lines to destroy a German petrol dump as part of the preparation for a major attack in the North African campaign. Sea of Sand was distributed in the US in a shortened version, Desert Patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfj1n36louQxSAN1ICsKlEzL2fv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30104'),
  ('265988723762181224', 'Sea of Shadows', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Richard Ladkani, Matthew Podolsky, Sean Bogle', null, 'Romel Eduardo Ledezma Abaroa, Rafael Pacchiano Alamán, Hector Capetillo, Andrea Crosta, Marc Davis, Jack Hutton, Jacqueline Le Duc, Carlos Loret de Mola', null, 'The vaquita, the world’s smallest whale, is nearing extinction as its habitat is destroyed by Mexican cartels and the Chinese Mafia, who harvest the totoaba fish, the “cocaine of the sea.” Environmental activists, the Mexican navy, and undercover investigators are fighting back against this illegal multimillion-dollar business.', 'The vaquita, the world’s smallest whale, is nearing extinction as its habitat is destroyed by Mexican cartels and the Chinese Mafia, who harvest the totoaba fish, the “cocaine of the sea.” Environmental activists, the Mexican navy, and undercover investigators are fighting back against this illegal multimillion-dollar business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oONUAloKVryxa3XZje6LLIscWC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566219'),
  ('386409646228671742', 'Sea of Time', 2022, 'Drama', 'Theu Boermans, Myrthe Mosterman', 'Marieke van der Pol', 'Sallie Harmsen, Elsie de Brauw, Gijs Scholten van Aschat, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, River Oosterink, Barbara Sobels, Koen Franse, Mieneke Bakker', null, 'Two former lovers find themselves struggling for shared closure as one of them prepares to stage a play about the unspeakable tragedy that tore them apart decades ago.', 'Two former lovers find themselves struggling for shared closure as one of them prepares to stage a play about the unspeakable tragedy that tore them apart decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beOttBg7SjRnOXXBEb3Xv9UEgKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002125'),
  ('1049494036078285607', 'Sea Prince and the Fire Child', 1981, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Romance', 'Masami Hata, Shouhei Hayashi, Iwao Yamaki', 'Masami Hata, Chiho Katsura', 'Toru Furuya, Mami Koyama, Keiko Han, Michiko Nomura, Ikue Sakakibara, Jūkichi Uno, Kenji Utsumi, Reiko Mutoh', null, 'The God of Water and the Goddess of Fire, who once lived in harmony, were torn apart by the Lord of the Winds. Their children, Sirius, heir to the Water Kingdom, and Malta, heir to the Fire Kingdom, become aware of the existence of their other worlds and fall in love. Their parents, however, disapprove, leading to a tale of star-crossed lovers trapped between life and death, water and fire.', 'The God of Water and the Goddess of Fire, who once lived in harmony, were torn apart by the Lord of the Winds. Their children, Sirius, heir to the Water Kingdom, and Malta, heir to the Fire Kingdom, become aware of the existence of their other worlds and fall in love. Their parents, however, disapprove, leading to a tale of star-crossed lovers trapped between life and death, water and fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AjvCcszj5cvZQjsK2R5dYKww1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42776'),
  ('1063674154313331456', 'Sea Salts', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Dink Trout', 'NR', '''Mac'' Bootle Beetle tells, referring to the ship''s log, how he and captain Donald Duck were sole survivors of a shipwreck. The insect always suspected the duck wasn''t quite fair, actually he was constantly cheated out of his rations share and used as angling bait without realizing it, both on the wreckage raft and after they drifted onto a deserted island, but ultimately they were rescued and stayed together for life, although even at their ripe age Donald.', '''Mac'' Bootle Beetle tells, referring to the ship''s log, how he and captain Donald Duck were sole survivors of a shipwreck. The insect always suspected the duck wasn''t quite fair, actually he was constantly cheated out of his rations share and used as angling bait without realizing it, both on the wreckage raft and after they drifted onto a deserted island, but ultimately they were rescued and stayed together for life, although even at their ripe age Donald.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgCS5UKYVAvh6hfO9oJhXrDv5lm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67168'),
  ('154313323945170624', 'Sea Scouts', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is an admiral on a seagoing voyage with his nephews in which they encounter a ravenous shark.', 'Donald is an admiral on a seagoing voyage with his nephews in which they encounter a ravenous shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkXgFH9f8ZQ8Bc6Ak6lKp529pEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78485'),
  ('107544561936112074', 'Sea Urchins', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'A close-up look at sand urchins and rock urchins. At the seashore, a man digs up a sand urchin. We look closely. He sets it back in the sand, and it burrows out of sight. Its intestines take nutrients out of sand. Using magnification 200,000 times normal size, we see a rock urchin''s spines with suckers on the end; a drawing illustrates how they work. A sea urchin walks toward a rock. We see three-fingered jaws—pedicellaria at the end of flexible stems—take in algae and other bits. We also see cilia less than 0.001 ml in length; their motion constant, creating whirlpools. On the shore again, we watch the setting sun. Occasional titles in French tell us what to watch for.', 'A close-up look at sand urchins and rock urchins. At the seashore, a man digs up a sand urchin. We look closely. He sets it back in the sand, and it burrows out of sight. Its intestines take nutrients out of sand. Using magnification 200,000 times normal size, we see a rock urchin''s spines with suckers on the end; a drawing illustrates how they work. A sea urchin walks toward a rock. We see three-fingered jaws—pedicellaria at the end of flexible stems—take in algae and other bits. We also see cilia less than 0.001 ml in length; their motion constant, creating whirlpools. On the shore again, we watch the setting sun. Occasional titles in French tell us what to watch for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kboyOrf4yXZMxwvfclo57z6GwGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147211'),
  ('1143305300051330567', 'Sea Urchins', 1954, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'Underwater photography, magnified close-ups, and film through microscope present the sea urchin, a complex creature. We see their mouth and five teeth close and open. After injecting one with gelatin, the shell is removed and we see the muscle structure, digestive tube, and reproductive organs. Magnified stems reveal suction cups; stems lengthen and contract allowing the sea urchin to move. We see microscopic calcareous stems; at their ends are jaws with various uses. Cilia everywhere are in constant motion, stirring up water and debris. African music on the soundtrack suggests a shuffle dance.', 'Underwater photography, magnified close-ups, and film through microscope present the sea urchin, a complex creature. We see their mouth and five teeth close and open. After injecting one with gelatin, the shell is removed and we see the muscle structure, digestive tube, and reproductive organs. Magnified stems reveal suction cups; stems lengthen and contract allowing the sea urchin to move. We see microscopic calcareous stems; at their ends are jaws with various uses. Cilia everywhere are in constant motion, stirring up water and debris. African music on the soundtrack suggests a shuffle dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RRzvySbI4yhNgg5RnBhNtZS81j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117593'),
  ('29884773755796160', 'Sea Wife', 1957, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, War', 'Bob McNaught, Ted Sturgis', 'George K. Burke', 'Richard Burton, Joan Collins, Basil Sydney, Cy Grant, Ronald Squire, Harold Goodwin, Roddy Hughes, Gibb McLaughlin', null, 'In 1942, a cargo ship jammed with British evacuees from Singapore is sunk by a Japanese sub. A small lifeboat carries a beautiful woman, an army officer, a bigoted administrator, and a black seaman. Only the seaman knows the woman is a nun. The men reveal their true selves under the hardships of survival. Told in a too-long flashback frame.', 'In 1942, a cargo ship jammed with British evacuees from Singapore is sunk by a Japanese sub. A small lifeboat carries a beautiful woman, an army officer, a bigoted administrator, and a black seaman. Only the seaman knows the woman is a nun. The men reveal their true selves under the hardships of survival. Told in a too-long flashback frame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79h7qiIdZQLPXQEVriXaBRUnLlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79730'),
  ('22649377516351270', 'Sea Wolves', 1991, 'Action, Crime', 'Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Tony Leung Siu-Hung', 'Cynthia Khan, Simon Yam, Garry Chow Ging-Yeung, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Eddie Maher, Lau Wai-Man, Mak Wai-Cheung, Wong Yuk-Hang', null, 'Madam Yeung is assigned to investigate a serial murder in a Philippine cargo ship anchored in Hong Kong.', 'Madam Yeung is assigned to investigate a serial murder in a Philippine cargo ship anchored in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulw3lbth1mdOXS8XuTr4t27WsEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170812'),
  ('727671174556729675', 'Sea, No Sex & Sun', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Christophe Turpin', 'Christophe Turpin', 'Fred Testot, Antoine Duléry, Julie Ferrier, Arthur Mazet, Patrick Bouchitey, Anouk Grinberg, Alma Jodorowsky, Jérémy Denisty', null, 'A comedy that affectionately pokes fun at men and their eternal quest for satisfaction. At last, a film about self-acceptance and renunciation.', 'A comedy that affectionately pokes fun at men and their eternal quest for satisfaction. At last, a film about self-acceptance and renunciation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21EjhDSOHOiBSHwNDDo2u8NAZiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131198'),
  ('940522702358911222', 'Seabiscuit', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'John Schwartzman, Gary Ross, Dan Bradley', 'Gary Ross', 'Tobey Maguire, David McCullough, Jeff Bridges, Chris Cooper, Elizabeth Banks, Gary L. Stevens, Eddie Jones, William H. Macy', 'PG-13', 'True story of the undersized Depression-era racehorse whose victories lifted not only the spirits of the team behind it but also those of their nation.', 'True story of the undersized Depression-era racehorse whose victories lifted not only the spirits of the team behind it but also those of their nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m7NfZvxYsSm2YBCJ2VPQf8ziKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4464'),
  ('1134778733368191536', 'Seagulls Die in the Harbour', 1955, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rik Kuypers, Ivo Michiels, Roland Verhavert', 'Roland Verhavert, Rik Kuypers, Ivo Michiels', 'Julien Schoenaerts, Dora van der Groen, Tine Balder, Piet Frison, Tone Brulin, Gisèle Peeters, Alice De Graef, Jenny Deheyder', null, 'A pessimistic urban drama, with a musical score by Jack Sels and Max Damasse, charts in strongly expressionistically lit black-and-white images the wanderings of a tormented man through the cosmopolitan port city of Antwerp. The only people to show him understanding are an orphan and two disillusioned women.', 'A pessimistic urban drama, with a musical score by Jack Sels and Max Damasse, charts in strongly expressionistically lit black-and-white images the wanderings of a tormented man through the cosmopolitan port city of Antwerp. The only people to show him understanding are an orphan and two disillusioned women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIFlOChyVEOKP1AqQ5A0Ia0W5fA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64355'),
  ('965217429554709186', 'Seal Island', 1948, 'Documentary', 'James Algar', null, 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Seal Island is a 1948 American documentary film directed by James Algar. It won an Academy Award in 1949 for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).', 'Seal Island is a 1948 American documentary film directed by James Algar. It won an Academy Award in 1949 for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bCvFyQ14yyUwAdAKhUS9Hjr8Dp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107881'),
  ('307004035628107319', 'Seal Team', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Greig Cameron, Tim Argall, Kane Croudace', 'Greig Cameron', 'Jessie T. Usher, J.K. Simmons, Matthew Rhys, Kristen Schaal, Patrick Warburton, Sharlto Copley, Camille Mana, John Kani', null, 'After his best friend is killed in a shark attack, Quinn, a lovable yet tenacious seal assembles a SEAL TEAM to fight back against a gang of sharks overtaking the neighborhood. But this merry band of international seals are not at all trained for such a mission. They seek the help of a much more skillful combatant, Claggart, but even his tricks and flips can’t whip these guys into shape. However, with a little bit of ingenuity, intelligence and a lot of heart, our SEAL TEAM may actually be able to bring peace back to their undersea community.', 'After his best friend is killed in a shark attack, Quinn, a lovable yet tenacious seal assembles a SEAL TEAM to fight back against a gang of sharks overtaking the neighborhood. But this merry band of international seals are not at all trained for such a mission. They seek the help of a much more skillful combatant, Claggart, but even his tricks and flips can’t whip these guys into shape. However, with a little bit of ingenuity, intelligence and a lot of heart, our SEAL TEAM may actually be able to bring peace back to their undersea community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPZ3I27oeSm4zVesgMxXlhW8GDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823610'),
  ('290882065546420160', 'Seal Team Eight: Behind Enemy Lines', 2014, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Brendan Cowles, Shane Kuhn', 'Tom Sizemore, Langley Kirkwood, Bonnie Lee Bouman, Leroy Gopal, Lex Shrapnel, Tanya van Graan, Warrick Grier, Dylan Edy', 'R', 'Seal Team Eight must fight their way deep into Africa''s Congo, decommission a secret uranium mine, and stop our most dangerous enemy from smuggling weapon''s grade yellow-cake out of the country.', 'Seal Team Eight must fight their way deep into Africa''s Congo, decommission a secret uranium mine, and stop our most dangerous enemy from smuggling weapon''s grade yellow-cake out of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmI6cpKVpw9sDyDmcgXJcnyckww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260063'),
  ('333906011743479973', 'Seal Team Six: The Raid on Osama Bin Laden', 2012, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Susan E. Fiore, Raj Acharya, Prince Shah', 'Kendall Lampkin', 'Cam Gigandet, Kathleen Robertson, William Fichtner, Robert Knepper, Anson Mount, Freddy Rodríguez, Xzibit, Eddie Kaye Thomas', 'NR', 'When the rumored whereabouts of Osama bin Laden are revealed, the CIA readies a team of seasoned U.S. Navy SEALs for the mission of a lifetime. Despite inconclusive evidence that bin Laden is inside the compound, and ignoring the possible ramifications of an unannounced attack on Pakistani soil, the Pentagon orders the attack. The SEAL Team bands together to complete their mission of justice in a riveting final showdown.', 'When the rumored whereabouts of Osama bin Laden are revealed, the CIA readies a team of seasoned U.S. Navy SEALs for the mission of a lifetime. Despite inconclusive evidence that bin Laden is inside the compound, and ignoring the possible ramifications of an unannounced attack on Pakistani soil, the Pentagon orders the attack. The SEAL Team bands together to complete their mission of justice in a riveting final showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hau6iHAIWJmlnaaZ0QRYZu9T6B1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130267'),
  ('881210596947334429', 'Sealed Cargo', 1951, 'War, Drama', 'Alfred L. Werker, George E. Diskant', 'Dale Van Every, Oliver H.P. Garrett, Roy Huggins', 'Dana Andrews, Carla Balenda, Claude Rains, Philip Dorn, Onslow Stevens, Skip Homeier, Eric Feldary, J.M. Kerrigan', 'NR', 'A Newfoundland fishingboat comes to the aid of a wrecked Danish sailing ship and tows it to a small village, but eventually the captain of the fishingboat realises that it''s a U-boat supply ship in disguise, loaded with torpedoes. So, together with his crew and a group of villagers he sets about a plan to blow the ship as well as any U-boats that approach it. Based on the novel "The Gaunt Woman" by Edmund Gilligan.', 'A Newfoundland fishingboat comes to the aid of a wrecked Danish sailing ship and tows it to a small village, but eventually the captain of the fishingboat realises that it''s a U-boat supply ship in disguise, loaded with torpedoes. So, together with his crew and a group of villagers he sets about a plan to blow the ship as well as any U-boats that approach it. Based on the novel "The Gaunt Woman" by Edmund Gilligan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBmecd5wIph6Oe03cH3sDmyPjlb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174773'),
  ('1148602434077538691', 'Sealed Lips', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Bernd Böhlich, Thomas Plenert', 'Bernd Böhlich', 'Alexandra Maria Lara, Robert Stadlober, Stefan Kurt, Barbara Schnitzler, Carlotta von Falkenhayn, Karoline Eichhorn, Stefan Lochau, Jenny Langner', null, 'A German communist wrongly accused and sent to a labour camp has to keep her past life hidden for the sake of her and her family’s freedom.', 'A German communist wrongly accused and sent to a labour camp has to keep her past life hidden for the sake of her and her family’s freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLaH973Ox3ON8VNkmVr6PrWrzw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565191'),
  ('740925840463410889', 'Sealed with a List', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Lucie Guest, Ryan Petey', 'Emily Ting, Melynda Bissmeyer, Robin Gadsby', 'Katie Findlay, Evan Roderick, Kelcey Mawema, Martin Donovan, Daylin Willis, Madonna Gonzalez, Jai Braithwaite, Sofia Hodsoni', 'G', 'Carley is determined to get through her list of abandoned resolutions from last year and enlists the help of coworker Wyatt.', 'Carley is determined to get through her list of abandoned resolutions from last year and enlists the help of coworker Wyatt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTqVu19sejNUyboLSjHOS5H7Y4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180688'),
  ('525075425668623284', 'Seance', 2021, 'Horror', 'Karim Hussain, Simon Barrett, Rob Cotterill', 'Simon Barrett', 'Suki Waterhouse, Ella-Rae Smith, Madisen Beaty, Inanna Sarkis, Stephanie Sy, Djouliet Amara, Jade Michael, Seamus Patterson', 'R', 'At an elite boarding school for girls, six friends jokingly engage in a late night ritual, calling forth the spirit of a dead former student who reportedly haunts their halls. Before morning, one of the girls is dead, leaving the others wondering what they may have awakened.', 'At an elite boarding school for girls, six friends jokingly engage in a late night ritual, calling forth the spirit of a dead former student who reportedly haunts their halls. Before morning, one of the girls is dead, leaving the others wondering what they may have awakened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roYaaPorqPvazR0sh1aTl64Fjsu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641668'),
  ('603180534107760383', 'Séance', 2001, 'Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Gen Ito, Tatsuya Yoshimura', null, 'Koji Yakusho, Jun Fubuki, Kitaro, Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Hikari Ishida, Ittoku Kishibe, Ren Osugi, Show Aikawa', null, 'A psychic housewife and her husband accidentally find a kidnapped girl. Instead of informing the police, they hatch a scheme to get famous by working with the police as a psychic consultant to ''find'' the girl. Just when it all seems to go right, everything goes horribly wrong.', 'A psychic housewife and her husband accidentally find a kidnapped girl. Instead of informing the police, they hatch a scheme to get famous by working with the police as a psychic consultant to ''find'' the girl. Just when it all seems to go right, everything goes horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97JOZbruPejp4e37Lu8wzOxnlgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27742'),
  ('88842079161753623', 'Séance', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mark L. Smith, Eric Clarke', 'Mark L. Smith', 'Adrian Paul, Kandis Fay, Bridget Shergalis, Tori White, Chauntal Lewis, Jack Hunter, Joel Geist, A.J. Lamas', null, 'Over Thanksgiving weekend, all but five students in an old Manhattan building that''s now a college dormitory leave for home: staying on one floor are roommates Lauren, Melina, and Alison, plus her boyfriend Diego and Grant, a loner in a room down the hall. Lauren''s been seeing things in her bathroom: a silent child of about six. Diego has written a paper on parapsychology, so he holds a séance with the disbelieving co-eds. Something goes awry, because bad things start to happen and the students'' only defender is an aging campus cop named Syd. What''s the silent ghostly girl''s secret, and can Alison discover what''s going on before it''s too late?', 'Over Thanksgiving weekend, all but five students in an old Manhattan building that''s now a college dormitory leave for home: staying on one floor are roommates Lauren, Melina, and Alison, plus her boyfriend Diego and Grant, a loner in a room down the hall. Lauren''s been seeing things in her bathroom: a silent child of about six. Diego has written a paper on parapsychology, so he holds a séance with the disbelieving co-eds. Something goes awry, because bad things start to happen and the students'' only defender is an aging campus cop named Syd. What''s the silent ghostly girl''s secret, and can Alison discover what''s going on before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5BB5KRV10Lio9TmLCIB1aZHDBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45853'),
  ('580223797474923301', 'Seance on a Wet Afternoon', 1964, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Gerry Turpin, Bryan Forbes, Christopher Dryhurst', 'Bryan Forbes', 'Kim Stanley, Richard Attenborough, Margaret Lacey, Marie Burke, Maria Kazan, Lionel Gamlin, Marian Spencer, Godfrey James', null, 'Working-class British housewife Myra Savage reinvents herself as a medium, holding seances in the sitting room of her home with the hidden assistance of her under-employed, asthmatic husband, Billy. In an attempt to enhance her credibility as a psychic, Myra hatches an elaborate, ill-conceived plot to kidnap a wealthy couple''s young daughter so that she can then help the police "find" the missing girl.', 'Working-class British housewife Myra Savage reinvents herself as a medium, holding seances in the sitting room of her home with the hidden assistance of her under-employed, asthmatic husband, Billy. In an attempt to enhance her credibility as a psychic, Myra hatches an elaborate, ill-conceived plot to kidnap a wealthy couple''s young daughter so that she can then help the police "find" the missing girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHu7nuNwXTXoPdpNOEPKhHfCBk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3092'),
  ('1105706756422976820', 'Search and Destroy', 1995, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'David Salle, Bobby Bukowski, Michael Spiller', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Griffin Dunne, Rosanna Arquette, Illeana Douglas, Ethan Hawke, Dennis Hopper, John Turturro, Christopher Walken, Robert Knepper', 'R', 'A self-help guru''s televised teachings inspire a down-and-out businessman to pursue his dream of making a movie.', 'A self-help guru''s televised teachings inspire a down-and-out businessman to pursue his dream of making a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE6Bu947OQR0fFjbZmWQ7iupMzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54022'),
  ('495280108970821862', 'Search and Destroy', 2020, 'Drama, Action', 'Danny Lerner', 'Benjamin Jackendoff, Craig Walser, Daniel Bruckner', 'Dylan Bruce, Julian Kostov, Tim Fellingham, Leslie Grantham, Atanas Srebrev, Bashar Rahal, Velislav Pavlov, Julian Vergov', null, 'When American Ranger John Cutter fails to save a family being held hostage and loses his entire team in a confrontation with infamous Ukrainian arms dealer Igor Rodin, he is discharged from the army.', 'When American Ranger John Cutter fails to save a family being held hostage and loses his entire team in a confrontation with infamous Ukrainian arms dealer Igor Rodin, he is discharged from the army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSFvFBZ1BAhmil0bjmLOliLyjek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715535'),
  ('349332484281276950', 'Search for Beauty', 1934, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Erle C. Kenton, Harry Fischbeck', 'Claude Binyon, Frank Butler', 'Buster Crabbe, Ida Lupino, Robert Armstrong, James Gleason, Toby Wing, Gertrude Michael, Bradley Page, Frank McGlynn Sr.', 'NR', 'Three con artists dupe two Olympians into serving as editors of a new health and beauty magazine which is only a front for salacious stories and pictures.', 'Three con artists dupe two Olympians into serving as editors of a new health and beauty magazine which is only a front for salacious stories and pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVJAZQnz6QQ4Sx3Wnlq0Nq4hxEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82179'),
  ('414019377426166164', 'Search Party', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Scot Armstrong, Tim Orr', 'Mike Gagerman, Andrew Waller, Scot Armstrong', 'Adam Pally, T.J. Miller, Thomas Middleditch, Shannon Woodward, Alison Brie, JB Smoove, Octavio Gómez Berríos, Maurice Compte', 'R', 'Two oafs must rescue their stranded pal in Mexico.', 'Two oafs must rescue their stranded pal in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnhMdtcbZnzcA9cMuZttwosaXji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239568'),
  ('1115288385327034787', 'Searching', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Aneesh Chaganty, Juan Sebastian Baron, Lindsey Weissmueller', 'Aneesh Chaganty, Sev Ohanian', 'John Cho, Michelle La, Debra Messing, Joseph Lee, Sara Sohn, Briana McLean, Erica Jenkins, Connor McRaith', 'PG-13', 'After David Kim''s 16-year-old daughter goes missing, a local investigation is opened and a detective is assigned to the case. But 37 hours later and without a single lead, David decides to search the one place no one has looked yet, where all secrets are kept today: his daughter''s laptop.', 'After David Kim''s 16-year-old daughter goes missing, a local investigation is opened and a detective is assigned to the case. But 37 hours later and without a single lead, David decides to search the one place no one has looked yet, where all secrets are kept today: his daughter''s laptop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuAPCsCGJGSxA7YOW4elF5JNrzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489999'),
  ('53972870180063460', 'Searching for a Scandal', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Niazi Mostafa', 'Farouk Sabry', 'Adel Emam, Mervat Amin, Samir Sabri, Youssef Wahby, Mohamed Reda, Mimi Chakib, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Ahmed Ramzy', null, 'As Magdy leaves Upper Egypt for a job, he befriends the playboy Sami who impresses him with his many relationships. After a chance meeting with Hanan, Magdy asks for Sami''s help to get close to her, something that Sami is happy to provide and support with previous experiences.', 'As Magdy leaves Upper Egypt for a job, he befriends the playboy Sami who impresses him with his many relationships. After a chance meeting with Hanan, Magdy asks for Sami''s help to get close to her, something that Sami is happy to provide and support with previous experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOOuGXSIoVCk2PerMIa3ATko3BE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513968'),
  ('464547726927307782', 'Searching for Bobby Fischer', 1993, 'Drama', 'Steven Zaillian, Conrad Hall, Tony Gittelson', 'Steven Zaillian', 'Max Pomeranc, Joe Mantegna, Joan Allen, Ben Kingsley, Laurence Fishburne, Michael Nirenberg, Robert Stephens, David Paymer', 'PG', 'A seven-year-old chess prodigy refuses to harden himself in order to become a champion like the famous but unlikable Bobby Fischer.', 'A seven-year-old chess prodigy refuses to harden himself in order to become a champion like the famous but unlikable Bobby Fischer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAJpHkMpfXiFY9F3HocIz9fhHLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14291'),
  ('705886725272925851', 'Searching for Ingmar Bergman', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Bettina Böhler, Felix Moeller', 'Felix Moeller, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Olivier Assayas, Daniel Bergman, Ingmar Bergman Jr., Stig Björkman, Jean-Claude Carrière, Gaby Dohm, Julia Dufvenius', null, 'A meaningful account of the personal and professional life of the great Swedish filmmaker Ingmar Bergman (1918-2007) that explores his film legacy, with interviews with his closest collaborators and a new generation of filmmakers.', 'A meaningful account of the personal and professional life of the great Swedish filmmaker Ingmar Bergman (1918-2007) that explores his film legacy, with interviews with his closest collaborators and a new generation of filmmakers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2khvUbOVJ4TPFZ8fcXllFF9zGPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522866'),
  ('486402933352689089', 'Searching for Planet 9', 2022, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Florence Tran, Mathilde Renard', 'Cécile Dumas, Florence Tran', 'Chadwick Trujillo, Michael E. Brown, Konstantin Batygin, Scott S. Sheppard, Kat Volk, Renu Malhotra, Guillaume Colin, Kevin Napier', null, 'At the edge of our solar system supposedly lies an immense planet. Five to ten times the size of the Earth. Several international teams of scientists have been competing in a frantic race to detect it, in uncharted territories, far beyond Neptune. The recent discovery of several dwarf planets, with intriguing trajectories, have put astronomers on the trail of this mysterious planet. Why is this enigmatic planet so difficult to detect? What would a ninth planet teach us about our corner of the universe? Could it help us unlock some of the mysteries of our solar system?', 'At the edge of our solar system supposedly lies an immense planet. Five to ten times the size of the Earth. Several international teams of scientists have been competing in a frantic race to detect it, in uncharted territories, far beyond Neptune. The recent discovery of several dwarf planets, with intriguing trajectories, have put astronomers on the trail of this mysterious planet. Why is this enigmatic planet so difficult to detect? What would a ninth planet teach us about our corner of the universe? Could it help us unlock some of the mysteries of our solar system?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbgZusFDy7W8TygXRkBINf4uLSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061618'),
  ('625383914773465503', 'Searching for Sheela', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Shakun Batra', null, 'Ma Anand Sheela, Karan Johar, Raghu Rai', 'NR', 'Journalists and fans await Ma Anand Sheela as the infamous former Rajneesh commune''s spokesperson returns to India after decades for an interview tour.', 'Journalists and fans await Ma Anand Sheela as the infamous former Rajneesh commune''s spokesperson returns to India after decades for an interview tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uUmXmS1BNXieflgr884NnjYRFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816836'),
