  ('487137794662730493', 'Searching for Tadzio', 1970, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Luchino Visconti', 'Oreste Del Buono', 'Björn Andrésen, Sergio Garfagnoli, Luchino Visconti', null, 'An account of Italian film director Luchino Visconti''s travels in search for a young actor to portray the role of Tadzio in his 1971 adaptation of Thomas Mann''s novella Death in Venice (1912).', 'An account of Italian film director Luchino Visconti''s travels in search for a young actor to portray the role of Tadzio in his 1971 adaptation of Thomas Mann''s novella Death in Venice (1912).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LOjmwrH3BWi0559AUnKcTx6L10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335202'),
  ('757266495916721293', 'Seashore', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcio Reolon, Filipe Matzembacher, Ana Girardello', 'Filipe Matzembacher, Marcio Reolon', 'Mateus Almada, Maurício Barcellos, Elisa Brites, Fernando Hart, Ariel Artur, Francisco Gick, Luisa Moser, Irene Brietzke', null, 'A lonely beach on the southernmost coast of Brazil is the scene for two friends, on the brink of adulthood, to explore their understanding of themselves and one another. Martin has been sent by his father to retrieve what appears to be an inheritance-related document from the family of his recently deceased and estranged grandfather. Tomaz accompanies him, seemingly hoping to regain some of their former closeness. The two boys shelter themselves in a glass house, in front of a cold and stormy sea.', 'A lonely beach on the southernmost coast of Brazil is the scene for two friends, on the brink of adulthood, to explore their understanding of themselves and one another. Martin has been sent by his father to retrieve what appears to be an inheritance-related document from the family of his recently deceased and estranged grandfather. Tomaz accompanies him, seemingly hoping to regain some of their former closeness. The two boys shelter themselves in a glass house, in front of a cold and stormy sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RGHChP3CB033cIMOZYp2Dx3pQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322740'),
  ('383541403679760387', 'Seasin''s Greetinks!', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Lou Fleischer', 'Max Fleischer', 'William ''Billy'' Costello, William Pennell, Bonnie Poe', null, 'Popeye skates over to Olive''s house to give her a Christmas present: ice skates of her own. While he''s teaching her, Bluto skates up and gets fresh; of course, Popeye fights him. When Olive rejects Bluto again, he sends her careening on an ice floe towards a waterfall.', 'Popeye skates over to Olive''s house to give her a Christmas present: ice skates of her own. While he''s teaching her, Bluto skates up and gets fresh; of course, Popeye fights him. When Olive rejects Bluto again, he sends her careening on an ice floe towards a waterfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a591gfIKh3WceUM3xPQFh11Uux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161843'),
  ('1054930104582872798', 'Season of Good Rain', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hur Jin-ho, Kim Byung-seo', 'Hur Jin-ho, Han-yeol Lee', 'Jung Woo-sung, Gao Yuanyuan, Kim Sang-ho, Ma Shaohua', null, 'A traveling architect meets an old friend from his student years; the pair realize their connection has always been a romantic one.', 'A traveling architect meets an old friend from his student years; the pair realize their connection has always been a romantic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSEHmvdjZ7pO8OOpkzAfA0lSnIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61269'),
  ('670241041765829659', 'Season of Love', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Christin Baker, Nathalie Taylor, David Y. Chung', 'Kathryn Trammell', 'Dominique Provost-Chalkley, Janelle Marie, Jessica Clark, Emily Goss, Laur Allen, Sandra Mae Frank, Matthew Bridges, Elana Krausz', null, 'A queer lady holiday movie that follows the lives of three very different couples in dealing with their love lives in various loosely interrelated tales all set right before Christmas through New Years.', 'A queer lady holiday movie that follows the lives of three very different couples in dealing with their love lives in various loosely interrelated tales all set right before Christmas through New Years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usx2sUMfr8XXI8QoQuzaxZzasvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606243'),
  ('963923336988257095', 'Season of Monsters', 1987, 'Drama', 'Miklós Jancsó, János Kende', 'Gyula Hernádi', 'György Cserhalmi, József Madaras, Ferenc Kállai, Székely B. Miklós, András Bálint, Béla Tarr, Júlia Nyakó, Katarzyna Figura', null, 'Zoltai is a Hungarian professor who returns home after a visit to the United States. Following a television interview, he commits suicide and leaves a note for his longtime friend Dr. Bardocz. The doctor and Zoltai''s colleague Komindi join the police in investigating what drove the man to suicide.', 'Zoltai is a Hungarian professor who returns home after a visit to the United States. Following a television interview, he commits suicide and leaves a note for his longtime friend Dr. Bardocz. The doctor and Zoltai''s colleague Komindi join the police in investigating what drove the man to suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g7BMA1EFxSCl0aIrgAQEm8VD6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204113'),
  ('140278709381193169', 'Season of Terror', 1969, 'Drama', 'Kōji Wakamatsu, Hideo Itō, Kazuo Komizu', 'Kazuo Komizu', 'Yuko Ejima, Tomomi Sahara, Hitomi Suma, Hiromasa Haruta, Hiroshi Imaizumi, Kibaji Tankobo, Ken Yoshizawa', null, 'From an apartment belonging to a single woman, two detectives spy on sex-obsessed radical.', 'From an apartment belonging to a single woman, two detectives spy on sex-obsessed radical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1vqCszpPoSnFc2u7BKxs6vEBLy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105634'),
  ('765185566501204804', 'Season of the Witch', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Dominic Sena, Amir Mokri, Kai Koch', 'Bragi F. Schut', 'Nicolas Cage, Ron Perlman, Ulrich Thomsen, Christopher Lee, Fernanda Dorogi, Stephen Graham, Rebekah Kennedy, Matt Devere', 'PG-13', 'A 14th century Crusader returns with his comrade to a homeland devastated by the Black Plague. The Church commands the two knights to transport a witch to a remote abbey, where monks will perform a ritual in hopes of ending the pestilence.', 'A 14th century Crusader returns with his comrade to a homeland devastated by the Black Plague. The Church commands the two knights to transport a witch to a remote abbey, where monks will perform a ritual in hopes of ending the pestilence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNVqi8EsBtnnwfR6TgiWM51JOuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23047'),
  ('474373043649580743', 'Season''s Beatings', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Danièle Thompson, Robert Fraisse', 'Christopher Thompson, Danièle Thompson', 'Sabine Azéma, Emmanuelle Béart, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Claude Rich, Françoise Fabian, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Isabelle Carré, Samuel Labarthe', null, 'Christmas, family, and infidelity. Yvette''s husband has died, and her grown daughters join her at the grave: Sonia, wealthy, bourgeois, and generous; Louba, living with their dad Stanislas, singing at a Russian restaurant, penniless, the mistress for the past 12 years of a man who will never leave his wife; Milla, the youngest, acerbic, lonesome. Christmas was when they learned their parents were divorcing 25 years ago. Over the next few days, yuletide depression, Louba''s pregnancy, Sonia''s crumbling marriage, Stanislas''s overtures to Yvette, and Milla''s attraction to the man who''s her father''s rent-free lodger lead each one to re-examine self, family, and hopes. Is renewal possible?', 'Christmas, family, and infidelity. Yvette''s husband has died, and her grown daughters join her at the grave: Sonia, wealthy, bourgeois, and generous; Louba, living with their dad Stanislas, singing at a Russian restaurant, penniless, the mistress for the past 12 years of a man who will never leave his wife; Milla, the youngest, acerbic, lonesome. Christmas was when they learned their parents were divorcing 25 years ago. Over the next few days, yuletide depression, Louba''s pregnancy, Sonia''s crumbling marriage, Stanislas''s overtures to Yvette, and Milla''s attraction to the man who''s her father''s rent-free lodger lead each one to re-examine self, family, and hopes. Is renewal possible?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvw98onaQNC31voFO3s7oPFYuu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48216'),
  ('752885419853738173', 'Season''s Greetings', 1996, 'Horror, Animation', 'Michael Dougherty', 'Michael Dougherty', null, null, 'This animated twist on Halloween memories involves the traumatic theft of a candy bag on Halloween night.', 'This animated twist on Halloween memories involves the traumatic theft of a candy bag on Halloween night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hX5vRYlWZDUnMkZcwQbdvy7JNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140149'),
