  ('1097752868942774919', 'Seasons', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Easy Ferrer, Steven Evangelio, Ice Idanan', 'Dwein Ruedas Baltazar, Lovi Poe', 'Lovi Poe, Carlo Aquino, Sarah Edwards, Jolo Estrada, Casie Banks, Ivan Carapiet, Sheenly Gener, Christian Ty', 'R', 'After a string of failed relationships, two best friends make a deal to take risks and look for love again — but they might just find it in each other.', 'After a string of failed relationships, two best friends make a deal to take risks and look for love again — but they might just find it in each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz0jM9Uw15ElDXQSpfNQupZuLPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849177'),
  ('384594913724956270', 'Seasons Change', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Prapop Duangpikul, Sangrawee Jongsinkul', 'Thanatcha Saksiamkul', 'Witawat Singlampong, Chutima Teepanat, Yuwanat Arayanimisakul, Ratchu Surajaras, Chalermpol Tuntawisut, Kazuki Yano, Panissara Arayaskul, Jumpol Thongtan', null, 'The story takes place at the College of Music, Mahidol University over one year and covers the three seasons that Bangkok typically experiences - summer, winter and monsoon.', 'The story takes place at the College of Music, Mahidol University over one year and covers the three seasons that Bangkok typically experiences - summer, winter and monsoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sahPyJtukyin1Ex4Uo61jQVW5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44627'),
  ('322443977404931019', 'Seasons of Our Love', 1966, 'Drama', 'Florestano Vancini, Mimmola Girosi, Camillo Fusaro', 'Elio Bartolini, Florestano Vancini', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Anouk Aimée, Jacqueline Sassard, Gastone Moschin, Valeria Valeri, Gian Maria Volonté, Checco Rissone, Pietro Tordi', null, 'Vittorio is a 40-year-old journalist who reaches a mid-life crisis. His wife nags him constantly for ignoring her and their child. After his mistress dumps him, Vittorio returns to the town where he spent his childhood to reflect on the state of his life. Flashbacks are used to tell of Vittorio’s relationship with his parents as a child and the effects World War II had on his development.', 'Vittorio is a 40-year-old journalist who reaches a mid-life crisis. His wife nags him constantly for ignoring her and their child. After his mistress dumps him, Vittorio returns to the town where he spent his childhood to reflect on the state of his life. Flashbacks are used to tell of Vittorio’s relationship with his parents as a child and the effects World War II had on his development.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHnRBWF82i0Kl0YZW3SmLv2EVps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105055'),
  ('942437319344886614', 'Seaspiracy', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Ali Tabrizi, Lucy Tabrizi, Ali Tabrizi', null, 'Ali Tabrizi, Sylvia Earle, Richard O''Barry, Paul de Gelder, Lucy Tabrizi, Jonathan Balcombe, George Monbiot, Michael Klaper', 'NR', 'Passionate about ocean life, a filmmaker sets out to document the harm that humans do to marine species — and uncovers an alarming global conspiracy.', 'Passionate about ocean life, a filmmaker sets out to document the harm that humans do to marine species — and uncovers an alarming global conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFNri0fwn1WfCoxf3H3v1z8dCm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801058'),
  ('483230458832563928', 'Seat Edge', 2026, null, 'Chethan Shetty', null, 'Puneeth Babu, Mimicry Gopi, Siddu Moolimani, Kiran Nayak, Theju Ponnappa', null, 'A social media star livestreams paranormal investigations until real supernatural forces turn his comedic ghost hunting channel into a fight for survival.', 'A social media star livestreams paranormal investigations until real supernatural forces turn his comedic ghost hunting channel into a fight for survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYjlmZDc3MTUtNmI2ZC00ODdjLWI4MmMtNDkxNzY2OGZhMTNjXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:seat-edge'),
  ('721099259313161865', 'Seawards Journey', 2003, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Guillermo Casanova, Bárbara Álvarez', 'Guillermo Casanova, Julio César Castro, J.J. Morosoli', 'César Troncoso, Hugo Arana, Diego Delgrossi, Julio César Castro, Julio Calcagno, Héctor Guido', null, 'The tale of five Uruguayan villagers who embark on a journey to see the ocean for the first time. They depart in a broken down freight truck, property of Rodríguez, a taciturn man who loves the sea. Their point of departure is a local bar, and at the last minute, an unknown man from the bar joins their adventure.', 'The tale of five Uruguayan villagers who embark on a journey to see the ocean for the first time. They depart in a broken down freight truck, property of Rodríguez, a taciturn man who loves the sea. Their point of departure is a local bar, and at the last minute, an unknown man from the bar joins their adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxS0onV8KQnx73Y0ZG0B7U7EniV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241390'),
  ('710081724067542153', 'Seb''s Papuan Adventure', 2019, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Francis Leduc', 'Grégoire Aussavy, Sébastien Frit', 'Sébastien Frit', null, 'A first-person documentary on an expedition to one of the last regions of the world still unexplored by man.', 'A first-person documentary on an expedition to one of the last regions of the world still unexplored by man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM9cdfQdcMM0uKeRNtGtywpSz1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658470'),
  ('982726836856699648', 'Sebastian', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'David Greene, Gordon Gilbert, Gerry Fisher', 'Gerald Vaughan-Hughes', 'Dirk Bogarde, Susannah York, Lilli Palmer, John Gielgud, Janet Munro, Ronald Fraser, Margaret Johnston, Nigel Davenport', 'NR', 'Sebastian is an undisciplined mathematics genius who works in the "cipher bureau" of the British Intelligence. While cracking enemy codes, Sebastian finds time to romance co-worker Rebecca Howard.', 'Sebastian is an undisciplined mathematics genius who works in the "cipher bureau" of the British Intelligence. While cracking enemy codes, Sebastian finds time to romance co-worker Rebecca Howard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpLwwnwhxAcclWRfyLTvePqaQQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12796'),
  ('5383209445715468', 'Sebastian', 1995, 'Drama', 'Svend Wam, Per Källberg, Anette Mandoki', 'Hansi Mandoki, Petter Vennerød, Svend Wam', 'Hampus Björck, Nicolai Cleve Broch, Ewa Fröling, Helge Jordal, Rebecka Hemse, Lena Olander, Emil Lindroth, Johanna Sällström', 'NR', 'In this thoughtful Scandinavian drama, a teenage boy wrestles with his sexuality and learns that most of his deepest fears were unfounded. Sebastian is almost 17 when he figures out that he is a homosexual. Though he lives with wonderful, stable parents and has a good-hearted sister, he finds himself wracked with turmoil and suddenly withdraws from them all. The more they try to understand why, the more distant Sebastian becomes. Things get worse when he falls in love with the handsome Ulf, who comes from an unstable, tempestuous home. Sebastian realizes he is lucky, but still can''t help but become irritated when he brings Ulf home for dinner. His parents are too nice and this quietly infuriates their son. Eventually they leave the two boys alone in the house. Sebastian have great fun doing teenage guy stuff, but then they take a bath together and it is then that Sebastian tries to kiss Ulf.', 'In this thoughtful Scandinavian drama, a teenage boy wrestles with his sexuality and learns that most of his deepest fears were unfounded. Sebastian is almost 17 when he figures out that he is a homosexual. Though he lives with wonderful, stable parents and has a good-hearted sister, he finds himself wracked with turmoil and suddenly withdraws from them all. The more they try to understand why, the more distant Sebastian becomes. Things get worse when he falls in love with the handsome Ulf, who comes from an unstable, tempestuous home. Sebastian realizes he is lucky, but still can''t help but become irritated when he brings Ulf home for dinner. His parents are too nice and this quietly infuriates their son. Eventually they leave the two boys alone in the house. Sebastian have great fun doing teenage guy stuff, but then they take a bath together and it is then that Sebastian tries to kiss Ulf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAIqIMiAjLmiT0nd3BRcQ5l4mMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213273'),
  ('1118721161760473971', 'Sebastian', 2024, 'Drama', 'Iikka Salminen, Mikko Mäkelä', 'Mikko Mäkelä', 'Ruaridh Mollica, Hiftu Quasem, Jonathan Hyde, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Dylan Brady, Pedro Minas, Matthias Moret, Akbar Kurtha', null, 'Max is a 25-year-old freelance writer and aspiring novelist who seems well on his way to success in London’s cultural spheres. Yet by night, he finds a different kind of exhilaration as a sex worker with the pseudonym Sebastian, meeting men via an escorting platform. Max uses his experiences as Sebastian to fuel his stories and the worthy debut novel that he has been longing to write, finally seems within reach.', 'Max is a 25-year-old freelance writer and aspiring novelist who seems well on his way to success in London’s cultural spheres. Yet by night, he finds a different kind of exhilaration as a sex worker with the pseudonym Sebastian, meeting men via an escorting platform. Max uses his experiences as Sebastian to fuel his stories and the worthy debut novel that he has been longing to write, finally seems within reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22JTGme2MLETmvhHQdiKP78S5Qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067485'),
  ('14309831421228425', 'Sebastian''s Voodoo', 2008, 'Animation, Horror', 'Joaquin Baldwin', null, null, null, 'A voodoo doll must find the courage to save his friends from being pinned to death.', 'A voodoo doll must find the courage to save his friends from being pinned to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aCbyxzSZOdsAomjcLzVLTXvrVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52803'),
  ('106454479782960555', 'Sebastiane', 1976, 'Drama, History', 'Derek Jarman, Paul Humfress, Peter Middleton', 'Paul Humfress, Derek Jarman, James Whaley', 'Leonardo Treviglio, Barney James, Neil Kennedy, Richard Warwick, Donald Dunham, Ken Hicks, Janusz Romanov, Steffano Massari', null, 'Rome, AD 303. Emperor Diocletian demotes his favourite, Sebastian, from captain of the palace guard to the rank of common soldier and banishes him to a remote coastal outpost where his fellow soldiers, weakened by their desires, turn to homosexual activities to satisfy their needs. Sebastian becomes the target of lust for the officer Severus, but repeatedly rejects the man''s advances. Castigated for his Christian faith, he is tortured, humiliated and ultimately killed.', 'Rome, AD 303. Emperor Diocletian demotes his favourite, Sebastian, from captain of the palace guard to the rank of common soldier and banishes him to a remote coastal outpost where his fellow soldiers, weakened by their desires, turn to homosexual activities to satisfy their needs. Sebastian becomes the target of lust for the officer Severus, but repeatedly rejects the man''s advances. Castigated for his Christian faith, he is tortured, humiliated and ultimately killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBek1olo2OUVmK3j0NMYRvKprpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42241'),
  ('934144696362037521', 'Sebelum Dijemput Nenek', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Fajar Martha Santosa, Ujel Bausad', 'Fajar Martha Santosa, Sandi Paputungan', 'Angga Yunanda, Dodit Mulyanto, Nopek, Oki Rengga, Wavi Zihan', null, 'Hestu and Akbar suddenly changed after their grandmother passed away. Instead of finding peace, they were often visited by their grandmother''s spirit with mysterious messages, including requests to be accompanied to the afterlife.', 'Hestu and Akbar suddenly changed after their grandmother passed away. Instead of finding peace, they were often visited by their grandmother''s spirit with mysterious messages, including requests to be accompanied to the afterlife.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fgut2EAv6h868bpAeqVyOSD8B4Qi.jpg', 'plex:movie:sebelum-dijemput-nenek'),
  ('536085423577593091', 'Seberg', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Benedict Andrews, Rachel Morrison, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Anna Waterhouse, Joe Shrapnel', 'Kristen Stewart, Jack O''Connell, Anthony Mackie, Margaret Qualley, Zazie Beetz, Yvan Attal, Stephen Root, Colm Meaney', null, 'An ambitious young FBI agent is assigned to investigate iconic actress Jean Seberg when she becomes embroiled in the tumultuous civil rights movement in late 1960s Los Angeles.', 'An ambitious young FBI agent is assigned to investigate iconic actress Jean Seberg when she becomes embroiled in the tumultuous civil rights movement in late 1960s Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv78WJ2YvWyk3c32sbOGFh64xcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510298'),
