  ('1064795460979425190', 'Sechzehneichen', 2012, null, 'Hendrik Handloegten', 'Hendrik Handloegten, Achim von Borries', 'Heike Makatsch, Mark Waschke, Sandra Borgmann, Marc Hosemann, Alexander Beyer, Anatole Taubman, Stefanie Stappenbeck, Jonas Nay', null, 'A young couple moves to a gated community (named Sechzehneichen), where soon the creative wife (a photographer) gets bored and the husband joins a secret mens'' club. All the other wives seem strangely conservative and shallow. Basically a thinly veiled take on the Stepford Wives, just without any bit of humor or atmosphere, but instead filled with the sterile, unflinching and dry seriousness that makes watching a lot of our German films such a drag and a miserable experience.', 'A young couple moves to a gated community (named Sechzehneichen), where soon the creative wife (a photographer) gets bored and the husband joins a secret mens'' club. All the other wives seem strangely conservative and shallow. Basically a thinly veiled take on the Stepford Wives, just without any bit of humor or atmosphere, but instead filled with the sterile, unflinching and dry seriousness that makes watching a lot of our German films such a drag and a miserable experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXzN3Ttr1boFR0dCyypgLqygFLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146448'),
  ('1025142933390718004', 'Secluded, Near Woods', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Roman Pavlíček', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Ladislav Smoljak', 'Josef Kemr, Zdeněk Svěrák, Daniela Kolářová, Marie Hradilková, Martin Hradilek, Ladislav Smoljak, Naďa Urbánková, Jan Tříska', null, 'The Lavicka''s, a Czech family from the city, rents a house in the country with the option to buy. However, old Mr Komarek seems reluctant to sell the house as they agreed.', 'The Lavicka''s, a Czech family from the city, rents a house in the country with the option to buy. However, old Mr Komarek seems reluctant to sell the house as they agreed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6KQtJB3pKV7GuEp1VrOOx2Ezc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75026'),
  ('685608381970112695', 'Second Act', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ginger Gonzalez, Abi O''Reilly, Victoria Ruskin', 'Elaine Goldsmith-Thomas, Justin Zackham', 'Jennifer Lopez, Vanessa Hudgens, Leah Remini, Milo Ventimiglia, Treat Williams, Lo Mutuc, Annaleigh Ashford, Alan Aisenberg', 'PG-13', 'Value Shop assistant manager Maya Vargas wants only one thing for her 43rd birthday -- a promotion. While her résumé may not scream upper management, her track record certainly does; she is an innovator who listens to her customers and delivers results. When she loses the job to a college-educated candidate, Maya sets out to prove to Madison Avenue that street smarts are as valuable as book smarts -- and it''s never too late for a second act.', 'Value Shop assistant manager Maya Vargas wants only one thing for her 43rd birthday -- a promotion. While her résumé may not scream upper management, her track record certainly does; she is an innovator who listens to her customers and delivers results. When she loses the job to a college-educated candidate, Maya sets out to prove to Madison Avenue that street smarts are as valuable as book smarts -- and it''s never too late for a second act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qf5rkbrzkE13peHxB6ENH9nGMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503616'),
  ('652662530043902872', 'Second Best', 1994, 'Drama, Family', 'Chris Menges, Ashley Rowe', 'David Cook', 'William Hurt, Nathan Yapp, Jane Horrocks, Prunella Scales, Keith Allen, Alan Cumming, John Hurt, Nerys Hughes', null, 'The difficult relationship between a british postal officer and his adoptive son.', 'The difficult relationship between a british postal officer and his adoptive son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKnqvAIYLUXm1Lnih0Oc024HbYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103413'),
  ('508884999992518724', 'Second Case of Seetharam', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Devi Prasad Shetty', 'Devi Prasad Shetty', 'Vijay Raghavendra, Gopalkrishna Deshpande, Usha Bhandary', null, 'A determined inspector hunts a psychotic murderer terrorizing Anegadde, all while attempting to reconnect with his long-lost sister.', 'A determined inspector hunts a psychotic murderer terrorizing Anegadde, all while attempting to reconnect with his long-lost sister.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F89Tuu93NTJVef2Y4iATRwlyAO37.jpg', 'plex:movie:second-case-of-seetharam'),
  ('546917368191169802', 'Second Chance', 1953, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Rudolph Maté, William E. Snyder', 'Sydney Boehm, Robert Presnell Sr., Oscar Millard', 'Robert Mitchum, Linda Darnell, Jack Palance, Roy Roberts, Dan Seymour, Fortunio Bonanova, Sandro Giglio, Reginald Sheffield', null, 'A prize-fighting boxer with a lethal right punch falls for a gangster''s moll on the run in Mexico.', 'A prize-fighting boxer with a lethal right punch falls for a gangster''s moll on the run in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvq2UYh4CSUz6VJ7WMAxEqnOSHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20621'),
  ('612118031289987168', 'Second Chance', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nicolas Cuche', 'Luc Bossi, Laurent Turner', 'Virginie Efira, François-Xavier Demaison, Raphaël Personnaz, Thomas Ngijol, Brigitte Roüan, Yves Jacques, Marie-Christine Adam, Élie Semoun', null, 'Julien Monnier has a serious problem. Though he''s a brilliant couples counselor, he can''t keep a woman in his life for more than two weeks. Indeed, ever since his childhood, Julien jinxes every woman who falls in love with him. But it''s not just any small jinx. It''s the kind that sends you to the hospital several times a week, that destroys your professional life or that turns your friends into enemies. Julien is strictly speaking a true black cat for women. Joanna Sorini will soon learn this at her expense the day she meets him. A career that''s just taking off, a love life that finally seems to be taking a good turn, all that may just change.', 'Julien Monnier has a serious problem. Though he''s a brilliant couples counselor, he can''t keep a woman in his life for more than two weeks. Indeed, ever since his childhood, Julien jinxes every woman who falls in love with him. But it''s not just any small jinx. It''s the kind that sends you to the hospital several times a week, that destroys your professional life or that turns your friends into enemies. Julien is strictly speaking a true black cat for women. Joanna Sorini will soon learn this at her expense the day she meets him. A career that''s just taking off, a love life that finally seems to be taking a good turn, all that may just change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB0gfY27K8WDJWgN9u6iI5RRiTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53010'),
  ('687129938194486880', 'Second Chance', 2016, 'Romance', 'Özcan Deniz', 'Özcan Deniz, Avni Tuna Dilligil', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Özcan Deniz, Mesut Can Tomay, Afra Saraçoğlu, Berrin Arısoy, Fulya Şirin, Anıl Altınöz, Aybike Turan', null, 'When a timid teacher meets a charismatic restaurateur, opposites hardly attract until their painful pasts transform their connection into love.', 'When a timid teacher meets a charismatic restaurateur, opposites hardly attract until their painful pasts transform their connection into love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BAdN2rHBfxfA3LEC8J61reRVAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462653'),
  ('621484096955686182', 'Second Chances', 1998, 'Drama, Family', 'James Fargo', null, 'Tom Amandes, Isabel Glasser, Kelsey Mulrooney, Terry Moore, Stuart Whitman, Madeline Zima, Charles Shaughnessy, Erica Hess', 'G', 'A little girl''s physical and emotional reawakening after an accident claims her father and her spirit.', 'A little girl''s physical and emotional reawakening after an accident claims her father and her spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giA61wWIJvafQtwdHOjiFh0EE7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63872'),
  ('994081249083965280', 'Second Chorus', 1941, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'H. C. Potter, Theodor Sparkuhl, Edward Montagne', 'Ben Hecht', 'Fred Astaire, Paulette Goddard, Artie Shaw, Charles Butterworth, Burgess Meredith, Frank Melton, Jimmy Conlin, Don Brodie', 'NR', 'Danny O''Neill and Hank Taylor are rival trumpeters with the Perennials, a college band, and both men are still attending college by failing their exams seven years in a row. In the midst of a performance, Danny spies Ellen Miller who ends up being made band manager. Both men compete for her affections while trying to get the other one fired.', 'Danny O''Neill and Hank Taylor are rival trumpeters with the Perennials, a college band, and both men are still attending college by failing their exams seven years in a row. In the midst of a performance, Danny spies Ellen Miller who ends up being made band manager. Both men compete for her affections while trying to get the other one fired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qo20sq732j5dIbgmNYveJITwvna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23627'),
  ('1002926140486444625', 'Second Glance', 1992, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Rich Christiano', 'Danny Carrales, Rich Christiano, Michael Martin', 'David A.R. White, Blaine Pickett, Lance Zitron, Denise Weatherly, Robert Kuns, Jim Whitehead, Andrea Darnell, Skip Steward', null, 'A Christian teenager, missing out on his fun years, begins to contemplate his religion but is given the ability to SECOND GLANCE his life had he not been a leader sent by Him.', 'A Christian teenager, missing out on his fun years, begins to contemplate his religion but is given the ability to SECOND GLANCE his life had he not been a leader sent by Him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FEmLbRN8jy5hL8dyzLfXVOvwPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46306'),
  ('1142382826363628459', 'Second in Command', 2006, 'Action', 'Simon Fellows, Douglas Milsome', 'David L. Corley, Jonathan Bowers, Jayson Rothwell', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Julie Cox, Alan McKenna, Razaaq Adoti, Velibor Topic, William Tapley, Warren Derosa, Ian Virgo', 'R', 'Armed insurgents attempt a coup d''etat in a troubled Eastern European country, and the president flees to the U.S. embassy for protection. When the U.S. ambassador is murdered by the ruthless and gun-happy rebels, it comes down to the second-in-command of the embassy, Sam Keenan, played by Belgian kickboxer Jean-Claude Van Damme, to use his amazing martial arts technique to defend the besieged.', 'Armed insurgents attempt a coup d''etat in a troubled Eastern European country, and the president flees to the U.S. embassy for protection. When the U.S. ambassador is murdered by the ruthless and gun-happy rebels, it comes down to the second-in-command of the embassy, Sam Keenan, played by Belgian kickboxer Jean-Claude Van Damme, to use his amazing martial arts technique to defend the besieged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MlHO10nWkQkzO7B5BE9OCKjC7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19167'),
  ('513108406244140132', 'Second Life', 2019, 'Drama', 'Hwang Kyung-hyun, Park Young-ju', 'Park Young-ju', 'Jeong Da-eun, Park Soo-yeon, Jeon Guk-hyang, Kim Jae-hwa, Jang Hye-jin, Jung Yi-jae, Kim So-suk, Kim Min-yeop', null, 'Seon-hee is a high school girl who used to tell lies to get her friends attention. She leaves Seoul guilt-ridden when her friend Jung-mi kills herself because of Seon-hee''s lies. In the countryside where no one knows her, Seon-hee begins a new life as Seul-ki.', 'Seon-hee is a high school girl who used to tell lies to get her friends attention. She leaves Seoul guilt-ridden when her friend Jung-mi kills herself because of Seon-hee''s lies. In the countryside where no one knows her, Seon-hee begins a new life as Seul-ki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HEojKErnT0SGCFXonCB0deCKmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547403'),
  ('496388771941984949', 'Second Name', 2002, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Paco Plaza, Xavier Bernabeu, Sergi Ruiz', 'Fernando Marías, Paco Plaza', 'Erica Prior, Trae Houlihan, Denis Rafter, Craig Stevenson, Frank O''Sullivan, John O''Toole, Teresa Gimpera, Craig Hill', null, 'After the suicide of her beloved father, the biologist Daniella Logan visits her catatonic mother in a mental institution to tell the tragic event and her mother calls her "Josephine". Daniella goes to the cemetery and finds that her father''s grave had been opened and his corpse was profaned. She decides to investigate, and receives a message of a diabetic priest, Father Elias, who tells her about an ancient fanatic religious sect of followers of Abraham that kills the first child. Later, she meets a weird man, Toby Harris, who claims to be his legitimate father. Daniella continues seeking the truth about her origins and discloses very dark secrets about her family and friends.', 'After the suicide of her beloved father, the biologist Daniella Logan visits her catatonic mother in a mental institution to tell the tragic event and her mother calls her "Josephine". Daniella goes to the cemetery and finds that her father''s grave had been opened and his corpse was profaned. She decides to investigate, and receives a message of a diabetic priest, Father Elias, who tells her about an ancient fanatic religious sect of followers of Abraham that kills the first child. Later, she meets a weird man, Toby Harris, who claims to be his legitimate father. Daniella continues seeking the truth about her origins and discloses very dark secrets about her family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iak4DHSceDrQtdJ2wkhnZnpWH9W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59851'),
  ('340689215747575266', 'Second Origin', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Carles Porta, Sergi Lara', 'Bigas Luna, Carles Porta, Carmen Chaves Gastaldo', 'Rachel Hurd-Wood, Andrés Batista, Sergi López, Ibrahim Mané', null, 'After a massive destruction on Earth, a white girl Alba (14) and a black boy Didac (9), are the only survivors on the Earth. They must start a new world. A Second Origin. Population is over. There are only two survivors. Now, our future depends on them.', 'After a massive destruction on Earth, a white girl Alba (14) and a black boy Didac (9), are the only survivors on the Earth. They must start a new world. A Second Origin. Population is over. There are only two survivors. Now, our future depends on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hHM8160Z5lK9eoFVduVd3S3o6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115874'),
  ('197208613303517866', 'Second Sight', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Joel Zwick, Dana Christiaansen, Walter Scott', 'Patricia Resnick, Tom Schulman', 'John Larroquette, Bronson Pinchot, Bess Armstrong, Stuart Pankin, John Schuck, James Tolkan, William Prince, Michael Lombard', 'PG', 'Wills is an ex-cop who pairs up with Bobby, a wacky psychic, to form the "Second Sight Detective Agency." Bobby''s clairvoyant abilities come in handy during their investigations. When a nun recruits them for a case involving car theft, they suddenly find themselves dealing with the abduction of a prominent cardinal who has a chance of becoming the next pope. Bobby''s psychic powers go haywire as they pursue the case.', 'Wills is an ex-cop who pairs up with Bobby, a wacky psychic, to form the "Second Sight Detective Agency." Bobby''s clairvoyant abilities come in handy during their investigations. When a nun recruits them for a case involving car theft, they suddenly find themselves dealing with the abduction of a prominent cardinal who has a chance of becoming the next pope. Bobby''s psychic powers go haywire as they pursue the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rml1HBcC7lmRhyK1IgPDI1zl9k6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55492'),
  ('661598257549452221', 'Second Skin', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gerardo Vera, Julio Madurga', 'Ángeles González-Sinde', 'Javier Bardem, Jordi Mollà, Ariadna Gil, Cecilia Roth, Mercedes Sampietro, Javier Albalá', 'R', 'When Elena finds a hotel bill in her husband’s pocket, she begins to suspect that he’s having an affair — but not that it’s with a man.', 'When Elena finds a hotel bill in her husband’s pocket, she begins to suspect that he’s having an affair — but not that it’s with a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EUWx8ZeAuly2mUd12KoOtqCF6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171229'),
