  ('465977780858300568', 'Second Tour', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Albert Dupontel, Julien Poupard, Alexandra Gayzal', 'Albert Dupontel, Camille Fontaine, Marcia Romano', 'Albert Dupontel, Cécile de France, Nicolas Marié, David Marsais, Bertrand Usclat, Jackie Berroyer, Philippe Uchan, Bouli Lanners', null, 'A disgraced political journalist placed in the soccer section, Miss Pove is asked to follow the presidential campaign in progress. The front-runner is a fifty-year-old heir to a powerful French family and a political novice. Troubled by this candidate, whom she has known to be less smooth in the past, Miss Pove embarks on an investigation that is as surprising as it is jubilant.', 'A disgraced political journalist placed in the soccer section, Miss Pove is asked to follow the presidential campaign in progress. The front-runner is a fifty-year-old heir to a powerful French family and a political novice. Troubled by this candidate, whom she has known to be less smooth in the past, Miss Pove embarks on an investigation that is as surprising as it is jubilant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEBis0K1hISWyUxtl6aZs3Yc2jc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962309'),
