  ('719513859124792195', 'Secret', 1999, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Yojiro Takita, Naoki Kayano, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Hirosue Ryoko, Kaoru Kobayashi, Ken Kaneko, Yuriko Ishida, Hideaki Ito, Tomoe Shinohara, Kayoko Kishimoto, Rie Shibata', null, 'A man is shocked to find out that after a deadly car accident involving his wife and daughter, his wife died, but her mind somehow got transfered into their daughter''s body.', 'A man is shocked to find out that after a deadly car accident involving his wife and daughter, his wife died, but her mind somehow got transfered into their daughter''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXG9OhzX1pFL94JXQTlSqHoy7gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88517'),
