  ('398718577690416400', 'Secret Agent', 1936, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Bernard Knowles, Louis Levy', 'Ian Hay, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Madeleine Carroll, John Gielgud, Peter Lorre, Robert Young, Percy Marmont, Florence Kahn, Charles Carson, Lilli Palmer', null, 'During World War I, a novelist declared dead is recruited by British intelligence and sent to Switzerland under a new identity to assassinate a German spy. Teamed with a fellow agent posing as his wife and an eccentric assassin known as “the General,” the trio close in on their target — until two of them grow ambivalent when their duty to the mission clashes with their consciences.', 'During World War I, a novelist declared dead is recruited by British intelligence and sent to Switzerland under a new identity to assassinate a German spy. Teamed with a fellow agent posing as his wife and an eccentric assassin known as “the General,” the trio close in on their target — until two of them grow ambivalent when their duty to the mission clashes with their consciences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHfEuqttHs2fXLGgkSxC5nh7AHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2761'),
  ('214967311575535844', 'Secret Agent', 1943, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Seymour Kneitel', null, 'Joan Alexander, Jackson Beck, Bud Collyer, Jack Mercer, Julian Noa, Sam Parker', null, 'A double agent trying to deliver information to Washington, D.C. is chased by Nazi operatives.', 'A double agent trying to deliver information to Washington, D.C. is chased by Nazi operatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gnfiuwSNjACbUKi8Ln4v8fR5TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146074'),
  ('516717733757272310', 'Secret Agent Super Dragon', 1966, 'Action, Adventure', 'Giorgio Ferroni', 'Bill Coleman, Remigio Del Grosso, Giorgio Ferroni', 'Ray Danton, Marisa Mell, Margaret Lee, Jess Hahn, Carlo D''Angelo, Adriana Ambesi, Marco Guglielmi, Solvi Stübing', 'NR', 'A series of murders in Michigan lead an American secret agent to Amsterdam, where he uncovers a plot to imperil the world with a potent new drug.', 'A series of murders in Michigan lead an American secret agent to Amsterdam, where he uncovers a plot to imperil the world with a potent new drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9hyX0Pj7ZOGrXEf1Epnp0KWk5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3692'),
  ('1133998450781802039', 'Secret Agents', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Frédéric Schoendoerffer, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire', 'Yann Brion, Olivier Douyère, Ludovic Schoendoerffer', 'Vincent Cassel, Monica Bellucci, André Dussollier, Charles Berling, Bruno Todeschini, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Ludovic Schoendoerffer, Éric Savin', null, 'From his offices in Switzerland, Russian Igor Lipovsky is engaged in a vast and profitable gunrunning operation with Africa. The French government wants to hinder the activities of the arms dealer and sends a team to sink one of his ships heading for Angola with a load of illegal weaponry. Lisa, Brisseau, Loïc, Tony and Raymond are professionals: they carefully set up their cover, plan all their moves meticulously, and carry out orders without asking questions. Perhaps they should. The code-name of the mission is "Janus"; and just like with the ancient deity, there are two opposite faces for every aspect of the operation: the objective of the French government, the role of each team member, the presumed friend and the assumed foe...', 'From his offices in Switzerland, Russian Igor Lipovsky is engaged in a vast and profitable gunrunning operation with Africa. The French government wants to hinder the activities of the arms dealer and sends a team to sink one of his ships heading for Angola with a load of illegal weaponry. Lisa, Brisseau, Loïc, Tony and Raymond are professionals: they carefully set up their cover, plan all their moves meticulously, and carry out orders without asking questions. Perhaps they should. The code-name of the mission is "Janus"; and just like with the ancient deity, there are two opposite faces for every aspect of the operation: the objective of the French government, the role of each team member, the presumed friend and the assumed foe...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tzRPF8TUQ1XTz3UnABCLOhMug4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12648'),
  ('1114139824964369442', 'Secret Beyond the Door', 1947, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Stanley Cortez, William Holland', 'Silvia Richards', 'Joan Bennett, Michael Redgrave, Anne Revere, Barbara O''Neil, Natalie Schafer, Paul Cavanagh, Anabel Shaw, Rosa Rey', 'NR', 'After a whirlwind romance in Mexico, a beautiful heiress marries a man she barely knows with hardly a second thought. She finds his New York home full of his strange relations, and macabre rooms that are replicas of famous murder sites. One locked room contains the secret to her husband''s obsession, and the truth about what happened to his first wife.', 'After a whirlwind romance in Mexico, a beautiful heiress marries a man she barely knows with hardly a second thought. She finds his New York home full of his strange relations, and macabre rooms that are replicas of famous murder sites. One locked room contains the secret to her husband''s obsession, and the truth about what happened to his first wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVBEwjzXweHWjCFjAs7eJzH9in6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560'),
  ('68296194524997147', 'Secret Ceremony', 1968, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher', 'George Tabori', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Mia Farrow, Robert Mitchum, Peggy Ashcroft, Pamela Brown, Robert Douglas, George Howell, Penelope Keith', null, 'A penniless woman meets a strange girl who insists she is her long-lost mother and becomes enmeshed in a web of deception, and perhaps madness.', 'A penniless woman meets a strange girl who insists she is her long-lost mother and becomes enmeshed in a web of deception, and perhaps madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezkV9lbSwbA76qomzhBNpGEHrkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71395'),
  ('1030089151001576441', 'Secret Chronicle: She Beast Market', 1974, 'Drama', 'Noboru Tanaka, Yoshiro Takahashi, Shōhei Andō', 'Akio Ido', 'Meika Seri, Junko Miyashita, Genshū Hanayagi, Shirō Yumemura, Moeko Ezawa, Sakumi Hagiwara, Akira Takahashi, Hyōe Enoki', null, 'A strong-willed young prostitute, her mentally challenged brother, and her aging prostitute mother attempt to survive in 1970s Osaka.', 'A strong-willed young prostitute, her mentally challenged brother, and her aging prostitute mother attempt to survive in 1970s Osaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trWzdzcNzLyma147JVblDNmIvuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125276'),
  ('1052191683290329860', 'Secret Defense', 1998, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Emmanuelle Cuau , Jacques Rivette', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Laure Marsac, Françoise Fabian, Christine Vouilloz, Mark Saporta, Sara Louis, Hermine Karagheuz, Bernadette Giraud', null, 'After biologist Sylvie discovers her brother Paul trying to steal a gun from her lab, he explains that he wishes to avenge the death of their father whom he suspects died at the hands of his business partner.', 'After biologist Sylvie discovers her brother Paul trying to steal a gun from her lab, he explains that he wishes to avenge the death of their father whom he suspects died at the hands of his business partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuIpOkvwLqG0U8DAudakJCMXuCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49559'),
  ('781868225351824754', 'Secret Fantasy', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Silvano Ippoliti, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Marcello Crescenzi', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile', 'Lando Buzzanca, Laura Antonelli, Lino Toffolo, Ferruccio De Ceresa, Gianrico Tedeschi, Elsa Vazzoler, Gino Cavalieri, Felicita Fanny', null, 'Niccolò Vivaldi is a cello player and he plays in Arena di Verona Orchestra. But he is not the first and neither the second cello. He is frustrated. Nobody can remember his face, nor his name. Niccolò is married to Costanza, who is really beautiful and he takes some pictures of her naked. Later he shows the pictures to a friend and so he feels better. He starts to write a comic opera called "Il merlo maschio" only to discover later he had written Rossini''s "La gazza ladra". To maintain his self-esteem he can only show his wife...', 'Niccolò Vivaldi is a cello player and he plays in Arena di Verona Orchestra. But he is not the first and neither the second cello. He is frustrated. Nobody can remember his face, nor his name. Niccolò is married to Costanza, who is really beautiful and he takes some pictures of her naked. Later he shows the pictures to a friend and so he feels better. He starts to write a comic opera called "Il merlo maschio" only to discover later he had written Rossini''s "La gazza ladra". To maintain his self-esteem he can only show his wife...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKzApg3uUn1eBaEfCrW5coGNpOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69470'),
  ('637815993254473598', 'Secret Friends', 1991, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Dennis Potter, Sue Gibson, Andy Kelk', 'Dennis Potter', 'Alan Bates, Gina Bellman, Frances Barber, Tony Doyle, Joanna David, Colin Jeavons, Rowena Cooper, Ian McNeice', null, 'During a train ride, an anxiety attack leads middle-aged illustrator John into an identity crisis. As his marital problems merge and blur into his fantasy life with prostitutes and call girls, a long-dormant secret friend of his childhood surfaces in his delusions.', 'During a train ride, an anxiety attack leads middle-aged illustrator John into an identity crisis. As his marital problems merge and blur into his fantasy life with prostitutes and call girls, a long-dormant secret friend of his childhood surfaces in his delusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1egkSKx60wkFrsaSzz2Bj5DzyWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123321'),
  ('750277657860448652', 'Secret Games', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Marshall Crosby, Stacey Kiel', 'Georges des Esseintes', 'Martin Hewitt, Michele Brin, Delia Sheppard, Catya Sassoon, Sabrina Mesko, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Billy Drago, Monique Parent', null, 'A bored and neglected housewife joins a local escort service and soon sinks deeper into trouble when she finds that she''s not permitted to quit when the work gets tough.', 'A bored and neglected housewife joins a local escort service and soon sinks deeper into trouble when she finds that she''s not permitted to quit when the work gets tough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAQpCP8YllNLslICW56F1ufzuJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164660'),
  ('1068449663437179342', 'Secret Games 3', 1994, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gregory Dark, Louis Shaw Milito, Shari Nicotero', 'Don Simmons, Tucker Johnston', 'Woody Brown, Rochelle Swanson, Dean Scofield, Brenda Swanson, May Karasun, Bob Delegall, Mark Davenport, Jasae', null, 'A neglected housewife of a busy husband who is a doctor turns to prostitution to pass the time. One of her customers develops an obsession with her and begins stalking her.', 'A neglected housewife of a busy husband who is a doctor turns to prostitution to pass the time. One of her customers develops an obsession with her and begins stalking her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GGyyLkp7Z0c5CWlDfwdQZWE2h6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216358'),
  ('767582377340323872', 'Secret Headquarters', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Larry Fong, Christina Fong, Doug Torres', 'Christopher L. Yost, Josh Koenigsberg, Henry Joost', 'Owen Wilson, Michael Peña, Walker Scobell, Momona Tamada, Keith L. Williams, Abby James Witherspoon, Jesse Williams, Jessie Mueller', 'PG', 'While hanging out after school, Charlie and his friends discover the headquarters of the world’s most powerful superhero hidden beneath his home. When villains attack, they must team up to defend the headquarters and save the world.', 'While hanging out after school, Charlie and his friends discover the headquarters of the world’s most powerful superhero hidden beneath his home. When villains attack, they must team up to defend the headquarters and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6mvk0YC4o0PUdq82IbNRjIEEv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791155'),
  ('542575002660509172', 'Secret Honeymoon: Assault Train', 1977, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yoshihiro Kawasaki, Yasuharu Hasebe, Masaru Mori', 'Chiho Katsura', 'Noriaki Abe, Daiki Katô, Natsuko Yashiro, Hidetoshi Kageyama, Tokuko Watanabe, Eisuke Izumi, Teruo Matsunaga, Tessen Nakahira', null, 'After a bungled robbery attempt, two thugs kidnap a bride on her wedding day.', 'After a bungled robbery attempt, two thugs kidnap a bride on her wedding day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m25Zre75PfbGupecWbHcWwhxWzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557863'),
  ('1150504707240480077', 'Secret Honor', 1984, 'Drama', 'Robert Altman, Pierre Mignot, Allan F. Nicholls', 'Donald Freed, Arnold M. Stone', 'Philip Baker Hall', 'NR', 'In his New Jersey study, Richard Nixon retraces the missteps of his political career, attempting to absolve himself of responsibility for Watergate and lambasting President Gerald Ford''s decision to pardon him. His monologue explores his personal life and describes his upbringing and his mother. A tape recorder, a gun and whiskey are his only companions during his entire monologue, which is tinged with the vitriol and paranoia that puzzled the public during his presidency.', 'In his New Jersey study, Richard Nixon retraces the missteps of his political career, attempting to absolve himself of responsibility for Watergate and lambasting President Gerald Ford''s decision to pardon him. His monologue explores his personal life and describes his upbringing and his mother. A tape recorder, a gun and whiskey are his only companions during his entire monologue, which is tinged with the vitriol and paranoia that puzzled the public during his presidency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYiadiL0xgIqpPgKj02NkYsb988.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50034'),
  ('1021973306073846387', 'Secret in Their Eyes', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Billy Ray, Daniel Moder, Aaron C. Fitzgerald', 'Eduardo Sacheri, Billy Ray, Juan José Campanella', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Nicole Kidman, Julia Roberts, Dean Norris, Alfred Molina, Michael Kelly, Joe Cole, Zoe Graham', 'PG-13', 'A tight-knit team of FBI investigators, along with their District Attorney supervisor, is suddenly torn apart when they discover that one of their own teenage daughters has been brutally murdered.', 'A tight-knit team of FBI investigators, along with their District Attorney supervisor, is suddenly torn apart when they discover that one of their own teenage daughters has been brutally murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJl4iTxQlazkPCplGmSLGBUwqg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290751'),
