  ('789527469993680349', 'Secret Love', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryoo Hoon, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Ryoo Hoon', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Yoon Jin-seo, Im Ye-jin, Jeong In-gi, Oh Yeon-ah, Yang Eun-yong, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'When her husband is left comatose after an accident, a distraught young bride develops an attraction to her spouse''s identical twin.', 'When her husband is left comatose after an accident, a distraught young bride develops an attraction to her spouse''s identical twin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99Fgp3ADIkLU54mMoLYdckbeOjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133573'),
  ('1091984811151228324', 'Secret Love in Peach Blossom Land', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stan Lai, Christopher Doyle', 'Stan Lai', 'Brigitte Lin, Wei-hui Li, Ku Pao-Ming, Lee Li-Chun, Ismene Ting, King Shih-chieh', null, 'Two drama companies happened to share one auditorium for rehearsal. Friction was inevitable. One of them played ''Peach Blossom'', a comedy in medieval costume. Another played ''Secret Love'', a sad story with contemporary setting. Though unreconciled in all aspects, they find themselves telling the same story: the story of Chinese people forced to leave home.', 'Two drama companies happened to share one auditorium for rehearsal. Friction was inevitable. One of them played ''Peach Blossom'', a comedy in medieval costume. Another played ''Secret Love'', a sad story with contemporary setting. Though unreconciled in all aspects, they find themselves telling the same story: the story of Chinese people forced to leave home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e427E7pcwTP3yCwhxxoxi8cF4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202516'),
  ('875296314158890207', 'Secret Love: My Friend''s Mom', 2018, 'Romance', 'Kim Bu-gon', null, 'Jin Si-ah, Lee Jae-seok, Jung Yoo-ah, Im Dong-min, Im Se-ho', null, 'A student finds his friend''s mom very sexy. While studying for tests, she tempts him away from his studies and a hot affair ensues.', 'A student finds his friend''s mom very sexy. While studying for tests, she tempts him away from his studies and a hot affair ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTari5xjCHcQULu7gF2WV7eIbAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504891'),
  ('1140172348937756803', 'Secret Love: The Schoolboy and the Mailwoman', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Franziska Buch', 'Silke Zertz', 'Kostja Ullmann, Marie Bäumer, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Rolf Kanies, Claudia Messner, Claudia Geisler-Bading, Stephan Schill, Michael Sideris', null, 'A 17 year old boy falls in love with a 37 year old woman. As if this wouldn''t be enough they are of different social classes and she is married.', 'A 17 year old boy falls in love with a 37 year old woman. As if this wouldn''t be enough they are of different social classes and she is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ff6CVhLTar9v1BiDNRKsTRr7z2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176147'),
  ('548644102749814238', 'Secret Magic Control Agency', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Dani Marcus, Alexey Tsitsilin', 'Analisa LaBianco, Alexey Tsitsilin, Alexey Zamyslov', 'Valery Smekalov, Irina Obrezkova, Alexey Makretsky, Regina Shchukina, Kseniya Brzhezovskaya, Yuliya Zorkina', 'NR', 'The Secret Magic Control Agency sends its two best agents, Hansel and Gretel, to fight against the witch of the Gingerbread House.', 'The Secret Magic Control Agency sends its two best agents, Hansel and Gretel, to fight against the witch of the Gingerbread House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZSzEDVdxWVMVO4oZDvoodQOEfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797394'),
  ('95761498303601173', 'Secret Mall Apartment', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Workman, Dan Kennedy, Jeremy Workman', null, 'Michael Townsend, Colin Bliss, James J.A. Mercer, Andrew Oesch, Greta Scheing, Emily Ustach, Adriana Valdez-Young, Jay Zehngebot', null, 'In 2003, eight Rhode Islanders created a secret apartment inside a busy mall and lived there for four years, filming everything along the way. Far more than a prank, the secret apartment became a deeply meaningful place for all involved.', 'In 2003, eight Rhode Islanders created a secret apartment inside a busy mall and lived there for four years, filming everything along the way. Far more than a prank, the secret apartment became a deeply meaningful place for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc6ZQMlQrCq03d1WXyYaeUXRlCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1237871'),
  ('322337175353591566', 'Secret Millionaire', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Toby Gorman, Michael M. Scott', 'Lizzy Davis', 'Steve Lund, Siobhan Williams, Jaime M. Callica, Allie Bertram, Adam DiMarco, Elise Gatien, Karen Holness', null, 'When a bored millionaire (Steve Lund) is mistaken for a parking attendant by a beautiful girl (Siobhan Williams) who is protesting against his family’s intention of closing a local park, he uses the misunderstanding to get to know her better.', 'When a bored millionaire (Steve Lund) is mistaken for a parking attendant by a beautiful girl (Siobhan Williams) who is protesting against his family’s intention of closing a local park, he uses the misunderstanding to get to know her better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYo2NBTFKySIRjT96fmIGSVmeWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497411'),
  ('829519094009590629', 'Secret Mission', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Harold French, Bernard Knowles, Paul Sheriff', 'Basil Bartlett, Anatole de Grunwald', 'Hugh Williams, Carla Lehmann, Roland Culver, Michael Wilding, James Mason, Nancy Price, Karl Stepanek, Fritz Wendhausen', 'NR', 'World War II drama in which a member of the French Resistance and three British agents undertake a hazardous mission to infiltrate a German HQ in search of vital information that could lead to the overthrow of the Nazis.', 'World War II drama in which a member of the French Resistance and three British agents undertake a hazardous mission to infiltrate a German HQ in search of vital information that could lead to the overthrow of the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylp4oOqDCbdDCI6ue64qC6n6mIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72698'),
  ('731714067767038052', 'Secret Name', 2021, 'Drama', 'Aurélia Georges, Jacques Girault', 'Aurélia Georges, Maud Ameline', 'Lyna Khoudri, Sabine Azéma, Maud Wyler, Laurent Poitrenaux, Didier Brice, Lise Lamétrie, Olivier Broche, Marie Hattermann', null, 'Nelie escaped a miserable existence by becoming a frontline nurse in 1914. One day, she takes the identity of Rose, a young woman from a good family, who dies in front of her. She presents herself in her place at Madame de Lengwil''s house, to become the reader of this wealthy woman.', 'Nelie escaped a miserable existence by becoming a frontline nurse in 1914. One day, she takes the identity of Rose, a young woman from a good family, who dies in front of her. She presents herself in her place at Madame de Lengwil''s house, to become the reader of this wealthy woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddMAnYkcCXRKmTYRoDsZM6O1x1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820712'),
  ('859906593464452846', 'Secret Obsession', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Eitan Almagor, Daniel Ringey, Peter Sullivan', 'Peter Sullivan, Kraig Wenman', 'Brenda Song, Mike Vogel, Dennis Haysbert, Ashley Scott, Paul Sloan, Daniel Booko, Scott Peat, Blair Hickey', 'PG-13', 'Newlywed Jennifer is brutally attacked at a dark rest stop. While healing from her injuries, she can’t recall anything from her past, including the ordeal. Her husband, Russell , is just thankful she’s alive and eager to get her home. As he reintroduces her to their secluded mountain estate, Detective Page pursues Jennifer’s assailant — his own daughter went missing and was never found. The same fate now awaits Jennifer, unless someone realizes that her loving caretaker is actually her captor.', 'Newlywed Jennifer is brutally attacked at a dark rest stop. While healing from her injuries, she can’t recall anything from her past, including the ordeal. Her husband, Russell , is just thankful she’s alive and eager to get her home. As he reintroduces her to their secluded mountain estate, Detective Page pursues Jennifer’s assailant — his own daughter went missing and was never found. The same fate now awaits Jennifer, unless someone realizes that her loving caretaker is actually her captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKMeE6oYzBVzhA6xLGb8PPWEruF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612152'),
  ('791832085209221926', 'Secret of Naruto', 1957, 'Drama, Action', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa, Kōhei Sugiyama', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa, Minoru Inuzuka', 'Chikage Awashima, Toshio Chiba, Kazuo Hasegawa, Raizō Ichikawa, Tatsuya Ishiguro, Ryōsuke Kagawa, Satoko Minami, Osamu Takizawa', null, 'From the pen of Yoshikawa Eiji comes this exciting story. The Naruto Strait separates Tokushima from the islands of Awaji and Honshu. On Tokushima the mad lord dreams of conquest and forges a bloody revolt against the Tokugawa shogunate. A mysterious swordsman named Noriyuki Gennojo has crossed Naruto’s waters to uncover the Awa clan’s secrets. He puts his life on the line after finding a testament of Awa’s secrets, written in blood by a dying man. Joining Noriyuki are a female ninja who loves him, and the beautiful daughter of an enemy who’s sworn to kill him. Awa’s defenders willl stop at nothing to prevent the blood-soaked letter from reaching the shogun.', 'From the pen of Yoshikawa Eiji comes this exciting story. The Naruto Strait separates Tokushima from the islands of Awaji and Honshu. On Tokushima the mad lord dreams of conquest and forges a bloody revolt against the Tokugawa shogunate. A mysterious swordsman named Noriyuki Gennojo has crossed Naruto’s waters to uncover the Awa clan’s secrets. He puts his life on the line after finding a testament of Awa’s secrets, written in blood by a dying man. Joining Noriyuki are a female ninja who loves him, and the beautiful daughter of an enemy who’s sworn to kill him. Awa’s defenders willl stop at nothing to prevent the blood-soaked letter from reaching the shogun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ3uBpRRuArcuLYlWoeVm4rNGxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359320'),
  ('35369025319372171', 'Secret of the Blackbirds', 1983, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Vadim Derbenyov, Rem Sobinov, Nikolay Nemolyaev', 'Valentina Kolodyazhnaya, Yelizaveta Smirnova', 'Ita Ever, Vladimir Sedov, Vsevolod Sanayev, Lyubov Polishchuk, Yuri Belyayev, Yelena Sanayeva, Andrey Kharitonov, Natalya Danilova', null, 'Mr. Fortescue, owner of a big company, unexpectedly dies. The autopsy shows that he has been poisoned. Nobody actually loved him, and even his family members had their reasons to kill him. But who really did it? And who is responsable for killing his young servant and his wife within the next couple of days? Of course the only person who can answer this question is Ms. Marple. And of course, the murderer is the person you least expected it to be.', 'Mr. Fortescue, owner of a big company, unexpectedly dies. The autopsy shows that he has been poisoned. Nobody actually loved him, and even his family members had their reasons to kill him. But who really did it? And who is responsable for killing his young servant and his wife within the next couple of days? Of course the only person who can answer this question is Ms. Marple. And of course, the murderer is the person you least expected it to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJbOIq1yWyV4aa3KdjhiMwDOuuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6029'),
  ('288069121634300187', 'Secret of the Blue Room', 1933, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Kurt Neumann, Charles J. Stumar, Jay Marchant', 'William Hurlbut', 'Lionel Atwill, Gloria Stuart, Paul Lukas, Edward Arnold, Onslow Stevens, William Janney, Elizabeth Patterson, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'According to a legend, the mansion''s "blue room" is cursed -- everyone who has ever spent the night in that room has met with an untimely end. The three suitors of the heroine wager that each can survive a night in the forbidding blue room.', 'According to a legend, the mansion''s "blue room" is cursed -- everyone who has ever spent the night in that room has met with an untimely end. The three suitors of the heroine wager that each can survive a night in the forbidding blue room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2DEVVE9ZHn9kvaWlgngiLx98Wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118570'),
  ('856938752568811240', 'Secret of the Incas', 1954, 'Action, Adventure', 'Jerry Hopper, Lionel Lindon, Daniel McCauley', 'Ranald MacDougall, Sydney Boehm', 'Charlton Heston, Robert Young, Nicole Maurey, Thomas Mitchell, Glenda Farrell, Michael Pate, Leon Askin, William Henry', null, 'Harry Steele (Charlton Heston) is a tourist guide determined to make his fortune by finding the Sunburst, an Inca treasure.', 'Harry Steele (Charlton Heston) is a tourist guide determined to make his fortune by finding the Sunburst, an Inca treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f09jwcHubGvpEN5Lnt7tl1FKgye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40790'),
