  ('378741586037986378', 'Secret Society of Second-Born Royals', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Anna Mastro, Jaron Presant', 'Andrew Green, Alex Litvak', 'Peyton Elizabeth Lee, Ashley Liao, Isabella Blake-Thomas, Olivia Deeble, Niles Fitch, Faly Rakotohavana, Élodie Yung, Skylar Astin', 'PG', 'Sam is a teenage royal rebel, second in line to the throne of the kingdom of Illyria. Just as her disinterest in the royal way of life is at an all-time high, she discovers she has super-human abilities and is invited to join a secret society of similar extraordinary second-born royals charged with keeping the world safe.', 'Sam is a teenage royal rebel, second in line to the throne of the kingdom of Illyria. Just as her disinterest in the royal way of life is at an all-time high, she discovers she has super-human abilities and is invited to join a secret society of similar extraordinary second-born royals charged with keeping the world safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnO3aXSqkKCDw5cEVyNUDexI4NJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621870'),
  ('275345508946342193', 'Secret Summer', 2016, 'Romance, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rick Bota, Zack Eginton', 'Alec Colantonio-Ray, Adam Rockoff, Cara J. Russell', 'Lindsey Shaw, Derek Theler, Chiara Aurelia, Emily Rose, Max Page, Lucas Bryant', 'PG', 'Appraiser Rachel (Lindsey Shaw) receives the news that her top-notched client wants to buyout a small town’s beloved library to build a resort and spa on the land. Rachel is completely against the idea of leaving NYC but loses the argument to her boss. So Rachel packs her bags and flies out to California. During her first visit to the library she runs into writer, Jake (Derek Theler), who is researching the tale of Captain Black Bart’s hidden treasures for his next novel. With hopes of saving the library, Mrs. Archer (Rachel Ticotin), the librarian, pushes Jake to show Rachel what the library means to the town. Jake’s already got a lot on his plate with his research and taking care of his niece, Hailey (Chiara Aurelia), and nephew, Noah (Max Page), for the summer but he agrees to help out. As Rachel learns what the library means to the community she must find away to save it before it’s too late.', 'Appraiser Rachel (Lindsey Shaw) receives the news that her top-notched client wants to buyout a small town’s beloved library to build a resort and spa on the land. Rachel is completely against the idea of leaving NYC but loses the argument to her boss. So Rachel packs her bags and flies out to California. During her first visit to the library she runs into writer, Jake (Derek Theler), who is researching the tale of Captain Black Bart’s hidden treasures for his next novel. With hopes of saving the library, Mrs. Archer (Rachel Ticotin), the librarian, pushes Jake to show Rachel what the library means to the town. Jake’s already got a lot on his plate with his research and taking care of his niece, Hailey (Chiara Aurelia), and nephew, Noah (Max Page), for the summer but he agrees to help out. As Rachel learns what the library means to the community she must find away to save it before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJJfrB3oHWK3KjzUUfZKatUIvfF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400190'),
  ('122873051780704448', 'Secret Sunshine', 2007, 'Drama', 'Cho Yong-kyu, Lee Chang-dong, Chu In-sik', 'Lee Chang-dong', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Song Kang-ho, Jo Young-jin, Seon Jeong-yeop, Kim Young-jae, Park Myung-shin, Cha Mi-kyeong, Oh Man-seok', 'NR', 'Shin-ae moves to her recently late husband’s hometown. Despite her efforts to settle in this unfamiliar and too-normal place, she finds that she can’t fit in. After a sudden tragedy, Shin-ae turns to Christianity to relieve her pain, but when even this is not permitted, she wages a war against God.', 'Shin-ae moves to her recently late husband’s hometown. Despite her efforts to settle in this unfamiliar and too-normal place, she finds that she can’t fit in. After a sudden tragedy, Shin-ae turns to Christianity to relieve her pain, but when even this is not permitted, she wages a war against God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vee1jyUrqUEmi5ZStWI1JJzLQJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2015'),
