  ('1140790465698594489', 'Secret Zoo', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Seung-hun, Song Byeong-gi, Son Jae-gon', 'Son Jae-gon, Kim Dae-woo, Lee Yong-jae', 'Ahn Jae-hong, Kang So-ra, Park Young-kyu, Kim Seung-o, Jeon Yeo-been, Park Hyuk-kwon, Seo Hyun-woo, Jang Seung-jo', null, 'A lawyer is given the mission of revitalising a bankrupt zoo that has no animals. When he and a group of zookeepers come up with the idea to dress like animals and his fake polar bear goes viral, the zoo becomes a hit, before his law firm’s real intentions are revealed.', 'A lawyer is given the mission of revitalising a bankrupt zoo that has no animals. When he and a group of zookeepers come up with the idea to dress like animals and his fake polar bear goes viral, the zoo becomes a hit, before his law firm’s real intentions are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN7qH8ynEmcodtgPBwKyd2VbFr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575718'),
