  ('540313813348370704', 'Secretariat', 2010, 'Drama', 'Randall Wallace, Naaman Marshall, Kim H. Winther', 'Mike Rich', 'Diane Lane, John Malkovich, Scott Glenn, Dylan Walsh, Fred Thompson, Margo Martindale, Nelsan Ellis, James Cromwell', 'PG', 'Housewife and mother Penny Chenery agrees to take over her ailing father''s Virginia-based Meadow Stables, despite her lack of horse-racing knowledge. Against all odds, Chenery - with the help of veteran trainer Lucien Laurin - manages to navigate the male-dominated business, ultimately fostering the first Triple Crown winner in 25 years.', 'Housewife and mother Penny Chenery agrees to take over her ailing father''s Virginia-based Meadow Stables, despite her lack of horse-racing knowledge. Against all odds, Chenery - with the help of veteran trainer Lucien Laurin - manages to navigate the male-dominated business, ultimately fostering the first Triple Crown winner in 25 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YJ39NqRJ0ljUQohizHmE2hB6Wh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39486'),
  ('773134026597496467', 'Secretary', 2002, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Steven Shainberg, Steven Fierberg, John Foster', 'Erin Cressida Wilson', 'James Spader, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Jeremy Davies, Lesley Ann Warren, Stephen McHattie, Patrick Bauchau, Jessica Tuck, Osgood Perkins', 'R', 'A young woman, recently released from a mental hospital, gets a job as a secretary to a demanding lawyer, where their employer-employee relationship turns into a sexual, sadomasochistic one.', 'A young woman, recently released from a mental hospital, gets a job as a secretary to a demanding lawyer, where their employer-employee relationship turns into a sexual, sadomasochistic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdRXSE7ho185SZlXj0JSwuecEd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11013'),
  ('1112725421654983602', 'Secretly, Greatly', 2013, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Jang Cheol-soo, Jo Seok-hyun, Choi Sang-ho', 'Yoon Hong-gi, Kim Bang-hyun', 'Kim Soo-hyun, Park Ki-woong, Lee Hyun-woo, Son Hyun-joo, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Sung-kyun, Shin Jung-keun, Hong Kyung-in', null, 'Three elite North Korean sleeper agents live under cover for so long that they believe their cover stories are their real identities. They are shocked when they are ordered to kill one another or face death at the hands of an elite hit team.', 'Three elite North Korean sleeper agents live under cover for so long that they believe their cover stories are their real identities. They are shocked when they are ordered to kill one another or face death at the hands of an elite hit team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5ESZzOGxnmugkLvyd45wOsn0mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199584'),
  ('695460717424459957', 'Secrets', 1933, 'Drama, Western', 'Frank Borzage, Ray June, Lew Borzage', 'Frances Marion', 'Mary Pickford, Leslie Howard, C. Aubrey Smith, Blanche Friderici, Doris Lloyd, Herbert Evans, Ned Sparks, Allan Sears', 'NR', 'In the 1860s, Mary Marlowe defies her father''s wishes to marry a British lord and runs away with clerk John Carlton as he heads West to make his fortune. Mary and John endure the difficult journey and settle into a small cabin, then face the hostilities of a cattle rustling gang, as well as the tragic loss of their only son. With Mary''s help, John defeats the gang, which propels him to political power that, over the years, gradually erodes the once-happy marriage.', 'In the 1860s, Mary Marlowe defies her father''s wishes to marry a British lord and runs away with clerk John Carlton as he heads West to make his fortune. Mary and John endure the difficult journey and settle into a small cabin, then face the hostilities of a cattle rustling gang, as well as the tragic loss of their only son. With Mary''s help, John defeats the gang, which propels him to political power that, over the years, gradually erodes the once-happy marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSya5tpIos1e3UGNWMT3YSzgv85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105548'),
