  ('486320253782808328', 'Secrets Behind the Wall', 1965, 'Drama', 'Kōji Wakamatsu, Hideo Itō, Yukikazu Morikubo', 'Takao Yoshizawa, Chūsei Sone', 'Hiroko Fujino, Kazuko Kano, Aya Mine, Michito Suzuki, Takao Yoshizawa, Yoichi Yasukawa, Mikio Terashima', null, 'In a housing complex, a college prep student is spying on his neighbor, a former peace activist, who now leads an ordinary life as a housewife, having a secret affair with an ex-lover.', 'In a housing complex, a college prep student is spying on his neighbor, a former peace activist, who now leads an ordinary life as a housewife, having a secret affair with an ex-lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D655S2JZPQ1Icr8SJKqCPkgzR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46100'),
  ('296635465140742191', 'Secrets in the Hot Spring', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kuan-Hui Lin, Feng Hsin-hua', 'Kuan-Hui Lin', 'Zhang Ting-hu, Sing Hom, Lin He-hsuan, Mimi Chu Mai-Mai, Chin Chi, Law Kar-Ying, Darren Chiu, Shu-yao Kuo', null, 'Xiaogin transferred to the third school during his fifth year at high school. During the winter vacation, his grandparents tricked him into returning to the hotel which was founded by his parents. Xiaogin’s classmates Little Princess and Lu Qun tagged along uninvited to escape being bullied at school. While the three boys were temporarily staying at Xiaogin’s family hotel, they quickly found out that the hotel was in terrible shape and was also haunted. Xiaogin and his friends have developed an extremely close friendship while they are trying to step closer to the truth. Will they find out the secret that hides underneath the steaming hot springs?', 'Xiaogin transferred to the third school during his fifth year at high school. During the winter vacation, his grandparents tricked him into returning to the hotel which was founded by his parents. Xiaogin’s classmates Little Princess and Lu Qun tagged along uninvited to escape being bullied at school. While the three boys were temporarily staying at Xiaogin’s family hotel, they quickly found out that the hotel was in terrible shape and was also haunted. Xiaogin and his friends have developed an extremely close friendship while they are trying to step closer to the truth. Will they find out the secret that hides underneath the steaming hot springs?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq9JHlqcgZJdPDiHnc2W4aF9wvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535849'),
