  ('572341747392001979', 'Secrets of a Soul', 1927, 'Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Robert Lach, Curt Oertel', 'Karl Abraham, Hans Neumann, Colin Ross', 'Werner Krauss, Ruth Weyher, Ilka Grüning, Jack Trevor, Lili Damita, Pavel Pavlov, Hertha von Walther, Renate Brausewetter', null, 'Scientist Martin Fellmann is tormented by an irrational fear of knives and the irresistible compulsion to murder his wife. Driven to the brink of madness by fantastic nightmares, he encounters a psychoanalyst who offers to treat the perplexing malady.', 'Scientist Martin Fellmann is tormented by an irrational fear of knives and the irresistible compulsion to murder his wife. Driven to the brink of madness by fantastic nightmares, he encounters a psychoanalyst who offers to treat the perplexing malady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4aEY255ZGw0V65DrblT0kGmnzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84954'),
  ('972595637644976684', 'Secrets of Life', 1956, 'Documentary', 'James Algar', 'James Algar', 'Winston Hibler', 'G', 'A feature-length documentary showing the changing world of nature, the sky, the sea, the sun, planets, insects and volcanic action. A story of nature''s strange and intricate designs for survival and her many methods of perpetuating life.', 'A feature-length documentary showing the changing world of nature, the sky, the sea, the sun, planets, insects and volcanic action. A story of nature''s strange and intricate designs for survival and her many methods of perpetuating life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iv5z819Ce8EOvEg7nZ9Jon9mKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162117'),
  ('800077648674153836', 'Secrets of My Stepdaughter', 2017, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jem Garrard', 'Conor Allyn', 'Josie Davis, Tiera Skovbye, Cameron Bancroft, Alissa Skovbye, Lucia Walters, Garry Chalk, Nancy Sivak, Veronika Hadravá', null, 'A mother protects her stepdaughter after the teenager witnesses the murder of her best friend, but is soon forced to come to grips with the terrifying possibility that her stepdaughter may be the real killer.', 'A mother protects her stepdaughter after the teenager witnesses the murder of her best friend, but is soon forced to come to grips with the terrifying possibility that her stepdaughter may be the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luyy5HsfR8cT3rDGuxpbXgR4XCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460096'),
  ('915014081372022653', 'Secrets of Palace coup d''etat. Russia, 18th century. Film №1. Testament of the Emperor', 2000, 'History, Drama', 'Svetlana Druzhinina, Anatoliy Mukasey', 'Pavel Finn', 'Natalya Yegorova, Sergey Shakurov, Nikolai Karachentsov, Aleksei Zharkov, Vladimir Ilin, Vladlen Davydov, Irina Lachina, Vyacheslav Grishechkin', null, 'Russia, January 25, 1725. "Give it all...". The emperor''s weakening hand was able to write in his will only these two short incomprehensible words that kept Russia in a bloody struggle for the crown for a century.', 'Russia, January 25, 1725. "Give it all...". The emperor''s weakening hand was able to write in his will only these two short incomprehensible words that kept Russia in a bloody struggle for the crown for a century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGHvyZozYhXjdorZ2tMA4tL1Jiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480284'),
  ('113652387152638981', 'Secrets of Palace coup d''etat. Russia, 18th century. Film №5. Second Bride of the Emperor', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Svetlana Druzhinina', null, null, null, 'As a result of a successful conspiracy against Menshikov, Peter II is prematurely recognized as an adult and is in a hurry to be crowned in Moscow. The Dolgoruky brothers gather for this celebration. There were eight of them - all-powerful and influential representatives of the ancient Rurikovich family - and among them the beautiful Ekaterina, the daughter of the huntsman Alexei.', 'As a result of a successful conspiracy against Menshikov, Peter II is prematurely recognized as an adult and is in a hurry to be crowned in Moscow. The Dolgoruky brothers gather for this celebration. There were eight of them - all-powerful and influential representatives of the ancient Rurikovich family - and among them the beautiful Ekaterina, the daughter of the huntsman Alexei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhQdeLJk4xXa3TwWtASnD4EHPyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143723'),
  ('169032689386324635', 'Secrets of State', 2008, 'Thriller', 'Philippe Haïm', 'Julien Sibony', 'Gérard Lanvin, Vahina Giocante, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Simon Abkarian, Rachida Brakni, Mehdi Nebbou, Aurélien Wiik, Nicolas Marié', null, 'In France, terrorist groups and intelligence agencies battle in a merciless war everyday, in the name of radically opposed ideologies. Yet, terrorist and secret agents lead almost the same lives. Condemned to secrecy, these masters of manipulation follow the same methods. Alex and Al Barad are two of them. The former is the head of the D.G.S.E.''s (Direction Générale de la Sécurité Extérieure, the French equivalent of the CIA or the MI6) counter-terrorism unit while the latter reigns over a terrorist network, and both fight using the most ruthless of weapons: human beings.', 'In France, terrorist groups and intelligence agencies battle in a merciless war everyday, in the name of radically opposed ideologies. Yet, terrorist and secret agents lead almost the same lives. Condemned to secrecy, these masters of manipulation follow the same methods. Alex and Al Barad are two of them. The former is the head of the D.G.S.E.''s (Direction Générale de la Sécurité Extérieure, the French equivalent of the CIA or the MI6) counter-terrorism unit while the latter reigns over a terrorist network, and both fight using the most ruthless of weapons: human beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zE8Jxg6hUZW6YGkfUS1tj78u08l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18940'),
  ('253330336097657498', 'Secrets of the Heart', 1997, 'Drama', 'Montxo Armendáriz, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Carmelo Gómez, Charo López, Sílvia Munt, Vicky Peña, Andoni Erburu, Álvaro Nagore, Íñigo Garcés, Joan Vallès', null, 'Javi and his friend Carlos visit an old house on the outskirts of a small Spanish village. According to his brother Juan this is a haunted house and one can hear the voices of the dead. Later he is intrigued with a room which is always closed (the room where his father was found dead). He is so interested in these mysteries that he starts to investigate all the secrets of these dead people and their stories.', 'Javi and his friend Carlos visit an old house on the outskirts of a small Spanish village. According to his brother Juan this is a haunted house and one can hear the voices of the dead. Later he is intrigued with a room which is always closed (the room where his father was found dead). He is so interested in these mysteries that he starts to investigate all the secrets of these dead people and their stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4h71CyoiXoc1Kf2MipSlTd6XTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92603'),
  ('658401974048920969', 'Secrets of the Heavenly Book', 1983, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Wang Shuchen, Qian Yunda', 'Wang Shuchen, Bao Lei', 'Ding Jianhua, Bi Ke, Su Xiu, Cheng Xiaohua, Shi Rong, Yu Ding, Sun Yufeng, Hu Qinghan', null, 'Yuangong, the deacon, opened the shrine and exposed the holy book to the human world. He is now punished to guard the book for life by the jade emperor for breaking heaven’s law. In order to pass this holy book to human beings, he would have to get by the antagonist fox.', 'Yuangong, the deacon, opened the shrine and exposed the holy book to the human world. He is now punished to guard the book for life by the jade emperor for breaking heaven’s law. In order to pass this holy book to human beings, he would have to get by the antagonist fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4zkRCguNF9N0WdfBEZ9aQwlhsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134575'),
  ('152797468126367240', 'Secrets of the Neanderthals', 2024, 'Documentary, Mystery, History', 'Ashley Gething, Patrick Acum, Chris Openshaw', null, 'Patrick Stewart, Gabriel Andreu, Caroline Colomei, Kareem Alexander, Ibbi El Hani, Paula Parunov', 'PG', 'This documentary delves into the mysteries surrounding the Neanderthals and what their fossil record tells us about their lives and disappearance.', 'This documentary delves into the mysteries surrounding the Neanderthals and what their fossil record tells us about their lives and disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0CWLFH50qVjEbPZ1TowFxjOVFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255030'),
  ('393460141176630830', 'Secrets of the Saqqara Tomb', 2020, 'Documentary', 'James Tovell', null, 'Salima Ikram', null, 'This documentary follows a team of local archaeologists excavating never before explored passageways, shafts, and tombs, piecing together the secrets of Egypt’s most significant find in almost 50 years in Saqqara.', 'This documentary follows a team of local archaeologists excavating never before explored passageways, shafts, and tombs, piecing together the secrets of Egypt’s most significant find in almost 50 years in Saqqara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za9ANBaT0JAamJl0JjGXz5P1Gkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753583'),
  ('205205522775392071', 'Secrets of the State', 2003, 'Drama', 'Paolo Benvenuti, Gianni Marras', 'Mario Cereghino, Paolo Benvenuti, Paola Baroni', 'Antonio Catania, David Coco, Sergio Graziani, Aldo Puglisi, Francesco Guzzo', null, 'On the first of May 1947, the bandit Salvatore Giuliano conducted a raid to the mountain pass Portella della Ginestra, with a view to capturing Sicily''s most prominent communist, Giacomo Licausi. What actually happened was a regular massacre, leaving fourteen people dead and more than thirty wounded. In 1951, about a year after Giulano''s violent death, his men are tried in Viterbo. Unconvinced by the official version, Gaspare Pasciotta''s lawyer, decides to travel to Sicily and starts investigating the facts.', 'On the first of May 1947, the bandit Salvatore Giuliano conducted a raid to the mountain pass Portella della Ginestra, with a view to capturing Sicily''s most prominent communist, Giacomo Licausi. What actually happened was a regular massacre, leaving fourteen people dead and more than thirty wounded. In 1951, about a year after Giulano''s violent death, his men are tried in Viterbo. Unconvinced by the official version, Gaspare Pasciotta''s lawyer, decides to travel to Sicily and starts investigating the facts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jg4bLDA1npmvYpXuPwVcRvIaRfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112183'),
  ('98158690843234723', 'Secrets of the Tribe', 2010, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'José Padilha, Tuki Jencquel, Reynaldo Zangrandi', null, 'Robert Borofsky, Jesus Cardozo, Marie Isabel Eguillor, Brian Ferguson, Kenneth Good, Paul R. Gross, Raymond Hames, William Irons', null, 'What happens when western anthropologists descend on the Amazon and make one of the last unacculturated tribes in existence, the Yanomami, the most exhaustively filmed and studied tribe on the planet? Despite their "do no harm" creed and scientific aims, the small army of anthropologists that has studied the Yanomami since the 1960s has wreaked havoc among the tribe – and sparked a war within the anthropology community itself.', 'What happens when western anthropologists descend on the Amazon and make one of the last unacculturated tribes in existence, the Yanomami, the most exhaustively filmed and studied tribe on the planet? Despite their "do no harm" creed and scientific aims, the small army of anthropologists that has studied the Yanomami since the 1960s has wreaked havoc among the tribe – and sparked a war within the anthropology community itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY7vsm844oCfBcxZIZwMxz4XkRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79528'),
  ('1069515419505394850', 'Secrets of War', 2014, 'War, Family, Drama, History', 'Marc Ridremont, Dennis Bots, Rolf Dekens', 'Karen van Holst Pellekaan', 'Maas Bronkhuyzen, Joes Brauers, Pippa Allen, Nils Verkooijen, Loek Peters, Eva Duijvestein, Stefan de Walle, René van ''t Hof', null, 'Tuur and Lambert are best friends. But the war is closing in and is about to change their lives forever. Tuurs dad joined the resistance and even his big brother seems so be part of it. Lamberts family on the other hand choose to obey the Germans. Then a new girls from the city shows up, befriending the boys but telling her secret to only one of them. A choice that separates the boys and ultimately gets her in trouble.', 'Tuur and Lambert are best friends. But the war is closing in and is about to change their lives forever. Tuurs dad joined the resistance and even his big brother seems so be part of it. Lamberts family on the other hand choose to obey the Germans. Then a new girls from the city shows up, befriending the boys but telling her secret to only one of them. A choice that separates the boys and ultimately gets her in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpkEDbomA3ZhcVJxpuiTiGFk3jt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277190'),
  ('408806623053211032', 'Secrets on the Ranch', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Adrian Langley, Louis-Philippe Blain', 'Courtney Cilman', 'Camille Stopps, Jesse Collin, Amanda Ip, Dawn Ford, Xavier Sotelo', 'TV-PG', 'After taking over her family''s Montana ranch, a woman is brought back into a web of unexpected secrets when she discovers the remains of her missing sister on the property.', 'After taking over her family''s Montana ranch, a woman is brought back into a web of unexpected secrets when she discovers the remains of her missing sister on the property.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F642745a483801323fb18c34cfc10989c.jpg', 'plex:movie:secrets-on-the-ranch'),
  ('890146221094842909', 'Secrets, Objects', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Young-mi', 'Lee Young-mi, Lee Dong-hoon-I', 'Jang Seo-hee, Jung Suk-won, Lee Pil-mo, Shim Yi-young, Son Ji-na, Park Hee-jin, Wi Ji-Woong, Yoon Da-gyeong', null, '40-year-old Sociology professor Hye-jung falls for a 21-year-old Usang, a male student who helps her project research on women''s extramarital affair. Their prohibited love and secrets are watched and told by two secretive observers. They are her copy machine and his digital camera.', '40-year-old Sociology professor Hye-jung falls for a 21-year-old Usang, a male student who helps her project research on women''s extramarital affair. Their prohibited love and secrets are watched and told by two secretive observers. They are her copy machine and his digital camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDX9MZb6j7RVUOM39looJCRZOhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103608'),
  ('125522180934633728', 'Section 375', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sudhir K Chaudhary, Ajay Bahl', 'Ajay Bahl, Manish Gupta', 'Akshaye Khanna, Richa Chadha, Meera Chopra, Rahul Bhat, Shriswara Dubey, Kishore Kadam, Kruttika Desai, Sandhya Mridul', null, 'A filmmaker stands trial when a costume assistant on his movie accuses him of rape.', 'A filmmaker stands trial when a costume assistant on his movie accuses him of rape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7rVZ0KiPWxBMJBI8roIwlMvs2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507941'),
