  ('733346811522779196', 'Sector 36', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Aditya Nimbalkar, Saurabh Goswami, Haider Naqvi', 'Bodhayan Roychaudhury', 'Vikrant Massey, Deepak Dobriyal, Akash Khurana, Darshan Jariwala, Baharul Islam, Ivana Kaur, Mahadev Singh Lakhawat, Ajeet Singh Palawat', 'R', 'When several children disappear at the hands of a serial killer in Sector 36, a corrupt cop is forced to pursue the chilling case at all costs.', 'When several children disappear at the hands of a serial killer in Sector 36, a corrupt cop is forced to pursue the chilling case at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbVcZmmcfqk35Q9hNxRoR7JPiVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245700'),
  ('293604975287997899', 'Sector 7', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Kim Ji-hoon, Kang Seong-hoon, Lee Doo-man', 'Kim Hwi', 'Ha Ji-won, Oh Ji-ho, Ahn Sung-ki, Park Cheol-min, Song Sae-byuk, Lee Han-wi, Cha Ye-ryun, Park Jeong-hak', null, 'In Sector 7, an underwater oil field located south of Jeju Island, Hae-jun is working as a marine equipment manager on an oil prospecting ship called Eclipse. Joining the crew later is Jeong-man, a former colleague of Hae-jun''s father, assigned to Eclipse as captain. Though his job is to oversee the withdrawal of the ship, he suggests conducting some drilling one last time.', 'In Sector 7, an underwater oil field located south of Jeju Island, Hae-jun is working as a marine equipment manager on an oil prospecting ship called Eclipse. Joining the crew later is Jeong-man, a former colleague of Hae-jun''s father, assigned to Eclipse as captain. Though his job is to oversee the withdrawal of the ship, he suggests conducting some drilling one last time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41ZNHkEs7GYTI9994mW6BHCIP29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75821'),
  ('448186901723542458', 'Sector VIP', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Federico Jacobi, Cecilia Pinotti, Eduardo Pinto', 'Rodolfo Cela', 'Luis Machín, Martina Krasinsky, Joaquín Berthold, Victor Schajovitsch, Gaby Valenti, Nahuel Marcos Yotich, Claudio Santorelli, Pablo Pinto', null, 'A girl comes to town to work as a dancer, an entrepreneur of the night becomes his manager. A journalist in decline, looking for the news that catapults him. All three converge in the VIP Sector, where human trafficking, fake news and transgressions of power coexist.', 'A girl comes to town to work as a dancer, an entrepreneur of the night becomes his manager. A journalist in decline, looking for the news that catapults him. All three converge in the VIP Sector, where human trafficking, fake news and transgressions of power coexist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rueNvAXcAwg0QykOBJcwPHny1RW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:789658'),
  ('120433082131994803', 'Secuestro Express', 2004, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jonathan Jakubowicz', 'Jonathan Jakubowicz', 'Mía Maestro, Rubén Blades, Carlos Julio Molina, Pedro Perez, Carlos Madera, Jean Paul Leroux, Miguelangel Landa, Elba Escobar', 'R', 'Young couple Carla and Martin are abducted by three men and spend a terrifying night in Caracas as they wait for Carla''s father to hand over the ransom', 'Young couple Carla and Martin are abducted by three men and spend a terrifying night in Caracas as they wait for Carla''s father to hand over the ransom', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhCIkOgBj2lgEbCQ7eAVPgGH39A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25956'),
  ('298025714343022828', 'Security', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Alain Desrochers, Anton Bakarski, Ivan Vatsov', 'Tony Mosher', 'Antonio Banderas, Ben Kingsley, Liam McIntyre, Chad Lindberg, Gabriella Wright, Cung Le, Mark Rhino Smith, Bashar Rahal', 'R', 'An ex-special services veteran, down on his luck and desperate for work, takes a job as a security guard at a run-down mall in a rough area of town. On his first night on the job, he opens the door to a distraught and desperate young girl who has fled the hijacking of a Police motorcade that was transporting her to testify as a witness in a trial. Hot on her heels is the psychopathic hijacker and his team of henchmen, who will stop at nothing to extract and eliminate the witness.', 'An ex-special services veteran, down on his luck and desperate for work, takes a job as a security guard at a run-down mall in a rough area of town. On his first night on the job, he opens the door to a distraught and desperate young girl who has fled the hijacking of a Police motorcade that was transporting her to testify as a witness in a trial. Hot on her heels is the psychopathic hijacker and his team of henchmen, who will stop at nothing to extract and eliminate the witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FN5n8wGYrfSJaKGF9uObdKimIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460846'),
  ('1054882939072834083', 'Security', 2021, 'Thriller', 'David Turchi, Peter Chelsom, Mauro Fiore', 'Tinker Lindsay, Amina Grenci, Peter Chelsom', 'Marco D''Amore, Maya Sansa, Silvio Muccino, Valeria Bilello, Ludovica Martino, Giulio Pranno, Tommaso Ragno, Beatrice Grannò', 'NR', 'After the assault of a young woman in their seaside town, a security expert and his family get caught in a powerful riptide of secrets and lies.', 'After the assault of a young woman in their seaside town, a security expert and his family get caught in a powerful riptide of secrets and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLjN3vIw63GJ6m1J2fhGL3D2VXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666624'),
  ('718808475271722158', 'Security Unlimited', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Sam Hui', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Sam Hui, Marylinn Wong Cho-Shut, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Chan Sing, Lee Hoi-Sang, David Cheung', null, 'This is a story about a security guard agency and its three agents-Michael, Sam and Ricky. Sam and Ricky are delivering a large sum of money to a bank when a robbery takes place under their nose. after a series of hair-raising about hilarious chases, the agents get their men. With Michael and Sam giving their reward money to Ricky. They live haphazardly ever after.', 'This is a story about a security guard agency and its three agents-Michael, Sam and Ricky. Sam and Ricky are delivering a large sum of money to a bank when a robbery takes place under their nose. after a series of hair-raising about hilarious chases, the agents get their men. With Michael and Sam giving their reward money to Ricky. They live haphazardly ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82ib6cIRrnuW7XlyByU1WKfqarR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33063'),
  ('1120405929028104201', 'Seduce Me: Pamela Principle 2', 1994, 'Drama', 'Kim Haun, Edward Holzman, Rod Smith', 'Gerard Maguire', 'India Allen, Alina Thompson, Shannon McLeod, Elizabeth Sandifer, Daniel Anderson, Frank Pesce, Gabrielle Scream, Stephanie Hudson', null, 'Charles is bored with being a wealthy, successful architect. He takes a temporary job photographing undressed women and falls for Pamela. His wife, Elaine, has little sympathy for this mid-life crisis.', 'Charles is bored with being a wealthy, successful architect. He takes a temporary job photographing undressed women and falls for Pamela. His wife, Elaine, has little sympathy for this mid-life crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49q25ztKuV4r6oPRnenrRXEwMCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281029'),
  ('395377908267846106', 'Seduced and Abandoned', 1964, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Francesco Massaro, Renzo Marignano', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Saro Urzì, Aldo Puglisi, Lando Buzzanca, Lola Braccini, Leopoldo Trieste, Umberto Spadaro, Paola Biggio', null, 'The film presents the tale of Agnese Ascalone, daughter of prominent miner Vincenzo Ascalone, and takes place in a small town in Sicily. Agnese is seduced by her sister Matilde''s fiancé, and has a tryst with him for which she confesses and tries to repent, only to be discovered by her mother and father.', 'The film presents the tale of Agnese Ascalone, daughter of prominent miner Vincenzo Ascalone, and takes place in a small town in Sicily. Agnese is seduced by her sister Matilde''s fiancé, and has a tryst with him for which she confesses and tries to repent, only to be discovered by her mother and father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kmSfkHFaP4kQcoRnSHuxHmvfxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42790'),
  ('718838480246029709', 'Seducing Doctor Lewis', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-François Pouliot, Allen Smith', 'Ken Scott', 'Raymond Bouchard, David Boutin, Benoît Brière, Pierre Collin, Rita Lafontaine, Clémence DesRochers, Lucie Laurier, Bruno Blanchet', null, 'A much-needed boost, in the form of a new factory, is promised to the residents of the tiny fishing village St. Marie-La-Mauderne, provided they can lure a doctor to take up full-time residency on the island. Inspired, the villagers devise a scheme to make Dr. Christopher Lewis a local.', 'A much-needed boost, in the form of a new factory, is promised to the residents of the tiny fishing village St. Marie-La-Mauderne, provided they can lure a doctor to take up full-time residency on the island. Inspired, the villagers devise a scheme to make Dr. Christopher Lewis a local.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KmlSVLZK1GvvHDUncpTeTkifOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41277'),
  ('319344057022415972', 'Seducing Mr. Perfect', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Sang-woo, Yu Yeong-jong', 'Lee Yeong-suk, Lee ran, Do Min-ik', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Daniel Henney, Bang Joong-Hyun, Lee Sung-min, Ok Ji-young, Baek Do-bin, Park Hyun-young, Kim Ki-hyeon', null, 'A Korean company analyst rear-ends an American man''s car then discovers he''s her new boss. Unlucky at love, she begins to take romance lessons from him in order to seduce him.', 'A Korean company analyst rear-ends an American man''s car then discovers he''s her new boss. Unlucky at love, she begins to take romance lessons from him in order to seduce him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yj4AXMYp7KQGkhd1NwNeZzyAEEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52444'),
  ('900907624833810385', 'Seduction', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fernando Di Leo, Franco Villa', 'Valentino Bompiani, Fernando Di Leo, Ercole Patti', 'Jenny Tamburi, Maurice Ronet, Lisa Gastoni, Pino Caruso, Graziella Galvani, Barbara Marzano, Rosario Bonaventura, Giorgio Dolfin', null, 'After returning to Catania after a long period of time, Giuseppe reunites with his old lover, Caterina. Her 15 year-old daughter, Graziella begins to seduce her mother''s lover and he soon breaks down and begins an affair with her. As time passes Caterina begins having sneaking suspicions about Giuseppe''s & Graziella''s relationship.', 'After returning to Catania after a long period of time, Giuseppe reunites with his old lover, Caterina. Her 15 year-old daughter, Graziella begins to seduce her mother''s lover and he soon breaks down and begins an affair with her. As time passes Caterina begins having sneaking suspicions about Giuseppe''s & Graziella''s relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knwO5jOgrl6EN4CCBe4At51nU8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80601'),
  ('995172852470209350', 'Seduction in a Small Town', 1997, 'Drama', 'Charles Wilkinson, Michael Slovis', 'Bill Phillips', 'Melissa Gilbert, Dennis Weaver, G.W. Bailey, Brian McNamara, Joel Palmer, Joely Fisher, Ashley Doty, Valerie Pearson', null, 'A couple''s idyllic life is shattered when authorities accuse them of child abuse and take away their three young children. When they desperately search for the source of the rumors about them, their suspicions lead them to a young woman who recently arrived in their small town, but they can''t believe that this person they befriended would turn the town against them.', 'A couple''s idyllic life is shattered when authorities accuse them of child abuse and take away their three young children. When they desperately search for the source of the rumors about them, their suspicions lead them to a young woman who recently arrived in their small town, but they can''t believe that this person they befriended would turn the town against them.', null, 'tmdb:movie:258866'),
