  ('1138527616100234247', 'See Here My Love', 1979, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Hugo Santiago, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Claude Ollier, Hugo Santiago', 'Catherine Deneuve, Sami Frey, Florence Delay, Anne Parillaud, Didier Haudepin, Antoine Vitez, Jean-François Stévenin, François Dyrek', null, 'Young aristocrat Arnaud de Maule hires female private detective Claude Alphand to investigate a strange cult, the Church of the Final Revival, that tried to recruit his girlfriend Chloé, who then disappeared, and it now stalks him.', 'Young aristocrat Arnaud de Maule hires female private detective Claude Alphand to investigate a strange cult, the Church of the Final Revival, that tried to recruit his girlfriend Chloé, who then disappeared, and it now stalks him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIizA9s9X0umK8ENLXIBqiPHXlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346535'),
