  ('329318392636917955', 'See How They Run', 2022, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Jamie D. Ramsay, Robert Haynes, John Reid', 'Mark Chappell', 'Sam Rockwell, Saoirse Ronan, Adrien Brody, Ruth Wilson, Reece Shearsmith, Harris Dickinson, Charlie Cooper, David Oyelowo', 'PG-13', 'In the West End of 1950s London, plans for a movie version of a smash-hit play come to an abrupt halt after a pivotal member of the crew is murdered. When world-weary Inspector Stoppard and eager rookie Constable Stalker take on the case, the two find themselves thrown into a puzzling whodunit within the glamorously sordid theater underground, investigating the mysterious homicide at their own peril.', 'In the West End of 1950s London, plans for a movie version of a smash-hit play come to an abrupt halt after a pivotal member of the crew is murdered. When world-weary Inspector Stoppard and eager rookie Constable Stalker take on the case, the two find themselves thrown into a puzzling whodunit within the glamorously sordid theater underground, investigating the mysterious homicide at their own peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3rpSAi2yukZwr9H2km0WKGODWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766475'),
  ('88008991530303183', 'See Me After Class', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hideo Takahashi, Hiromitsu Kanazawa, Takayuki Uchida', 'Hiromitsu Kanazawa', 'Asami Shimoda, Azumi Asakura, Suzuko Mimori, Akiko Toda, Takahiro Fujiwara, Keisuke Sogo', null, 'Due to an error the male student Kagami Yuuki is registered for a room in the girls dormitory of his new co-ed high school. Since no male rooms are available he is left with no other option than to sleep in the girls dormitory in the same room as the teacher that made the mistak in the first place, Ayane-sensei. To avoid getting kicked out of the school for being a boy in a girls dormitory he has to cross-dress whenever he is leaving his room. Needless to say that this brings him a lot of trouble.', 'Due to an error the male student Kagami Yuuki is registered for a room in the girls dormitory of his new co-ed high school. Since no male rooms are available he is left with no other option than to sleep in the girls dormitory in the same room as the teacher that made the mistak in the first place, Ayane-sensei. To avoid getting kicked out of the school for being a boy in a girls dormitory he has to cross-dress whenever he is leaving his room. Needless to say that this brings him a lot of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3gNvSldV59CegfMYUFdB5wNaV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288737'),
  ('949915059774288243', 'See No Evil', 1971, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Richard Fleischer, Gerry Fisher', 'Brian Clemens', 'Mia Farrow, Dorothy Alison, Robin Bailey, Diane Grayson, Brian Rawlinson, Norman Eshley, Paul Nicholas, Christopher Matthews', 'PG', 'In the English countryside, Sarah Rexton, recently blinded in a horse riding accident, moves in with her uncle''s family and gallantly adjusts to her new condition, unaware that a killer stalks them.', 'In the English countryside, Sarah Rexton, recently blinded in a horse riding accident, moves in with her uncle''s family and gallantly adjusts to her new condition, unaware that a killer stalks them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gR2xs6S9F2zjPrmzWsgMXSdVX2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39859'),
  ('314578566432249259', 'See No Evil', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Ben Nott, Scott Lovelock', 'Dan Madigan', 'Glenn Jacobs, Christina Vidal Mitchell, Luke Pegler, Craig Horner, Rachael Taylor, Jason Chong, Michael J. Pagan, Samantha Noble', 'R', 'A group of delinquents are sent to clean the Blackwell Hotel but little do they know reclusive psychopath Jacob Goodnight has holed away in the rotting hotel. When one of the teens is captured, those who remain band together to survive against the brutal killer.', 'A group of delinquents are sent to clean the Blackwell Hotel but little do they know reclusive psychopath Jacob Goodnight has holed away in the rotting hotel. When one of the teens is captured, those who remain band together to survive against the brutal killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a0vqkB4SVIkl2JlHlUOcY9qmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10007'),
  ('829531125810070487', 'See No Evil 2', 2014, 'Horror', 'Andrew Niiranen, Mike Crain, Linda Crain', 'Nathan Brookes, Bobby Lee Darby', 'Danielle Harris, Glenn Jacobs, Kaj-Erik Eriksen, Katharine Isabelle, Chelan Simmons, Lee Majdoub, Greyston Holt, Michael Eklund', 'R', 'A group of friends pays a late-night visit to the city morgue to surprise Amy on her birthday. But the surprise is on them when the one-eyed corpse of brutal psychopath Jacob Goodnight unexpectedly rises from a cold sub-basement slab, turning their wild party into a terrifying slay-fest.', 'A group of friends pays a late-night visit to the city morgue to surprise Amy on her birthday. But the surprise is on them when the one-eyed corpse of brutal psychopath Jacob Goodnight unexpectedly rises from a cold sub-basement slab, turning their wild party into a terrifying slay-fest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGLfL5zg5mt3GXtJtEsk7kqTP93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226140'),
  ('176012534753856318', 'See No Evil, Hear No Evil', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Victor J. Kemper, Arthur Hiller, Mark McGann', 'Earl Barret, Arne Sultan, Eliot Wald', 'Richard Pryor, Gene Wilder, Joan Severance, Kevin Spacey, Alan North, Alexandra Neil, John Capodice, Tonya Pinkins', 'R', 'A murder takes place in the shop of David Lyons, a deaf man who fails to hear the gunshot being fired. Outside, blind man Wally Karue hears the shot, but cannot see the perpetrator. Both are arrested, but escape to form an unlikely partnership. Being chased by both the law AND the original killers, can the pair work together to outwit them all?', 'A murder takes place in the shop of David Lyons, a deaf man who fails to hear the gunshot being fired. Outside, blind man Wally Karue hears the shot, but cannot see the perpetrator. Both are arrested, but escape to form an unlikely partnership. Being chased by both the law AND the original killers, can the pair work together to outwit them all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9JrnUotqhKTUQEgg2UzDQ7nME2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11185'),
  ('1026168242547299457', 'See Spot Run', 2001, 'Family, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'John Whitesell, John S. Bartley', 'Gregory Poirier, Dan Baron, Chris Faber', 'David Arquette, Leslie Bibb, Michael Clarke Duncan, Angus T. Jones, Anthony Anderson, Paul Sorvino, Joe Viterelli, Steve Schirripa', 'PG', 'A drug sniffing agent canine is a target for an assassin boss so the FBI calls Witness Protection to send him somewhere else. Meanwhile a single Mom puts her 6 year old boy James in the care of her irresponsible, mailman, neighbor, Gordon, when the babysitter bails on her. Meanwhile, an assassin mob boss hires 2 goons to kill Agent 11. But when 11 escapes from the van when they tried to kill him, he hides in Gordon''s Mailtruck that James is in too. And guess what they name him. Spot.', 'A drug sniffing agent canine is a target for an assassin boss so the FBI calls Witness Protection to send him somewhere else. Meanwhile a single Mom puts her 6 year old boy James in the care of her irresponsible, mailman, neighbor, Gordon, when the babysitter bails on her. Meanwhile, an assassin mob boss hires 2 goons to kill Agent 11. But when 11 escapes from the van when they tried to kill him, he hides in Gordon''s Mailtruck that James is in too. And guess what they name him. Spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29iKqRGRcNqhrT710ohxVq5WwcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39180'),
  ('916277790471250704', 'See the Sea', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'François Ozon, Yorick Le Saux', 'François Ozon, Isabelle Broué', 'Sasha Hails, Marina de Van, Samantha, Paul Raoux', 'NR', 'Sasha, a young British woman, is living with her baby daughter at Ile d''Yeu, a peaceful beach community. A stranger appears. Her name is Tatiana, she''s passing through, and pitches her tent in Sasha''s yard. The two women build an odd rapport, and tension builds as events unfold.', 'Sasha, a young British woman, is living with her baby daughter at Ile d''Yeu, a peaceful beach community. A stranger appears. Her name is Tatiana, she''s passing through, and pitches her tent in Sasha''s yard. The two women build an odd rapport, and tension builds as events unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8gnjkOv5GKg0fyW8hf7tA2dix4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46748'),
