  ('717834861290976594', 'Seemabaddha', 1971, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Barun Chanda, Sharmila Tagore, Paromita Chowdhury, Indira Roy, Promode Ganguly, Haradhan Bandyopadhyay, Harindranath Chattopadhyay, Dipankar Dey', null, 'Ambitious businessman Shyamalendu enjoys showing his visiting sister-in-law, Tutul, the extravagant life he leads with his wife. But Tutul is less than impressed with the trappings of wealth.', 'Ambitious businessman Shyamalendu enjoys showing his visiting sister-in-law, Tutul, the extravagant life he leads with his wife. But Tutul is less than impressed with the trappings of wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1123G9zGCavlBLkJt9sOPKkXQdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45940'),
  ('1066800333852662582', 'Seemingly Perfect Family', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Lisa France, Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan', 'Daniel West, Ken Sanders', 'Rylee Reagan, Sarah Nicklin, Violet SinClair, Sharonne Lanier, Patric Palkens', 'TV-14', 'Inspired by true events. When 18-year-old Lexi ages out of the foster care system and lies to get an au pair job, the dream family she is working for turns out to be a nightmare as she uncovers their twisted secrets. Rylee Reagan stars.', 'Inspired by true events. When 18-year-old Lexi ages out of the foster care system and lies to get an au pair job, the dream family she is working for turns out to be a nightmare as she uncovers their twisted secrets. Rylee Reagan stars.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6zWfc362NggxvIkqgMsAR4PskfH.jpg', 'plex:movie:seemingly-perfect-family'),
  ('491061782653990269', 'Seems Like Old Times', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jay Sandrich, Jack Aldworth, Venita Ozols-Graham', 'Neil Simon', 'Goldie Hawn, Chevy Chase, Charles Grodin, Robert Guillaume, Harold Gould, George Grizzard, Yvonne Wilder, T.K. Carter', 'PG', 'After being falsely accused of robbing a bank, a writer seeks the help of his lawyer ex-wife to clear his name. However, hilarity ensues when he must hide from her husband, who’s throwing a party for law enforcement officials.', 'After being falsely accused of robbing a bank, a writer seeks the help of his lawyer ex-wife to clear his name. However, hilarity ensues when he must hide from her husband, who’s throwing a party for law enforcement officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mT6l2TO3kbeG7olZV5Zmd8MqSh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28124'),
  ('41289567155004909', 'Seeta and Geeta', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance, Adventure', 'Ramesh Sippy', 'Salim Khan, Satish Bhatnagar, Javed Akhtar', 'Hema Malini, Sanjeev Kumar, Dharmendra, Manorama, Satyendra Kapoor, Roopesh Kumar, Honey Irani, Pratima Devi', null, 'Long-suffering heiress Seeta is treated worse than a servant by her abusive money-grubbing aunt. Meanwhile, her long-lost twin sister Geeta grows up to be a gutsy street performer. One day, the girls unintentionally swap places.', 'Long-suffering heiress Seeta is treated worse than a servant by her abusive money-grubbing aunt. Meanwhile, her long-lost twin sister Geeta grows up to be a gutsy street performer. One day, the girls unintentionally swap places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2tl8IoE8uMvJe6ICTU7Nk07dKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35751'),
  ('953277498404526219', 'Seetha Payanam', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Arjun Sarja, G Balamurugan', 'Arjun Sarja, Sai Madhav Burra, Chandrabose', 'Aishwarya Arjun, Niranjan Sudhindra, Sai Madhav Burra, Chandrabose, Kasarla Shyam', null, 'Chef Seetha survives an accident and seeks to thank her saviors. She falls for stranger Abhishek, who hides a secret. When truth surfaces, she must choose between love, honesty, and her future.', 'Chef Seetha survives an accident and seeks to thank her saviors. She falls for stranger Abhishek, who hides a secret. When truth surfaces, she must choose between love, honesty, and her future.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfHTdiVZlS2SuZA2t8wFTedu0ZT6.jpg', 'plex:movie:seetha-payanam'),
  ('502546380464218355', 'Segundo López, Urban Adventurer', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Ana Mariscal, José Luis Jerez, Gervasio Banciella', 'Leocadio Mejías, Ana Mariscal', 'Ana Mariscal, Luisita Esteso, Severiano Población, Martín Ramírez, Tony Leblanc, Adela Carbone, Mariano Azaña, Dolores Bremón', null, 'Segundo López, a mature and very humble man who has arrived in Madrid from Cáceres, his homeland, meets Francisca, with whom he falls in love, and El Chirri, a roguish street urchin with whom he will have adventures all over the huge and hostile city.', 'Segundo López, a mature and very humble man who has arrived in Madrid from Cáceres, his homeland, meets Francisca, with whom he falls in love, and El Chirri, a roguish street urchin with whom he will have adventures all over the huge and hostile city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijTHvFB6Vh4sbZueT2aJldfm4Gh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392270'),
  ('68345403604220275', 'Segurança Nacional', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Roberto Carminati, Juliano Cortuah, Bruno Fantini', 'Roberto Carminati, Bruno Fantini, Daniel Ortiz', 'Milton Gonçalves, Thiago Lacerda, Ângela Vieira, Joaquín Cosío, Gracindo Júnior, Aílton Graça, Viviane Victorette, Javier Robles', null, 'The Brazilian Government leads Latin American countries in the fight against drug cartels. In response drug cartels start a series of attacks against Brazil''s cities and natural resources. Their first target is the Amazon Forest.', 'The Brazilian Government leads Latin American countries in the fight against drug cartels. In response drug cartels start a series of attacks against Brazil''s cities and natural resources. Their first target is the Amazon Forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVGzrxslFxg2GrmNS7sJ2jWUFG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45060'),
  ('9435763180805198', 'Sehar', 2005, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kabeer Kaushik', 'Kabeer Kaushik', 'Arshad Warsi, Sushant Singh, Pankaj Kapur, Mahima Chaudhry, Suhasini Mulay, Rajendra Gupta, Naved Aslam, Ghanshyam Garg', null, 'Ajay Kumar (Warsi) is the newly appointed, honest SSP of Lucknow police. Of his family only his mother (Mulay) remains, and she inspires and motivates him to do the right thing. Ajay tries to crack down on the UP mafia, but more often than not is betrayed by information-leaking local police officials. His boss tries to aid him by shielding him from political pressures, and by getting sanction for', 'Ajay Kumar (Warsi) is the newly appointed, honest SSP of Lucknow police. Of his family only his mother (Mulay) remains, and she inspires and motivates him to do the right thing. Ajay tries to crack down on the UP mafia, but more often than not is betrayed by information-leaking local police officials. His boss tries to aid him by shielding him from political pressures, and by getting sanction for', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfLIFMSy7wNbGQPfZftqRTzfJoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33460'),
  ('882832709719636561', 'Seiai scandal: Kokeshi to hanayome', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yutaka Ikejima, Yōichi Shiga, Obihiro Kitagawa', 'Kyoko Godai', 'Meguri Fujiura, Yui Kawagoe, Maya Sawamura, Takashi Naha, Taishi Takemoto, Riko Matsui, Guriko Yamanote, Misa Wada', null, 'Homma, a shy and hard-working car mechanic, said goodbye to Mao (Maya Sawamura), a delivery health girl who has forgiven her heart for three years. This is because he started dating with an office lady named Yurie (Meguri) who he met at a matchmaking party and got engaged. Mao was a little jealous when he realized that he secretly loved Honma, but wished for the relationship between adults and the happiness of Honma. On the way home one day, Homma found a dirty kokeshi doll, cleaned it with a handkerchief moistened with water, and placed it on the flowerbed. That night, a strange young woman (Yui Kawagoe) visited the room. She forcibly went up to the room and said that she was a kokeshi doll...', 'Homma, a shy and hard-working car mechanic, said goodbye to Mao (Maya Sawamura), a delivery health girl who has forgiven her heart for three years. This is because he started dating with an office lady named Yurie (Meguri) who he met at a matchmaking party and got engaged. Mao was a little jealous when he realized that he secretly loved Honma, but wished for the relationship between adults and the happiness of Honma. On the way home one day, Homma found a dirty kokeshi doll, cleaned it with a handkerchief moistened with water, and placed it on the flowerbed. That night, a strange young woman (Yui Kawagoe) visited the room. She forcibly went up to the room and said that she was a kokeshi doll...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRp7B598rUVMeiaugCcS4lvKvma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803224'),
