  ('928356476424673192', 'Seisaku''s Wife', 1965, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Tomohiro Akino', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Ayako Wakao, Takahiro Tamura, Yūzō Hayakawa, Shoichi Ozawa, Yuka Konno, Taiji Tonoyama, Nobuo Chiba, Noriko Hodaka', null, 'On the eve of the Russo-Japanese war at the beginning of the 20th century, small-town girl Okane has married an old wealthy man to escape a life of poverty.', 'On the eve of the Russo-Japanese war at the beginning of the 20th century, small-town girl Okane has married an old wealthy man to escape a life of poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzzAQ5sADh8LrqACfL23Qo1E0JX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115647'),
  ('1145746296123014387', 'Seitenwechsel', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Hagen Bogdanski, Vivian Naefe', 'Katharina Eyssen, Andrea Sixt', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Mina Tander, Ruby O. Fee, Friederike Kempter, Anna Maria Mühe, Axel Stein, Frederick Lau, Steve Windolf', null, 'The relationship of Alex and Teresa has hit hard times. After 15 years of marriage, the passionate football coach and the sensitive psychoanalyst do not respect each other''s needs anymore, and thus they are arguing constantly. Even a divorce seems possible, but then something unbelievable happens: After another ugly fight during a big thunderstorm, they switch bodies. Trapped, they have to play each other''s roles, and chaos is bound to follow.', 'The relationship of Alex and Teresa has hit hard times. After 15 years of marriage, the passionate football coach and the sensitive psychoanalyst do not respect each other''s needs anymore, and thus they are arguing constantly. Even a divorce seems possible, but then something unbelievable happens: After another ugly fight during a big thunderstorm, they switch bodies. Trapped, they have to play each other''s roles, and chaos is bound to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fbF5DO7veXtbQvEAdWNioqHUOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389379'),
  ('98338068276951715', 'Seize the Day', 1986, 'Drama', 'Mark Croll, Dwight Williams, Fielder Cook', 'Ronald Ribman', 'Robin Williams, Jerry Stiller, Joseph Wiseman, Glenne Headly, John Fiedler, Richard B. Shull, Katherine Borowitz, Louis Guss', null, 'Tommy Wilhelm (Robin Williams) is a salesman. An honest, hard-working guy who has lost his job, his girlfriend, and left part of his sanity behind as he heads to New York to pick up the pieces of his life. He''s always been able to sell, but caught in a downward spiral, he must, in addition, face the father who never really understood him, while trying to balance his newly precarious existence.', 'Tommy Wilhelm (Robin Williams) is a salesman. An honest, hard-working guy who has lost his job, his girlfriend, and left part of his sanity behind as he heads to New York to pick up the pieces of his life. He''s always been able to sell, but caught in a downward spiral, he must, in addition, face the father who never really understood him, while trying to balance his newly precarious existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lw1k5uiqqWyRaZ47sxITKlgKJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140071'),
  ('1141255852215918952', 'Seize Them!', 2024, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Curtis Vowell, Ashley Rowe, Murray McKeown', 'Andy Riley', 'Aimee Lou Wood, Lolly Adefope, Nicola Coughlan, Jessica Hynes, Nick Frost, Paul Kaye, Nitin Ganatra, Murray McArthur', null, 'An arrogant queen becomes a fugitive in her own land after being overthrown by a charismatic revolutionary and must face hardship and danger as she embarks on a voyage to win back her throne.', 'An arrogant queen becomes a fugitive in her own land after being overthrown by a charismatic revolutionary and must face hardship and danger as she embarks on a voyage to win back her throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41ObLC8TWDLnEKjMlax519wPNk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:954802'),
  ('296358250506227171', 'Seized', 2020, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Isaac Florentine', 'Richard Lowry', 'Scott Adkins, Mario Van Peebles, Matthew Garbacz, Steven Elder, James P. Bennett, Karlee Perez, Peter Organ, David Fernandez Jr.', 'R', 'Hiding out with his son Taylor on the Mexican coast, Nero hopes to put his violent Special Forces career behind him. But after Nero’s home is attacked and Taylor is abducted, the mysterious Mzamo orders Nero to slaughter the members of three rival crime syndicates. If he fails, Taylor will die. Now, with bullets flying and bodies dropping as Nero completes his mission, he races to find Mzamo’s hideout and seek revenge.', 'Hiding out with his son Taylor on the Mexican coast, Nero hopes to put his violent Special Forces career behind him. But after Nero’s home is attacked and Taylor is abducted, the mysterious Mzamo orders Nero to slaughter the members of three rival crime syndicates. If he fails, Taylor will die. Now, with bullets flying and bodies dropping as Nero completes his mission, he races to find Mzamo’s hideout and seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4SHHEf6MH1Z1GmUZBtHwJL7YbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572751'),
  ('603659307263862892', 'Seizure', 1974, 'Horror', 'Oliver Stone', 'Oliver Stone, Edward Mann', 'Jonathan Frid, Martine Beswick, Joseph Sirola, Christina Pickles, Hervé Villechaize, Anne Meacham, Roger De Koven, Troy Donahue', 'PG', 'A disturbed author''s house party becomes a scene of carnage when three of his homicidal creations appear.', 'A disturbed author''s house party becomes a scene of carnage when three of his homicidal creations appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vY4XtaLvSJxRHg3QQI9Zq0pH4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29854'),
  ('712411440284704822', 'Sekaiichi Hatsukoi Movie', 2014, 'Animation, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Chiaki Kon', 'Chiaki Kon', 'Kenyu Horiuchi, Toru Furuya, Katsuyuki Konishi, Yui Horie, Yuichi Nakamura', 'NR', 'Yokozawa meets a man (Kirishima) and his life is turned around. Kirishima starts to blackmail and tease Yokozawa, but Kirishima might actually be trying to help him recover from an emotional period of his life in the process.', 'Yokozawa meets a man (Kirishima) and his life is turned around. Kirishima starts to blackmail and tease Yokozawa, but Kirishima might actually be trying to help him recover from an emotional period of his life in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWQC14a1XjgYqT4GI5nvF522naT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448441'),
  ('45293812602755348', 'Sekal Has to Die', 1998, 'Drama', 'Vladimír Michálek, Martin Štrba, Martina Pálková', 'Jiří Křižan', 'Bogusław Linda, Olaf Lubaszenko, Jiří Bartoška, Agnieszka Sitek, Vlasta Chramostová, Ľudovít Cittel, Martin Sitta, Jiří Holý', null, 'ComiBaran, a protestant blacksmith arrives in the little village of Lakotice to kill Sekal, a cruel Nazi collaborator.', 'ComiBaran, a protestant blacksmith arrives in the little village of Lakotice to kill Sekal, a cruel Nazi collaborator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dsAmcyVnfR9MXjciNvMBUdRPFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136896'),
  ('70321321747473448', 'Sekigahara', 2017, 'War, History, Drama', 'Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Masato Harada', 'Junichi Okada, Kasumi Arimura, Koji Yakusho, Takehiro Hira, Masahiro Higashide, Yasumasa Oba, Kenichi Matsuyama, Shihou Harumi', null, 'The background to and depiction of a watershed battle in Japanese history, at Sekigahara in 1600, when Tokugawa Ieyasu''s Army of the East defeated the Army of the West of Ishida Mitsunari. The story includes the intrigues and shifting loyalties of the various retainers, family members, and samurai.', 'The background to and depiction of a watershed battle in Japanese history, at Sekigahara in 1600, when Tokugawa Ieyasu''s Army of the East defeated the Army of the West of Ishida Mitsunari. The story includes the intrigues and shifting loyalties of the various retainers, family members, and samurai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juY76LvfACsS9AnKKktIKdzH1mR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455954'),
  ('218653972544146969', 'Selam', 2013, 'Drama', 'Levent Demirkale', 'Necati Şahin', 'Yunus Emre Yıldırımer, Burçin Abdullah, Hasan Nihat Sütçü, Emre Karakoç, Fatma Karanfil, Saba Mehri', null, '''Selam'' is a Turkish movie that tells the impressive stories of three Turkish teachers who are idealists working at schools opened by Turkish entrepreneurs on three different continents and in three different countries: Afghanistan, Senegal, and Bosnia and Herzegovina. This story is based on true events that has been in progress for more than 20 years in which a number of young people in love of peace and humanity leave their countries to teach, help and live in countries they have never heard of before. This is the story of people who live for their ideals and other people before themselves, and who leave their families, loves, friends, countries behind. They set on this pet just with the inspiration of the words which said "A couple of eyes are waiting for you here, but thousands of eyes are waiting in faraway lands." They had sacrifice and kindness in their bags, love in their hearts and a smiling Selam (greetings) in their tongues. - Written by Akif Okumus', '''Selam'' is a Turkish movie that tells the impressive stories of three Turkish teachers who are idealists working at schools opened by Turkish entrepreneurs on three different continents and in three different countries: Afghanistan, Senegal, and Bosnia and Herzegovina. This story is based on true events that has been in progress for more than 20 years in which a number of young people in love of peace and humanity leave their countries to teach, help and live in countries they have never heard of before. This is the story of people who live for their ideals and other people before themselves, and who leave their families, loves, friends, countries behind. They set on this pet just with the inspiration of the words which said "A couple of eyes are waiting for you here, but thousands of eyes are waiting in faraway lands." They had sacrifice and kindness in their bags, love in their hearts and a smiling Selam (greetings) in their tongues. - Written by Akif Okumus', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIDdqTQHQjtBZRj7XicBCSpDGFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175091'),
  ('341647548926929763', 'Selamsız''s Band', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Mustafa Koçyiğit, İrfan Eroğlu, Hakan Aytekin', null, 'Şener Şen, Ali Uyandıran, Üstün Asutay, Güzin Çorağan, Uğur Yücel, Can Kolukısa, Cengiz Tünay, Celal Perk', null, 'Selamsiz (wich means ''no greeting'') is a small town in Anatolia. The town has a lot of problems but noone from governments come and see the town. One day the mayor learns that the prime minister will come to the city. They, now, have a chance to solve their problems. However, they think that they should have a band to greet the prime minister.', 'Selamsiz (wich means ''no greeting'') is a small town in Anatolia. The town has a lot of problems but noone from governments come and see the town. One day the mayor learns that the prime minister will come to the city. They, now, have a chance to solve their problems. However, they think that they should have a band to greet the prime minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r00yDAQ5iHAnKmmhJIWko5mVrwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31176'),
  ('998328993438453723', 'Selena Gomez: My Mind & Me', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alek Keshishian, Matthias Schubert, David Paul Jacobson', 'Alek Keshishian, Paul Marchand', 'Selena Gomez, Raquelle Stevens, Ashley Cook, Liana Blackburn, Brent L. Boxberger, Devyck Bull, Mia Campagna, Rodney Chonia', 'R', 'After years in the limelight, Selena Gomez achieves unimaginable stardom. But just as she reaches a new peak, an unexpected turn pulls her into darkness. This uniquely raw and intimate documentary spans her six-year journey into a new light.', 'After years in the limelight, Selena Gomez achieves unimaginable stardom. But just as she reaches a new peak, an unexpected turn pulls her into darkness. This uniquely raw and intimate documentary spans her six-year journey into a new light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMpsswJv8x4vnOnIKqs4xJs2Kn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022256'),
  ('499252085337520789', 'Selena Live! The Last Concert', 1995, 'Music, Documentary', null, null, 'Selena Quintanilla, Chris Pérez, Suzette Arriaga, A.B. Quintanilla, Arturo Meza, Joe Ojeda, Don Shelton, Ricky Vela', 'NR', 'The concert was recorded on February 26, 1995, at the “Houston Astrodome” and was televised live on Univision. The singer shared the concert with Tejano singer “Emilio Navaira” and performed to 66,994 people, which broke the previous attendance record held by Selena in the previous year. Selena''s performance at the Astrodome became her final televised concert before she was shot and killed on March 31, 1995. The set list mostly included material from her "Amor Prohibido" (1994) album and a medley mashup of disco music songs.', 'The concert was recorded on February 26, 1995, at the “Houston Astrodome” and was televised live on Univision. The singer shared the concert with Tejano singer “Emilio Navaira” and performed to 66,994 people, which broke the previous attendance record held by Selena in the previous year. Selena''s performance at the Astrodome became her final televised concert before she was shot and killed on March 31, 1995. The set list mostly included material from her "Amor Prohibido" (1994) album and a medley mashup of disco music songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVgHumgohTo0QhmlKb2tfuKUAwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251799'),
  ('766333282614163416', 'Selena y Los Dinos: A Family''s Legacy', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Isabel Castro', null, 'Selena Quintanilla', 'PG', 'Never-before-seen footage and intimate interviews celebrate the life and legacy of iconic Mexican American singer Selena Quintanilla and her family band.', 'Never-before-seen footage and intimate interviews celebrate the life and legacy of iconic Mexican American singer Selena Quintanilla and her family band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dNDTnc2KsX7g73V5l1D0YCAQqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400784'),
  ('493608932937999803', 'Self', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Searit Huluf, Adam Habib, Mathieu Cassagne', 'Searit Huluf', 'Searit Huluf', 'PG', 'A wooden puppet who desperately wants to fit in makes an ill-fated wish upon a star, sparking a journey of self-discovery.', 'A wooden puppet who desperately wants to fit in makes an ill-fated wish upon a star, sparking a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrbBVDmC4lTquL5NvNbom9RAzbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221396'),
  ('86285924664236284', 'Self Control', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'Donald hears a radio philosopher advise to laugh and count ten when he gets angry. He tries it successfully, then settles into his hammock for a nap. Between a caterpillar and the hen chasing it, he''s soon tangled up and counting ten again. He also shrugs off a bird using his lemonade as a birdbath, but when a woodpecker attacks his apple tree, burying Donald in apples, he snaps.', 'Donald hears a radio philosopher advise to laugh and count ten when he gets angry. He tries it successfully, then settles into his hammock for a nap. Between a caterpillar and the hen chasing it, he''s soon tangled up and counting ten again. He also shrugs off a bird using his lemonade as a birdbath, but when a woodpecker attacks his apple tree, burying Donald in apples, he snaps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcSi64FFA0Jehkm5gXHxMZGhKd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69105'),
  ('252640675408027613', 'Self Defense', 1983, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Paul Donovan, Cordell Wynne, Maura O''Connell', 'Paul Donovan', 'Tom Nardini, Brenda Bazinet, Daryl Haney, Terry-David Després, Jack Blum, Keith Knight, Doug Lennox, Jeff Pustil', 'R', 'During a police strike in Nova Scotia''s capital city, a gang of hoodlums end up unintentionally causing the owner of a gay bar to be killed. This escalates into a string of murders with a lone survivor trying to not be next.', 'During a police strike in Nova Scotia''s capital city, a gang of hoodlums end up unintentionally causing the owner of a gay bar to be killed. This escalates into a string of murders with a lone survivor trying to not be next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSu6cSghAcmm8gyh4xDjEonQfSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40169'),
  ('974270499326378768', 'Self Portrait', 1988, 'Animation', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, null, 'This extremely brief film was Osamu Tezuka''s answer to a challenge presented to the leaders of the international animation community to create animated self-portraits.', 'This extremely brief film was Osamu Tezuka''s answer to a challenge presented to the leaders of the international animation community to create animated self-portraits.', null, 'tmdb:movie:283074'),
  ('373639063581718050', 'Self Reliance', 2024, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Adam Silver, Jake Johnson', 'Jake Johnson', 'Jake Johnson, Anna Kendrick, Natalie Morales, Andy Samberg, Mary Holland, Emily Hampshire, Nancy Lenehan, Daryl J. Johnson', 'R', 'When a man is offered a million dollars to play a game in which hunters try to kill him, he thinks he has found the perfect loophole: they can only attack when he’s alone. His only problem is that none of his friends or family believe the game is real. Forced to seek companionship in unexpected places, he navigates the bizarre challenge with humor, paranoia, and a surprising search for connection.', 'When a man is offered a million dollars to play a game in which hunters try to kill him, he thinks he has found the perfect loophole: they can only attack when he’s alone. His only problem is that none of his friends or family believe the game is real. Forced to seek companionship in unexpected places, he navigates the bizarre challenge with humor, paranoia, and a surprising search for connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlSWmmuuLeV1p3YcIkU59khEHLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072876'),
