  ('1067635572159017458', 'Self/less', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Tarsem Singh, Brendan Galvin, Jason Rhein', 'Àlex Pastor, David Pastor', 'Ryan Reynolds, Ben Kingsley, Natalie Martinez, Matthew Goode, Michelle Dockery, Melora Hardin, Victor Garber, Sam Page', 'PG-13', 'An extremely wealthy elderly man dying from cancer undergoes a radical medical procedure that transfers his consciousness to the body of a healthy young man but everything may not be as good as it seems when he starts to uncover the mystery of the body''s origins and the secret organization that will kill to keep its secrets.', 'An extremely wealthy elderly man dying from cancer undergoes a radical medical procedure that transfers his consciousness to the body of a healthy young man but everything may not be as good as it seems when he starts to uncover the mystery of the body''s origins and the secret organization that will kill to keep its secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ri3y5n3BXahy6lu2i0ndrqA4CA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238615'),
  ('799996839041768142', 'Selfie', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Víctor García León, Eva Díaz Iglesias', 'Víctor García León', 'Santi Alverú, Pepe Ocio, Alicia Rubio, Macarena Sanz, Javier Carramiñana', null, 'Bosco is the son of a minister arrested for corruption, misappropriation of public funds, money laundering and a lot more of economic crimes. Selfie is about the story of him since he''s kicked out of his luxurious chalet until he tries to get a job at the headquarters of a left-wing political party.', 'Bosco is the son of a minister arrested for corruption, misappropriation of public funds, money laundering and a lot more of economic crimes. Selfie is about the story of him since he''s kicked out of his luxurious chalet until he tries to get a job at the headquarters of a left-wing political party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1qRrnTx4y85sZUwf33ZFhlYm7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445840'),
  ('739252613982407840', 'Selfie', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Agostino Ferrente, Alessandro Antonelli, Pietro Orlando', 'Agostino Ferrente', 'Pietro Orlando, Alessandro Antonelli', null, 'Naples, Trajan''s district. Initially it was intended for the inhabitants of the shantytowns on the seafront of Naples, who were homeless after the war. But it soon became a kind of ghetto. Alessandro and Pietro are two teenagers who film with an iPhone to tell their difficult neighborhood, their daily life, the friendship that binds them.', 'Naples, Trajan''s district. Initially it was intended for the inhabitants of the shantytowns on the seafront of Naples, who were homeless after the war. But it soon became a kind of ghetto. Alessandro and Pietro are two teenagers who film with an iPhone to tell their difficult neighborhood, their daily life, the friendship that binds them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZd21f945K5aPZlJr8HPFCqfWVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574236'),
  ('52131631120685551', 'Selfie', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Vianney Lebasque, Marc Fitoussi, Tristan Aurouet', 'Heléne Lombard, Bertrand Soulier, Noé Debré', 'Max Boublil, Blanche Gardin, Sébastien Chassagne, Elsa Zylberstein, Idir Chender, Estéban, Mariama Gueye, Alma Jodorowsky', null, 'In a world where digital technology has invaded our lives, some of us end up cracking. Addict or technophobe, with family or at school, at work or in love, SELFIE tells the comic and wild destinies of Homo Numericus on the verge of a nervous breakdown.', 'In a world where digital technology has invaded our lives, some of us end up cracking. Addict or technophobe, with family or at school, at work or in love, SELFIE tells the comic and wild destinies of Homo Numericus on the verge of a nervous breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPoOB4BOm3EfUMgYxjuzPLuwi59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613319'),
  ('221901551536204792', 'Selfie from Hell', 2018, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Erdal Ceylan', 'Erdal Ceylan, Paul Burton', 'Alyson Walker, Tony Giroux, Meelah Adams, Ian Butcher, Matthew Graham', null, 'Julia, an online vlogger from Germany, comes to the US to visit her cousin Hannah. Upon her arrival, Julia falls fatefully ill, prompting Hannah''s suspicion of the strange and sudden illness. When unusual happenings start taking place in her home, Hannah begins a relentless internet search to discover the cause. She comes across Julia''s vlog entries and finds herself immersed deep in the web - too deep - in a place where terror knows no end.', 'Julia, an online vlogger from Germany, comes to the US to visit her cousin Hannah. Upon her arrival, Julia falls fatefully ill, prompting Hannah''s suspicion of the strange and sudden illness. When unusual happenings start taking place in her home, Hannah begins a relentless internet search to discover the cause. She comes across Julia''s vlog entries and finds herself immersed deep in the web - too deep - in a place where terror knows no end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmjj2PY1IEgi9e4WOQXDskII2iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494058'),
  ('196198080010699836', 'Selfiee', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rajeev Ravi, Raj Mehta, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Rishabh Sharma', 'Akshay Kumar, Emraan Hashmi, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Diana Penty, Mahesh Thakur, Akashdeep Sabir, Neev Ahuja, Abhimanyu Singh', 'NR', 'RTO officer Om Prakash strikes a golden opportunity to meet his icon, Vijay Kumar. Bhut when his love gets spurned by the superstar, a clash of egos ensues.', 'RTO officer Om Prakash strikes a golden opportunity to meet his icon, Vijay Kumar. Bhut when his love gets spurned by the superstar, a clash of egos ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QU1MCj0gFEZzIKl6pbfLsfClbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926130'),
  ('932836887801310420', 'Selina''s Gold', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mac Alejandre', null, 'Angeli Khang, Gold Aceron, Jay Manalo, Azi Acosta, Soliman Cruz, Aurora Sevilla, Mickey Ferriols, Archie Adamos', null, 'Selina''s father sells her to Tiago who makes her a sex slave. With the help of Domeng, Tiago''s blind slave, she plans their way out of this living hell.', 'Selina''s father sells her to Tiago who makes her a sex slave. With the help of Domeng, Tiago''s blind slave, she plans their way out of this living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a0X2GKDmhhp1U2FUKtKY6uNQHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029446'),
  ('100667780393829549', 'Sellaisena kuin sinä minut halusit', 1944, 'Drama', 'Teuvo Tulio, Gunnar Juselius', 'Nisse Hirn', 'Marie-Louise Fock, Ture Ara, Kunto Karapää, Lauri Korpela, Annie Sundman, Ida Salmi, Sven Relander, Paavo Jännes', null, 'Once a naïve, love-struck girl now forsaken by her lover, Maija leaves her island home to work as a housemaid in the city, only to be seduced by her employer''s son Erkki, then forced to leave the household in order to avoid the scandal of a pregnancy. With few prospects for a decent job, Maija is reduced to working as a bar hostess to make ends meet, ever fending off the advances of disreputable clients, even as she continues to hold out hope for an enduring love that will redeem her from her fate.', 'Once a naïve, love-struck girl now forsaken by her lover, Maija leaves her island home to work as a housemaid in the city, only to be seduced by her employer''s son Erkki, then forced to leave the household in order to avoid the scandal of a pregnancy. With few prospects for a decent job, Maija is reduced to working as a bar hostess to make ends meet, ever fending off the advances of disreputable clients, even as she continues to hold out hope for an enduring love that will redeem her from her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqW12qjgqa4DYWDJJCadSCgrfml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217632'),
  ('547704681651051180', 'Selma', 2014, 'History, Drama', 'Ava DuVernay, Bradford Young, Jonathan Keith', 'Paul Webb, Ava DuVernay', 'David Oyelowo, Carmen Ejogo, Tom Wilkinson, Giovanni Ribisi, Tim Roth, André Holland, Colman Domingo, Common', 'PG-13', '"Selma," as in Alabama, the place where segregation in the South was at its worst, leading to a march that ended in violence, forcing a famous statement by President Lyndon B. Johnson that ultimately led to the signing of the Voting Rights Act.', '"Selma," as in Alabama, the place where segregation in the South was at its worst, leading to a march that ended in violence, forcing a famous statement by President Lyndon B. Johnson that ultimately led to the signing of the Voting Rights Act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QyUcitU0hrxy6B2zkyJ0EhNlqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273895'),
  ('610331736333456024', 'Selma, Lord, Selma', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Charles Burnett', 'Cynthia Whitcomb', 'Jurnee Smollett, Clifton Powell, Mackenzie Astin, Ella Joyce, Afemo Omilami, Brett Rice, Margo Moorer, Faye Yvette McQueen', 'G', 'In 1965 Alabama, an 11 year old girl is touched by a speech by Martin Luther King, Jr. and becomes a devout follower. But her resolution is tested when she joins others in the famed march from Selma to Montgomery.', 'In 1965 Alabama, an 11 year old girl is touched by a speech by Martin Luther King, Jr. and becomes a devout follower. But her resolution is tested when she joins others in the famed march from Selma to Montgomery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHw8px9u7m2WogMB7E8DrWLjNDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247434'),
