  ('210162738120447690', 'Send Help', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Sam Raimi, Damien Drew, Bill Pope', 'Damian Shannon, Mark Swift', 'Rachel McAdams, Dylan O''Brien, Edyll Ismail, Dennis Haysbert, Xavier Samuel, Chris Pang, Thaneth Warakulnukroh, Emma Raimi', 'R', 'Two colleagues become stranded on a deserted island, the only survivors of a plane crash. On the island, they must overcome past grievances and work together to survive, but ultimately, it''s a battle of wills and wits to make it out alive.', 'Two colleagues become stranded on a deserted island, the only survivors of a plane crash. On the island, they must overcome past grievances and work together to survive, but ultimately, it''s a battle of wills and wits to make it out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjkS2iAgWj3ik1DTjvI15nHZ7yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1198994'),
