  ('85383513781134581', 'Senritsu Kaiki World Kowasugi!', 2023, 'Horror', 'Koji Shiraishi, Shinsaku Yamaguchi', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Shigeo Ôsako, Chika Kuboyama, Koji Shiraishi, Rie Kuwana, Akari Fukunaga, Yuki Yoshida, Ayano Ogura, Keisaku Kimura', null, 'The submitted footage, taken in a cursed ruin, shows a creepy altar, a "red woman" covered in blood, and the crying of a baby that is nowhere to be seen. The "Too Scary!" team of rough producer Kudo, director Ichikawa, and cameraman Tashiro have reunited. They will now transcend time and space to solve the mystery!', 'The submitted footage, taken in a cursed ruin, shows a creepy altar, a "red woman" covered in blood, and the crying of a baby that is nowhere to be seen. The "Too Scary!" team of rough producer Kudo, director Ichikawa, and cameraman Tashiro have reunited. They will now transcend time and space to solve the mystery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUmFd1BM9V6kxjXycb08ndQTueV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039280'),
  ('367823537862429289', 'Sensation', 1994, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Brian Grant, Ross Berryman, Aaron Barsky', 'Dougal Wallace', 'Eric Roberts, Kari Wührer, Ron Perlman, Paul Le Mat, Claire Stansfield, Tracy Needham, Kieran Mulroney, Ed Begley Jr.', 'R', 'Lila a college student discovers a latent ability to see into the past. When a professor hires her for some psychological tests she becomes the target of the killer of the woman she sees in her dreams.', 'Lila a college student discovers a latent ability to see into the past. When a professor hires her for some psychological tests she becomes the target of the killer of the woman she sees in her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGh3KB482FrR20qMy13yoFfrjsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93753'),
  ('218440410872206294', 'Sense and Sensibility', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ang Lee, Ben Howarth, Michael Coulter', 'Emma Thompson', 'Emma Thompson, Kate Winslet, Alan Rickman, Hugh Grant, Gemma Jones, Greg Wise, Elizabeth Spriggs, Imogen Stubbs', 'PG', 'The Dashwood sisters, sensible Elinor and passionate Marianne, learn that their prospects of marriage seem doomed by their family''s sudden loss of fortune. After Henry Dashwood dies unexpectedly, his estate must pass on by law to his son. These circumstances leave Mr. Dashwood''s wife and daughters without a home and with barely enough money to live on. As Elinor and Marianne struggle to find romantic fulfillment in a society obsessed with financial and social status, they must learn to mix sense with sensibility in their dealings with both money and men.', 'The Dashwood sisters, sensible Elinor and passionate Marianne, learn that their prospects of marriage seem doomed by their family''s sudden loss of fortune. After Henry Dashwood dies unexpectedly, his estate must pass on by law to his son. These circumstances leave Mr. Dashwood''s wife and daughters without a home and with barely enough money to live on. As Elinor and Marianne struggle to find romantic fulfillment in a society obsessed with financial and social status, they must learn to mix sense with sensibility in their dealings with both money and men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBK2yL3HqhFvIVd7lLtazWlRZPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4584'),
