  ('625432360074287832', 'Sensuela', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Teuvo Tulio, Teuvo Tulio, Yrjö Norta', 'Teuvo Tulio, Yrjö Norta', 'Marianne Mardi, Ossi Elstelä, Mauritz Åkerman, Ismo Saario, Marja Pertamo, Armas Ek, Yrjö Tähtelä, Uolevi Vahteristo', null, 'Laila is an innocent Lappish girl and the only daughter of a reindeer herder. During World War II, Laila rescues a crashed German fighter pilot, Hans, and the two develop warm feelings for each other during his convalescence. Years later, after the war, Hans returns to Lapland as a freelance photographer and manages to lure Laila to run away with him to the capital, Helsinki, to start a career as a photo model, much to the chagrin of her traditional father, Aslak. After initial happiness, however, Hans abandons Laila, and the decadent lifestyle of a big city sends her life into a downward spiral.', 'Laila is an innocent Lappish girl and the only daughter of a reindeer herder. During World War II, Laila rescues a crashed German fighter pilot, Hans, and the two develop warm feelings for each other during his convalescence. Years later, after the war, Hans returns to Lapland as a freelance photographer and manages to lure Laila to run away with him to the capital, Helsinki, to start a career as a photo model, much to the chagrin of her traditional father, Aslak. After initial happiness, however, Hans abandons Laila, and the decadent lifestyle of a big city sends her life into a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iedjQb1JogeSqdSM63uK0MU2cMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176568'),
