  ('932785331341213463', 'Sentimental Education', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Júlio Bressane, Walter Carvalho, Rosa Dias', 'Júlio Bressane, Rosa Dias', 'Josie Antello, Bernardo Marinho, Debora Olivieri, Gustavo Novaes, Júlio Bressane', null, 'Sentimental Education centers on the unique relationship between Áurea, a lonely 40 year old teacher, and a young man she has just met by chance – one of these encounters which mythology and literature are full of. A delicate soul who finds itself attracted to a beauty that seems to demand, disturb and move her. That shakes her up entirely. During the days following their first conversation, she will expose all her feelings through classes in which he will let himself be carried away. Until an unusual episode from the past is revealed and changes everything.', 'Sentimental Education centers on the unique relationship between Áurea, a lonely 40 year old teacher, and a young man she has just met by chance – one of these encounters which mythology and literature are full of. A delicate soul who finds itself attracted to a beauty that seems to demand, disturb and move her. That shakes her up entirely. During the days following their first conversation, she will expose all her feelings through classes in which he will let himself be carried away. Until an unusual episode from the past is revealed and changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jNg7eGFBsMuowv458VYdJ07Um7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225836'),
