  ('236976438517606391', 'Separate Bedrooms', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jacky Cukier, Yves Angelo', 'Jacky Cukier', 'Michel Blanc, Jacques Dutronc, Lio, Frances Barber, Catherine Frot, Christine Murillo, Roger Ashton-Griffiths, Engelbert Humperdinck', null, 'Martin and Gert lead a very quiet life, until the day when their path crosses that of Marie and Francis. Martin, the shy one, lets himself be seduced by Marie. Gert wasted no time in understanding and dropped into Francis'' arms.', 'Martin and Gert lead a very quiet life, until the day when their path crosses that of Marie and Francis. Martin, the shy one, lets himself be seduced by Marie. Gert wasted no time in understanding and dropped into Francis'' arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9h7Pcp7Fe3PZG0rDAQiXb1DuNjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175769'),
