  ('758484430411218476', 'September 11: The New Pearl Harbor', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Massimo Mazzucco, Riccardo Pizzirani, Elia Dallabrida', 'Massimo Mazzucco', 'David Chandler M.S., Roberto Trapani, David Ray Griffin, Elisabeth Woodworth, Richard Gage, Chris Sarns, Rob Balsamo, Barry Zwicker', null, '"September 11: The New Pearl Harbor" is a 5-hour documentary that summarizes 12 years of public debate on 9/11. While aimed primarily at a general, uninformed audience, the film also contains some new findings that may be of interest to advanced researchers.', '"September 11: The New Pearl Harbor" is a 5-hour documentary that summarizes 12 years of public debate on 9/11. While aimed primarily at a general, uninformed audience, the film also contains some new findings that may be of interest to advanced researchers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54HEYT9Ldsi9k3CHgRaFpIIzXyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299783'),
