  ('814322924154563530', 'September 5', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Tim Fehlbaum, Markus Förderer, Ulrike Schürhoff', 'Tim Fehlbaum, Moritz Binder, Alex David', 'Peter Sarsgaard, John Magaro, Ben Chaplin, Leonie Benesch, Zinedine Soualem, Georgina Rich, Corey Johnson, Marcus Rutherford', 'R', 'During the 1972 Munich Olympics, an American sports broadcasting crew finds itself thrust into covering the hostage crisis involving Israeli athletes.', 'During the 1972 Munich Olympics, an American sports broadcasting crew finds itself thrust into covering the hostage crisis involving Israeli athletes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kcQOLwYKGPwyjiynFsvP8vHvRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211472'),
  ('66685044322066488', 'September Affair', 1950, 'Romance, Drama', 'William Dieterle, Charles Lang, Richard McWhorter', 'Ben Hecht', 'Joan Fontaine, Joseph Cotten, Françoise Rosay, Jessica Tandy, Robert Arthur, Jimmy Lydon, Fortunio Bonanova, Grazia Narciso', 'NR', 'An industrialist and a pianist meet on a trip and fall in love. Through a quirk of fate, they are reported dead in a crash though they weren''t on the plane. This gives them the opportunity to live together free from their previous lives. Unfortunately, this artificial arrangement leads to greater and greater stress. Eventually the situation collapses when they come to pursue their original, individual interests without choosing a common path.', 'An industrialist and a pianist meet on a trip and fall in love. Through a quirk of fate, they are reported dead in a crash though they weren''t on the plane. This gives them the opportunity to live together free from their previous lives. Unfortunately, this artificial arrangement leads to greater and greater stress. Eventually the situation collapses when they come to pursue their original, individual interests without choosing a common path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ebUz4EzehOpOdZFI2EaMpknUuy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90746'),
  ('97510639466400250', 'September Dawn', 2007, 'Drama, History, Western', 'Christopher Cain, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Carole Whang Schutter, Christopher Cain', 'Jon Voight, Tamara Hope, Trent Ford, Lolita Davidovich, Dean Cain, Terence Stamp, Shaun Johnston, Franklin E. Levinson', 'R', 'A story set against the Mountain Meadows Massacre, the film is based upon the tragedy which occurred in Utah in 1857. A group of settlers, traveling on wagons, was murdered by the Mormons. All together, about 140 souls of men, women and children, were taken.', 'A story set against the Mountain Meadows Massacre, the film is based upon the tragedy which occurred in Utah in 1857. A group of settlers, traveling on wagons, was murdered by the Mormons. All together, about 140 souls of men, women and children, were taken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZomhyZMwrRk8D57BXz4xDcFT4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14877'),
  ('1040608133225877672', 'September Says', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ariane Labed, Balthazar Lab, Ger Duffy', 'Ariane Labed', 'Mia Tharia, Pascale Kann, Rakhee Thakrar, Cal O''Driscoll, Niamh Moriarty, Barry John Kinsella, Shane Connellan, Amelia Valentina Pankhania', null, 'Sisters September and July share an intense bond, speaking in a secret language and keeping the outside world at a distance. After September is suspended from school, their mother brings them to a remote house on the Irish coast—where July begins to resist her sister’s increasingly sadistic control.', 'Sisters September and July share an intense bond, speaking in a secret language and keeping the outside world at a distance. After September is suspended from school, their mother brings them to a remote house on the Irish coast—where July begins to resist her sister’s increasingly sadistic control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyRzD90yGBRfRuWyRoGdPbqVJk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1212337'),
  ('698315787814922157', 'September Vacation', 1979, 'Drama', 'Vitaliy Melnikov, Konstantin Lashkov, V. Apananskiy', 'Vitaliy Melnikov', 'Oleg Dal, Yuri Bogatyryov, Irina Kupchenko, Natalya Gundareva, Nikolay Burlyaev, Evgeni Leonov, Natalya Mikolyshina, Gennadiy Bogachyov', null, 'Engineer Zilov, having woken up, finds the funeral wreath at his place – his friends'' present. This rather symbolic joke makes him recollect the previous night as well as 2 last months...', 'Engineer Zilov, having woken up, finds the funeral wreath at his place – his friends'' present. This rather symbolic joke makes him recollect the previous night as well as 2 last months...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saAKh7D3mjHl2qPvx4ERjK7SGTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72949'),
  ('1094900832044858227', 'Septembers of Shiraz', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Wayne Blair, Warwick Thornton, Kess Bonnet', 'Hanna Weg', 'Adrien Brody, Salma Hayek Pinault, Gabriella Wright, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Bashar Rahal, Alon Aboutboul, Anthony Azizi, Nasser Memarzia', 'PG-13', 'In this adaptation of the critically acclaimed debut novel by Iranian American author Dalia Sofer, a secular Jewish family is caught up in the maelstrom of the 1979 Iranian Revolution.', 'In this adaptation of the critically acclaimed debut novel by Iranian American author Dalia Sofer, a secular Jewish family is caught up in the maelstrom of the 1979 Iranian Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1s2xayFVgYEQb8DxnmNCJZMXgGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352179'),
  ('1146347404597370395', 'Septet: The Story of Hong Kong', 2022, 'Action, Drama, History, Romance', 'Poon Hang-Sang, Tam Wai-Kai, Lo Lau-Fai', 'Patrick Tam Kar-Ming, Yuen Woo-Ping, Melvin Luk', 'Timmy Hung Tin-Ming, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Sire Ma, Sam Leung Kin-Ping, Ben Yuen Foo-Wah, Jennifer Yu, Ian Gouw', null, 'A seven-part anthology film exploring the history of Hong Kong from the 1940s to present day.', 'A seven-part anthology film exploring the history of Hong Kong from the 1940s to present day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv19QA5Ofa6vBmX5QEf34UZ3WsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537761'),
  ('975947914805690651', 'Sepultura Endurance', 2017, 'Documentary, Music', 'Otávio Juliano', 'Otávio Juliano', 'Andreas Kisser, Paulo Xisto, Derrick Green, Eloy Casagrande, Jean Dolabella, Max Cavalera, Igor Cavalera, Phil Campbell', null, 'The long awaited documentary about Sepultura''s incredible journey from Brazil to the world.', 'The long awaited documentary about Sepultura''s incredible journey from Brazil to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxvVQ3UTSu92WzxJ3pWZs6Fn5wB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458803'),
  ('496524645507072549', 'Sequence of Feelings', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Witold Adamek, Radosław Piwowarski', 'Radosław Piwowarski', 'Maria Seweryn, Daniel Olbrychski, Wojciech Siemion, Krystyna Tkacz, Barbara Dziekan, Ewa Telega, Wojciech Skibiński, Zdzisław Alama', null, 'A renowned actor, Rafal Nawrot, is invited to play the main part in a theatre production of "Romeo and Juliet" in a backwater town. Upon arriving he realizes his mistake and is packing to leave when Julia, a beautiful blonde teenager appears at his hotel room door, the starstruck emissary from a local fan club. The encounter triggers a host of erotic fantasies and dreams for Nawrot, who decides to stay in town after all. Although his dreams more or less come true when Julia becomes sexually involved with him, his growing obsession with the young woman is paralleled by her emotional growth in a simultaneous relationship with a lover her own age.', 'A renowned actor, Rafal Nawrot, is invited to play the main part in a theatre production of "Romeo and Juliet" in a backwater town. Upon arriving he realizes his mistake and is packing to leave when Julia, a beautiful blonde teenager appears at his hotel room door, the starstruck emissary from a local fan club. The encounter triggers a host of erotic fantasies and dreams for Nawrot, who decides to stay in town after all. Although his dreams more or less come true when Julia becomes sexually involved with him, his growing obsession with the young woman is paralleled by her emotional growth in a simultaneous relationship with a lover her own age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9EaGISvhqfcBqlwaBQmf82azKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409702'),
  ('362568854534080398', 'Sequences...', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexandru Tatos', 'Alexandru Tatos', 'Geo Barton, Ion Vâlcu, Emilia Dobrin, Mircea Diaconu, Dragoș Pîslaru, Alexandru Tatos, Constantin Drăgănescu, Ioana Manolescu', null, 'Three sequences which could have formed separate stories are linked together to give a larger perspective on the nature of reality and film. The three episodes are joined together by one film crew at work. In the beginning, the crew is introduced as they juggle their dual roles as State-supported propagandists who laud their government and society, and as private movie makers working on their own film. Next, they are in a restaurant looking for suitable locations to film when the eatery’s owner is induced to wax long and lugubriously on his miserable life. In the last segment, two extras are in the background of a scene, sitting at a table in a restaurant. It slowly becomes apparent to one of them that the man he’s sitting with tortured him more than 40 years ago at a Nazi concentration camp during World War II.', 'Three sequences which could have formed separate stories are linked together to give a larger perspective on the nature of reality and film. The three episodes are joined together by one film crew at work. In the beginning, the crew is introduced as they juggle their dual roles as State-supported propagandists who laud their government and society, and as private movie makers working on their own film. Next, they are in a restaurant looking for suitable locations to film when the eatery’s owner is induced to wax long and lugubriously on his miserable life. In the last segment, two extras are in the background of a scene, sitting at a table in a restaurant. It slowly becomes apparent to one of them that the man he’s sitting with tortured him more than 40 years ago at a Nazi concentration camp during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGpo9jmGjNKpaknbFe3Sbh1GQWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114202'),
  ('1113267086030793455', 'Serafino', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Pietro Germi, Aiace Parolin, Francesco Massaro', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Pietro Germi, Tullio Pinelli', 'Adriano Celentano, Ottavia Piccolo, Saro Urzì, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Benjamin Lev, Nazzareno Natale, Giosué Ippolito, Ermelinda De Felice', null, 'Serafino, a young and innocent shepherd, inherits a huge fortune. He immediately starts spending the entire sum on presents for his friends, causing the envy of his family.', 'Serafino, a young and innocent shepherd, inherits a huge fortune. He immediately starts spending the entire sum on presents for his friends, causing the envy of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rokM12HnR01GU3iWnmCGDVgHJRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50197'),
  ('286329397080345108', 'Seragu', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sai Nag', 'Sai Nag', 'Akshata Kulkarni, Santu Sokanadagi, Mahantesh Gajendragada, Umarani Barigidad, Chandrashekharayya Shasthri', null, 'Shankravva is the Four months pregnant wife of Yamunya, a poor weaver from ilkal, a town in Karnataka. Despite her extreme poverty, She longs to wear the silk sarees she has woven for thousands of people.', 'Shankravva is the Four months pregnant wife of Yamunya, a poor weaver from ilkal, a town in Karnataka. Despite her extreme poverty, She longs to wear the silk sarees she has woven for thousands of people.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FswGiynsarm8tLiD7CjnULPXV8m1.jpg', 'plex:movie:seragu'),
  ('764540347473353974', 'Seraphim Falls', 2007, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'John Toll, David Von Ancken, Michael Ferris', 'David Von Ancken', 'Liam Neeson, Pierce Brosnan, Michael Wincott, Xander Berkeley, Ed Lauter, Kevin J. O''Connor, John Robinson, Anjelica Huston', 'R', 'The Civil War has ended, but Colonel Morsman Carver is on one final mission – to kill Gideon, no matter what it takes. Launched by a gunshot and propelled by rage, the relentless pursuit takes the two men through frigid snow-capped mountains and arid deserts, far from the comforts and codes of civilisation, into the bloodiest recesses of their own souls.', 'The Civil War has ended, but Colonel Morsman Carver is on one final mission – to kill Gideon, no matter what it takes. Launched by a gunshot and propelled by rage, the relentless pursuit takes the two men through frigid snow-capped mountains and arid deserts, far from the comforts and codes of civilisation, into the bloodiest recesses of their own souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WCcrCYq9mCyFGLpgx2IwhpURTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13249'),
  ('726113317606144970', 'Séraphin: Heart of Stone', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charles Binamé, Marc Larose, Jean Lépine', 'Lorraine Richard, Pierre Billon, Antonine Maillet', 'Pierre Lebeau, Karine Vanasse, Roy Dupuis, Rémy Girard, Robert Brouillette, Céline Bonnier, Benoît Brière, Yves Jacques', null, 'The story takes place during the colonization of the Laurentian region in Quebec towards the end of the 19th century (approx. 1885-90), near Sainte-Adèle. An unscrupulous man, Séraphin Poudrier, dominates the small community using his wealth. Mayor of the village, he will marry Donalda Laloge, after her father, unable to repay his debt, gives her to him in marriage. Donalda, a gentle and submissive woman who was promised to the handsome Alexis Labranche, rather, he will live his life according to the wishes of this petty and contemptuous miser, but will never let his situation get him down.', 'The story takes place during the colonization of the Laurentian region in Quebec towards the end of the 19th century (approx. 1885-90), near Sainte-Adèle. An unscrupulous man, Séraphin Poudrier, dominates the small community using his wealth. Mayor of the village, he will marry Donalda Laloge, after her father, unable to repay his debt, gives her to him in marriage. Donalda, a gentle and submissive woman who was promised to the handsome Alexis Labranche, rather, he will live his life according to the wishes of this petty and contemptuous miser, but will never let his situation get him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E1s5HL6nXzcj2JW6wZCwUz3TpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56717'),
  ('637792893602495952', 'Séraphine', 2008, 'History, Drama', 'Martin Provost, Laurent Brunet', 'Marc Abdelnour', 'Yolande Moreau, Ulrich Tukur, Anne Bennent, Geneviève Mnich, Nico Rogner, Adélaïde Leroux, Françoise Lebrun, Hélène Hardouin', null, 'The tragic story of French naïve painter Séraphine Louis aka Séraphine de Senlis (1864-1942), a humble servant who becomes a gifted self-taught painter. Discovered by prominent critic and collector William Uhde, she came to prominence between the wars grouped with other naïve painters like Henri Rouseau only to descend into madness and obscurity with the onset of the Great Depression and World War II.', 'The tragic story of French naïve painter Séraphine Louis aka Séraphine de Senlis (1864-1942), a humble servant who becomes a gifted self-taught painter. Discovered by prominent critic and collector William Uhde, she came to prominence between the wars grouped with other naïve painters like Henri Rouseau only to descend into madness and obscurity with the onset of the Great Depression and World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSA2iRp6BxhqDPzJsdk6CXALgjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14415'),
  ('365007751316272944', 'Serbis', 2008, 'Drama', 'Brillante Ma Mendoza', 'Boots Agbayani Pastor, Armando Lao', 'Coco Martin, Jaclyn Jose, Gina Pareño, Mercedes Cabral, Kristoffer King, Julio Díaz, Dan Alvaro, Roxanne Jordan', null, 'A struggling family owns a Filipino porn theater where prostitutes conduct their business.', 'A struggling family owns a Filipino porn theater where prostitutes conduct their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJXdfE1VTYQFLvljHIzAWulQyXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8904'),
  ('381566509474400793', 'Serena', 2014, 'Drama', 'Susanne Bier, Morten Søborg, Martin Kurel', 'Christopher Kyle', 'Bradley Cooper, Jennifer Lawrence, Rhys Ifans, Toby Jones, Blake Ritson, Sean Harris, Sam Reid, Charity Wakefield', 'R', 'North Carolina mountains at the end of the 1920s – George and Serena Pemberton, love-struck newly-weds, begin to build a timber empire. Serena soon proves herself to be equal to any man: overseeing loggers, hunting rattle-snakes, even saving a man’s life in the wilderness. With power and influence now in their hands, the Pembertons refuse to let anyone stand in the way of their inflated love and ambitions. However, once Serena discovers George’s hidden past and faces an unchangeable fate of her own, the Pemberton’s passionate marriage begins to unravel leading toward a dramatic reckoning.', 'North Carolina mountains at the end of the 1920s – George and Serena Pemberton, love-struck newly-weds, begin to build a timber empire. Serena soon proves herself to be equal to any man: overseeing loggers, hunting rattle-snakes, even saving a man’s life in the wilderness. With power and influence now in their hands, the Pembertons refuse to let anyone stand in the way of their inflated love and ambitions. However, once Serena discovers George’s hidden past and faces an unchangeable fate of her own, the Pemberton’s passionate marriage begins to unravel leading toward a dramatic reckoning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P1IgM4T3cOmEiBL01AFtPbHk9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164251'),
  ('370444041996766276', 'Serenade', 1956, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Anthony Mann, Dick Moder, Ray Heindorf', 'Ivan Goff, Ben Roberts, John Twist', 'Mario Lanza, Joan Fontaine, Sara Montiel, Vincent Price, Joseph Calleia, Harry Bellaver, Vince Edwards, Silvio Minciotti', 'NR', 'A wealthy woman discovers a vineyard worker with a beautiful operatic singing voice. She helps make him a star but then breaks his heart. He flees in misery to Mexico where he meets a sweet farm girl.', 'A wealthy woman discovers a vineyard worker with a beautiful operatic singing voice. She helps make him a star but then breaks his heart. He flees in misery to Mexico where he meets a sweet farm girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qTorXlcEnN33MRLLr5jPLeJCGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60963'),
  ('613158296525058062', 'Serendipity', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Chelsom, John de Borman, Amy Lynn', 'Marc Klein', 'John Cusack, Kate Beckinsale, Jeremy Piven, Bridget Moynahan, John Corbett, Molly Shannon, Eugene Levy, Lilli Lavine', 'PG-13', 'Although strangers Sara and Jonathan are both already in relationships, they realize they have genuine chemistry after a chance encounter – but part company soon after. Years later, they each yearn to reunite, despite being destined for the altar. But to give true love a chance, they have to find one another again.', 'Although strangers Sara and Jonathan are both already in relationships, they realize they have genuine chemistry after a chance encounter – but part company soon after. Years later, they each yearn to reunite, despite being destined for the altar. But to give true love a chance, they have to find one another again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jS66Qmq2Ru5S2YzHVknGd4xJyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9778'),
  ('880876737958765129', 'Serene Hunter', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Bushman, Jako Raybaut, Gaëlle Tournier', 'Jason Bushman', 'Eric Debets, Flannan Obé, Jonathan Blanc, Jason Bushman, Thibaut Chassigneux-Laqueille', null, 'A randy gay Parisian moves in with his new boyfriend just as an old flame from Los Angeles comes back into town.', 'A randy gay Parisian moves in with his new boyfriend just as an old flame from Los Angeles comes back into town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZFjXyzoRJr9pqSdBvECwqkBY2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49282'),
  ('952039550497076277', 'Serene Velocity', 1970, null, 'Ernie Gehr', null, null, null, '"Serene Velocity (1970) created a stunning percussive head-on motion by systemically shifting the focal length of a stationary zoom lens as it stared down the center of an empty institutional hallway – thus playing off the contradiction generated by the frames’ heightened flatness and the compositions’ severely overdetermined perspective. Without ever moving the camera, Gehr turned the fluorescent geometry of this literal Shock Corridor (in the then – new State University of N.Y at Binghamton) into a sort of piston-powered mandala. If Giotto had made action films it would be this." – J. Hoberman', '"Serene Velocity (1970) created a stunning percussive head-on motion by systemically shifting the focal length of a stationary zoom lens as it stared down the center of an empty institutional hallway – thus playing off the contradiction generated by the frames’ heightened flatness and the compositions’ severely overdetermined perspective. Without ever moving the camera, Gehr turned the fluorescent geometry of this literal Shock Corridor (in the then – new State University of N.Y at Binghamton) into a sort of piston-powered mandala. If Giotto had made action films it would be this." – J. Hoberman', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7rnbFTvFXejnhJMoQGqiMsw7Gi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145915'),
  ('381909636308664824', 'Serengeti', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Reinhard Radke', 'Reinhard Radke', 'Hardy Krüger Jr.', null, 'Main subject of Serengeti is the mass migration of wildebeest , which in search of nutritious grass hundreds of kilometers annually by the savannah draw. At the end of the rainy season, they break into a huge herd of over a million animals on the north. The wildebeest and other animals are joining the migration, as zebras and gazelles , continuously exposed to hazards, particularly by predators such as lions and cheetahs . A highlight of the great migration, the crossing of the Mara is: There, the wildebeest have to overcome not only meter high cliffs, they are also crocodiles delivered. With the onset of the rainy season, however, leave the wildebeest north again what had long been a mystery. The reason for this is that the grass in the north a phosphorus deficiency , and said thus wildebeest forces to retreat to the south.', 'Main subject of Serengeti is the mass migration of wildebeest , which in search of nutritious grass hundreds of kilometers annually by the savannah draw. At the end of the rainy season, they break into a huge herd of over a million animals on the north. The wildebeest and other animals are joining the migration, as zebras and gazelles , continuously exposed to hazards, particularly by predators such as lions and cheetahs . A highlight of the great migration, the crossing of the Mara is: There, the wildebeest have to overcome not only meter high cliffs, they are also crocodiles delivered. With the onset of the rainy season, however, leave the wildebeest north again what had long been a mystery. The reason for this is that the grass in the north a phosphorus deficiency , and said thus wildebeest forces to retreat to the south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WnRg2MxiKueQFXbvzUgE7wy9EF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69959'),
  ('818925747137224045', 'Serengeti Shall Not Die', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Hermann Gimbel, Richard Graf, Michael Grzimek', 'Bernhard Grzimek', 'Hermann Rockmann, Bernhard Grzimek, Holger Hagen, Michael Grzimek', null, 'The film tells of the beginnings of the Serengeti National Park in Tanzania. At the end of the 1950s, the Tanzanian National Park Administration wanted to fence in the protected area around the Ngorongoro Crater. Bernhard and Michael Grzimek were invited by the national park administration in 1957 to get a precise picture of the animal migrations and to provide the national park administration with the values ​​they needed for their project. Using a new counting method with two airplanes, the Grzimeks found out that the migration of the herds was different than assumed.', 'The film tells of the beginnings of the Serengeti National Park in Tanzania. At the end of the 1950s, the Tanzanian National Park Administration wanted to fence in the protected area around the Ngorongoro Crater. Bernhard and Michael Grzimek were invited by the national park administration in 1957 to get a precise picture of the animal migrations and to provide the national park administration with the values ​​they needed for their project. Using a new counting method with two airplanes, the Grzimeks found out that the migration of the herds was different than assumed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY1ngpl7pPkFjhiiuKNHSllSZF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12552'),
  ('496288953475520843', 'Serenity', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Joss Whedon, Jack N. Green, Gerald Sullivan', 'Joss Whedon', 'Nathan Fillion, Summer Glau, Gina Torres, Alan Tudyk, Morena Baccarin, Adam Baldwin, Jewel Staite, Sean Maher', 'PG-13', 'When the renegade crew of Serenity agrees to hide a fugitive on their ship, they find themselves in an action-packed battle between the relentless military might of a totalitarian regime who will destroy anything – or anyone – to get the girl back and the bloodthirsty creatures who roam the uncharted areas of space. But... the greatest danger of all may be on their ship.', 'When the renegade crew of Serenity agrees to hide a fugitive on their ship, they find themselves in an action-packed battle between the relentless military might of a totalitarian regime who will destroy anything – or anyone – to get the girl back and the bloodthirsty creatures who roam the uncharted areas of space. But... the greatest danger of all may be on their ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sqUOaPFoP2W81mq1UYqZqf5WzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16320'),
  ('176326874306918870', 'Serenity', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Steven Knight, Jess Hall, Frederic Evard', 'Steven Knight', 'Matthew McConaughey, Anne Hathaway, Jason Clarke, Diane Lane, Djimon Hounsou, Jeremy Strong, Charlotte Butler, David Butler', 'R', 'The quiet life of Baker Dill, a fishing boat captain who lives on the isolated Plymouth Island, where he spends his days obsessed with capturing an elusive tuna while fighting his personal demons, is interrupted when someone from his past comes to him searching for help.', 'The quiet life of Baker Dill, a fishing boat captain who lives on the isolated Plymouth Island, where he spends his days obsessed with capturing an elusive tuna while fighting his personal demons, is interrupted when someone from his past comes to him searching for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgWAcic93phg4DOuQ8NrsgQWiqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452832'),
  ('108716371311525201', 'Sergeant Keroro The Super Duper Movie', 2006, 'Animation', 'Masashi Kudo, Shinichi Takahashi, Masahiko Itojima', 'Mamiko Ikeda', 'Kumiko Watanabe, Hiroaki Ogi, Ken Yahagi, Yui Aragaki, Etsuko Kozakura, Jouji Nakata, Takehito Koyasu, Takeshi Kusao', null, 'Sergeant Keroro and his four subordinates came from the planet Keron to the Earth to conquer. However, without notice, they began to enjoy the life on the Earth. Keroro was supposed to stay with Hitana to get the chance to conquer the Earth, but he became friend with Hinata''s son, Fuyuki. Today, as usual, Keroro goes to buy his favorite Gundam plastic model with Fuyuki. On their way home, they find a small shrine, and enter. There, they find a vase, and happens to break it. Since the next day, strange things happen all over the town and people are in panic. Inside the vase, Kiruru, Keron''s ancient ultimate weapon was sealed. At the moment, Mirara who holds the secret of the Kiruru appears and informs them of the only method to save the Earth. However...', 'Sergeant Keroro and his four subordinates came from the planet Keron to the Earth to conquer. However, without notice, they began to enjoy the life on the Earth. Keroro was supposed to stay with Hitana to get the chance to conquer the Earth, but he became friend with Hinata''s son, Fuyuki. Today, as usual, Keroro goes to buy his favorite Gundam plastic model with Fuyuki. On their way home, they find a small shrine, and enter. There, they find a vase, and happens to break it. Since the next day, strange things happen all over the town and people are in panic. Inside the vase, Kiruru, Keron''s ancient ultimate weapon was sealed. At the moment, Mirara who holds the secret of the Kiruru appears and informs them of the only method to save the Earth. However...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsUdCOhXPgR1ZwawOaQKGZTe9xi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103368'),
  ('451765557305624921', 'Sergeant Rutledge', 1960, 'Western, Crime, Drama', 'John Ford, Edward O''Fearna, Allen Pomeroy', 'Willis Goldbeck, James Warner Bellah', 'Jeffrey Hunter, Woody Strode, Constance Towers, Billie Burke, Juano Hernández, Willis Bouchey, Carleton Young, Judson Pratt', 'NR', 'Respected black cavalry Sergeant Brax Rutledge stands court-martial for raping and killing a white woman and murdering her father, his superior officer.', 'Respected black cavalry Sergeant Brax Rutledge stands court-martial for raping and killing a white woman and murdering her father, his superior officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpi9dXkF4ZHUVxRDHjh6jJlrdun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43040'),
  ('371094639538390976', 'Sergeant York', 1941, 'War, Drama, History', 'Howard Hawks, Sol Polito, Jack Sullivan', 'Alvin C. York', 'Gary Cooper, Walter Brennan, Joan Leslie, George Tobias, Stanley Ridges, Margaret Wycherly, Ward Bond, Noah Beery Jr.', 'NR', 'Alvin York a hillbilly sharpshooter transforms himself from ruffian to religious pacifist. He is then called to serve his country and despite deep religious and moral objections to fighting becomes one of the most celebrated American heroes of WWI.', 'Alvin York a hillbilly sharpshooter transforms himself from ruffian to religious pacifist. He is then called to serve his country and despite deep religious and moral objections to fighting becomes one of the most celebrated American heroes of WWI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54LTgyRHSixyeeFhLtCFj0SMAQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16442'),
  ('129769095343031097', 'Sergio', 2020, 'Drama', 'Greg Barker, Adrian Teijido, Charlie Endean', 'Craig Borten', 'Wagner Moura, Ana de Armas, Garret Dillahunt, Will Dalton, Bradley Whitford, Brían F. O''Byrne, Clemens Schick, Clarisse Abujamra', 'R', 'A sweeping drama set in the chaotic aftermath of the US invasion of Iraq, where the life of top UN diplomat Brazilian Sérgio Vieira de Mello hangs in the balance during the most treacherous mission of his career.', 'A sweeping drama set in the chaotic aftermath of the US invasion of Iraq, where the life of top UN diplomat Brazilian Sérgio Vieira de Mello hangs in the balance during the most treacherous mission of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tABtj9BwYVDCM69h7AK38MDgw64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653744'),
  ('21237617143639949', 'Sergio and Sergei', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ernesto Daranas', 'Ernesto Daranas, Marta Daranas', 'Tomás Cao, Héctor Noas, Ron Perlman, Yuliet Cruz, Mario Guerra, Ana Gloria Buduén, Armando Miguel Gómez, Camila Arteche', null, 'In 1991, the USSR is falling apart and Cuba enters its hardest economic crisis. Sergio, a professor of Marxism who can''t provide for his family, and Sergei, a Soviet cosmonaut stranded in the Mir space station, share a common passion: amateur radio. Through this hobby, both men will be able to help each other in facing the dramatic changes of their countries.', 'In 1991, the USSR is falling apart and Cuba enters its hardest economic crisis. Sergio, a professor of Marxism who can''t provide for his family, and Sergei, a Soviet cosmonaut stranded in the Mir space station, share a common passion: amateur radio. Through this hobby, both men will be able to help each other in facing the dramatic changes of their countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJQl4BIbNSnLoHJkIjVxbHN5Ubg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473352'),
  ('178218251494462571', 'Sergio Leone, une Amérique de légende', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Michel-Clement Franco, Jean-François Giré', 'Jean-François Giré', 'Sergio Leone, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Clint Eastwood, Ennio Morricone, Luca Verdone, Noël Simsolo, Claudia Cardinale, Alessandro Alessandroni', null, 'The destiny of Sergio Leone from his poor childhood in a neighborhood under fascism in Rome until his last film in America. This guided the filmmaker''s personal life and career to create his epic antiheroes and spaghetti westerns.', 'The destiny of Sergio Leone from his poor childhood in a neighborhood under fascism in Rome until his last film in America. This guided the filmmaker''s personal life and career to create his epic antiheroes and spaghetti westerns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bTr3Ai8e6kbIKXswcpS843BHb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569055'),
  ('739308526153578860', 'Sergio Leone: The Italian Who Invented America', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Francesco Zippel, Marco Tomaselli, Carlo Alberto Orecchia', 'Francesco Zippel', 'Quentin Tarantino, Frank Miller, Giuseppe Tornatore, Damien Chazelle, Clint Eastwood, Steven Spielberg, Martin Scorsese, Jennifer Connelly', null, 'To mark the recent thirtieth anniversary of Sergio Leone’s death, this documentary sets out to pay tribute to one of the great legends of world cinema. The singular artistic vision of Sergio Leone has transcended national borders, creating the Spaghetti Western genre and transforming the international cinematic panorama forever with his innovative stylistic and narrative solutions, which have now become part of the language of the movies. The film, which is enriched with precious archive footage from the Cineteca di Bologna, including rare audio recordings and film clips shot behind the scenes, sees for the first time the direct participation of the Leone family and has interviews both with Leone’s longtime collaborators and with icons of Hollywood who have been profoundly influenced by his work.', 'To mark the recent thirtieth anniversary of Sergio Leone’s death, this documentary sets out to pay tribute to one of the great legends of world cinema. The singular artistic vision of Sergio Leone has transcended national borders, creating the Spaghetti Western genre and transforming the international cinematic panorama forever with his innovative stylistic and narrative solutions, which have now become part of the language of the movies. The film, which is enriched with precious archive footage from the Cineteca di Bologna, including rare audio recordings and film clips shot behind the scenes, sees for the first time the direct participation of the Leone family and has interviews both with Leone’s longtime collaborators and with icons of Hollywood who have been profoundly influenced by his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCKJgQ4pA68AadCzvGsngWQLHeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005428'),
  ('44854577839289160', 'Serial', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bill Persky, Rexford L. Metz, Jerry Sobul', 'Michael Elias, Rich Eustis', 'Martin Mull, Tuesday Weld, Jennifer McAllister, Sam Chew Jr., Sally Kellerman, Anthony Battaglia, Bill Macy, Nita Talbot', 'R', 'A man resists the California fads that his wife, friends and wealthy Marin County neighbors embrace.', 'A man resists the California fads that his wife, friends and wealthy Marin County neighbors embrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JxAZlcYOyZtNiUTUtBzgzskFN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41034'),
  ('3781681590731727', 'Serial (Bad) Weddings', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Vincent Mathias, Bruce Amic', 'Guy Laurent, Philippe de Chauveron', 'Christian Clavier, Chantal Lauby, Ary Abittan, Medi Sadoun, Frédéric Chau, Noom Diawara, Frédérique Bel, Julia Piaton', 'PG', 'A catholic French couple sees their life upside down when their four daughters get married to men of different religion and origins.', 'A catholic French couple sees their life upside down when their four daughters get married to men of different religion and origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkAiSLxLJJEZXZZqgNna5BWcBIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262391'),
  ('1009378941863053028', 'Serial (Bad) Weddings 2', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Manuela Muller, Troy Gregory', 'Guy Laurent, Philippe de Chauveron', 'Christian Clavier, Chantal Lauby, Ary Abittan, Medi Sadoun, Frédéric Chau, Noom Diawara, Frédérique Bel, Julia Piaton', null, 'Claude and Marie Verneuil face a new crisis. The four spouses of their daughters, David, Rachid, Chao and Charles decided to leave France for various reasons. Here they are imagining their lives elsewhere.', 'Claude and Marie Verneuil face a new crisis. The four spouses of their daughters, David, Rachid, Chao and Charles decided to leave France for various reasons. Here they are imagining their lives elsewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/422okWTstVRy1sW5VaAHqONasIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505436'),
  ('920735740038245620', 'Serial (Bad) Weddings 3', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Philippe de Chauveron', 'Guy Laurent, Philippe de Chauveron', 'Christian Clavier, Chantal Lauby, Ary Abittan, Medi Sadoun, Frédéric Chau, Noom Diawara, Frédérique Bel, Émilie Caen', null, 'Claude and Marie Verneuil will soon be celebrating their 40th wedding anniversary. For the occasion, their four daughters - Isabelle, Odile, Ségolène and Laure - decide to organize a big surprise party in their family home in Chinon. They also decide to invite, each, the parents of their respective husbands - Rachid Benassem, David Benichou, Chao Ling and Charles Koffi.', 'Claude and Marie Verneuil will soon be celebrating their 40th wedding anniversary. For the occasion, their four daughters - Isabelle, Odile, Ségolène and Laure - decide to organize a big surprise party in their family home in Chinon. They also decide to invite, each, the parents of their respective husbands - Rachid Benassem, David Benichou, Chao Ling and Charles Koffi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQfCJjbAAyk4IwRR8IqdCzPOJE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714869'),
  ('56094191630865901', 'Serial Cook', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Demet Evgar, Fatih Al, Alican Yücesoy, Elit Andaç Çam, Fırat Altunmeşe, Ferit Aktuğ, Emrah Kolukısa, Burcu Şeyben', null, 'Meet Neslihan. A perfect cook, an expert on Turkish cuisine, strictly loyal to her husband, an impeccable house wife ...and a serial killer.', 'Meet Neslihan. A perfect cook, an expert on Turkish cuisine, strictly loyal to her husband, an impeccable house wife ...and a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZsxuy1BNdwENAwQHOVxuCWgZ6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476197'),
  ('226083551396620649', 'Serial Driver', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jonathan Barré, Sébastien Cros', 'Laurent Vayriot, Jonathan Barré', 'Laure Calamy, Tchéky Karyo, Grégoire Ludig, David Marsais, Thomas VDB, Sixtine Aupetit, Olivier Marchal, David Salles', null, 'Pauline has her own way of doing road safety: as a trainer in a point recovery center during the day, she becomes a serial killer of drivers at night.', 'Pauline has her own way of doing road safety: as a trainer in a point recovery center during the day, she becomes a serial killer of drivers at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUG0fuNLXnFBEweGs8of38KtXlw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974561'),
  ('356547788143411251', 'Serial Killer', 1995, 'Thriller', 'Pierre David, Tom Jewett', 'Mark Sevi', 'Tobin Bell, Kim Delaney, Gary Hudson, Pam Grier, Marco Rodríguez, Joel Polis, Lyman Ward, Andrew Prine', null, 'As a member of FBI Psychological Profile Unit, Selby Younger tracks Morrano, vicious and intelligent serial killer. Before getting caught, Morrano attacks her leaving serious psychological wounds. Two years later, Morrano escapes and Selby, now working on a desk job, must face her personal traumas again.', 'As a member of FBI Psychological Profile Unit, Selby Younger tracks Morrano, vicious and intelligent serial killer. Before getting caught, Morrano attacks her leaving serious psychological wounds. Two years later, Morrano escapes and Selby, now working on a desk job, must face her personal traumas again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xOrT1s2Wd0Ssi15AGJHPpTe4PS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70515'),
  ('828361344366582094', 'Serial Killers: The Real Life Hannibal Lecters', 2001, 'Documentary, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Sean Buckley', 'Phil M. Rosenberg', 'Richard Morgan, Phil Morrison, Robert K. Ressler, Jeffrey Dahmer, Andrei Chikatilo, Ted Bundy, John Wayne Gacy', null, 'This documentary examines a selection of real life serial killers and compares them to the fictional Hannibal Lecter.', 'This documentary examines a selection of real life serial killers and compares them to the fictional Hannibal Lecter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n75iTwhKA5EIrNSQn56UtnPvY9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41704'),
