  ('321333162748636468', 'Serial Teachers', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Régis Blondeau', 'Mathias Gavarry, Pierre-François Martin-Laval', 'Christian Clavier, Isabelle Nanty, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Kev Adams, François Morel, Arnaud Ducret, Stéfi Celma, Raymond Bouchard', null, 'With only 12 percent of its pupils obtaining their baccalaureate, Jules Ferry High School is the worst school in France. The Inspector of Schools has already exhausted all the conventional means to raise standards at the school and he has no choice but to take the advice of his deputy. It is a case of having to fight fire with fire: the worst pupils must be taught by the worst teachers...', 'With only 12 percent of its pupils obtaining their baccalaureate, Jules Ferry High School is the worst school in France. The Inspector of Schools has already exhausted all the conventional means to raise standards at the school and he has no choice but to take the advice of his deputy. It is a case of having to fight fire with fire: the worst pupils must be taught by the worst teachers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59Bi4wtdoxXV9eaPat7em2ahISI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182219'),
  ('594132995008705739', 'Serial Teachers 2', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Régis Blondeau', 'Mathias Gavarry, Pierre-François Martin-Laval', 'Kev Adams, Isabelle Nanty, Didier Bourdon, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Arnaud Ducret, Stéfi Celma, Raymond Bouchard, Fred Tousch', null, 'The worst teachers of France landed in England for an ultra-secret mission. With Boulard, the King of the Dunces, they are parachuted in the best school of the country, and they will apply their famous methods on the future of the nation.', 'The worst teachers of France landed in England for an ultra-secret mission. With Boulard, the King of the Dunces, they are parachuted in the best school of the country, and they will apply their famous methods on the future of the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qW5bsYI2RjduaJhUz3U6extqNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325844'),
  ('439600641056457299', 'Serialized', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michel Poulette, Daniel Villeneuve', 'Doug Barber, James Taylor Phillips', 'Vanessa Ray, Adam Korson, Tara Spencer-Nairn, Tyler Hynes, Meghan Heffern, Steven Yaffee, Jess Salgueiro, Ryan Kelly', null, 'After getting dropped by her publisher, celebrated novelist Hannah Ryan uses the negative forces in her life to inspire the creation of a pulp crime serial that posts new chapters to subscriber''s devices every week. The initial release is a modest success but the work becomes a massive hit after a real life murder takes place that bears a striking similarity to Hannah''s story. Is it really just a coincidence or is it possible that a copycat serial killer is acting out the fictitious murders in real life? And is he going to strike again once Hannah releases her next chapter?', 'After getting dropped by her publisher, celebrated novelist Hannah Ryan uses the negative forces in her life to inspire the creation of a pulp crime serial that posts new chapters to subscriber''s devices every week. The initial release is a modest success but the work becomes a massive hit after a real life murder takes place that bears a striking similarity to Hannah''s story. Is it really just a coincidence or is it possible that a copycat serial killer is acting out the fictitious murders in real life? And is he going to strike again once Hannah releases her next chapter?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx5SewDf5H82zqlVRZFgicsVPGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465023'),
