  ('736376241473808420', 'Serious Men', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sudhir Mishra, Alexander Šurkala', 'Abhijeet Khuman, Nikhil Nair, Niren Bhatt', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Nassar, Indira Tiwari, Aakshath Das, Sanjay Narvekar, Shweta Basu Prasad', null, 'Tormented with his ''under-privileged'' societal status, a father capitalizes on his son''s newfound fame as a boy-genius. Little does he realize that the secret he harbors will destroy the very thing he loves the most.', 'Tormented with his ''under-privileged'' societal status, a father capitalizes on his son''s newfound fame as a boy-genius. Little does he realize that the secret he harbors will destroy the very thing he loves the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRrVmiXapjHAcc3tW7wvY5n3WLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743382'),
