  ('1088919306669707594', 'Seth Rogen''s Hilarity for Charity', 2018, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Ryan Polito', 'Beth Stelling', 'Seth Rogen, Ike Barinholtz, Michael Che, Sacha Baron Cohen, Jeff Goldblum, Tiffany Haddish, Chris Hardwick, Nick Kroll', null, 'Seth Rogen and friends combine stand-up, sketches and music for an outrageous comedy special that could only come from the mind of Seth. Guests include Tiffany Haddish, Sarah Silverman, Michelle Wolf, John Mulaney, Michael Che, David Chang, Ike Barinholtz, Chelsea Peretti, Kumail Nanjiani, Jon Lovitz, Jeff Goldblum, Sacha Baron Cohen, Nick Kroll, Post Malone, Chris Hardwick, and Craig Robinson & The Nasty Delicious.', 'Seth Rogen and friends combine stand-up, sketches and music for an outrageous comedy special that could only come from the mind of Seth. Guests include Tiffany Haddish, Sarah Silverman, Michelle Wolf, John Mulaney, Michael Che, David Chang, Ike Barinholtz, Chelsea Peretti, Kumail Nanjiani, Jon Lovitz, Jeff Goldblum, Sacha Baron Cohen, Nick Kroll, Post Malone, Chris Hardwick, and Craig Robinson & The Nasty Delicious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoRYL6uuS9qvGeJ4o0hbmQji7hm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516525'),
  ('256458949877808699', 'Sethu...', 1999, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'R. Ratnavelu, Bala, Ameer', 'Bala', 'Vikram, Abitha, Sivakumar, Sriman, Mohan Vaidya, Rasheed Ummer, Lavanya, Jyothi Lakshmi', null, 'A violent college student softens his tough exterior when he falls in love with a shy Brahmin woman. Just as the ice between them begins to melt, he''s attacked viciously and loses his mental stability.', 'A violent college student softens his tough exterior when he falls in love with a shy Brahmin woman. Just as the ice between them begins to melt, he''s attacked viciously and loses his mental stability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak7L2zzWojsnmwk7Bb3izV6ZkFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69669'),
  ('476460124836852475', 'Seto and Utsumi', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Katsumi Nojiri', 'Tatsushi Ōmori, Dai Miyazaki', 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Masaki Suda, Ayami Nakajo, Takuji Suzuki, Eiki Narita, Amane Okayama, Isao Okumura, Kumi Ryu', null, 'Utsumi and Seto''s daily routine is to spend their afterschool hours just jabbering with one another along a riverbed. Getting excited over trivial word play, agonizing over the content of an email to be sent to a girl, and, at times, talking about a serious problem, the two endlessly engage in meaningless idle talk as if it were meaningful.', 'Utsumi and Seto''s daily routine is to spend their afterschool hours just jabbering with one another along a riverbed. Getting excited over trivial word play, agonizing over the content of an email to be sent to a girl, and, at times, talking about a serious problem, the two endlessly engage in meaningless idle talk as if it were meaningful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8SyvydQEOqqF4JNFQhqhyw0lSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382200'),
  ('511090621937170817', 'Settlers', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Willie Nel, Clare Harlow, Megan Truter', 'Wyatt Rockefeller', 'Sofia Boutella, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Brooklynn Prince, Nell Tiger Free, Jonny Lee Miller, Natalie Walsh, Matthew Van Leeve', 'NR', 'Remmy and her parents, refugees from Earth, have found peace on the Martian outskirts until strangers appear in the hills beyond their farm. Told as a triptych, the film follows Remmy as she struggles to survive in an uneasy landscape.', 'Remmy and her parents, refugees from Earth, have found peace on the Martian outskirts until strangers appear in the hills beyond their farm. Told as a triptych, the film follows Remmy as she struggles to survive in an uneasy landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBUYDwiJVDcnjPneOitVetJk2Rt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791568'),
  ('767200586990215252', 'Setup', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Mike Gunther, Steve Gainer', 'Mike Behrman, Mike Gunther', '50 Cent, Ryan Phillippe, Bruce Willis, James Remar, Randy Couture, Will Yun Lee, Shaun Toub, Susie Abromeit', 'R', 'A group of friends plan out a detailed heist that turns deadly when one betrays the other by taking off with the goods. Taking matters into his own hands, Sonny seeks out his revenge teaming up with the most dangerous mob boss in town to get back what is rightfully his. When he finally comes face to face with his longtime friend he will be forced to make a life changing choice.', 'A group of friends plan out a detailed heist that turns deadly when one betrays the other by taking off with the goods. Taking matters into his own hands, Sonny seeks out his revenge teaming up with the most dangerous mob boss in town to get back what is rightfully his. When he finally comes face to face with his longtime friend he will be forced to make a life changing choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h74bol6GYG6eyXIAZVGmQBraI8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70586'),
  ('582925223884698060', 'Seul', 2024, 'Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Pierre Isoard', 'Pierre Isoard, Julien Guérif', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Anne Suarez, Clément Bresson, Anaël Guez, Frédéric Bocquet', null, 'Inspired by the true story of navigator Yves Parlier who in 2000 set sail in a round-the-world, no-stopover solo sailing race, the perfect opportunity for him to rise to the heights of his childhood heroes. As he launches for the race of his life, Parlier is far from suspecting that he is embarking on a completely different adventure: an incredible test of endurance and survival.', 'Inspired by the true story of navigator Yves Parlier who in 2000 set sail in a round-the-world, no-stopover solo sailing race, the perfect opportunity for him to rise to the heights of his childhood heroes. As he launches for the race of his life, Parlier is far from suspecting that he is embarking on a completely different adventure: an incredible test of endurance and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCEu3bF9ocPBTbDReCbrBEPZG52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105946'),
  ('1106003945568231212', 'Sev Kardeşim', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Tarık Akan, Münir Özkul, Hulusi Kentmen, Adile Naşit, Halit Akçatepe, Zeki Alasya, Esmeray', null, 'A factory owners son falls in love with a worker who works at the factory.', 'A factory owners son falls in love with a worker who works at the factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFS5TqQ2xSBODPxYKhKvBebU7jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325626'),
  ('437156049217814988', 'Seven', 1979, 'Action, Drama', 'Quito, Andy Sidaris', 'Robert Baird, William Driskill', 'William Smith, Barbara Leigh, Guich Koock, Christopher Joy, Art Metrano, Ed Parker, Richard LePore, Reggie Nalder', 'R', 'A government agent discovers a plot by a cartel of seven gangsters to take over the state of Hawaii. He hires a team of seven hitmen to stop them.', 'A government agent discovers a plot by a cartel of seven gangsters to take over the state of Hawaii. He hires a team of seven hitmen to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btiZ1zyHY1EzlPnrKKN3sWc4NcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102961'),
  ('1145196727709842696', 'Seven Alone', 1974, 'Drama, Family, Adventure, Western', 'Earl Bellamy', 'Eleanor Lamb, Douglas C. Stewart', 'Dewey Martin, Aldo Ray, Anne Collings, Dean Smith, James Griffith, Stewart Petersen, Dehl Berti, Bea Morris', 'G', 'A fictionalized account of the real-life adventure of the Sager family. Travelling with a wagon train from Missouri to Oregon, things are going well for the Sagers, until father Sager dies from blood poisoning following an Indian attack, and mother Sager dies soon afterward from pneumonia. The leaders of the wagon train decide to send the children back, but the oldest, John (who had been described by all the adults as lazy and worthless), decides to lead his siblings through the wilderness to complete the journey their parents started.', 'A fictionalized account of the real-life adventure of the Sager family. Travelling with a wagon train from Missouri to Oregon, things are going well for the Sagers, until father Sager dies from blood poisoning following an Indian attack, and mother Sager dies soon afterward from pneumonia. The leaders of the wagon train decide to send the children back, but the oldest, John (who had been described by all the adults as lazy and worthless), decides to lead his siblings through the wilderness to complete the journey their parents started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPnzfH7CMz5MqPoC1GQgtbcsKsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53931'),
  ('285507825676884761', 'Seven and a Half', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miroslav Momčilović', 'Miroslav Momčilović', 'Branislav Trifunović, Marija Karan, Branko Vidaković, Boris Komnenić, Nenad Jezdić, Gordan Kičić, Milan ''Lane'' Gutović, Nikola Đuričko', null, 'A collection of seven stories "from the block," linked by the theme of the seven deadly sins, humorously portrays the everyday life of New Belgrade''s inhabitants, who are consumed by their minor foibles and guided by their passions. While pride, sloth, envy, wrath, greed, lust, and gluttony are biblical sins, they seem almost ridiculous in contemporary times when set against the backdrop of civilization''s far more severe challenges.', 'A collection of seven stories "from the block," linked by the theme of the seven deadly sins, humorously portrays the everyday life of New Belgrade''s inhabitants, who are consumed by their minor foibles and guided by their passions. While pride, sloth, envy, wrath, greed, lust, and gluttony are biblical sins, they seem almost ridiculous in contemporary times when set against the backdrop of civilization''s far more severe challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIT7TLLRg3GYFdgVwMQiKKLlgfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110501'),
  ('956483073523597781', 'Seven Beauties', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Lina Wertmüller, Sandra Dal Sasso, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Fernando Rey, Shirley Stoler, Elena Fiore, Roberto Herlitzka, Piero Di Iorio, Enzo Vitale, Ermalinda De Felice', 'R', 'Pasqualino Frafuso, known in Naples as "Pasqualino Seven Beauties" is a petty thief who lives off of the profits of his seven sisters while claiming to protect their honor at any cost, Pasqualino is arrested for murder and later sent to fight in the army after committing sexual assault. The Germans capture him and he gets sent to a concentration camp where he plots to make his escape by seducing a German officer.', 'Pasqualino Frafuso, known in Naples as "Pasqualino Seven Beauties" is a petty thief who lives off of the profits of his seven sisters while claiming to protect their honor at any cost, Pasqualino is arrested for murder and later sent to fight in the army after committing sexual assault. The Germans capture him and he gets sent to a concentration camp where he plots to make his escape by seducing a German officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1c93tNFz3ypiOpfQDji15nm98I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37550'),
  ('1018565308155215996', 'Seven Billiard Tables', 2007, 'Drama', 'Gracia Querejeta, Ángel Iguacel, Antonio Ordóñez', 'David Planell, Gracia Querejeta', 'Maribel Verdú, Blanca Portillo, Amparo Baró, Enrique Villén, Raúl Arévalo, Ramón Barea, Jesús Castejón, Víctor Valdivia', null, 'Angela and her young son Guille travel to the big city to see Leo, her father and the boy''s grandfather, when he suddenly takes ill. However, they arrive to discover that he has just passed away. Charo, the dead man''s lover, explains the dire traits suffered by the paternal business: a hall with seven billiard tables.', 'Angela and her young son Guille travel to the big city to see Leo, her father and the boy''s grandfather, when he suddenly takes ill. However, they arrive to discover that he has just passed away. Charo, the dead man''s lover, explains the dire traits suffered by the paternal business: a hall with seven billiard tables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XC3OvBu6QaJ5McHW33c8mC5gOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42400'),
  ('167899363226603090', 'Seven Black Heroines', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Western', 'Kevin Chu, Lin Wen-Chin, Chen-kuo Chao', 'Tsai Han-Tseng', 'Brigitte Lin, Sally Yeh, Sylvia Peng Hsueh-Fen, Hilda Liu Hao-Yi, Loretta Yang Hui-shan, Hsu Pu-Liao, Teresa Tsui Jun-Jun, Liang Hsiu-shen', null, 'A group of women with various criminal skills are thrown into prison during World War 2. They escape and proceed to head off to destroy a chemical lab in a well fortified valley.', 'A group of women with various criminal skills are thrown into prison during World War 2. They escape and proceed to head off to destroy a chemical lab in a well fortified valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk4phwJtIs83VPWlh8SaFcvIlfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104240'),
  ('850824006386797690', 'Seven Blood-Stained Orchids', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Angelo Lotti, Fulvio Barresi, Umberto Lenzi', 'Umberto Lenzi, Roberto Gianviti', 'Antonio Sabàto, Uschi Glas, Pier Paolo Capponi, Rossella Falk, Marina Malfatti, Renato Romano, Claudio Gora, Gabriella Giorgelli', null, 'A maniac on the loose is committing savage acts of slaughter, and one survivor may be the only key to unmasking the serial slayer known as the Half-Moon Killer. The mysterious half-moon lockets he leaves with his victims could be the only key to unraveling his sinister motives, but will that be enough before he completes his ice-cold plot to claim his intended seven victims?', 'A maniac on the loose is committing savage acts of slaughter, and one survivor may be the only key to unmasking the serial slayer known as the Half-Moon Killer. The mysterious half-moon lockets he leaves with his victims could be the only key to unraveling his sinister motives, but will that be enough before he completes his ice-cold plot to claim his intended seven victims?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AB1EeJWra8kiTsjSTHkuDDzCzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3699'),
  ('319230809505780586', 'Seven Brides for Seven Brothers', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Stanley Donen, Carl Roup, George J. Folsey', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Jane Powell, Howard Keel, Jeff Richards, Russ Tamblyn, Tommy Rall, Julie Newmar, Ruta Lee, Matt Mattox', 'G', 'In 1850 Oregon, when a backwoodsman brings a wife home to his farm, his six brothers decide that they want to get married too.', 'In 1850 Oregon, when a backwoodsman brings a wife home to his farm, his six brothers decide that they want to get married too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH7dd9x4hyiC047gfp0XxKiTOss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16563'),
  ('833331330747911685', 'Seven Chances', 1925, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Buster Keaton, Byron Houck, Elgin Lessley', 'Clyde Bruckman, Joseph A. Mitchell, Jean C. Havez', 'Buster Keaton, T. Roy Barnes, Snitz Edwards, Ruth Dwyer, Frances Raymond, Erwin Connelly, Jules Cowles, Jean Arthur', 'NR', 'Struggling stockbroker Jimmie Shannon learns that, if he gets married by 7 p.m. on his 27th birthday -- which is today -- he''ll inherit $7 million from an eccentric relative.', 'Struggling stockbroker Jimmie Shannon learns that, if he gets married by 7 p.m. on his 27th birthday -- which is today -- he''ll inherit $7 million from an eccentric relative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH9woIxzqVtyv6S711vSVlS12eA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32600'),
  ('484455558845135494', 'Seven Days', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Won Shin-yun, Kim Min-soo', 'Won Shin-yun, Yoon Jae-goo', 'Yunjin Kim, Kim Mi-sook, Park Hee-soon, Choi Moo-seong, Jang Hang-seon, Oh Kwang-rok, Ok Ji-young, Jeong Dong-hwan', null, 'A successful lawyer who, in order to save her daughter, is pressured into defending the innocence of a man slated to receive the death penalty.', 'A successful lawyer who, in order to save her daughter, is pressured into defending the innocence of a man slated to receive the death penalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C5ZLHaXk7vuckR9DW8bzG8UwFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24822'),
  ('201138639919929733', 'Seven Days', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Podz, Sylvie Perron, Bernard Couture', 'Patrick Senécal', 'Claude Legault, Rémy Girard, Martin Dubreuil, Fanny Mallette, Rose-Marie Coallier, Alexandre Goyette, Dominique Quesnel, Pascale Delhaes', null, 'Like many happy people, Bruno Hamel is leading an uneventful life until one afternoon, when his daughter is raped and murdered. When the murderer is arrested, a terrible project germinates in Bruno''s darkened mind. He plans to capture the "monster" and make him pay for his crime.', 'Like many happy people, Bruno Hamel is leading an uneventful life until one afternoon, when his daughter is raped and murdered. When the murderer is arrested, a terrible project germinates in Bruno''s darkened mind. He plans to capture the "monster" and make him pay for his crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag662hfmscOMYuVXxcPzAcDfIJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39681'),
  ('739385303397401332', 'Seven Days in May', 1964, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Frankenheimer, Ellsworth Fredericks, Hal W. Polaire', 'Rod Serling', 'Burt Lancaster, Kirk Douglas, Fredric March, Ava Gardner, Edmond O''Brien, Martin Balsam, Andrew Duggan, Hugh Marlowe', null, 'A U.S. Marine Corps colonel alerts the president of a planned military coup against him.', 'A U.S. Marine Corps colonel alerts the president of a planned military coup against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgMwyNl7uZeUrnIAqlX7htSQ2O2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23518'),
  ('623816480771111960', 'Seven Days to Noon', 1950, 'Thriller', 'Mike Johnson, Roy Boulting, John Boulting', 'Roy Boulting, Frank Harvey', 'Barry Jones, André Morell, Olive Sloane, Sheila Manahan, Hugh Cross, Joan Hickson, Ronald Adam, Marie Ney', null, 'When Professor Willingdon becomes wary of the nuclear weapons he is helping build, he steals a warhead and threatens to detonate it in London in seven days unless the government begins nuclear disarmament. As Willingdon goes into hiding, Detective Folland of Scotland Yard sets out to find him. Willingdon''s daughter Ann also joins the cause, hoping she can talk sense into her father before he causes a catastrophe.', 'When Professor Willingdon becomes wary of the nuclear weapons he is helping build, he steals a warhead and threatens to detonate it in London in seven days unless the government begins nuclear disarmament. As Willingdon goes into hiding, Detective Folland of Scotland Yard sets out to find him. Willingdon''s daughter Ann also joins the cause, hoping she can talk sense into her father before he causes a catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDvEMfWqgCzMMBwKp1J2GashTga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46932'),
  ('75223537908501169', 'Seven Days War', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Action', 'Yuki Nishioka, Kento Sasaki, Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Kyoko Yoshine, Takumi Kitamura, Haruka Michii, Makoto Koichi, Megumi Han, Rie Miyazawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Takeo Otsuka', null, 'In the town of Saima, when summer is about to begin, a group of six high school students intend to live a secret adventure by spending seven carefree days in a ruined mining facility.', 'In the town of Saima, when summer is about to begin, a group of six high school students intend to live a secret adventure by spending seven carefree days in a ruined mining facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1t4u5I9W5rJkxfvh1u32CrxsMjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608085'),
  ('845037181477105619', 'Seven Days: Friday - Sunday', 2015, 'Romance', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Yoko Itakura', 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Tomoki Hirose, James Takeshi Yamada, Hiyori Yuki, Hinako Tanaka, Itsuki Sagara, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Rin Ishikawa', 'NR', 'Yuzuru asked Touji out as a half-hearted joke, not expecting to be taken seriously. Touji accepted, and Yuzuru knew he was like the rest, the relationship begins on a Monday and ends on Sunday. What he did not expect was the feelings that went beyond friendship that emerged. It''s now Friday, and the end is approaching. But is it? Yuzuru may be mourning the inevitable, but what about Touji? Friday begins the end, but Sunday reveals all.', 'Yuzuru asked Touji out as a half-hearted joke, not expecting to be taken seriously. Touji accepted, and Yuzuru knew he was like the rest, the relationship begins on a Monday and ends on Sunday. What he did not expect was the feelings that went beyond friendship that emerged. It''s now Friday, and the end is approaching. But is it? Yuzuru may be mourning the inevitable, but what about Touji? Friday begins the end, but Sunday reveals all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qzVlz3HgBK8jUz4go5U7y8sdwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346356'),
  ('550531233587329932', 'Seven Days: Monday - Thursday', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Takeshi Yokoi, Yoko Itakura', 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Tomoki Hirose, James Takeshi Yamada, Hiyori Yuki, Hinako Tanaka, Itsuki Sagara, Yukihiro Takiguchi, Rin Ishikawa', 'NR', 'Toji Seryo is a popular first year high school student. It''s well known that Toji Seryo will date anyone that confesses their affection for him on a Monday, but he will break up with that person by Sunday. Yuzuru Shino is a third year student at the same high school. He looks pretty, but all of his former girlfriends end up dumping him. Yuzuru Shino becomes curious about Toji Seryo. On a whim, half serious & half joking, Yuzuru Shino asks Toji Seryo to date.', 'Toji Seryo is a popular first year high school student. It''s well known that Toji Seryo will date anyone that confesses their affection for him on a Monday, but he will break up with that person by Sunday. Yuzuru Shino is a third year student at the same high school. He looks pretty, but all of his former girlfriends end up dumping him. Yuzuru Shino becomes curious about Toji Seryo. On a whim, half serious & half joking, Yuzuru Shino asks Toji Seryo to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4las5FrcFHX85nQyQU4R0q5HwrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346355'),
  ('553348307579341124', 'Seven Days… Seven Nights', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Brook, Serge Vallin, Armand Thirard', 'Gérard Jarlot, Marguerite Duras', 'Jeanne Moreau, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Didier Haudepin, Colette Régis, Pascale de Boysson, Jean Deschamps, Valeric Dobuzinsky', null, 'Anne Desbarèdes is a young woman who is married to a wealthy businessman and lives a monotonous existence in the small commune town of Blaye. After indirectly witnessing a murder in a café, she returns to the scene of the crime the next day and meets Chauvin, who informs her in more detail about the events that took place. Mentally unbalanced, Anne begins to believe that Chauvin intends to kill her.', 'Anne Desbarèdes is a young woman who is married to a wealthy businessman and lives a monotonous existence in the small commune town of Blaye. After indirectly witnessing a murder in a café, she returns to the scene of the crime the next day and meets Chauvin, who informs her in more detail about the events that took place. Mentally unbalanced, Anne begins to believe that Chauvin intends to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Gti1xNWrLOOefC1bmcK9ku0HqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83662'),
  ('273400998704927249', 'Seven Deaths by Prescription', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jacques Rouffio, Andréas Winding', 'Georges Conchon, Jean-Louis Chevrier, Jacques Rouffio', 'Michel Piccoli, Gérard Depardieu, Jane Birkin, Marina Vlady, Charles Vanel, Michel Auclair, Antonio Ferrandis, Étienne Draber', null, 'Dr. Brézé and his sons, all surgeons with limited abilities fight any competition on their sector with all means.', 'Dr. Brézé and his sons, all surgeons with limited abilities fight any competition on their sector with all means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18lMVtsmw4sUQ553OubBs5eswK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78267'),
  ('318788330856382409', 'Seven Deaths in the Cat''s Eye', 1973, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Antonio Margheriti, Carlo Carlini', 'Giovanni Simonelli, Antonio Margheriti', 'Jane Birkin, Hiram Keller, Françoise Christophe, Venantino Venantini, Doris Kunstmann, Anton Diffring, Dana Ghia, Konrad Georg', null, 'In a small Scottish village, horribly murdered bodies keep turning up. Suspicion falls upon the residents of a nearby castle that is haunted by a curse involving a killer cat.', 'In a small Scottish village, horribly murdered bodies keep turning up. Suspicion falls upon the residents of a nearby castle that is haunted by a curse involving a killer cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6y5ajDJlZj41DcEpMZmjuMZSUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98027'),
  ('324387695568382790', 'Seven Dollars on Red', 1966, 'Western', 'Alberto Cardone, José F. Aguayo, Luis S. Enciso', 'Juan Cobos, Melchiade Coletti', 'Anthony Steffen, Elisa Montés, Fernando Sancho, Roberto Miali, Loredana Nusciak, José Manuel Martín, Carla Calò, Spartaco Conversi', null, 'A little boy is abducted by ruthless bandit gang leader El Cachal after Cachal and his men butcher the boy''s family with the exception of his father. Johnny Ashley, the gunslinger father of the boy, goes searching for his son. Alas, the boy has grown up to be a mean and vicious criminal.', 'A little boy is abducted by ruthless bandit gang leader El Cachal after Cachal and his men butcher the boy''s family with the exception of his father. Johnny Ashley, the gunslinger father of the boy, goes searching for his son. Alas, the boy has grown up to be a mean and vicious criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDllrFHpY2mF3CIhU5qTy4PUhpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126421'),
  ('464818762385709206', 'Seven Footprints to Satan', 1929, 'Crime, Comedy, Horror', 'Benjamin Christensen, Sol Polito', 'Benjamin Christensen', 'Thelma Todd, Creighton Hale, Sheldon Lewis, William V. Mong, Sôjin Kamiyama, Laska Winter, Angelo Rossitto, Ivan Christy', 'NR', 'Before a planned African expedition, a man''s fiancée worries her father''s guest plans to steal one of her father''s rubies. The couple are kidnapped and held prisoner at a mysterious, creepy house. Strange things are afoot at Satan''s house.', 'Before a planned African expedition, a man''s fiancée worries her father''s guest plans to steal one of her father''s rubies. The couple are kidnapped and held prisoner at a mysterious, creepy house. Strange things are afoot at Satan''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMixJjn3SqwAFgdpiBOs4Re2tRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27500'),
  ('683391586947760152', 'Seven Freckles', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Herrmann Zschoche, Ursula Ullrich, Günter Jaeuthe', 'Herrmann Zschoche, Christa Kožik', 'Kareen Schröter, Harald Rathmann, Christa Löser, Evelyn Opoczynski, Jan Bereska, Barbara Dittus, Hilmar Baumann, Janine Beilfuß', null, 'East Germany 1978. Karoline and Robert, teenagers who used to live in the same house until Robert''s family moved, meet again at this year''s holiday-camp. First love, first nude experience, first self-made theatre performance of "Romeo and Juliet". A look at the east-German youth in the late seventies.', 'East Germany 1978. Karoline and Robert, teenagers who used to live in the same house until Robert''s family moved, meet again at this year''s holiday-camp. First love, first nude experience, first self-made theatre performance of "Romeo and Juliet". A look at the east-German youth in the late seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUKAOeh55PbrSoTAwl1cTIVt145.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40792'),
  ('461495939165563209', 'Seven Golden Men', 1965, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marco Vicario', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Marco Vicario, Noelle Gillmor', 'Philippe Leroy, Rossana Podestà, Gabriele Tinti, Maurice Poli, Gastone Moschin, Giampiero Albertini, Manuel Zarzo, Dario De Grassi', null, 'After bungling a job in London, Albert, an international thief, masterminds a plan to rob a Geneva bank of 7 tons of gold. Assisted by the seductive Giorgia, who works from within the bank, and six other accomplices, Albert sets himself up in an expensive hotel with a battery of electronic devices to supervise the operation.', 'After bungling a job in London, Albert, an international thief, masterminds a plan to rob a Geneva bank of 7 tons of gold. Assisted by the seductive Giorgia, who works from within the bank, and six other accomplices, Albert sets himself up in an expensive hotel with a battery of electronic devices to supervise the operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY1M7IizUu13muFXOEOoGbkfwCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168529'),
  ('316483793466252942', 'Seven Golden Men Strike Again', 1966, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Marco Vicario, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Marco Vicario', 'Rossana Podestà, Philippe Leroy, Gastone Moschin, Gabriele Tinti, Maurice Poli, Giampiero Albertini, Manuel Zarzo, Dario De Grassi', null, 'Armed with gadgets and an atomic sub, a crook (Philippe Leroy) and his gang target a Latin dictator and Soviet gold.', 'Armed with gadgets and an atomic sub, a crook (Philippe Leroy) and his gang target a Latin dictator and Soviet gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/451aP5QPdcAma8R5FFiL3I44g2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168536'),
  ('2055416313092185', 'Seven Guns for the MacGregors', 1966, 'Western', 'Franco Giraldi, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Fernando Di Leo, Enzo Dell''Aquila, David Moreno Mingote', 'Robert Woods, Fernando Sancho, Agata Flori, Leo Anchóriz, Manuel Zarzo, Nazzareno Zamperla, Paolo Magalotti, Julio Pérez Tabernero', null, 'Ranch owner MacGregor has seven sons and oldest Gregor leads his brothers to Las Mesas, a small town where they want to sell horses. They get into trouble with local people who are related with evil Santillana. After getting imprisoned and losing their horses they decide to go after Santillana''s gang.', 'Ranch owner MacGregor has seven sons and oldest Gregor leads his brothers to Las Mesas, a small town where they want to sell horses. They get into trouble with local people who are related with evil Santillana. After getting imprisoned and losing their horses they decide to go after Santillana''s gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYI5wI9p61vrupNNkyXHMCjkDh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129078'),
  ('2082011726209450', 'Seven Hours of Troubles', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Marchesi, Vittorio Metz, Mario Mariani', 'Agenore Incrocci, Marcello Marchesi, Vittorio Metz', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Carlo Campanini, Eduardo Passarelli, Mario Castellani, Galeazzo Benti, Clelia Matania, Guido Celano', null, 'Totò is a tailor but not a great tailor. He is married and his son is to be baptized and Totò hopes that his grand-mother will be moved by the baptism, so moved to help him. Unfortunately his wet nurse Maria loses his son in the garden. Totò doesn''t lose heart and rents Rita''s daughter and leaves looking for his son. Many adventures are awaiting for him.', 'Totò is a tailor but not a great tailor. He is married and his son is to be baptized and Totò hopes that his grand-mother will be moved by the baptism, so moved to help him. Unfortunately his wet nurse Maria loses his son in the garden. Totò doesn''t lose heart and rents Rita''s daughter and leaves looking for his son. Many adventures are awaiting for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MADKVgahWRuaT7vGGiKw061Qcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139485'),
  ('61192671060201630', 'Seven in Heaven', 2018, 'Horror', 'Chris Eigeman, Karim Hussain, Yari Azzopardi', 'Chris Eigeman', 'Travis Tope, Haley Ramm, Jacinda Barrett, Gary Cole, Clark Backo, Vinson Tran, Gage Munroe, Milton Barnes', 'PG-13', 'Teenagers Jude and June spend seven minutes in a locked closet and emerge in a hostile and dangerous alternate world.', 'Teenagers Jude and June spend seven minutes in a locked closet and emerge in a hostile and dangerous alternate world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elReufFR4NYFiBVRsD0wB2F6FDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500535'),
  ('967653914299954465', 'Seven Lacs', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jaffer Malik', 'Saifuddin Saif', 'Santosh Kumar, Sabiha Khanum, Neelo, Nayyar Sultana, Agha Talish', null, 'A heiress has to marry in order to spend her financial assets and physical possessions worth PKR seven lakh each. As part of this condition, she makes a plan to marry a convicted man....', 'A heiress has to marry in order to spend her financial assets and physical possessions worth PKR seven lakh each. As part of this condition, she makes a plan to marry a convicted man....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rozQ9wHd0hVaJegJPUuKz0PGmDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852257'),
  ('1019187334460913980', 'Seven Minutes', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Lajos Koltai, Nikolai Müllerschön', 'Stephen Sheppard', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Rebecca Miller, Brian Dennehy, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Marthe Keller, Vadim Glowna, Ralf Richter, Nigel Le Vaillant', null, 'A true story about Johann Georg Elser, a quiet carpenter who tried to assassinate Hitler with an explosive device in 1939.', 'A true story about Johann Georg Elser, a quiet carpenter who tried to assassinate Hitler with an explosive device in 1939.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gi1QMnjfyQzZJ3caeYhJXTqAYz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264943'),
  ('439267044880107256', 'Seven Minutes', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Daniela Féjerman', 'Daniela Féjerman, Ángeles González-Sinde', 'Toni Acosta, Pilar Castro, Luis Callejo, Antonio Garrido, Asier Etxeandia, Juan Manuel Cifuentes, Marta Etura, Tatiana Astengo', null, '¿Bastan 7 minutos para enamorarse? Los protagonistas de esta comedia coral y romántica no lo tienen claro. Pero lo van a intentar. Por eso acuden a una sesión de "citas rápidas", encuentros entre hombres y mujeres que quieren conocer gente, huir de la soledad y encontrar el amor.En estas veladas, cada uno tiene siete minutos para hablar con cada una, y viceversa. Luego, todos se van a casa y votan por Internet a aquellas personas que les han gustado. Si el voto es coincidente, la empresa que organiza los encuentros remite a los interesados los e-mails respectivos, y a partir de ahí, puede surgir o no una historia...', '¿Bastan 7 minutos para enamorarse? Los protagonistas de esta comedia coral y romántica no lo tienen claro. Pero lo van a intentar. Por eso acuden a una sesión de "citas rápidas", encuentros entre hombres y mujeres que quieren conocer gente, huir de la soledad y encontrar el amor.En estas veladas, cada uno tiene siete minutos para hablar con cada una, y viceversa. Luego, todos se van a casa y votan por Internet a aquellas personas que les han gustado. Si el voto es coincidente, la empresa que organiza los encuentros remite a los interesados los e-mails respectivos, y a partir de ahí, puede surgir o no una historia...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVpY6WbHE7DWphB5lBLKn4phaw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25259'),
  ('59370768786028575', 'Seven Minutes in Heaven', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Linda Feferman, Steven Fierberg, Judy Irola', 'Linda Feferman, Jane Bernstein', 'Jennifer Connelly, Byron Thames, Maddie Corman, Michael Zaslow, Polly Draper, Alan Boyce, Billy Wirth, Terry Kinney', 'PG-13', 'Natalie allows her classmate Jeff, who has run away from home, to stay at her place while her father is away on a business trip. Natalie soon starts dating Jeff''s friend James Casey, who isn''t as faithful as she thinks, while her best friend Polly falls in love with baseball player Zoo Knudsen.', 'Natalie allows her classmate Jeff, who has run away from home, to stay at her place while her father is away on a business trip. Natalie soon starts dating Jeff''s friend James Casey, who isn''t as faithful as she thinks, while her best friend Polly falls in love with baseball player Zoo Knudsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIvg1lnhK2t4WVltHAkCn1J6aSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38981'),
  ('252423843825153974', 'Seven Murders for Scotland Yard', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Diego Úbeda, José Luis Madrid', 'Tito Carpi, Paul Naschy, José Luis Madrid', 'Paul Naschy, Patricia Loran, Renzo Marignano, Orchidea De Santis, Andrés Resino, Irene Mir, Franco Borelli, Víctor Iregua', 'R', 'Several murders have taken place in London. All the victims are prostitutes and the murderer is using the same techniques as Jack the Ripper. Peter Dockerman, an ex-acrobat and husband of one of the victims is the prime suspect. But whoever the killer is has cannibalistic tendencies and if Scotland Yard doesn''t solve the murders quickly the evidence just might be eaten!', 'Several murders have taken place in London. All the victims are prostitutes and the murderer is using the same techniques as Jack the Ripper. Peter Dockerman, an ex-acrobat and husband of one of the victims is the prime suspect. But whoever the killer is has cannibalistic tendencies and if Scotland Yard doesn''t solve the murders quickly the evidence just might be eaten!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21w2HI1ZH5kd1YItUf5k2nttvLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28402'),
  ('836693950245174648', 'Seven Old Men and One Girl', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Yevgeni Karelov, Sergey Zaytsev, A. Pavlov', 'Albert Ivanov, Yevgeni Karelov', 'Svetlana Savyolova, Valentin Smirnitskiy, Boris Novikov, Aleksei Smirnov, Nikolai Parfyonov, Aleksandr Beniaminov, Boris Chirkov, Anatoli Adoskin', null, 'Lara Velichko is a young coach who''s dreaming about coaching world champions but suddenly she''s forced to train a group of a very grumpy old men.', 'Lara Velichko is a young coach who''s dreaming about coaching world champions but suddenly she''s forced to train a group of a very grumpy old men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOrZyvGLwWp7oX86uumtM2duzTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65713'),
  ('190185586170711004', 'Seven Pounds', 2008, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Muccino, Philippe Le Sourd, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Grant Nieporte', 'Will Smith, Rosario Dawson, Woody Harrelson, Michael Ealy, Barry Pepper, Elpidia Carrillo, Robinne Lee, Bill Smitrovich', 'PG-13', 'An IRS agent with a fateful secret embarks on an extraordinary journey of redemption by forever changing the lives of seven strangers.', 'An IRS agent with a fateful secret embarks on an extraordinary journey of redemption by forever changing the lives of seven strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85zUipgVy2QbvAJ6djZXYaGckMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11321'),
  ('248299454289857852', 'Seven Psychopaths', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Martin McDonagh, Ben Davis, Peter Kohn', 'Martin McDonagh', 'Colin Farrell, Sam Rockwell, Woody Harrelson, Christopher Walken, Olga Kurylenko, Tom Waits, Abbie Cornish, Michael Stuhlbarg', 'R', 'A struggling screenwriter inadvertently becomes entangled in the Los Angeles criminal underworld after his oddball friends kidnap a gangster''s beloved Shih Tzu.', 'A struggling screenwriter inadvertently becomes entangled in the Los Angeles criminal underworld after his oddball friends kidnap a gangster''s beloved Shih Tzu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ukEYAxlSivFcDG6vLxJB6PjTjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86838'),
  ('823089668970511387', 'Seven Reeds, One Dress', 1948, 'Documentary', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Giovanni Ventimiglia', 'Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Mario Chiocchio', null, 'A short documentary on the production of rayon, filmed in the industrial town of Torviscosa in northeastern Italy. The film documents the transformation of raw materials into synthetic fabric, situating the manufacturing process within a town specifically constructed to serve the factory and its workforce.', 'A short documentary on the production of rayon, filmed in the industrial town of Torviscosa in northeastern Italy. The film documents the transformation of raw materials into synthetic fabric, situating the manufacturing process within a town specifically constructed to serve the factory and its workforce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icnh7NPWavUzEHLb9ImKT09glhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387603'),
  ('183122444723763223', 'Seven Rooms, Kitchen, Bathroom, for Sale', 1984, 'Drama', 'Agnès Varda, Dominique Treillou, America Knees', 'Agnès Varda', 'Hervé Mangani, Louis Bec, Saskia Cohen Tanugi, Colette Bonnet, Pierre Esposito, Catherine De Barbeyrac, Folco Chevalier, Michèle Nespoulet', null, 'An unusual visit to a large, empty apartment. But is it empty or not? Maybe a family has lived there or is going to live there. Maybe a young girl is going to escape from there. Maybe some of the old-timers who lived there never left. The walls themselves tell the stories of the time passing by.', 'An unusual visit to a large, empty apartment. But is it empty or not? Maybe a family has lived there or is going to live there. Maybe a young girl is going to escape from there. Maybe some of the old-timers who lived there never left. The walls themselves tell the stories of the time passing by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYrX2tSejwUKwPzCwTS8rDDRp1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251004'),
  ('828362755342554328', 'Seven Samurai', 1954, 'Action, Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Yasuyoshi Tajitsu, Sakae Hirosawa', 'Hideo Oguni, Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Yoshio Inaba, Seiji Miyaguchi, Minoru Chiaki, Daisuke Katō, Isao Kimura, Keiko Tsushima', 'NR', 'A samurai answers a village''s request for protection after he falls on hard times. The town needs protection from bandits, so the samurai gathers six others to help him teach the people how to defend themselves, and the villagers provide the soldiers with food.', 'A samurai answers a village''s request for protection after he falls on hard times. The town needs protection from bandits, so the samurai gathers six others to help him teach the people how to defend themselves, and the villagers provide the soldiers with food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOMGc8bnSwQhS4XyE1S99uH8NXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346'),
  ('533583610982764109', 'Seven Seas Pirates', 2012, 'Animation', 'Walter Tournier, Santiago Epstein', 'Mario Jacob, Enrique Cortés, Walter Tournier', 'Omar Aranda, Marcelo Armand, Diego Brizzi, Mariano Chiesa, Ariel Cister, Gustavo Dardés, Mario De Candia, Leandro Dugatkin', null, 'Selkirk, an unruly, selfish pirate, is the sailing master of the Esperanza, an English galley sailing the South Seas in search of treasures. When Captain Bullock decides to abandon him on an uninhabited island, he discovers a new outlook on the world and learns to survive alone, becoming the real Robinson Crusoe.', 'Selkirk, an unruly, selfish pirate, is the sailing master of the Esperanza, an English galley sailing the South Seas in search of treasures. When Captain Bullock decides to abandon him on an uninhabited island, he discovers a new outlook on the world and learns to survive alone, becoming the real Robinson Crusoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svPLGOaMkk3RoBh1QolvDjpiiO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89733'),
  ('983283031736991025', 'Seven Seas to Calais', 1962, 'Adventure', 'Rudolph Maté, Primo Zeglio', 'Filippo Sanjust', 'Rod Taylor, Keith Michell, Edy Vessel, Terence Hill, Basil Dignam, Anthony Dawson, Irene Worth, Luciano Melani', null, 'Sir Francis Drake fights to take over Spain''s treasure routes for Queen Elizabeth I.', 'Sir Francis Drake fights to take over Spain''s treasure routes for Queen Elizabeth I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AgN2xZ0ZaORhUpjYPCrei2TpWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207784'),
  ('608851299415400425', 'Seven Sinners', 1936, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Albert de Courville, Mutz Greenbaum, Douglas Peirce', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Edmund Lowe, Constance Cummings, Thomy Bourdelle, Henry Oscar, Felix Aylmer, O.B. Clarence, Allan Jeayes, Anthony Holles', null, 'Ed Harwood, a wisecracking private investigator from New York, discovers a crime at a hotel in Nice during a carnival. The unraveling of the mystery which lies behind will lead him and Caryl Fenton, a female insurance agent, who will become his companion, first to Paris, then to London, later through the English countryside and finally to Southampton, in search of a criminal train wrecker.', 'Ed Harwood, a wisecracking private investigator from New York, discovers a crime at a hotel in Nice during a carnival. The unraveling of the mystery which lies behind will lead him and Caryl Fenton, a female insurance agent, who will become his companion, first to Paris, then to London, later through the English countryside and finally to Southampton, in search of a criminal train wrecker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqsNGvYqO44jtdBgqrbDkD8RGO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70357'),
  ('1086186906374996794', 'Seven Sinners', 1940, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Rudolph Maté, Phil Karlson', 'Harry Tugend, John Meehan', 'Marlene Dietrich, John Wayne, Albert Dekker, Broderick Crawford, Anna Lee, Mischa Auer, Billy Gilbert, Richard Carle', 'NR', 'Banished from various U.S. protectorates in the Pacific, a saloon entertainer uses her femme-fatale charms to woo politicians, navy personnel, gangsters, riff-raff, judges and a ship''s doctor in order to achieve her aims.', 'Banished from various U.S. protectorates in the Pacific, a saloon entertainer uses her femme-fatale charms to woo politicians, navy personnel, gangsters, riff-raff, judges and a ship''s doctor in order to achieve her aims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6FGWhSclWSWof9isa8oKJsOe6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40979'),
  ('755015621612179708', 'Seven Something', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Weerachai Yaikwawong, Siwawut Sewatanon, Naruphol Chokanapitak', 'Adisorn Trisirikasem, Paween Purijitpanya, Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Sutatta Udomsilp, Jirayu La-ongmanee, Sirin Horwang, Sunny Suwanmethanon, Suquan Bulakul, Nichkhun Horvejkul, Panissara Arayaskul, Jarinporn Joonkiat', null, 'Three modern love stories focus on how digital privacy, fleeting fame and the power of personal reinvention can change one''s romantic destiny.', 'Three modern love stories focus on how digital privacy, fleeting fame and the power of personal reinvention can change one''s romantic destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzYYJmdlOgc39Qc5SDYiBm2fs3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143315'),
  ('145848687720245960', 'Seven Stages to Achieve Eternal Bliss', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Vivieno Caldinelli, Mathew Rudenberg, Alexander Harrison Jacobs', 'Christopher Hewitson, Clayton Hewitson, Justin Jones', 'Kate Micucci, Sam Huntington, Taika Waititi, Dan Harmon, Mark McKinney, Rhea Seehorn, Dana Gould, Maria Bamford', null, 'A small-town couple finds the perfect apartment in the big city, except there''s one catch: the apartment is home to the ritualistic suicides of a deranged cult.', 'A small-town couple finds the perfect apartment in the big city, except there''s one catch: the apartment is home to the ritualistic suicides of a deranged cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thb424IgPjgJS1mBE6FGLglpfll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502104'),
  ('982213283533721739', 'Seven Swords', 2005, 'Action, Drama', 'Venus Keung, Tsui Hark, Tommy Wai-Tak Lor', 'Tsui Hark, Chun Tin-Nam, Cheung Chi-Sing', 'Leon Lai Ming, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Lu Yi, Lau Kar-Leung, Donnie Yen, Sun Honglei, Kim So-yeon, Michael Wong', 'R', 'In the middle of the 17th century, the Manchus conquered China and founded the Ching dynasty. Due to widespread uprisings against the new rulers, the study and practice of traditional martial arts is forbidden and punishable by death. The unscrupulous leader of a troop of mercenaries takes advantage of this situation to make a fortune with the bounty on his head.', 'In the middle of the 17th century, the Manchus conquered China and founded the Ching dynasty. Due to widespread uprisings against the new rulers, the study and practice of traditional martial arts is forbidden and punishable by death. The unscrupulous leader of a troop of mercenaries takes advantage of this situation to make a fortune with the bounty on his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irZQJV9fv6XSbWmwquKSWCLDqDg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10703'),
  ('965837958637396705', 'Seven Thieves', 1960, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Sam Leavitt, Henry Hathaway, Ad Schaumer', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Edward G. Robinson, Rod Steiger, Joan Collins, Eli Wallach, Alexander Scourby, Michael Dante, Berry Kroeger, Sebastian Cabot', null, 'A discredited professor and a sophisticated thief decide to join together and pick a team to pull off one last job--the casino vault in Monte Carlo.', 'A discredited professor and a sophisticated thief decide to join together and pick a team to pull off one last job--the casino vault in Monte Carlo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yWo5PtqR2KhhZxp08lCRqGUKyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64605'),
  ('1065428359795947177', 'Seven Thunders', 1957, 'War, Drama', 'Hugo Fregonese, Wilkie Cooper', 'John Baines', 'Stephen Boyd, James Robertson Justice, Tony Wright, Anna Gaylor, Kathleen Harrison, Eugene Deckers, Rosalie Crutchley, June Cowell', null, 'Escaping British prisoners of war hide out in German occupied France.', 'Escaping British prisoners of war hide out in German occupied France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tT8kloy6AI3mi6yOpgIdaNDW3mR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137603'),
  ('497760060171282510', 'Seven Up!', 1964, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Paul Almond', null, 'Lynn Johnson, Tony Walker, Jacqueline Bassett, Bruce Balden, Andrew Brackfield, Neil Hughes, Nicholas Hitchon, Susan Sullivan', null, 'A group of British children aged 7 from widely ranging backgrounds are interviewed about a range of subjects. The filmmakers plan to re-interview them at 7 year intervals to track how their lives and attitudes change as they age.', 'A group of British children aged 7 from widely ranging backgrounds are interviewed about a range of subjects. The filmmakers plan to re-interview them at 7 year intervals to track how their lives and attitudes change as they age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KSbxDP4wAZBkpbW2rs6CZBZJbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51863'),
  ('334918112870494854', 'Seven Veils', 2025, 'Drama', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, Daniel J. Murphy', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Amanda Seyfried, Rebecca Liddiard, Douglas Smith, Mark O''Brien, Vinessa Antoine, Ambur Braid, Michael Kupfer-Radecky, Tara Nicodemo', 'NR', 'Jeanine, an earnest theatre director, has been given the task of remounting her former mentor’s most famous work, the opera Salome. Haunted by dark and disturbing memories from her past, she allows her repressed trauma to color the present as she re-enters the opera world after so many years away.', 'Jeanine, an earnest theatre director, has been given the task of remounting her former mentor’s most famous work, the opera Salome. Haunted by dark and disturbing memories from her past, she allows her repressed trauma to color the present as she re-enters the opera world after so many years away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eX6WC02RFdm2Om6iPzV5YV3wFAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083782'),
  ('532422228613890420', 'Seven Waves Away', 1957, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Richard Sale, Basil Keys, Wilkie Cooper', 'Richard Sale', 'Tyrone Power, Mai Zetterling, Lloyd Nolan, Stephen Boyd, Moira Lister, James Hayter, Marie Lohr, Finlay Currie', 'NR', 'After a massive luxury liner sinks into the ocean, the ship''s officer must command a rickety lifeboat, built for only nine, that is stuffed with over twenty desperate and injured passengers. As a hurricane approaches and the many wounded passengers struggle for life, difficult decisions must be made about who will remain on the boat and who must be cast to the sea in order to give others the chance to survive.', 'After a massive luxury liner sinks into the ocean, the ship''s officer must command a rickety lifeboat, built for only nine, that is stuffed with over twenty desperate and injured passengers. As a hurricane approaches and the many wounded passengers struggle for life, difficult decisions must be made about who will remain on the boat and who must be cast to the sea in order to give others the chance to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q6g7tQw8U3HRfj9i2W9FeKlwNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98289'),
  ('348263116310447730', 'Seven Ways from Sundown', 1960, 'Western', 'Harry Keller, Ellis W. Carter, Tom Connors Jr.', 'Clair Huffaker', 'Audie Murphy, Barry Sullivan, Venetia Stevenson, John McIntire, Kenneth Tobey, Mary Field, Ken Lynch, Suzanne Lloyd', 'NR', 'A Texas Ranger must capture an outlaw and take him-in, while tangling with savage Apaches and greedy bounty-hunters on the way back to jail.', 'A Texas Ranger must capture an outlaw and take him-in, while tangling with savage Apaches and greedy bounty-hunters on the way back to jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPKTDltWmjWgKRLRVw8eV7Ntn0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78550'),
  ('126901841610026115', 'Seven Weeks', 2014, 'Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Kujô Sanbongi', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Tadashi Naitô', 'Tōru Shinagawa, Takako Tokiwa, Yumi Adachi, Takao Itō, Saki Terashima, Hirona Yamazaki, Natsuki Harada, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'Relatives gather from afar in wintery Ashibetsu upon the death of patriarch Mitsuo. A mysterious woman named Nobuko suddenly shows up. Her appearance gradually exposes wartime secrets and Mitsuo''s unknown past.', 'Relatives gather from afar in wintery Ashibetsu upon the death of patriarch Mitsuo. A mysterious woman named Nobuko suddenly shows up. Her appearance gradually exposes wartime secrets and Mitsuo''s unknown past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gge0HCpgFJaoHplpwMAzAuKnQyP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321192'),
  ('689706740046930201', 'Seven Winters in Tehran', 2023, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Steffi Niederzoll, Stefan Kriekhaus, Julia Daschner', 'Steffi Niederzoll', 'Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Reyhaneh Jabbari, Shole Pakravan, Shahrzad Jabbari, Fereydoon Jabbari, Sharare Jabbari', null, 'After seven years in prison, a female student in Tehran is hanged for murder. She had acted in self-defence against a rapist. For a pardon, she would have had to retract her testimony. This moving film reopens the case.', 'After seven years in prison, a female student in Tehran is hanged for murder. She had acted in self-defence against a rapist. For a pardon, she would have had to retract her testimony. This moving film reopens the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqD4OdxAB68GNf5G9UUMHziC44B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073462'),
  ('873336885959749879', 'Seven Wishes', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Igor Kiselev, Evgeny Privin, Dasha Charusha', 'Ekaterina Kononenko, Maxim Budarin, Tina Kaval', 'Aglaya Tarasova, Kirill Nagiev, Mariya Minogarova, Aleksandr Gudkov, Yana Troyanova, Pavel Derevyanko, Yuliya Aug, Yekaterina Varnava', null, 'Hoping to change her life, Marina, a small town girl, embarks on a journey to a life coaching event. But an unexpected delay at a St. Petersburg airport sends her on a 24 hour comedic spree, which may ultimately provide her with the key to her happiness.', 'Hoping to change her life, Marina, a small town girl, embarks on a journey to a life coaching event. But an unexpected delay at a St. Petersburg airport sends her on a 24 hour comedic spree, which may ultimately provide her with the key to her happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzKXT1CIM5tL0AmtDPL29cUCjWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584006'),
  ('551496432639065896', 'Seven Women for Satan', 1975, 'Horror', 'Michel Lemoine, Jean Lefèvre, Jacques Lavaud', 'Michel Lemoine', 'Michel Lemoine, Nathalie Zeiger, Howard Vernon, Joëlle Cœur, Martine Azencot, Stéphane Lorry, Robert de Laroche, Sophie Grynholc', null, 'Boris Zaroff is a modern businessman who is haunted by his past -- his father was the notorious Count Zaroff of The Most Dangerous Game fame. Consequently, Boris is subject to hallucinations and all-too-real social lapses which normally involve sadistic harm to beautiful naked young women. His butler is sworn to indoctrinating him into the evils of the family line, and their castle''s torture dungeon proves quite useful in this regard. However, Boris is periodically lured away from his destiny by the romantic apparition of the deceased countess who previously owned the castle.', 'Boris Zaroff is a modern businessman who is haunted by his past -- his father was the notorious Count Zaroff of The Most Dangerous Game fame. Consequently, Boris is subject to hallucinations and all-too-real social lapses which normally involve sadistic harm to beautiful naked young women. His butler is sworn to indoctrinating him into the evils of the family line, and their castle''s torture dungeon proves quite useful in this regard. However, Boris is periodically lured away from his destiny by the romantic apparition of the deceased countess who previously owned the castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DweD57NzMR2STOY6QovyV6s8Mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30458'),
  ('716213426582825038', 'Seven Women of Different Ages', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, null, 'Each day of the week is represented by a ballerina beginning with a young child and ending with an older ballet teacher.', 'Each day of the week is represented by a ballerina beginning with a young child and ending with an older ballet teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH9m1EhwfqU2CHYKXUHTJ0A9y6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49109'),
  ('595176742275270780', 'Seven Women, Seven Sins', 1986, 'Drama', 'Valie Export, Laurence Gavron, Helke Sander', 'Dörte Haak, Helke Sander, Valie Export', 'Gabi Herz, Michael Dick, Kate Valk, Rosemary Hochschild, Roberta Wallach, Suzanne Fletcher, Luis Guzmán, Alan Colmes', 'R', 'Seven Women, Seven Sins (1986) represents a quintessential moment in film history. The women filmmakers invited to direct for the seven sins were amongst the world''s most renown: Helke Sander (Gluttony), Bette Gordon (Greed), Maxi Cohen (Anger), Chantal Akerman (Sloth), Valie Export (Lust), Laurence Gavron (Envy), and Ulrike Ottinger (Pride). Each filmmaker had the liberty of choosing a sin to interpret as they wished. The final film reflected this diversity, including traditional narrative fiction, experimental video, a musical, a radical documentary, and was delivered in multiple formats from 16, super 16, video and 35mm.', 'Seven Women, Seven Sins (1986) represents a quintessential moment in film history. The women filmmakers invited to direct for the seven sins were amongst the world''s most renown: Helke Sander (Gluttony), Bette Gordon (Greed), Maxi Cohen (Anger), Chantal Akerman (Sloth), Valie Export (Lust), Laurence Gavron (Envy), and Ulrike Ottinger (Pride). Each filmmaker had the liberty of choosing a sin to interpret as they wished. The final film reflected this diversity, including traditional narrative fiction, experimental video, a musical, a radical documentary, and was delivered in multiple formats from 16, super 16, video and 35mm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwftNGXq3NsqRZsJCX5vErybQfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252286'),
  ('743085569783555431', 'Seven Years', 2016, 'Drama', 'Roger Gual, Arnau Valls Colomer', 'Roger Gual, Cristian Conti, Julia Fontana', 'Paco León, Juan Pablo Raba, Àlex Brendemühl, Juana Acosta, Manuel Morón, Marta Torné, Marta Casielles, Josete Rivas', 'R', 'The drama is centered on four friends and business partners who in one evening are forced to find a way to save their company and themselves. The impossible decision they face is agreeing on who will be the one to sacrifice their freedom to save the others from personal and financial demise. It is a race against time that will put their friendship and sanity to the test. Who will take the fall?', 'The drama is centered on four friends and business partners who in one evening are forced to find a way to save their company and themselves. The impossible decision they face is agreeing on who will be the one to sacrifice their freedom to save the others from personal and financial demise. It is a race against time that will put their friendship and sanity to the test. Who will take the fall?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWPHFAVZFFVcPzy5HYMGS7beHjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423093'),
  ('388821278808186591', 'Seven Years Bad Luck', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder, Charles Van Enger', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Alta Allen, Ralph McCullough, Betty K. Peterson, F.B. Crayne, Chance Ward, Hugh Saxon, Thelma Percy', null, 'After breaking a mirror in his home, superstitious Max tries to avoid situations which could bring bad luck, but in doing so causes himself the worst luck imaginable.', 'After breaking a mirror in his home, superstitious Max tries to avoid situations which could bring bad luck, but in doing so causes himself the worst luck imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2wzhYV3Kk36hkxxAJekNk1uz97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97995'),
  ('50495790443048322', 'Seven Years in May', 2019, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Marcela Santos, Bruno Vasconcelos, Affonso Uchôa', 'Affonso Uchôa, João Dumans, Rafael dos Santos Rocha', 'Rafael dos Santos Rocha, Maicon Felipe, Leonardo Ferreira, Max Henrique, Wederson Neguinho, Magno Pires, Robson Vieira', null, 'One night seven years ago, Rafael came home after work and discovered that people he did not know had come looking for him. He immediately fled, without looking back. From that moment on, his life changed, as if that night had never ended. One evening, around an improvised fire near a factory, he decides to confide his journey to a stranger. Rafael’s intimate account meets the collective testimony of an entire nation oppressed by poverty, police repression and institutional corruption.', 'One night seven years ago, Rafael came home after work and discovered that people he did not know had come looking for him. He immediately fled, without looking back. From that moment on, his life changed, as if that night had never ended. One evening, around an improvised fire near a factory, he decides to confide his journey to a stranger. Rafael’s intimate account meets the collective testimony of an entire nation oppressed by poverty, police repression and institutional corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pyyG7nSbqXXPvoM1MIocpN2dfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594342'),
  ('282303405825427090', 'Seven Years in Tibet', 1997, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Robert Fraisse', 'Becky Johnston', 'Brad Pitt, Jamyang Jamtsho Wangchuk, David Thewlis, BD Wong, Mako, Lhakpa Tsamchoe, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Duncan Fraser', 'PG-13', 'Austrian mountaineer Heinrich Harrer journeys to the Himalayas without his family to head an expedition in 1939. But when World War II breaks out, the arrogant Harrer falls into Allied forces'' hands as a prisoner of war. He escapes with a fellow detainee and makes his way to Lhasa, Tibet, where he meets the 14-year-old Dalai Lama, whose friendship ultimately transforms his outlook on life.', 'Austrian mountaineer Heinrich Harrer journeys to the Himalayas without his family to head an expedition in 1939. But when World War II breaks out, the arrogant Harrer falls into Allied forces'' hands as a prisoner of war. He escapes with a fellow detainee and makes his way to Lhasa, Tibet, where he meets the 14-year-old Dalai Lama, whose friendship ultimately transforms his outlook on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5euQXAgJ34TdUFl1t3O6Jw2lJAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978'),
  ('795793933644393848', 'Seven Years of Marriage', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Didier Bourdon, Pascal Caubère', 'Nathalie Vierne, Dominique Coubes, Didier Bourdon', 'Didier Bourdon, Catherine Frot, Jacques Weber, Yan Duffas, Jacques Herlin, Michèle Moretti, Philippe Brigaud, Thierry Bosc', null, 'After seven years of marriage, a couple of professional workers (he, a doctor and she, a banker) try to refresh their sex life.', 'After seven years of marriage, a couple of professional workers (he, a doctor and she, a banker) try to refresh their sex life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1mzZaporwNd9SYVytAxh2ljygV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19565'),
  ('507998907799885368', 'Seven Years of Night', 2018, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Choo Chang-min, Shin Tae-seob, Ha Gyeong-ho', 'Choo Chang-min', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Jang Dong-gun, Song Sae-byuk, Go Kyung-pyo, Moon Jeong-hee, Lee Re, Tang Joon-sang, Moon Chang-gil', null, 'Set against the haunting backdrop of a small lake town, this chilling thriller unravels a meticulous revenge set over a period of 7 years, all beginning with the accidental death of an innocent girl.', 'Set against the haunting backdrop of a small lake town, this chilling thriller unravels a meticulous revenge set over a period of 7 years, all beginning with the accidental death of an innocent girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4baB3og9gSHT9aysMgMu4WZTMMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437083'),
  ('527076910680799965', 'Seven-day Swapping', 2023, 'Romance', 'Kim Man-seok-I', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Yeon Joo, Han Seok-bong, Kang Min-woo', null, 'Cheon-seok and Mi-seon remarried. Mi-seon goes on a trip with her friends and asks her daughter-in-law to take care of her father-in-law for a week. Her father-in-law and her daughter-in-law came to live together for 7 days. Her daughter-in-law, who tasted her father-in-law''s crispy pork belly, falls in love with her father-in-law...', 'Cheon-seok and Mi-seon remarried. Mi-seon goes on a trip with her friends and asks her daughter-in-law to take care of her father-in-law for a week. Her father-in-law and her daughter-in-law came to live together for 7 days. Her daughter-in-law, who tasted her father-in-law''s crispy pork belly, falls in love with her father-in-law...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DNis2hoyLImQnGIZoianI7iohe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233728'),
  ('229823169817274100', 'Seventeen', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Joel DeMott, Jeff Kreines', null, 'Lynn Massie', null, 'In their final year at Muncie''s Southside High School, a group of seniors hurtles toward maturity with a combination of joy, despair, and an aggravated sense of urgency. They are also learning a great deal about life, both in and out of school, and not what school officials think they are teaching.', 'In their final year at Muncie''s Southside High School, a group of seniors hurtles toward maturity with a combination of joy, despair, and an aggravated sense of urgency. They are also learning a great deal about life, both in and out of school, and not what school officials think they are teaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHlwOJVGkypfXOThA7CnzDzJ82u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97887'),
  ('194292043562284584', 'Seventeen', 2017, 'Drama', 'Caroline Bobek, Monja Art', 'Monja Art', 'Elisabeth Wabitsch, Anaelle Dézsy, Alexandra Schmidt, Vanessa Ozinger, Christopher Schärf, Martina Poel, Chantal Zitzenbacher, Magdalena Wabitsch', null, 'Paula, an above-average intelligent student, is in love with her classmate Charlotte. At the same time she feels permanently provoked by dissolute Lilly to challenge her limits.', 'Paula, an above-average intelligent student, is in love with her classmate Charlotte. At the same time she feels permanently provoked by dissolute Lilly to challenge her limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeKOYFrJJyY5RbZTEhWHCAaZxoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434504'),
  ('206901799961352018', 'Seventeen', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Araceli Sánchez, Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Biel Montoro, Nacho Sánchez, Lola Cordón, Kandido Uranga, Itsaso Arana, Mamen Duch, Chani Martín, Jorge Cabrera', null, 'To find his therapy dog, a 17-year-old escapes from juvie and embarks on a journey of reconnection with his brother and grandmother through Cantabria.', 'To find his therapy dog, a 17-year-old escapes from juvie and embarks on a journey of reconnection with his brother and grandmother through Cantabria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZJS7IeKUOUvABoiJTbbsoLa8YQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623627'),
  ('1012286907254572365', 'Seventeen Again', 2000, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey W. Byrd, John P. Tarver', 'Stewart St. John', 'Tia Mowry, Tamera Mowry-Housley, Tahj Mowry, Robert Hooks, Maia Campbell, Hope Clarke, Mark Taylor, Merwin Mondesir', 'NR', 'Cat and Gene have been divorced for several years. They are both visiting their son and their grandchildren, Sydney and Willie. Willie''s a genius who develops a formula that makes who uses it young again, it inadvertently spills into some soap that Willie places in his grandparents room. When each of them uses it they finds themselves 17 again. Willie had to find a way to reverse the process but will his grandparents want to be old again?', 'Cat and Gene have been divorced for several years. They are both visiting their son and their grandchildren, Sydney and Willie. Willie''s a genius who develops a formula that makes who uses it young again, it inadvertently spills into some soap that Willie places in his grandparents room. When each of them uses it they finds themselves 17 again. Willie had to find a way to reverse the process but will his grandparents want to be old again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypMJVLjfhtx1B6TLGAqFTvy4AKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52051'),
  ('93279571038686488', 'Seventeen Ninja', 1963, 'Action', 'Yasuto Hasegawa, Motoya Washio', 'Kaneo Ikegami', 'Kōtarō Satomi, Jūshirō Konoe, Yuriko Mishima, Ryutaro Otomo, Chiyonosuke Azuma, Tokue Hanazawa, Kunio Kaga, Ryūji Shinagawa', null, 'As the Shogun lays dying, seventeen Iga clan ninja are sent to infiltrate the impenetrable fortress where his youngest son is preparing to storm Edo Castle and name himself Shogun by force of arms. They are to either steal the documents that will eventually give him lawful claim to rulership, or they are to assassinate him. But even before they reach the castle walls, they find their every move countered by a ruthless ninja hunter in the employ of the would-be usurper (Konoe), who not only knows their every tactic but knows the exact make-up of their team thanks to his own spies within Edo Castle. As the Iga Ninja fall one by one, the mission''s success or complete failure--where failure will result in a bloody war of succession--comes to hinge on a single young and inexperienced ninja (Kotaro).', 'As the Shogun lays dying, seventeen Iga clan ninja are sent to infiltrate the impenetrable fortress where his youngest son is preparing to storm Edo Castle and name himself Shogun by force of arms. They are to either steal the documents that will eventually give him lawful claim to rulership, or they are to assassinate him. But even before they reach the castle walls, they find their every move countered by a ruthless ninja hunter in the employ of the would-be usurper (Konoe), who not only knows their every tactic but knows the exact make-up of their team thanks to his own spies within Edo Castle. As the Iga Ninja fall one by one, the mission''s success or complete failure--where failure will result in a bloody war of succession--comes to hinge on a single young and inexperienced ninja (Kotaro).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aN8uHG80OeoYGItnrsTMC0OGbZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210865'),
  ('885604975650223618', 'Seventeen Times Cécile Cassard', 2002, 'Drama', 'Christophe Honoré, Rémy Chevrin', 'Christophe Honoré', 'Béatrice Dalle, Romain Duris, Jeanne Balibar, Ange Ruzé, Jérôme Kircher, Johan Oderio-Robles, Tiago Manaïa, Julien Collet', null, 'A portrait of a woman, composed of 17 moments from her life.', 'A portrait of a woman, composed of 17 moments from her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7U8hBiL4KxE7xlujEtaaxsOtUZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62415'),
  ('233296642305247604', 'Seventeen Years', 1999, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yuan, Zhang Xigui', 'Dai Ning, Yu Hua, Zhu Wen', 'Liu Lin, Li Bingbing, Yeding Li, Song Liang, Li Yun, Wan Suwan, Li Ye Ping', null, 'Yu Xiaoqin steals money from her father and blames on her sister Tao Lan, who accidentally kills her sister while attempting to prove her innocence. After 17 years in jail, Tao Lan is escorted by a guard only to find her home long demolished. The two go to the new address of her ageing parents, and the guard becomes witness to the family''s difficult reunion.', 'Yu Xiaoqin steals money from her father and blames on her sister Tao Lan, who accidentally kills her sister while attempting to prove her innocence. After 17 years in jail, Tao Lan is escorted by a guard only to find her home long demolished. The two go to the new address of her ageing parents, and the guard becomes witness to the family''s difficult reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ey5n906QiWeG4WLjnjCmwHr3ghO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41455'),
  ('666349083482935042', 'Seventh Code', 2014, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Shinya Kimura', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Atsuko Maeda, Ryohei Suzuki, Aissy, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Elena Andreeva', null, 'Akiko, a young woman, comes to Vladivostok to meet Matsunaga, a young businessman she has met in Tokyo only once. Akiko finally finds Matsunaga. However, he leaves her again, warning her not to trust strangers in a foreign country. She tries to follow him, but she is attacked by thugs and dumped on the outskirts of town.', 'Akiko, a young woman, comes to Vladivostok to meet Matsunaga, a young businessman she has met in Tokyo only once. Akiko finally finds Matsunaga. However, he leaves her again, warning her not to trust strangers in a foreign country. She tries to follow him, but she is attacked by thugs and dumped on the outskirts of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBqViu6LDzBie3TfPsqfi0hHzpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250278'),
  ('712131976261003919', 'Seventh Heaven', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Robert D. Webb, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Melville Baker', 'Simone Simon, James Stewart, Jean Hersholt, Gregory Ratoff, Gale Sondergaard, J. Edward Bromberg, John Qualen, Victor Kilian', null, 'A Parisian sewer worker longs for a rise in status and a beautiful wife. He rescues a girl from the police, lives with her in a barren flat on the seventh floor, and then marches away to war.', 'A Parisian sewer worker longs for a rise in status and a beautiful wife. He rescues a girl from the police, lives with her in a barren flat on the seventh floor, and then marches away to war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI0de3DvGSH6yh2W9rzOmHsLhkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173605'),
