  ('319786816391657628', 'Severina', 2017, 'Drama', 'Rui Poças, Juani Monteverdi, Jean Michel Cerf', null, 'Javier Drolas, Carla Quevedo, Alfredo Castro, Alejandro Awada, Daniel Hendler, Gonzalo Delgado, Nacho Mendy, Pedro Dalton', null, 'A melancholic, aspiring writer and bookseller is shaken by the appearances and disappearances of his newfound muse who steals books from his bookstore. When he discovers that she also steals from other bookstores, he is consumed with jealousy and starts living in a kind of love delirium, on the border between fiction and reality. The closer he gets to her, the more indescribable she becomes and he begins to wonder why she steals, what are her values and who is the older man she lives with. In the end, what is real and what isn’t? And will he find a place in her life as he moves away from his own?', 'A melancholic, aspiring writer and bookseller is shaken by the appearances and disappearances of his newfound muse who steals books from his bookstore. When he discovers that she also steals from other bookstores, he is consumed with jealousy and starts living in a kind of love delirium, on the border between fiction and reality. The closer he gets to her, the more indescribable she becomes and he begins to wonder why she steals, what are her values and who is the older man she lives with. In the end, what is real and what isn’t? And will he find a place in her life as he moves away from his own?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5drBC1Lj4ubrrCtAFq1Ds4cJvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467391'),
