  ('550506861593804338', 'Şevkat Yerimdar', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bülent İşbilen', 'Erol Hızarcı', 'Özgürcan Çevik, Başak Parlak, Cezmi Baskın, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Serkan Kuru, Özgür Emre Yıldırım, Murat Makar, Asuman Kostak', null, 'Şevkat Yerimdar is a good-hearted but hot-headed egg shop owner in Istanbul’s historic Balat district whose life is turned upside down when a wealthy heiress named Pelin crashes her car into his store - an incident that, captured and shared online, thrusts him into unexpected fame and a whirlwind of comic and romantic misadventures.', 'Şevkat Yerimdar is a good-hearted but hot-headed egg shop owner in Istanbul’s historic Balat district whose life is turned upside down when a wealthy heiress named Pelin crashes her car into his store - an incident that, captured and shared online, thrusts him into unexpected fame and a whirlwind of comic and romantic misadventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj7aSSH9kzbUcmGXAZD2CqneOLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278475'),
  ('674809928742987955', 'Sew Torn', 2025, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Govind Sharma, Sebastian Klinger, Sharon Howard-Field', 'Fred Macdonald, Freddy Macdonald', 'Eve Connolly, Calum Worthy, John Lynch, K Callan, Ron Cook, Thomas Douglas, Caroline Goodall, Werner Biermeier', null, 'A seamstress gets tangled in her own thread after stealing a briefcase from a drug deal gone bad. In an escalating game of cat and mouse, her different choices lead to drastically different outcomes along the way.', 'A seamstress gets tangled in her own thread after stealing a briefcase from a drug deal gone bad. In an escalating game of cat and mouse, her different choices lead to drastically different outcomes along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6N3bJq0VInPhifYml7cZ0TjRrXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046758'),
  ('764148827200418774', 'Sewage', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Murat Aykul, Alper Mestçi', 'Okan Bayülgen, Hakan Yılmaz, Aslihan Gurbuz, Ceren Benderlioğlu, Serhat Özcan, Orhan Aydın, Hakkı Devrim, Hüseyin Elmalıpınar', null, 'Imdat is a poor, uneducated, working class window cleaner who has migrated to the big city. As he cleans the windows of the private TV channel Kanal I, the president of the channel, Berk, discovers that Imdat has an uncanny ability to sense what program will yield the best ratings and what is likely to be panned by audiences, thus Berk begins milking Imdat''s unique ability to score ratings. Soon Imdat finds himself replacing the president and leading the TV channel. He goes on to produce some truly tasteless and exploitative programs that enjoy massive ratings, eventually becoming part of the dirty media games himself.', 'Imdat is a poor, uneducated, working class window cleaner who has migrated to the big city. As he cleans the windows of the private TV channel Kanal I, the president of the channel, Berk, discovers that Imdat has an uncanny ability to sense what program will yield the best ratings and what is likely to be panned by audiences, thus Berk begins milking Imdat''s unique ability to score ratings. Soon Imdat finds himself replacing the president and leading the TV channel. He goes on to produce some truly tasteless and exploitative programs that enjoy massive ratings, eventually becoming part of the dirty media games himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljaqj5VRmIGYtmZc51RMw7l44u4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52175'),
