  ('746406417621846864', 'Sex Cowboys', 2016, 'Drama', 'Adriano Giotti, Sandro Chessa', 'Adriano Giotti', 'Nataly Beck''S, Francesco Maccarinelli, Vito Napolitano, Francesca Renzi, Federico Rosati, Luca Buongiorno', null, 'Marla and Simone are madly in love and have a very passionate relationship. They are also struggling to get by and are unable to pay the rent. In desperation they decide to make porn videos. Sex cowboys is a travel inside our generation, the lost generation, destined to live without a permanent employment, a fixed home and a defined lifestyle. The characters of this travel are nomadic, precarious e immature in the comedy of their life: to Simone''s anger and to Marla''s magic need, alternates passion and sex. The generational crisis is inside us, and we have to find a way to survive and make the present our dream, since in our future we won''t have space.', 'Marla and Simone are madly in love and have a very passionate relationship. They are also struggling to get by and are unable to pay the rent. In desperation they decide to make porn videos. Sex cowboys is a travel inside our generation, the lost generation, destined to live without a permanent employment, a fixed home and a defined lifestyle. The characters of this travel are nomadic, precarious e immature in the comedy of their life: to Simone''s anger and to Marla''s magic need, alternates passion and sex. The generational crisis is inside us, and we have to find a way to survive and make the present our dream, since in our future we won''t have space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLyybioymJ2ZRl8lRu07SBUlu6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:562581'),
