  ('1003911987708527102', 'Sex Partner From a Blind Date App Who Helps Release Tension', 2025, null, null, null, 'Hae Il, Kim Soo Yeon, Lee Chae-dam, Min Do-yoon, Woo Yeol, Yeon Joo', null, 'Seo-yeon and Dong-seok had been trying to make their marriage work, but constant arguments and unresolved issues were driving them apart. One day, after a nudge from their friend Na-sung, they decided to give a dating app a try. Hoping to find some clarity or escape from their frustrations, they started meeting other people. Seo-yeon with other men, and Dong-seok with other women. What began as an attempt to fix their problems only seemed to push them further away from each other.', 'Seo-yeon and Dong-seok had been trying to make their marriage work, but constant arguments and unresolved issues were driving them apart. One day, after a nudge from their friend Na-sung, they decided to give a dating app a try. Hoping to find some clarity or escape from their frustrations, they started meeting other people. Seo-yeon with other men, and Dong-seok with other women. What began as an attempt to fix their problems only seemed to push them further away from each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yay9LXuyBOVy239NRhS6KbAWG6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1470984'),
