  ('118275850912011063', 'Shaandaar', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vikas Bahl, Anil Mehta', 'Anvita Dutt, Vikas Bahl', 'Shahid Kapoor, Alia Bhatt, Pankaj Kapur, Sanjay Kapoor, Kumud Pant, Niki Aneja Walia, Sanah Kapoor, Vikas Verma', null, 'Jagjinder Joginder, a wedding planner, brings together the dysfunctional family of businessman Bipin Arora while making arrangements for Bipin''s daughter''s destination wedding in London.', 'Jagjinder Joginder, a wedding planner, brings together the dysfunctional family of businessman Bipin Arora while making arrangements for Bipin''s daughter''s destination wedding in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5P4zbvCglw1WW61aCol3vJ1N28j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362140'),
