  ('41979686062543585', 'Shabaash Mithu', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Srijit Mukherji, Sirsha Ray', 'Priya Aven', 'Taapsee Pannu, Vijay Raaz, Mumtaz Sorcar, Inayat Verma, Brijendra Kala, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Shilpi Marwaha, Sampa Mandal', null, 'From child prodigy to trailblazing captain, Indian women''s cricket icon Mithali Raj navigates highs and lows of professional career. A story of a young girl''s determination and stance against discrimination, about her spirit, passion, courage, and her dreams.', 'From child prodigy to trailblazing captain, Indian women''s cricket icon Mithali Raj navigates highs and lows of professional career. A story of a young girl''s determination and stance against discrimination, about her spirit, passion, courage, and her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4T4LGIRErWK7bomHFlSJirGZ4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911154'),
