  ('1118097870445485710', 'Shadow', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Federico Zampaglione, Marco Bassano', 'Domenico Zampaglione, Federico Zampaglione, Giacomo Gensini', 'Jake Muxworthy, Karina Testa, Nuot Arquint, Chris Coppola, Ottaviano Blitch, Matt Patresi, Emilio De Marchi, Gianpiero Cognoli', null, 'A Young soldier returning from Iraq goes on a high mountain adventure in a desolate place in Europe to forget his past, he will lear truth in a mysterious local legend discovering that reality can be sicker than nightmares.', 'A Young soldier returning from Iraq goes on a high mountain adventure in a desolate place in Europe to forget his past, he will lear truth in a mysterious local legend discovering that reality can be sicker than nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mGtMVwXrv8vGAoYKeS1889fruU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37813'),
  ('540314060712460144', 'Shadow', 2018, 'Action, War', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Dee Dee', 'Zhu Sujin', 'Deng Chao, Sun Li, Ryan Zheng, Wang Qianyuan, Wang Jingchun, Hu Jun, Guan Xiaotong, Leo Wu', 'PG-13', 'In a kingdom ruled by a young and unpredictable king, the military commander has a secret weapon: a shadow, a look-alike who can fool both his enemies and the King himself. Now he must use this weapon in an intricate plan that will lead his people to victory in a war that the King does not want.', 'In a kingdom ruled by a young and unpredictable king, the military commander has a secret weapon: a shadow, a look-alike who can fool both his enemies and the King himself. Now he must use this weapon in an intricate plan that will lead his people to victory in a war that the King does not want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVXFyASEt1kLpZv9EYze0S0mZe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463319'),
  ('173632884617623358', 'Shadow', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mariana Roque, Luís Sérgio, Bruno Gascon', 'Bruno Gascon', 'Ana Moreira, Miguel Borges, Tomás Alves, Ana Cristina Oliveira, Raimundo Cosme, Vítor Norte, Oksana Tkach, Joana Ribeiro', null, 'Years after her son''s disappearance, a mother keeps trying to find him after an abduction that justice cannot solve while she is moving in a universe that wants to force her to mourn a child that she believes is still alive.', 'Years after her son''s disappearance, a mother keeps trying to find him after an abduction that justice cannot solve while she is moving in a universe that wants to force her to mourn a child that she believes is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyRthp0GGGrficgeG4Dqt7UR3gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720045'),
  ('1043530895278324464', 'Shadow Builder', 1998, 'Horror', 'Jamie Dixon, David Pelletier', 'Michael Stokes', 'Michael Rooker, Leslie Hope, Shawn Thompson, Andrew Jackson, Kevin Zegers, Tony Todd, Hardee T. Lineham, Catherine Bruhier', 'R', 'A demon is summoned to take the soul of a young boy who has the potential to become a saint. By doing this he will open a doorway to hell and destroy the world.', 'A demon is summoned to take the soul of a young boy who has the potential to become a saint. By doing this he will open a doorway to hell and destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isR6U53W9jCU85xlVAdKRW3QLeR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48921'),
  ('134634678550050356', 'Shadow Conspiracy', 1997, 'Thriller', 'George P. Cosmatos, Buzz Feitshans IV', 'Adi Hasak, Ric Gibbs', 'Charlie Sheen, Donald Sutherland, Linda Hamilton, Stephen Lang, Nicholas Turturro, Stanley Anderson, Theodore Bikel, Charles Cioffi', 'R', 'Bobby Bishop is a special assistant to the President of the United States. Accidentally, he meets his friend professor Pochenko on the street. Pochenko has time to tell Bishop about some conspiracy in the White House but then immediately gets killed by an assassin. Now bad guys are after Bobby as the only man who knows about a plot. Bishop must now not only survive, but to stop the conspirators from achieving their goal. And he doesn''t know whom to trust.', 'Bobby Bishop is a special assistant to the President of the United States. Accidentally, he meets his friend professor Pochenko on the street. Pochenko has time to tell Bishop about some conspiracy in the White House but then immediately gets killed by an assassin. Now bad guys are after Bobby as the only man who knows about a plot. Bishop must now not only survive, but to stop the conspirators from achieving their goal. And he doesn''t know whom to trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8dgxxCrpLhKjkjH2DPxkz0inoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38153'),
