  ('385515868559938814', 'Shadow Death', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chris Spinelli', 'Chris Spinelli', 'Luca Toumadi, Bryan Brewer, Johnny Mask, Emiko Ishii, Masashi Ishizuka', null, 'A mysterious killer roams a small town pulling it''s victims into the shadows. As the fatalities rise, dark secrets are revealed.', 'A mysterious killer roams a small town pulling it''s victims into the shadows. As the fatalities rise, dark secrets are revealed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F2%2Fgracenote%2F29db9f8e5a89e1acf518270803396268.jpg', 'plex:movie:shadow-death'),
  ('776312921498032405', 'Shadow Force', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joe Carnahan, Paulo Orellana, David Pombo', 'Leon Chills, Joe Carnahan', 'Kerry Washington, Omar Sy, Jahleel Kamara, Mark Strong, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Method Man, Ed Quinn, Natalia Reyes', 'R', 'Kyrah and Isaac were once the leaders of a multinational special forces group called Shadow Force. They broke the rules by falling in love, and in order to protect their son, they go underground. With a large bounty on their heads, and the vengeful Shadow Force hot on their trail, one family''s fight becomes all-out war.', 'Kyrah and Isaac were once the leaders of a multinational special forces group called Shadow Force. They broke the rules by falling in love, and in order to protect their son, they go underground. With a large bounty on their heads, and the vengeful Shadow Force hot on their trail, one family''s fight becomes all-out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LCpHFXZgkqp2AWiYq0mGbfZauk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757725'),
