  ('1077360658792427776', 'Shadow of a Doubt', 1943, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Joseph A. Valentine, Bernard B. Brown', 'Thornton Wilder, Alma Reville, Sally Benson', 'Teresa Wright, Joseph Cotten, Macdonald Carey, Henry Travers, Patricia Collinge, Hume Cronyn, Wallace Ford, Edna May Wonacott', 'PG', 'In sleepy Santa Rosa, restless young Charlie’s world brightens when her sophisticated Uncle Charlie arrives for a long visit. But as his behavior grows increasingly strange, she begins to suspect that her beloved uncle may be hiding a terrible secret—and that danger has quietly entered her home.', 'In sleepy Santa Rosa, restless young Charlie’s world brightens when her sophisticated Uncle Charlie arrives for a long visit. But as his behavior grows increasingly strange, she begins to suspect that her beloved uncle may be hiding a terrible secret—and that danger has quietly entered her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptyWagbWE8jSGyV2tGEzAdVbRCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21734'),
  ('437763241110006702', 'Shadow of a Woman', 1946, 'Drama', 'Bert Glennon, Joseph Santley, William Kissell', 'C. Graham Baker, Whitman Chambers', 'Helmut Dantine, Andrea King, William Prince, John Alvin, Becky Brown, Richard Erdman, Peggy Knudsen, Don McGuire', 'NR', 'Brooke''s brief marital life with Eric takes a downturn when she starts suspecting that he is starving his son from a prior marriage to death in order to claim his inheritance.', 'Brooke''s brief marital life with Eric takes a downturn when she starts suspecting that he is starving his son from a prior marriage to death in order to claim his inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZcoQqWCrggZJCIv2cFMM1Zaqt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44042'),
