  ('771025291047740508', 'Shadow of God', 2025, 'Horror', 'Michael Peterson', 'Tim Cairo', 'Mark O''Brien, Shaun Johnston, Jacqueline Byers, Josh Cruddas, Adrian Hough, David Haysom, Emily James, Alexis McKenna', null, 'While performing an unauthorized exorcism on his father, an elite exorcist suspects the entity he''s doing battle with might be a holy being – perhaps even God.', 'While performing an unauthorized exorcism on his father, an elite exorcist suspects the entity he''s doing battle with might be a holy being – perhaps even God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vi6LF8rTdU4DeYrXTtUBqG9gFnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227003'),
  ('432936884443907569', 'Shadow of the Cat', 2021, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Drama', 'Juan Fernando Pacheco, José María Cicala', 'Griselda Sánchez, Gustavo Lencina, José María Cicala', 'Danny Trejo, Guillermo Zapata, Miguel Ángel Solá, Mónica Antonópulos, Griselda Sánchez, Maite Lanata, Rita Cortese, Roberto Peloni', null, 'Gato lives on a remote farm with his teenage daughter Emma where without even basic communications tools they’re entirely cut off from the outside world. But once Emma comes into possession of a phone, she’s contacted by a party claiming to be working on behalf of her mother, who her father claimed abandoned her at birth. Infuriated, Emma heads off on a journey of self-discovery to reconnect with her mother, all the while Gato and his best pal Sombra (Danny Trejo) race to rescue her from the grim fate she’s unknowingly heading towards.', 'Gato lives on a remote farm with his teenage daughter Emma where without even basic communications tools they’re entirely cut off from the outside world. But once Emma comes into possession of a phone, she’s contacted by a party claiming to be working on behalf of her mother, who her father claimed abandoned her at birth. Infuriated, Emma heads off on a journey of self-discovery to reconnect with her mother, all the while Gato and his best pal Sombra (Danny Trejo) race to rescue her from the grim fate she’s unknowingly heading towards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCktbqokuarE0NskB9GZE4cDxR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661004'),
  ('1013527622859094299', 'Shadow of the Hawk', 1976, 'Horror, Adventure', 'Daryl Duke, George McCowan, Reginald H. Morris', 'Herbert Wright, Norman Thaddeus Vane', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Marilyn Hassett, Chief Dan George, Pia Shandel, Marianne Jones, Jacques Hubert, Anna Hagan', 'PG', 'Jan-Michael Vincent stars as Mike, the grandson of Native American shaman Old Man Hawk who is called back to his village to help defeat evil forces threatening the tribe. After years of living in the city and working in a business world altogether apart from his roots, Mike is contacted by a freelance reporter, Maureen, who was enlisted by Old Man Hawk to track his grandson. When Mike assents to returning with Maureen, they find that the village is beset by the evil spirit of an ancient sorceress, Dsonoqua, animating beasts and objects and causing strange, deadly accidents. Only the heir of the tribe’s shaman can stand in the way of the evil and protect his people, but will Mike be able to harness his power in time?', 'Jan-Michael Vincent stars as Mike, the grandson of Native American shaman Old Man Hawk who is called back to his village to help defeat evil forces threatening the tribe. After years of living in the city and working in a business world altogether apart from his roots, Mike is contacted by a freelance reporter, Maureen, who was enlisted by Old Man Hawk to track his grandson. When Mike assents to returning with Maureen, they find that the village is beset by the evil spirit of an ancient sorceress, Dsonoqua, animating beasts and objects and causing strange, deadly accidents. Only the heir of the tribe’s shaman can stand in the way of the evil and protect his people, but will Mike be able to harness his power in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtTMiwuxrTrHWgxSHwAMHf1xHAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133838'),
  ('328886101213750593', 'Shadow of the Law', 1930, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Louis J. Gasnier', 'Max Marcin, John A. Moroso', 'William Powell, Marion Shilling, Natalie Moorhead, Regis Toomey, Paul Hurst, George Irving, Frederick Burt, James Durkin', 'NR', 'John Nelson, a well-to-do businessman, is escorting a woman he knows as Ethel Barry to the door of her apartment suite when a man steps out of the shadows and angrily demands to know where she has been. The embarrassed Nelson excuses himself and goes to his rooms in the same hotel. The woman rushes into his apartment followed by the man who met her in the hall. The man threatens her with violence and Nelson comes to her defense. In the ensuing fight, the man is knocked out of the window and falls to his death to the pavement many stories down. He is charged with the killing and his only witness that can prove self-defense for him has disappeared, and can not be found.', 'John Nelson, a well-to-do businessman, is escorting a woman he knows as Ethel Barry to the door of her apartment suite when a man steps out of the shadows and angrily demands to know where she has been. The embarrassed Nelson excuses himself and goes to his rooms in the same hotel. The woman rushes into his apartment followed by the man who met her in the hall. The man threatens her with violence and Nelson comes to her defense. In the ensuing fight, the man is knocked out of the window and falls to his death to the pavement many stories down. He is charged with the killing and his only witness that can prove self-defense for him has disappeared, and can not be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUSnatxveyFpFY0aKguCHbSqJhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291239'),
  ('886885934580555790', 'Shadow of the Sword', 2005, 'Adventure, Action', 'Vladimír Smutný, Simon Aeby', 'Steve Attridge, Susanne Freund', 'Steven Berkoff, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Julie Cox, Lili Gesler, Anastasia Griffith, Maria Hofstätter, Virág Bárány, Patrick Godfrey', null, 'Central Europe, early 16th century: two childhood friends, Martin &amp; Georg, find themselves on rival sides of a religious war with both of them struggling to do the right thing.', 'Central Europe, early 16th century: two childhood friends, Martin &amp; Georg, find themselves on rival sides of a religious war with both of them struggling to do the right thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wBxOVzkpPwLv6rlch1NWB3euDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30800'),
  ('260319573733716228', 'Shadow of the Thin Man', 1941, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'W.S. Van Dyke, William H. Daniels', 'Harry Kurnitz, Irving Brecher', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Barry Nelson, Donna Reed, Sam Levene, Alan Baxter, Henry O''Neill, Richard Hall', 'NR', 'High society sleuths Nick and Nora Charles run into a variety of shady characters while investigating a race-track murder.', 'High society sleuths Nick and Nora Charles run into a variety of shady characters while investigating a race-track murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYiasULoMJj84A5zheNyChGuhHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14590'),
  ('169687979614582902', 'Shadow of the Vampire', 2000, 'Drama, Horror', 'E. Elias Merhige, Jamie Christopher, Edward Brett', 'Steven Katz', 'John Malkovich, Willem Dafoe, Udo Kier, Cary Elwes, Catherine McCormack, Eddie Izzard, Aden Gillett, Nicholas Elliott', 'R', 'Director F.W. Murnau makes a Faustian pact with a vampire to get him to star in his 1922 film "Nosferatu."', 'Director F.W. Murnau makes a Faustian pact with a vampire to get him to star in his 1922 film "Nosferatu."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWm7DWi8X4D87XkM5qr9BhTJHq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10873'),
  ('1113105865031817672', 'Shadow of the Wolf', 1992, 'Adventure', 'Jacques Dorfmann, Pierre Magny, Billy Williams', 'Rudy Wurlitzer, Evan Jones', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Toshirō Mifune, Jennifer Tilly, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Donald Sutherland, Nicholas Campbell, Raoul Max Trujillo, Qalingo Tookalak', 'PG-13', 'In the 1930s, Agaguk lives his traditional Inuit life. But one day, there is a murder in the tribe and Agaguk becomes a suspect. Soon he becomes persecuted by Henderson, a mean mountie, and he must flee through the cold winter of Northern Quebec.', 'In the 1930s, Agaguk lives his traditional Inuit life. But one day, there is a murder in the tribe and Agaguk becomes a suspect. Soon he becomes persecuted by Henderson, a mean mountie, and he must flee through the cold winter of Northern Quebec.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28aMtjD22pq8jSHVTKjv3FNhRut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48918'),
  ('159905818312211847', 'Shadow on the Wall', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Pat Jackson, Ray June', 'William Ludwig', 'Ann Sothern, Zachary Scott, Gigi Perreau, Nancy Reagan, Kristine Miller, John McIntire, Tom Helmore, Helen Brown', 'NR', 'Angered that her sister Celia has stolen her fiance, Dell Faring kills her and allows Celia''s husband David, knocked out in an argument with Celia, to take the blame and end up on death row. Later Dell, finding out that David''s young daughter Susan was witness to the crime and is undergoing psychiatric treatment, plans to eliminate her before her memory returns.', 'Angered that her sister Celia has stolen her fiance, Dell Faring kills her and allows Celia''s husband David, knocked out in an argument with Celia, to take the blame and end up on death row. Later Dell, finding out that David''s young daughter Susan was witness to the crime and is undergoing psychiatric treatment, plans to eliminate her before her memory returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzySAC336zcypJzWjQ7TWi62Ayr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25548'),
  ('1121973755967121365', 'Shadow People', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Matthew Arnold', null, 'Dallas Roberts, Alison Eastwood, Anne Dudek, Mariah Bonner, Mattie Liptak, Christopher Berry, Jonathan Baron, Tony Schiena', 'PG-13', 'A radio talk show host unravels a conspiracy about encounters with mysterious beings known as The Shadow People and their role in the unexplained deaths of several hundred victims in the 1980s.', 'A radio talk show host unravels a conspiracy about encounters with mysterious beings known as The Shadow People and their role in the unexplained deaths of several hundred victims in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1exiURM0lihHWoEEeLrHux5sxEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176570'),
  ('680445751820005086', 'Shadow Puppets', 2007, 'Horror', 'Michael Winnick', 'Michael Winnick', 'James Marsters, Tony Todd, Jolene Blalock, Marc Winnick, Diahnna Nicole Baxter, Natasha Alam, Richard Whiten, Jennie Ford', 'PG-13', 'Director Michael Winnick''s chilling tale stars James Marsters as Jack, one of eight captives who awaken in an abandoned asylum not knowing who they are or why they are together. They discover that they''ve been used in an experiment to erase disturbing memories, but instead, a murderous creature has been unleashed. Reaching out from the shadows, the monster hunts the eight strangers as they race to escape the asylum.', 'Director Michael Winnick''s chilling tale stars James Marsters as Jack, one of eight captives who awaken in an abandoned asylum not knowing who they are or why they are together. They discover that they''ve been used in an experiment to erase disturbing memories, but instead, a murderous creature has been unleashed. Reaching out from the shadows, the monster hunts the eight strangers as they race to escape the asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxuUnZxJsRz6DHlZ1yKByoyeORj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19551'),
  ('635133734466143149', 'Shadow Run', 1998, 'Thriller', 'Geoffrey Reeve', 'Desmond Lowden', 'Michael Caine, James Fox, Christopher Cazenove, Kenneth Colley, Matthew Pochin, Rae Barker, Rupert Frazer, Leslie Grantham', null, 'Haskell is assigned a job by his boss, the aristocratic Landon-Higgins, to highjack a high security van in broad daylight while it''s in the shadow run (out of radio contact with the main security firm). He assembles a team to carry out the heist, but things don''t go according to plan and Haskell begins to think his boss might be double crossing him. Add to this, a teenage boarding school pupil has already witnessed some of the meetings of the team and Haskell''s in real trouble.', 'Haskell is assigned a job by his boss, the aristocratic Landon-Higgins, to highjack a high security van in broad daylight while it''s in the shadow run (out of radio contact with the main security firm). He assembles a team to carry out the heist, but things don''t go according to plan and Haskell begins to think his boss might be double crossing him. Add to this, a teenage boarding school pupil has already witnessed some of the meetings of the team and Haskell''s in real trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXEqyEHp1SAtfEq2XoHWBPN3OHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112767'),
  ('725022023900657413', 'Shadow: Dead Riot', 2006, 'Action, Horror', 'Derek Wan Man-Kit, Derek Wan Man-Kit', 'Michael Gingold, Richard Siegel', 'Tony Todd, Carla Greene, Nina Hodoruk, Michael Quinlan, Cat Miller, Andrea Langi, Tatianna Butler, Erin Brown', null, 'Evil voodoo-practicing serial killer Shadow gets executed for murdering pregnant women. Twenty years later the prison Shadow was put to death at has been turned into an experimental women''s penitentiary. Tough and fiercely autonomous new inmate Solitaire has some kind of link with Shadow. When Shadow and his lethal shambling zombie minions are resurrected, it''s up to Solitaire to stop them.', 'Evil voodoo-practicing serial killer Shadow gets executed for murdering pregnant women. Twenty years later the prison Shadow was put to death at has been turned into an experimental women''s penitentiary. Tough and fiercely autonomous new inmate Solitaire has some kind of link with Shadow. When Shadow and his lethal shambling zombie minions are resurrected, it''s up to Solitaire to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/labFmu8KL7DGIOp9w5n5PNQALtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49359'),
  ('571189232468322139', 'Shadowboxer', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lee Daniels, M. David Mullen', 'Will Rokos', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Helen Mirren, Vanessa Ferlito, Macy Gray, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Stephen Dorff, Mo''Nique, Tom Pasch', 'R', 'Mikey and Rose are professional assassins. They are also lovers, and once upon a time Rose also knew Mikey''s father. During an elaborate hit job for a malicious gangster, Rose fails to kill the main target, the gangster''s pregnant girlfriend. Instead, she delivers her baby and convinces Mikey to help her protect them both. As Rose weakens from cancer, Mikey becomes breadwinner for this unusual family. But tranquility will not last.', 'Mikey and Rose are professional assassins. They are also lovers, and once upon a time Rose also knew Mikey''s father. During an elaborate hit job for a malicious gangster, Rose fails to kill the main target, the gangster''s pregnant girlfriend. Instead, she delivers her baby and convinces Mikey to help her protect them both. As Rose weakens from cancer, Mikey becomes breadwinner for this unusual family. But tranquility will not last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqXOZ5a3q8AAM8jvNaVQC8PAILk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9921'),
  ('249655576267570405', 'Shadowboxing', 2005, 'Action, Drama', 'Alexey Sidorov, Yuriy Rayskiy, Sergey Chuprov', null, 'Andrei Panin, Elena Panova, Denis Nikiforov, Dmitriy Shevchenko, Alexander Kuznetsov, John Amos, Sergei Bezrukov, Ivan Makarevich', null, 'Artem Kolchin was one of many, but he wanted glory. And he has chosen the way: he became the boxer. Now Artem the applicant for a champion title, fighter, known worldwide as Great White Hope. But the main fight in his life has not gone how he expected...', 'Artem Kolchin was one of many, but he wanted glory. And he has chosen the way: he became the boxer. Now Artem the applicant for a champion title, fighter, known worldwide as Great White Hope. But the main fight in his life has not gone how he expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySAn3W1QJ097y0EVq2UzTX76bZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56372'),
