  ('14905284731617402', 'Shadowlands', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Norman Stone, Russ Walker', 'William Nicholson', 'Joss Ackland, Claire Bloom, David Waller, Rupert Baderman, Rhys Hopkins, Alan MacNaughtan, Philip Stone, Tim Preece', null, 'A play based on the friendship between CS Lewis and Joy Gresham.', 'A play based on the friendship between CS Lewis and Joy Gresham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbWOa25R7FMDJRyf5posqGOeFPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239971'),
  ('1048718077958558731', 'Shadowlands', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Attenborough, Roger Pratt, Jim Morahan', 'William Nicholson', 'Anthony Hopkins, Debra Winger, Edward Hardwicke, John Wood, Michael Denison, Peter Firth, Matthew Delamere, Julian Fellowes', 'PG', 'C.S. Lewis, a world-renowned writer and professor, leads a passionless life until he meets spirited poet Joy Gresham.', 'C.S. Lewis, a world-renowned writer and professor, leads a passionless life until he meets spirited poet Joy Gresham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jTWY1M2O4Zhid4rLOpftzazRGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10445'),
  ('318525212278491205', 'Shadowless Sword', 2005, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kim Young-jun', 'Kim Tae-Kwon, Shin Joon-Hee', 'Lee Seo-jin, Yoon So-Yi, Lee Ki-Yong, Shin Hyun-jun, Park Sung-woong, Jung Ho-bin, Jin Bong-jin, Kim Soo-ro', null, '927 AD. The Killer-Blade Army has toppled the ruling dynasty, plunging the kingdom into chaos. The only remaining heir, Prince Jung-Hyun is living in exile, unaware of his family''s dark fate. Still loyal to the dynasty, the beautiful and deadly warrior Soha sets out to find Jung-Hyun and guide him to become the great leader he was born to be. But with the Army''s greatest assassins and the criminal underworld hunting them, Soha and Jung-Hyun are swept into an explosive, non-stop battle of swords, wits and bloodshed as they fight to reclaim the fallen throne.', '927 AD. The Killer-Blade Army has toppled the ruling dynasty, plunging the kingdom into chaos. The only remaining heir, Prince Jung-Hyun is living in exile, unaware of his family''s dark fate. Still loyal to the dynasty, the beautiful and deadly warrior Soha sets out to find Jung-Hyun and guide him to become the great leader he was born to be. But with the Army''s greatest assassins and the criminal underworld hunting them, Soha and Jung-Hyun are swept into an explosive, non-stop battle of swords, wits and bloodshed as they fight to reclaim the fallen throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8zYKidsjUXDjftPWo9DkrV2gcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14763'),
  ('641270046125230712', 'Shadowman', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Georges Franju, Guido Bertoni, Jacques Faber', 'Jacques Champreux', 'Jacques Champreux, Josephine Chaplin, Patrick Préjean, Gert Fröbe, Ugo Pagliai, Enzo Fisichella, Raymond Bussières, Pierre Collet', 'PG', 'Clad in a featureless red mask, The Man Without A Face is involved in a single-minded pursuit of the fabled treasure of the Knights Templar in this tribute to the pulp adventure stories of Louis Feuillade.', 'Clad in a featureless red mask, The Man Without A Face is involved in a single-minded pursuit of the fabled treasure of the Knights Templar in this tribute to the pulp adventure stories of Louis Feuillade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CMPEwqJY8V4WLUZxQWZU7D5fR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4443'),
  ('467430723409647702', 'Shadows', 1922, 'Drama', 'Tom Forman, Harry Perry', 'Eve Unsell, Hope Loring', 'Lon Chaney, Marguerite De La Motte, Harrison Ford, John St. Polis, Walter Long, Buddy Messinger, Priscilla Bonner, Frances Raymond', 'PG', 'Yen Sin, a humble Chinese, is washed ashore after a storm and finds himself an outsider in the deeply Christian fishing community of Urkey. Yen Sin elects to stay, despite his status as a despised ''heathen'', only to reveal hypocrisy amid the self-righteous township.', 'Yen Sin, a humble Chinese, is washed ashore after a storm and finds himself an outsider in the deeply Christian fishing community of Urkey. Yen Sin elects to stay, despite his status as a despised ''heathen'', only to reveal hypocrisy amid the self-righteous township.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avs0TSFmnyUNCjeYP7QAZAi3reM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64860'),
  ('38056542524253479', 'Shadows', 1960, 'Drama', 'John Cassavetes, Erich Kollmar, Al Giglio', 'John Cassavetes', 'Ben Carruthers, Lelia Goldoni, Hugh Hurd, Anthony Ray, Dennis Sallas, Tom Reese, David Pokitillow, Rupert Crosse', 'PG', 'The relationship between Lelia, a light-skinned black woman, and Tony, a white man is put in jeopardy when Tony meets Lelia’s darker-skinned jazz singer brother, Hugh, and discovers that her racial heritage is not what he thought it was.', 'The relationship between Lelia, a light-skinned black woman, and Tony, a white man is put in jeopardy when Tony meets Lelia’s darker-skinned jazz singer brother, Hugh, and discovers that her racial heritage is not what he thought it was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR1gHOGVruoROCdHS7Tc5TSZqED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15484'),
  ('724683720695952401', 'Shadows', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Carlo Lavagna, James Mather', 'Fabio Mollo, Tiziana Triana, Damiano Bruè', 'Saskia Reeves, Lola Petticrew, Mia Threapleton', null, 'Alma and Alex, two adolescent sisters, are survivors of a catastrophic event. They live deep in the woods with their Mother, a strict, over-protective woman who has sheltered them from ominous presences, the Shadows, which live in the daylight and infest the world beyond the river, a border for Alma and Alex. When they follow Mother, out for hunting, Alma and Alex start a series of events which will make them discover the truth about the Shadows and their own reality.', 'Alma and Alex, two adolescent sisters, are survivors of a catastrophic event. They live deep in the woods with their Mother, a strict, over-protective woman who has sheltered them from ominous presences, the Shadows, which live in the daylight and infest the world beyond the river, a border for Alma and Alex. When they follow Mother, out for hunting, Alma and Alex start a series of events which will make them discover the truth about the Shadows and their own reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZUKYzQ6eb2ieIn8E5nmbBDnCoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650597'),
  ('7091605000798733', 'Shadows and Fog', 1991, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Woody Allen, Robert Perdziola, Peter Eastman', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Mia Farrow, John Malkovich, John Cusack, Madonna, Kathy Bates, Jodie Foster, Lily Tomlin', 'PG-13', 'With a serial strangler on the loose, a bookkeeper wanders around town searching for the vigilante group intent on catching the killer.', 'With a serial strangler on the loose, a bookkeeper wanders around town searching for the vigilante group intent on catching the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ybi2u1TSOTpAocZAGJl2WThq11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19200'),
  ('61507319963322576', 'Shadows in an Empty Room', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Joe D''Amato, Alberto De Martino', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Stuart Whitman, John Saxon, Martin Landau, Tisa Farrow, Carole Laure, Jean LeClerc, Gayle Hunnicutt, Peter MacNeill', null, 'After his younger sister is poisoned, a tough Ottawa cop embarks on a violent journey through Montreal to find her killer, which turns into a whirlpool of revenge and betrayal.', 'After his younger sister is poisoned, a tough Ottawa cop embarks on a violent journey through Montreal to find her killer, which turns into a whirlpool of revenge and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kibftFdCPw7mIl8yTjb3jk5XqoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84425'),
  ('3752262502628086', 'Shadows in Paradise', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Pauli Pentti', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Matti Pellonpää, Kati Outinen, Sakari Kuosmanen, Esko Nikkari, Kylli Köngäs, Pekka Laiho, Jukka-Pekka Palo, Svante Korkiakoski', 'NR', 'Nikander, a rubbish collector and would-be entrepreneur, finds his plans for success dashed when his business associate dies. One evening, he meets Ilona, a down-on-her-luck cashier, in a local supermarket. Falteringly, a bond begins to develop between them.', 'Nikander, a rubbish collector and would-be entrepreneur, finds his plans for success dashed when his business associate dies. One evening, he meets Ilona, a down-on-her-luck cashier, in a local supermarket. Falteringly, a bond begins to develop between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj01hspawPof0mJmlgfjuLyJuRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3'),
  ('616508776651809793', 'Shadows in the Palace', 2007, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Mee-jeung, Park Se-moon, Jeong Sang-min', 'Kim Mee-jeung', 'Park Jin-hee, Yoon Se-a, Seo Young-hee, Im Jung-eun, Jeon Hye-jin, Kim Sung-ryung, Kim Nam-jin, Kim Mi-kyeong', null, 'Upon receiving the body of a maid in waiting who was said to have hung herself within the palace walls, dedicated doctor Chun-ryung begins to suspect foul play. Upon launching a personal investigation, however, Chun-ryung quickly discovers a labyrinthine maze of deception constructed by those with limitless power to conceal a valuable secret.', 'Upon receiving the body of a maid in waiting who was said to have hung herself within the palace walls, dedicated doctor Chun-ryung begins to suspect foul play. Upon launching a personal investigation, however, Chun-ryung quickly discovers a labyrinthine maze of deception constructed by those with limitless power to conceal a valuable secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgRvfJjCfPjnu804PVSAYGdBR3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61128'),
  ('953571470992218930', 'Shadows in the Sun', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Brad Mirman, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Brad Mirman', 'Harvey Keitel, Joshua Jackson, Claire Forlani, Armando Pucci, Giancarlo Giannini, John Rhys-Davies, Ken Drury, Stomy Bugsy', 'NR', 'An aspiring young writer tracks a literary titan suffering from writers block to his refuge in rural Italy and learns about life and love from the irascible genius and his daughters.', 'An aspiring young writer tracks a literary titan suffering from writers block to his refuge in rural Italy and learns about life and love from the irascible genius and his daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rAHY4G69iz1hwG6tkeBNupzimz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12547'),
  ('1131620265986178678', 'Shadows of Forgotten Ancestors', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sergei Parajanov, Vladimir Lugovskiy, Yurii Illienko', 'Sergei Parajanov, Ivan Chendej', 'Ivan Mykolaichuk, Larysa Kadochnykova, Tatyana Bestayeva, Mykola Hrynko, Spartak Bagashvili, Leonid Yengibarov, Nina Alisova, Oleksandr Hai', null, 'In the Carpathian Mountains of 19th-century Ukraine, love, hate, life and death among the Hutsul people are as they’ve been since time began. Ivan is drawn to Marichka, the beautiful young daughter of the man who killed his father. But fate tragically decrees that the two lovers will remain apart.', 'In the Carpathian Mountains of 19th-century Ukraine, love, hate, life and death among the Hutsul people are as they’ve been since time began. Ivan is drawn to Marichka, the beautiful young daughter of the man who killed his father. But fate tragically decrees that the two lovers will remain apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oSZTeejmx80tIBVSqYzJpFhjkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26782'),
  ('341256070189664103', 'Shadows of Love', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Calvin Poon Yuen-Leung, Pad Chan Wai-Hung', 'Bing Wu, Calvin Poon Yuen-Leung, Qin Wen', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Cecilia Cheung, Jing Tian, Angela Zhang, Jing Boran, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Cheng Taishen', null, 'Previously known as "Repeat, I Love You", "Shadows of Love" is a modern-day Cinderella romance starring Cecilia Cheung ("Legendary Amazons") and Kwon Sang-woo ("Stairway to Heaven") as a rivals who eventually fall for each other. The film revolves around three interrelated love stories with the one played by Kwon and Cheung as the core. Cheung plays two contrasting roles in the film, one as a refined lady, and the other as a determined young woman with quick temper.', 'Previously known as "Repeat, I Love You", "Shadows of Love" is a modern-day Cinderella romance starring Cecilia Cheung ("Legendary Amazons") and Kwon Sang-woo ("Stairway to Heaven") as a rivals who eventually fall for each other. The film revolves around three interrelated love stories with the one played by Kwon and Cheung as the core. Cheung plays two contrasting roles in the film, one as a refined lady, and the other as a determined young woman with quick temper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym8ZOvl2shwdJIMsIMc61OYslD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136942'),
  ('212731524838553696', 'Shadows on the Stairs', 1941, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Vreeland, D. Ross Lederman, Allen G. Siegler', 'Anthony Coldeway', 'Frieda Inescort, Paul Cavanagh, Heather Angel, Bruce Lester, Miles Mander, Lumsden Hare, Turhan Bey, Charles Irwin', null, 'Occupants of a London boarding house become suspects as a string of murders are discovered.', 'Occupants of a London boarding house become suspects as a string of murders are discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNP63PHuHNnpAAt1bDLc2gwGjIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49786'),
  ('29711159386271808', 'Shadows Over Chinatown', 1946, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Terry O. Morse', 'Raymond L. Schrock', 'Sidney Toler, Mantan Moreland, Victor Sen Yung, Tanis Chandler, John Gallaudet, Paul Bryar, Bruce Kellogg, Al Bridge', 'NR', 'In San Francisco''s Chinatown, Charlie helps two different people search for their missing relatives and uncovers a murder for insurance scheme.', 'In San Francisco''s Chinatown, Charlie helps two different people search for their missing relatives and uncovers a murder for insurance scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trleHQ8ehaM9YSIEDKj1qu8MTFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38469'),
  ('359303059750039468', 'Shadows Run Black', 1984, 'Horror', 'Howard Heard, John Sprung', 'Craig Kusaba, Duke Howard', 'William J. Kulzer, Elizabeth Trosper, Shea Porter, George Engelson, Dianne Hinkler, Kevin Costner, Terry Congie, Barbara Peckinpaugh', null, 'A detective investigates a series of killings committed by a serial killer known as "The Black Angel." He begins to suspect that it might not be just a random group of murders.', 'A detective investigates a series of killings committed by a serial killer known as "The Black Angel." He begins to suspect that it might not be just a random group of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydtDz8UuidYtkvDvI8fPt82RmRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85145'),
  ('546221453175411416', 'Shadows Unseen', 1972, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Camillo Bazzoni, Claudio Ragona', 'Enzo D''Ambrosio, Massimo Felisatti, Fabio Pittorru', 'Frederick Stafford, Marilù Tolo, Franco Fabrizi, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Corrado Gaipa, Claudio Gora, Ninetto Davoli, Judy Winter', null, 'When a journalist is murdered Inspector Micheli begins to investigate. Although someone comes forward to confess to the crime, Micheli doesn''t believe he acted alone and keeps investigating despite coming under pressure to close the case.', 'When a journalist is murdered Inspector Micheli begins to investigate. Although someone comes forward to confess to the crime, Micheli doesn''t believe he acted alone and keeps investigating despite coming under pressure to close the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tp3nb0lFRMY2ppMpyFfDNaqNUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131943'),
  ('628221995883812125', 'Shadowzone', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'J.S. Cardone, Karen Grossman, John E. Vohlers', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Louise Fletcher, David Beecroft, James Hong, Frederick Flynn, Shawn Weatherly, Miguel A. Núñez Jr., Lu Leonard, Maureen Flaherty', 'R', 'After someone is killed in the subterranean project called "Shadowzone," a NASA captain is called in to investigate. In the project, sleeping subjects are induced into a deep EDS state whereby they become portals to a parallel universe. Unfortunately this causes adverse reactions in the subject, and something gets through the portal, the consequence of which is an attrition problem.', 'After someone is killed in the subterranean project called "Shadowzone," a NASA captain is called in to investigate. In the project, sleeping subjects are induced into a deep EDS state whereby they become portals to a parallel universe. Unfortunately this causes adverse reactions in the subject, and something gets through the portal, the consequence of which is an attrition problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cjKHs3zD3vScNvmGfY4i0HyGEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58200'),
  ('471395903021920327', 'Shadrach', 1998, 'Drama', 'Susanna Styron, Hiro Narita', 'Susanna Styron, Bridget Terry', 'Harvey Keitel, Andie MacDowell, Martin Sheen, John Franklin Sawyer, Scott Terra, Ginnie Randall, Darrell Larson, Deborah Hedwall', 'PG-13', 'In 1935, 99-year-old former slave Shadrach asks to be buried on the soil where he was born to slavery, and that land is owned by the large Dabney family, consisting of Vernon, Trixie and their seven children, and to bury a black man on that land is a violation of strict Virginia law.', 'In 1935, 99-year-old former slave Shadrach asks to be buried on the soil where he was born to slavery, and that land is owned by the large Dabney family, consisting of Vernon, Trixie and their seven children, and to bury a black man on that land is a violation of strict Virginia law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXqzSRvIUBBJRVaHXXQSEkGMmdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73351'),
  ('1030111008601770607', 'Shady', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Ryohei Watanabe, Katsuki Tsuji', null, 'mimpi*β, Izumi Okamura, Gota Ishida, Hiroki Horikawa, Juzo Kakei, Isao Nakazawa, Ayumi Seko', null, 'Because of her last name "Kumada" (bear + rice paddy) and her appearance, Misa''s high school classmates call her "Pooh" disparagingly. She obviously has no friends and can only let down her guard around her pet parrot and the goldfish in the science room at school. But, then she finds herself quickly becoming best friends with Izumi who is a cute and popular classmates. Although somewhat puzzled by Izumi''s interest in her, Misa is excited about having a friend for the first time ever. But, Izumi''s initial angelic demeanor gradually transforms into a demonic one.', 'Because of her last name "Kumada" (bear + rice paddy) and her appearance, Misa''s high school classmates call her "Pooh" disparagingly. She obviously has no friends and can only let down her guard around her pet parrot and the goldfish in the science room at school. But, then she finds herself quickly becoming best friends with Izumi who is a cute and popular classmates. Although somewhat puzzled by Izumi''s interest in her, Misa is excited about having a friend for the first time ever. But, Izumi''s initial angelic demeanor gradually transforms into a demonic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYSiwH2EKrlqv9Wl4HfklrMnyDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152640'),
  ('850655153772322783', 'Shaft', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Urs Furrer, Gordon Parks', 'Ernest Tidyman, John D.F. Black', 'Richard Roundtree, Moses Gunn, Charles Cioffi, Christopher St. John, Gwenn Mitchell, Lawrence Pressman, Victor Arnold, Sherri Brewer', 'R', 'Cool Black private eye John Shaft is hired by a crime lord to find and retrieve his kidnapped daughter.', 'Cool Black private eye John Shaft is hired by a crime lord to find and retrieve his kidnapped daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJChPuu2V339IiDPQDHeIh1SYpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482'),
  ('381486789996651837', 'Shaft', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'John Singleton, Donald E. Thorin, Julie A. Bloom', 'Shane Salerno, John Singleton, Richard Price', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Vanessa Williams, Jeffrey Wright, Christian Bale, Busta Rhymes, Dan Hedaya, Toni Collette, Richard Roundtree', 'R', 'New York police detective John Shaft arrests Walter Wade Jr. for a racially motivated slaying. But the only eyewitness disappears, and Wade jumps bail for Switzerland. Two years later Wade returns to face trial, confident his money and influence will get him acquitted -- especially since he''s paid a drug kingpin to kill the witness.', 'New York police detective John Shaft arrests Walter Wade Jr. for a racially motivated slaying. But the only eyewitness disappears, and Wade jumps bail for Switzerland. Two years later Wade returns to face trial, confident his money and influence will get him acquitted -- especially since he''s paid a drug kingpin to kill the witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ncvnNPaN73cOqD4muE413sSOyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479'),
  ('330813323419076023', 'Shaft', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Mystery', 'Tim Story, Philip Banks, Greg Guzik', 'Kenya Barris, Alex Barnow', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Jessie T. Usher, Regina Hall, Alexandra Shipp, Richard Roundtree, Jordan Preston Carter, Nyah Marie Johnson, Matt Lauria', 'R', 'JJ, aka John Shaft Jr., may be a cyber security expert with a degree from MIT, but to uncover the truth behind his best friend’s untimely death, he needs an education only his dad can provide. Absent throughout JJ’s youth, the legendary locked-and-loaded John Shaft agrees to help his progeny navigate Harlem’s heroin-infested underbelly.', 'JJ, aka John Shaft Jr., may be a cyber security expert with a degree from MIT, but to uncover the truth behind his best friend’s untimely death, he needs an education only his dad can provide. Absent throughout JJ’s youth, the legendary locked-and-loaded John Shaft agrees to help his progeny navigate Harlem’s heroin-infested underbelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joNpwk3wQXpiv6d2bPemjWj3CBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486131'),
  ('1021111206322456741', 'Shaft in Africa', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Marcel Grignon, John Guillermin, David Tomblin', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Richard Roundtree, Frank Finlay, Vonetta McGee, Neda Arnerić, Debebe Eshetu, Spiros Focás, Jacques Herlin, Jho Jhenkins', 'R', 'Detective John Shaft travels incognito to Ethiopia, then France, to bust a human trafficking ring.', 'Detective John Shaft travels incognito to Ethiopia, then France, to bust a human trafficking ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6yYpJBuRd1j5kldYd9vjbv9xfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494'),
  ('1023347674198266161', 'Shaft''s Big Score!', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Urs Furrer, Gordon Parks, William C. Gerrity', 'Ernest Tidyman', 'Richard Roundtree, Moses Gunn, Drew Bundini Brown, Joseph Mascolo, Kathy Imrie, Wally Taylor, Julius Harris, Rosalind Miles', 'R', 'John Shaft is back as the lady-loved black detective cop on the search for the murderer of a client.', 'John Shaft is back as the lady-loved black detective cop on the search for the murderer of a client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iNj96mEU66sRi1aCRDzglDUaGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493'),
  ('192772626249213660', 'Shag', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Zelda Barron, Gregory Jacobs, Katarina Wittich', 'Terry Sweeney, Lanier Laney, Robin Swicord', 'Phoebe Cates, Scott Coffey, Bridget Fonda, Annabeth Gish, Page Hannah, Robert Rusler, Tyrone Power Jr., Jeff Yagher', 'PG', 'Summer of 1963. Carson is getting married to her boyfriend so her friends Melaina, Pudge and Luanne take her to Myrtle Beach for one last irresponsible weekend.', 'Summer of 1963. Carson is getting married to her boyfriend so her friends Melaina, Pudge and Luanne take her to Myrtle Beach for one last irresponsible weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIxA8FkPBk0wJLkF4znqBdWD8HX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38043'),
  ('471860692451264579', 'Shagird', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia, Yogesh Jani', 'Tigmanshu Dhulia', 'Nana Patekar, Mohit Ahlawat, Rimi Sen, Zakir Hussain, Anurag Kashyap, Kishori Shahane, Rajendra Sethi, Rajiv Gupta', null, 'Hanumant Singh is the quirky cop in the police department. He is a man of action who delivers most of the time but he has unusual ways to accomplish his mission. More importantly, he doesn''t think twice before hobnobbing with corrupt politicians and gangsters and taking bribes for services rendered. Trouble begins when a new and seemingly honest recruit joins his team.', 'Hanumant Singh is the quirky cop in the police department. He is a man of action who delivers most of the time but he has unusual ways to accomplish his mission. More importantly, he doesn''t think twice before hobnobbing with corrupt politicians and gangsters and taking bribes for services rendered. Trouble begins when a new and seemingly honest recruit joins his team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7RiRBHpFBJp2AVSBWYrdXgYxrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64881'),
  ('715691436910562005', 'Shahenshah', 1988, 'Action', 'Tinnu Anand', 'Inder Raj Anand', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Meenakshi Sheshadri, Aruna Irani, Rohini Hattangadi, Supriya Pathak, Jagdeep, Vijayendra Ghatge, Avtar Gill', null, 'Inspector Srivastav is framed by a wily and cunning gangster, J.K., and unable to prove his innocence, hangs himself, leaving behind his wife, and son, Vijay. Years later, Vijay has grown up and has joined the police force as an Inspector. Unlike his dad, he is corrupt and does accept bribes to turn a nelson''s eye to crime. The City Police are assigned the task of apprehending a customed man called "Shahenshah", who operates at night and targets, tries and kills gangsters in a "Judge and Executioner "style. No one knows the real identity of Shahenshah, as he is feared by the police department, and respected by the poor and middle-class.', 'Inspector Srivastav is framed by a wily and cunning gangster, J.K., and unable to prove his innocence, hangs himself, leaving behind his wife, and son, Vijay. Years later, Vijay has grown up and has joined the police force as an Inspector. Unlike his dad, he is corrupt and does accept bribes to turn a nelson''s eye to crime. The City Police are assigned the task of apprehending a customed man called "Shahenshah", who operates at night and targets, tries and kills gangsters in a "Judge and Executioner "style. No one knows the real identity of Shahenshah, as he is feared by the police department, and respected by the poor and middle-class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZUpj73MzEh2YwVzJNVUqBSu2LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62201'),
  ('493878198621389987', 'Shahid', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hansal Mehta, Anuj Dhawan', 'Sameer Gautam Singh', 'Rajkummar Rao, Kay Kay Menon, Tigmanshu Dhulia, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Vipin Sharma, Prabhleen Sandhu, Baljinder Kaur, Prabal Panjabi', null, 'A story based on real-life human-rights and criminal lawyer, Shahid Azmi, who was slain while defending the wrongly accused by the law in terrorist activities.', 'A story based on real-life human-rights and criminal lawyer, Shahid Azmi, who was slain while defending the wrongly accused by the law in terrorist activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AO8ciYnqjg9YavpR01n9sobE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128206'),
  ('433258990580026987', 'Shaitaan', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Vikas Bahl, Sudhakar Reddy Yakkanti, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Aamil Keyan Khan', 'Ajay Devgn, R. Madhavan, Janki Bodiwala, Jyothika, Anngad Raaj', null, 'Kabir and his family''s fun weekend retreat takes terrifying turn when an intruder takes over the control of the body of his teenage daughter, putting her at the mercy of his increasingly sinister orders.', 'Kabir and his family''s fun weekend retreat takes terrifying turn when an intruder takes over the control of the body of his teenage daughter, putting her at the mercy of his increasingly sinister orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRvFzcagAcC6Q317xtV7QXzwBnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187619'),
  ('122599635971430038', 'Shaitan', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bejoy Nambiar, Bharat Jha, R. Madhi', 'Megha Ramaswamy, Bejoy Nambiar', 'Rajeev Khandelwal, Kalki Koechlin, Shiv Panditt, Neil Bhoopalam, Gulshan Devaiah, Kirti Kulhari, Rajit Kapoor, Rajat Barmecha', null, 'Five substance-abusing friends decide to fake a kidnapping in order to bribe a police constable for covering-up a hit-and-run accident.', 'Five substance-abusing friends decide to fake a kidnapping in order to bribe a police constable for covering-up a hit-and-run accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4X9wr1tnwPY0MPlf3MHtJBggdlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69785'),
  ('733755790058362761', 'Shake Before Use', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Manuel Rojas', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Andrés Pajares, Fernando Esteso, Antonio Ozores, Juanito Navarro, Jenny Llada, Beatriz Escudero, Adrián Ortega, Nadine Rochex', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTu4oMJ4mHlrQstFpsqgFG3Dbd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28141'),
  ('90687290151127124', 'Shake Hands with Danger', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Herk Harvey, Bob Rose', 'John Clifford', 'Cliff Bemis, Charles Oldfather, David Early', null, 'This short cautionary training film examines dangers associated with earthmoving equipment operation, showing many simulated accidents on construction sites.', 'This short cautionary training film examines dangers associated with earthmoving equipment operation, showing many simulated accidents on construction sites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggzEblPSYqODQvapAsDSBeVETJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270521'),
  ('49124531603707410', 'Shake Hands with the Devil', 1959, 'Action, Drama, War, History', 'Michael Anderson, Erwin Hillier', 'Ben Roberts, Ivan Goff', 'James Cagney, Don Murray, Dana Wynter, Glynis Johns, Michael Redgrave, Sybil Thorndike, Cyril Cusack, Marianne Benet', 'NR', 'In 1921 Dublin, the IRA battles the "Black & Tans," special British forces given to harsh measures. Irish-American medical student Kerry O''Shea hopes to stay aloof, but saving a wounded friend gets him outlawed, and inexorably drawn into the rebel organization by his former professor Sean Lenihan, who has "shaken hands with the devil" and begun to think of fighting as an end in itself. Complications arise when Kerry falls for a beautiful English hostage, and the British offer a peace treaty that is not enough to satisfy Lenihan.', 'In 1921 Dublin, the IRA battles the "Black & Tans," special British forces given to harsh measures. Irish-American medical student Kerry O''Shea hopes to stay aloof, but saving a wounded friend gets him outlawed, and inexorably drawn into the rebel organization by his former professor Sean Lenihan, who has "shaken hands with the devil" and begun to think of fighting as an end in itself. Complications arise when Kerry falls for a beautiful English hostage, and the British offer a peace treaty that is not enough to satisfy Lenihan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jN4KfZK0XX8q58PeRp4XQP4Cv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51947'),
  ('477354242748845016', 'Shake Hands with the Devil', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Mirosław Baszak', 'Michael Donovan', 'Roy Dupuis, Owen Sejake, James Gallanders, Michel Ange Nzojibwami, Michel Mongeau, Robert Lalonde, John Sibi-Okumu, John Matshikiza', null, 'In 1993, Canadian Lieutenant General Roméo Dallaire was sent by the United Nations to Rwanda as commander of the United Nations Assistance Mission for Rwanda (UNAMIR). Its mission, to ensure the ceasefire, is underfunded, excessively bureaucratized and made up of military units which come from dozens of countries and which each have a very different program... These are Lt Gen Dallaire''s efforts to stop the madness of the Rwandan Genocide, despite the complete indifference of his superiors.', 'In 1993, Canadian Lieutenant General Roméo Dallaire was sent by the United Nations to Rwanda as commander of the United Nations Assistance Mission for Rwanda (UNAMIR). Its mission, to ensure the ceasefire, is underfunded, excessively bureaucratized and made up of military units which come from dozens of countries and which each have a very different program... These are Lt Gen Dallaire''s efforts to stop the madness of the Rwandan Genocide, despite the complete indifference of his superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PUO6gBb2w1GIjEvX3nWnvhTXfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30527'),
  ('31133380080558493', 'Shake It All About', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hella Joof, Eric Kress', 'Hella Joof, Klaus Bondam', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Troels Lyby, Charlotte Munck, Jesper Lohmann, Oscar Walsøe Busch, Peter Frödin, Nikolaj Steen, Ditte Gråbøl', null, 'Jacob is a young man used to getting everything he wants. For several years, he has been living in a happy homosexual partnership with Jørgen, and one night Jacob decides to pop the big question to Jørgen. Jørgen happily accepts Jacobs marriage proposal, but then something happens: Jacob falls in love with a girl, and not just any girl. The girl is Caroline, married to Jørgens younger brother Tom.', 'Jacob is a young man used to getting everything he wants. For several years, he has been living in a happy homosexual partnership with Jørgen, and one night Jacob decides to pop the big question to Jørgen. Jørgen happily accepts Jacobs marriage proposal, but then something happens: Jacob falls in love with a girl, and not just any girl. The girl is Caroline, married to Jørgens younger brother Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKMnFxvNWGgb6VDTXGMkf9Ip2yR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14893'),
  ('1006671517342824442', 'Shake, Rattle and Rock!', 1994, 'Drama, Music, TV Movie', 'Allan Arkush, Jean de Segonzac', 'Trish Soodik', 'Renée Zellweger, Jenifer Lewis, Max Perlich, John Doe, Patricia Childress, Latanyia Baldwin, Necia Bray, Josina Elder', 'PG-13', 'In 1950s America, teenage rebellion comes easy when something like rock ''n'' roll is viewed as sinful. Looking to have a good time while they''re young, small-town teens Susan, Cookie and Tony start a nightclub where host Danny Klay introduces the newest rock ''n'' roll talent, and everyone can dance the night away. Of course, not everyone in town is happy with the new establishment.', 'In 1950s America, teenage rebellion comes easy when something like rock ''n'' roll is viewed as sinful. Looking to have a good time while they''re young, small-town teens Susan, Cookie and Tony start a nightclub where host Danny Klay introduces the newest rock ''n'' roll talent, and everyone can dance the night away. Of course, not everyone in town is happy with the new establishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mebjjlkx166DqUdF2Lt0STiDOUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107814'),
  ('218825596992230326', 'Shake! Otis at Monterey', 1987, 'Documentary, Music', 'D. A. Pennebaker, Bob Neuwirth, Chris Hegedus', null, 'Otis Redding, Steve Cropper, Donald ''Duck'' Dunn, Al Jackson Jr., Booker T. Jones, Tom Smothers, Wayne Jackson, Andrew Love', null, 'Renowned documentary filmmaker D.A. Pennebaker captures Otis Redding in his ascendancy, singing at the historic Monterey International Pop Festival in June 1967. Comedian Tom Smothers introduces Redding to a crowd that is leaving -- until Redding grabs them with his charged rendition of "Shake." Redding''s performance also includes "Respect" (which he wrote), "I''ve Been Loving You Too Long," "Satisfaction," and "Try a Little Tenderness." Tragically, Redding died in a plane crash six months later. An innovative filmmaker who started in the 1950s making experimental films, Pennebaker garnered an Oscar nomination for Best Documentary Feature in 1993 for The War Room, his behind-the-scenes look at Bill Clinton''s 1992 campaign. His other subjects have included Norman Mailer, Bob Dylan, and David Bowie.', 'Renowned documentary filmmaker D.A. Pennebaker captures Otis Redding in his ascendancy, singing at the historic Monterey International Pop Festival in June 1967. Comedian Tom Smothers introduces Redding to a crowd that is leaving -- until Redding grabs them with his charged rendition of "Shake." Redding''s performance also includes "Respect" (which he wrote), "I''ve Been Loving You Too Long," "Satisfaction," and "Try a Little Tenderness." Tragically, Redding died in a plane crash six months later. An innovative filmmaker who started in the 1950s making experimental films, Pennebaker garnered an Oscar nomination for Best Documentary Feature in 1993 for The War Room, his behind-the-scenes look at Bill Clinton''s 1992 campaign. His other subjects have included Norman Mailer, Bob Dylan, and David Bowie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyd0OdBxYK3m3DFf5xtBowd7Oe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61708'),
  ('136014350446095771', 'Shakedown', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Pevney, Irving Glassberg, George Lollier', 'Martin Goldsmith, Alfred Lewis Levitt', 'Howard Duff, Brian Donlevy, Peggy Dow, Lawrence Tierney, Bruce Bennett, Anne Vernon, Jack Reitzen, Peter Virgo', 'NR', 'Jack Early is a photographer who will stop at nothing to climb his way to the very top of the success ladder. On the strength of his sheer tenacity, he gets a job with a major newspaper, and it''s not long before he''s made a name for himself by charming a notorious crime boss, Nick Palmer, into allowing himself to be photographed. Palmer takes him under his wing, but Early decides to bite the hand that feeds him and sets Palmer and another crime boss, Colton, against one another.', 'Jack Early is a photographer who will stop at nothing to climb his way to the very top of the success ladder. On the strength of his sheer tenacity, he gets a job with a major newspaper, and it''s not long before he''s made a name for himself by charming a notorious crime boss, Nick Palmer, into allowing himself to be photographed. Palmer takes him under his wing, but Early decides to bite the hand that feeds him and sets Palmer and another crime boss, Colton, against one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA7Zkr2JoKO1aj9NEBHn423djky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73369'),
  ('617165624353651374', 'Shakedown', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'James Glickenhaus, Michael Schroeder, Joel Segal', 'James Glickenhaus, James Borrelli', 'Peter Weller, Sam Elliott, Patricia Charbonneau, Antonio Fargas, Blanche Baker, John C. McGinley, Richard Brooks, Jude Ciccolella', 'R', 'When a local drug dealer shoots a dishonest cop in self-defense, lawyer and renegade undercover cop join forces to clear him. But when their investigation leads them into a maze of greed and corruption, they learn that in a town where everything is for sale, anything can happen.', 'When a local drug dealer shoots a dishonest cop in self-defense, lawyer and renegade undercover cop join forces to clear him. But when their investigation leads them into a maze of greed and corruption, they learn that in a town where everything is for sale, anything can happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj0bTImQPWkBBD3Kh2ArqAqEnv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38558'),
  ('480292973768747597', 'Shakes the Clown', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Bobby Bukowski, Elliot Davis', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Julie Brown, Adam Sandler, Blake Clark, Tom Kenny, Paul Dooley, Kathy Griffin, Robin Williams', 'R', 'Shakes plods about his duties as party clown, and uses all of his free time getting seriously drunk. Binky, another clown, wins the spot on a local kiddie show, which depresses Shakes even more, and his boss threatens him with unemployment if he can''t get his act under control.', 'Shakes plods about his duties as party clown, and uses all of his free time getting seriously drunk. Binky, another clown, wins the spot on a local kiddie show, which depresses Shakes even more, and his boss threatens him with unemployment if he can''t get his act under control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfTWQ7GfH462FVmYEGQB1oHR6H4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26291'),
  ('1107175809111989070', 'Shakespeare in Love', 1998, 'Romance, History, Comedy', 'Richard Greatrex, John Madden', 'Marc Norman, Tom Stoppard', 'Joseph Fiennes, Gwyneth Paltrow, Geoffrey Rush, Tom Wilkinson, Judi Dench, Imelda Staunton, Colin Firth, Ben Affleck', 'R', 'Young William Shakespeare is forced to stage his latest comedy, ''Romeo and Ethel, the Pirate''s Daughter'', before it''s even written. When lovely noblewoman Viola de Lesseps auditions for a role, they fall into forbidden love — and Shakespeare''s play finds a new life (and title). As their relationship intensifies, the comedy soon transforms into tragedy.', 'Young William Shakespeare is forced to stage his latest comedy, ''Romeo and Ethel, the Pirate''s Daughter'', before it''s even written. When lovely noblewoman Viola de Lesseps auditions for a role, they fall into forbidden love — and Shakespeare''s play finds a new life (and title). As their relationship intensifies, the comedy soon transforms into tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdW7jdzPi4J9KZR3TyY2jn3Xh5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1934'),
  ('1048150949301631721', 'Shakespeare-Wallah', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Subrata Mitra', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala, James Ivory', 'Shashi Kapoor, Felicity Kendal, Geoffrey Kendal, Laura Liddell, Madhur Jaffrey, Utpal Dutt, Praveen Paul, Prayag Raj', null, 'The story of a family troupe of English actors who travel around the towns and villages in India giving performances of Shakespearean plays. Through their travels we see the changing face of India as the old is replaced by the new, Maharajas become hotel owners, sports become more important than culture and the theater is replaced by Bollywood movies. Based on the travels of Geoffrey Kendal with his daughter Felicity Kendal.', 'The story of a family troupe of English actors who travel around the towns and villages in India giving performances of Shakespearean plays. Through their travels we see the changing face of India as the old is replaced by the new, Maharajas become hotel owners, sports become more important than culture and the theater is replaced by Bollywood movies. Based on the travels of Geoffrey Kendal with his daughter Felicity Kendal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irtkkojpoWhIkdA1VCC7r08LzwX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109600'),
  ('130799722276767559', 'Shakma', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hugh Parks, Andrew Bieber, Tom Logan', 'Roger Engle', 'Christopher Atkins, Amanda Wyss, Ari Meyers, Roddy McDowall, Robb Edward Morris, Tre Laughlin, Greg Flowers, Ann Kymberlie', 'R', 'A murderous baboon escapes from a laboratory and roams the research building, and begins to kill some teenagers who are also in the building playing a Dungeons-and-Dragons type game.', 'A murderous baboon escapes from a laboratory and roams the research building, and begins to kill some teenagers who are also in the building playing a Dungeons-and-Dragons type game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVrOi48ZJGmUPGYtFGnQtqgFSzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36992'),
  ('531394159113501169', 'Shakti', 1982, 'Action, Crime', 'Ramesh Sippy', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Dilip Kumar, Amitabh Bachchan, Rakhee Gulzar, Smita Patil, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Amrish Puri, Vikas Anand, Goga Kapoor', null, 'A policeman''s son becomes a criminal after a childhood incident creates a rift between them.', 'A policeman''s son becomes a criminal after a childhood incident creates a rift between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gz21c2XNYIOWty9JaFMc3h825E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159487'),
  ('994104623551660442', 'Shakti', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Guillermina Pico, Clara Miani, Ana Laura Viciconti', 'Martín Rejtman', 'Ignacio Solomonese, Laura Visconti, Valentina Posleman, Pablo Moseinco, Patricio Penna, Emma Rivera, Miel Bargman, Alejandra Flechner', null, 'Federico, in his mid-20s, lives alone in Buenos Aires. The day his grandmother dies, he decides to part with his girlfriend. He fears hurting her. However, she is laid-back, feisty and not even close to feeling hurt. He begins obsessing over her unexpected reaction—but then he meets someone else.', 'Federico, in his mid-20s, lives alone in Buenos Aires. The day his grandmother dies, he decides to part with his girlfriend. He fears hurting her. However, she is laid-back, feisty and not even close to feeling hurt. He begins obsessing over her unexpected reaction—but then he meets someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB9vFBXhd4X1jOeJ6U7h3mIXH5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594258'),
  ('394296072704507782', 'Shakti: The Power', 2002, 'Action, Drama', 'Pasupuleti Krishna Vamsi, Kumar Nagendra, Vasu Oleti', 'Pasupuleti Krishna Vamsi', 'Karisma Kapoor, Nana Patekar, Sanjay Kapoor, Shah Rukh Khan, Deepti Naval, Tara Deshpande, Ritu Shivpuri, Prakash Raj', null, 'A couple visits the husband''s family in India and finds itself in the middle of a fratricidal battle.', 'A couple visits the husband''s family in India and finds itself in the middle of a fratricidal battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nn3XFCa0FreqSG7GfDK5bDUH12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161179'),
  ('152572412302597344', 'Shakugan no Shana: The Movie', 2007, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Takashi Watanabe, Jin Aketagawa, Takashi Ikehata', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Satoshi Hino, Ayako Kawasumi, Junichi Suwabe, Mitsuo Iwata, Tomo Sakurai, Kimiko Koyama, Hirofumi Nojima, Rie Kugimiya', 'PG-13', 'The movie is more or less a retelling of the first few episodes of the series that is not much more than a slightly padded director''s cut. You do learn some interesting details such as where Yugi''s dad is, a look at the flame haze who was in the city before Shana, and even a couple of new powers for the Reiji Maigo. The story is certainly fleshed out quite a bit more and the final 15 minutes of the film comprise a surprisingly powerful conclusion (worth the price of admission on its own), but I would have liked a more original story rather then a highly polished version of one that I''ve already enjoyed. In the end, spectacular visuals, great new music, and well thought out additions to the core story leave you feeling glad to have seen the film. On the other hand, the fact that anything new that was added obviously doesn''t change the events that come later in the series means that established fans will likely leave the experience less than satisfied.', 'The movie is more or less a retelling of the first few episodes of the series that is not much more than a slightly padded director''s cut. You do learn some interesting details such as where Yugi''s dad is, a look at the flame haze who was in the city before Shana, and even a couple of new powers for the Reiji Maigo. The story is certainly fleshed out quite a bit more and the final 15 minutes of the film comprise a surprisingly powerful conclusion (worth the price of admission on its own), but I would have liked a more original story rather then a highly polished version of one that I''ve already enjoyed. In the end, spectacular visuals, great new music, and well thought out additions to the core story leave you feeling glad to have seen the film. On the other hand, the fact that anything new that was added obviously doesn''t change the events that come later in the series means that established fans will likely leave the experience less than satisfied.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMRs3Km9gcjVWt9WCujO5E3FPUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68263'),
  ('68228470639771368', 'Shakuntala Devi', 2020, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Anu Menon, Keiko Nakahara', 'Anu Menon, Nayanika Mahtani', 'Vidya Balan, Sanya Malhotra, Jisshu Sengupta, Amit Sadh, Luca Calvani, Sheeba Chaddha, Prakash Belawadi, Ipshita Chakraborty Singh', null, 'Based on the life of Shakuntala Devi who is a well-known mathematical genius and calculating progidy from India. She has been nicknamed ''Human Computer'' because of her extraordinary talent and skill in solving complex mathematical problems without any mechanical aid.', 'Based on the life of Shakuntala Devi who is a well-known mathematical genius and calculating progidy from India. She has been nicknamed ''Human Computer'' because of her extraordinary talent and skill in solving complex mathematical problems without any mechanical aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KBmoMHfdrjednxWAvkh7ARhrRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679045'),
  ('595172975613877832', 'Shalako', 1968, 'Western', 'Ted Moore, Edward Dmytryk', 'Hal Hopper, James Griffith, Scot Finch', 'Sean Connery, Brigitte Bardot, Jack Hawkins, Stephen Boyd, Peter van Eyck, Honor Blackman, Woody Strode, Alexander Knox', null, 'Sean Connery is Shalako, a guide in the old West who has to rescue an aristocratic British hunting party from Indians and bandits.', 'Sean Connery is Shalako, a guide in the old West who has to rescue an aristocratic British hunting party from Indians and bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywxINymAsSGAJmPvDqMkdFY3PNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39209'),
  ('1061092232208432410', 'Shall We Dance', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, David Abel, Nathaniel Shilkret', 'Allan Scott, Ernest Pagano', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Edward Everett Horton, Eric Blore, Jerome Cowan, Ketti Gallian, William Brisbane, Ann Shoemaker', 'NR', 'Ballet star Petrov arranges to cross the Atlantic aboard the same ship as the dancer and musical star he''s fallen for but barely knows. By the time the ocean liner reaches New York, a little white lie has churned through the rumour mill and turned into a hot gossip item—that the two celebrities are secretly married.', 'Ballet star Petrov arranges to cross the Atlantic aboard the same ship as the dancer and musical star he''s fallen for but barely knows. By the time the ocean liner reaches New York, a little white lie has churned through the rumour mill and turned into a hot gossip item—that the two celebrities are secretly married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6anwn2NxTw7NwVEEU4qhVwN3Exi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31530'),
  ('1050247628876916818', 'Shall We Dance?', 1996, 'Music, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Masayuki Suō, Naoki Kayano', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Koji Yakusho, Tamiyo Kusakari, Naoto Takenaka, Eri Watanabe, Akira Emoto, Yuu Tokui, Hiromasa Taguchi, Reiko Kusamura', 'PG', 'A bored accountant spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.', 'A bored accountant spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCpqoo4phrDQSaLs9ToJnAqPG83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11239'),
  ('405116730554901046', 'Shall We Dance?', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Peter Chelsom, John de Borman, Martin Walters', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Richard Gere, Jennifer Lopez, Susan Sarandon, Stanley Tucci, Lisa Ann Walter, Anita Gillette, Bobby Cannavale, Omar Benson Miller', 'PG-13', 'A bored estate lawyer spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.', 'A bored estate lawyer spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGIyiQv08Gw1HO5BV1yrwCWtGHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4380'),
  ('102699949918548488', 'Shall We Go to Your or My Place or Each Go Home Alone?', 1973, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Lasse Hallström, Lasse Hallström', 'Lasse Hallström', 'Stig Engström, Anita Ekström, Göran Stangertz, Lena Lindgren, Claire Wikholm, Christer ''Bonzo'' Jonsson, Marvin Yxner, Wiveka Alexandersson', null, 'Arne, Calle, and Gunnar are friends, probably in their twenties. One telephones the others, and they decide to visit a nightclub. They hope to meet women and have sex. After they arrive at the club, each man meets with a certain degree of success or failure. Calle particularly is frustrated, for no woman agrees to dance with him. Meanwhile, Arne and Gunnar are busily conversing with women. Eventually the friends all leave with lady friends in tow, and spend the night in various apartments. In the morning, the couples depart differently. One couple has bonded amicably, another tenuously, and the third not at all. The next day, the men reconnect, and decide to try their luck again. Written by veloc', 'Arne, Calle, and Gunnar are friends, probably in their twenties. One telephones the others, and they decide to visit a nightclub. They hope to meet women and have sex. After they arrive at the club, each man meets with a certain degree of success or failure. Calle particularly is frustrated, for no woman agrees to dance with him. Meanwhile, Arne and Gunnar are busily conversing with women. Eventually the friends all leave with lady friends in tow, and spend the night in various apartments. In the morning, the couples depart differently. One couple has bonded amicably, another tenuously, and the third not at all. The next day, the men reconnect, and decide to try their luck again. Written by veloc', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB0G4p1mshXBeTci9HWdEU1x1AM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110347'),
  ('179142484993105787', 'Shall We Kiss?', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Laurent Desmet, Emmanuel Mouret, Pierrick Vautier', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Emmanuel Mouret, Julie Gayet, Michaël Cohen, Stefano Accorsi, Frédérique Bel, Mélanie Maudran, Marie Madinier', null, 'When Gabriel and Emilie meet by chance, he offers her a ride, and they spend the evening talking, laughing and getting along famously. At the end of the night, Emilie declines Gabriel''s offer of "a kiss without consequences". Emilie admonishes him that the kiss could have unexpected consequences, and tells him a story, unfolding in flashbacks, about the impossibility of indulging your desires without affecting someone else''s life.', 'When Gabriel and Emilie meet by chance, he offers her a ride, and they spend the evening talking, laughing and getting along famously. At the end of the night, Emilie declines Gabriel''s offer of "a kiss without consequences". Emilie admonishes him that the kiss could have unexpected consequences, and tells him a story, unfolding in flashbacks, about the impossibility of indulging your desires without affecting someone else''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LviJDLStrDRtHtfdA8jlqlRgla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10541'),
  ('858790544954531177', 'Shallow Grave', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Styles, Corky Irick, Orson Ochoa', 'George Edward Fernandez', 'Tony March, Lisa Stahl, Tom Law, Carol Cadby, Donna Baltron, Just Kelly, Vincent Tumeo, Gregg Todd Davis', 'R', 'When four young college girls stumble upon a murder, they find themselves targeted by a killer who will stop at nothing to silence them.', 'When four young college girls stumble upon a murder, they find themselves targeted by a killer who will stop at nothing to silence them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IdrAxax97Yrlnm8gJjHtWL73LY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85159'),
  ('212187224576304860', 'Shallow Grave', 1994, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Brian Tufano, Danny Boyle, Tracey Gallacher', 'John Hodge', 'Ewan McGregor, Christopher Eccleston, Kerry Fox, Ken Stott, Keith Allen, Colin McCredie, Peter Mullan, Gary Lewis', 'R', 'When David, Juliet, and Alex find their new roommate dead with a large sum of money, they agree to hide the body and keep the cash. However, this newfound fortune gradually corrodes their friendship.', 'When David, Juliet, and Alex find their new roommate dead with a large sum of money, they agree to hide the body and keep the cash. However, this newfound fortune gradually corrodes their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqvSKLbfIg1mja1ulVkVcLhdwWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9905'),
  ('587675905831670054', 'Shallow Ground', 2005, 'Horror', 'Sheldon Wilson, John P. Tarver', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Timothy V. Murphy, Lindsey Stoddart, Rocky Marquette, Stan Kirsch, Patty McCormack, Natalie Avital, Tara Killian, Myron Natwick', 'R', 'A naked teenage boy covered in blood appears at a remote sheriff''s station one year after the brutal unsolved murder of a local girl. Now Sheriff Jack Shepherd, guilt ridden over the girl''s murder, must confront his own demons as he desperately searches for the boy''s true identity and possible victims. Little does Jack realize that he has started down a path that will bring him face to face with an unthinkable horror. Before sunrise the living will pay for the pain the dead have suffered.', 'A naked teenage boy covered in blood appears at a remote sheriff''s station one year after the brutal unsolved murder of a local girl. Now Sheriff Jack Shepherd, guilt ridden over the girl''s murder, must confront his own demons as he desperately searches for the boy''s true identity and possible victims. Little does Jack realize that he has started down a path that will bring him face to face with an unthinkable horror. Before sunrise the living will pay for the pain the dead have suffered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78kkO758SsSKotEripSPDW4eULL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24702'),
  ('206396849413872298', 'Shallow Hal', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly, Russell Carpenter', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, Sean Moynihan', 'Jack Black, Gwyneth Paltrow, Jason Alexander, Joe Viterelli, Rene Kirby, Bruce McGill, Tony Robbins, Susan Ward', 'PG-13', 'After taking his dying father''s advice, Hal dates only the embodiments of female physical perfection. But that all changes after Hal has an unexpected run-in with self-help guru Tony Robbins. Intrigued by Hal''s shallowness, Robbins hypnotizes him into seeing the beauty that exists even in the least physically appealing women. Hal soon falls for Rosemary, but he doesn''t realize that his gorgeous girlfriend is actually a 300-pound-not-so-hottie.', 'After taking his dying father''s advice, Hal dates only the embodiments of female physical perfection. But that all changes after Hal has an unexpected run-in with self-help guru Tony Robbins. Intrigued by Hal''s shallowness, Robbins hypnotizes him into seeing the beauty that exists even in the least physically appealing women. Hal soon falls for Rosemary, but he doesn''t realize that his gorgeous girlfriend is actually a 300-pound-not-so-hottie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4lZrHWTWuybb6pzMucj1c0ngCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9889'),
  ('909016440780317759', 'Shaman', 1996, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Mikhail Agranovich, Mariya Solovyova, Bartabas', 'Jean-Louis Gouraud', 'Spartak Fedotov, Vladimir Yakolev, Stefan Beliaev, Aliocha Egounov, Igor Gotesman, Stepan Yemelyanov', null, 'Gorgeously shot in the wide-open Siberian wilderness this outdoor adventure chronicles the dramatic escape of a big-city bred violinist from a Siberian labor camp. Underlying the action is the tale of a man who learns to become one with his environment rather than trying to dominate it. The story begins as enigmatic, Asian tribesman Toli comforts the starved violinist Dimitri that they will be escaping soon. They get their chance when a beautiful herd of Yakut horses begin grazing placidly near where the two are toiling. Sneaking away from the others, they grab tow hand steeds and race off. Unfortunately, Toli is mortally wounded. Just before he dies, he tells Dimitri that he is a powerful shaman and then hands the fiddler a protective amulet. In this way, Toli becomes Dimitri''s guardian spirit. The city youth will need all the help he can get as he and his horse must traverse the unforgiving wilds and keep away from guards, alone.', 'Gorgeously shot in the wide-open Siberian wilderness this outdoor adventure chronicles the dramatic escape of a big-city bred violinist from a Siberian labor camp. Underlying the action is the tale of a man who learns to become one with his environment rather than trying to dominate it. The story begins as enigmatic, Asian tribesman Toli comforts the starved violinist Dimitri that they will be escaping soon. They get their chance when a beautiful herd of Yakut horses begin grazing placidly near where the two are toiling. Sneaking away from the others, they grab tow hand steeds and race off. Unfortunately, Toli is mortally wounded. Just before he dies, he tells Dimitri that he is a powerful shaman and then hands the fiddler a protective amulet. In this way, Toli becomes Dimitri''s guardian spirit. The city youth will need all the help he can get as he and his horse must traverse the unforgiving wilds and keep away from guards, alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp762iXrUZBZEALso57Kq8mZ0W3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173005'),
  ('30515409646318858', 'Shaman', 2025, 'Horror', 'Antonio Negret, Daniel Andrade, Mimi Crowe', 'Daniel Negret', 'Sara Canning, Daniel Gillies, Jett Klyne, Lisandro Morales, Alejandro Fajardo, Segundo Fuérez, Dylan Tacuri', 'R', 'A Missionary converting an Indigenous Community in a remote Ecuadorian volcano must come to terms with her own Faith when her son is possessed by dark forces older than her own religion.', 'A Missionary converting an Indigenous Community in a remote Ecuadorian volcano must come to terms with her own Faith when her son is possessed by dark forces older than her own religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltLqm9f9Ma3iCFmfXNHenzPEqda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339166'),
  ('120256225309569761', 'Shame', 1968, 'War, Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist, Raymond Lundberg', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Liv Ullmann, Max von Sydow, Sigge Fürst, Gunnar Björnstrand, Birgitta Valberg, Hans Alfredson, Ingvar Kjellson, Frank Sundström', null, 'In the midst of a civil war, a pair of former violinists in a tempestuous marriage oversee a farm on a rural island. In spite of their best efforts to escape their homeland, the war impinges on every aspect of their lives.', 'In the midst of a civil war, a pair of former violinists in a tempestuous marriage oversee a farm on a rural island. In spite of their best efforts to escape their homeland, the war impinges on every aspect of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRJFOadujA7COrBV4HqB6bWcpLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26372'),
  ('525624530083682390', 'Shame', 1988, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steve Jodrell, Joseph Pickering', 'Beverley Blankenship, Michael Brindley', 'Deborra-Lee Furness, Simone Buchanan, David Franklin, Bill McCluskey, Allison Taylor, Tony Barry, Gillian Jones, Peter Aanensen', 'R', 'Hardened prosecutor Asta Cadell leaves home for a road trip down the coast of Australia. But Cadell''s relaxing ride turns tense when her motorcycle malfunctions and she makes a pit stop in a remote town. Cadell meets teen Elizabeth Curtis, who confides that she has just been raped, and Cadell helps the young woman report the crime to the authorities. When police corruption stands in the way of justice, she takes matters into her own hands.', 'Hardened prosecutor Asta Cadell leaves home for a road trip down the coast of Australia. But Cadell''s relaxing ride turns tense when her motorcycle malfunctions and she makes a pit stop in a remote town. Cadell meets teen Elizabeth Curtis, who confides that she has just been raped, and Cadell helps the young woman report the crime to the authorities. When police corruption stands in the way of justice, she takes matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRdRmO4hLiQOcW3cmyrcLG8hzPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113747'),
