  ('285580630608182626', 'Shanghai 13', 1984, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh', 'Chang Cheh', 'Jimmy Wang Yu, Ti Lung, Chiang Sheng, Chen Kuan-Tai, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, David Chiang Da-Wei, Chi Kuan-Chun, Chan Sing', null, 'A patriot finds evidence that the government is collaborating with a foreign power. If the people knew about the deception, they would revolt and overthrow the corrupt government. One patriot in office steals the proof and must make it out of the country. He gets assistance from a local rebel leader who is in charge of a motley group of fighters called the Shanghai 13. Not all of them can be trusted, as some of them will turn in the government official. Our weak protagonist must run a gauntlet of the who''s who already mentioned.', 'A patriot finds evidence that the government is collaborating with a foreign power. If the people knew about the deception, they would revolt and overthrow the corrupt government. One patriot in office steals the proof and must make it out of the country. He gets assistance from a local rebel leader who is in charge of a motley group of fighters called the Shanghai 13. Not all of them can be trusted, as some of them will turn in the government official. Our weak protagonist must run a gauntlet of the who''s who already mentioned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27cYfrVy4d9zW7C37esQ49wRzIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63528'),
  ('263770201120597617', 'Shanghai Blues', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tsui Hark, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan, Chang Hui-kung', 'Raymond To Kwok-Wai, John Chan Koon-Chung', 'Kenny Bee, Sylvia Chang, Sally Yeh, Tin Ching, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Shing Fui-On, Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Fung Ging-Man', null, 'In 1937 Shanghai, a soldier and a young woman have an awkward meet-cute in darkness under a bridge as they seek refuge during a bomb raid. Ten years later, the soldier, now a burgeoning songwriter and tuba-player in a marching band, is back in town desperately searching for his would-be soulmate. As fate would have it they end up living in the same building unbeknownst to each other. Through a series of mishaps, he mistakes her new ingénue roommate for his love interest and wacky love triangle hijinks ensue.', 'In 1937 Shanghai, a soldier and a young woman have an awkward meet-cute in darkness under a bridge as they seek refuge during a bomb raid. Ten years later, the soldier, now a burgeoning songwriter and tuba-player in a marching band, is back in town desperately searching for his would-be soulmate. As fate would have it they end up living in the same building unbeknownst to each other. Through a series of mishaps, he mistakes her new ingénue roommate for his love interest and wacky love triangle hijinks ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8O7AmHGOyyqQNfilWJhap4miZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143479'),
  ('370149412679762830', 'Shanghai Dreams', 2005, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Gao Yuanyuan, Yao Anlian, Li Bin, Wang Xueyang, Qin Hao, Tang Yang, Zhang Yu, Liu Yangyingzi', null, 'In 1980s China, the country is beginning to reform and workers who had been moved with their families to the provinces in the 60s now long to return to Shanghai. For one displaced family a conflict arises when their 19-year-old daughter finds love with a local boy, threatening their chance of a return to the city.', 'In 1980s China, the country is beginning to reform and workers who had been moved with their families to the provinces in the 60s now long to return to Shanghai. For one displaced family a conflict arises when their 19-year-old daughter finds love with a local boy, threatening their chance of a return to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPm6d6y6zsBdMZpmru5XNlE57s7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101908'),
  ('1118446971434214415', 'Shanghai Express', 1932, 'Drama, Romance, War, Crime, History', 'Lee Garmes, Josef von Sternberg', 'Jules Furthman', 'Marlene Dietrich, Clive Brook, Anna May Wong, Warner Oland, Eugene Pallette, Lawrence Grant, Louise Closser Hale, Gustav von Seyffertitz', null, 'A beautiful temptress re-kindles an old romance while trying to escape her past during a tension-packed train journey.', 'A beautiful temptress re-kindles an old romance while trying to escape her past during a tension-packed train journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0ea6xM3HhIZi7zApDVsxewv9R8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875'),
  ('432385749442471764', 'Shanghai Fortress', 2019, 'Science Fiction, War', 'Jai Ip, Teng Huatao, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Jiang Nan', 'Lu Han, Shu Qi, Shi Liang, Godfrey Gao, Wang Gongliang, Wang Sen, Sun Jialing, Vincent Matile', null, 'Set in the future, the city of Shanghai battle to defend itself against an ongoing attack by an alien force that has attacked and laid siege to numerous cities around the globe in it''s quest to harvest a hidden energy only found on earth.', 'Set in the future, the city of Shanghai battle to defend itself against an ongoing attack by an alien force that has attacked and laid siege to numerous cities around the globe in it''s quest to harvest a hidden energy only found on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPqlhcsiu7U20aQu2r6wI4RgsnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559957'),
  ('251621547710456977', 'Shanghai Grand', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Poon Man-Kit, Poon Hang-Sang, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Poon Man-Kit, Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Andy Lau, Leslie Cheung, Ning Jing, Jung Woo-sung, Lau Shun, Wu Hsing-Guo, Amanda Lee Wai-Man, Almen Wong Pui-Ha', null, 'Hui Man Keung is washed up on a beach near Shanghai. He is taken in by Ding Lik, a kindly beggar who is in love with Fung Ching Ching, the daughter of a prominent gangster. It isn''t long before Ding Lik rises through the underworld ranks to become one of the city''s most powerful gangsters.', 'Hui Man Keung is washed up on a beach near Shanghai. He is taken in by Ding Lik, a kindly beggar who is in love with Fung Ching Ching, the daughter of a prominent gangster. It isn''t long before Ding Lik rises through the underworld ranks to become one of the city''s most powerful gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0u2kP7Cz4IPhviIlwvUnqUlJM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93387'),
  ('1022980691736330408', 'Shanghai Kiss', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Ren, Kip Konwiser, Alexander Buono', 'David Ren', 'Ken Leung, Hayden Panettiere, Kathleen Lancaster, Joel David Moore, Summer Altice, James Hong, Kelly Hu, Lorna Scott', null, 'Liam Liu unwittingly gets involved with a high school girl. He suddenly has to go to China after learning from his father that he has inherited his grandmother''s home in Shanghai. He''s not very appreciative of his Chinese roots, and at first, only wants to sell the house and get back to the U.S. as fast as possible. He gets a taste of the Chinese culture and ends up having some big decisions to make.', 'Liam Liu unwittingly gets involved with a high school girl. He suddenly has to go to China after learning from his father that he has inherited his grandmother''s home in Shanghai. He''s not very appreciative of his Chinese roots, and at first, only wants to sell the house and get back to the U.S. as fast as possible. He gets a taste of the Chinese culture and ends up having some big decisions to make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMXs40GxPhVSqzGudmqg8Yx5LDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15361'),
  ('705078120657577576', 'Shanghai Knights', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'David Dobkin, Adrian Biddle, Ben Howarth', 'Miles Millar, Alfred Gough', 'Jackie Chan, Owen Wilson, Fann Wong, Aidan Gillen, Donnie Yen, Tom Fisher, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Alison King', 'PG-13', 'When a Chinese rebel murders Chon''s estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.', 'When a Chinese rebel murders Chon''s estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVNQStMlZS9mn2AKBEpadRunHgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6038'),
  ('754957376653052310', 'Shanghai Noon', 2000, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Western', 'Dan Mindel, Tom Dey, Jeff Ginn', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar', 'Jackie Chan, Owen Wilson, Lucy Liu, Xander Berkeley, Roger Yuan, Yu Rongguang, Walton Goggins, Brandon Merrill', 'PG-13', 'Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she''s kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O''Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.', 'Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she''s kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O''Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0WwWRcDiDahkah5vZ0KjB4N9ZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8584'),
  ('421814340571829575', 'Shanghai Shanghai', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Teddy Robin, Richard Yuen Tak, Dion Lam', 'Calvin Poon Yuen-Leung, Raymond To Kwok-Wai', 'Yuen Biao, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, George Lam Tsz-Cheung, Chan Chi-Fai, Cheng Ka-Sang, Lawrence Cheng Tan-Shui, John Cheung Chan-Sang', null, 'Little Tiger ventures from the sticks to the big city in search of his cop brother Big Tiger, an honest cop working in a corrupt system. Surmising that life in the police force was not his cup of tea, Little Tiger joins the Swallow Acrobatic Troop, which he excels in because of his kung-fu prowess. When a band of thugs from Chin Hung-yun''s group attacks the troop, Little Tiger not only handily fights them back but also infiltrates their organization to destroy them from the inside. Meanwhile, Big Tiger''s old flame Mary returns from America to join the revolutionaries. Big Tiger soon finds himself torn between his love of this girl and his orders to arrest all revolutionaries.', 'Little Tiger ventures from the sticks to the big city in search of his cop brother Big Tiger, an honest cop working in a corrupt system. Surmising that life in the police force was not his cup of tea, Little Tiger joins the Swallow Acrobatic Troop, which he excels in because of his kung-fu prowess. When a band of thugs from Chin Hung-yun''s group attacks the troop, Little Tiger not only handily fights them back but also infiltrates their organization to destroy them from the inside. Meanwhile, Big Tiger''s old flame Mary returns from America to join the revolutionaries. Big Tiger soon finds himself torn between his love of this girl and his orders to arrest all revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUKdfS4cm6iNjppjoZ6nI8qO7av.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154694'),
  ('1033132887856017499', 'Shanghai Surprise', 1986, 'Romance, Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Jim Goddard, Gino Marotta, Gerry Toomey', 'John Kohn, Robert Bentley', 'Sean Penn, Madonna, Paul Freeman, Richard Griffiths, Clyde Kusatsu, Philip Sayer, Lim Kay Tong, Victor Wong', 'PG-13', 'Glendon Wasey is a fortune hunter looking for a fast track out of China. Gloria Tatlock is a missionary nurse seeking the curing powers of opium for her patients. Fate sets them on a hectic, exotic, and even romantic quest for stolen drugs. But they are up against every thug and smuggler in Shangai.', 'Glendon Wasey is a fortune hunter looking for a fast track out of China. Gloria Tatlock is a missionary nurse seeking the curing powers of opium for her patients. Fate sets them on a hectic, exotic, and even romantic quest for stolen drugs. But they are up against every thug and smuggler in Shangai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zsU3Vq9FG9Q0kTEYrl0CWDlvX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58048'),
  ('1053218680781902289', 'Shanghai Triad', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Zhang Yimou, Lü Yue, Wang Min', 'Bi Feiyu', 'Gong Li, Li Baotian, Sun Chun, Li Xuejian, Liu Jiang, Fu Biao, Chen Shu, Wang Xiaoxiao', 'R', 'Shanghai, China, 1930. When young Shuisheng arrives from the countryside, his uncle Liushu puts him at the service of Bijou, the mistress of Laoda, supreme boss of the Tang Triad, constantly threatened by his enemies, both those he knows and those lurking in the shadows.', 'Shanghai, China, 1930. When young Shuisheng arrives from the countryside, his uncle Liushu puts him at the service of Bijou, the mistress of Laoda, supreme boss of the Tang Triad, constantly threatened by his enemies, both those he knows and those lurking in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzG1UxUSfPACREjgBrsPDRUvneH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37557'),
  ('131414290035448098', 'Shanghaied', 1915, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Harry Ensign', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Wesley Ruggles, Bud Jamison, Billy Armstrong, Paddy McGuire, Leo White, John Rand', 'NR', 'A shipowner intends to scuttle his ship on its last voyage to get the insurance money. Charlie, a tramp in love with the owner''s daughter, is grabbed by the captain and promises to help him shanghai some seamen. The daughter stows away to follow Charlie. Charlie assists in the galley and attempts to serve food during a gale.', 'A shipowner intends to scuttle his ship on its last voyage to get the insurance money. Charlie, a tramp in love with the owner''s daughter, is grabbed by the captain and promises to help him shanghai some seamen. The daughter stows away to follow Charlie. Charlie assists in the galley and attempts to serve food during a gale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juwx4pw6gyloHyxAEUagCF3vkB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53411'),
  ('695674589239821922', 'Shanghaied', 1934, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Elvia Allman, Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Pirate Pete has kidnapped Mickey and Minnie and has them tied up. As Pete prepares to have his way with Minnie, Mickey escapes and gets a swordfish off the wall; a swordfight with Pete ensues. Mickey gets out of the cabin and on deck; he hoists Minnie up onto the mast. Pete summons his crew, and Mickey fights them off with a cannon, shooting pots and pans, a stove, and ultimately a harpoon before winning Minnie and the ship back for good.', 'Pirate Pete has kidnapped Mickey and Minnie and has them tied up. As Pete prepares to have his way with Minnie, Mickey escapes and gets a swordfish off the wall; a swordfight with Pete ensues. Mickey gets out of the cabin and on deck; he hoists Minnie up onto the mast. Pete summons his crew, and Mickey fights them off with a cannon, shooting pots and pans, a stove, and ultimately a harpoon before winning Minnie and the ship back for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sExll25F9vGDXzkphkvwv1n5E2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174303'),
  ('1022881874164615564', 'Shango', 1970, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Edoardo Mulargia, Gino Santini', 'Anthony Steffen, Edoardo Mulargia', 'Anthony Steffen, Eduardo Fajardo, Maurice Poli, Barbara Nelli, Valerio Fioravanti, Gabriella Giorgelli, Andrea Scotti, Massimo Carocci', null, 'Shango is a Texas Ranger who finds himself up against a former Confederate officer and his gang of thugs who have been terrorizing a local border town in search of gold.', 'Shango is a Texas Ranger who finds himself up against a former Confederate officer and his gang of thugs who have been terrorizing a local border town in search of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuGjR9hO6cZ6gtj07uQa0MKn5Cs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129654'),
  ('1114859443906422519', 'Shania Twain: Not Just a Girl', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Joss Crowley', null, 'Shania Twain, Lionel Richie, Avril Lavigne, Diplo, Kelsea Ballerini, Orville Peck, Este Haim, Danielle Haim', 'NR', 'From Nashville newcomer to international icon, singer Shania Twain transcends genres across borders amid triumphs and setbacks in this documentary.', 'From Nashville newcomer to international icon, singer Shania Twain transcends genres across borders amid triumphs and setbacks in this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62tI0ppjUJE8m24ZlDa1pMcICYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999262'),
  ('815336242253442133', 'Shank', 2009, 'Drama, Action', 'Simon Pearce, Christian Martin', 'Darren Flaxstone, Christian Martin', 'Wayne Virgo, Marc Laurent, Tom Bott, Alice Payne, Garry Summers, Bernie Hodges, Louise Fearnside, Oliver Park', null, 'Teenage gang member Cal, hides his sexuality from his fellow gang members despite their often violent dislike of anyone that isn''t the same as them, be they unsuspecting shoppers, foreign students, gays, etc. When his world collides with Olivier, a student he rescues from a pointless beating, he encounters a lifestyle that presents as many new experiences as it does obstacles.', 'Teenage gang member Cal, hides his sexuality from his fellow gang members despite their often violent dislike of anyone that isn''t the same as them, be they unsuspecting shoppers, foreign students, gays, etc. When his world collides with Olivier, a student he rescues from a pointless beating, he encounters a lifestyle that presents as many new experiences as it does obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9xtOtEGHcANKEByorTLxcKNE8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26630'),
  ('294525399729507460', 'Shank', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mo Ali, Kate Millner, Lance Roehrig', 'Paul van Carter', 'Kedar Williams-Stirling, Ashley Thomas, Adam Deacon, Michael Socha, Jan Uddin, Kaya Scodelario, Jennie Jacques, Rheanne Murray', null, 'SHANK delivers a ruthless vision of forthcoming urban life, where guns have been superseded by knives and are fiercely wielded by aimless youths. Amidst the chaos is the Paper Chazers gang, a rare morally conscious group who trade scavenged food for money. After Chazers gang member, Junior, witnesses his brothers murder, he must decide whether to get revenge or stick to the gangs moral code.', 'SHANK delivers a ruthless vision of forthcoming urban life, where guns have been superseded by knives and are fiercely wielded by aimless youths. Amidst the chaos is the Paper Chazers gang, a rare morally conscious group who trade scavenged food for money. After Chazers gang member, Junior, witnesses his brothers murder, he must decide whether to get revenge or stick to the gangs moral code.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUqEb54raDC2SnAznfkQYC08H2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41345'),
  ('1066946237731583005', 'Shanks', 1974, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'William Castle, Val Raset, Martin Walters', 'Ranald Graham', 'Marcel Marceau, Tsilla Chelton, Philippe Clay, Cindy Eilbacher, Biff Manard, Helena Kallianiotes, Larry Bishop, Don Calfa', 'PG', 'Malcolm Shanks is a sad and lonely man, deaf, mute and living with his cruel sister and her husband, who delight in making him miserable. His only pleasure, it seems, is in making and controlling puppets. Thanks to his skill, he is offered a job as a lab assistant to Dr. Walker, who is working on ways to re-animate dead bodies by inserting electrodes at key nerve points and manipulating the bodies as if they were on strings. When the professor suddenly dies one night, Shanks gets the idea to apply their experimental results to a human body, and then to start exacting some revenge.', 'Malcolm Shanks is a sad and lonely man, deaf, mute and living with his cruel sister and her husband, who delight in making him miserable. His only pleasure, it seems, is in making and controlling puppets. Thanks to his skill, he is offered a job as a lab assistant to Dr. Walker, who is working on ways to re-animate dead bodies by inserting electrodes at key nerve points and manipulating the bodies as if they were on strings. When the professor suddenly dies one night, Shanks gets the idea to apply their experimental results to a human body, and then to start exacting some revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QlcNEGeEXp5ixtCaOuQyGlEb7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29399'),
  ('904329643391809958', 'Shanthi Appuram Nithya', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Murali Vishwa', 'Murali Vishwa', 'Maha Adithya, Archana Sharma', null, 'An erotic movie that depicts how innocent women fall for bad boys and how those men treat them without any courtesy.', 'An erotic movie that depicts how innocent women fall for bad boys and how those men treat them without any courtesy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okr8zGwzIuEKmCxWtyNXiirZrho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088602'),
  ('667029084002657770', 'Shanty Tramp', 1967, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Raphael Remy, Bob Clark, Joseph G. Prieto', 'Reuben Guberman, Joseph P. Mawra', 'Eleanor Vaill, Otto Schlessinger, Ray Aranha, Bill Rogers, Lawrence Tobin, Ed Anderson, Charles Deilhi, George Henry Smith', null, 'On a hot night in Dixie, the local shanty tramp heads out for adventure and leaves disaster in her wake. The lust she excites in the local men leads to fights, murders, lynch mobs, ruined reputations, and broken homes.', 'On a hot night in Dixie, the local shanty tramp heads out for adventure and leaves disaster in her wake. The lust she excites in the local men leads to fights, murders, lynch mobs, ruined reputations, and broken homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drEZeOBmPx3VoSVx4uBaMC0HK04.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35062'),
  ('961713883550741626', 'Shaolin', 2011, 'Action, Drama', 'Corey Yuen, Richard Yuen Tak, Nicky Li Chung-Chi', 'Charcoal Tan, Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Andy Lau, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Fan Bingbing, Jackie Chan, Wu Jing, Yu Shaoqun, Xing Yu, Yu Hai', 'R', 'China is plunged into strife as feuding warlords try to expand their power by warring over neighboring lands. Fuelled by his success on the battlefield, young and arrogant Hao Jie sneers at Shaolin''s masters when he beats one of them in a duel. But the pride comes before a fall. When his own family is wiped out by a rival warlord, Hao is forced to take refuge with the monks. As the civil unrest spreads and the people suffer, Hao and the Shaolin masters are forced to take a fiery stand against the evil warlords. They launch a daring plan or rescue and escape.', 'China is plunged into strife as feuding warlords try to expand their power by warring over neighboring lands. Fuelled by his success on the battlefield, young and arrogant Hao Jie sneers at Shaolin''s masters when he beats one of them in a duel. But the pride comes before a fall. When his own family is wiped out by a rival warlord, Hao is forced to take refuge with the monks. As the civil unrest spreads and the people suffer, Hao and the Shaolin masters are forced to take a fiery stand against the evil warlords. They launch a daring plan or rescue and escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stvd0u2Pmy2VjdZHbFIEvCwDzRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55292'),
  ('284791174219606913', 'Shaolin Abbot', 1979, 'Action', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Hung Hak, Chan Fen', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Lo Lieh, Ching Miao, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Lily Li, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Yang Chi-Ching, Chiang Tao', null, 'While international favorite David Chiang was best known for his roles as a grinning, streetwise, fighter in many Chang Cheh-directed classics, he rarely played a noble warrior monk. But here he portrays the great Chih Shim, the monk who saved the Southern Shaolin Temple. Making this production all the more notable is Lo Lieh, Shaws'' first international star, who returns to a role he also made famous - that of Shaolin renegade Pai Mei. This, and even more, makes for a true martial arts epic of the first order.', 'While international favorite David Chiang was best known for his roles as a grinning, streetwise, fighter in many Chang Cheh-directed classics, he rarely played a noble warrior monk. But here he portrays the great Chih Shim, the monk who saved the Southern Shaolin Temple. Making this production all the more notable is Lo Lieh, Shaws'' first international star, who returns to a role he also made famous - that of Shaolin renegade Pai Mei. This, and even more, makes for a true martial arts epic of the first order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx3DTUX9GHXJFkP2deBKRTHos2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66217'),
  ('7416636214632430', 'Shaolin and Wu Tang', 1983, 'Action', 'Huang Pa-Ching, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui', 'Huang Pa-Ching, Shu Mei Chin, Chi-kien Wong', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Idy Chan Yuk-Lin, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Brian Baek Hwang-gi, Chan Shen, Ching Li, Chiang Chen', null, 'Master Liu and Master Law are rival masters of Shaolin style kung fu, and Wudang style sword fighting, running schools in the same city. Their top students, Chao Fung-wu, and Hung Jun-kit, are actually close friends. After observing the two students fighting at a brothel, the Lord determines that the two styles are dangerous, and he must learn both.', 'Master Liu and Master Law are rival masters of Shaolin style kung fu, and Wudang style sword fighting, running schools in the same city. Their top students, Chao Fung-wu, and Hung Jun-kit, are actually close friends. After observing the two students fighting at a brothel, the Lord determines that the two styles are dangerous, and he must learn both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8WDiah1B7cUAJlFd5kVeD776Ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20966'),
  ('797735382591302167', 'Shaolin Deadly Kicks', 1977, 'Action, Drama', 'Wu Ma', null, 'Dorian Tan Tao-Liang, Lo Lieh, Wang Hsieh, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Lu Ti, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei, Kim Se-Ok, Chin Kang', null, 'Eight thieves steal a treasure map and split it into eight pieces, vowing to regroup three years later. But they''ll have to deal with a deadly-kicking cop.', 'Eight thieves steal a treasure map and split it into eight pieces, vowing to regroup three years later. But they''ll have to deal with a deadly-kicking cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwJYSX218yhnNnKlsKHrXSPHUug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131859'),
  ('392779210823786335', 'Shaolin Girl', 2008, 'Action, Comedy', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Akira Sako', 'Masashi Sogo, Rika Sogo', 'Ko Shibasaki, Toru Nakamura, Zhang Yuqi, Tenky Tin Kai-Man, Lam Tze-Chung, Takashi Okamura, Yosuke Eguchi, Mami Yamasaki', null, 'A Shaolin-trainer young woman returns to Japan to resuscitate her grandfather''s defunct martial arts school.', 'A Shaolin-trainer young woman returns to Japan to resuscitate her grandfather''s defunct martial arts school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLcN3Rh2cfh5tQscaR6izDf0Pxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22411'),
  ('855691371317288643', 'Shaolin Hand Lock', 1978, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Lo Lieh, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Chen Ping, Shum Lee-Mei, Karen Yip Leng-Chi, Dick Wei, Chan Shen', null, 'As an expert of the ''Cross fists'' technique, a reclusive kung fu master Li Pai perfects a lethal maneuver called the ''Shaolin Handlock'' while an old wolf-in-sheep''s-clothing friend Fang Yun-piao pays the unwitting Li a visit. Armed with the deadly Handlock maneuver, Cheng-ying & Kun Shih joins forces to exact revenge on the evil Ling Hao after the truth is unraveled.', 'As an expert of the ''Cross fists'' technique, a reclusive kung fu master Li Pai perfects a lethal maneuver called the ''Shaolin Handlock'' while an old wolf-in-sheep''s-clothing friend Fang Yun-piao pays the unwitting Li a visit. Armed with the deadly Handlock maneuver, Cheng-ying & Kun Shih joins forces to exact revenge on the evil Ling Hao after the truth is unraveled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHzyWiwdLUtoIp4ZGrrbKx6vPYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44924'),
  ('226770615289254886', 'Shaolin Intruders', 1983, 'Action, Drama', 'Hung Hak, Tong Kai, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Hung Hak, Ni Kuang, Ling Yun', 'Derek Yee, Lau Yuk-Pok, Jason Pai Piao, Phillip Ko Fai, Chan Shen, Ku Feng, Teng Wei-Hao, Kwan Fung', null, 'On a routine courier mission, the prestigious Chin Hu chief was murdered by four mysterious monks. When all evidence points to Ching Hua, his friend Lei Hsin is determined to clear his name by barging in the Shaolin Temple thrice, and gets intwined in an intricate web of deception!', 'On a routine courier mission, the prestigious Chin Hu chief was murdered by four mysterious monks. When all evidence points to Ching Hua, his friend Lei Hsin is determined to clear his name by barging in the Shaolin Temple thrice, and gets intwined in an intricate web of deception!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yce4AEyRPvIHZ6c15RDnv8NUt2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60568'),
  ('1033438735335000438', 'Shaolin Invincibles', 1977, 'Action', 'Hou Cheng', null, 'Carter Huang Chia-Ta, Chia Ling, Dorian Tan Tao-Liang, Chen Hung-Lieh, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Wong Hoi', null, 'Two sword-wielding sisters seek revenge against the villains who murdered their family. But these are no ordinary villains — they’re wizards with giant, elasticized tongues who use black magic to control... kung fu gorillas!', 'Two sword-wielding sisters seek revenge against the villains who murdered their family. But these are no ordinary villains — they’re wizards with giant, elasticized tongues who use black magic to control... kung fu gorillas!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0D2fakjakdswCJfVP5RgJZgelJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269651'),
  ('685525003370105881', 'Shaolin Kung Fu', 1974, 'Action', 'Joseph Kuo, Lau Sau-Wa', 'Siao Se', 'Wen Chiang-Lung, Yi Yuan, Liu Ping, Liu Hsiu-Yun, Yee Hung, Yuan Shen, Yeung San-San, Tseng Chao', null, 'Tongyang brings his rickshaws into town and starts using his hired muscle to dominate the clientele.', 'Tongyang brings his rickshaws into town and starts using his hired muscle to dominate the clientele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXLDQaYeRRDzonIOqBF6oSa09lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255208'),
  ('372990613705950162', 'Shaolin Mantis', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Huang Pa-Ching, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Szeto On', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Lily Li, Lau Kar-Wing, Cecilia Wong, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Wai Wang, Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, John Cheung Ng-Long', null, 'When scholar Wei Fung is forcibly hired by the Manchu Emperor to infiltrate a clan of rebellious Ming Loyalists, his mission goes adrift when he falls in love with the clan''s leader''s granddaughter. Wei Fung must choose between his new love and his family, who will be put to death if he doesn''t return to the palace successfully.', 'When scholar Wei Fung is forcibly hired by the Manchu Emperor to infiltrate a clan of rebellious Ming Loyalists, his mission goes adrift when he falls in love with the clan''s leader''s granddaughter. Wei Fung must choose between his new love and his family, who will be put to death if he doesn''t return to the palace successfully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56rT3K25YXP04cINDXI5jRLW5VU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59402'),
  ('417762729722377858', 'Shaolin Martial Arts', 1974, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Chi Kuan-Chun, Irene Chen Yi-Ling, Yuan Man-Tzu, Lu Ti, Chiang Tao, Fung Hak-On, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', null, 'After the destruction of the Shaolin Temple, the Chings are in control and send their best students to wipe out all of the remaining Shaolin practioners. They almost succeed, but two students escape. They learn various Kung Fu styles from different teachers to combat the Ching''s two kung fu fighters.', 'After the destruction of the Shaolin Temple, the Chings are in control and send their best students to wipe out all of the remaining Shaolin practioners. They almost succeed, but two students escape. They learn various Kung Fu styles from different teachers to combat the Ching''s two kung fu fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0YKxuP5bFXrMp7bSQyWyYqh4RO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64360'),
  ('606982701429701446', 'Shaolin Popey', 1994, 'Action, Romance, Comedy', 'Kevin Chu', 'Yip Wan-Chiu, Ting Ya-min', 'Ashton Chen, Steven Hao, Jimmy Lin Chih-Ying, Vivian Hsu, Hilary Tsui Ho-Ying, Paul Chun Pui, Chang Kuo-Chu, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', null, 'A high school loser dreams of winning the heart of the principal''s daughter, but his chances are slim as long as her bruiser boyfriend''s around. Fortunately, a chance meeting with a pair of Shaolin-trained kids (previously seen in DRAGON FROM SHAOLIN) gives him the fighting skills needed to come out on top. An unusual but entertaining blending of teen romantic comedy and martial arts slapstick', 'A high school loser dreams of winning the heart of the principal''s daughter, but his chances are slim as long as her bruiser boyfriend''s around. Fortunately, a chance meeting with a pair of Shaolin-trained kids (previously seen in DRAGON FROM SHAOLIN) gives him the fighting skills needed to come out on top. An unusual but entertaining blending of teen romantic comedy and martial arts slapstick', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz2LVFEWRflbToMUsCj0KAFhRQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63718'),
  ('988284097009685814', 'Shaolin Popey II: Messy Temple', 1994, 'Comedy, Action', 'Kevin Chu, Chen Jung-Shu', 'Sip Wan Chiu', 'Steven Hao, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Michael Lee Ming-Yeung, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Michelle Yeoh, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Elsie Yeh, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', null, 'Fun-loving young Shaolin initiates get the better of two bungling assassins hired to chop off the right hand of their crochety master, who commands magical kung-fu powers.', 'Fun-loving young Shaolin initiates get the better of two bungling assassins hired to chop off the right hand of their crochety master, who commands magical kung-fu powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x05LwIAQF6VbPVxhKytUFzEnhCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63719'),
  ('879258885173529085', 'Shaolin Prince', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hung Hak, Tong Kai, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Wong Jing', 'Ti Lung, Derek Yee, Jason Pai Piao, Ku Feng, Chan Shen, Yue Tau-Wan, Alan Chan Kwok-Kuen, Lam Fai-Wong', null, 'Two princes are seperated by birth; one is raised by the Prime Minister, the other by three mad Shaolin Monks. They both learn kung-fu. 23 years later, they meet and combine forces to defeat the tyrannical 9th Prince.', 'Two princes are seperated by birth; one is raised by the Prime Minister, the other by three mad Shaolin Monks. They both learn kung-fu. 23 years later, they meet and combine forces to defeat the tyrannical 9th Prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR6zfd2ssLrr2aZv3GHXjqJD2TQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66756'),
  ('416486672197174008', 'Shaolin Rescuers', 1979, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Chan Yau-Man, Chiang Sheng', 'Ni Kuang', 'Jason Pai Piao, Lu Feng, Lo Meng, Phillip Kwok Chui, Chiang Sheng, Sun Chien, Chiang Nan, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', 'PG-13', 'Two friends who long to be heroes join the fight against a Ching warlord and his students. They get help from a Kung Fu student and a rebel. They also save Hung Si Quan''s life.', 'Two friends who long to be heroes join the fight against a Ching warlord and his students. They get help from a Kung Fu student and a rebel. They also save Hung Si Quan''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QmEa8N0eIJg3KtWzwZABef9fHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63439'),
  ('265816373463149629', 'Shaolin Soccer', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'Stephen Chow, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Stephen Wong Wai-Him', 'Stephen Chow, Tsang Kan-Cheong, Steven Fung Min-Hang', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Vicky Zhao, Patrick Tse Yin, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Wong Yat-Fei, Mo Meilin, Tenky Tin Kai-Man', 'PG', 'A young Shaolin follower reunites with his discouraged brothers to form a soccer team using their martial art skills to their advantage.', 'A young Shaolin follower reunites with his discouraged brothers to form a soccer team using their martial art skills to their advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6ZQqwoxWy9muIxwUP4K2zWw7BU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11770'),
  ('573439953520106098', 'Shaolin Temple', 1976, 'Action, Adventure', 'Chang Cheh, Yeh Te-Sheng, Wu Ma', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Chi Kuan-Chun, Wai Wang, David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Elliot Ngok Wah, Wong Chung', null, 'There is no place more hallowed in the martial art world than China''s Shaolin Temple. This special place deserves a special epic, which is what the martial arts maestro delivers in this battle between a brave brand of Chinese boxers and literally thousands of Qing troops - complete with betrayals, intrigues, and such novel fighting machines as 108 wooden robots. The conflicts grow in complexity, intensity and even suspense as monks struggle to stay alive in the face of overwhelming odds.', 'There is no place more hallowed in the martial art world than China''s Shaolin Temple. This special place deserves a special epic, which is what the martial arts maestro delivers in this battle between a brave brand of Chinese boxers and literally thousands of Qing troops - complete with betrayals, intrigues, and such novel fighting machines as 108 wooden robots. The conflicts grow in complexity, intensity and even suspense as monks struggle to stay alive in the face of overwhelming odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6IALg4S0qujZha9xbFBLnELksZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45736'),
  ('812605759200392735', 'Shaolin Temple', 1982, 'Action', 'Cheung Sing-Yim, Chau Pak-Ling, Lo Siu-Cheung', 'Sit Hau, Lo Siu-Cheung', 'Jet Li, Yu Hai, Yu Chenghui, Ding Lan, Hu Jian-Qiang, Sun Jiankui, Liu Huai-Liang, Ji Chunhua', null, 'The Tang emperor is betrayed by one of his generals, who installs himself as emperor in the East Capital. The son of one of his slave workers escapes to the Shaolin Temple, learns kung fu, and sets out to kill the traitor who killed his father.', 'The Tang emperor is betrayed by one of his generals, who installs himself as emperor in the East Capital. The son of one of his slave workers escapes to the Shaolin Temple, learns kung fu, and sets out to kill the traitor who killed his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKt2c9nvc9qHIoa530XdZi4X1WZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10275'),
  ('364385446424805815', 'Shaolin vs. Evil Dead', 2004, 'Action, Horror', 'Douglas Kung Cheung-Tak', 'Ho Yiu-Wang', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Shi Xiaohu, Jacky Woo, Shannon Yiu King, German Cheung Man-Kit, Zho Lung-Lung', null, 'The plot thickens as heroes Pak and Ha discover the evil Dr. Magma''s plan to reanimate the dead and take on the master-fighting Shaolin monks.', 'The plot thickens as heroes Pak and Ha discover the evil Dr. Magma''s plan to reanimate the dead and take on the master-fighting Shaolin monks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF43gRWg2qymxtbhOXLRC7Sl46p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51868'),
  ('543333558347191890', 'Shaolin vs. Lama', 1983, 'Action, Drama', 'Lee Tso-Nam', 'Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Alexander Lo Rei, Chen Shan, Wang Chi-Sheng, Sun Jung-Chi, William Yen Ming-Chang, Chang Chi-Ping, Lee Wai-Wan, Yang Hsiung', null, 'A kung fu fanatic, Yu Ting (Alexander Lo Rei), searching for the ultimate master, saves a young Shaolin monk, Hsu Shi (William Yen), from a group of mobsters and sees it as a golden opportunity to enrich his kung fu skills. He persuades the young novice monk to smuggle him into Shaolin, but Ting''s presence isn''t welcome and he is driven out, but remains close to the temple, keeping in touch with Hsu Shi. When Ting rescues a girl from the clutches of the Flying Eagle gang, the Golden Wheel Lama and sworn enemy of Shaolin finds the perfect excuse to lead an assault on the Temple. Realizing Ting''s devotion, the abbot decides to bring Ting into the Shaolin order and teach him the deadliest techniques to prepare him for the Lama''s merciless fury.', 'A kung fu fanatic, Yu Ting (Alexander Lo Rei), searching for the ultimate master, saves a young Shaolin monk, Hsu Shi (William Yen), from a group of mobsters and sees it as a golden opportunity to enrich his kung fu skills. He persuades the young novice monk to smuggle him into Shaolin, but Ting''s presence isn''t welcome and he is driven out, but remains close to the temple, keeping in touch with Hsu Shi. When Ting rescues a girl from the clutches of the Flying Eagle gang, the Golden Wheel Lama and sworn enemy of Shaolin finds the perfect excuse to lead an assault on the Temple. Realizing Ting''s devotion, the abbot decides to bring Ting into the Shaolin order and teach him the deadliest techniques to prepare him for the Lama''s merciless fury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmOwYQQzIawPNX4BHFZa4m9lNNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59404'),
  ('100466998205123024', 'Shaolin vs. Ninja', 1983, 'Action', 'Robert Tai', 'Cheung Gin-Gat', 'Alexander Lo Rei, William Yen Ming-Chang, Alan Chui Chung-San, Chang Chi-Ping, Yee Yuen, Wang Hsieh, Wang Chi-Sheng, Mau Ging-Shun', 'NR', 'A Japanese Prince proposes to the Shaolin abbot that a contest between Ching and Japanese martials arts should be held at the Shaolin Temple. However this is just a front for a more villainous plot to overthrow Shaolin and then China herself. Without doubt some of the best choreography to come out of the Orient and crack up as Japanese Bushido experts take on the very best of Shaolin kung fu', 'A Japanese Prince proposes to the Shaolin abbot that a contest between Ching and Japanese martials arts should be held at the Shaolin Temple. However this is just a front for a more villainous plot to overthrow Shaolin and then China herself. Without doubt some of the best choreography to come out of the Orient and crack up as Japanese Bushido experts take on the very best of Shaolin kung fu', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peHNjZ1RADlQ3pPdz1mAS22VrA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98171'),
  ('11991490148422148', 'Shaolin Wooden Men', 1976, 'Action', 'Chen Chi-Hwa, Chan Chung-Yuen', 'Gam Yam', 'Jackie Chan, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Chin Kang, Chang Ping-Yu, Chang I-Fei, Chiu Lo-Kong, Cheung Kam, Gam Yam', null, 'Little Mute is an orphan traumatized into silence by the death of his father at the hands of a vicious fighting master. Living at the Shaolin monastery, he befriends a dangerous prisoner who teaches him a secret form of deadly kung fu. Seeing his intense determination, other masters share the wisdom of the Gliding Snake and Drunken Master techniques. In one of the most exciting fight scenes ever filmed, Little Mute must run the gauntlet of the famous 108 wooden men in an extreme test of skill and endurance. But if he becomes a master, will he use his unmatched force for redemption or revenge?', 'Little Mute is an orphan traumatized into silence by the death of his father at the hands of a vicious fighting master. Living at the Shaolin monastery, he befriends a dangerous prisoner who teaches him a secret form of deadly kung fu. Seeing his intense determination, other masters share the wisdom of the Gliding Snake and Drunken Master techniques. In one of the most exciting fight scenes ever filmed, Little Mute must run the gauntlet of the famous 108 wooden men in an extreme test of skill and endurance. But if he becomes a master, will he use his unmatched force for redemption or revenge?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNeXr9PRv8m83BjfL4K6wP5oPZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40829'),
  ('661574570192992450', 'Shape of My Heart', 2024, 'Romance', 'Shinji Imaoka, Shinji Imaoka', 'Shinji Imaoka', 'Keisuke Koide, Kei Fubuki, Manami Shindo, Yohta Kawase, Kotaro Tanaka, Norimasa Fuke', null, 'A romance about a man and a woman who, due to an unexpected event, end up switching bodies. Despite coming from completely different backgrounds and environments, the two try to overcome the various difficulties that arise from their body swap.', 'A romance about a man and a woman who, due to an unexpected event, end up switching bodies. Despite coming from completely different backgrounds and environments, the two try to overcome the various difficulties that arise from their body swap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3r0O6BW9USoZ9mteCVyNKMQriRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285366'),
  ('972784999604751607', 'Shapoklyak', 1974, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Kachanov', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Klara Rumyanova, Irina Mazing, Vladimir Ferapontov', null, 'Gena the Crocodile and Cheburashka decide to go to the sea on vacation. Shapoklyak steals their train tickets, so they are kicked off the train. On their way home, the duo, with Shapoklyak''s help, stops hikers from poaching and a factory from polluting a river.', 'Gena the Crocodile and Cheburashka decide to go to the sea on vacation. Shapoklyak steals their train tickets, so they are kicked off the train. On their way home, the duo, with Shapoklyak''s help, stops hikers from poaching and a factory from polluting a river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1e7aK4FP1tbKlYsoJEG6pU7VMHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79702'),
  ('474463872479211128', 'Shara', 2003, 'Drama', 'Naomi Kawase, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Naomi Kawase', 'Kohei Fukungaga, Yuka Hyyoudo, Naomi Kawase, Katsuhisa Namase, Kanako Higuchi', null, 'The Aso family live in the old town of Nara. One Day, Kei, one of the Aso''s twin boys suddenly disappears. Five years later seventeen-year old Shun, the remaining twin, is an art student. He now has to move forward with his life, together with his childhood friend, Yu.', 'The Aso family live in the old town of Nara. One Day, Kei, one of the Aso''s twin boys suddenly disappears. Five years later seventeen-year old Shun, the remaining twin, is an art student. He now has to move forward with his life, together with his childhood friend, Yu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfsdobIiofqZVHNbDyLDs5d0pzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36281'),
  ('1143431702960195287', 'Sharaabi', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Prakash Mehra, Sushil Malik', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Jaya Prada, Bharat Bhushan, Chandrashekhar Vaidya, C.S. Dubey, A.K. Hangal, Dinesh Hingoo, Jankidas Mehra', null, 'A workaholic businessman neglects his only son after his wife''s death. The son grows up to be a rebellious alcoholic.', 'A workaholic businessman neglects his only son after his wife''s death. The son grows up to be a rebellious alcoholic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9spEnoxSCLqMmXLiASWECfJ1IpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71304'),
  ('267615082910860111', 'Sharad of Atlantis', 1936, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Edgar Lyons, William Nobles, B. Reeves Eason', 'Maurice Geraghty, Oliver Drake, John Rathmell', 'Ray Corrigan, Lois Wilde, Monte Blue, William Farnum, Boothe Howard, Raymond Hatton, C. Montague Shaw, Lee Van Atta', 'NR', 'Crash Corrigan, a recent graduate of Annapolis, and Diana, a go-getting reporter, join Professor Norton for a search for the source of a string of earthquakes, Atlantis. They ride Prof. Norton''s rocket submarine searching the sea and little Billy Norton, the professor''s son stows away, of course. When they find Atlantis they are caught in a war between peaceful Atlanteans, note their white capes, and war-monging Atlanteans, note their black capes. After many harrowing moments for Crash, Diana, Prof. Norton and Billy, they barely get away with their lives when they escape a tower of Atlantis raised to the surface for the sole purpose of dominating or destroying the Earth (Which one depends on the compliance of the upper world dwellers.)', 'Crash Corrigan, a recent graduate of Annapolis, and Diana, a go-getting reporter, join Professor Norton for a search for the source of a string of earthquakes, Atlantis. They ride Prof. Norton''s rocket submarine searching the sea and little Billy Norton, the professor''s son stows away, of course. When they find Atlantis they are caught in a war between peaceful Atlanteans, note their white capes, and war-monging Atlanteans, note their black capes. After many harrowing moments for Crash, Diana, Prof. Norton and Billy, they barely get away with their lives when they escape a tower of Atlantis raised to the surface for the sole purpose of dominating or destroying the Earth (Which one depends on the compliance of the upper world dwellers.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v24hM8WeAlT4uoZHPWu94DbMHz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90918'),
  ('1042524057275217187', 'Sharaku', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Midori Katakura, Frankie Sakai, Hiroko Minagawa', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Shima Iwashita, Frankie Sakai, Tsurutaro Kataoka, Shiro Sano, Riona Hazuki, Toshiya Nagasawa, Haruko Katō', null, 'A crippled kabuki player is taken into a strolling company of itinerant actors. An influential publisher notices his honest, bold drawings, and nurtures him despite persecution and betrayal. The film explores the eternal relationship between artist and producer, and describes the emanicipation of a man who refuses to let himself become the plaything of power and money.', 'A crippled kabuki player is taken into a strolling company of itinerant actors. An influential publisher notices his honest, bold drawings, and nurtures him despite persecution and betrayal. The film explores the eternal relationship between artist and producer, and describes the emanicipation of a man who refuses to let himself become the plaything of power and money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrBayZ1nXHpn3GF9u9OKjyVpQPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198431'),
  ('826378795964870535', 'Share', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Pippa Bianco, Ava Berkofsky', 'Pippa Bianco', 'Rhianne Barreto, Charlie Plummer, Poorna Jagannathan, Lovie Simone, Milcania Diaz-Rojas, J.C. MacKenzie, Nicholas Galitzine, Danny Mastrogiorgio', 'R', 'After discovering a disturbing video from a night she doesn’t remember, sixteen-year-old Mandy must try to figure out what happened and how to navigate the escalating fallout.', 'After discovering a disturbing video from a night she doesn’t remember, sixteen-year-old Mandy must try to figure out what happened and how to navigate the escalating fallout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3sdrWXD7GknI0e5OTIyH01Kxs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510355'),
  ('1126514443306839444', 'SHARE?', 2023, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ira Rosensweig', 'Benjamin Sutor', 'Melvin Gregg, Bradley Whitford, Danielle Campbell, Alice Braga, Melvin Vaughan, Macy Minear', null, 'A man awakens stripped of all of his possessions and trapped in a bare room. Aided by a primitive computer, he must learn to survive in his new isolated existence where entertainment is the only currency.', 'A man awakens stripped of all of his possessions and trapped in a bare room. Aided by a primitive computer, he must learn to survive in his new isolated existence where entertainment is the only currency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HZv3pcDFZDSl8pdzxohHQZa1y3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1095885'),
  ('390839698016314163', 'Shared Apartment', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Mario Faroni, Horacio Guisado, Víctor Hugo Caula', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Alberto Olmedo, Tato Bores, Graciela Alfano, Camila Perissé, César Bertrand, Ovidio Fuentes, Noemí Alan, Augusto Larreta', null, 'A recently separated man decides to go to his best friend''s apartment, where their different personalities cause crazy events, hilarious situations and, in addition, he meets a beautiful woman with whom he falls in love.', 'A recently separated man decides to go to his best friend''s apartment, where their different personalities cause crazy events, hilarious situations and, in addition, he meets a beautiful woman with whom he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Jwpr0RnpcwEKbHU9trDe7lNYgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547930'),
  ('339211437674318157', 'Sharing Christmas', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Eitan Almagor, Peter Sullivan', 'Jay Cipriani, Peter Sullivan', 'Ellen Hollman, Bobby Campo, Dave Koz, Cynthia Gibb, Melanie Nelson, David Starzyk, Jon Prescott, Pamela Roylance', 'G', 'A real estate developer is given the opportunity of his career to transform an old shopping complex into a prime location. Unfortunately, there is one tenant who is holding out—the Christmas shop owner he met by happenstance just days ago.', 'A real estate developer is given the opportunity of his career to transform an old shopping complex into a prime location. Unfortunately, there is one tenant who is holding out—the Christmas shop owner he met by happenstance just days ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbcQlnr10rmpyqGftTeZvtbKCeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483558'),
  ('797594708377504784', 'Sharing the Secret', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Katt Shea, Wally Pfister, Martha Elcan', 'Barbara Turner', 'Alison Lohman, Mare Winningham, Tim Matheson, Diane Ladd, Mary Crosby, Lawrence Monoson, Camryn Grimes, Brighton Hertford', null, 'A teenage girl, who feels she must always seem happy for her parents and friends, secretly binges and purges.', 'A teenage girl, who feels she must always seem happy for her parents and friends, secretly binges and purges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKO3CPkP0ZrDpWMUdbD2i5bzmMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299024'),
  ('713748892301264304', 'Shark', 1969, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Raúl Martínez Solares, Samuel Fuller, Said Karem', 'John T. Dugan, Samuel Fuller', 'Burt Reynolds, Barry Sullivan, Silvia Pinal, Arthur Kennedy, Emilia Stuart, Manuel Alvarado, Enrique Lucero, Carlos Beriochoa', null, 'A gunrunner loses his cargo near a small coastal Sudanese town so he''s stuck there. When a woman hires him to raid a sunken ship in the shark-infested waters, he sees a chance to compensate for his losses. He''s not the only one.', 'A gunrunner loses his cargo near a small coastal Sudanese town so he''s stuck there. When a woman hires him to raid a sunken ship in the shark-infested waters, he sees a chance to compensate for his losses. He''s not the only one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUTzpRHEWHSZerpKcozoA9NlvQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4992'),
  ('737513546146166040', 'Shark Attack', 1999, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Bob Misiorowski, Lawrence Sher', null, 'Casper Van Dien, Ernie Hudson, Bentley Mitchum, Jenny McShane, Cordell McQueen, Anton Dekker, Tony Caprari, Chris Olley', 'R', 'When an accidental death verdict is given on discovery of the remains of a top scientist, within the stomach of a hammerhead shark his closest friend Marine Biologist Steven McRay is not happy with the explanation and travels to investigate further, where he discovers that his friend''s death was not an isolated incident, and that the local population have been terrorised by a rash of shark attacks.Developments in scientific technology had allowed experts to predict the pattern and likelihood of Shark Attacks, but now it seems that they may also be able to actually control these factors, rendering at their disposal the ultimate Killing machine.Enjoy the water... you may never want to go in the sea again!', 'When an accidental death verdict is given on discovery of the remains of a top scientist, within the stomach of a hammerhead shark his closest friend Marine Biologist Steven McRay is not happy with the explanation and travels to investigate further, where he discovers that his friend''s death was not an isolated incident, and that the local population have been terrorised by a rash of shark attacks.Developments in scientific technology had allowed experts to predict the pattern and likelihood of Shark Attacks, but now it seems that they may also be able to actually control these factors, rendering at their disposal the ultimate Killing machine.Enjoy the water... you may never want to go in the sea again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3xlaPOkt1vFkJqxA32LnudEqrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42185'),
  ('587702049069587589', 'Shark Attack 2', 2000, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'David Worth, Yossi Wein', 'Scott Devine, William Hooke', 'Thorsten Kaye, Nikita Ager, Dan Metcalfe, Caroline Bruins, Danny Keogh, Rob van Vuuren, Warrick Grier, Ian Jepson', 'R', 'A biological experiment goes bad, this time releasing a gaggle of mutated great white sharks with a taste for human flesh. Soon enough, shark expert Nick West is on the case, leading a crew to study them and eventually bring them back into captivity. West''s plans hit a snag, however, when Australian shark hunter Roy Bishop is called in to wipe out the fishy menace.', 'A biological experiment goes bad, this time releasing a gaggle of mutated great white sharks with a taste for human flesh. Soon enough, shark expert Nick West is on the case, leading a crew to study them and eventually bring them back into captivity. West''s plans hit a snag, however, when Australian shark hunter Roy Bishop is called in to wipe out the fishy menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnzeIraE5HhY8Bg3wZE7spb0aVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42187'),
  ('372713820378437198', 'Shark Attack 3: Megalodon', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'David Worth, David Worth', 'William Hooke, Scott Devine', 'John Barrowman, Jenny McShane, Ryan Cutrona, Bashar Rahal, George Stanchev, Pavlin Kemilev, Plamen Manassiev, Krasimir Simeonov', 'R', 'When two researchers discover a colossal shark''s tooth off the Mexican coast their worst fears surface - the most menacing beast to ever rule the waters is still alive and mercilessly feeding on anything that crosses its path. Now they must hunt the fierce killer and destroy it... before there is no one left to stop it', 'When two researchers discover a colossal shark''s tooth off the Mexican coast their worst fears surface - the most menacing beast to ever rule the waters is still alive and mercilessly feeding on anything that crosses its path. Now they must hunt the fierce killer and destroy it... before there is no one left to stop it', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jPTanuMn99GaLSSRVfaEwDVUWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18015'),
  ('278209035152309321', 'Shark Attack in the Mediterranean', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Yvonne Tratz, Jorgo Papavassiliou', 'Don Schubert, Jörg Alberts, Roland Heep', 'Ralf Moeller, Julia Stinshoff, Gregor Bloéb, Katy Karrenbauer, Jeanette Biedermann, Anna Bertheau, Ottfried Fischer, Oona-Devi Liebich', null, 'A prehistoric shark (named in the books "megalodon") lurks Mallorca, killing a couple of individuals. A professional diver begins the hunt.', 'A prehistoric shark (named in the books "megalodon") lurks Mallorca, killing a couple of individuals. A professional diver begins the hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abhZdKvx2PMkNtFII9zXngMVNCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10100'),
  ('898433421967965967', 'Shark Bait', 2006, 'Animation, Family', 'Howard E. Baker, Jan Carlee, Andy Wang', 'Scott Clevenger', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Rob Schneider, Evan Rachel Wood, Donal Logue, Andy Dick, Fran Drescher, John Rhys-Davies, R. Lee Ermey', 'G', 'After losing everything, a young fish, Pi, goes to live with his family on the Reef. There he meets the love of his life but finds that she already has the unwanted affections of a bully shark. He must follow his destiny to save her and rid the Reef of this menace for good.', 'After losing everything, a young fish, Pi, goes to live with his family on the Reef. There he meets the love of his life but finds that she already has the unwanted affections of a bully shark. He must follow his destiny to save her and rid the Reef of this menace for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmFSuoUfA1t4xsGKFR6i4kFvmWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19595'),
  ('1122946877291451099', 'Shark Bait', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'James Nunn', 'Nick Saltrese', 'Holly Earl, Jack Trueman, Catherine Hannay, Malachi Pullar-Latchman, Thomas Michael Flynn, Manuel Cauchi, Maxime Durand, Joshua Takacs', null, 'A group of friends enjoying a weekend steal a couple of jetskis racing them out to sea, ending up in a horrific head-on collision. They struggle to find a way home with a badly injured friend while from the waters below predators lurk.', 'A group of friends enjoying a weekend steal a couple of jetskis racing them out to sea, ending up in a horrific head-on collision. They struggle to find a way home with a badly injured friend while from the waters below predators lurk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVVU9zC8snNHlcqYONY2HOsh9ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960258'),
  ('168685512297038607', 'Shark Evil', 2023, 'Horror, Drama, Comedy', 'Joshua Chen Huanxiang', null, 'Tan Xin Zer, Fan Dong, Wei Xiaohuan, Huang Ziling', null, 'A group of poachers provoke the fury of a great white shark. After killing the poachers, the shark sets its sights on a group of friends celebrating their university graduation on a yacht. A life-and-death struggle on the open water ensues.', 'A group of poachers provoke the fury of a great white shark. After killing the poachers, the shark sets its sights on a group of friends celebrating their university graduation on a yacht. A life-and-death struggle on the open water ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qo2Lk44rcAH2N0PHWwHfXoFbtb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370704'),
  ('993984701659148353', 'Shark Exorcist', 2015, 'Horror', 'Donald Farmer', 'Donald Farmer', 'Angela Kerecz, Bobby Kerecz, James Balsamo, Glynne Blackwell, Brad Blanchard, Alaine Huntington, Roni Jonah, Kirstin Vanhooser', null, 'A demonic nun unleashes HOLY HELL when she summons the devil to possess a MAN-EATING SHARK!!', 'A demonic nun unleashes HOLY HELL when she summons the devil to possess a MAN-EATING SHARK!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qL9nOCETCQKWGruXWsH75QDLXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387396'),
  ('889515094134189482', 'Shark Hunters', 1963, 'Drama', 'Luis Alcoriza, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Julio Aldama, Dacia González, Tito Junco, Amanda del Llano, Noé Murayama, Alfredo Varela, Eric del Castillo, Enrique Lucero', null, 'Aurelio is a shark fisherman who works very hard to send money to his family in the city and keep Manela, his young lover on the coast. One day, he decides to move to the big city.', 'Aurelio is a shark fisherman who works very hard to send money to his family in the city and keep Manela, his young lover on the coast. One day, he decides to move to the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4JpELqw4HXoRuIAVQ5KPGhgA3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118010'),
  ('106168554286513618', 'Shark Lake', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Jerry Dugan', 'David Anderson, Gabe Burnstein', 'Dolph Lundgren, Sara Malakul Lane, Lily Brooks O''Briant, Michael Aaron Milligan, Lance E. Nichols, James Chalke, Ibrahim Renno, Miles Doleac', null, 'Meredith Hendricks happens to be the best cop in her quiet town on Lake Tahoe. When a black-market exotic species dealer named Clint is paroled from prison, something he let loose begins to make its presence known. Swimmers and land-lovers alike begin to become part of the food chain at an unbelievable rate. Meredith and her team discover that they''re not just hunting one eating machine, but a whole family of them. Not everyone will make it out alive, but those who do will never forget this summer at Shark Lake.', 'Meredith Hendricks happens to be the best cop in her quiet town on Lake Tahoe. When a black-market exotic species dealer named Clint is paroled from prison, something he let loose begins to make its presence known. Swimmers and land-lovers alike begin to become part of the food chain at an unbelievable rate. Meredith and her team discover that they''re not just hunting one eating machine, but a whole family of them. Not everyone will make it out alive, but those who do will never forget this summer at Shark Lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAvFko64iscEmDQkVnmc8rpmqCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299553'),
  ('260029521795456394', 'Shark Night 3D', 2011, 'Thriller, Horror', 'David R. Ellis, Jeff Dashnaw, Gary Capo', 'Will Hayes, Jesse Studenberg', 'Sara Paxton, Dustin Milligan, Chris Carmack, Katharine McPhee, Joel David Moore, Chris Zylka, Sinqua Walls, Alyssa Diaz', 'PG-13', 'A weekend at a lake house in the Louisiana Gulf turns into a nightmare for seven vacationers as they are subjected to fresh-water shark attacks.', 'A weekend at a lake house in the Louisiana Gulf turns into a nightmare for seven vacationers as they are subjected to fresh-water shark attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjfRqUXtNc2iJHfP60HTq9nFs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65055'),
  ('1147285806398812416', 'Shark Season', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Nicholas Ryan, Dom Poniac, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Mark Atkins', 'Michael Madsen, Paige McGarvin, Juliana Destefano, Jack Pearson, Lauren E. Hubbard, Nicholas Ryan, Christian Frazier, Josh Lovejoy', null, 'Dozens of great white sharks attack the sleepy coastal town of Goldcoast, CA, resulting in several deaths and forcing the town council to bring in a group of marine biologists and shark hunters to solve the problem. But when one shark in particular refuses to go down without a fight, it will take all of the biologists’ and hunters’ knowhow to defeat the creature for good.', 'Dozens of great white sharks attack the sleepy coastal town of Goldcoast, CA, resulting in several deaths and forcing the town council to bring in a group of marine biologists and shark hunters to solve the problem. But when one shark in particular refuses to go down without a fight, it will take all of the biologists’ and hunters’ knowhow to defeat the creature for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Rk7t9K2V3nzUTwfdugw1yOVnHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728069'),
  ('973877320570468348', 'Shark Side of the Moon', 2022, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Tammy Klein, Glenn Campbell, Michael Su', 'Ryan Ebert, Anna Rasmussen', 'Maxi Witrak, Ego Mikitas, Michael Marcel, Tania Fox, Konstantin Podprugin, Lindsey Marie Wilson, Lydia Hunter, Reginald Stalling III', 'R', 'Decades ago, the USSR developed unkillable sharks and launched them to the moon. Today, a team of American astronauts will endure the fight of their lives.', 'Decades ago, the USSR developed unkillable sharks and launched them to the moon. Today, a team of American astronauts will endure the fight of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5CfpzxoJDkZxjZAizClFdlEF0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011679'),
  ('197387142163085556', 'Shark Skin Man and Peach Hip Girl', 1999, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller, Action', 'Katsuhito Ishii, Hiroshi Machida', 'Katsuhito Ishii', 'Tadanobu Asano, Sie Kohinata, Ittoku Kishibe, Susumu Terajima, Kimie Shingyoji, Shingo Tsurumi, Shingoro Yamada, Yôhachi Shimada', null, 'In dreamlike mountain scenery, Toshiko makes a daring escape from her sexually warped Uncle Sonezaki. Fortunately, she met Samehada as she runs for her life, which is also escaping from some slayers. What follows is a wild chase that leads the audience into a comically violent world.', 'In dreamlike mountain scenery, Toshiko makes a daring escape from her sexually warped Uncle Sonezaki. Fortunately, she met Samehada as she runs for her life, which is also escaping from some slayers. What follows is a wild chase that leads the audience into a comically violent world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31rPJUTmffhsKmCT996kKIBflkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36867'),
  ('1053688228596775791', 'Shark Swarm', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Action', 'James A. Contner, Dane Peterson', 'David Rosiak, Matthew Chernov', 'Daryl Hannah, John Schneider, Armand Assante, F. Murray Abraham, Roark Critchlow, Heather McComb, John Enos III, Alan Fudge', null, 'A fisherman and his family fight to take down a greedy real estate developer who has released toxins into the ocean, turning the area''s sharks into bloodthirsty hunters.', 'A fisherman and his family fight to take down a greedy real estate developer who has released toxins into the ocean, turning the area''s sharks into bloodthirsty hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaNa3QHUTZjAWDyvUGtG6hSPIgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100669'),
  ('75968775458477594', 'Shark Tale', 2004, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Gil Zimmerman, Justin Miller, Bibo Bergeron', 'Lona Williams', 'Will Smith, Robert De Niro, Renée Zellweger, Jack Black, Angelina Jolie, Ziggy Marley, Martin Scorsese, David P. Smith', 'PG', 'Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He''s a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.', 'Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He''s a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r08DpyPyhXcJTfNZAICNGMzcQ8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10555'),
  ('631797873577955729', 'Shark Warning', 2024, 'Action, Horror', 'Jimmy Gadd, Marcus Friedlander, Tessa Johnson', 'Ryan Ebert', 'Andrew J Katers, David Chokachi, Angela Cole, Lauren Pike, Rebecca Ritz, Canyon Prince, James Dash, Linh Bui', null, 'After 20 years, a man returns to the town where his brother was killed by a shark. When it resurfaces and kills again, the man goes on a mission to hunt down the predator, making unlikely alliances along the way, in order to stop it once and for all.', 'After 20 years, a man returns to the town where his brother was killed by a shark. When it resurfaces and kills again, the man goes on a mission to hunt down the predator, making unlikely alliances along the way, in order to stop it once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrVyGN0sQCqfN1Xqh7XfU8kToFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321239'),
  ('527751371765238956', 'Shark Waters', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Jake Jalbert, Jadon Cal', 'M. L. Miller', 'Jim Fitzpatrick, Meghan Carrasquillo, Mike Rae Anderson, Jonathan Shores, Brad Worch II, Francesca Shipsey, Tara Phillips, Brandon Laabs', null, 'Great white sharks attack a fishing charter, ramming a hole in the ship’s hull. With the shoreline miles away, those aboard are forced to fight for their lives before they are either drowned or eaten alive.', 'Great white sharks attack a fishing charter, ramming a hole in the ship’s hull. With the shoreline miles away, those aboard are forced to fight for their lives before they are either drowned or eaten alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSvT8vTAtZzgf3uc5QJchLYgtYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011604'),
  ('208969201519647840', 'Shark Whisperer', 2025, 'Documentary', 'JP Stiles, Harrison Macks, James Reed', 'Ocean Ramsey', 'Ocean Ramsey, Juan Oliphant', 'PG-13', 'Marine conservationist and social media activist Ocean Ramsey fearlessly swims with sharks in this documentary about her risky mission to protect them.', 'Marine conservationist and social media activist Ocean Ramsey fearlessly swims with sharks in this documentary about her risky mission to protect them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0WEubJKWTfqYX8laBGIPI07Z7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1491570'),
  ('247903101623506017', 'Shark: The Beginning', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Lee Chol-o, Jin Hyun-woo, Johnny Chae', 'Johnny Chae', 'Kim Min-seok, Wi Ha-jun, Jung Won-chang, Lee Jae-kyoon, Bae Myeong-jin, Lee Jung-hyun, Cha Yeob, Shin Min-jae', null, 'A bullied teenager who is locked up at a juvenile detention center due to an unexpected accident, meets a mixed martial arts champion to break through his own limits.', 'A bullied teenager who is locked up at a juvenile detention center due to an unexpected accident, meets a mixed martial arts champion to break through his own limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3zWv3Ly1Y2NZrGHFaQntCS4MT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801604'),
  ('424082222400708964', 'Sharkansas Women''s Prison Massacre', 2015, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Jim Wynorski, David M. Rakoczy', 'Jim Wynorski, William Dever', 'Dominique Swain, Traci Lords, Christine Nguyen, Cindy Lucas, Amy Holt, John Callahan, Corey Landis, Chris De Christopher', null, 'When a fracking mishap accidentally rips apart the earth’s crust, the resulting hole opens up a gaping underground water way to a vast and mysterious ocean somewhere deep below. Instantly, giant prehistoric sharks begin wending their way upward toward a murky bog in the heart of the Arkansas Bayou. Unfortunately, for a group of female prisoners on a work detail in the swamp, the deadly sharks attack without warning – pinning a hapless group of intended victims in a small deserted cabin in the heart of the wetlands. Death may be the only means of escape!', 'When a fracking mishap accidentally rips apart the earth’s crust, the resulting hole opens up a gaping underground water way to a vast and mysterious ocean somewhere deep below. Instantly, giant prehistoric sharks begin wending their way upward toward a murky bog in the heart of the Arkansas Bayou. Unfortunately, for a group of female prisoners on a work detail in the swamp, the deadly sharks attack without warning – pinning a hapless group of intended victims in a small deserted cabin in the heart of the wetlands. Death may be the only means of escape!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB7jXKuObdVq83JjAC9prIa2pM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335409'),
  ('376854738114274084', 'Sharknado', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Ben Demaree, Esther Elise Johnson', 'Thunder Levin', 'Ian Ziering, Tara Reid, John Heard, Cassie Scerbo, Jaason Simmons, Alex Arleo, Neil H. Berkow, Heather Jocelyn Blair', 'R', 'A freak hurricane hits Los Angeles, causing man-eating sharks to be scooped up in tornadoes and flooding the city with shark-infested seawater. Surfer and bar-owner Fin sets out with his friends Baz and Nova to rescue his estranged wife April and teenage daughter Claudia.', 'A freak hurricane hits Los Angeles, causing man-eating sharks to be scooped up in tornadoes and flooding the city with shark-infested seawater. Surfer and bar-owner Fin sets out with his friends Baz and Nova to rescue his estranged wife April and teenage daughter Claudia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atEmHkVFTSGRYt2PeCiziQqbZnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205321'),
  ('290674986425239865', 'Sharknado 2: The Second One', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Glenn Miller, Anthony C. Ferrante, Ben Demaree', 'Thunder Levin', 'Ian Ziering, Vivica A. Fox, Tara Reid, Judd Hirsch, Courtney Baxter, Kari Wührer, Tiffany Shepis, Richard Kind', null, 'A freak weather system turns its deadly fury on New York City, unleashing a Sharknado on the population and its most cherished, iconic sites - and only Fin and April can save the Big Apple.', 'A freak weather system turns its deadly fury on New York City, unleashing a Sharknado on the population and its most cherished, iconic sites - and only Fin and April can save the Big Apple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GgZOBSNIkxz3qA66Jauv6VvIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248504'),
  ('582743392221962576', 'Sharknado 3: Oh Hell No!', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alexander Coco, Antonio Rios, Danae Stringfellow', 'Thunder Levin', 'Ian Ziering, Cassie Scerbo, Frankie Muniz, Tara Reid, Ryan Whitney, David Hasselhoff, Mark Cuban, Bo Derek', null, 'The sharks take bite out of the East Coast when the sharknado hits Washington, D.C. and Orlando, Florida.', 'The sharks take bite out of the East Coast when the sharknado hits Washington, D.C. and Orlando, Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8qy2CgaSjJYusWy3XkbZieK5aG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331446'),
  ('596338611154116059', 'Sharknado 4: The 4th Awakens', 2016, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Laura Beth Love, Glenn Miller', 'Thunder Levin', 'Ian Ziering, Ryan Whitney, Tara Reid, David Hasselhoff, Gary Busey, Tommy Davidson, Imani Hakim, Cody Linley', null, 'The new installment of the Sharknado franchise takes place 5 years after Sharknado 3: Oh Hell No! There have been no Sharknados in the intervening years, but now they’re appearing again in unexpected ways.', 'The new installment of the Sharknado franchise takes place 5 years after Sharknado 3: Oh Hell No! There have been no Sharknados in the intervening years, but now they’re appearing again in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUbN2ww2T3y3kaW6lf3c5DabE5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390989'),
  ('3028046274594478', 'Sharknado 5: Global Swarming', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Stanimir Stamatov, Anthony C. Ferrante, Ryan Broomberg', 'Scotty Mullen', 'Ian Ziering, Tara Reid, Cassie Scerbo, Masiela Lusha, Olivia Newton-John, Chloe Lattanzi, Billy Barratt, Chris Kattan', null, 'Fin and his wife April travel around the world to save their young son who''s trapped inside a sharknado.', 'Fin and his wife April travel around the world to save their young son who''s trapped inside a sharknado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zB1ZhLWQNiBkRnABbFaULodfEaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438970'),
  ('284393269898515056', 'Sharks in Venice', 2008, 'Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Danny Lerner, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Danny Lerner, Les Weldon', 'Stephen Baldwin, Vanessa Johansson, Hilda van der Meulen, Giacomo Gonnella, Ivaylo Geraskov, Atanas Srebrev, Kaloian Vodenicharov, Bashar Rahal', null, 'The seemingly tranquil waterways of Venice are terrorized by the perfect killing machine. In search of his father who has mysteriously disappeared diving in the city, David stumbles across the cryptic trail leading to the long-lost fortune of the Medici. As the unwitting pawn in a Mafia plot to recover the treasure, David''s girlfriend is kidnapped at gunpoint, plunging him into a desperate race against time. If he has any hope of saving her he must enter the deadly waters. Can David out-gun the Mafia assassins and survive the voracious sharks laying in wait beneath the surface, or will he succumb to the same fate as his father?', 'The seemingly tranquil waterways of Venice are terrorized by the perfect killing machine. In search of his father who has mysteriously disappeared diving in the city, David stumbles across the cryptic trail leading to the long-lost fortune of the Medici. As the unwitting pawn in a Mafia plot to recover the treasure, David''s girlfriend is kidnapped at gunpoint, plunging him into a desperate race against time. If he has any hope of saving her he must enter the deadly waters. Can David out-gun the Mafia assassins and survive the voracious sharks laying in wait beneath the surface, or will he succumb to the same fate as his father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1eLcdXdYuhV38QoH3NrHXfYWCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45009'),
  ('1142970461558185106', 'Sharktopus', 2010, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Declan O''Brien, Santiago Navarrete, Adam Finer', 'Mike MacLean', 'Eric Roberts, Kerem Bürsin, Sara Malakul Lane, Liv Boughn, Héctor Jiménez, Ralph Garman, Shandi Finnessey, Roger Corman', null, 'The U.S. Navy''s special group "Blue Water" builds a half-shark, half-octopus for combat. But the sharktopus escapes and terrorizes the beaches of Puerto Vallarta.', 'The U.S. Navy''s special group "Blue Water" builds a half-shark, half-octopus for combat. But the sharktopus escapes and terrorizes the beaches of Puerto Vallarta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l1W3yZWkWfPKMU768DaiD6UZmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46020'),
  ('893488147298701246', 'Sharktopus vs. Pteracuda', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kevin O''Neill, Hernan Herrera', 'Matt Yamashita', 'Robert Carradine, Tony Evangelista, Rib Hillis, Conan O''Brien, Katie Savoy, Amanda Philipson, Akari Endo, Hector Then', null, 'An American scientist up to no good (as usual) by creating the half-pterodactyl, half-barracuda: Pteracuda. When the creature inevitably escapes, it''s up to Sharktopus to stop him.', 'An American scientist up to no good (as usual) by creating the half-pterodactyl, half-barracuda: Pteracuda. When the creature inevitably escapes, it''s up to Sharktopus to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9tL8K2cb77Cj6yDFlILVdgqDmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284711'),
  ('442649434589857988', 'Sharktopus vs. Whalewolf', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie', 'Kevin O''Neill, Hernan Herrera', 'Matt Yamashita', 'Casper Van Dien, Catherine Oxenberg, Jennifer Wenger, Sarodj Bertin, Akari Endo, Jorge Eduardo De Los Santos, Tony Almont, Mario Arturo Hernández', null, 'When a mad scientist mixes the genes of a killer whale and a wolf, it creates the Whalewolf, and it''s up to Sharktopus to stop it.', 'When a mad scientist mixes the genes of a killer whale and a wolf, it creates the Whalewolf, and it''s up to Sharktopus to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzsZYcM5WSXnpNT9dEZQr4U7oWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344147'),
  ('377080756631572861', 'Sharkwater', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Rob Stewart', 'Rob Stewart', 'Patrick Moore, Erich Ritter, Paul Watson, Rob Stewart, Boris Worm', null, 'Driven by passion fed from a life-long fascination with sharks, Rob Stewart debunks historical stereotypes and media depictions of sharks as bloodthirsty, man-eating monsters and reveals the reality of sharks as pillars in the evolution of the seas.', 'Driven by passion fed from a life-long fascination with sharks, Rob Stewart debunks historical stereotypes and media depictions of sharks as bloodthirsty, man-eating monsters and reveals the reality of sharks as pillars in the evolution of the seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLsTIdlsnJnPioWGiCsLFQzLdzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13894'),
  ('488069782892419216', 'Sharkwater Extinction', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Rob Stewart', 'Rob Stewart', 'Rob Stewart, Paul Watson, Madison Stewart, Les Stroud, Boris Worm, Randall Arauz, Maike Heidemeyer', null, 'Discovering that sharks are being hunted to extinction, and with them the destruction of our life support system - activist and filmmaker Rob Stewart embarks on a dangerous quest to stop the slaughter. Following the sharks - and the money - into the elusive pirate fishing industry, Stewart uncovers a multi-billion dollar scandal that makes us all accomplices in the greatest wildlife massacre ever known.', 'Discovering that sharks are being hunted to extinction, and with them the destruction of our life support system - activist and filmmaker Rob Stewart embarks on a dangerous quest to stop the slaughter. Following the sharks - and the money - into the elusive pirate fishing industry, Stewart uncovers a multi-billion dollar scandal that makes us all accomplices in the greatest wildlife massacre ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovR3P319oFShWQ0G5ioOAeXWMda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539765'),
  ('232254000646106837', 'Sharky''s Machine', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Burt Reynolds, William A. Fraker', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Burt Reynolds, Rachel Ward, Henry Silva, Brian Keith, Vittorio Gassman, Charles Durning, Earl Holliman, Bernie Casey', 'R', 'Police officer Tom Sharky gets busted back to working vice, where he happens upon a scandalous conspiracy involving a local politician. Sharky''s new ''machine'' gathers evidence while Sharky falls in love with a woman he has never met.', 'Police officer Tom Sharky gets busted back to working vice, where he happens upon a scandalous conspiracy involving a local politician. Sharky''s new ''machine'' gathers evidence while Sharky falls in love with a woman he has never met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ardH3Ian8CK7kxyHrmhdx9mb4F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14664'),
  ('552278078802828964', 'Sharm El Sheikh: Un''estate indimenticabile', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Ugo Fabrizio Giordani, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Matteo Albano', 'Alfredo Arciero, Ugo Fabrizio Giordani, Massimiliano Orfei', 'Giorgio Panariello, Enrico Brignano, Maurizio Casagrande, Cecilia Dazzi, Michela Quattrociocche, Laura Torrisi, Hassani Shapi, Fioretta Mari', null, 'An insurance agent, in order to save his job, leaves with his family for the trendy Egyptian resort of Sharm El Sheikh, where his boss will also spend the holidays.', 'An insurance agent, in order to save his job, leaves with his family for the trendy Egyptian resort of Sharm El Sheikh, where his boss will also spend the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK9jaSAnZqSxibuy897ssdxaUwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53840'),
  ('817278957544619571', 'Sharmaji Namkeen', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tarandeep Bajaj, Honey Trehan, Harendra Singh', 'Supratik Sen, Hitesh Bhatia', 'Rishi Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Satish Kaushik, Suhail Nayyar, Taaruk Raina, Isha Talwar, Sheeba Chaddha', null, 'Late Rishi Kapoor in his swansong plays B. G. Sharma, a 58-year old middle-class widower living in West Delhi. After being laid off from the company he has worked for his entire life, Sharmaji struggles to deal with the beast called retirement. His struggle to stay relevant in front of his two sons finally ends when he rekindles his love for cooking through a kitty party. A bunch of merry women rekindle in Sharma, a passion for cooking and chutzpah in general, that help him find his true calling.', 'Late Rishi Kapoor in his swansong plays B. G. Sharma, a 58-year old middle-class widower living in West Delhi. After being laid off from the company he has worked for his entire life, Sharmaji struggles to deal with the beast called retirement. His struggle to stay relevant in front of his two sons finally ends when he rekindles his love for cooking through a kitty party. A bunch of merry women rekindle in Sharma, a passion for cooking and chutzpah in general, that help him find his true calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xve92SlbFCl4eEESx78eutq6rjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870387'),
  ('452588756416964301', 'Sharp Corner', 2025, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Jason Buxton, Guy Godfree, Rob Cotterill', 'Jason Buxton', 'Ben Foster, Cobie Smulders, William Kosovic, Gavin Drea, Emily Jewer, Susan Leblanc-Crawford, Sebastien Labelle, Rudy Harris', 'NR', 'A dedicated family man becomes obsessed with saving the lives of the car accident victims on the sharp corner in front of his house – an obsession that could cost him everything.', 'A dedicated family man becomes obsessed with saving the lives of the car accident victims on the sharp corner in front of his house – an obsession that could cost him everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuYg70w27rSgcE14NW9pPRDRXY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244890'),
  ('808854914488306310', 'Sharp Stick', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexandra Lambrinidis, Jeff Goodell, Ashley Connor', 'Lena Dunham', 'Kristine Froseth, Jon Bernthal, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Taylour Paige, Scott Speedman, Luka Sabbat, Lena Dunham, Ebon Moss-Bachrach', null, 'Sarah Jo is a naive 26-year-old living on the fringes of Hollywood with her mother and sister. When she begins an affair with her older employer, she is thrust into an education on sexuality, loss and power.', 'Sarah Jo is a naive 26-year-old living on the fringes of Hollywood with her mother and sister. When she begins an affair with her older employer, she is thrust into an education on sexuality, loss and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqPILOj6IAcoCYPE6vqGDQJtlUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801913'),
  ('872304382896419796', 'Sharpay''s Fabulous Adventure', 2011, 'Family, Music', 'Michael Lembeck, Ousama Rawi, Andrew Shea', 'Robert Horn', 'Ashley French, Austin Butler, Cameron Goodman, Bradley Steven Perry, Alec Mapa, Jack Plotnick, Robert Curtis Brown, Jessica Tuck', 'G', 'After a talent scout spots her performing with her dog Boi at a charity gala, Sharpay Evans sets off for the bright lights of NYC, convinced instant fame and fortune are in the bag. But theatre''s a dog-eat-dog world. Fortunately, Sharpay also meets Peyton, a handsome student filmmaker who finds Sharpay nearly as fascinating as she finds herself.', 'After a talent scout spots her performing with her dog Boi at a charity gala, Sharpay Evans sets off for the bright lights of NYC, convinced instant fame and fortune are in the bag. But theatre''s a dog-eat-dog world. Fortunately, Sharpay also meets Peyton, a handsome student filmmaker who finds Sharpay nearly as fascinating as she finds herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPtBzBKCCvByXue1AZrG2lrxm4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60405'),
  ('186164354390499007', 'Sharpe''s Battle', 1995, 'War, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Russell Lewis', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Hugh Ross, Hugh Fraser, Ian McNeice, Oliver Cotton, Jason Salkey, John Tams', null, 'When Sharpe is ordered to whip the King of Spain''s Irish Royal Brigade into shape, he faces dissent from the men who believe the British are slaughtering their relatives in Ireland and a spy from within.', 'When Sharpe is ordered to whip the King of Spain''s Irish Royal Brigade into shape, he faces dissent from the men who believe the British are slaughtering their relatives in Ireland and a spy from within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zZ2b0cSnfSwXLByumjyM0ssruj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75137'),
  ('1093660029295166702', 'Sharpe''s Challenge', 2006, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Russell Lewis', 'Sean Bean, Padma Lakshmi, Daragh O''Malley, Toby Stephens, Lucy Brown, Michael Cochrane, Hugh Fraser, Nicholas Blane', null, 'Sean Bean is back as the swashbuckling hero in Sharpe''s Challenge, an action packed mini-series to be shot on location in Rajasthan, India. Two years after the Duke of Wellington crushes Napoleon at Waterloo, dispatches from India tell of a local Maharaja, Khande Rao, who is threatening British interests there. Wellington sends Sharpe to investigate on what turns out to be his most dangerous mission to date. When a beautiful general''s daughter is kidnapped by the Indian warlord, the tension mounts, leaving Sharpe no option but to pursue the enemy right into its deadly lair. Deep in the heart of enemy territory he also has to keep at bay the beautiful but scheming Regent, Madhuvanthi, who is out to seduce him. The fate of an Empire and the life of a General''s daughter lie in one man''s hands...', 'Sean Bean is back as the swashbuckling hero in Sharpe''s Challenge, an action packed mini-series to be shot on location in Rajasthan, India. Two years after the Duke of Wellington crushes Napoleon at Waterloo, dispatches from India tell of a local Maharaja, Khande Rao, who is threatening British interests there. Wellington sends Sharpe to investigate on what turns out to be his most dangerous mission to date. When a beautiful general''s daughter is kidnapped by the Indian warlord, the tension mounts, leaving Sharpe no option but to pursue the enemy right into its deadly lair. Deep in the heart of enemy territory he also has to keep at bay the beautiful but scheming Regent, Madhuvanthi, who is out to seduce him. The fate of an Empire and the life of a General''s daughter lie in one man''s hands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q3NldV0WViNzNy8td2BFUVzcFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75634'),
  ('411769506330222581', 'Sharpe''s Company', 1994, 'War, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Charles Wood', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Hugh Fraser, Michael Byrne, Pete Postlethwaite, Assumpta Serna, Clive Francis, Nicholas Jones', null, 'Spain 1812 The Duke of Wellington plans to lay siege to Badajoz. A murderous figure from Sharpe''s past uses a beautiful woman revenge himself on Sharpe, now the father of her child. Sharpe has reason to be happy, he holds his daughter for the first time and is given command of the Light Company again, together with his captaincy. But will his happiness be short lived?', 'Spain 1812 The Duke of Wellington plans to lay siege to Badajoz. A murderous figure from Sharpe''s past uses a beautiful woman revenge himself on Sharpe, now the father of her child. Sharpe has reason to be happy, he holds his daughter for the first time and is given command of the Light Company again, together with his captaincy. But will his happiness be short lived?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aDGMHUAZVAejI6SCq2B0DKrNDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74405'),
  ('293427736832335472', 'Sharpe''s Eagle', 1993, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Brian Cox, Daragh O''Malley, Assumpta Serna, Michael Cochrane, David Troughton, Daniel Craig, John Tams', null, 'Sharpe is a Captain saddled with the South Essex, a battalion run by incompetents and filled with soldiers who have never been in battle. When the South Essex loses its colours (its regimental flag), Sharpe vows to save the honor of the regiment by capturing a French Imperial standard: an eagle.', 'Sharpe is a Captain saddled with the South Essex, a battalion run by incompetents and filled with soldiers who have never been in battle. When the South Essex loses its colours (its regimental flag), Sharpe vows to save the honor of the regiment by capturing a French Imperial standard: an eagle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKNdqtM7C0F6WaPwZjbPKLHCdTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69787'),
  ('608554338720832538', 'Sharpe''s Enemy', 1994, 'War, History, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Hugh Fraser, Pete Postlethwaite, Assumpta Serna, Elizabeth Hurley, Helena Michell, Michael Byrne', null, 'Portugal 1813. A band of deserters, including Sharpe''s old enemy, Obadiah Hakeswill, have captured two women, one the wife of a high-ranking English officer, and are holding them hostage for ransom. Sharpe is given the 60th Rifles and a Rocket troop, as well as his majority to rescue the women. But while Sharpe may be able to deal with his old enemy, he has yet to face a newer threat, the French Major Pierre Ducos.', 'Portugal 1813. A band of deserters, including Sharpe''s old enemy, Obadiah Hakeswill, have captured two women, one the wife of a high-ranking English officer, and are holding them hostage for ransom. Sharpe is given the 60th Rifles and a Rocket troop, as well as his majority to rescue the women. But while Sharpe may be able to deal with his old enemy, he has yet to face a newer threat, the French Major Pierre Ducos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNWnWxp7FsyLgdNsnnnmxpqc15o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75133'),
  ('1079817989230202202', 'Sharpe''s Gold', 1995, 'War, TV Movie, Adventure, Action, History', 'Tom Clegg', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Hugh Fraser, John Tams, Michael Mears, Jason Salkey, Hugh Ross, Lyndon Davies', null, 'Sharpe is sent on a mission to exchange rifles for deserters with a strange band of Spanish guerillas. He also has to chaperone two women looking for their missing husband.', 'Sharpe is sent on a mission to exchange rifles for deserters with a strange band of Spanish guerillas. He also has to chaperone two women looking for their missing husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLTolubxEYMzr7pVbrCg58zbTBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75136'),
  ('534151255754348125', 'Sharpe''s Honour', 1994, 'War, History, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Colin MacDonald', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Alice Krige, Nickolas Grace, Féodor Atkine, Hugh Fraser, Michael Byrne, John Tams', null, '1813. Major Sharpe''s old enemy, Major Ducos manipulates a beautiful young marquesa into falsely accusing Sharpe of rape. Her husband calls Sharpe out in a duel. But when the husband is found dead the next morning, Sharpe is arrested and brought before a court martial, and it seems not even Patrick Harper and the Chosen Men can save Sharpe from a hanging, or rescue his honour', '1813. Major Sharpe''s old enemy, Major Ducos manipulates a beautiful young marquesa into falsely accusing Sharpe of rape. Her husband calls Sharpe out in a duel. But when the husband is found dead the next morning, Sharpe is arrested and brought before a court martial, and it seems not even Patrick Harper and the Chosen Men can save Sharpe from a hanging, or rescue his honour', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2yWjH9VVhqUod2HjJdOxlirIo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75134'),
  ('464100916381920724', 'Sharpe''s Justice', 1997, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Patrick Harbinson', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, Caroline Langrishe, Philip Glenister, John Tams, Alexis Denisof, Douglas Henshall', null, 'Napoleon has been exiled to Elba, the English have returned from the wars, and Major Richard Sharpe finds himself in a sort of exile to lead a company of Yorkshire Yeomen. His duties include protecting mill owners from restless workers who are on the verge of strike or outright revolt. Meanwhile, Sharpe''s faithless wife and her lover fall within range of Sharpe''s wrath. Sharpe, with his two of his devoted Chosen Men nearby, must decide whether to continue to protect the mill owners or to take the side of their fiercely downtrodden workers.', 'Napoleon has been exiled to Elba, the English have returned from the wars, and Major Richard Sharpe finds himself in a sort of exile to lead a company of Yorkshire Yeomen. His duties include protecting mill owners from restless workers who are on the verge of strike or outright revolt. Meanwhile, Sharpe''s faithless wife and her lover fall within range of Sharpe''s wrath. Sharpe, with his two of his devoted Chosen Men nearby, must decide whether to continue to protect the mill owners or to take the side of their fiercely downtrodden workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gSrftajShSSvLvRztIDIOyL9mC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75146'),
  ('281617978413067908', 'Sharpe''s Mission', 1996, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, James Laurenson, Mark Strong, John Tams, Hugh Fraser, Jason Salkey', null, 'Sharpe is teamed with a Colonel he helped promote and they are tasked to destroy a powder magazine, but an alliance with the French may threaten their success. Meanwhile, Jane is wearying of the army life and Harper and Ramona are at odds.', 'Sharpe is teamed with a Colonel he helped promote and they are tasked to destroy a powder magazine, but an alliance with the French may threaten their success. Meanwhile, Jane is wearying of the army life and Harper and Ramona are at odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXp1fNEvI2xma60t25bX2wKrWDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75143'),
  ('145788208482052017', 'Sharpe''s Peril', 2008, 'War, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Tom Clegg', 'Russell Lewis', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Michael Cochrane, Velibor Topic, Beatrice Rosen, Raza Jaffrey, Steve Speirs, Jonny Coyne', null, 'Our story begins at the end of Sharpe''s Challenge. Sharpe and Harper are en route to Madras when they encounter a baggage train from the East India Company traveling through hostile territory. Chitu, a legendary bandit leader in control of the area, strikes fear in the members of the party. When an attack occurs Sharpe takes control of the situation, leading the group 300 miles through enemy territory and training the disorganized, rag-tag group to be proper soldiers. Despite all these responsibilities, Sharpe still manages to find time for a little romance...', 'Our story begins at the end of Sharpe''s Challenge. Sharpe and Harper are en route to Madras when they encounter a baggage train from the East India Company traveling through hostile territory. Chitu, a legendary bandit leader in control of the area, strikes fear in the members of the party. When an attack occurs Sharpe takes control of the situation, leading the group 300 miles through enemy territory and training the disorganized, rag-tag group to be proper soldiers. Despite all these responsibilities, Sharpe still manages to find time for a little romance...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsRwkujS1IxlTVvoOshgmlvS3MB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79451'),
  ('994840009793901022', 'Sharpe''s Regiment', 1996, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Charles Wood', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, Michael Cochrane, Caroline Langrishe, James Laurenson, John Tams, Nicholas Farrell', null, 'Told his battalion is to be split up due to lack of recruits at home, Sharpe and Harper return to England to investigate. What should have been a simple query turns politically explosive as they come nearer to exposing profiteering on the home front that could jeopardize the Wellington''s war.', 'Told his battalion is to be split up due to lack of recruits at home, Sharpe and Harper return to England to investigate. What should have been a simple query turns politically explosive as they come nearer to exposing profiteering on the home front that could jeopardize the Wellington''s war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8gqXJMoRs3ccKKcR76ObRkbxno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75140'),
  ('1011402947516825208', 'Sharpe''s Revenge', 1997, 'War, Action, Adventure, History, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Bernard Cornwell, Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, Philip Whitchurch, Cécile Paoli, Féodor Atkine, James Laurenson, John Benfield', null, 'Sharpe is framed as the thief who stole Napolean''s gold, and he must clear his name to avoid execution. Meanwhile his wife Jane - urged on by a friend - makes some questionable choices.', 'Sharpe is framed as the thief who stole Napolean''s gold, and he must clear his name to avoid execution. Meanwhile his wife Jane - urged on by a friend - makes some questionable choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73Dc0mkQNiFLXfh1LODd2HPTJdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108794'),
  ('108267077344923937', 'Sharpe''s Rifles', 1993, 'War, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg, Ivan Strasburg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Brian Cox, Daragh O''Malley, Assumpta Serna, David Troughton, John Tams, Jason Salkey, Michael Mears', null, 'During the Peninsular War in Spain against the French, Sergeant Richard Sharpe saves the life of Arthur Wellesley, the future Duke of Wellington and is promoted to Lieutenant. In order to pay the troops Wellesley needs a money draft from the banker Rothschild, but fears he has been captured by the French and sends Sharpe behind enemy lines to find him. Sharpe is given command of a platoon of crack riflemen, led by the surly Irishman Harper and including Hagman and Harris, who resent Sharpe as not being a ''proper officer''.', 'During the Peninsular War in Spain against the French, Sergeant Richard Sharpe saves the life of Arthur Wellesley, the future Duke of Wellington and is promoted to Lieutenant. In order to pay the troops Wellesley needs a money draft from the banker Rothschild, but fears he has been captured by the French and sends Sharpe behind enemy lines to find him. Sharpe is given command of a platoon of crack riflemen, led by the surly Irishman Harper and including Hagman and Harris, who resent Sharpe as not being a ''proper officer''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqlInABgkRM4sldonrEcAeJZaXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70133'),
  ('38297044125626732', 'Sharpe''s Siege', 1996, 'War, Action, Adventure, TV Movie, History', 'Tom Clegg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, James Laurenson, Féodor Atkine, Christian Brendel, Christopher Villiers, Amira Casar', null, 'Sharpe, with his new commanding officer, is sent to capture a castle when news comes of locals who will rise against Bonaparte. However, he is somewhat distracted by thoughts of his wife whom he was forced to leave while stricken with fever.', 'Sharpe, with his new commanding officer, is sent to capture a castle when news comes of locals who will rise against Bonaparte. However, he is somewhat distracted by thoughts of his wife whom he was forced to leave while stricken with fever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2Yri1KKRr19rkNtfBwZJAgwq2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75142'),
  ('845666740523633592', 'Sharpe''s Sword', 1995, 'War, History, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg', 'Eoghan Harris', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Hugh Ross, John Tams, Michael Cochrane, Emily Mortimer, Jason Salkey, James Purefoy', null, 'Sharpe is tasked to protect the most important spy in Lord Wellington''s network, but domestic issues, a traumatized young girl, and possible French spies all threaten his success', 'Sharpe is tasked to protect the most important spy in Lord Wellington''s network, but domestic issues, a traumatized young girl, and possible French spies all threaten his success', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSwS9DKt8mLZV1itBOzE8YgELZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75138'),
  ('396555429583376172', 'Sharpe''s Waterloo', 1997, 'War, Action, Adventure, TV Movie, History', 'Tom Clegg', 'Charles Wood', 'Sean Bean, Daragh O''Malley, Abigail Cruttenden, Cécile Paoli, Paul Bettany, Alexis Denisof, Hugh Fraser, John Tams', null, 'Based on the novel by Bernard Cornwell, "Sharpe''s Waterloo" brings maverick British officer Lt. Col. Richard Sharpe to his last fight against the French, in June of 1815.', 'Based on the novel by Bernard Cornwell, "Sharpe''s Waterloo" brings maverick British officer Lt. Col. Richard Sharpe to his last fight against the French, in June of 1815.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NGDArvQGsVvgoZYVLPHkYP6VFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75147'),
  ('137490918095791237', 'Sharper', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Benjamin Caron, Jurasama Arunchai, Nithya Shrinivasan', 'Alessandro Tanaka, Brian Gatewood', 'Julianne Moore, Sebastian Stan, Justice Smith, Briana Middleton, John Lithgow, Darren Goldstein, Phillip Johnson Richardson, Kerry Flanagan', 'R', 'A small, wealthy family in New York City gets progressively torn apart by secrets, lies, and the theft that orchestrates all of it.', 'A small, wealthy family in New York City gets progressively torn apart by secrets, lies, and the theft that orchestrates all of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tq8x5F17q95T1j0up5rpzXFAylN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717980'),
  ('870753053847178691', 'Sharpshooter', 2007, 'TV Movie, Action, Thriller', 'Armand Mastroianni, Dane Peterson', 'Steven H. Berman', 'James Remar, Mario Van Peebles, Catherine Mary Stewart, Bruce Boxleitner, Al Sapienza, Victoria De Mare, Dominic Rains', 'NR', 'An assassin working for the CIA decides to take one final job before quitting only to find out that he is the target of his CIA boss.', 'An assassin working for the CIA decides to take one final job before quitting only to find out that he is the target of his CIA boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBMQ3fWZaAC4xrNk3FTcxAfU1YK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22672'),
  ('357738279324819535', 'Shatak', 2026, 'Drama, History', 'Aashish Mall', 'Anil Agarwal, Utsav Dan, Rohit Gahlowt', 'Ajay Devgn, Swapnil Parjane', null, 'The narrative covers a century of institutional history, revealing how a small group expanded its mission and membership to achieve widespread influence.', 'The narrative covers a century of institutional history, revealing how a small group expanded its mission and membership to achieve widespread influence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fel9P81GOvCmD7RFf2TcLJEtUJ1n.jpg', 'plex:movie:shatak'),
  ('840648212368769648', 'Shatter', 1974, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Godfrey Ho, Michael Carreras, Monte Hellman', 'Don Houghton', 'Stuart Whitman, Ti Lung, Lily Li, Peter Cushing, Anton Diffring, Ko Hung, Keung Hon, James Ma Chim-Si', 'R', 'Shatter, an international contract killer, has been assigned to assassinate the President of a small African country and collect his fee from a bank in the Far East. On arrival in Hong Kong his life is threatened and when the bank denies all knowledge of payment arrangements, he realises he has been drawn into a dangerous game where there are no rules. Amongst the players are the Mafia and several foreign intelligence services and the stakes being played for are deadly.', 'Shatter, an international contract killer, has been assigned to assassinate the President of a small African country and collect his fee from a bank in the Far East. On arrival in Hong Kong his life is threatened and when the bank denies all knowledge of payment arrangements, he realises he has been drawn into a dangerous game where there are no rules. Amongst the players are the Mafia and several foreign intelligence services and the stakes being played for are deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aymvVJWMLqJAp1hGvUTEHRSRZwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93754'),
  ('353785114370305238', 'Shatter Dead', 1994, 'Horror', 'Scooter McCrae, Matthew M. Howe', 'Scooter McCrae', 'Stark Raven, Flora Fauna, Daniel ''Smalls'' Johnson, Robert Wells, John Weiner, Marina Del Rey, Jeff Kushner, Sharon Kingston', null, 'In a dystopian world where the dead no longer stay dead, a young woman struggles to return home to her boyfriend.', 'In a dystopian world where the dead no longer stay dead, a young woman struggles to return home to her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Zhu6zmkVT9NjRcOm2U970Buqqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85024'),
  ('469926661622429243', 'Shattered', 1921, 'Drama', 'Lupu Pick, Friedrich Weinmann', 'Lupu Pick, Carl Mayer', 'Werner Krauss, Edith Posca, Hermine Straßmann-Witt, Paul Otto, Lupu Pick', null, 'The everyday lives of a poverty-stricken railway trackman, his wife and daughter in a remote, isolated house in a winter landscape. One day, they receive a telegram announcing the arrival of the section inspector, who is to live with the family. After his arrival, a downward spiral begins.', 'The everyday lives of a poverty-stricken railway trackman, his wife and daughter in a remote, isolated house in a winter landscape. One day, they receive a telegram announcing the arrival of the section inspector, who is to live with the family. After his arrival, a downward spiral begins.', null, 'tmdb:movie:175437'),
  ('638917675984117739', 'Shattered', 1991, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Petersen, László Kovács, Dick Ziker', 'Wolfgang Petersen', 'Tom Berenger, Bob Hoskins, Greta Scacchi, Joanne Whalley, Corbin Bernsen, Debi A. Monahan, Bert Rosario, Jedda Jones', 'R', 'Dan Merrick comes out from a shattering car accident with amnesia. He finds that he is married to Judith who is trying to help him start his life again. He keeps getting flashbacks about events and places that he can''t remember. He meets pet shop owner and part time private detective Gus Klein who has supposedly done some work for him prior to the accident. Klein helps Merrick to find out more...', 'Dan Merrick comes out from a shattering car accident with amnesia. He finds that he is married to Judith who is trying to help him start his life again. He keeps getting flashbacks about events and places that he can''t remember. He meets pet shop owner and part time private detective Gus Klein who has supposedly done some work for him prior to the accident. Klein helps Merrick to find out more...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3UaQNJ8FAUaHgDhPyT3uEiod8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2071'),
  ('444876018306688218', 'Shattered', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Luis Prieto, Juan Miguel Azpiroz', 'David Loughery', 'Cameron Monaghan, Lilly Krug, Frank Grillo, Sasha Luss, John Malkovich, Ridley Asha Bateman, Ash Santos, Dat Phan', 'R', 'Chris, a wealthy divorcee, lives in a high-tech house of his own design in Montana. His life changes when he meets Sky, a mysterious young woman who draws him out of his shell and moves in after Chris is injured.', 'Chris, a wealthy divorcee, lives in a high-tech house of his own design in Montana. His life changes when he meets Sky, a mysterious young woman who draws him out of his shell and moves in after Chris is injured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6buNalHVFyBRQFLQKqzkvshQWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844398'),
  ('308242342850449329', 'Shattered Glass', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Billy Ray, Mandy Walker, Phedon Papamichael', 'Billy Ray', 'Hayden Christensen, Peter Sarsgaard, Chloë Sevigny, Rosario Dawson, Melanie Lynskey, Hank Azaria, Steve Zahn, Mark Blum', 'PG-13', 'The true story of fraudulent Washington, D.C. journalist Stephen Glass, who rose to meteoric heights as a young writer in his 20s, becoming a staff writer at The New Republic for three years. Looking for a short cut to fame, Glass concocted sources, quotes and even entire stories, but his deception did not go unnoticed forever, and eventually, his world came crumbling down.', 'The true story of fraudulent Washington, D.C. journalist Stephen Glass, who rose to meteoric heights as a young writer in his 20s, becoming a staff writer at The New Republic for three years. Looking for a short cut to fame, Glass concocted sources, quotes and even entire stories, but his deception did not go unnoticed forever, and eventually, his world came crumbling down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekHG7UsZVxBUGGa0NvxrBXtZVuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13537'),
  ('1094396326649898487', 'Shattered Image', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz, Robby Müller', 'Duane Poole', 'William Baldwin, Anne Parillaud, Lisanne Falk, Graham Greene, Bulle Ogier, Rick Ravanello, Peter Hanlon, Marc Akerstream', null, 'Confusing realities surface in this paranoid film dealing with the fragile nature of a young woman recovering from rape and an apparent attempted suicide. In one reality, she is a killer destroyer of men. In another she is the new wife on a Jamaican honeymoon with her husband (William Baldwin), who is trying to help her recover. Which is real is the question as the story unfolds.', 'Confusing realities surface in this paranoid film dealing with the fragile nature of a young woman recovering from rape and an apparent attempted suicide. In one reality, she is a killer destroyer of men. In another she is the new wife on a Jamaican honeymoon with her husband (William Baldwin), who is trying to help her recover. Which is real is the question as the story unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvlr7rwFilRQDxXdLVFdSR2M01N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125762'),
  ('425439840480046039', 'Shattered Soul', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Soykut Turan', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Nükhet Bıçakçı, Ebru Hacıoğlu', 'Demet Evgar, Tamer Karadağlı, Levent Üzümcü, Salih Güney, Mine Çayıroğlu, Haldun Boysan, Engin Hepileri, Arda Kural', null, 'As dismembered legs begin appearing across Istanbul, Commissioner Fatih and his partner Doruk—a U.S.-trained forensic psychiatrist—race to catch the killer, even as Doruk’s wife Beyza, haunted by mysterious blackouts, discovers a chilling connection between her missing time and the victims.', 'As dismembered legs begin appearing across Istanbul, Commissioner Fatih and his partner Doruk—a U.S.-trained forensic psychiatrist—race to catch the killer, even as Doruk’s wife Beyza, haunted by mysterious blackouts, discovers a chilling connection between her missing time and the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EV5nkwpxnIA9K9Vg4D5JaKqi55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33951'),
  ('216940020446134544', 'Shaun of the Dead', 2004, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Edgar Wright, David M. Dunlap, Richard Hewitt', 'Simon Pegg, Edgar Wright', 'Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Kate Ashfield, Lucy Davis, Dylan Moran, Jessica Hynes, Penelope Wilton, Bill Nighy', 'R', 'Shaun lives a supremely uneventful life, which revolves around his girlfriend, his mother, and, above all, his local pub. This gentle routine is threatened when the dead return to life and make strenuous attempts to snack on ordinary Londoners.', 'Shaun lives a supremely uneventful life, which revolves around his girlfriend, his mother, and, above all, his local pub. This gentle routine is threatened when the dead return to life and make strenuous attempts to snack on ordinary Londoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgXPhzNJH8HFTBjXPB177yNx6RI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747'),
  ('1016670930715666795', 'Shaun the Sheep Movie', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Mark Burton, Dave Alex Riddett, Charles Copping', 'Mark Burton, Richard Starzak', 'Justin Fletcher, John Sparkes, Omid Djalili, Rich Webber, Kate Harbour, Tim Hands, Simon Greenall, Andy Nyman', 'PG', 'When Shaun decides to take the day off and have some fun, he gets a little more action than he bargained for. A mix up with the Farmer, a caravan and a very steep hill lead them all to the Big City and it''s up to Shaun and the flock to return everyone safely to the green grass of home.', 'When Shaun decides to take the day off and have some fun, he gets a little more action than he bargained for. A mix up with the Farmer, a caravan and a very steep hill lead them all to the Big City and it''s up to Shaun and the flock to return everyone safely to the green grass of home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GMvKNy2Ht5QwI0oV0ycYnxzWdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263109'),
  ('769312938098641727', 'Shaun the Sheep: The Farmer''s Llamas', 2015, 'TV Movie, Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Charles Copping, Jay Grace', 'Richard Starzak, Nick Vincent Murphy, Lee Pressman', 'Justin Fletcher, John Sparkes, Sean Connolly, Chris Grimes, Kate Harbour, Simon Greenall, Andy Nyman, Emma Tate', null, 'Shaun bluffs his dimwitted farmer master into bidding for three llamas at a county fair. Once they arrive, however, they cause such chaotic destructive mayhem that Shaun has to carefully remove them – high-speed chases, careful rooftop scrambles and dangerous falls ensue.', 'Shaun bluffs his dimwitted farmer master into bidding for three llamas at a county fair. Once they arrive, however, they cause such chaotic destructive mayhem that Shaun has to carefully remove them – high-speed chases, careful rooftop scrambles and dangerous falls ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21laLCk0pmTKpLybSFPwZUFNSD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374252'),
  ('939968722283314247', 'Shaun the Sheep: The Flight Before Christmas', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Sam Morris, Steve Cox', 'Mark Burton, Giles Pilbrow', 'Justin Fletcher, John Sparkes, Kate Harbour, Laura Aikman, Marcus Brigstocke, Anna Leong Brophy, Simon Greenall, Andy Nyman', 'G', 'Shaun''s seasonal excitement turns to dismay when a farmhouse raid to get bigger stockings for the flock inadvertently leads to Timmy going missing. Can Shaun get Timmy back before he becomes someone else’s present?', 'Shaun''s seasonal excitement turns to dismay when a farmhouse raid to get bigger stockings for the flock inadvertently leads to Timmy going missing. Can Shaun get Timmy back before he becomes someone else’s present?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eh6Yv6bAU2ghHxP1zgUlMfaOR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785545'),
