  ('666734115832219058', 'She', 1935, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lansing C. Holden, Irving Pichel, J. Roy Hunt', null, 'Helen Gahagan, Randolph Scott, Helen Mack, Nigel Bruce, Lumsden Hare, Samuel S. Hinds, Noble Johnson, Gustav von Seyffertitz', 'NR', 'Leo Vincey, told by his dying uncle of a lost land visited 500 years ago by his ancestor, heads out with family friend Horace Holly to try to discover the land and its secret of immortality, said to be contained within a mystic fire. Picking up Tanya, a guide''s daughter, in the frozen Russian arctic, they stumble upon Kor, revealed to be a hidden civilization ruled over by an immortal queen, called She, who believes Vincey is her long-lost lover John Vincey, Leo''s ancestor.', 'Leo Vincey, told by his dying uncle of a lost land visited 500 years ago by his ancestor, heads out with family friend Horace Holly to try to discover the land and its secret of immortality, said to be contained within a mystic fire. Picking up Tanya, a guide''s daughter, in the frozen Russian arctic, they stumble upon Kor, revealed to be a hidden civilization ruled over by an immortal queen, called She, who believes Vincey is her long-lost lover John Vincey, Leo''s ancestor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziqvOkl1pfOxx3SH8EElx9V1lZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60566'),
  ('425043171320941708', 'She', 1965, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Robert Day, Harry Waxman, Don Mingaye', 'David T. Chantler', 'Ursula Andress, Peter Cushing, Bernard Cribbins, John Richardson, Rosenda Monteros, Christopher Lee, André Morell, Soraya Esfandiary-Bakhtiari', 'NR', 'The lost city of Kuma is ruled by the cruel, arrogant, beautiful queen, Ayesha, gifted with eternal life. She lures Leo Vincey into her world, seeing in him the reincarnation of the lover she long ago murdered in a fit of violent jealousy. Against all advice Leo is determined to stay and Ayesha persuades him to bathe in the flame of eternal youth... with disastrous consequences.', 'The lost city of Kuma is ruled by the cruel, arrogant, beautiful queen, Ayesha, gifted with eternal life. She lures Leo Vincey into her world, seeing in him the reincarnation of the lover she long ago murdered in a fit of violent jealousy. Against all advice Leo is determined to stay and Ayesha persuades him to bathe in the flame of eternal youth... with disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foCvE8j9WeEYBR7SiHqkjHX68Kn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17604'),
  ('593567786242246442', 'She', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Avi Nesher, Sandro Mancori', 'Avi Nesher', 'Sandahl Bergman, David Goss, Quin Kessler, Harrison Muller Jr., Elena Wiedermann, Gordon Mitchell, Laurie Sherman, Andrew McLeay', null, 'In a backward post-apocalyptic world, She aids two brothers'' quest to rescue their kidnapped sister. Along the way, they battle orgiastic werewolves, a psychic communist, a tutu-wearing giant, a mad scientist, and gladiators before standing against the odds to defeat the evil Norks.', 'In a backward post-apocalyptic world, She aids two brothers'' quest to rescue their kidnapped sister. Along the way, they battle orgiastic werewolves, a psychic communist, a tutu-wearing giant, a mad scientist, and gladiators before standing against the odds to defeat the evil Norks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4IHaMTl89DKvY1wdzbiig7WkDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47345'),
