  ('425730823942182392', 'She Came to Me', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Josh Muzaffer, Sam Levy, Rebecca Miller', 'Rebecca Miller', 'Peter Dinklage, Anne Hathaway, Marisa Tomei, Evan Ellison, Harlow Jane, Joanna Kulig, Brian d''Arcy James, Judy Gold', 'R', 'Composer Steven Lauddem is plagued by a creative block which leaves him unable to finish the score for his big comeback opera. When his former therapist-turned-wife Patricia suggests he rekindle his creativity by getting lost in the city, Steven sets out in search of inspiration. His epiphany comes after he meets a spirited woman named Katrina and discovers his life has much more potential than he bargained for, or ever could have imagined.', 'Composer Steven Lauddem is plagued by a creative block which leaves him unable to finish the score for his big comeback opera. When his former therapist-turned-wife Patricia suggests he rekindle his creativity by getting lost in the city, Steven sets out in search of inspiration. His epiphany comes after he meets a spirited woman named Katrina and discovers his life has much more potential than he bargained for, or ever could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lG18RqCK8qTk7R5jA1L7ZRMWXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503417'),
