  ('1018881549215339088', 'She Is Conann', 2023, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Vincent Ridelle, Harald Rude, Justine Thomas', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn, Julia Riedler, Claire Duburcq, Christa Théret, Sandra Parfait, Agata Buzek, Nathalie Richard, Françoise Brion', 'NR', 'Traveling through the abyss, underworld dog Rainer recounts the six lives of Conann, perpetually put to death by her own future, across eras, myths and ages. From her childhood, a slave of Sanja and her barbarian horde, to her accession to the summits of cruelty at the doors of our world.', 'Traveling through the abyss, underworld dog Rainer recounts the six lives of Conann, perpetually put to death by her own future, across eras, myths and ages. From her childhood, a slave of Sanja and her barbarian horde, to her accession to the summits of cruelty at the doors of our world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbfBdnTZPedsnin0n86dpuYLD7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724846'),
  ('452381052335345736', 'She Is Not Crying, She Is Singing', 2011, 'Drama', 'Philippe de Pierpont, Isabelle Rey, Alain Marcoen', 'Philippe de Pierpont', 'Erika Sainte, Laurent Capelluto, Marijke Pinoy, Jean-François Wolff, Jules Werner, Vicky Krieps, Martin De Myttenaere, Galatea Bellugi', null, 'Laura, in her thirties, lives alone on the outskirts of a big city. She learns that her father is in a coma, following a serious traffic accident. She decides to visit him regularly at the hospital: the opportunity finally presents itself to settle accounts, perhaps even to take revenge... But life is unpredictable and Laura''s desire for revenge will lead to a reunion troubling with her family and her past. She will come out of it reconciled, with herself and with life.', 'Laura, in her thirties, lives alone on the outskirts of a big city. She learns that her father is in a coma, following a serious traffic accident. She decides to visit him regularly at the hospital: the opportunity finally presents itself to settle accounts, perhaps even to take revenge... But life is unpredictable and Laura''s desire for revenge will lead to a reunion troubling with her family and her past. She will come out of it reconciled, with herself and with life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65l3zX5gv13Jesbk6QEegAMXQKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147679'),
  ('859297728041321423', 'She Killed in Ecstasy', 1971, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino', 'Jesús Franco', 'Soledad Miranda, Fred Williams, Paul Müller, Ewa Strömberg, Howard Vernon, Jesús Franco, Horst Tappert, Beni Cardoso', null, 'A young doctor kills himself after a medical committee terminates his research into human embryos, considering it too inhumane. His wife then seeks revenge on those who drove her husband to his death by luring each member of the committee into compromising situations and then killing them one by one.', 'A young doctor kills himself after a medical committee terminates his research into human embryos, considering it too inhumane. His wife then seeks revenge on those who drove her husband to his death by luring each member of the committee into compromising situations and then killing them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aqolUAcTzv6BKxoZM1LaIIfxO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28294'),
  ('172760412165571981', 'She Loves Me Not', 1934, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Elliott Nugent, Charles Lang', 'Benjamin Glazer, Edward Hope, Howard Lindsay', 'Bing Crosby, Miriam Hopkins, Kitty Carlisle, Edward Nugent, Henry Stephenson, Warren Hymer, Lynne Overman, Judith Allen', null, 'A cabaret dancer witnesses a murder and is forced to hide from gangsters by disguising herself as a male Princeton student.', 'A cabaret dancer witnesses a murder and is forced to hide from gangsters by disguising herself as a male Princeton student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wl70yoLCiduwAvm66IxnhZyNTgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111582'),
  ('626591757375231588', 'She Made Me a Criminal', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Amr Arafa, Ayman Abu El Makarem', 'Nader Salah ElDin', 'Ahmed Helmy, Ghada Adel, Hassan Hosny, Reham Abdelghafour, Mahmoud El-Bezzawy, Edward, Abd Allah Meshref, Donia Massoud', null, 'The movie is about a very naive young man, who wants to fix his house before it falls, but does not have the money, and rich girl who likes to spend money uncontrollably, whose father is scrooge, who would not give her access to her trust fund. In order to force her father to give her money, she stages a kidnapping with the assistance of her best friend and the naive young man, who ends up falling in love with her.', 'The movie is about a very naive young man, who wants to fix his house before it falls, but does not have the money, and rich girl who likes to spend money uncontrollably, whose father is scrooge, who would not give her access to her trust fund. In order to force her father to give her money, she stages a kidnapping with the assistance of her best friend and the naive young man, who ends up falling in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9InvbMsehKRhHMSbPvAJrK0boCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48658'),
  ('317838695058282391', 'She Mob', 1968, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Harold Williams, Maurice Levy, Harry Wuest', 'Diana Paschal', 'Marni Castle, Monique Duval, Adam Clyde, Twig, Eve Laurie, Ann Adams, Joy Dale, Bill Bags', null, 'A gang of four inmates and their lesbian leader escape from prison and kidnap the boyfriend of a wealthy woman. She hires a tough private eye to find her boyfriend and rescue him.', 'A gang of four inmates and their lesbian leader escape from prison and kidnap the boyfriend of a wealthy woman. She hires a tough private eye to find her boyfriend and rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogeyCiiz7CZsjEJm6CFOqXZIzqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93758'),
  ('886223127340593914', 'She Never Died', 2019, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Crime', 'David Ralph, Alice Kim, Amy Brennan', 'Jason Krawczyk', 'Oluniké Adeliyi, Peter MacNeill, Kiana Madeira, Michelle Nolden, Noah Dalton Danby, Edsson Morales, Katie Messina, Murray Furrow', 'NR', 'Lacey, a socially detached loner is cursed with immortality and a never-ending tedium of existence. In her attempts to keep her compulsions in check, she seeks out the darkest souls humanity has to offer. Lacey must now face her own inner demons while simultaneously finding her next meal.', 'Lacey, a socially detached loner is cursed with immortality and a never-ending tedium of existence. In her attempts to keep her compulsions in check, she seeks out the darkest souls humanity has to offer. Lacey must now face her own inner demons while simultaneously finding her next meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqYBxQn8huCutt0yokas4Z5SsvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609919'),
  ('732191932922151160', 'She No Longer Talks, She Shoots', 1972, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Michel Audiard', 'Annie Girardot, Bernard Blier, Maurice Biraud, Roger Carel, Jean Carmet, Darry Cowl, André Pousse, Catherine Samie', null, 'Rosemonde, hailed as "the Princess" reign over a slum in the Paris suburbs. Herbert, a reporter who came to investigate on the pollution, ends up in a grinding machine of her invention. Rosemonde resells the bones to the church authorities who use them as holy relics. Inspector Adrian Bondu is handling the case... But a young hippie who looks like Jesus will have Rosemonde suddenly feel very earthly feelings...', 'Rosemonde, hailed as "the Princess" reign over a slum in the Paris suburbs. Herbert, a reporter who came to investigate on the pollution, ends up in a grinding machine of her invention. Rosemonde resells the bones to the church authorities who use them as holy relics. Inspector Adrian Bondu is handling the case... But a young hippie who looks like Jesus will have Rosemonde suddenly feel very earthly feelings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2utGi5Dg6s6JWPRYPOQO2cK4xvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78193'),
  ('1066165715079673433', 'She Rides Shotgun', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Nick Rowland, Robert Alonzo, Wyatt Garfield', 'Jordan Harper, Ben Collins, Luke Piotrowski', 'Taron Egerton, Ana Sophia Heger, Rob Yang, Odessa A''zion, David Lyons, John Carroll Lynch, Keith Jardine, Jamie Bernadette', 'R', 'Newly released from prison and marked for death by unrelenting enemies, Nate must now protect his estranged 9-year-old daughter, Polly, at all costs. With scant resources and no one to trust, Nate and Polly forge a bond under fire as he shows her how to fight and survive—and she teaches him the true meaning of unconditional love.', 'Newly released from prison and marked for death by unrelenting enemies, Nate must now protect his estranged 9-year-old daughter, Polly, at all costs. With scant resources and no one to trust, Nate and Polly forge a bond under fire as he shows her how to fight and survive—and she teaches him the true meaning of unconditional love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvqW8mOm818QDio3GKKmPLK8kXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196573'),
  ('14742625567306587', 'She Said', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Natasha Braier, Sia Balabanova, Tristan Ringenoldus', 'Rebecca Lenkiewicz', 'Carey Mulligan, Zoe Kazan, Patricia Clarkson, Andre Braugher, Lola Petticrew, Katherine Laheen, Emma Clare O''Connor, Tom Pelphrey', 'R', 'New York Times reporters Megan Twohey and Jodi Kantor break one of the most important stories in a generation — a story that helped launch the #MeToo movement and shattered decades of silence around the subject of sexual assault in Hollywood.', 'New York Times reporters Megan Twohey and Jodi Kantor break one of the most important stories in a generation — a story that helped launch the #MeToo movement and shattered decades of silence around the subject of sexual assault in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG4UI2dbNWlWtTTupjeU3fRJ5Fn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837881'),
  ('60256527289304846', 'She Said Maybe', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'The Chau Ngo, Buket Alakuş', 'Ipek Zübert', 'Beritan Balcı, Sinan Güleç, Serkan Çayoğlu, Meral Perin, Caro Daur, Cansu Tosun, Mehmet Ateşçi, Ilknur Boyraz', 'PG-13', 'When German-raised Mavi learns she belongs to a superrich Turkish dynasty, new family expectations quickly turn her world and love life upside down.', 'When German-raised Mavi learns she belongs to a superrich Turkish dynasty, new family expectations quickly turn her world and love life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujNDflVpoFsBqlbVt58pc7lT1WR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1509871'),
  ('629465644173152910', 'She Said, He Said', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Claudia Castro, Renata Braz, Pedro Serrão', 'Tati Ingrid Adão, Thalita Rebouças', 'Maisa Silva, Duda Matte, Marcus Bessa, Matheus Lustosa, Maria Clara Gueiros, Fernanda Gentil, Bianca Andrade, Maria Cecília Warpe', null, 'Rosa (Duda Matte) is dedicated to study, Leo (Marcus Bessa) is a good soccer player. She is always on time, he is always late. She hates Julia (Maisa), the most popular girl in high school, he kind of likes her. They are both new students at school and, besides having to learn how to deal with new friends and family problems, they find out that they have much more in common than they thought. Based on the successful book by Thalita Rebouças, they will find that growing up may seem complicated but deep down it''s a great adventure.', 'Rosa (Duda Matte) is dedicated to study, Leo (Marcus Bessa) is a good soccer player. She is always on time, he is always late. She hates Julia (Maisa), the most popular girl in high school, he kind of likes her. They are both new students at school and, besides having to learn how to deal with new friends and family problems, they find out that they have much more in common than they thought. Based on the successful book by Thalita Rebouças, they will find that growing up may seem complicated but deep down it''s a great adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBYRlsyD1ydYBB2IQ0SbmG9GNYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574547'),
  ('1150813997462109774', 'She Shoots Straight', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Corey Yuen, Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming', 'Yuen Kai-Chi, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Joyce Godenzi, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Carina Lau, Anglie Leung Wan-Yui, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Sarah Lee, Tang Pik-Wan, Yuen Wah', null, 'Hong Kong police officer Mina Kao marries Huang Tsung-Pao, who is a member of a law enforcement dynasty. His father and his many sisters are also officers, and the eldest sister Chia-Ling is one of the highest ranking women in the police department. When a Vietnamese gang begins a rampage through the city, the women must overcome their suspicion of one another to bring the criminals to justice.', 'Hong Kong police officer Mina Kao marries Huang Tsung-Pao, who is a member of a law enforcement dynasty. His father and his many sisters are also officers, and the eldest sister Chia-Ling is one of the highest ranking women in the police department. When a Vietnamese gang begins a rampage through the city, the women must overcome their suspicion of one another to bring the criminals to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XumtdPXkoKZ2mXhSxyPcAPkGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45447'),
  ('183567963917096986', 'She Walks in Darkness', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Paco Femenía, Richard Diment', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes', 'Susana Abaitua, Andrés Gertrúdix, Iraia Elias, Ariadna Gil, Raúl Arévalo, Anartz Zuazua, Jaime Chávarri, Cris Iglesias', 'R', 'A young agent leaves everything behind to pose as a member of ETA, risking her life to uncover the terrorists'' hideouts in the south of France.', 'A young agent leaves everything behind to pose as a member of ETA, risking her life to uncover the terrorists'' hideouts in the south of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR7TH2IlUJWh92HuiYrlb8rNuCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275151'),
