  ('193577468352969243', 'She, a Chinese', 2009, 'Drama', 'Xiaolu Guo, Zillah Bowes, Charlie Endean', 'Xiaolu Guo', 'Huang Lu, Wei Yibo, Geoffrey Hutchings, Chris Ryman, Liu Hsinyi', null, 'This is the story of Mei, a young woman on a trip from East to West after her escape from her provincial Chinese village. Beginning in Chongqing and a disastrous factory job, Mei soon heads out for London and a marriage to an older man where her entrapment begins anew.', 'This is the story of Mei, a young woman on a trip from East to West after her escape from her provincial Chinese village. Beginning in Chongqing and a disastrous factory job, Mei soon heads out for London and a marriage to an older man where her entrapment begins anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTJfxJofdClsyWXb3CtpWOapO5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73970'),
  ('503090037480086192', 'She: Their Love Story', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sarunya Noithai', null, 'Ann Siriwan Baker, Supachai Girdsuwan, Kitchya Kaesuwan, Papussamol Pawatkamolpat, Apassaporn Saengthong, Penpak Sirikul', null, 'She: Their Love Story is a tale of passionate female intimacy and the struggles of overcoming society''s repressive demands to be true to themselves. Bua is a successful business woman with the "perfect life". Following a sudden cancer diagnosis she leaves her family behind to ease their pain and hide her destiny. Residing by the sea, she befriends June, an undemanding independent female photographer with a sensual energy and spirit. Meanwhile, Da has her reputation ruined when her "perfect" boyfriend emails out raunchy video clips of her. In order to escape the embarrassment she accepts a job to write a feature about the love life of lesbians in Bangkok. She convinces Bee, a charming tomboy, to be her research subject. As their lives cross, they all embark on a journey of emotional and sexual discovery: With Bua at the end of her life journey, she is granted one last chance to discover the profound meaning of passionate love.', 'She: Their Love Story is a tale of passionate female intimacy and the struggles of overcoming society''s repressive demands to be true to themselves. Bua is a successful business woman with the "perfect life". Following a sudden cancer diagnosis she leaves her family behind to ease their pain and hide her destiny. Residing by the sea, she befriends June, an undemanding independent female photographer with a sensual energy and spirit. Meanwhile, Da has her reputation ruined when her "perfect" boyfriend emails out raunchy video clips of her. In order to escape the embarrassment she accepts a job to write a feature about the love life of lesbians in Bangkok. She convinces Bee, a charming tomboy, to be her research subject. As their lives cross, they all embark on a journey of emotional and sexual discovery: With Bua at the end of her life journey, she is granted one last chance to discover the profound meaning of passionate love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8woakmfrOJyw9g8T5UcyhLdU6Gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291373'),
  ('815378356685031480', 'She''s a Good Skate, Charlie Brown', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Family', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Patricia Patts, Casey Carlson, Arrin Skelley, Debbie Muller, Scott Beach, Tim Hall, Mary Ellen Kinsey, Daniel Anderson', 'G', 'Peppermint Patty is in zealous training for a figure skating competition, but with no help from her grumpy coach, Snoopy. He growls coaching tips that don''t make sense, and Marcie can''t sew the dress Peppermint Patty is dying to wear. Still determined to win, Peppermint Patty turns to Woodstock when disaster looms at the competition.', 'Peppermint Patty is in zealous training for a figure skating competition, but with no help from her grumpy coach, Snoopy. He growls coaching tips that don''t make sense, and Marcie can''t sew the dress Peppermint Patty is dying to wear. Still determined to win, Peppermint Patty turns to Woodstock when disaster looms at the competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvf9MFvDE9jXJ2RsQMVIpuFKxio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141933'),
  ('374915981622916394', 'She''s Alive! Creating ''The Bride of Frankenstein''', 1999, 'Documentary', 'David J. Skal, David J. Skal', 'David J. Skal', 'Joe Dante, Rick Baker, Clive Barker, Christopher Bram, Bill Condon, Paul M. Jensen, Sara Karloff, Scott MacQueen', null, 'Documentary about the making of 1935''s "The Bride of Frankenstein."', 'Documentary about the making of 1935''s "The Bride of Frankenstein."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sCyNYuFRVmgKGnPasZYWLKOSEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3204'),
  ('40625959431200629', 'She''s All That', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Iscove, Francis Kenny, Randall Badger', 'R. Lee Fleming Jr.', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Rachael Leigh Cook, Paul Walker, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Kevin Pollak, Anna Paquin, Kieran Culkin, Elden Henson', 'PG-13', 'High school hotshot Zach Siler is the envy of his peers. But his popularity declines sharply when his cheerleader girlfriend, Taylor, leaves him for sleazy reality-television star Brock Hudson. Desperate to revive his fading reputation, Siler agrees to a seemingly impossible challenge. He has six weeks to gain the trust of nerdy outcast Laney Boggs -- and help her to become the school''s next prom queen.', 'High school hotshot Zach Siler is the envy of his peers. But his popularity declines sharply when his cheerleader girlfriend, Taylor, leaves him for sleazy reality-television star Brock Hudson. Desperate to revive his fading reputation, Siler agrees to a seemingly impossible challenge. He has six weeks to gain the trust of nerdy outcast Laney Boggs -- and help her to become the school''s next prom queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0pepZNFCjggc7Na9gEwbTI1f46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10314'),
  ('15415154799670740', 'She''s Beautiful When She''s Angry', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Mary Dore, Svetlana Cvetko', null, null, null, 'A documentary that resurrects the buried history of the outrageous, often brilliant women who founded the modern women''s movement from 1966 to 1971.', 'A documentary that resurrects the buried history of the outrageous, often brilliant women who founded the modern women''s movement from 1966 to 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDmeDTNKbbR8P0ukjff1Ey77dl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269705'),
  ('416614918633172370', 'She''s Funny That Way', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Yaron Orbach, Brad Robinson', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Louise Stratten', 'Owen Wilson, Imogen Poots, Kathryn Hahn, Will Forte, Lucy Punch, Joanna Lumley, Cybill Shepherd, Illeana Douglas', 'R', 'On the set of a playwright''s new project, a love triangle forms between his wife, her ex-lover, and the call girl-turned-actress cast in the production.', 'On the set of a playwright''s new project, a love triangle forms between his wife, her ex-lover, and the call girl-turned-actress cast in the production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FiZVfwz27bvMROkud3dlFyE8uA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245906'),
  ('401735440369026098', 'She''s Gotta Have It', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Spike Lee, Ernest R. Dickerson', 'Spike Lee', 'Tracy Camilla Johns, Tommy Redmond Hicks, John Canada Terrell, Spike Lee, Raye Dowell, Joie Lee, S. Epatha Merkerson, Bill Lee', 'R', 'The story of Nola Darling''s simultaneous sexual relationships with three different men is told by her and by her partners and other friends. All three men wanted her to commit solely to them; Nola resists being "owned" by a single partner.', 'The story of Nola Darling''s simultaneous sexual relationships with three different men is told by her and by her partners and other friends. All three men wanted her to commit solely to them; Nola resists being "owned" by a single partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiJuXvPONqTSSnzhbCBqE7EotV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27995'),
  ('591603911086359162', 'She''s Having a Baby', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Hughes, Donald Peterman, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'John Hughes', 'Kevin Bacon, Elizabeth McGovern, Alec Baldwin, William Windom, Holland Taylor, Cathryn Damon, John Ashton, Larry Hankin', 'PG-13', 'Jake and Kristy Briggs are newlyweds. Being young, they are perhaps a bit unprepared for the full reality of marriage and all that it (and their parents) expect from them. Do they want babies? Their parents certainly want them to. Is married life all that there is? Things certainly aren''t helped by Jake''s friend Davis, who always seems to turn up just in time to put a spanner in the works.', 'Jake and Kristy Briggs are newlyweds. Being young, they are perhaps a bit unprepared for the full reality of marriage and all that it (and their parents) expect from them. Do they want babies? Their parents certainly want them to. Is married life all that there is? Things certainly aren''t helped by Jake''s friend Davis, who always seems to turn up just in time to put a spanner in the works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYe2V6TYWRB4an52pemjvy9pHw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12714'),
  ('97803016945800322', 'She''s on Duty', 2005, 'Comedy, Action, Crime, Romance', 'Park Kwang-chun, Park Hyeon-cheol', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Lee Won-jae', 'Kim Seon-a, Gong Yoo, Nam Sang-mi, Kim Sang-ho, Noh Joo-hyun, Hong Soo-ah, Oh Kwang-rok, Moon Seo-yeon', null, 'A boisterous detective goes undercover in a high school in order to befriend the teenage daughter of a notorious gangster.', 'A boisterous detective goes undercover in a high school in order to befriend the teenage daughter of a notorious gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFdnARZK8aFXasUvdwVWv4LcYef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54555'),
  ('562097750910259334', 'She''s Out of Control', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stan Dragoti, Donald Peterman, Rey Vincenty', 'Michael J. Nathanson, Seth Winston', 'Tony Danza, Catherine Hicks, Wallace Shawn, Dick O''Neill, Ami Dolenz, Laura Mooney, Derek McGrath, Dana Ashbrook', 'PG', 'A Los Angeles radio-station manager''s girlfriend shows his teenage daughter how to be sexy.', 'A Los Angeles radio-station manager''s girlfriend shows his teenage daughter how to be sexy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTQ4FIz8D0YsSSpcgGjR6EWFvhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47045'),
  ('152497144734714343', 'She''s Out of My League', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jim Field Smith, Jim Denault, Richard L. Fox', 'John Morris, Sean Anders', 'Jay Baruchel, Alice Eve, T.J. Miller, Nate Torrence, Mike Vogel, Lindsay Sloane, Krysten Ritter, Kim Shaw', 'R', 'When he starts dating drop-dead gorgeous Molly, insecure airport security agent Kirk can''t believe it. As his friends and family share their doubts about the relationship lasting, Kirk does everything he can to avoid losing Molly forever.', 'When he starts dating drop-dead gorgeous Molly, insecure airport security agent Kirk can''t believe it. As his friends and family share their doubts about the relationship lasting, Kirk does everything he can to avoid losing Molly forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpYHjyPX0DAxbsnWKmSK5jZ1s4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34016'),
  ('910289114656410288', 'She''s Ramona', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Rodríguez, Hugo Rodríguez', 'Beto Cohen, Hugo Rodríguez', 'Andrea Ortega-Lee, María Rojo, Lila Avilés, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Julio Bekhor, Juan Carlos Colombo, Jimena Guerra, Iván Lipkies Barro', null, 'Ramona is fat woman with too much weight and barely any luck. She recalls a childhood filled with moral abuse by her mother, sister and friends, calling her silly offensive names referencing her overweight. When she became an adult, things didn’t really get any better. She’s fired for being fat, she wants a liposuction but the doctor informs her she’s not a candidate due to her overweight, and all her universe seems to be collapsing after a series of unfortunate events. But everything will soon get better thanks to some magical beetles she finds in a Tarot café.', 'Ramona is fat woman with too much weight and barely any luck. She recalls a childhood filled with moral abuse by her mother, sister and friends, calling her silly offensive names referencing her overweight. When she became an adult, things didn’t really get any better. She’s fired for being fat, she wants a liposuction but the doctor informs her she’s not a candidate due to her overweight, and all her universe seems to be collapsing after a series of unfortunate events. But everything will soon get better thanks to some magical beetles she finds in a Tarot café.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8bhrKhQCo11IMnGei42kws7WDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329601'),
  ('56348788227432648', 'She''s So Lovely', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Nick Cassavetes, John Nelson, Ross Novie', 'John Cassavetes', 'Sean Penn, Robin Wright, John Travolta, Harry Dean Stanton, Debi Mazar, James Gandolfini, David Thornton, Susan Traylor', 'R', 'After being released from a psychiatric institution, a man tries to redeem himself in the eyes of his now-ex wife from the events that led up to his incarceration.', 'After being released from a psychiatric institution, a man tries to redeem himself in the eyes of his now-ex wife from the events that led up to his incarceration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZISQ7Cnmezs5NgBaL6uHUkDMFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38295'),
  ('533486869267695226', 'She''s the Man', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Greg Gardiner, Andy Fickman, Tracey Poirier', 'Kirsten Smith, Ewan Leslie, Karen McCullah', 'Amanda Bynes, Channing Tatum, Laura Ramsey, Vinnie Jones, David Cross, Julie Hagerty, Robert Hoffman, Alexandra Breckenridge', 'PG-13', 'Viola Hastings is in a real jam. Complications threaten her scheme to pose as her twin brother, Sebastian, and take his place at a new boarding school. She falls in love with her handsome roommate, Duke, who loves beautiful Olivia, who has fallen for Sebastian! As if that were not enough, Viola''s twin returns from London ahead of schedule but has no idea that his sister has already replaced him on campus.', 'Viola Hastings is in a real jam. Complications threaten her scheme to pose as her twin brother, Sebastian, and take his place at a new boarding school. She falls in love with her handsome roommate, Duke, who loves beautiful Olivia, who has fallen for Sebastian! As if that were not enough, Viola''s twin returns from London ahead of schedule but has no idea that his sister has already replaced him on campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms9vdHyBLgAj0txnMWI9djGpDGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9655'),
  ('260475244856466706', 'She''s the One', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Edward Burns, Frank Prinzi, Julian Wall', 'Edward Burns', 'Jennifer Aniston, Maxine Bahns, Edward Burns, Cameron Diaz, John Mahoney, Michael McGlone, Leslie Mann, Amanda Peet', 'R', 'Mickey, a free-spirited New York cabbie, and Francis, a materialistic Wall Street stockbroker, are extremely competitive and confused about women as a result of their father''s influence. They disagree on everything, but they have one thing in common: Mickey''s ex-fiance Heather is Francis''s secret love. Although both brothers are already married, Heather triggers their longtime sibling rivalry.', 'Mickey, a free-spirited New York cabbie, and Francis, a materialistic Wall Street stockbroker, are extremely competitive and confused about women as a result of their father''s influence. They disagree on everything, but they have one thing in common: Mickey''s ex-fiance Heather is Francis''s secret love. Although both brothers are already married, Heather triggers their longtime sibling rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNd6qM8Qa8tLFOiUOiEivh0qBkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11363'),
  ('784960214538971979', 'She''s the One', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Marco Martani, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Marco Martani, Eleonora Ceci', 'Andrea Arcangeli, Alessandra Mastronardi, Stefano Fresi, Cristiano Caccamo, Eduardo Scarpetta, Francesco Gabbani, Fabio Morici, Angela Curri', null, 'What if you could answer any question and eliminate all doubts before making the most important decision of your life? What if, by some sort of magic, you could live your life pursuing your wildest and deepest desires? That’s what’s about to happen to Andrea, a thirty-year-old man on the eve of his wedding with Laura, the girl he met in college and with whom he built a life together. Andrea starts waking up everyday in a different life and a different self, in realities where he and Laura never got together in the first place. Exploring the many paths his life could have lead him on to, from unapologetic womanizer to acclaimed musician, Andrea will have to face the void Laura’s absence left in his many different “iterations”. Will he try to break the spell?', 'What if you could answer any question and eliminate all doubts before making the most important decision of your life? What if, by some sort of magic, you could live your life pursuing your wildest and deepest desires? That’s what’s about to happen to Andrea, a thirty-year-old man on the eve of his wedding with Laura, the girl he met in college and with whom he built a life together. Andrea starts waking up everyday in a different life and a different self, in realities where he and Laura never got together in the first place. Exploring the many paths his life could have lead him on to, from unapologetic womanizer to acclaimed musician, Andrea will have to face the void Laura’s absence left in his many different “iterations”. Will he try to break the spell?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK7N0tLvsVK2RUpytz172MxSfHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800741'),
  ('869111246593560149', 'She''s Too Young', 2004, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Tom McLoughlin, David McLennan', 'Richard Kletter', 'Marcia Gay Harden, Alexis Dziena, Mike Erwin, Miriam McDonald, Megan Park, Gary Hudson, Deborah Odell, Joe Dinicol', 'NR', 'A mother/daughter relationship is thrown off balance when the mother discovers that her "good girl" daughter is part of a group who are engaging in sexual activities with multiple partners that results in an outbreak of sexually transmitted diseases.', 'A mother/daughter relationship is thrown off balance when the mother discovers that her "good girl" daughter is part of a group who are engaging in sexual activities with multiple partners that results in an outbreak of sexually transmitted diseases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuSuhgxpbsDMogfO1hW6e0QSi1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38878'),
  ('158558167035382809', 'Sheba, Baby', 1975, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'William Girdler, William L. Asman', 'William Girdler', 'Pam Grier, Austin Stoker, D''Urville Martin, Rudy Challenger, Dick Merrifield, Christopher Joy, Charles Kissinger, Charles Broaddus', 'PG', 'Sheba, a Chicago private detective returns back home to Louisville, Kentucky, to help her father fight mobsters.', 'Sheba, a Chicago private detective returns back home to Louisville, Kentucky, to help her father fight mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRxpK74AbizKDmYNiupWG3ryNNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34459'),
