  ('659028508517873428', 'Shedites', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Ben Kellett, Martin Hawkins', 'Paddy Houlihan', 'Danny O''Carroll, Shane Casey, Brendan O''Carroll, Simon Delaney, Deirdre O''Kane', null, 'A comedy about a place where men can make themselves useful and along the way, find company through unlikely friendships, a sense of purpose and a mug of strong tea.', 'A comedy about a place where men can make themselves useful and along the way, find company through unlikely friendships, a sense of purpose and a mug of strong tea.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fartworks.thetvdb.com%2Fbanners%2Fv4%2Fmovie%2F372464%2Fbackgrounds%2F69580096ae41f.jpg', 'plex:movie:shedites'),
  ('1026166829482609667', 'Sheena', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'John Guillermin, Pasqualino De Santis, Patrick Clayton', 'David Newman, Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Tanya Roberts, Ted Wass, Donovan Scott, Elizabeth of Toro, France Zobda, Trevor Thomas, Clifton Jones, John Forgeham', 'PG', 'Sheena''s parents are killed while on Safari. She is raised by the mystical witch woman of an African tribe. When her foster mother is framed for the murder of a political leader, Sheena and a newsman, Vic Casey, are forced to flee while pursued by the mercenaries hired by the real killer, who hopes to assume power. Sheena''s ability to talk to the animals and knowledge of jungle lore give them a chance against the high tech weapons of the mercenaries.', 'Sheena''s parents are killed while on Safari. She is raised by the mystical witch woman of an African tribe. When her foster mother is framed for the murder of a political leader, Sheena and a newsman, Vic Casey, are forced to flee while pursued by the mercenaries hired by the real killer, who hopes to assume power. Sheena''s ability to talk to the animals and knowledge of jungle lore give them a chance against the high tech weapons of the mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3MC1eYoW1Se9fQzCOZ5tfyMatl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24264'),
  ('90050331595018547', 'Sheep & Wolves', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Maksim Volkov, Andrey Galat', 'Tikhon Kornev, Vadim Sveshnikov, Maksim Sveshnikov', 'Alexander Petrov, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Sergei Bezrukov, Nikita Prozorovsky, Andrew Barkhudarov, Yuri Tarasov, Andrey Rozhkov, Tatyana Shitova', 'PG', 'In a magical faraway land, in a picturesque little village nestled among green meadows and rolling hills, lives a flock of carefree sheep. But their pastoral and stress-free life is interrupted when a pack of wolves sets up camp in the nearby ravine.', 'In a magical faraway land, in a picturesque little village nestled among green meadows and rolling hills, lives a flock of carefree sheep. But their pastoral and stress-free life is interrupted when a pack of wolves sets up camp in the nearby ravine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4R28oIV65bElWcXlavPV0kRbmSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394759'),
  ('753647545479080648', 'Sheep & Wolves: Pig Deal', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Vladimir Nikolaev', 'Alexey Tsitsilin, Vladimir Nikolaev, Robert Lence', 'Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Maksim Matveev, Galina Korneva, Anton Yuryev, Alexey Sigaev, Daniil Eldarov, Mikhail Belyakovich, Mikhail Tikhonov', 'PG', 'The united town of sheep and wolves lives a peaceful and quiet life until two unexpected guests turn up - a polar fox and a tiny ewe. No one ever expected them to bring a deadly danger, which can be overcome only if they work together. Only teamwork can solve big problems and deal with serious challenges - as there is strength in unity.', 'The united town of sheep and wolves lives a peaceful and quiet life until two unexpected guests turn up - a polar fox and a tiny ewe. No one ever expected them to bring a deadly danger, which can be overcome only if they work together. Only teamwork can solve big problems and deal with serious challenges - as there is strength in unity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVizGmUr06F8LrVXt6nEYrmwmos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518755'),
  ('288686684642527644', 'Sheep Ahoy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'After punching in for work, Sam Sheepdog deals with Ralph Wolf''s attempts to steal the flock, which this time make use of a balloon, a fake Acme-brand rock and a bicycle-propelled submarine.', 'After punching in for work, Sam Sheepdog deals with Ralph Wolf''s attempts to steal the flock, which this time make use of a balloon, a fake Acme-brand rock and a bicycle-propelled submarine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm5CuXy5esM8aZaBREr1PoFIFLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235789'),
  ('934673888639324327', 'Sheep Dog', 1949, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A coyote and his rather dim son stalk the sheep that Pluto is guarding.', 'A coyote and his rather dim son stalk the sheep that Pluto is guarding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWS6hydBnXjeDH74jp3nlJEWSnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164966'),
  ('375800120025077724', 'Sheep Without a Shepherd', 2019, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sam Quah, Zhang Ying', 'Yang Weiwei', 'Xiao Yang, Tan Zhuo, Joan Chen, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Paul Chun Pui, Bian Tianyang, Audrey Hui, Ye Liu', 'PG-13', 'Li and his wife A Yu run a small business in Thailand and enjoy a happy home life with their two daughters. When their eldest daughter is violently assaulted, blackmailed and left traumatised by another student, her parents intervene, leading to a dead body which needs to be hidden, and every trace of the boy buried to cover up the accident.', 'Li and his wife A Yu run a small business in Thailand and enjoy a happy home life with their two daughters. When their eldest daughter is violently assaulted, blackmailed and left traumatised by another student, her parents intervene, leading to a dead body which needs to be hidden, and every trace of the boy buried to cover up the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pjSsjhkv4tiFe2wTE3VPycQY6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652783'),
  ('682697138845558340', 'Sheep Wrecked', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Lah', null, 'Bill Thompson, Daws Butler', null, 'Droopy is guarding his flock of sheep from the rebel wolf.', 'Droopy is guarding his flock of sheep from the rebel wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Zj9kiV6BBmN3Yma46SZyoh7hEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144240'),
  ('624311313431112029', 'Sheesha', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Ashu Trikha', 'Ashu Trikha', 'Neha Dhupia, Elidh MacQueen, Niju Mavani, Nares Ngamseera, Vivek Shauq, Robert Slater, Sonu Sood', null, 'Businesswoman Sia Malhotra lives a wealthy lifestyle in Bangkok, along with her twin, Ria, who is deaf and dumb due to a neurological disorder. She meets with Raj Oberoi, and both fall in love. Their endeavors to cure Ria are all in vain. Sia plans to travel to the United States to improve her business, and has no one to look after Ria. So she decides to get married to Raj so that he could move in with Ria and look after her. Raj agrees, and both obtain a marriage certificate from Pattaya City Hall, and Sia departs for America. Sia does not know that after her return she will be a suspect in the brutal killing of a female Caucasian, Diana, and will not be permitted to leave Bangkok; and she will face further trauma and shock when she finds that her husband has been sexually molesting her handicapped sister.', 'Businesswoman Sia Malhotra lives a wealthy lifestyle in Bangkok, along with her twin, Ria, who is deaf and dumb due to a neurological disorder. She meets with Raj Oberoi, and both fall in love. Their endeavors to cure Ria are all in vain. Sia plans to travel to the United States to improve her business, and has no one to look after Ria. So she decides to get married to Raj so that he could move in with Ria and look after her. Raj agrees, and both obtain a marriage certificate from Pattaya City Hall, and Sia departs for America. Sia does not know that after her return she will be a suspect in the brutal killing of a female Caucasian, Diana, and will not be permitted to leave Bangkok; and she will face further trauma and shock when she finds that her husband has been sexually molesting her handicapped sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rNLPwBItoiSVP4EyDpKe50cZHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112627'),
  ('319922008872804757', 'Shehata''s Store', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Romance', 'Khaled Youssef, Ayman Abu El Makarem', 'Nasser Abdulrahman', 'Amr Saad, Haifa Wehbe, Amr Abdel Gelil, Ahmad Wafiq, Mohamed Karim, Mahmoud Hemida, Tarek Abdelaziz, Ghada Abdel Razek', null, 'Shehata is the son of a modest gardener who saved all his money to open a fruit stand and named it after his favorite son. Shehata''s siblings get so jealous of their brother and plot against him. A representation of the downfall of society and its decaying morals.', 'Shehata is the son of a modest gardener who saved all his money to open a fruit stand and named it after his favorite son. Shehata''s siblings get so jealous of their brother and plot against him. A representation of the downfall of society and its decaying morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mPlmM4vLd6i4chNs0YpnWjN7JM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63362'),
  ('107854640145164121', 'Shéhérazade', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Jonathan Ricquebourg, Jean-Bernard Marlin', 'Jean-Bernard Marlin, Catherine Paillé', 'Dylan Robert, Kenza Fortas, Idir Azougli, Lisa Amedjout, Sofia Bent, Nabila Bounab, Kader Benchoudar, Nabila Ait Amer', null, 'Zachary, 17 years old, gets out of jail. Rejected by his mother, he hangs out in the mean streets of Marseille. He falls in love with Shéhérazade, a young prostitute of whom he becomes the pimp without realizing it...', 'Zachary, 17 years old, gets out of jail. Rejected by his mother, he hangs out in the mean streets of Marseille. He falls in love with Shéhérazade, a young prostitute of whom he becomes the pimp without realizing it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW8XIlWjND96WCMPwMZn1z9PG0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518671'),
