  ('1011807009899584146', 'Shell', 2025, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Drew Daniels, Max Minghella, Peter Etzweiler', 'Jack Stanley', 'Elisabeth Moss, Kate Hudson, Kaia Gerber, Arian Moayed, Este Haim, Elizabeth Berkley, Leanne Suter, Amy Landecker', 'R', 'Desperate to reclaim her career, once-beloved actress Samantha Lake is drawn into the glamorous world of wellness mogul Zoe Shannon - only to uncover a monstrous truth beneath its flawless surface.', 'Desperate to reclaim her career, once-beloved actress Samantha Lake is drawn into the glamorous world of wellness mogul Zoe Shannon - only to uncover a monstrous truth beneath its flawless surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XBNS8DxMFP7qOoTOY7cc8OYFwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787747'),
