  ('535728633206656039', 'Shelter Me', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tarek Ben Abdallah, Marco S. Puccioni', 'Marco S. Puccioni', 'Maria de Medeiros, Antónia Lišková, Mounir Ouadi, Steffan Boje, Vitaliano Trevisan', null, 'Anna and Mara return from a holiday abroad, and realize that Anis, a young Moroccan immigrant, managed to hide in their car in order to cross the border to Italy. At first unsure of what to do, they then decide to take him with them.', 'Anna and Mara return from a holiday abroad, and realize that Anis, a young Moroccan immigrant, managed to hide in their car in order to cross the border to Italy. At first unsure of what to do, they then decide to take him with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGYV5sV4cnKYp1FTfWgiZGgramE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3984'),
  ('581658506037612371', 'Shenandoah', 1965, 'Western, War', 'William H. Clothier, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'James Lee Barrett', 'James Stewart, Doug McClure, Glenn Corbett, Patrick Wayne, Rosemary Forsyth, Phillip Alford, Katharine Ross, Jim McMullan', 'NR', 'Charlie Anderson, a farmer in Shenandoah, Virginia, finds himself and his family in the middle of the Civil War he wants nothing to do with. When his youngest boy is taken prisoner by the North, the Civil War is forced upon him.', 'Charlie Anderson, a farmer in Shenandoah, Virginia, finds himself and his family in the middle of the Civil War he wants nothing to do with. When his youngest boy is taken prisoner by the North, the Civil War is forced upon him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAB8UFwpoKPdgJlCuYZiF1hyn9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21027'),
