  ('1026288406945466186', 'Shepherd: The Story of a Jewish Dog', 2020, 'Family, Drama, War', 'Lynn Roth', 'Asher Kravitz', 'August Maturo, Ayelet Zurer, Ken Duken, Lois Robbins, Rebeka Rea, Levente Molnár, Hans Peterson, Peter Linka', null, 'Follow the perilous journey to freedom when a young boy and his dog attempt to escape a concentration camp during World War II. Based on true events.', 'Follow the perilous journey to freedom when a young boy and his dog attempt to escape a concentration camp during World War II. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6vgaoJzpCLJAVKw1ZFQw45Du46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718235'),
