  ('445990976609264116', 'Shithouse', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cooper Raiff, Wes Middleton, Ishmel Muhammad', 'Cooper Raiff', 'Cooper Raiff, Dylan Gelula, Amy Landecker, Logan Miller, Olivia Scott Welch, Abby Quinn, Joy Sunday, Ashley Padilla', 'R', 'Lonely college freshman Alex has closed himself off from his peers, who all appear to have this whole "college thing" figured out. But everything changes one night when Alex takes a leap and attends a party at Shithouse - a legendary party fraternity - where he forges a strong connection with Maggie.', 'Lonely college freshman Alex has closed himself off from his peers, who all appear to have this whole "college thing" figured out. But everything changes one night when Alex takes a leap and attends a party at Shithouse - a legendary party fraternity - where he forges a strong connection with Maggie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyOajZgP8Iy3JdVgvaiBv9K5OMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637053'),
  ('866807721156569705', 'Shiva', 1990, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Ram Gopal Varma, S. Gopala Reddy', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Amala Akkineni, Raghuvaran, Paresh Rawal, J. D. Chakravarthi, Tanikella Bharani, Rohini Hattangadi, Goga Kapoor', null, 'Shiva, a fresher at VAC College, is forced to stand up against the students'' union president and a group of gangsters who have made the college environment increasingly violent.', 'Shiva, a fresher at VAC College, is forced to stand up against the students'' union president and a group of gangsters who have made the college environment increasingly violent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jWEsHBD1gaGn5Aa0CHHfPmJCQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109001'),
  ('1063762677557128989', 'Shiva Baby', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kate Geller, Gerardo Coello Escalante, Emma Seligman', 'Emma Seligman', 'Rachel Sennott, Molly Gordon, Polly Draper, Danny Deferrari, Fred Melamed, Dianna Agron, Glynis Bell, Sondra James', 'NR', 'College student Danielle must cover her tracks when she unexpectedly runs into her sugar daddy at a shiva - with her parents, ex-girlfriend and family friends also in attendance.', 'College student Danielle must cover her tracks when she unexpectedly runs into her sugar daddy at a shiva - with her parents, ex-girlfriend and family friends also in attendance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sdqVsT6SHqtbCYZS7bhVoEftlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664300'),
  ('753332994978273002', 'Shivaay', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Ajay Devgn, Aseem Bajaj, Padmini Nandakumar', 'Sandeep Srivastava', 'Ajay Devgn, Abigail Eames, Erika Kaar, Sayesha Saigal, Ali Kazmi, Aakash Dabhade, Vir Das, Bijou Thaangjam', 'PG-13', 'Shivaay , a fearless Himalayan mountaineer covered in Lord Shiva tattoos, heads to Bulgaria to fulfill his nine-year-old daughter Gaura’s wish of seeing her mother Olga, who abandoned them years ago. But their plan goes for a toss when the little girl gets kidnapped in the foreign land. Rescuing her from the masked child-traffickers becomes his only reason for survival.', 'Shivaay , a fearless Himalayan mountaineer covered in Lord Shiva tattoos, heads to Bulgaria to fulfill his nine-year-old daughter Gaura’s wish of seeing her mother Olga, who abandoned them years ago. But their plan goes for a toss when the little girl gets kidnapped in the foreign land. Rescuing her from the masked child-traffickers becomes his only reason for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BWgVSH1cbTHtaD11Ckf9JLmT7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370992'),
  ('723624708070457429', 'Shivam', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Sreenivasa Reddy', 'Sreenivasa Reddy', 'Ram Pothineni, Raashii Khanna, Abhimanyu Singh, Brahmanandam, Jayaprakash Reddy, Vineet Kumar, Saptagiri, Naresh', null, 'A fearless young man with a knack for helping couples elope finds himself on the run when a powerful gangster targets him, leading to a high-stakes chase where his own love life is the ultimate prize.', 'A fearless young man with a knack for helping couples elope finds himself on the run when a powerful gangster targets him, leading to a high-stakes chase where his own love life is the ultimate prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulChVthJVkvmqVbiHlnCFZ8yjBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307344'),
  ('445998502890435345', 'Shiver', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Isidro Ortiz, Josep M. Civit', 'Alejandro Hernández, José Gamo Suárez, Isidro Ortiz', 'Junio Valverde, Blanca Suárez, Jimmy Barnatán, Mar Sodupe, Francesc Orella, Roberto Enríquez, Josep Maria Domènech, Paul Berrondo', null, 'Santi, a young high-school student with a serious physical reaction to sunlight, is forced by his health to move with his single mother to a shadowy, isolated village in the mountains of Spain where the inhabitants begin to reveal themselves as strangely xenophobic. When terrible, violent events begin to occur, Santi becomes first a pariah at school and then strongly suspected by the police of hideous murders. Santi himself, however, wonders if he is not the next victim.', 'Santi, a young high-school student with a serious physical reaction to sunlight, is forced by his health to move with his single mother to a shadowy, isolated village in the mountains of Spain where the inhabitants begin to reveal themselves as strangely xenophobic. When terrible, violent events begin to occur, Santi becomes first a pariah at school and then strongly suspected by the police of hideous murders. Santi himself, however, wonders if he is not the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDwh6cUbDMN0jIBmyHpmMag1g5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30713'),
  ('458295620543593637', 'Shivering and Shaking', 1930, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Enrique Acosta, Baldwin Cooke, Charlie Hall, Bob O''Connor, Blanche Payson, Leo Willis', null, 'Street musicians Stan and Ollie have no success earning money in the dead of winter in a bad neighborhood. Their instruments are destroyed in an argument with a woman, but their luck seems to turn when Stan finds a wallet.', 'Street musicians Stan and Ollie have no success earning money in the dead of winter in a bad neighborhood. Their instruments are destroyed in an argument with a woman, but their luck seems to turn when Stan finds a wallet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYbizGsjmBQhZN9UyLiAo5dmKnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162927'),
  ('1037213167223837337', 'Shivers', 1975, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Cronenberg, Robert Saad', 'David Cronenberg', 'Paul Hampton, Joe Silver, Lynn Lowry, Allan Kolman, Susan Petrie, Barbara Steele, Ronald Mlodzik, Barry Baldaro', 'R', 'The residents of a suburban high-rise apartment building are infected by parasites that turn them into mindless nymphomaniac fiends.', 'The residents of a suburban high-rise apartment building are infected by parasites that turn them into mindless nymphomaniac fiends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcgfPA5FicDgQXaw67kjtUxuxdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27429'),
  ('493517217157019785', 'Shivers', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Wojciech Marczewski, Krzysztof Maj, Wiesław Saniewski', 'Wojciech Marczewski', 'Tomasz Hudziec, Teresa Marczewska, Marek Kondrat, Zdzisław Wardejn, Władysław Kowalski, Teresa Sawicka, Marian Opania, Jerzy Bińczycki', null, 'A boy comes of age under an oppressive, cruel socialist government and watches as it slowly but surely distorts his family, his school and even his own thoughts.', 'A boy comes of age under an oppressive, cruel socialist government and watches as it slowly but surely distorts his family, his school and even his own thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvsBTC7lKQfjKhMFI9O7Aiqsn0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135625'),
  ('1126874894542257405', 'Shkola Baby-Yagi', 2026, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Dmitry Dakovich', 'Svetlana Koroleva', 'Artem Bobtsov, Agrafena Drevnova, Andrey Gryzlov, Vladimir Kapustin, Mariya Poroshina', null, 'While trying to find her missing parents, schoolgirl Lena unexpectedly finds herself in the fairytale world of the Far Far Away Kingdom. She becomes a student at Baba Yaga''s School, and heroes from Russian folk tales become her teachers. To bring her family back, Lena must overcome numerous challenges.', 'While trying to find her missing parents, schoolgirl Lena unexpectedly finds herself in the fairytale world of the Far Far Away Kingdom. She becomes a student at Baba Yaga''s School, and heroes from Russian folk tales become her teachers. To bring her family back, Lena must overcome numerous challenges.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BN2VhNTQ4NDItY2JjYS00ODM5LWEzNDUtNmI3OGY0YzQ2NDM2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:shkola-baby-yagi-2026'),
  ('658568808606201181', 'Shoah', 1985, 'Documentary, History', 'Claude Lanzmann, Dominique Chapuis, Jimmy Glasberg', null, 'Claude Lanzmann, Simon Srebnik, Michael Podchlebnik, Motke Zaidl, Jan Karski, Paula Biren, Abraham Bomba, Inge Deutschkron', 'NR', 'Director Claude Lanzmann spent 11 years on this sprawling documentary about the Holocaust, conducting his own interviews and refusing to use a single frame of archival footage. Dividing Holocaust witnesses into three categories – survivors, bystanders, and perpetrators – Lanzmann presents testimonies from survivors of the Chelmno concentration camp, an Auschwitz escapee, and witnesses of the Warsaw Ghetto Uprising, as well as a chilling report of gas chambers from an SS officer at Treblinka.', 'Director Claude Lanzmann spent 11 years on this sprawling documentary about the Holocaust, conducting his own interviews and refusing to use a single frame of archival footage. Dividing Holocaust witnesses into three categories – survivors, bystanders, and perpetrators – Lanzmann presents testimonies from survivors of the Chelmno concentration camp, an Auschwitz escapee, and witnesses of the Warsaw Ghetto Uprising, as well as a chilling report of gas chambers from an SS officer at Treblinka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvwF7dfSCybFcBOklUzKpE46bHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42044'),
  ('210849163335385394', 'Shock', 1946, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Glen MacWilliams, Alfred L. Werker, Joseph MacDonald', 'Eugene Ling', 'Vincent Price, Lynn Bari, Frank Latimore, Anabel Shaw, Stephen Dunne, Reed Hadley, Renee Carson, Charles Trowbridge', 'NR', 'In this thriller, psychiatrist Dr. Cross kills his wife and expects to get away with murder, until he discovers that the slaying was observed by a next-door neighbor, Janet Stewart. As Janet attempts to convince her husband of the doctor''s dastardly deed, Cross shows up to advise him that Janet is in dire need of some in-depth counseling.', 'In this thriller, psychiatrist Dr. Cross kills his wife and expects to get away with murder, until he discovers that the slaying was observed by a next-door neighbor, Janet Stewart. As Janet attempts to convince her husband of the doctor''s dastardly deed, Cross shows up to advise him that Janet is in dire need of some in-depth counseling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egWouljGXXidknA9cplDTApXcAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29237'),
  ('1006768024675885875', 'Shock', 1977, 'Horror', 'Alberto Spagnoli, Mario Bava, Mario Bava', 'Lamberto Bava, Dardano Sacchetti, Francesco Barbieri', 'Daria Nicolodi, John Steiner, David Colin Jr., Ivan Rassimov, Paul Costello, Nicola Salerno, Lamberto Bava', 'R', 'A couple is terrorized in their new house haunted by the vengeful ghost of the woman''s former husband who possesses her young son.', 'A couple is terrorized in their new house haunted by the vengeful ghost of the woman''s former husband who possesses her young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAa9c7jxONjWNbaacZrIwb39bf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5481'),
  ('642714539661566777', 'Shock', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Denis Moschitto, Daniel Rakete Siegel, Paul Pieck', 'Daniel Rakete Siegel, Denis Moschitto', 'Denis Moschitto, Aenne Schwarz, Fahri Yardım, Anke Engelke, Patrick Phul, Esra Phul, Daniel Wiemer, Antonio Putignano', null, 'Bruno has lost his medical license and is now practicing illegally, no questions asked. His interest is aroused when a lawyer offers to have him treat a leukemia-stricken mafioso. This not only gets him caught between rival gangs, but also puts his old life further and further out of reach.', 'Bruno has lost his medical license and is now practicing illegally, no questions asked. His interest is aroused when a lawyer offers to have him treat a leukemia-stricken mafioso. This not only gets him caught between rival gangs, but also puts his old life further and further out of reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bJQKYWUaJrddMVZwEmj3oaaETa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000683'),
  ('899444530106768423', 'Shock ''Em Dead', 1991, 'Music, Horror, Thriller', 'Mark Freed, Ron Chapman', 'Andrew Cross, Mark Freed, Dave Tedder', 'Traci Lords, Stephen Quadros, Troy Donahue, Aldo Ray, Tim Moffett, Karen Russell, Markus Grupa, Gina Parks', 'R', 'Martin is a total loser, who nobody cares for. When he fails to get a position as guitar player in Lindsay''s band and loses his job on the way, he makes a deal with a Voodoo priestess. She promises him the fulfillment of all his dreams if he swears obedience to her. He becomes a rock star and has many women - but to stay alive, he has to kill other people.', 'Martin is a total loser, who nobody cares for. When he fails to get a position as guitar player in Lindsay''s band and loses his job on the way, he makes a deal with a Voodoo priestess. She promises him the fulfillment of all his dreams if he swears obedience to her. He becomes a rock star and has many women - but to stay alive, he has to kill other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtxvMkhC7sPwQltcjp5L90bKDbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40208'),
  ('937539074081634929', 'Shock and Awe', 2017, 'History, Drama, Thriller', 'Rob Reiner, Barry Markowitz, Stephen Harrison', 'Joey Hartstone', 'Woody Harrelson, James Marsden, Rob Reiner, Tommy Lee Jones, Jessica Biel, Milla Jovovich, Richard Schiff, Luke Tennie', 'R', 'A group of journalists covering George Bush''s planned invasion of Iraq in 2003 are skeptical of the presidents claim that Saddam Hussein has "weapons of mass destruction."', 'A group of journalists covering George Bush''s planned invasion of Iraq in 2003 are skeptical of the presidents claim that Saddam Hussein has "weapons of mass destruction."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8Y9lKNnroACauSxmVQRkACj2ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476335'),
  ('1087180981915106447', 'Shock Corridor', 1963, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Samuel Fuller, Floyd Joyer, Stanley Cortez', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Peter Breck, Constance Towers, Gene Evans, James Best, Hari Rhodes, Larry Tucker, Paul Dubov, Chuck Roberson', null, 'With the help of his girlfriend Cathy and Dr. Fong, a psychiatrist, ambitious journalist Johnny Barrett poses as a madman in order to be admitted to a mental institution where a bloody murder has been committed.', 'With the help of his girlfriend Cathy and Dr. Fong, a psychiatrist, ambitious journalist Johnny Barrett poses as a madman in order to be admitted to a mental institution where a bloody murder has been committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jFI7GdduTss2SdgApcsiWtU5gA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25504'),
  ('536738423898997991', 'Shock to the System: A Donald Strachey Mystery', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ron Oliver, C. Kim Miles, Catherine Kretz', 'Ron McGee', 'Chad Allen, Sebastian Spence, Michael Woods, Morgan Fairchild, Daryl Shuttleworth, Anne Marie DeLuise, Stephen Huszar, Nelson Wong', null, 'When hard boiled private eye Donald Strachey finds his latest client dead, an apparent suicide, Albany’s favorite gay detective smells a rat and decides to take matters into his own hands. With the help of his straight-laced but adoring husband Tim and his occasionally too-eager assistant Kenny, Strachey’s investigation leads him on a dark and dangerous trail into the world of "gay conversion therapy".', 'When hard boiled private eye Donald Strachey finds his latest client dead, an apparent suicide, Albany’s favorite gay detective smells a rat and decides to take matters into his own hands. With the help of his straight-laced but adoring husband Tim and his occasionally too-eager assistant Kenny, Strachey’s investigation leads him on a dark and dangerous trail into the world of "gay conversion therapy".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d70xmyanZCbCsFpMkpqSyA7mJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51913'),
  ('1094385434734988200', 'Shock Treatment', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Alain Jessua, Jacques Robin, Jacques Santi', 'Alain Jessua', 'Annie Girardot, Alain Delon, Robert Hirsch, Michel Duchaussoy, Anna Gaylor, Jean-François Calvé, Guy Saint-Jean, Lucienne Legrand', null, 'Hélène Masson visits her friend Gérôme Savignat in the isolated rejuvenation clinic owned by Dr. Devilers and his partner Dr. Berbard. But after a series of tragic events, Hélène goes further in her investigation of the clinic.', 'Hélène Masson visits her friend Gérôme Savignat in the isolated rejuvenation clinic owned by Dr. Devilers and his partner Dr. Berbard. But after a series of tragic events, Hélène goes further in her investigation of the clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4k78EcpmexEKAeSHxIT84bN5iI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5601'),
  ('33925600181492696', 'Shock Treatment', 1981, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jim Sharman, Mike Molloy, Roger Simons', 'Richard O''Brien, Jim Sharman', 'Jessica Harper, Cliff DeYoung, Richard O''Brien, Patricia Quinn, Charles Gray, Ruby Wax, Nell Campbell, Rik Mayall', 'PG', 'Brad and Janet Majors find their strained marriage put to the test on popular Denton TV show Marriage Maze. Poor Brad is heavily sedated and institutionalised, whilst Janet is given a radical makeover and primed for stardom. But what are the real motivations behind the kooky DTV crew and their enigmatic head-honcho, Farley Flavors?', 'Brad and Janet Majors find their strained marriage put to the test on popular Denton TV show Marriage Maze. Poor Brad is heavily sedated and institutionalised, whilst Janet is given a radical makeover and primed for stardom. But what are the real motivations behind the kooky DTV crew and their enigmatic head-honcho, Farley Flavors?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obUmsgTu0MqXiEU5PtSOuAqnl05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27997'),
  ('186639230234587469', 'Shock Troops', 1967, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Bruno Cremer, Jean-Claude Brialy, Michel Piccoli, Gérard Blain, Claude Brasseur, Jacques Perrin, Charles Vanel, Claude Brosset', null, 'A French resistance group free twelve soldiers from a German prison camp, but apparently there''s an additional detainee among them suspected of being an enemy spy.', 'A French resistance group free twelve soldiers from a German prison camp, but apparently there''s an additional detainee among them suspected of being an enemy spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWYX0uluAvWJFHlRUF4hapENYtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365414'),
