  ('381147387906594753', 'Shocking Asia', 1974, 'Horror, Documentary', 'Rolf Olsen', 'Rolf Olsen, Ingeborg Steinbach', null, 'R', 'High on shock and light on cultural relativism, this mondo collection of video strangeness features assorted dead (or dying) people, a sex change operation, inexplicable sex acts, and a bunch of other stuff the producers'' could get the rights to cheaply.', 'High on shock and light on cultural relativism, this mondo collection of video strangeness features assorted dead (or dying) people, a sex change operation, inexplicable sex acts, and a bunch of other stuff the producers'' could get the rights to cheaply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wcG7c5MTESg3U6AWl3TvfONhlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115463'),
  ('257222912339123308', 'Shocking Dark', 1989, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei, Riccardo Grassetti, Luigi Ciccarese', 'Rossella Drudi, Claudio Fragasso', 'Christopher Ahrens, Haven Tyler, Mark Steinborn, Fausto Lombardi, Geretta Geretta, Clive Riche, Dominica Coulson, Paul Norman Allen', null, 'In a polluted future Venice researchers work to improve the situation. One day, unknown forces start killing them. A team of soldiers and a couple of civilians is sent to investigate. Soon, they encounter strange murderous creatures.', 'In a polluted future Venice researchers work to improve the situation. One day, unknown forces start killing them. A team of soldiers and a couple of civilians is sent to investigate. Soon, they encounter strange murderous creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tztmdSyvfvQBVyzqyh6sKQeJP5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66664'),
  ('746739360628505731', 'Shocking Pink', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', 'Bob Kurtz', 'Larry Storch', null, 'The Pink Panther tries laying in the hammock; it throws him out every time. He does some work around the house. The Pink Panther decides to fix basement stairs. Every time that he turns on the light bulb, it goes out again. He plugs in his electric saw. It won''t go off, and it saws down his house. When he tries to take a shower, water comes out of his ears. He loads his shotgun and waits for the next disaster. He falls down to the basement using a power saw, lighting gunpowder and killing the narrator.', 'The Pink Panther tries laying in the hammock; it throws him out every time. He does some work around the house. The Pink Panther decides to fix basement stairs. Every time that he turns on the light bulb, it goes out again. He plugs in his electric saw. It won''t go off, and it saws down his house. When he tries to take a shower, water comes out of his ears. He loads his shotgun and waits for the next disaster. He falls down to the basement using a power saw, lighting gunpowder and killing the narrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXS4e7IbDjTcBxJ2WjMy0tMRu71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379046'),
  ('581341767191521523', 'Shockproof', 1949, 'Romance, Crime, Thriller', 'Douglas Sirk, Charles Lawton Jr., Earl Bellamy', 'Helen Deutsch, Samuel Fuller', 'Cornel Wilde, Patricia Knight, John Baragrey, Esther Minciotti, Howard St. John, Russell Collins, Charles Bates, Richard Benedict', null, 'Jenny Marsh, recently released from prison for killing a man, finds herself under the watchful eye of her parole officer, Griff Marat, who helps her secure a job caring for his ailing mother.', 'Jenny Marsh, recently released from prison for killing a man, finds herself under the watchful eye of her parole officer, Griff Marat, who helps her secure a job caring for his ailing mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dN60rm7b2g2RuCB8D6yVU98LLE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25915'),
  ('838732917017877666', 'Shockwave: Countdown to Disaster', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Nick Lyon, Pedja Radenkovic', 'Blaine Chiappetta, Rafael Jordan, Ari Novak', 'Stacey Oristano, Rib Hillis, Ed Amatrudo, Bruce Thomas, Tyler Perez, Morgan Lindholm, Mike Capozzi, Soufiane El Khalidy', 'NR', 'A stolen seismic weapon is activated in Yemen. A hostage freed there tries in vain to warn against its global effect. It starts seismic activity at the Californian fault line where her daughter and ex are monitoring it. Can they stop it?', 'A stolen seismic weapon is activated in Yemen. A hostage freed there tries in vain to warn against its global effect. It starts seismic activity at the Californian fault line where her daughter and ex are monitoring it. Can they stop it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBD608VF4TcFHmP7SuC0OcvZQ0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479753'),
  ('1044980817029999975', 'Shoeshine', 1946, 'Drama', 'Vittorio De Sica, Elmo De Sica, Argi Rovelli', 'Sergio Amidei, Adolfo Franci, Cesare Giulio Viola', 'Franco Interlenghi, Rinaldo Smordoni, Annielo Mele, Bruno Ortenzi, Emilio Cigoli, Gino Saltamerenda, Peppino Spadaro, Antonio Nicotra', null, 'Two shoeshine boys in postwar Rome, Italy save up to buy a horse, but their involvement as dupes in a burglary lands them in juvenile prison; the experience take a devastating toll on their friendship.', 'Two shoeshine boys in postwar Rome, Italy save up to buy a horse, but their involvement as dupes in a burglary lands them in juvenile prison; the experience take a devastating toll on their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhhbo7rzJ1U8y1jW5cpR2j5GhvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43469'),
  ('1108210457572182436', 'Shogun Assassin', 1980, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert Houston, Kenji Misumi', 'David Weisman', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Akihiro Tomikawa, Kayo Matsuo, Minoru Ōki, Shin Kishida, Shogen Nitta, Reiko Kasahara, Akiji Kobayashi', null, 'A Shogun who grew paranoid as he became senile sent his ninjas to kill his samurai. They failed but did kill the samurai’s wife. The samurai swore to avenge the death of his wife and roams the countryside with his toddler son in search of vengeance.', 'A Shogun who grew paranoid as he became senile sent his ninjas to kill his samurai. They failed but did kill the samurai’s wife. The samurai swore to avenge the death of his wife and roams the countryside with his toddler son in search of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t376p5q8zvhyQ2FOroytJsRvlL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15119'),
  ('230873769234682119', 'Shogun''s Joy of Torture', 1968, 'Horror, Drama', 'Teruo Ishii', 'Teruo Ishii, Misao Arai', 'Reiko Mikasa, Miki Obana, Masumi Tachibana, Fumio Watanabe, Teruo Yoshida, Asao Koike, Shin''ichirô Hayashi, Yukie Kagawa', null, 'A young magistrate recalls three tales of heinous crimes committed by women, and the brutal punishments that ensued.', 'A young magistrate recalls three tales of heinous crimes committed by women, and the brutal punishments that ensued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOOvsEnAzEATmwHkglMKheARNy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99099'),
  ('215828189277090743', 'Shogun''s Ninja', 1980, 'Action, Adventure', 'Norifumi Suzuki', 'Fumio Kōnami', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Sonny Chiba, Etsuko Shihomi, Yuki Ninagawa, Isao Natsuyagi, Asao Koike, Makoto Satō, Fumio Watanabe', null, 'In the middle of the 16th century, Hideyoshi, a power hungry warlord sets out to destroy the Momochi clan. He sends his war commander in search of the clan''s hidden gold only to find that two daggers are the key to the hiding place of the treasured gold. Spanning decades, the quest for the missing daggers takes Shiranui through war and ancient tradition.', 'In the middle of the 16th century, Hideyoshi, a power hungry warlord sets out to destroy the Momochi clan. He sends his war commander in search of the clan''s hidden gold only to find that two daggers are the key to the hiding place of the treasured gold. Spanning decades, the quest for the missing daggers takes Shiranui through war and ancient tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaJWF2bFN7VYZKmTephsSYIbd8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44963'),
  ('870720210122461002', 'Shogun''s Samurai', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tôru Nakajima', 'Hirō Matsuda, Kinji Fukasaku, Tatsuo Nogami', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Sonny Chiba, Hiroki Matsukata, Teruhiko Saigō, Reiko Ōhara, Yoshio Harada, Isao Natsuyagi, Mikio Narita', null, 'Following the death of the second Tokugawa shogun, it is revealed that he was poisoned by retainers of his son Iemitsu in hopes of gaining him the shogunate despite the stammer and birthmark which undermine his respect. Iemitsu and his brother Tadanaga become bitter rivals for the shogunate, and the land is split into factions, eventually erupting into warfare. Iemitsu''s mentor, his fencing instructor Yagyu, is fixated upon securing Iemitsu the shogunate and ends up betraying everyone, even his own family, in pursuit of the goal.', 'Following the death of the second Tokugawa shogun, it is revealed that he was poisoned by retainers of his son Iemitsu in hopes of gaining him the shogunate despite the stammer and birthmark which undermine his respect. Iemitsu and his brother Tadanaga become bitter rivals for the shogunate, and the land is split into factions, eventually erupting into warfare. Iemitsu''s mentor, his fencing instructor Yagyu, is fixated upon securing Iemitsu the shogunate and ends up betraying everyone, even his own family, in pursuit of the goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jodipMyJcNwdSDfWJ6Chr2BG84k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34546'),
  ('1086262757494549498', 'Shogun''s Shadow', 1989, 'History, Action', 'Yasuo Furuhata, Kiyoshi Kitasaka', 'Hirō Matsuda, Sadao Nakajima', 'Ken Ogata, Sonny Chiba, Hiroki Matsukata, Hiroyuki Nagato, Tetsuro Tamba, Masaki Kyomoto, Miyuki Kanō, Yuji Oda', null, 'A shogun''s eldest son must do whatever it takes to survive a series of attempts on his life. He receives much-needed aid from seven warriors who are led by a strong leader.', 'A shogun''s eldest son must do whatever it takes to survive a series of attempts on his life. He receives much-needed aid from seven warriors who are led by a strong leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNjko2JANLETiXj7Q5PX2WNlfGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58879'),
  ('1039778855774492694', 'Shola Aur Shabnam', 1992, 'Action, Romance', 'David Dhawan', 'Anees Bazmee', 'Govinda, Divya Bharti, Gulshan Grover, Alok Nath, Anupam Kher, Mohnish Behl, Harish Patel, Raja Bundela', null, 'The spoiled and arrogant brother, Bali, of notorious gangster, Kali Baba, enlists in the National Cadet Corps, and wants to have his way with his fellow-students and trainer, Inder Mohan Lahti, with comical results. When he meets Divya Thapa for the first time, he is smitten by her, and wants to marry her by hook or by crook. But Divya is in love with Karan, and both plan to marry each other. Circumstances act against them, and they flee together, with Kali Baba''s men, and Divya''s Police Commissioner dad, Yashpal Thapa, in hot pursuit, to an unknown destination, surrounded by a web of lies, deception, and no known resource to assist them.', 'The spoiled and arrogant brother, Bali, of notorious gangster, Kali Baba, enlists in the National Cadet Corps, and wants to have his way with his fellow-students and trainer, Inder Mohan Lahti, with comical results. When he meets Divya Thapa for the first time, he is smitten by her, and wants to marry her by hook or by crook. But Divya is in love with Karan, and both plan to marry each other. Circumstances act against them, and they flee together, with Kali Baba''s men, and Divya''s Police Commissioner dad, Yashpal Thapa, in hot pursuit, to an unknown destination, surrounded by a web of lies, deception, and no known resource to assist them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chuyRvvnvgs1oW1hLIYMwGJpO6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103015'),
  ('212771636824549313', 'Sholay', 1975, 'Action', 'Ramesh Sippy, Sharad Palekar, Khalish Lucknavi', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Dharmendra, Amitabh Bachchan, Sanjeev Kumar, Amjad Khan, Hema Malini, Jaya Bachchan, Leela Mishra, Mac Mohan', null, 'After his family is slain by the notorious bandit Gabbar Singh, former Inspector Thakur Baldev Singh enlists low-level outlaws Jai and Veeru to capture Gabbar and seek revenge.', 'After his family is slain by the notorious bandit Gabbar Singh, former Inspector Thakur Baldev Singh enlists low-level outlaws Jai and Veeru to capture Gabbar and seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya9bwgqA4eNl5bQ9QqS0jcmRoBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12259'),
  ('562469360326067065', 'Shook', 2021, 'Horror', 'Jennifer Harrington, Richard Wong', 'Jennifer Harrington', 'Daisye Tutor, Emily Goss, Nicola Posener, Octavius J. Johnson, Grant Rosenmeyer, Stephanie Simbari, Joy Gohring, Lesley Wolff', 'NR', 'When Mia, a social media star, becomes the target of an online terror campaign, she has to solve a series of games to prevent people she cares about from getting murdered.', 'When Mia, a social media star, becomes the target of an online terror campaign, she has to solve a series of games to prevent people she cares about from getting murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oa6hI8m0fcQCUXHkgYy7UpYsJ5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786627'),
  ('84566395211669842', 'Shool', 1999, 'Action, Crime', 'Eeshwar Nivas, Hari Nair', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Sayaji Shinde, Raveena Tandon, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Rajpal Yadav, Ganesh Yadav, Yashpal Sharma', null, 'Police Inspector Samar Pratap Singh is transferred to Motihari, in the Indian state of Bihar, along with his wife, Manjari and a daughter. He is honest and diligent and these attributes sets him up against his superior - the District Superintendent of Police, as well as his subordinates and fellow officers.', 'Police Inspector Samar Pratap Singh is transferred to Motihari, in the Indian state of Bihar, along with his wife, Manjari and a daughter. He is honest and diligent and these attributes sets him up against his superior - the District Superintendent of Police, as well as his subordinates and fellow officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrH5MNv0C0pBsAXLr1TNW8etsXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170998'),
  ('252370650320090574', 'Shooom''s Odyssey', 2019, 'Animation, Family', 'Julien Bisaro, Carol Freeman, Sonja Rohelder', 'Julien Bisaro, Claire Paoletti', 'Oscar Pauleau, Thierry Desroses, Prune Bozo, Effie Rey', null, 'Shooom, a baby owl, hatches just as a storm turns the bayou surrounding her tree upside down. No sooner has she fallen from her nest, then the little fledgling totters off into the mangrove, pushing a second egg from the brood along with her. Come hell or high water, she’s determined to find a mother… even if that mom turns out to be an alligator or a raccoon!', 'Shooom, a baby owl, hatches just as a storm turns the bayou surrounding her tree upside down. No sooner has she fallen from her nest, then the little fledgling totters off into the mangrove, pushing a second egg from the brood along with her. Come hell or high water, she’s determined to find a mother… even if that mom turns out to be an alligator or a raccoon!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/R0cVg1hz5TmGCLbBt5xz74gcqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641364'),
  ('976091110437613701', 'Shoot ''Em Up', 2007, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Davis, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Robert Lee', 'Michael Davis', 'Clive Owen, Paul Giamatti, Monica Bellucci, Stephen McHattie, Greg Bryk, Daniel Pilon, Ramona Pringle, Julian Richings', 'R', 'A man named Mr. Smith delivers a woman''s baby during a shootout, and is then called upon to protect the newborn from the army of gunmen.', 'A man named Mr. Smith delivers a woman''s baby during a shootout, and is then called upon to protect the newborn from the army of gunmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ4p0MvSUWnCCL0IUn47UXTVPCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4141'),
