  ('876028923095736545', 'Shoot First… Ask Questions Later', 1975, 'Western, Adventure, Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Luis Cuadrado', 'Renée Asseo, Santiago Moncada, Sergio Corbucci', 'Giuliano Gemma, Tomas Milian, Eli Wallach, Manuel de Blas, Jacques Berthier, Romano Puppo, Nazzareno Zamperla, Hideo Saito', null, 'The White, the Yellow, and the Black (Italian: Il bianco, il giallo, il nero, also known as Shoot First… Ask Questions Later) is a 1975 Spaghetti Western comedy film. It is the last spaghetti western directed by Sergio Corbucci. Differently from his previous western films, this is openly parodic.', 'The White, the Yellow, and the Black (Italian: Il bianco, il giallo, il nero, also known as Shoot First… Ask Questions Later) is a 1975 Spaghetti Western comedy film. It is the last spaghetti western directed by Sergio Corbucci. Differently from his previous western films, this is openly parodic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zTMv5JM5gXcFIMUxXgTacOqT5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78408'),
  ('475618638142921097', 'Shoot Me in the Heart', 2015, 'Drama', 'Cho Yong-kyu, Je-yong Mun, Shin Sang-yeul', 'Jeon Yun-su, Je-yong Mun, Yoo Sun-dong', 'Lee Min-ki, Yeo Jin-goo, Yu Oh-seong, Kim Jung-tae, Shin Gu, Han Hye-rin, Kim Bo-ra, Yun Yeong-keol', null, 'A young man develops schizophrenia after his mother''s suicide. After he meets a kindred spirit at the psychiatric hospital, he forges a plan with the man to escape.', 'A young man develops schizophrenia after his mother''s suicide. After he meets a kindred spirit at the psychiatric hospital, he forges a plan with the man to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEva7iEzhKUvljLATELn4dc9vZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326854'),
  ('605708240860033428', 'Shoot on Sight', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Jag Mundhra', null, 'Naseeruddin Shah, Greta Scacchi, Gulshan Grover, Om Puri, India Wadsworth, Brian Cox, Laila Rouass, Jeffrey Lipman Snr', 'R', 'Tariq Ali, a Muslim police officer of Scotland Yard, is asked to hunt-down suspected suicide-bombers against the backdrop of July 7 bombings in London. Tariq''s task gets complicated as an innocent Muslim is killed by the commando shooters of Scotland Yard. On the other hand, Tariq - a British citizen is himself a suspect in the eyes of his boss, despite his long service in the Scotland Yard', 'Tariq Ali, a Muslim police officer of Scotland Yard, is asked to hunt-down suspected suicide-bombers against the backdrop of July 7 bombings in London. Tariq''s task gets complicated as an innocent Muslim is killed by the commando shooters of Scotland Yard. On the other hand, Tariq - a British citizen is himself a suspect in the eyes of his boss, despite his long service in the Scotland Yard', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf3mAhPe2FOCfbVaLH7tV8v2Qtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14076'),
  ('491650716318537545', 'Shoot Out', 1971, 'Western', 'Henry Hathaway, Kenny Williams, Milton Feldman', 'Marguerite Roberts', 'Gregory Peck, Patricia Quinn, Robert F. Lyons, Susan Tyrrell, Jeff Corey, James Gregory, Rita Gam, Dawn Lyn', 'PG', 'Clay Lomax, a bank robber, gets out of jail after an 7 year sentence. He is looking after Sam Foley, the man who betrayed him. Knowing that, Foley hires three men to pay attention of Clay''s steps. The things get complicated when Lomax, waiting to receive some money from his ex-lover, gets only the notice of her death and an 7 year old girl, sometimes very annoying, presumed to be his daughter.', 'Clay Lomax, a bank robber, gets out of jail after an 7 year sentence. He is looking after Sam Foley, the man who betrayed him. Knowing that, Foley hires three men to pay attention of Clay''s steps. The things get complicated when Lomax, waiting to receive some money from his ex-lover, gets only the notice of her death and an 7 year old girl, sometimes very annoying, presumed to be his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyuq9116gONmk6zMhP1Qn4VsXBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79735'),
  ('978827642425583948', 'Shoot the Living and Pray for the Dead', 1971, 'Action, Western', 'Giuseppe Vari, Franco Villa', 'Adriano Bolzoni', 'Klaus Kinski, Victoria Zinny, Paolo Casella, Dino Strano, Patrizia Adiutori, Dante Maggio, Anna Zinnemann, Aldo Barberito', null, 'Dan Hogan and his gang have held up a bank for $100,000 in gold bars. They meet up at Jackal''s Ranch, a weigh station for stage coaches. While waiting for the gold to arrive they encounter a stranger, John Webb, who wants half the gold in exchange for guiding them safely to Mexico. Reluctantly, Dan agrees and they set across the brutal desert for a race to the border with the Rangers hot on their tail. Is John who he says he is? Is he really after the gold or does he have an ulterior motive?', 'Dan Hogan and his gang have held up a bank for $100,000 in gold bars. They meet up at Jackal''s Ranch, a weigh station for stage coaches. While waiting for the gold to arrive they encounter a stranger, John Webb, who wants half the gold in exchange for guiding them safely to Mexico. Reluctantly, Dan agrees and they set across the brutal desert for a race to the border with the Rangers hot on their tail. Is John who he says he is? Is he really after the gold or does he have an ulterior motive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRNFFwBFengyFklt2MLlpUHKCD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66055'),
  ('468131413775145590', 'Shoot the Moon', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alan Parker, Michael Seresin, Ray Greenfield', 'Bo Goldman', 'Albert Finney, Diane Keaton, Karen Allen, Peter Weller, Dana Hill, Viveka Davis, Tracey Gold, Tina Yothers', 'R', 'After fifteen years of marriage, an affluent couple divorce and take up with new partners.', 'After fifteen years of marriage, an affluent couple divorce and take up with new partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71GK3DRyFWN0Ke0s8WwgEEEOUJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52772'),
  ('318403683225847157', 'Shoot the Piano Player', 1960, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'François Truffaut, Raoul Coutard, Bjørn Johansen', null, 'Charles Aznavour, Marie Dubois, Nicole Berger, Michèle Mercier, Serge Davri, Claude Mansard, Richard Kanayan, Albert Rémy', 'NR', 'Charlie is a former classical pianist who has changed his name and now plays jazz in a grimy Paris bar. When Charlie''s brothers, Richard and Chico, surface and ask for Charlie''s help while on the run from gangsters they have scammed, he aids their escape. Soon Charlie and Lena, a waitress at the same bar, face trouble when the gangsters arrive, looking for his brothers.', 'Charlie is a former classical pianist who has changed his name and now plays jazz in a grimy Paris bar. When Charlie''s brothers, Richard and Chico, surface and ask for Charlie''s help while on the run from gangsters they have scammed, he aids their escape. Soon Charlie and Lena, a waitress at the same bar, face trouble when the gangsters arrive, looking for his brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UhMIZaaoe2HUU7sEIwYpuYgugh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1818'),
  ('900668032320285713', 'Shoot to Kill', 1947, 'Crime', 'William Berke, Benjamin H. Kline, Byron Roberts', 'Edwin V. Westrate', 'Russell Wade, Luana Walters, Edmund MacDonald, Robert Kent, Vince Barnett, Nestor Paiva, Charles Trowbridge, Harry Brown', 'NR', 'A gritty crime story involving a newspaper man and crooked politicians.', 'A gritty crime story involving a newspaper man and crooked politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGLE6hI6NUdu8DYKQcK5gOSc6kn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51476'),
  ('951359538337103372', 'Shoot to Kill', 1988, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Curtis Petersen, Michael Chapman', 'Harv Zimmel, Michael Burton, Daniel Petrie Jr.', 'Sidney Poitier, Tom Berenger, Kirstie Alley, Clancy Brown, Richard Masur, Andrew Robinson, Kevin Scannell, Frederick Coffin', 'R', 'When a cunning murderer vanishes into the rugged mountains of the Pacific Northwest, pursuing FBI agent Warren Stantin must exchange familiar city streets for unknown wilderness trails. Completely out of his element, Stantin is forced to enlist the aid of expert tracker Jonathan Knox. It''s a turbulent yet vital relationship they must maintain in order to survive... and one that becomes increasingly desperate when Knox''s girlfriend Sarah becomes the killer''s latest hostage!', 'When a cunning murderer vanishes into the rugged mountains of the Pacific Northwest, pursuing FBI agent Warren Stantin must exchange familiar city streets for unknown wilderness trails. Completely out of his element, Stantin is forced to enlist the aid of expert tracker Jonathan Knox. It''s a turbulent yet vital relationship they must maintain in order to survive... and one that becomes increasingly desperate when Knox''s girlfriend Sarah becomes the killer''s latest hostage!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvp2vmD7qRgrh7rjiL7qI8XYxne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9717'),
  ('920280054554601984', 'Shoot-Out At Medicine Bend', 1957, 'Western', 'Richard L. Bare, William Kissell, Carl E. Guthrie', 'John Tucker Battle, D.D. Beauchamp', 'Randolph Scott, James Craig, Angie Dickinson, Dani Crayne, James Garner, Gordon Jones, Trevor Bardette, Don Beddoe', 'NR', 'In Medicine Bend, a crooked businessman has the town mayor and sheriff in his pocket while his henchmen raid the wagon trains passing through the region.', 'In Medicine Bend, a crooked businessman has the town mayor and sheriff in his pocket while his henchmen raid the wagon trains passing through the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7uNTN9F8YFkiqGbsM1YivW5Wnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176670'),
  ('976212336949309634', 'Shoot, Gringo... Shoot!', 1968, 'Western', 'Bruno Corbucci', 'Bruno Corbucci, Mario Amendola', 'Brian Kelly, Fabrizio Moroni, Keenan Wynn, Erika Blanc, Folco Lulli, Rik Battaglia, Linda Sini, Giovanni Pallavicino', null, 'Chad Stark is offered his life and a nice ammount of dollars if he is to bring back the runaway son of mexican land-owner Gutierrez . This son, Fidel, teams up with an outlaw band lead by a former military man going by the name The Major. When Stark finds Fidel he is reintroduced to an old acquaintance which makes his job of returning the son a lot more difficult.', 'Chad Stark is offered his life and a nice ammount of dollars if he is to bring back the runaway son of mexican land-owner Gutierrez . This son, Fidel, teams up with an outlaw band lead by a former military man going by the name The Major. When Stark finds Fidel he is reintroduced to an old acquaintance which makes his job of returning the son a lot more difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E8ACKmmkA0Y16Sa7tBxGblntgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128882'),
  ('1118823237309536231', 'Shooter', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Antoine Fuqua, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Jonathan Lemkin', 'Mark Wahlberg, Michael Peña, Danny Glover, Kate Mara, Elias Koteas, Rhona Mitra, Jonathan Walker, Louis Ferreira', 'R', 'A top Marine sniper, Bob Lee Swagger, leaves the military after a mission goes horribly awry and disappears, living in seclusion. He is coaxed back into service after a high-profile government official convinces him to help thwart a plot to kill the President of the United States. Ultimately double-crossed and framed for the attempt, Swagger becomes the target of a nationwide manhunt. He goes on the run to track the real killer and find out who exactly set him up, and why, eventually seeking revenge against some of the most powerful and corrupt leaders in the free world.', 'A top Marine sniper, Bob Lee Swagger, leaves the military after a mission goes horribly awry and disappears, living in seclusion. He is coaxed back into service after a high-profile government official convinces him to help thwart a plot to kill the President of the United States. Ultimately double-crossed and framed for the attempt, Swagger becomes the target of a nationwide manhunt. He goes on the run to track the real killer and find out who exactly set him up, and why, eventually seeking revenge against some of the most powerful and corrupt leaders in the free world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aWGxo1E5polpBjPvtBRkWp7qaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7485'),
