  ('676130198311426554', 'Shooting Dogs', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Ivan Strasburg, Claudine Murenzi', 'David Wolstencroft', 'John Hurt, Hugh Dancy, Dominique Horwitz, Nicola Walker, David Gyasi, Steve Toussaint, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Susan Nalwoga', null, 'Two westerners, a priest and a teacher find themselves in the middle of the Rwandan genocide and face a moral dilemna. Do they place themselves in danger and protect the refugees, or escape the country with their lives? Based on a true story.', 'Two westerners, a priest and a teacher find themselves in the middle of the Rwandan genocide and face a moral dilemna. Do they place themselves in danger and protect the refugees, or escape the country with their lives? Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xC2yUgqPVvoHykYuigrxLyunya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8588'),
