  ('758499108879255887', 'Shot Through the Heart', 1998, 'TV Movie, Drama, War', 'David Attwood, Gábor Szabó', 'Guy Hibbert, John Falk', 'Linus Roache, Vincent Perez, Lia Williams, Adam Kotz, Soo Garay, Lothaire Bluteau, Viktória Bajza, Daniel Betts', 'R', 'The horrors of war are examined from the view points of lifelong friends (Linus Roache, Vincent Perez), who end up on opposing sides in the civil war in Sarajevo. One is an expert marksman, who trains the snipers used to terrify the city and the other becomes a freedom fighter, who rejects his friend''s offer to gain an escape from the city. As might be expected, the two eventually have to face-off against one another.', 'The horrors of war are examined from the view points of lifelong friends (Linus Roache, Vincent Perez), who end up on opposing sides in the civil war in Sarajevo. One is an expert marksman, who trains the snipers used to terrify the city and the other becomes a freedom fighter, who rejects his friend''s offer to gain an escape from the city. As might be expected, the two eventually have to face-off against one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SaCrqSYJJZjvS78OW2dvvWS394.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23217'),
  ('102341308732766946', 'Shotgun', 1955, 'Western', 'Lesley Selander', 'Clarke Reynolds, Rory Calhoun', 'Sterling Hayden, Yvonne De Carlo, Zachary Scott, Guy Prescott, Fiona Hale, Angela Greene, Lane Chandler, Robert J. Wilke', 'NR', 'Clay Hardin, a Deputy U.S. Marshal, is about to turn in his badge and take the job as the territory''s Indian commissioner until the notorious Ben Thompson slays the marshal when he tried to make an arrest. Clay turns his back on a white-collar job and his girl to pursue the gang. Picking up a bounty hunter and a beautiful half-breed woman along the way, the little band follows the trail into Apache land where the lawman discovers that the outlaws plan to sell repeating rifles to the Indians.', 'Clay Hardin, a Deputy U.S. Marshal, is about to turn in his badge and take the job as the territory''s Indian commissioner until the notorious Ben Thompson slays the marshal when he tried to make an arrest. Clay turns his back on a white-collar job and his girl to pursue the gang. Picking up a bounty hunter and a beautiful half-breed woman along the way, the little band follows the trail into Apache land where the lawman discovers that the outlaws plan to sell repeating rifles to the Indians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0JXEerlqhHo2pfGC39DdwVzIxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169521'),
  ('1021723008464627339', 'Shotgun', 1989, 'Action, Thriller', 'Addison Randall, F. Smith Martin', 'Addison Randall', 'Stuart Chapin, Rif Hutton, David Marriott, Rhonda Gray, Metanel Ryan, Jerry Neal, Peter Morrison, James Baker', null, 'Detective Ian ''Shotgun'' Jones hunts a sadistic misogynistic maniac.', 'Detective Ian ''Shotgun'' Jones hunts a sadistic misogynistic maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9b7m1VDavPimw13sWH9CmJFZuU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212759'),
  ('686226678466655210', 'Shotgun Love', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rain Jung', 'Rain Jung', 'Im Chang-jung, Kim Tae-hun, Park Min-hwan, Kim Gyu-ri, Yoon Ji-min, Ahn Suk-hwan, Kim Soo-mi, Kim Nan-hwi', null, 'Sang-yeol, a 30-something loser stuck in a dead-end job as a home-shopping model, is able to marry the girl of his dreams - his modeling colleague So-yeon - when he discovers she''s pregnant with his child. But after marriage an even bigger discovery awaits: the child isn''t his - in fact he''s still a virgin, and he might even be gay...', 'Sang-yeol, a 30-something loser stuck in a dead-end job as a home-shopping model, is able to marry the girl of his dreams - his modeling colleague So-yeon - when he discovers she''s pregnant with his child. But after marriage an even bigger discovery awaits: the child isn''t his - in fact he''s still a virgin, and he might even be gay...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9w237hzy8ElrQvbziop5cmuimJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72442'),
  ('1020307866075651574', 'Shotgun Stories', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Adam Stone, Jeff Nichols, Cosmo Pfeil', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Michael Shannon, Douglas Ligon, Barlow Jacobs, Michael Abbott Jr., Travis Smith, Lynnsee Provence, David Rhodes, Glenda Pannell', 'PG-13', 'Shotgun Stories tracks a feud that erupts between two sets of half brothers following the death of their father. Set against the cotton fields and back roads of Southeast Arkansas, these brothers discover the lengths to which each will go to protect their family.', 'Shotgun Stories tracks a feud that erupts between two sets of half brothers following the death of their father. Set against the cotton fields and back roads of Southeast Arkansas, these brothers discover the lengths to which each will go to protect their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeIlHt28Z8KmHcKEgl4oLHpwZ8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12247'),
  ('717234399103911831', 'Shotgun Wedding', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Rafael Sanz, Lee Morrison, Darin Rivetti', 'Mark Hammer', 'Jennifer Lopez, Josh Duhamel, Lenny Kravitz, Jennifer Coolidge, Sonia Braga, Cheech Marin, Steve Coulter, D''Arcy Carden', 'R', 'Darcy and Tom gather their families for the ultimate destination wedding but when the entire party is taken hostage, “’Til Death Do Us Part” takes on a whole new meaning. Now, Darcy and Tom must save their loved ones—if they don’t kill each other first.', 'Darcy and Tom gather their families for the ultimate destination wedding but when the entire party is taken hostage, “’Til Death Do Us Part” takes on a whole new meaning. Now, Darcy and Tom must save their loved ones—if they don’t kill each other first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t79ozwWnwekO0ADIzsFP1E5SkvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758009'),
  ('449187231477737994', 'Should Married Men Go Home?', 1928, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Lloyd French, Leo McCarey', 'James Parrott, Leo McCarey, H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Kay Deslys, Edgar Kennedy, Charlie Hall, Sam Lufkin, Edna Marion, Viola Richard', null, 'Mrs. Hardy throws Ollie and Stan out of the house. They try to impress two young ladies at a golf course and end up fighting with other golfers.', 'Mrs. Hardy throws Ollie and Stan out of the house. They try to impress two young ladies at a golf course and end up fighting with other golfers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zz41YviOTV8AvOotLUKsTezUEXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48738'),
  ('311897432245841456', 'Should Men Walk Home?', 1927, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Leo McCarey, Floyd Jackman', 'Albert Austin, H.M. Walker', 'Mabel Normand, Creighton Hale, Eugene Pallette, Oliver Hardy, William A. Boardway, Edgar Dearing, Julia Griffith, F.F. Guenste', 'NR', 'Mabel plays an out-and-out crook, a "Girl Bandit," no less. And she quickly hooks up with a male partner in crime, in this case a Gentleman Crook played by perpetually grinning Creighton Hale. Mabel seems a little livelier in this film than in some of her other late works. In the very first scene we find her hitch-hiking, and she''s forced to make a mad dash for cover when Hale''s car nearly hits her. Soon they team up and crash a swanky party in a mansion to steal a jewel from the host''s safe.', 'Mabel plays an out-and-out crook, a "Girl Bandit," no less. And she quickly hooks up with a male partner in crime, in this case a Gentleman Crook played by perpetually grinning Creighton Hale. Mabel seems a little livelier in this film than in some of her other late works. In the very first scene we find her hitch-hiking, and she''s forced to make a mad dash for cover when Hale''s car nearly hits her. Soon they team up and crash a swanky party in a mansion to steal a jewel from the host''s safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5fH61sX6HgwCRP28RRSEUyPbMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189735'),
  ('380071126432336926', 'Should Not!...', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Jugnot', 'Gérard Jugnot, Philippe Lopes-Curval', 'Gérard Jugnot, Michèle Laroque, François Morel, Martin Lamotte, Jean Yanne, Micheline Presle, Claude Piéplu, Sophie Desmarets', null, 'Bernard, an executive for a big company, tries to get home in time for his wedding but is caught in the middle of a mass suicide. He saves a sect member who then follows him like a puppy, and is chased by the sect leaders, two over-the-top crooks with bloated egos and a craving for money.', 'Bernard, an executive for a big company, tries to get home in time for his wedding but is caught in the middle of a mass suicide. He saves a sect member who then follows him like a puppy, and is chased by the sect leaders, two over-the-top crooks with bloated egos and a craving for money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gthv9hfBqbtpdEkQtA9M115RPUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40626'),
  ('444311201322513984', 'Should the Wind Drop', 2021, 'Drama', 'Nora Martirosyan, Simon Roca', 'Nora Martirosyan, Olivier Torres, Guillaume Andre', 'Grégoire Colin, Hayk Bakhryan, Arman Navasardyan, David Hakobyan, Narine Grigoryan, Amalya Ohanjanyan, Marianna Vorskanyan, Artak Mkrtchyan', null, 'International auditor Alain has arrived to appraise the airport of a small self-proclaimed republic in the Caucasus to green light its eventual reopening. Through Edgar, a local boy running a make-shift business in the airport, Alain will risk all to help this isolated territory to open up.', 'International auditor Alain has arrived to appraise the airport of a small self-proclaimed republic in the Caucasus to green light its eventual reopening. Through Edgar, a local boy running a make-shift business in the airport, Alain will risk all to help this isolated territory to open up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mw30OPdISb3NkY5XE7JdLKG2zPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592777'),
