  ('1094543432727613326', 'Shout', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeffrey Hornaday, Robert Brinkmann', 'Joe Gayton', 'John Travolta, Jamie Walters, Heather Graham, Richard Jordan, Linda Fiorentino, Scott Coffey, Glenn Quinn, Francis von Zerneck', 'PG-13', 'A new music teacher in a 1955 West Texas home for wayward boys brings new vision and hope for many of the interned boys.', 'A new music teacher in a 1955 West Texas home for wayward boys brings new vision and hope for many of the interned boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgHhbol55iYeFl8I1f3ubtBSdTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25674'),
  ('240115184547734173', 'Shout at the Devil', 1976, 'Adventure, War', 'Peter R. Hunt, John Glen, Michael Reed', 'Alastair Reid, Wilbur Smith, Stanley Price', 'Lee Marvin, Roger Moore, Barbara Parkins, Ian Holm, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Gernot Endemann, Karl Michael Vogler, Horst Janson', 'PG', 'During World War One an English adventurer, an American elephant poacher and the latter''s attractive young daughter, set out to destroy a German battle-cruiser which is awaiting repairs in an inlet just off Zanzibar. The story is based on a novel by Wilbur Smith, which in turn is very loosely based on events involving the light cruiser SMS Königsberg, which was sunk after taking refuge in Rufigi delta in 1915.', 'During World War One an English adventurer, an American elephant poacher and the latter''s attractive young daughter, set out to destroy a German battle-cruiser which is awaiting repairs in an inlet just off Zanzibar. The story is based on a novel by Wilbur Smith, which in turn is very loosely based on events involving the light cruiser SMS Königsberg, which was sunk after taking refuge in Rufigi delta in 1915.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b3E45shfLbipuRc2lXrqSkkrn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39419'),
