  ('1070402136036503834', 'Showbiz: or how to become a celebrity in 1-2-3!', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Herodes Falsk, Odd Ragnar Lund', 'Herodes Falsk, Tom Mathisen', 'Herodes Falsk, Tom Mathisen, Guro Rustad, Terry Heart, Paul Åge Johannesen, Anette Stai, Marius Müller, Øivind Blunck', null, 'A young boy named Espen Søplekladden is leaving home. He starts to work at a jazz café named "Balla Jazzhus". But his evil brother is trying to make everything bad for him.', 'A young boy named Espen Søplekladden is leaving home. He starts to work at a jazz café named "Balla Jazzhus". But his evil brother is trying to make everything bad for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uJowqvNnWQwAKxkuuYfBkvdpoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354868'),
