  ('856790792931667787', 'Showdown at Boot Hill', 1958, 'Western', 'Gene Fowler Jr., John M. Nickolaus Jr.', 'Louis Vittes', 'Charles Bronson, John Carradine, Carole Mathews, Robert Hutton, Fintan Meyler, Thomas Browne Henry, Paul Maxey, George Douglas', 'NR', 'Bounty hunter Luke Welsh arrives looking for a wanted man. When that man draws on him he has to kill him. To collect his reward he needs a statement identifying him. But the man was well liked in town and no one will sign such a statement. When he outdraws another man who thought he was faster, some townsmen decide he should be killed and they organize a mob to go after him.', 'Bounty hunter Luke Welsh arrives looking for a wanted man. When that man draws on him he has to kill him. To collect his reward he needs a statement identifying him. But the man was well liked in town and no one will sign such a statement. When he outdraws another man who thought he was faster, some townsmen decide he should be killed and they organize a mob to go after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ1vrJbWYa65MopMb1UjPLGOAKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73821'),
  ('607279707144484963', 'Showdown at the Grand', 2023, 'Action, Comedy', 'Orson Oblowitz', 'Orson Oblowitz', 'Terrence Howard, Dolph Lundgren, Amanda Righetti, John Savage, Piper Curda, Jon Sklaroff, Mike Ferguson, Clemmie Dugdale', 'NR', 'A proud movie theater owner must defend his family business from corporate developers alongside a legendary action star as art imitates life in a showdown for the ages.', 'A proud movie theater owner must defend his family business from corporate developers alongside a legendary action star as art imitates life in a showdown for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BHE8h2wnqk7MY6KdnIE1RZT4ZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117269'),
  ('1011648898900764368', 'Showdown in Little Tokyo', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Mark L. Lester, Mark Irwin, Dirk Craft', 'Stephen Glantz, Caliope Brattlestreet', 'Dolph Lundgren, Brandon Lee, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Tia Carrere, Toshishiro Obata, Philip Tan, Rodney Kageyama, Ernie Lively', 'R', 'An American with a Japanese upbringing, Chris Kenner is a police officer assigned to the Little Tokyo section of Los Angeles. Kenner is partnered with Johnny Murata, a Japanese-American who isn''t in touch with his roots. Despite their differences, both men excel at martial arts, and utilize their formidable skills when they go up against Yoshida, a vicious yakuza drug dealer with ties to Kenner''s past.', 'An American with a Japanese upbringing, Chris Kenner is a police officer assigned to the Little Tokyo section of Los Angeles. Kenner is partnered with Johnny Murata, a Japanese-American who isn''t in touch with his roots. Despite their differences, both men excel at martial arts, and utilize their formidable skills when they go up against Yoshida, a vicious yakuza drug dealer with ties to Kenner''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phwuQrs557cJkRhoS1TVWsslnJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13154'),
  ('650774966090241033', 'Shower', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zhang Yang', 'Zhang Yang, Xin Huo, Cai Shangjun', 'Zhu Xu, Pu Cunxin, Jiang Wu, Li Ding, Feng Shun, He Bing, Du Peng, Sui Yongqing', 'PG-13', 'An aged father and his younger, mentally challenged son have been working hard every day to keep the bathhouse running for a motley group of regular customers. When his elder son, who left years ago to seek his fortune in the southern city of Shenzhen, abruptly returns one day, it once again puts under stress the long-broken father-son ties. Presented as a light-hearted comedy, Shower explores the value of family, friendship, and tradition.', 'An aged father and his younger, mentally challenged son have been working hard every day to keep the bathhouse running for a motley group of regular customers. When his elder son, who left years ago to seek his fortune in the southern city of Shenzhen, abruptly returns one day, it once again puts under stress the long-broken father-son ties. Presented as a light-hearted comedy, Shower explores the value of family, friendship, and tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAEmh0m4RSDQrby64REzZJLCSH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1050'),
  ('789404665403916894', 'Showing Up', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christopher Blauvelt, Kiya Entwisle, Rachel Jensen', 'Kelly Reichardt, Jonathan Raymond', 'Michelle Williams, Hong Chau, Maryann Plunkett, John Magaro, André 3000, Amanda Plummer, Matt Malloy, Heather Lawless', 'R', 'In the days leading up to a possibly career-changing exhibition, a sculptor navigates her relationships with family, friends, and colleagues.', 'In the days leading up to a possibly career-changing exhibition, a sculptor navigates her relationships with family, friends, and colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJw55oTb2MlG4NWjq3sbIFUVU76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790416'),
  ('996936507692522817', 'Showroom', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Ortega, Fernando Molnar', 'Sabrina Campos, Sergio Bizzio, Fernando Molnar', 'Diego Peretti, Pablo Seijo, Roberto Catarineu, Andrea Garrote, Mónica Gonzaga, Matías Scarvaci', null, 'Out of work, Diego has only one goal: to return to live in the Capital no matter the cost. After leaving his family in Delta del Tigre, he becomes an obsessive salesman inside a building''s showroom: a perfect model that will lead him to experience absurd situations on the verge of madness.', 'Out of work, Diego has only one goal: to return to live in the Capital no matter the cost. After leaving his family in Delta del Tigre, he becomes an obsessive salesman inside a building''s showroom: a perfect model that will lead him to experience absurd situations on the verge of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0Nf8rGsXklcksfyZeSGjJGqdSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360039'),
  ('66102411975446200', 'Showroom', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlo Obispo', 'Carlo Obispo', 'Quinn Carrillo, Robb Guinto, Kit Thompson, Emilio Garcia, Ralmon Mendoza, Massimo Scofield, Alvaro Oteyza, Aaron Concepcion', null, 'Liezl, an ambitious agent, learns that her colleague, Susanah, uses her body to sell condo units; so she imitates her scheme. When the tables turn, Liezl begins to face her punishments one by one.', 'Liezl, an ambitious agent, learns that her colleague, Susanah, uses her body to sell condo units; so she imitates her scheme. When the tables turn, Liezl begins to face her punishments one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMtfinteQu34A9mGKBOW0BY7zT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034662'),
  ('889660088132592631', 'Showtime', 2002, 'Action, Comedy', 'Thomas Kloss, Tom Dey, Jack Gill', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Keith Sharon', 'Robert De Niro, Eddie Murphy, Rene Russo, William Shatner, Nestor Serrano, Joy Bryant, Yasiin Bey, Rachael Harris', 'PG-13', 'A spoof of buddy cop movies where two very different cops are forced to team up on a new reality based T.V. cop show.', 'A spoof of buddy cop movies where two very different cops are forced to team up on a new reality based T.V. cop show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sIooUxXZo2blCVuAYbL2wkdUfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5851'),
  ('88350974704106432', 'SHOWTIME 7', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kazutaka Watanabe, Masato Yano', 'Kim Byung-woo', 'Hiroshi Abe, Ryo Ryusei, Meru Nukumi, Haruka Igawa, Kotaro Yoshida, Tamae Ando, Koki Uchiyama, Mitsuru Hirata', null, 'Orimoto Shinnosuke, a former popular news anchor, was forced to leave the nationwide news program “Showtime 7” for a certain reason. Orimoto, now a negotiator, forcefully goes live on air to negotiate with a bomber. Based on the 2013 Korean film “Terror, Live.”', 'Orimoto Shinnosuke, a former popular news anchor, was forced to leave the nationwide news program “Showtime 7” for a certain reason. Orimoto, now a negotiator, forcefully goes live on air to negotiate with a bomber. Based on the 2013 Korean film “Terror, Live.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvESd95vkvMG3X1Km2cp8HlWwnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1368326'),
  ('585044509572526073', 'Shrapnel', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'William Kaufman, Lindsay Chag', 'Chad Law, Johnny Martin Walters', 'Jason Patric, Cam Gigandet, Kesia Elwin, Mauricio Mendoza, Guillermo Iván, Emily Perry, David DeLao, Teresa Decher', 'R', 'A former Marine and his old war buddy face off against the Mexican cartel behind the disappearance of his daughter.', 'A former Marine and his old war buddy face off against the Mexican cartel behind the disappearance of his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsRDrAML7hJC8ZCgRQobHIrzbxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982932'),
  ('851271681646168', 'Shredder', 2003, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Greg Huson, Charles Schner', 'Craig Donald Carlson, Greg Huson', 'Scott Weinger, Lindsey McKeon, Juleah Weikel, Billy O''Sullivan, Holly Towne, Brad Hawkins, Peter Riggs, Candace Moon', 'R', 'At an exclusive, secluded North American ski resort up on Mount Rocky Summit, brutal slashing, severing and beheading on a group of teenagers are taking place and are believed to be the work of a mysterious skier dressed in black.', 'At an exclusive, secluded North American ski resort up on Mount Rocky Summit, brutal slashing, severing and beheading on a group of teenagers are taking place and are believed to be the work of a mysterious skier dressed in black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdEnifU9Zm6L4CRnnHVRvgFWPCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36911'),
  ('880071804040056646', 'Shredderman Rules', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Savage Steve Holland, William D. Barber', 'Russell Marcus', 'Devon Werkheiser, Andrew Lewis Caldwell, Tim Meadows, Daniel Roebuck, Dave Coulier, Clare Carey, Francia Raísa, Mindy Sterling', null, 'Nolan Byrd is a scrawny and shy 9th grader who, like all the other kids, is bullied by Bubba Bixby. When their teacher, Mr. Green allows the students to do a computer project, Nolan, who has a particular knack with technology, decides to catch Bubba in action.', 'Nolan Byrd is a scrawny and shy 9th grader who, like all the other kids, is bullied by Bubba Bixby. When their teacher, Mr. Green allows the students to do a computer project, Nolan, who has a particular knack with technology, decides to catch Bubba in action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yi3ebCS5REMLY7sHsDdefC24cf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27353'),
  ('153834996238738763', 'Shree 420', 1955, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Raj Kapoor, Radhu Karmakar', 'Khwaja Ahmad Abbas', 'Raj Kapoor, Nargis, Nemo, Nadira, Lalita Pawar, Iftekhar, Hari Shivdasani, Rashid Khan', null, 'The story of a small-town man who comes to make it big in the city, where he is almost instantly relieved of all his possessions. Homeless and penniless, he is taken in by a woman who looks after him.', 'The story of a small-town man who comes to make it big in the city, where he is almost instantly relieved of all his possessions. Homeless and penniless, he is taken in by a woman who looks after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKqpOzyDhZvpGUDkUK8aY4treLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48929'),
  ('57557074497220988', 'Shrek', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Andrew Adamson, Vicky Jenson, Tim Cheung', 'Ted Elliott, Roger S.H. Schulman, Joe Stillman', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, John Lithgow, Vincent Cassel, Peter Dennis, Clive Pearse, Jim Cummings', 'PG', 'It ain''t easy bein'' green -- especially if you''re a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.', 'It ain''t easy bein'' green -- especially if you''re a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iB64vpL3dIObOtMZgX3RqdVdQDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808'),
  ('1018161146047133433', 'Shrek 2', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Conrad Vernon, Kelly Asbury, Andrew Adamson', 'Andrew Adamson, J. David Stem, Joe Stillman', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Julie Andrews, Antonio Banderas, John Cleese, Rupert Everett, Jennifer Saunders', 'PG', 'Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of his faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on a potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, the pompous Prince Charming, and the ogre-killer, Puss In Boots.', 'Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of his faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on a potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, the pompous Prince Charming, and the ogre-killer, Puss In Boots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yYP0PQjG8zVqturh1BAqu2Tixl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809'),
  ('50317853831290093', 'Shrek 5', 2027, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Brad Ableson, Walt Dohrn, Conrad Vernon', 'Michael McCullers', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Zendaya, Marcello Hernández, Skyler Gisondo, Chris Miller', null, 'The fifth film in the Shrek franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The fifth film in the Shrek franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRntI6gNBMu4B6YozI7rxXRPyQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421892'),
  ('118496815659768747', 'Shrek Forever After', 2010, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Mike Mitchell', 'Josh Klausner, Darren Lemke', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Walt Dohrn, Julie Andrews, John Cleese, Jon Hamm', 'PG', 'A midlife-crisis burdened Shrek, longing for the days when he felt like a real ogre, makes a pact with magic deal-maker Rumpelstiltskin. But when he''s duped and sent to a twisted version of Far Far Away—where Rumpelstiltskin is king, ogres are hunted, and he and Fiona have never met—he sets out to restore his world and reclaim his true love.', 'A midlife-crisis burdened Shrek, longing for the days when he felt like a real ogre, makes a pact with magic deal-maker Rumpelstiltskin. But when he''s duped and sent to a twisted version of Far Far Away—where Rumpelstiltskin is king, ogres are hunted, and he and Fiona have never met—he sets out to restore his world and reclaim his true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HrfPZtKcGmX2tUWW3cnciZTaSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10192'),
  ('761169782114437875', 'Shrek in the Swamp Karaoke Dance Party', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Music, Family, Romance', 'Vicky Jenson, Andrew Adamson', null, 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Christopher Knights, Guillaume Aretos, John Bisom, Matthew Gonder, Calvin Remsberg, Jean-Paul Vignon', null, 'Shrek and his friends enjoy themselves with some Karaoke partying.', 'Shrek and his friends enjoy themselves with some Karaoke partying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJg4alrYfp7CDNVID4iGefT9CIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26840'),
  ('115802863887330062', 'Shrek the Halls', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Gary Trousdale', 'Sean Bishop, Theresa Cullen, Bill Riling', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Cody Cameron, Conrad Vernon, Aron Warner, Christopher Knights', 'PG', 'The Christmas tree isn''t the only thing green in this new holiday classic. Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season. After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they''ll remember, he is forced to take a crash course in the holiday. But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.', 'The Christmas tree isn''t the only thing green in this new holiday classic. Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season. After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they''ll remember, he is forced to take a crash course in the holiday. But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeqUbXA0JPSlyAHdRTgxoYgK24n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13394'),
  ('121733152451278863', 'Shrek the Musical', 2013, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Romance, Adventure', 'Michael John Warren, Declan Quinn, David Backus', null, 'Brian d''Arcy James, Sutton Foster, Daniel Breaker, Christopher Sieber, John Tartaglia, Haven Burton Paschall, Jennifer Cody, Bobby Daye', 'PG', 'Put out of his swamp solitude by a wicked tyrant''s order, grumpy ogre Shrek goes on a journey – accompanied by a chatterbox donkey – to retrieve a beautiful princess from a tower, unaware that she has secrets all her own.', 'Put out of his swamp solitude by a wicked tyrant''s order, grumpy ogre Shrek goes on a journey – accompanied by a chatterbox donkey – to retrieve a beautiful princess from a tower, unaware that she has secrets all her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRvMRdLa8zQ85drGAWEsZTuKJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381696'),
  ('254317237803579551', 'Shrek the Third', 2007, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chris Miller, Raman Hui Shing-Ngai', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman, Chris Miller', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Julie Andrews, John Cleese, Rupert Everett, Eric Idle', 'PG', 'The King of Far Far Away has died and Shrek and Fiona are to become King & Queen. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, they set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.', 'The King of Far Far Away has died and Shrek and Fiona are to become King & Queen. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, they set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4SexGGQzI26E269tfpa80MZaGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810'),
  ('322100609257918866', 'Shrek''s Thrilling Tales', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', null, null, 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Hugh Laurie, Seth Rogen, Conrad Vernon, Cody Cameron', 'G', 'SHREK''S THRILLING TALES is the ultimate Halloween DVD compilation for your family. Shrek''s Thrilling Tales review Featuring the scariest, ugliest, and funniest characters from DreamWorks Animation''s successful SHREK and MONSTERS VS. ALIENS franchises. DVD includes ''The Pig who Cried (Were)Wolf'' and ''The Ghost of Lord Farquaad'' from the Shrek movies, and ''Night of the Living Carrots'' from Monsters vs. Aliens, featuring B.O.B.', 'SHREK''S THRILLING TALES is the ultimate Halloween DVD compilation for your family. Shrek''s Thrilling Tales review Featuring the scariest, ugliest, and funniest characters from DreamWorks Animation''s successful SHREK and MONSTERS VS. ALIENS franchises. DVD includes ''The Pig who Cried (Were)Wolf'' and ''The Ghost of Lord Farquaad'' from the Shrek movies, and ''Night of the Living Carrots'' from Monsters vs. Aliens, featuring B.O.B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wFlq0jFqW7vS0ttjLsWaoWOVKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128914'),
  ('72955687051426891', 'Shrew''s Nest', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Juanfer Andrés, Esteban Roel, Ángel Amorós', 'Ángel Amorós, Emma Tusell, Juanfer Andrés', 'Macarena Gómez, Nadia de Santiago, Hugo Silva, Luis Tosar, Gracia Olayo, Lucía de la Fuente, Carolina Bang, Tomás del Estal', 'NR', 'Spain, 1950s. Montse''s agoraphobia keeps her locked in a sinister apartment in Madrid and her only link to reality is the little sister she lost her youth raising. But one day, a reckless young neighbor, Carlos, falls down the stairwell and drags himself to their door. Someone has entered the shrew''s nest... perhaps he''ll never leave.', 'Spain, 1950s. Montse''s agoraphobia keeps her locked in a sinister apartment in Madrid and her only link to reality is the little sister she lost her youth raising. But one day, a reckless young neighbor, Carlos, falls down the stairwell and drags himself to their door. Someone has entered the shrew''s nest... perhaps he''ll never leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rgorbW4vCzZZHW5sEEczSjNqza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284305'),
  ('891673351854821050', 'Shriek If You Know What I Did Last Friday the Thirteenth', 2000, 'Comedy', 'John Blanchard, David J. Miller', 'Sue Bailey, Joe Nelms', 'Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Tom Arnold, Coolio, Majandra Delfino, Julie Benz, Danny Strong, Simon Rex, Harley Cross', 'R', 'In this horror parody, a masked serial killer menaces the town of Bulimia Falls with various sharp objects. Attention-seeking television personality Hagitha Utslay is soon on the scene, reporting on the ever-growing body count. Former mall security guard Doughy shows up to protect the teenage population, but he''s clearly not much help, allowing the murderer to pick off even more hapless kids as numerous scary movies are referenced.', 'In this horror parody, a masked serial killer menaces the town of Bulimia Falls with various sharp objects. Attention-seeking television personality Hagitha Utslay is soon on the scene, reporting on the ever-growing body count. Former mall security guard Doughy shows up to protect the teenage population, but he''s clearly not much help, allowing the murderer to pick off even more hapless kids as numerous scary movies are referenced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0jr23r30h8DUrX3kIu7rO3NIQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4226'),
  ('1010203306205849540', 'Shriek of the Mutilated', 1974, 'Horror', 'Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Ed Kelleher, Ed Adlum', 'Alan Brock, Jennifer Stock, Tawm Ellis, Michael Harris, Darcy Brown, Jack Neubeck, Ivan Agar, Tom Grail', 'R', 'An anthropology professor has invited his class to a remote cabin in the mountains to research the mythical Abominable Snowman. Soon after they arrive, strange events begin to befall the students, including sightings of a huge, white, furry creature.', 'An anthropology professor has invited his class to a remote cabin in the mountains to research the mythical Abominable Snowman. Soon after they arrive, strange events begin to befall the students, including sightings of a huge, white, furry creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LPOf2XRubz5hFTH5JpASuVsOwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84104'),
  ('1070875455866326258', 'Shrieker', 1998, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Brad Rushing', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Tanya Dempsey, Jamie Gannon, Parry Shen, Alison Cuffe, Chris Boyd, Thomas R. Martin, Jenya Lano, Rick Buono', 'R', 'Clark (Tanya Dempsey), a young Mathematics major at University, thinks she''s found the best deal for student housing: a group of squatters who live in an abandoned hospital secretly. The quirky residents let her into their community provided she follow the rules, including not telling anyone about her living arrangements. All seems wonderful, until she discovers that the reason that the hospital was abandoned was a series of murders in the 1940s by a strange "shrieking killer" who was never captured - and the discovery that someone who''s living in the hospital is using occult means to bring back the demonic "Shrieker".', 'Clark (Tanya Dempsey), a young Mathematics major at University, thinks she''s found the best deal for student housing: a group of squatters who live in an abandoned hospital secretly. The quirky residents let her into their community provided she follow the rules, including not telling anyone about her living arrangements. All seems wonderful, until she discovers that the reason that the hospital was abandoned was a series of murders in the 1940s by a strange "shrieking killer" who was never captured - and the discovery that someone who''s living in the hospital is using occult means to bring back the demonic "Shrieker".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7ScQr1GWejGrwcz0V7ahSVYgiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36854'),
  ('1124164670755348612', 'Shrill Cries of Summer', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Ataru Oikawa, Kazuhiro Shirao', 'Ataru Oikawa', 'Goki Maeda, Rin Asuka, Airi Matsuyama, Aika, Erena Ono, Tetta Sugimoto, Ayako Kawahara, Masashi Taniguchi', null, 'Early summer, Keiichi had just moved to a remote mountain village. As he becomes close friends with a group of girls, he was enjoying his life in the village. However when he starts to become suspicious that his friends may be deeply involved in successive murders that occur every summer, the situation around Keiichi gradually starts to turn into something more sinister.', 'Early summer, Keiichi had just moved to a remote mountain village. As he becomes close friends with a group of girls, he was enjoying his life in the village. However when he starts to become suspicious that his friends may be deeply involved in successive murders that occur every summer, the situation around Keiichi gradually starts to turn into something more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPoxpoDGiONigDfNx3b2SpO4oN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34129'),
  ('300845671280553200', 'Shrill Cries: Reshuffle', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ataru Oikawa, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Ataru Oikawa', 'Goki Maeda, Airi Matsuyama, Rin Asuka, Aika, Erena Ono, Hitomi Miwa, Kotaro Tanaka', null, 'Maebara Keiichi, a young teenager, has recently moved from the city to the rural village of Hinamizawa with his family. He is adjusting quite well to his new life, making friends at the small school, playing games, passing time in relative happiness, when suddenly a gruesome murder occurs. A mystery begins to unravel — tracing back to happenings five years ago. As Keiichi learns more about these strange events, he wonders if he will be able to face the truth behind all of this.', 'Maebara Keiichi, a young teenager, has recently moved from the city to the rural village of Hinamizawa with his family. He is adjusting quite well to his new life, making friends at the small school, playing games, passing time in relative happiness, when suddenly a gruesome murder occurs. A mystery begins to unravel — tracing back to happenings five years ago. As Keiichi learns more about these strange events, he wonders if he will be able to face the truth behind all of this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKxlOK0HNkGWDED1C66vNAvEwEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68557'),
  ('649504861579415102', 'Shrimp Stories', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon, Jean Painlevé', 'Catherine Tchernigovtzeff', null, null, 'After a comic introduction, we look closely at a shrimp. Eyes on stilts, color patterns, pinchered walking feet, a rostrum. We watch shrimp eat using a strong claw and a fine one; we watch digestion. After eating, shrimp clean themselves. The female lays eggs that cling to her feet. After three weeks, the eggs hatch explosively. Few larvae live to adulthood. We watch an adult shed its carapace with a final leap, leaving it vulnerable; other shrimp attack.', 'After a comic introduction, we look closely at a shrimp. Eyes on stilts, color patterns, pinchered walking feet, a rostrum. We watch shrimp eat using a strong claw and a fine one; we watch digestion. After eating, shrimp clean themselves. The female lays eggs that cling to her feet. After three weeks, the eggs hatch explosively. Few larvae live to adulthood. We watch an adult shed its carapace with a final leap, leaving it vulnerable; other shrimp attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96cwlRWVYriIy7jZ6zBkmhSzwWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163146'),
  ('1042254561131200571', 'Shrink', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonas Pate, Jason Roberts, Christian Clarke', 'Thomas Moffett', 'Kevin Spacey, Mark Webber, Keke Palmer, Saffron Burrows, Jack Huston, Pell James, Dallas Roberts, Laura Ramsey', 'R', 'Unable to cope with a recent personal tragedy, LA''s top celebrity shrink turns into a pothead with no concern for his appearance and a creeping sense of his inability to help his patients.', 'Unable to cope with a recent personal tragedy, LA''s top celebrity shrink turns into a pothead with no concern for his appearance and a creeping sense of his inability to help his patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pg6649ymX3M5otI7siheMggBsz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22640'),
  ('182958252436484479', 'Shrooms', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Paddy Breathnach, Nanu Segal, Rory Bruen', 'Pearse Elliott', 'Lindsey Haun, Jack Huston, Max Kasch, Maya Hazen, Alice Greczyn, Robert Hoffman, Don Wycherley, Sean McGinley', 'NR', 'A group of American teens comes to Ireland to visit a friend who takes them on a camping trip in search of the local, fabled magic mushrooms. When the psychedelics start taking hold, the panicked friends are attacked by ghostly creatures; but how can they determine whether what they are experiencing is reality or hallucination?', 'A group of American teens comes to Ireland to visit a friend who takes them on a camping trip in search of the local, fabled magic mushrooms. When the psychedelics start taking hold, the panicked friends are attacked by ghostly creatures; but how can they determine whether what they are experiencing is reality or hallucination?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU4lcKfjf0U8pM036FHyoVGLev7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14456'),
