  ('416450186449321406', 'Shulie', 1997, null, 'Elisabeth Subrin', 'Elisabeth Subrin', 'Kim Soss', null, 'Elisabeth Subrin’s masterful film is a shot-by-shot reenactment of an unreleased 1967 documentary portrait of SAIC student Shulamith Firestone, who, a few years later, would become a central figure in the rise of radical feminism. Through its meticulous staging, the film expresses in Subrin’s words, “the residues of the past,” and the resonance of issues around gender and class today. (Gene Siskel Film Center)', 'Elisabeth Subrin’s masterful film is a shot-by-shot reenactment of an unreleased 1967 documentary portrait of SAIC student Shulamith Firestone, who, a few years later, would become a central figure in the rise of radical feminism. Through its meticulous staging, the film expresses in Subrin’s words, “the residues of the past,” and the resonance of issues around gender and class today. (Gene Siskel Film Center)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyCW2sqAa8X9gjuaZOtNrjw4iTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319050'),
  ('315704273921666607', 'Shun Li and the Poet', 2011, 'Drama', 'Andrea Segre, Luca Bigazzi', 'Andrea Segre, Marco Pettenello', 'Zhao Tao, Rade Šerbedžija, Marco Paolini, Roberto Citran, Giuseppe Battiston, Giordano Bacci, Spartaco Mainardi, Zhong Cheng', null, 'A study of the friendship between a Chinese woman and a fisherman who came to Italy from Yugoslavia many years ago, who live in a small city-island in the Veneto lagoon.', 'A study of the friendship between a Chinese woman and a fisherman who came to Italy from Yugoslavia many years ago, who live in a small city-island in the Veneto lagoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj0qO36gzAWh9vhpbVjvQp3iQqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75562'),
  ('327295953546284489', 'Shut In', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Farren Blackburn, Yves Bélanger', 'Christina Hodson', 'Naomi Watts, Charlie Heaton, Oliver Platt, David Cubitt, Jacob Tremblay, Crystal Balint, Clémentine Poidatz, Ellen David', 'PG-13', 'A widowed child psychologist lives in an isolated existence in rural New England. When caught in a deadly winter storm, she must find a way to rescue a young boy before he disappears forever.', 'A widowed child psychologist lives in an isolated existence in rural New England. When caught in a deadly winter storm, she must find a way to rescue a young boy before he disappears forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXIGq6ddQhIYe4Z7A86nZ1qjUME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329981'),
  ('802052242691203880', 'Shut In', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'D.J. Caruso, Akis Konstantakopoulos', 'Melanie Toast', 'Rainey Qualley, Vincent Gallo, Jake Horowitz, Luciana VanDette, Aidan Steimer', 'R', 'A young single mother is held captive along with her two children by a violent ex and must plot their escape before it’s too late.', 'A young single mother is held captive along with her two children by a violent ex and must plot their escape before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5ug4LyLQFeR6azAJyIPBQz5ur9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629015'),
  ('900041954166191398', 'Shut Up and Play the Hits', 2012, 'Music, Documentary', 'Dylan Southern, Will Lovelace, Reed Morano', null, 'James Murphy, Nancy Whang, Pat Mahoney, Gavilán Rayna Russom, Al Doyle, Matt Thornley, Tyler Pope, Chuck Klosterman', 'NR', 'An intimate portrait of Brooklyn-based electronic rock band LCD Soundsystem''s then-final live show on April 2, 2011, capturing both the exuberant, three-hour farewell concert at New York City''s Madison Square Garden and frontman James Murphy''s introspective 48 hours surrounding it.', 'An intimate portrait of Brooklyn-based electronic rock band LCD Soundsystem''s then-final live show on April 2, 2011, capturing both the exuberant, three-hour farewell concert at New York City''s Madison Square Garden and frontman James Murphy''s introspective 48 hours surrounding it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e5f9fMU1FtWPmZZTrvqk3hCG81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83589'),
  ('270412035724026148', 'Shut Up When You Speak!', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Clair, Mario Vulpiani', 'Philippe Clair, Enrico Oldoini', 'Aldo Maccione, Edwige Fenech, Philippe Clair, Tarak Harbi, Dominique Zardi, Clément Harari, André Nader, Daniel Derval', null, 'Giacomo has an idol: James Bond. When he dreams, he dreams of himself, his fabulous adventures, especially in Tunisia, and a beautiful wife, Belle. In reality he is unemployed, overwhelmed by an obsessive mother who continually called to see if he wore his woolen tank top and is treated by a doctor who thinks he is Einstein. Finally Giacomo is followed by bizarre characters, kidnapped and taken to Tunisia to live a wonderful adventure of her dreams, from the dangers of any kind ... and he met Beatrice', 'Giacomo has an idol: James Bond. When he dreams, he dreams of himself, his fabulous adventures, especially in Tunisia, and a beautiful wife, Belle. In reality he is unemployed, overwhelmed by an obsessive mother who continually called to see if he wore his woolen tank top and is treated by a doctor who thinks he is Einstein. Finally Giacomo is followed by bizarre characters, kidnapped and taken to Tunisia to live a wonderful adventure of her dreams, from the dangers of any kind ... and he met Beatrice', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61Z4bjKaiS3X82qOjKBcBWIwHxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41470'),
  ('219648551847358162', 'Shutter', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Parkpoom Wongpoom, Banjong Pisanthanakun, Niramon Ross', 'Sophon Sakdaphisit, Banjong Pisanthanakun, Parkpoom Wongpoom', 'Ananda Everingham, Natthaweeranuch Thongmee, Achita Sikamana, Unnop Chanpaibool, Titikarn Tongprasearth, Sivagorn Muttamara, Chachchaya Chalemphol, Kachornsak Naruepatr', 'R', 'When Jane and Tun run over a girl in a car accident, they speed away immediately from the crime scene. However, Tun, a photographer, soon discovers strange shadows in his photos, which unsettles them.', 'When Jane and Tun run over a girl in a car accident, they speed away immediately from the crime scene. However, Tun, a photographer, soon discovers strange shadows in his photos, which unsettles them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUyaVtyugDaDHtOC6kCMJhbZsWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17111'),
  ('39903329758115183', 'Shutter', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Masayuki Ochiai, Katsumi Yanagijima, Ed Licht', 'Luke Dawson', 'Joshua Jackson, Rachael Taylor, Megumi Okina, David Denman, Elly Otoguro, John Hensley, Maya Hazen, James Kyson', 'PG-13', 'A newly married couple discovers disturbing, ghostly images in photographs they develop after a tragic accident. Fearing the manifestations may be connected, they investigate and learn that some mysteries are better left unsolved.', 'A newly married couple discovers disturbing, ghostly images in photographs they develop after a tragic accident. Fearing the manifestations may be connected, they investigate and learn that some mysteries are better left unsolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5AEelR6nS0ISwaSZCcUrF2GKZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10885'),
  ('371386836391790987', 'Shutter Bugged Cat', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Tom Ray, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'G', 'Tom watches and studies films of some of his earlier encounters with Jerry, much like game films; he runs them backwards and stops them so he can study them more closely, all the while scribbling notes. Jerry pulls up a box of popcorn and watches, too. Tom notices Jerry and chases him into his hole. Tom designs a better mousetrap, but Jerry alters the plans, so it doesn''t work any better than it did the first time the footage was used, in Designs on Jerry (1955).', 'Tom watches and studies films of some of his earlier encounters with Jerry, much like game films; he runs them backwards and stops them so he can study them more closely, all the while scribbling notes. Jerry pulls up a box of popcorn and watches, too. Tom notices Jerry and chases him into his hole. Tom designs a better mousetrap, but Jerry alters the plans, so it doesn''t work any better than it did the first time the footage was used, in Designs on Jerry (1955).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jNwbsZ6Z3VK8SYwQadTKipErGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224059'),
  ('1035644252203078435', 'Shutter Island', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Martin Scorsese, Robert Richardson, Robert Guerra', 'Laeta Kalogridis', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Mark Ruffalo, Ben Kingsley, Max von Sydow, Michelle Williams, Emily Mortimer, Patricia Clarkson, Jackie Earle Haley', 'R', 'World War II soldier-turned-U.S. Marshal Teddy Daniels investigates the disappearance of a patient from a hospital for the criminally insane, but his efforts are compromised by troubling visions and a mysterious doctor.', 'World War II soldier-turned-U.S. Marshal Teddy Daniels investigates the disappearance of a patient from a hospital for the criminally insane, but his efforts are compromised by troubling visions and a mysterious doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrmXQ0zcZUL8jFLrakWc90IR8z9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11324'),
  ('973545607447606635', 'Shuttle', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'Edward Anderson, Allan Rafael, Jonathan Southard', 'Edward Anderson', 'Tony Curran, Peyton List, Cameron Goodman, Cullen Douglas, Dave Power, James Snyder, Tom Kemp, Kaylan Tracey', 'R', 'When two friends return from a girls weekend vacation in Mexico, they find themselves stranded at the airport. Trying to get home safely, they board an airport shuttle for the short trip. But once their feet cross the threshold of the shuttle, a night that had started like any other turns terrifying, and the ride home becomes a descent into darkness.', 'When two friends return from a girls weekend vacation in Mexico, they find themselves stranded at the airport. Trying to get home safely, they board an airport shuttle for the short trip. But once their feet cross the threshold of the shuttle, a night that had started like any other turns terrifying, and the ride home becomes a descent into darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZWYVT0YC5kDf6fetNAAifN1aAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17027'),
