  ('845481401678716137', 'Shy People', 1987, 'Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Chris Menges', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Marjorie David, Gérard Brach', 'Jill Clayburgh, Barbara Hershey, Martha Plimpton, Merritt Butrick, John Philbin, Don Swayze, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Mare Winningham', 'R', 'A Cosmo Magazine journalist and her daughter leave New York City to visit their distant relatives deep in the bayous of Louisiana.', 'A Cosmo Magazine journalist and her daughter leave New York City to visit their distant relatives deep in the bayous of Louisiana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GWGbFWk6fB9FuYSF5c5EuR3Jfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69040'),
  ('304654835561898505', 'Shyam Singha Roy', 2021, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'Rahul Sankrityan, Sanu John Varghese', 'Satyadev Janga', 'Nani, Sai Pallavi, Krithi Shetty, Madonna Sebastian, Murali Sharma, Rahul Ravindran, Abhinav Gomatam, Ankith Koyya', null, 'A young filmmaker is in a soup right when he’s about to find his footing in the film industry. When he sets out to find an answer, turns out it’s in the past.', 'A young filmmaker is in a soup right when he’s about to find his footing in the film industry. When he sets out to find an answer, turns out it’s in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C2wGMdwTQDUMIltYnn9qGrOs8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799676'),
  ('882543215705451124', 'Shyness Machine Girl', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Noboru Iguchi, Eiji Kametani', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Noriko Kohara, Yuya Ishikawa, Demo Tanaka, Kentaro Kishi, Hiroaki Murakami, Yukihide Benny, Takatoshi Naoi, Masahiro Aoki', null, 'Ami''s friend, Yoshie, was murdered and desecrated by the Kimura Gang. She was saved and, like Ami in the previous film, received modifications from the same mechanics. Remembering her past, Yoshie decides to avenge herself and Ami.', 'Ami''s friend, Yoshie, was murdered and desecrated by the Kimura Gang. She was saved and, like Ami in the previous film, received modifications from the same mechanics. Remembering her past, Yoshie decides to avenge herself and Ami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjTIML9a1LycaGlvnwZsL52jxTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36119'),
