  ('528800182364106926', 'Si Fa Presto a Dire Amore', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bruno Nappi, Enrico Brignano, Paolo Rossato', 'Enrico Brignano, Augusto Caminito, Natalia Gambino', 'Enrico Brignano, Vittoria Belvedere, Isabel Pérez, Samuela Sardo, Corrado Olmi, Pia Velsi, Luigi Diberti, Mariolina De Fano', null, 'Enrico is 30 years old, unemployed, and spends his life between public competitions and his friends at the bar. But one day, Silvana, his beautiful girlfriend, suddenly leaves him without explanation. His life falls apart, and Enrico even attempts suicide, albeit half-heartedly. Elvira, a sweet girl who has also recently suffered a heartbreak, mends his broken heart. Everything seems to be fine when Silvana returns forcefully to the forefront. Enrico has no choice but to divide his time between the two. Martha, a beautiful foreigner with children, will take him far away, dragging him to Uruguay. But Silvana will always be in his heart.', 'Enrico is 30 years old, unemployed, and spends his life between public competitions and his friends at the bar. But one day, Silvana, his beautiful girlfriend, suddenly leaves him without explanation. His life falls apart, and Enrico even attempts suicide, albeit half-heartedly. Elvira, a sweet girl who has also recently suffered a heartbreak, mends his broken heart. Everything seems to be fine when Silvana returns forcefully to the forefront. Enrico has no choice but to divide his time between the two. Martha, a beautiful foreigner with children, will take him far away, dragging him to Uruguay. But Silvana will always be in his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bP87N8EBF7vO2HEttvhwvoB3hj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113598'),
  ('759336623297434248', 'Si muore solo da vivi', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Rizzi, Massimo Moschin', 'Marco Pettenello, Alberto Rizzi', 'Alessandra Mastronardi, Alessandro Roja, Francesco Pannofino, Neri Marcorè, Amanda Lear, Ugo Pagliai, Andrea Gherpelli, Paolo Cioni', null, 'Orlando is in his 40s and is "loser" until the 2012 earthquake makes him change his life.', 'Orlando is in his 40s and is "loser" until the 2012 earthquake makes him change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMSnmBDATYQKzXV0BoOIfC9wkG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:708618'),
  ('984456556948690751', 'Si muore tutti democristiani', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Davide Rossi, Andrea Mazzarella, Davide Bonacina', 'Davide Bonacina, Pietro Belfiore, Davide Rossi', 'Massimiliano Loizzi, Walter Leonardi, Marco Ripoldi, Valentina Lodovini, Francesco Mandelli, Paolo Rossi, Cochi Ponzoni, Martina De Santis', null, 'Enrico, Fabrizio, and Stefano are three lifelong friends and colleagues who share left-wing political ideals. They run a small production company, juggling commercials and wedding shoots, but hope to return to making social-themed documentaries. One day, they receive a financially attractive offer that seems to meet their expectations. Unfortunately, the deal has unethical implications.', 'Enrico, Fabrizio, and Stefano are three lifelong friends and colleagues who share left-wing political ideals. They run a small production company, juggling commercials and wedding shoots, but hope to return to making social-themed documentaries. One day, they receive a financially attractive offer that seems to meet their expectations. Unfortunately, the deal has unethical implications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLdgBaGQSUkOgt6unV18bNAU8Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520379'),
  ('248855304926993515', 'Si può fare l''amore vestiti?', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Donato Ursitti, Federico Del Zoppo', 'Giorgia Colli', 'Bianca Guaccero, Corrado Fortuna, Marina Rocco, Michele Venitucci, Maurizio Battista, Bonaria Decorato, Paolo De Vita, Anna Ferruzzo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbf3z60Q5pjaX27HfYjHfgTCKl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187238'),
  ('509377340718796653', 'Si saben cómo me pongo ¿Pa'' qué me invitan?', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Henry Albadán, Fernando Ayllón, Ludi Lizcano', 'Fernando Ayllón, Ricardo Quevedo, Iván Marín', 'Ricardo Quevedo, Fabiola Posada, Nelson Polanía, Iván Marín, Freddy Beltrán, Patricia Maldonado, Manuel Busquets, Jéssica Sanjuan', null, 'Four mismatched couples meet at an exclusive resort in search of new adventures to improve their relationship. All of them will do their best to find the balance with their better half, but to achieve it they will have to overcome the difficult tests that love poses.', 'Four mismatched couples meet at an exclusive resort in search of new adventures to improve their relationship. All of them will do their best to find the balance with their better half, but to achieve it they will have to overcome the difficult tests that love poses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txY8qhRvbws3UCY5E29EG4akncg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504062'),
  ('486216100412153740', 'Si tu vois ma mère', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Nathanaël Guedj', 'Nathanaël Guedj, Sophie Glaas, Alexandre Smia', 'Félix Moati, Noémie Lvovsky, Sara Giraudeau, Gilles Cohen, Eugénie Derouand, Géraldine Martineau, Estéban, Raphaël Quenard', null, 'Max is single, ophthalmologist, and a real mama''s boy. Until she suddenly dies. Max should be devastated, yet he seems to be coping well. Too well. He actually still sees her, talks to her. She is not gone, still here, still close to her beloved baby boy. Max knows she is dead, yet he holds on to this impossible reality. Until he starts sharing his office with Ohiana, a shrink who he slowly falls in love with. Mom is not going to like it.', 'Max is single, ophthalmologist, and a real mama''s boy. Until she suddenly dies. Max should be devastated, yet he seems to be coping well. Too well. He actually still sees her, talks to her. She is not gone, still here, still close to her beloved baby boy. Max knows she is dead, yet he holds on to this impossible reality. Until he starts sharing his office with Ohiana, a shrink who he slowly falls in love with. Mom is not going to like it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsIniVKXBTDSqjPvhArphQE29xW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689240'),
