  ('78649614195253825', 'Sibel', 2019, 'Drama', 'Çagla Zencirci, Guillaume Giovanetti, Yagmur Misirlioglu', 'Ramata-Toulaye Sy, Çagla Zencirci, Guillaume Giovanetti', 'Damla Sönmez, Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Emin Gürsoy, Elit İşcan, Gülçin Kültür Şahin, Sevval Tezcan, Meral Çetinkaya', null, '25-year-old Sibel lives with her father and sister in a secluded village in the mountains of Turkey’s Black Sea region. Sibel is a mute, but she communicates by using the ancestral whistled language of the area.', '25-year-old Sibel lives with her father and sister in a secluded village in the mountains of Turkey’s Black Sea region. Sibel is a mute, but she communicates by using the ancestral whistled language of the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bK58MiYSyYkORnXKkcir8zSx2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537651'),
