  ('364411109820535282', 'Siberia', 2018, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Matthew Ross, Eric Koretz, Alexander Galeev', 'Scott B. Smith', 'Keanu Reeves, Ana Ularu, Pasha D. Lychnikoff, Boris Gulyarin, Ashley St. George, Elliot Lazar, Veronica Ferres, Vladimir Shklyar', 'R', 'Lucas, a diamond trader who travels to Saint Petersburg to arrange a sale, discovers that his Russian business partner has left his hotel and gone to a small Siberian village, so Lucas also heads there to try find him.', 'Lucas, a diamond trader who travels to Saint Petersburg to arrange a sale, discovers that his Russian business partner has left his hotel and gone to a small Siberian village, so Lucas also heads there to try find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGfIsvdrUhTlQOkxQIELU7obDYj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438689'),
  ('811994993429685222', 'Siberia', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Stefano Falivene, Jacopo Bonvicini, Abel Ferrara', 'Abel Ferrara, Christ Zois', 'Willem Dafoe, Dounia Sichov, Simon McBurney, Cristina Chiriac, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Anna Ferrara, Phil Neilson, Stella Pecollo', 'R', 'Clint is a dead man who lives alone in a frozen tundra. However, this isolation cannot bring either evasion or peace. One night, he begins a journey where he must confront his dreams, memories, and visions, crossing the darkness into the light.', 'Clint is a dead man who lives alone in a frozen tundra. However, this isolation cannot bring either evasion or peace. One night, he begins a journey where he must confront his dreams, memories, and visions, crossing the darkness into the light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSCjeSAkdrAyi3XDIrNWpMsH5oP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446574'),
  ('870101686592717448', 'Siberiade', 1979, 'War, Drama, History, Romance', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Levan Paatashvili, Boris Travkin', 'Valentin Ezhov, Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Vitali Solomin, Sergey Shakurov, Natalya Andreychenko, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Vladimir Samoylov, Mikhail Kononov, Nikolai Skorobogatov', null, 'The story about a very small god-forgotten village in Siberia reflects the history of Russia from the beginning of the century till the early 1980s. Three generations try to find the land of happiness and to give it to the people. One builds the road through taiga to the star over horizon, the second ''build communism'' and the third searches for oil.', 'The story about a very small god-forgotten village in Siberia reflects the history of Russia from the beginning of the century till the early 1980s. Three generations try to find the land of happiness and to give it to the people. One builds the road through taiga to the star over horizon, the second ''build communism'' and the third searches for oil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3WYuEQkI5hAFGmCsip1hcModo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68553'),
  ('916200657770232732', 'Siberian Education', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Italo Petriccione, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia', 'John Malkovich, Arnas Fedaravičius, Vilius Tumalavicius, Eleanor Tomlinson, Peter Stormare, Jonas Trukanas, Andrius Paulavičius, Donatas Šimukauskas', 'R', 'The story of a gang of children growing up in a community of banished criminals, in a forgotten corner of the former Soviet Union. This community rejects the world outside. The only law it obeys… is its own. Against this backdrop two best friends, Kolyma and Gagarin, gradually become fierce enemies as they find themselves on opposite sides of the strict code of honour of the ‘honest criminal’ brotherhood.', 'The story of a gang of children growing up in a community of banished criminals, in a forgotten corner of the former Soviet Union. This community rejects the world outside. The only law it obeys… is its own. Against this backdrop two best friends, Kolyma and Gagarin, gradually become fierce enemies as they find themselves on opposite sides of the strict code of honour of the ‘honest criminal’ brotherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSXguX0FmIvRr7r85uSZW96tLut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171337'),
  ('277591718624022078', 'Siberian Lady Macbeth', 1962, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Andrzej Wajda, Aleksandar Sekulović', 'Nikolai Leskov', 'Olivera Marković, Ljuba Tadić, Kapitalina Erić, Bojan Stupica, Miodrag Lazarević, Branka Petrić, Ingrid Lotarius, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić', null, 'A ruthless woman''s adulterous affair with a drifter sets in motion a chain-reaction of murder and deception in a remote village in 19th Century Mtsensk.', 'A ruthless woman''s adulterous affair with a drifter sets in motion a chain-reaction of murder and deception in a remote village in 19th Century Mtsensk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmdVUPcuFZZHON6dlsEONnrdAL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191407'),
  ('606122739982063494', 'Siberian Sniper', 2021, 'War, History', 'Dmitry Koltsov, Sergey Zverev', null, 'Aytal Stepanov, Aleksandr Kazantsev, Dmitry Koltsov, Daniil Zhuravlev, Pavel Pogodaev, Vyacheslav Yugov', null, 'After months of exhausting trench warfare, most of Major Belyaev''s battalion was destroyed. The area is ruled by German aces snipers. Hope for replenishment collapses when the convoy, in which the Soviet snipers were traveling, falls under a German airstrike. A handful of soldiers and a young hunter from Yakutia, Yegor Cheerin, survive.', 'After months of exhausting trench warfare, most of Major Belyaev''s battalion was destroyed. The area is ruled by German aces snipers. Hope for replenishment collapses when the convoy, in which the Soviet snipers were traveling, falls under a German airstrike. A handful of soldiers and a young hunter from Yakutia, Yegor Cheerin, survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbeqC9It2Z5AnsJMd6qFLC4kVNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752589'),
  ('306595961808617874', 'Sibling Rivalry', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carl Reiner, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Martha Goldhirsh', 'Kirstie Alley, Bill Pullman, Carrie Fisher, Jami Gertz, Scott Bakula, Frances Sternhagen, John Randolph, Sam Elliott', 'PG-13', 'Marjorie Turner is suffocating in her marriage and day to day life. An extramarital affair with a stranger seems to be the answer until her paramour has a fatal heart attack, and turns out to be less of a stranger than she could have thought...', 'Marjorie Turner is suffocating in her marriage and day to day life. An extramarital affair with a stranger seems to be the answer until her paramour has a fatal heart attack, and turns out to be less of a stranger than she could have thought...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBrfiqeiB8L6VU04NSZy1e3qc2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108553'),
  ('379050462530505836', 'Siblings', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Greta Scarano, Valerio Azzali, Matteo Damiani', 'Greta Scarano, Sofia Assirelli, Tieta Madia', 'Matilda De Angelis, Yuri Tuci, Maria Amelia Monti, Paolo Hendel, Adriano Pantaleo, Christian Ginepro, Gloria Cocco, Ariella Reggio', null, 'Irene lives in Rome. When her mother ask to, she go back to Rimini, her hometown, to take care of her autistic brother, Omar. She soon discover that Omar knows very well what to expect from the future, but in order to achieve his dreams, he need to be independent, which is why Irene begins a tender crash course to teach him adult life.', 'Irene lives in Rome. When her mother ask to, she go back to Rimini, her hometown, to take care of her autistic brother, Omar. She soon discover that Omar knows very well what to expect from the future, but in order to achieve his dreams, he need to be independent, which is why Irene begins a tender crash course to teach him adult life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toPaHeoiPLRG0LJ4DZYXuIwT8W9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421309'),
  ('621610525612517157', 'Siblings of the Cape', 2019, 'Drama', 'Takuya Fujii, Kazuhiro Saito, Shinzo Katayama', 'Shinzo Katayama', 'Yuya Matsuura, Misa Wada, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Masayasu Kitayama, Ayumu Tokitô, Takumi Matsuzawa, Tateto Serizawa, Kenji Iwaya', null, 'A pair of siblings battling poverty and disabilities turn to prostitution, learning how to eat, fight, and love.', 'A pair of siblings battling poverty and disabilities turn to prostitution, learning how to eat, fight, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSHGNzQ0NlllCZQfgbucMOQYdBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579057'),
  ('335674554412080301', 'Sibyl', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sacha Peluchon, Bénédicte Dujardin, Madeleine Thiberville', 'Arthur Harari, Justine Triet', 'Virginie Efira, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Gaspard Ulliel, Sandra Hüller, Laure Calamy, Niels Schneider, Paul Hamy, Arthur Harari', 'R', 'Sibyl, a jaded psychotherapist, returns to her first passion: writing. But her newest patient Margot, a troubled up-and-coming actress, proves to be a source of inspiration that is far too tempting. Fascinated almost to the point of obsession, Sibyl becomes more and more involved in Margot’s tumultuous life, reviving volatile memories that bring her face to face with her past.', 'Sibyl, a jaded psychotherapist, returns to her first passion: writing. But her newest patient Margot, a troubled up-and-coming actress, proves to be a source of inspiration that is far too tempting. Fascinated almost to the point of obsession, Sibyl becomes more and more involved in Margot’s tumultuous life, reviving volatile memories that bring her face to face with her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W4pznUF8Np6qHExgclaRHVHzom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559401'),
