  ('463165417282262348', 'Sicario', 1994, 'Drama', 'José Ramón Novoa, Oscar Pérez, Belén Orsini', 'David Suárez', 'Laureano Olivares, Gledys Ibarra, Pedro Lander, Hermán Gil, Eva Mondolfi, William Moreno, Paco Hernández, Hugo Márquez', null, 'Jairo is a teenager living in a marginal world, in a neighborhood full of drugs and assaults. Tired of poverty and his family hell, he is forced to resort to violence. He thinks his only way out of misery through the world of crime, so he decides to participate in an assault to get money with which to regain their dignity.', 'Jairo is a teenager living in a marginal world, in a neighborhood full of drugs and assaults. Tired of poverty and his family hell, he is forced to resort to violence. He thinks his only way out of misery through the world of crime, so he decides to participate in an assault to get money with which to regain their dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFs9f9cksIg0ukzdD1w7YlPFo3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95700'),
