  ('842102706535740109', 'Sicarivs: The Night and the Silence', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Javier Muñoz, Javier Cerdá', 'Javier Muñoz', 'Víctor Clavijo, Fernando Gil, Nahia Laiz, Israel Elejalde, María Cecilia Sánchez, Sebastián Haro, Alejandra Lorente, Chete Lera', null, 'A hit man receives the assignment to kill a woman. But what seems as another job complicates when he is about to execute her, but does not. He will have to go after those who gave him the contract, for, in his profession, those who do not comply with their duty end up dead. But the question remains, why did he not kill the woman?', 'A hit man receives the assignment to kill a woman. But what seems as another job complicates when he is about to execute her, but does not. He will have to go after those who gave him the contract, for, in his profession, those who do not comply with their duty end up dead. But the question remains, why did he not kill the woman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJIiMef1Yr9BOSiDu4uPzKRcC8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331110'),
  ('705027058350096298', 'Sicilian Ghost Story', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Antonio Piazza, Fabio Grassadonia, Luca Bigazzi', 'Fabio Grassadonia, Antonio Piazza', 'Julia Jedlikowska, Gaetano Fernandez, Corinne Musallari, Andrea Falzone, Federico Finocchiaro, Lorenzo Curcio, Vincenzo Amato, Sabine Timoteo', null, 'In a little Sicilian village at the edge of a forest, Giuseppe, a boy of 13, vanishes. Luna, his classmate who loves him, refuses to accept his mysterious disappearance. She rebels against the silence and complicity that surround her, and to find him she descends into the dark world which has swallowed him up and which has a lake as its mysterious entrance.', 'In a little Sicilian village at the edge of a forest, Giuseppe, a boy of 13, vanishes. Luna, his classmate who loves him, refuses to accept his mysterious disappearance. She rebels against the silence and complicity that surround her, and to find him she descends into the dark world which has swallowed him up and which has a lake as its mysterious entrance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqKVM6ujKR1UkyehoRaBsxw2D8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453347'),
  ('320584846679047685', 'Sicilian Letters', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Fabio Grassadonia, Antonio Piazza, Luca Bigazzi', 'Fabio Grassadonia, Antonio Piazza', 'Toni Servillo, Elio Germano, Daniela Marra, Barbora Bobuľová, Giuseppe Tantillo, Fausto Russo Alesi, Antonia Truppo, Tommaso Ragno', null, 'Loosely based on real events that took place during Matteo Messina Denaro''s thirty years on the run. A disgraced politician is gifted a second chance when secret services involve him in an operation to root out an elusive Mafia boss. Using his personal connection as the Boss'' godfather, his task is to get him to reveal his hiding place in their secret letters.', 'Loosely based on real events that took place during Matteo Messina Denaro''s thirty years on the run. A disgraced politician is gifted a second chance when secret services involve him in an operation to root out an elusive Mafia boss. Using his personal connection as the Boss'' godfather, his task is to get him to reveal his hiding place in their secret letters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NTEqGvc0EaNraKYSDtevQprP9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148663'),
  ('65941256215352942', 'Sicily!', 1999, 'Drama', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Arnaud Maillet', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Gianni Buscarino, Vittorio Vigneri, Angela Nugara, Carmelo Maddio, Angela Durantini, Simone Nucatola, Ignazio Trombello, Giovanni Interlandi', null, 'A man returns to visit his native Sicily after living in New York for a long time. He learns about the Sicilian way of life from stylized conversations with an orange picker, his fellow train passengers, his mother, and a knife-sharpener.', 'A man returns to visit his native Sicily after living in New York for a long time. He learns about the Sicilian way of life from stylized conversations with an orange picker, his fellow train passengers, his mother, and a knife-sharpener.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyB17QfiGKt12LmJYMpHoY9XooD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104871'),
  ('701976307074332301', 'Sick', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John Hyams, Yaron Levy, Craig Borden', 'Katelyn Crabb, Kevin Williamson', 'Gideon Adlon, Bethlehem Million, Dylan Sprayberry, Marc Menchaca, Jane Adams, Joel Courtney, Chris Reid, Duane Stephens', 'R', 'While quarantining at her family''s lake house during the pandemic, Parker and her best friend are threatened by an unexpected visitor.', 'While quarantining at her family''s lake house during the pandemic, Parker and her best friend are threatened by an unexpected visitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bshCGAHZRldAfdxXDX3637PW9cR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829410'),
  ('931835966710543944', 'Sick Girl', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Attila Szalay, Lucky McKee', null, 'Angela Bettis, Erin Brown, Mike McKee, Jesse Hlubik, Marcia Bennett, Chandra Berg, Alison Bartlett, William Finley', 'NR', 'A shy entomologist named Ida—whose girlfriend has left her, due to her interest in insects—develops a crush on a strange girl, Misty. After Ida receives a mysterious insect in the mail, the two women spend the night together, and Ida awakens to find that Misty has stumbled upon her insect collection and has a great interest in them herself.', 'A shy entomologist named Ida—whose girlfriend has left her, due to her interest in insects—develops a crush on a strange girl, Misty. After Ida receives a mysterious insect in the mail, the two women spend the night together, and Ida awakens to find that Misty has stumbled upon her insect collection and has a great interest in them herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayUkeTAikjxC4KTClDX6xyOvsPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334033'),
  ('267324927843062901', 'Sick Girl', 2007, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Eben McGarr, C.J. Roy', 'Eben McGarr', 'Leslie Andrews, Charlie Trepany, John McGarr, Katherine Macanufo, Graham Denman, Stephen Geoffreys, Ian Villalobos, Andy Signore', null, 'Izzy is raising her younger brother, Kevin, by herself. Their parents are deceased and her older brother, Rusty, is away in the Marines. When Izzy learns that her little brother is being bullied at school, she does what any unstable, psychopathic, homicidal sister would do.', 'Izzy is raising her younger brother, Kevin, by herself. Their parents are deceased and her older brother, Rusty, is away in the Marines. When Izzy learns that her little brother is being bullied at school, she does what any unstable, psychopathic, homicidal sister would do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mrmx2if86VytBnrKVKrpPPa22m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23515'),
  ('76485986676781350', 'Sick Girl', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Ante Cheng, Kim A. Winther, Sha''ree Green', 'Jennifer Cram', 'Nina Dobrev, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Brandon Mychal Smith, Sherry Cola, Stephanie Koenig, Hayley Magnus, Dan Bakkedahl, Ray McKinnon', 'R', 'When Wren Pepper feels her closest friends slipping away, she lets loose a little white lie that snowballs into a colossal, life-altering event.', 'When Wren Pepper feels her closest friends slipping away, she lets loose a little white lie that snowballs into a colossal, life-altering event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBwvNA03OQ2VXbtySYXPWRuWAGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618165'),
  ('129441509390634847', 'Sick Nurses', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Piraphan Laoyont, Thospol Sirivivat, Chitti Urnorakankij', 'Chanop Sirikamolmas, Buddhiporn Boossabarati, Piraphan Laoyont', 'Chidjun Hung, Wichaya Jarujinda, Chon Wachananon, Ase Wang, Dollaros Dachapratumwan, Kanya Rattanapetch, Ampaiwan Techapoowapat, Ampairat Techapoowapat', null, 'At a Thai hospital, a doctor and his seven nubile nurses engage in the sale of dead bodies. Jealousy causes one of the nurses to threaten to blow the whistle on the practice, so the others murder her. Soon the spirit of the slain nurse seeks revenge.', 'At a Thai hospital, a doctor and his seven nubile nurses engage in the sale of dead bodies. Jealousy causes one of the nurses to threaten to blow the whistle on the practice, so the others murder her. Soon the spirit of the slain nurse seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tikpHYU9fpf5iJmVeYiQ0htj4np.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45737'),
  ('369871009014827066', 'Sick of Myself', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katinka Lotherington, Benjamin Loeb, Kristoffer Borgli', 'Kristoffer Borgli', 'Kristine Kujath Thorp, Eirik Sæther, Fanny Vaager, Fredrik Stenberg Ditlev-Simonsen, Sarah Francesca Brænne, Steinar Klouman Hallert, Ingrid Vollan, Andrea Bræin Hovig', 'NR', 'Increasingly overshadowed by her boyfriend''s recent rise to fame as a contemporary artist creating sculptures from stolen furniture, Signe hatches a vicious plan to reclaim her rightfully deserved attention within the milieu of Oslo''s cultural elite.', 'Increasingly overshadowed by her boyfriend''s recent rise to fame as a contemporary artist creating sculptures from stolen furniture, Signe hatches a vicious plan to reclaim her rightfully deserved attention within the milieu of Oslo''s cultural elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynePU5z7JFn2Gf82RmfZgV84H8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788734'),
  ('596637999137448168', 'Sick: The Life and Death of Bob Flanagan, Supermasochist', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick, Sheree Rose, Jonathan Dayton', null, 'Bob Flanagan, Sheree Rose, Kirby Dick, Kathe Burkhart, Rita Valencia, Sarah Doucette, Richard Kopelle', null, 'The story of Robert Flanagan, a man who was born with cystic fibrosis and told he wouldn''t live past 20, who through a unique odyssey of masochism, art and love found a way to live decades past his expiration date.', 'The story of Robert Flanagan, a man who was born with cystic fibrosis and told he wouldn''t live past 20, who through a unique odyssey of masochism, art and love found a way to live decades past his expiration date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNyc2Ay883m6FFN1BV6s8ROfYHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35638'),
  ('387150956250437467', 'Sicko', 2007, 'Documentary, Comedy, Drama', 'Christoph Vitt, Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore', 'Michael Moore, Tony Benn, Tucker Albrizzi, Reggie Cervantes, John Graham, Aleida Guevara, Bill Maher, Patrick Pedraja', 'PG-13', 'A documentary about the corrupt health care system in The United States whose main goal is to make profit even if it means losing people’s lives. "The more people you deny health insurance, the more money we make" is the business model for health care providers in America.', 'A documentary about the corrupt health care system in The United States whose main goal is to make profit even if it means losing people’s lives. "The more people you deny health insurance, the more money we make" is the business model for health care providers in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3L6lwVFgv1VaqbtDLWkAlLc319.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2359'),
  ('1100337161106288058', 'Sid and Nancy', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alex Cox, Roger Deakins', 'Alex Cox, Abbe Wool', 'Gary Oldman, Chloe Webb, David Hayman, Debby Bishop, Andrew Schofield, Xander Berkeley, Perry Benson, Tony London', 'R', 'January 1978. After their success in England, the punk rock band Sex Pistols venture out on their tour of the southern United States. Temperamental bassist Sid Vicious is forced by his band mates to travel without his troubled girlfriend, Nancy Spungen, who will meet him in New York. When the band breaks up and Sid begins his solo career in a hostile city, the turbulent couple definitely falls into the depths of drug addiction.', 'January 1978. After their success in England, the punk rock band Sex Pistols venture out on their tour of the southern United States. Temperamental bassist Sid Vicious is forced by his band mates to travel without his troubled girlfriend, Nancy Spungen, who will meet him in New York. When the band breaks up and Sid begins his solo career in a hostile city, the turbulent couple definitely falls into the depths of drug addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHzCbMCfipDJ38GW5IyBTWDflMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14924'),
  ('1083042955974988871', 'Sid Is Dead', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Eli Gonda', 'Peter Warren', 'Joey Bragg, Genevieve Hannelius, Tyler Alvarez, Mary Stuart Masterson, Jack Griffo, Anjelica Bette Fellini, Eileen Galindo, Belissa Escobedo', 'NR', 'The story of a socially invisible high school senior who, after slipping up and getting the school''s biggest bully suspended, realizes he may only have two weeks left to experience everything he''s ever missed out on.', 'The story of a socially invisible high school senior who, after slipping up and getting the school''s biggest bully suspended, realizes he may only have two weeks left to experience everything he''s ever missed out on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqHFVUYXOwpNyHWJddW4HWJa4GY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555235'),
  ('1148549861598889550', 'Siddharth', 2013, 'Drama', 'Richie Mehta', 'Richie Mehta', 'Rajesh Tailang, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Anuraag Arora, Shobha Sharma Jassi, Geeta Agrawal Sharma', null, 'A chain-wallah from Delhi travels across India in search of his missing son, in the hopes that whoever took him, returns him unharmed.', 'A chain-wallah from Delhi travels across India in search of his missing son, in the hopes that whoever took him, returns him unharmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY4YvKVbVePmZVMdZqwxq8Mjukz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212754'),
  ('767605103477830455', 'Siddhartha', 1972, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Conrad Rooks, Sven Nykvist', 'Conrad Rooks', 'Shashi Kapoor, Simi Garewal, Romesh Sharma, Zul Vellani, Amrik Singh, Kunal Kapoor, Shanti Hiranand, Pinchoo Kapoor', 'R', 'Siddhartha is the story of a young Brahmin and his search for a meaningful way of life. His journey takes him through periods of harsh asceticism, sensual pleasures, material wealth, self-revulsion and eventually to the oneness and harmony that he had been seeking. The story is based on the best-selling novel by German Nobel Prize winner Hermann Hesse.', 'Siddhartha is the story of a young Brahmin and his search for a meaningful way of life. His journey takes him through periods of harsh asceticism, sensual pleasures, material wealth, self-revulsion and eventually to the oneness and harmony that he had been seeking. The story is based on the best-selling novel by German Nobel Prize winner Hermann Hesse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXyfCpesJh0ihDZOKkooSAaEAOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60595'),
  ('763652387533939543', 'Side by Side', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Christopher Kenneally', 'Christopher Kenneally', 'Keanu Reeves, Martin Scorsese, James Cameron, David Fincher, David Lynch, Lars von Trier, Steven Soderbergh, Danny Boyle', 'NR', 'Since the invention of cinema, the standard format for recording moving images has been film. Over the past two decades, a new form of digital filmmaking has emerged, creating a groundbreaking evolution in the medium. Keanu Reeves explores the development of cinema and the impact of digital filmmaking via in-depth interviews with Hollywood masters, such as James Cameron, David Fincher, David Lynch, Christopher Nolan, Martin Scorsese, George Lucas, Steven Soderbergh, and many more.', 'Since the invention of cinema, the standard format for recording moving images has been film. Over the past two decades, a new form of digital filmmaking has emerged, creating a groundbreaking evolution in the medium. Keanu Reeves explores the development of cinema and the impact of digital filmmaking via in-depth interviews with Hollywood masters, such as James Cameron, David Fincher, David Lynch, Christopher Nolan, Martin Scorsese, George Lucas, Steven Soderbergh, and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeeQ7rfTAXNYh4EqqdolFLkNwKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110354'),
  ('380645138549392671', 'Side Effect', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Filipp Lamshin, Anna Uvarova, Timofey Parschikov', 'Alexey Kazakov', 'Semen Serzin, Marina Vasilyeva, Aleksandra Revenko, Anatoli Zhuravlyov, Mariya Abramova, Mariya Karpova, Stepan Devonin, Sergey Cherdantsev', null, 'A traumatic experience leads to a break-up between a young married couple. In a desperate attempt to save their marriage, Andrey, the husband, seeks help from a psychic named Mara. His only wish is to make his wife Olga forget the past. Mara''s magic works, but the second honeymoon soon turns into a living nightmare... Andrey gradually recognizes that he is dealing with a powerful evil that possesses his wife, and the price of the psychic''s service is Olga’s life.', 'A traumatic experience leads to a break-up between a young married couple. In a desperate attempt to save their marriage, Andrey, the husband, seeks help from a psychic named Mara. His only wish is to make his wife Olga forget the past. Mara''s magic works, but the second honeymoon soon turns into a living nightmare... Andrey gradually recognizes that he is dealing with a powerful evil that possesses his wife, and the price of the psychic''s service is Olga’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pEnKpR7B08zDctLfpRdFT8hoe6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728552'),
  ('548019244324789999', 'Side Effects', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kathleen Slattery-Moschkau, Carl F. Whitney, Liza Hanson', 'Kathleen Slattery-Moschkau', 'Katherine Heigl, Lucian McAfee, David Durbin, Dorian DeMichele, Temeceka Harris, Beth Hebert, Mimi Sagadin , Sandy Adell', 'R', 'America! Built on a better pill. Karly Hert has spent the last ten years selling drugs. Legally, that is. Karly is a pharmaceutical sales representative. She sells pills to doctors. She makes lots of money. She has a company car. She has a nice fat expense account. But there''s a growing pit in Karly''s stomach. Something isn''t right behind the scenes at big pharma. Based on the director''s decade working directly for the industry.', 'America! Built on a better pill. Karly Hert has spent the last ten years selling drugs. Legally, that is. Karly is a pharmaceutical sales representative. She sells pills to doctors. She makes lots of money. She has a company car. She has a nice fat expense account. But there''s a growing pit in Karly''s stomach. Something isn''t right behind the scenes at big pharma. Based on the director''s decade working directly for the industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhQiaAEChJTHyfDE39cIDOLsfgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7871'),
  ('1080829480162485206', 'Side Effects', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Scott Z. Burns', 'Rooney Mara, Jude Law, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Channing Tatum, Vinessa Shaw, Ann Dowd, Polly Draper, David Costabile', 'R', 'A woman turns to prescription medication as a way of handling her anxiety concerning her husband''s upcoming release from prison.', 'A woman turns to prescription medication as a way of handling her anxiety concerning her husband''s upcoming release from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dk10bwGyj8aRdOTl3EkgATEefh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109421'),
  ('451854806818242810', 'Side Job', 2017, 'Drama', 'Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Ryuichi Hiroki', 'Masato Katō', 'Kumi Takiuchi, Ken Mitsuishi, Kengo Kora, Tokio Emoto, Masahiro Toda, Tamae Ando, Kazuki Namioka, Misako Renbutsu', null, 'Based on the novel "Kanojo no Jinsei wa Machigai ja Nai" (literal translation: Her life is not at fault) by Director Hiroki, it is a powerful story of survivors, who are all trying to find their own silver linings in life.', 'Based on the novel "Kanojo no Jinsei wa Machigai ja Nai" (literal translation: Her life is not at fault) by Director Hiroki, it is a powerful story of survivors, who are all trying to find their own silver linings in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsFtahjjx37ykntQjA5cE9BQJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467209'),
  ('710064306264375290', 'Side Out', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Israelson, Ronald Víctor García, Marty Eli Schwartz', 'David Thoreau', 'C. Thomas Howell, Peter Horton, Courtney Thorne-Smith, Harley Jane Kozak, Christopher Rydell, Terry Kiser, Randy Stoklos, Sinjin Smith', 'PG-13', 'A law student comes to California for the summer and ends up playing professional volleyball.', 'A law student comes to California for the summer and ends up playing professional volleyball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAuywGtaKhXOjpkIM2gzHT0FSXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52741'),
  ('203208914929324301', 'Side Street', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Anthony Mann, Joseph Ruttenberg, Howard W. Koch', 'Sydney Boehm', 'Farley Granger, Cathy O''Donnell, James Craig, Paul Kelly, Jean Hagen, Paul Harvey, Edmon Ryan, Charles McGraw', 'NR', 'A struggling young father-to-be gives in to temptation and impulsively steals an envelope of money from the office of a corrupt attorney. Instead of a few hundred dollars, it contains $30,000. When he decides to return the money, things go wrong - and that is only the beginning of his troubles.', 'A struggling young father-to-be gives in to temptation and impulsively steals an envelope of money from the office of a corrupt attorney. Instead of a few hundred dollars, it contains $30,000. When he decides to return the money, things go wrong - and that is only the beginning of his troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt3VdPaLWhfgwsCMMW4DIVlgzdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18281'),
  ('319027502361738465', 'Side Street Story', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Ruggero Fiorillo, Augusto Carloni', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Piero Tellini, Dino Maiuri', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Delia Scala, Leda Gloria, Titina De Filippo, Carlo Ninchi, Totò, Dante Maggio, Gianni Musy', null, 'A combination of a satire on war and a comedy with war as the background. It tells of the ordinary people living on a Naples sidestreet, from 1940 to 1950 under the dominance of the Fascists, the Nazis and then the Allies occupation forces. Primary among the citizens is Gennaro Iovine (Eduard De Filippo)who has a penchant for innocently getting into trouble, and his friend Pasquale (Toto.) The latter is a rail-sweeper who becomes a professional stand-in...a corpse used to conceal contraband...serving jail time for those who don''t care to spend the time to do the time...a substitute at a political rally when violence threatens the scheduled speaker', 'A combination of a satire on war and a comedy with war as the background. It tells of the ordinary people living on a Naples sidestreet, from 1940 to 1950 under the dominance of the Fascists, the Nazis and then the Allies occupation forces. Primary among the citizens is Gennaro Iovine (Eduard De Filippo)who has a penchant for innocently getting into trouble, and his friend Pasquale (Toto.) The latter is a rail-sweeper who becomes a professional stand-in...a corpse used to conceal contraband...serving jail time for those who don''t care to spend the time to do the time...a substitute at a political rally when violence threatens the scheduled speaker', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hB8BozUwIkmL1XDSU6KzJdaZjW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60061'),
  ('423708641919386099', 'Side/Walk/Shuttle', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Ernie Gehr', null, null, null, 'In this infamous structural film, Ernie Gehr takes to the glass elevator attached to San Francisco''s Fairmont Hotel and rides its 24 stories up and down, constantly shifting the orientation of his camera to offer images of the city as a zone of constant flux, freed from gravity and in perpetual rearrangement.', 'In this infamous structural film, Ernie Gehr takes to the glass elevator attached to San Francisco''s Fairmont Hotel and rides its 24 stories up and down, constantly shifting the orientation of his camera to offer images of the city as a zone of constant flux, freed from gravity and in perpetual rearrangement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcGMDQZAnFUKH77o1cfnAUjIY6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141685'),
  ('690790695312508876', 'Sideburns', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yuri Mamin, Leonid Gavrichenko, Vladimir Studennikov', 'Vyacheslav Leykin', 'Viktor Sukhorukov, Artur Vakha, Aleksandr Lykov, Aleksandr Medvedev, Nikolay Dik, Viktor Mikhaylov, Vladlen Biryukov, Anatoli Zhuravlyov', null, 'A small provincial town is home to two rival teenage gangs, one devoted to loose living and punk music and the other a collection of narrow-minded bodybuilders obsessed with order and convinced of their own moral rectitude. However, this cosy state of affairs is upset by the arrival of two strangers dressed like Pushkin, the famous early 19th century Russian poet, who proceed to found their own organisation, dedicated ostensibly to the memory of the great writer and the "salvation of Russia". Gradually, they begin to assume control of the town...', 'A small provincial town is home to two rival teenage gangs, one devoted to loose living and punk music and the other a collection of narrow-minded bodybuilders obsessed with order and convinced of their own moral rectitude. However, this cosy state of affairs is upset by the arrival of two strangers dressed like Pushkin, the famous early 19th century Russian poet, who proceed to found their own organisation, dedicated ostensibly to the memory of the great writer and the "salvation of Russia". Gradually, they begin to assume control of the town...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5KFcHcSrI1RSJKNCpLDlmxAq4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63530'),
  ('613701237838214288', 'Sidekicks', 1992, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Leo Zisman, Mark S. Glick, Dean Raphael Ferrandini', 'Galen Thompson, Lou Illar', 'Jonathan Brandis, Chuck Norris, Beau Bridges, Mako, Julia Nickson, Joe Piscopo, Danica McKellar, John Buchanan', 'PG', 'Asthmatic teenager Barry Gabrewski is a daydreamer. Troubled by bullying, he escapes into a fantasy world where he is the sidekick to his martial arts hero, Chuck Norris, in a series of high-octane adventures taken right out of his movies. With help from his teacher''s wise old uncle, Mr. Lee, Barry learns the finer points of martial arts and enters a karate championship.', 'Asthmatic teenager Barry Gabrewski is a daydreamer. Troubled by bullying, he escapes into a fantasy world where he is the sidekick to his martial arts hero, Chuck Norris, in a series of high-octane adventures taken right out of his movies. With help from his teacher''s wise old uncle, Mr. Lee, Barry learns the finer points of martial arts and enters a karate championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4n2gLg7Iqko72GMJwfaHHCdVg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22590'),
  ('707127616644230611', 'Sidelined 2: Intercepted', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Justin Wu', 'Crystal Ferreiro', 'Noah Beck, Siena Agudong, Charlie Gillespie, Drew Ray Tanner, James Van Der Beek, Roan Curtis, Kolton Stewart, Sage Linder', 'PG-13', 'Freshman star quarterback Drayton struggles with the weight of expectations after a devastating setback, while dancer Dallas begins to question the future she thought she wanted. As their high school relationship begins to unravel under the pressures of distance and self-discovery, they’ll learn that the bravest versions of themselves emerge when they let life redirect them.', 'Freshman star quarterback Drayton struggles with the weight of expectations after a devastating setback, while dancer Dallas begins to question the future she thought she wanted. As their high school relationship begins to unravel under the pressures of distance and self-discovery, they’ll learn that the bravest versions of themselves emerge when they let life redirect them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEIP1pTVXa8BJaYSuVeVG3wFN10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429520'),
  ('1028992859902298642', 'Sidelined: The QB and Me', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Justin Wu, Mark Chow', 'Mary Gulino, Crystal Ferreiro', 'Siena Agudong, Noah Beck, Drew Ray Tanner, James Van Der Beek, Deborah Cox, Asia Lizardo, Jake Foy, Jason Fernandes', 'NR', 'Dallas, a burdened but headstrong dancer, is determined to get into the best dance school in the country—her late mother’s alma mater. However, that dream is suddenly derailed when the cheeky yet secretly grieving football star, Drayton, crashes into her life with a unique story of his own. Will the two of them be able to grow into their dreams together, or will their dreams be sidelined?', 'Dallas, a burdened but headstrong dancer, is determined to get into the best dance school in the country—her late mother’s alma mater. However, that dream is suddenly derailed when the cheeky yet secretly grieving football star, Drayton, crashes into her life with a unique story of his own. Will the two of them be able to grow into their dreams together, or will their dreams be sidelined?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSL6truNrWP1Bn9ng1rN0SkMI4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957119'),
  ('324399064939136091', 'Sideshow Wrestlers', 1908, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A man gets cajoled into working as a sideshow wrestler.', 'A man gets cajoled into working as a sideshow wrestler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Awdwmj05XHDJu2apDQJUT5lJ1ZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196659'),
  ('816515793001253751', 'Sidetracked', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, David Azcano', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero', 'Raúl Arévalo, Inma Cuesta, Alberto San Juan, Candela Peña, Jorge Bosch, Irene Escolar, Kiti Mánver, Pepo Oliva', null, 'A rural couple in crisis, who have a brother and sister with urban problems, and all of them trying to find a solution.', 'A rural couple in crisis, who have a brother and sister with urban problems, and all of them trying to find a solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM1QyTM6Ra7r2E4ZiyIyRsMzwys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300596'),
  ('160007640119908487', 'Sidewalk Stories', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lane', 'Charles Lane', 'Charles Lane, Robert Clohessy, Tom Alpern, Nicole Alysia, Edwin Anthony, Angel Cappellino, Edie Falco, Sandye Wilson', null, 'A New York City street artist rescues a baby girl after her father is murdered. He then sets off to find the mother, but has to first learn how to care for the child. Ultimately he ends up in a horse drawn chase for the murderers.', 'A New York City street artist rescues a baby girl after her father is murdered. He then sets off to find the mother, but has to first learn how to care for the child. Ultimately he ends up in a horse drawn chase for the murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1coA5pj2Sr4W485AAmhTy648v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73823'),
  ('437096479262222984', 'Sidewalks of Bangkok', 1984, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Jean Rollin', 'Jean-Claude Benhamou', 'Yoko, Françoise Blanchard, Jean-Claude Benhamou, Jean-Pierre Bouyxou, Jean-Paul Bride, Gérard Landry, Brigitte Borghese, Olivier Rollin', null, 'Adventure, crime and mystery combine with comic book dialogue and some sadistic sex for good measure. Playfully perverse, pistol-packing fun with Yoko and the alluring Francoise Blanchard.', 'Adventure, crime and mystery combine with comic book dialogue and some sadistic sex for good measure. Playfully perverse, pistol-packing fun with Yoko and the alluring Francoise Blanchard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYcsmarzOUCODGLemUgDoQcE1F7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116468'),
  ('183293923327766841', 'Sidewalks of New York', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edward Burns', 'Edward Burns', 'Edward Burns, Heather Graham, Rosario Dawson, Dennis Farina, Brittany Murphy, David Krumholtz, Stanley Tucci, Callie Thorne', 'R', 'The film follows the marital and dating lives of three men and three women who unknowingly form a tangled web of relationships. Interspersing "man on the street" interviews with scenes from the six characters'' lives, the film weaves a humorous and biting commentary on the game of love -- easy to start, hard to finish.', 'The film follows the marital and dating lives of three men and three women who unknowingly form a tangled web of relationships. Interspersing "man on the street" interviews with scenes from the six characters'' lives, the film weaves a humorous and biting commentary on the game of love -- easy to start, hard to finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJuZGjMUKsYJXSkLXdOZ9CePJhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31016'),
  ('993228178802767235', 'Sidewalls', 2006, 'Romance', 'Gustavo Taretto', 'Gustavo Taretto', 'Mariana Anghileri, Javier Drolas, Valentina Liernud, Carlos Santamaría', null, 'Mariana and Martin have similar lives: the same loneliness, the same neurosis, even the same apartment, but they can’t meet. Their only link is also what separates them: the sidewall.', 'Mariana and Martin have similar lives: the same loneliness, the same neurosis, even the same apartment, but they can’t meet. Their only link is also what separates them: the sidewall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSi1tnK9S4jYxiLRs7R5SCk0GkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328301'),
  ('136575713276261812', 'Sidewalls', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gustavo Taretto, Silvana Savastano, Fernando Brom', 'Gustavo Taretto', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Javier Drolas, Inés Efrón, Rafael Ferro, Jorge Ernesto Lanata, Carla Peterson, Adrián Navarro, Romina Paula', 'PG-13', 'Martin is a neurotic web designer taking baby steps out of the isolation of his one-room apartment and his virtual reality. Mariana is an artist fresh out of a a long relationship. They are perfect for each other, live on the same street, in opposite buildings, but they never meet. Can the movement of a modern city of three million people bring them together?', 'Martin is a neurotic web designer taking baby steps out of the isolation of his one-room apartment and his virtual reality. Mariana is an artist fresh out of a a long relationship. They are perfect for each other, live on the same street, in opposite buildings, but they never meet. Can the movement of a modern city of three million people bring them together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LkufGzat0GMRDEr88w0oHQM2CD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76696'),
  ('687593248271890506', 'Sideway', 2017, 'Drama', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu, Andreas Sinanos', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', 'Tansu Biçer, Nalan Kuruçim, Taner Birsel, Ercan Kesal, Rıza Akın, Haydar Şişman, Müfit Kayacan, İsrafil Köse', null, 'The residents of a small town set between a stormy sea and an ominous forest are becoming insane. They are convinced that successive signs appearing in the town are indications of doomsday.', 'The residents of a small town set between a stormy sea and an ominous forest are becoming insane. They are convinced that successive signs appearing in the town are indications of doomsday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ks3fNPVQiKpN1uGanqaq08EIFhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518439'),
  ('934944594292454698', 'Sideways', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alexander Payne, Phedon Papamichael, George Parra', 'Jim Taylor, Alexander Payne', 'Paul Giamatti, Thomas Haden Church, Virginia Madsen, Sandra Oh, Marylouise Burke, Jessica Hecht, Missy Doty, M.C. Gainey', 'R', 'Two middle-aged men embark on a spiritual journey through Californian wine country. One is an unpublished novelist suffering from depression, and the other is only days away from walking down the aisle.', 'Two middle-aged men embark on a spiritual journey through Californian wine country. One is an unpublished novelist suffering from depression, and the other is only days away from walking down the aisle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOsaxYLgvZVU7cJBpPn8CuE0MrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9675'),
  ('82584129232866827', 'Sidney', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Reginald Hudlin, Matthew Chavez', 'Jesse James Miller', 'Sidney Poitier, Harry Belafonte, Halle Berry, Nelson George, Louis Gossett Jr., Aram Goudsouzian, Katharine Houghton, Quincy Jones', 'PG-13', 'This revealing documentary honors the legendary Sidney Poitier—iconic actor, filmmaker, and civil rights activist. Featuring interviews with Denzel Washington, Spike Lee, Halle Berry, and more.', 'This revealing documentary honors the legendary Sidney Poitier—iconic actor, filmmaker, and civil rights activist. Featuring interviews with Denzel Washington, Spike Lee, Halle Berry, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVdkjqmIipF2DCvDwt16BRv7e9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961722'),
  ('1049232661962614796', 'Sidney Lumet''s Day of Birth', 2026, 'Drama', 'Raul Geydarov, Mikhail Ogonkov', 'Raul Geydarov, Lidiya Yartseva', 'Artem Koshman, Julietta Stepanyan, Marietta Tsigal-Polishchuk', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Georgian Dato and his grandmother try to find common ground in the ruins of their once large family. Everything is going according to plan until Dato''s mother suddenly appears on the doorstep after many years of absence.', 'Seventeen-year-old Georgian Dato and his grandmother try to find common ground in the ruins of their once large family. Everything is going according to plan until Dato''s mother suddenly appears on the doorstep after many years of absence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4Hy5qwC37COYSEkZA76ieo1HT2E.jpg', 'plex:movie:sidney-lumets-day-of-birth'),
  ('311704267737497708', 'Sidonie in Japan', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Céline Bozon, Elise Girard, Hagen Rohling', 'Sophie Fillières, Maud Ameline, Elise Girard', 'Isabelle Huppert, Tsuyoshi Ihara, August Diehl, Yuoko Hitomi, Aurora Catalano, Yusuke Kitaguchi, Masumi Fukushi, Keiko Hara', null, 'Sidonie Perceval, an established French writer, is mourning her deceased husband. Invited to Japan for the reedition of her first book, she is welcomed by her local editor who takes her to Kyoto, the city of shrines and temples. As they travel together through the Japanese spring blossoms, she slowly opens up to him. But the ghost of her husband follows Sidonie: she will have to finally let go of the past to let herself love again.', 'Sidonie Perceval, an established French writer, is mourning her deceased husband. Invited to Japan for the reedition of her first book, she is welcomed by her local editor who takes her to Kyoto, the city of shrines and temples. As they travel together through the Japanese spring blossoms, she slowly opens up to him. But the ghost of her husband follows Sidonie: she will have to finally let go of the past to let herself love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adBH0FdequMh45GO2jcIMDExAN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004555'),
  ('716378049219967924', 'Siege', 1940, 'Documentary', 'Julien Bryan, Julien Bryan', 'Julien Bryan', 'Julien Bryan', null, 'Siege is a 1940 documentary short about the Siege of Warsaw by the Wehrmacht at the start of World War II. It was shot by Julien Bryan, a Pennsylvanian photographer and cameraman who later established the International Film Foundation. Siege was nominated for an Oscar for Best One-reel Short at the 13th Academy Awards in 1941, and in 2006, it was named to the National Film Registry by the Librarian of Congress as "a unique, horrifying record of the dreadful brutality of war."', 'Siege is a 1940 documentary short about the Siege of Warsaw by the Wehrmacht at the start of World War II. It was shot by Julien Bryan, a Pennsylvanian photographer and cameraman who later established the International Film Foundation. Siege was nominated for an Oscar for Best One-reel Short at the 13th Academy Awards in 1941, and in 2006, it was named to the National Film Registry by the Librarian of Congress as "a unique, horrifying record of the dreadful brutality of war."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tmkMS9vx5bdrZVlFMJHZsefQh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147364'),
  ('532166764859480884', 'Siege (Asedio)', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Rafael Reparaz, Florencia Inés González', 'Marta Medina', 'Natalia de Molina, Bella Agossou, Francisco Reyes, Fran Cantos, Chani Martín, Jorge Kent, Efraín Rodríguez, Lucas Nabor', 'R', 'During an eviction procedure in a troubled area of Madrid, police officer Dani makes a shocking discovery.', 'During an eviction procedure in a troubled area of Madrid, police officer Dani makes a shocking discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muWiU7atZmDZN74OTvjHGA6hf26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090868'),
  ('162240620333962518', 'Siege of the Saxons', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Nathan Juran', 'John Kohn, Jud Kinberg', 'Janette Scott, Ronald Howard, Mark Dignam, John Laurie, Jerome Willis, John Gabriel, Ronald Lewis, Francis de Wolff', null, 'King Arthur learns one of his knights is plotting to take over and marry his daughter. After the King''s death, the Knight wishing to marry the princess is ordered by the great wizard Merlin to remove the sword from the scabbard and prove his right to the throne.', 'King Arthur learns one of his knights is plotting to take over and marry his daughter. After the King''s death, the Knight wishing to marry the princess is ordered by the great wizard Merlin to remove the sword from the scabbard and prove his right to the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OjBjoaBqll0Y1kIFDEC3Lj5U5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79864'),
  ('1121527287906903561', 'Siegfried', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Peter von Haller, Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Herman Weigel, Tom Gerhardt', 'Tom Gerhardt, Dorkas Kiefer, Janine Kunze, Volker Büdts, Axel Neumann, Jan Sosniok, Michael Brandner, Mirco Nontschew', null, 'The tale of Siegfried, a fearless dragon slayer who wins the heart of Celtic beauty Kriemhild.', 'The tale of Siegfried, a fearless dragon slayer who wins the heart of Celtic beauty Kriemhild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c24IjdewTfL3W5NiRoRRYrwNun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10659'),
  ('978731946669489364', 'Siembra', 2015, 'Drama', 'Santiago Lozano Álvarez, Ángela Maria Osorio Rojas', 'Santiago Lozano Álvarez, Ángela Maria Osorio Rojas', 'Diego Balanta, Ines Granja, Jose Luis Preciado, Carol Hurtado, Jhon Javier Ramos', null, 'A man and his son move from the Pacific coast of Colombia to Cali, but have a difficult time adapting to the city. When his son is killed, the father must go through the hard process of grief while trying to find roots in a place that does not belong to him.', 'A man and his son move from the Pacific coast of Colombia to Cali, but have a difficult time adapting to the city. When his son is killed, the father must go through the hard process of grief while trying to find roots in a place that does not belong to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDfhwIVsTU60eD4jp4cQmIlnv48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354170'),
  ('601956336553393499', 'Siempre es Otoño', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alex Sereno, Alex Sereno', 'Alex Sereno', 'Isabel Pecci, Gonzalo Cortés, Marta Nebot', null, 'A young couple is reunited 7 years after having broken. Filled with insecurities, frustrations and dreams that have not been fulfilled, they decide to spend a day together that is slowly becoming an excuse to reopen wounds that they believed were closed and see if they are able to leave their past behind in order to move forward.', 'A young couple is reunited 7 years after having broken. Filled with insecurities, frustrations and dreams that have not been fulfilled, they decide to spend a day together that is slowly becoming an excuse to reopen wounds that they believed were closed and see if they are able to leave their past behind in order to move forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wSWsmel9o6jclGyIwA17Gm5OOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679129'),
  ('55150904101116638', 'Sieranevada', 2016, 'Drama', 'Cristi Puiu, Barbu Bălășoiu', 'Cristi Puiu', 'Mimi Brănescu, Judith State, Bogdan Dumitrache, Dana Dogaru, Sorin Medeleni, Marin Grigore, Ana Ciontea, Rolando Matsangos', null, 'Back from a professional trip to Paris, a neurologist at the pinnacle of his career has to pick up his wife so that they can attend a family meal to commemorate his father, who died a year before. At his mother''s flat, the guests are waiting for the priest to arrive while arguing about all kinds of things connected and unconnected with the world’s events and wars.', 'Back from a professional trip to Paris, a neurologist at the pinnacle of his career has to pick up his wife so that they can attend a family meal to commemorate his father, who died a year before. At his mother''s flat, the guests are waiting for the priest to arrive while arguing about all kinds of things connected and unconnected with the world’s events and wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q48ZKaoCQg5nVJvfXBRzMTl38Fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374452'),
  ('336623502035509203', 'Sierra', 1950, 'Western', 'Alfred E. Green, Russell Metty', 'Edna Anhalt', 'Audie Murphy, Wanda Hendrix, Burl Ives, Dean Jagger, Richard Rober, Tony Curtis, Houseley Stevenson, Elliott Reid', 'NR', 'Ring Hassard and his father Jeff, wild horse breakers, live in a hidden mountain eyrie as Jeff is wanted for a murder he didn''t commit. Things change when they take in a lost young lady, Riley Martin, who finds that Ring has "never seen a woman close up." Jeff is injured, Ring runs afoul of horse thieves and the law, and Riley (who is a lawyer) labors to clear the Hassards (who others would prefer dead).', 'Ring Hassard and his father Jeff, wild horse breakers, live in a hidden mountain eyrie as Jeff is wanted for a murder he didn''t commit. Things change when they take in a lost young lady, Riley Martin, who finds that Ring has "never seen a woman close up." Jeff is injured, Ring runs afoul of horse thieves and the law, and Riley (who is a lawyer) labors to clear the Hassards (who others would prefer dead).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akxybiTgk4qH5Ccp8l5PxxAQdaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126900'),
  ('746768836303104814', 'Sierra Burgess Is a Loser', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ian Samuels, Mikhaela Rosen, Tony Niknejadi', 'Lindsey Anderson Beer', 'Shannon Purser, Kristine Froseth, Noah Centineo, RJ Cyler, Chrissy Metz, Alice Lee, Giorgia Whigham, Will Peltz', 'PG-13', 'A case of mistaken identity results in unexpected romance when the most popular girl in high school and the biggest loser must come together to win over their crushes.', 'A case of mistaken identity results in unexpected romance when the most popular girl in high school and the biggest loser must come together to win over their crushes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjnHRySiVM4YcBYzjCxw344y9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462919'),
  ('317175813619174147', 'Siesta', 1987, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mary Lambert, K.C. Hodenfield, Bryan Loftus', 'Patricia Louisianna Knop', 'Ellen Barkin, Gabriel Byrne, Julian Sands, Isabella Rossellini, Martin Sheen, Grace Jones, Jodie Foster, Alexei Sayle', 'R', 'American Claire wakes up blood-soaked and bruised at the end of a runway in Spain. As she tries to account for her state, she has flashbacks from the past few days. She thinks she''s killed someone, but isn''t sure, and now she''s wandering the Spanish streets without money or a clear memory.', 'American Claire wakes up blood-soaked and bruised at the end of a runway in Spain. As she tries to account for her state, she has flashbacks from the past few days. She thinks she''s killed someone, but isn''t sure, and now she''s wandering the Spanish streets without money or a clear memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkBcoO3yHJC0WeAVdiZhw78kBem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42014'),
  ('1097039901427384808', 'Siete En La Mira', 1984, 'Drama, Action', 'Pedro Galindo III', null, 'Mario Almada, Fernando Almada, Jorge Reynoso, Diana Ferreti, Eleazar García Jr., Adalberto Arvizu, Javier García, Fernando Sáenz', null, 'A quaint small town is terrorized by a group of sadistic bikers.', 'A quaint small town is terrorized by a group of sadistic bikers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WcySeFLh0BpmPWTSbCqguUrAKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170304'),
  ('912712764065761649', 'Siete En La Mira 2 - La Furia de La Venganza', 1986, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Pedro Galindo III', null, 'Álvaro Zermeño, Jorge Reynoso, Agustín Bernal, Miguel Gómez Checa, Sergio Acosta, Martha Gasque, Armando Galván, Carlos González', null, 'A surviving member of the Siete En La Mira gang sets out to avenge his dead brother and recover the ashes from his cremation. The two lawmen that killed him are dead now themselves, but they have a third brother who wasn''t involved in the original conflict.', 'A surviving member of the Siete En La Mira gang sets out to avenge his dead brother and recover the ashes from his cremation. The two lawmen that killed him are dead now themselves, but they have a third brother who wasn''t involved in the original conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKHaBpNdL4MI5ZMQfOJfnD8VqLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618836'),
