  ('902503064419519288', 'Sight', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Andrew Hyatt, Michael Balfry', 'Andrew Hyatt, John Duigan, Buzz McLaughlin', 'Terry Chen, Greg Kinnear, Fionnula Flanagan, Wai Ching Ho, Raymond Ma, Ben Wang, Jayden Tianyi Zhang, Donald Heng', 'PG-13', 'Ming Wang is an impoverished Chinese prodigy who flees Communist China to become a pioneering eye surgeon in America. When tasked with restoring the sight of an orphan in India, who was blinded by her stepmother, Wang must confront the trauma of living through the violent uprising in his youth, the Cultural Revolution.', 'Ming Wang is an impoverished Chinese prodigy who flees Communist China to become a pioneering eye surgeon in America. When tasked with restoring the sight of an orphan in India, who was blinded by her stepmother, Wang must confront the trauma of living through the violent uprising in his youth, the Cultural Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8LEeWVe0enckZjFOOnSGPQyGCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057006'),
  ('377641709853348386', 'Sightless', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Eric Zaragoza, Tony Aronovitz, Cooper Karl', 'Cooper Karl', 'Madelaine Petsch, Alexander Koch, December Ensminger, Lee Jones, Deniz Akdeniz, Jarrod Crawford, Matthew Yang King, Mikandrew', null, 'After an attack renders her blind, Ellen withdraws from the world to recover. But soon she plunges into paranoia, unable to convince anyone that her assailant has returned to terrorize her by hiding in plain sight.', 'After an attack renders her blind, Ellen withdraws from the world to recover. But soon she plunges into paranoia, unable to convince anyone that her assailant has returned to terrorize her by hiding in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byScu2YTPLsEfDAiXm3pW6w8FBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733156'),
  ('529313828427581690', 'Sightseeing Through Whisky', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Fernande Albany, Manuel', null, 'John, who loves the bottle a little too much, is one of a group of sightseers. Too drunk to follow the party, the reeling drunkard remains on the site of a ruin where he starts having hallucinations.', 'John, who loves the bottle a little too much, is one of a group of sightseers. Too drunk to follow the party, the reeling drunkard remains on the site of a ruin where he starts having hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VQ5idM3tY825rEirq4dQMLk3IK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196534'),
