  ('1021822593284429251', 'Signs of Life', 1968, 'Drama, War', 'Werner Herzog, Martje Grohmann, Thomas Mauch', 'Werner Herzog, Achim von Arnim', 'Peter Brogle, Wolfgang Reichmann, Athina Zacharopoulou, Wolfgang von Ungern-Sternberg, Wolfgang Stumpf, Henry van Lyck, Julio Pinheiro, Florian Fricke', null, 'During World War II, three German soldiers are withdrawn from combat when one of them, Stroszek, is wounded. They are assigned to a small coastal community on the Greek island of Kos while Stroszek recuperates. The men become increasingly stir crazy in their uneventful new assignment. Stroszek eventually goes mad.', 'During World War II, three German soldiers are withdrawn from combat when one of them, Stroszek, is wounded. They are assigned to a small coastal community on the Greek island of Kos while Stroszek recuperates. The men become increasingly stir crazy in their uneventful new assignment. Stroszek eventually goes mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPxzosD2y4duUZMwtPOkJuYYdB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67217'),
  ('543013924008400299', 'Sijjin', 2014, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Ersan Özer', 'Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk, Koray Şahinbaş, Ebru Kaymakçı, Merve Ateş, Güneş Galava, Toygun Ateş, Aydan Çakır, Asuman Kostak', null, 'Öznur is a young and beautiful woman. She has had a platonic love since childhood to Kudret, who is her cousin. Kudret, however, is married to a woman named Nisa and is very happy. Jealous, Öznur uses terrible black magic to change this so that she and Kudret will be together. However, she is not prepared for the evil that this spell unleashes.', 'Öznur is a young and beautiful woman. She has had a platonic love since childhood to Kudret, who is her cousin. Kudret, however, is married to a woman named Nisa and is very happy. Jealous, Öznur uses terrible black magic to change this so that she and Kudret will be together. However, she is not prepared for the evil that this spell unleashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYbhwSIVl42JA4f6rs3MeE2wR4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334175'),
  ('1043096877423468369', 'Sijjin 2', 2015, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi, Ersan Özer', 'Seyda Terzioglu, Bulut Akkale, Ece Baykal, Reyhan İlhan, Yavuz Çetin, Seda Oguz, Salih Usta, Berat Efe Parlar', null, 'Adnan and Hicran are happily married however when their son die as a result of a mysterious accident Adanan becomes distant from his wife. Hicran starts investigating her past to see how it could connect to the death of her son.', 'Adnan and Hicran are happily married however when their son die as a result of a mysterious accident Adanan becomes distant from his wife. Hicran starts investigating her past to see how it could connect to the death of her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92HBT46woySCuwROxD0P1C1m0Af.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388192'),
  ('593238790122115784', 'Sijjin 3: The Forbidden Love', 2016, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi, Bekir Acar', 'Adnan Koç, Büşra Ayaydın, Cem Uslu, Nevin Efe, Yavuz Pekdiker, Elif Baysal, Yavuz Çetin, Ömer Musab Küçükler', null, 'Growing up, siblings Sedat and Kahder live a happy life with their childhood friend Orhan. The trio''s kinship is further strengthened by the union of Orhan and Kahder in a holy matrimony. However, when the siblings are involved in a fateful accident, Orhan''s faith is put to the test in his desperate attempt to save his sanity by making a deal with the devil, all in the name of love.', 'Growing up, siblings Sedat and Kahder live a happy life with their childhood friend Orhan. The trio''s kinship is further strengthened by the union of Orhan and Kahder in a holy matrimony. However, when the siblings are involved in a fateful accident, Orhan''s faith is put to the test in his desperate attempt to save his sanity by making a deal with the devil, all in the name of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUZJoSDQ42ccWUjNU9k69c56aMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414827'),
  ('81245655635052531', 'Sijjin 4', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Mirza Metin, Yasemin Kurttekin, Sebahat Adalar, Yasemen Büyükağaoğlu, Mana Alkoy, Merve Ateş, Kıvılcım Kaya, Aslı Sevi', null, 'Due to financial problems, Yilmaz family moves in their grandmother Saadet''s house. But Saadet is not living alone as known. Saadet''s old house, which is also a tomb of her deceased husband, is inhabited by beings from another dimension. And this beings don''t want anyone in the house, but Saadet.', 'Due to financial problems, Yilmaz family moves in their grandmother Saadet''s house. But Saadet is not living alone as known. Saadet''s old house, which is also a tomb of her deceased husband, is inhabited by beings from another dimension. And this beings don''t want anyone in the house, but Saadet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgceFw2fvM0bjFSiCVjER3rPCIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474698'),
  ('816938890517548544', 'Sijjin 5', 2018, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi, Mehmet Eren Nayir', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Rüya Önal, Merve Ateş, Özgür Hacier, Ece Köroğlu, Ece Baykal, Pınar Gülkapan, Tuncay Çağıl, Metin Yıldırım', null, 'Hale attracted attention with its different appearance and strange behavior. She lives in a historical and eerily house in Nevsehir with her mother, a depressed grandmother and her aunt Azra. Hale''s father had disappeared before she was born and was never seen again. Hale sees a nightmare of a terrible night; her father, whom she never saw, invites her to an old and uncanny home.', 'Hale attracted attention with its different appearance and strange behavior. She lives in a historical and eerily house in Nevsehir with her mother, a depressed grandmother and her aunt Azra. Hale''s father had disappeared before she was born and was never seen again. Hale sees a nightmare of a terrible night; her father, whom she never saw, invites her to an old and uncanny home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n35ni2r90lNB0KUGVAuPeksmlHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546507'),
  ('293804839768319892', 'Sijjin 6', 2019, 'Horror', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Alper Mestçi', 'Merve Ateş, Adnan Koç, Dilara Büyükbayraktar, Fatih Murat Teke, Sibel Aytan, Hüseyin Taş, Gönül Ürer, Deniz Kiziroğlu', null, 'A girl is haunted by an evil spirit in her family home. Several bad things begin to happen around her house and to her family members. An old character rises back and tries to save the family from their doomed fate.', 'A girl is haunted by an evil spirit in her family home. Several bad things begin to happen around her house and to her family members. An old character rises back and tries to save the family from their doomed fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sQWnbH1sFvA1Ug9Jtm8HBDnL16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615982'),
