  ('683742286142833582', 'Sikandar', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'A. R. Murugadoss, S. Thirunavukkarasu, Balaji Ganesh', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Salman Khan, Rashmika Mandanna, Sathyaraj, Sharman Joshi, Prateik Smita Patil, Kajal Aggarwal, Nawab Shah, Kishore', null, 'A tragic accident pushes the powerful Sikandar to protect the less fortunate by standing up to corruption and greed — using any means necessary.', 'A tragic accident pushes the powerful Sikandar to protect the less fortunate by standing up to corruption and greed — using any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41s42CRXafa3OuRGvCtfYPEBmse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257960'),
  ('1081870955242857161', 'Sikandar Ka Muqaddar', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'Neeraj Pandey, Arvind Singh, Trishaan', 'Neeraj Pandey, Vipul K Rawal', 'Jimmy Shergill, Avinash Tiwary, Tamannaah Bhatia, Divya Dutta, Rajeev Mehta, Zoya Afroz, Ridhima Pandit, Deepak Daryani', 'R', 'After an unsolved diamond heist, a hard-nosed cop’s pursuit of his key suspect turns into obsession, until they finally face each other — and the truth.', 'After an unsolved diamond heist, a hard-nosed cop’s pursuit of his key suspect turns into obsession, until they finally face each other — and the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWUh4rgxtgypgnOa6uGMnUt01ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252470'),
  ('821569430410611363', 'Silas Marner', 1985, 'Drama', 'Giles Foster, Nat Crosby', 'Louis Marks, Giles Foster', 'Ben Kingsley, Jenny Agutter, Patrick Ryecart, Freddie Jones, Jonathan Coy, Patsy Kensit, Elizabeth Hoyle, Melinda Whiting', null, 'Adaption of George Eliot''s novel. When a respectable weaver is wrongfully accused of theft, he becomes a virtual hermit until his own fortune is stolen and an orphaned child is found on his doorstep.', 'Adaption of George Eliot''s novel. When a respectable weaver is wrongfully accused of theft, he becomes a virtual hermit until his own fortune is stolen and an orphaned child is found on his doorstep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKLYfJJGvmHZoqdDrHJBtUZ7nsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59174'),
  ('119068743655288510', 'Silence', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Seikichi Iizumi, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Shūsaku Endō', 'David Lampson, Mako, Eiji Okada, Rokkō Toura, Noboru Matsuhashi, Yoshi Katō, Taiji Tonoyama, Don Kenny', null, 'Two Jesuit priests encounter persecution when they travel to Japan in the 17th century to spread Christianity and search for their mentor.', 'Two Jesuit priests encounter persecution when they travel to Japan in the 17th century to spread Christianity and search for their mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C08Kex73PXwiOPygyC0RScOYFU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92670'),
  ('14739297110594674', 'Silence', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Huang Wen-Ying, Rodrigo Prieto, Martin Scorsese', 'Jay Cocks, Martin Scorsese', 'Andrew Garfield, Adam Driver, Liam Neeson, Tadanobu Asano, Ciarán Hinds, Issey Ogata, Shinya Tsukamoto, Yoshi Oida', 'R', 'In the 17th century, two Portuguese Jesuit priests travel to Japan in an attempt to locate their mentor, who is rumored to have committed apostasy, and to propagate Catholicism.', 'In the 17th century, two Portuguese Jesuit priests travel to Japan in an attempt to locate their mentor, who is rumored to have committed apostasy, and to propagate Catholicism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5T0cQDYws0xRBVG4Q3wpcrcmax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68730'),
  ('330185968487855587', 'Silence and Cry', 1968, 'Drama', 'Miklós Jancsó, János Kende', 'Gyula Hernádi, Miklós Jancsó', 'Mari Törőcsik, Zoltán Latinovits, József Madaras, Andrea Drahota, András Kozák, István Bujtor, Ida Siménfalvy, János Koltai', null, 'Set during a turbulent era of disquiet, fear, persecution and terror, which permeates every corner of post-WWI Hungarian society. In 1919, after just a few months of communist rule the Hungarian Republic of Councils falls victim to a nationalist counter-revolution. Admiral Horthy, leader of the nationalist far right movement, becomes the self-proclaimed regent of Hungary, and assumes power as the legal Head of State. Soldiers of the short-lived Hungarian Red Army are now on the run from relentless secret policemen and patrol units of the nationalist Royal Gendarme. If caught, ex-Red Army soldiers are executed without mercy or proper trial. István Cserzi, a former soldier of the Red Army has fled to the Great Hungarian Plains and has taken refuge on a farm, which is run by two sympathetic women.', 'Set during a turbulent era of disquiet, fear, persecution and terror, which permeates every corner of post-WWI Hungarian society. In 1919, after just a few months of communist rule the Hungarian Republic of Councils falls victim to a nationalist counter-revolution. Admiral Horthy, leader of the nationalist far right movement, becomes the self-proclaimed regent of Hungary, and assumes power as the legal Head of State. Soldiers of the short-lived Hungarian Red Army are now on the run from relentless secret policemen and patrol units of the nationalist Royal Gendarme. If caught, ex-Red Army soldiers are executed without mercy or proper trial. István Cserzi, a former soldier of the Red Army has fled to the Great Hungarian Plains and has taken refuge on a farm, which is run by two sympathetic women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtQQdm8oFyeJCvzTUGijq9x3opL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129820'),
  ('600980221290619723', 'Silence Becomes You', 2005, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Stephanie Sinclaire', 'Stephanie Sinclaire', 'Alicia Silverstone, Sienna Guillory, Joe Anderson, Leigh Lawson', 'R', 'Two sisters, Grace and Violet, bound together by more than blood, live a reclusive life in a large mansion, detached from society and reality too. They have a plan. It''s hardly conventional, but the outcome nine months later is all that counts. Whatever they do they must not fall in love with the man that they choose to ensnare. Set in contemporary New England.', 'Two sisters, Grace and Violet, bound together by more than blood, live a reclusive life in a large mansion, detached from society and reality too. They have a plan. It''s hardly conventional, but the outcome nine months later is all that counts. Whatever they do they must not fall in love with the man that they choose to ensnare. Set in contemporary New England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVlNJYAUDAU4DYgcY4koQdBOI62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24075'),
  ('1023845488168898732', 'Silence Has No Wings', 1966, 'Drama', 'Kazuo Kuroki, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Kazuo Kuroki, Hisaya Iwasa, Yasuo Matsukawa', 'Mariko Kaga, Hiroyuki Nagato, Shoichi Ozawa, Fumio Watanabe, Kyū Sazanka, Rokkō Toura, Toshie Kimura, Yukio Ninagawa', null, 'After a young boy captures a rare butterfly in Nagasaki, a caterpillar begins a relay-trip toward the northern tip of Hokkaido, serving as a silent witness to a series of vignettes featuring people struggling with the psychological and social scars of post-war Japan.', 'After a young boy captures a rare butterfly in Nagasaki, a caterpillar begins a relay-trip toward the northern tip of Hokkaido, serving as a silent witness to a series of vignettes featuring people struggling with the psychological and social scars of post-war Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzdy70CZYRKVpy9jKDehMa8m2yn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104254'),
  ('515558005755785866', 'Silence in Paradise', 2011, 'Drama', 'Colbert Garcia', 'Mauricio Cuervo, Colbert Garcia', 'Pedro Palacio, Francisco Bolívar, Linda Baldrich, Esmeralda Pinzón, Alejandro Aguilar', null, 'The unscrupulousness of members of the Colombian army destroys the love between twenty-year-old Roland and Lady in El Paraíso, an impoverished neighborhood of Bogotá.', 'The unscrupulousness of members of the Colombian army destroys the love between twenty-year-old Roland and Lady in El Paraíso, an impoverished neighborhood of Bogotá.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp0oYKJbf5pp2qgrcEs6ftBJcgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390686'),
  ('1089508781587718704', 'Silence Is a Falling Body', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Matías Herrera Córdoba, Agustina Comedi, Ezequiel Salinas', 'Agustina Comedi', 'Agustina Comedi, Jaime Comedi, La Delpi, Susana Palomas', null, 'The film follows Agustina as she finds the videotapes that her father Jaime recorded before the accident that took his life. The family secrets surrounding Jaime push Agustina to get involved. Her search will reveal a story marked by sexuality and political activism.', 'The film follows Agustina as she finds the videotapes that her father Jaime recorded before the accident that took his life. The family secrets surrounding Jaime push Agustina to get involved. Her search will reveal a story marked by sexuality and political activism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk1ybJ0uJLFjIcinOWKaAobNrju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518776'),
  ('92293531507990745', 'Silence Is Golden', 1947, 'Romance, Comedy', 'René Clair, Pierre Blondy, Armand Thirard', 'René Clair', 'Maurice Chevalier, François Périer, Marcelle Derrien, Dany Robin, Raymond Cordy, Bernard Lajarrige, Paul Ollivier, Christiane Sertilange', null, 'Emile is a French film producer at the beginning of the century. One of his friends leaves his daughter Lucette in his house, when he is starting a tour through France. Emile falls in love with her. Problems starts when his younger friend Jacques come back from military service and after complaining his misfortune with women, follows Emile''s advice in starting affairs with women and he meets Lucette.', 'Emile is a French film producer at the beginning of the century. One of his friends leaves his daughter Lucette in his house, when he is starting a tour through France. Emile falls in love with her. Problems starts when his younger friend Jacques come back from military service and after complaining his misfortune with women, follows Emile''s advice in starting affairs with women and he meets Lucette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSUvAHoW8jRqvj7eWphBzJ22KIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146828'),
  ('402060619219570366', 'Silence of the Sea', 2004, 'Romance, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Pierre Boutron, Alain Levent, Françoise Menidrey', 'Anne Giafferi', 'Julie Delarme, Michel Galabru, Thomas Jouannet, Marie Bunel, Timothée Ferrand, Jean-Baptiste Puech, Jörg Schnass, Jorn Cambreleng', null, 'In a small town in the West of France, during the German Occupation, a room is requisitioned by a Wehrmacht captain, Werner von Ebrennac. The house where he now stays is inhabited by young Jeanne, who makes a living by giving piano lessons, and by her grandfather. Quite upset, the two "hosts" decide to resist the occupier by never speaking a word to him. Now Werner is a lover of France and its culture, and he tries to persuade them that a rapprochement between Germany and France would be beneficial for the two nations. Quite unexpectedly Jeanne, little by little, falls in love with Werner. At the same time, the Francophile officer loses his illusions, realizing at last that what Nazi Germany actually wants is to thrall France and to stifle its culture...', 'In a small town in the West of France, during the German Occupation, a room is requisitioned by a Wehrmacht captain, Werner von Ebrennac. The house where he now stays is inhabited by young Jeanne, who makes a living by giving piano lessons, and by her grandfather. Quite upset, the two "hosts" decide to resist the occupier by never speaking a word to him. Now Werner is a lover of France and its culture, and he tries to persuade them that a rapprochement between Germany and France would be beneficial for the two nations. Quite unexpectedly Jeanne, little by little, falls in love with Werner. At the same time, the Francophile officer loses his illusions, realizing at last that what Nazi Germany actually wants is to thrall France and to stifle its culture...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9h6lKitROXrUQ7SWLL5cVPgCOkY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336748'),
  ('1151692791048606892', 'Silence!', 2001, null, 'Gregg Lachow', 'Gregg Lachow', 'Megan Murphy, Michael Chick, Judith Weber, Richard Waugh, Charles Mudede, Jon Sampson, Roald Simonson', null, 'A multi-genre performance that fuses 35mm film of an actor and actress arriving on a 1920s movie set with live performances by those same actors, as well as a live score.', 'A multi-genre performance that fuses 35mm film of an actor and actress arriving on a 1920s movie set with live performances by those same actors, as well as a live score.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1621945'),
  ('70593538424369500', 'Silence... Can You Hear It?', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Parvez Shaikh, Aban Bharucha Deohans', 'Aban Bharucha Deohans', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Arjun Mathur, Prachi Desai, Sahil Vaid, Barkha Singh, Shishir Sharma, Sohaila Kapur, Vaquar Shaikh', null, 'When Pooja, the daughter of retired Justice Chaudhary, is found murdered under mysterious circumstances, ACP Verma is roped in to investigate this high-profile case. When everyone is hiding the truth, justice will thrive despite the silence.', 'When Pooja, the daughter of retired Justice Chaudhary, is found murdered under mysterious circumstances, ACP Verma is roped in to investigate this high-profile case. When everyone is hiding the truth, justice will thrive despite the silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lxPuirAgtqHYG3JtIdfg7TucKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804005'),
  ('502980099495850473', 'Silent Action', 1975, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Claudio Bondi', 'Gianfranco Couyoumdjian, Massimo Felisatti, Sergio Martino', 'Luc Merenda, Mel Ferrer, Tomas Milian, Delia Boccardo, Michele Gammino, Paola Tedesco, Franco Giornelli, Gianfranco Barra', null, 'A number of unexplained military deaths hit Italy and are ruled to be accidental or suicides, but police inspector Giorgio Solmi suspects otherwise. When a mysterious wealthy electrician is seemingly murdered by a female escort, a sinister plot slowly begins to unravel.', 'A number of unexplained military deaths hit Italy and are ruled to be accidental or suicides, but police inspector Giorgio Solmi suspects otherwise. When a mysterious wealthy electrician is seemingly murdered by a female escort, a sinister plot slowly begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6UffxuYNNXbtycOdnISXL1JzYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75754'),
  ('619626824423541960', 'Silent Code', 2012, 'Drama', 'Lin Shih-yung', 'Lin Shih-yung', 'Chen Bolin, Ivy Chen, Shiou Chieh-kai, Puff Kuo', null, 'A journalist, tasked with monitoring online message boards for potential news stories, becomes involved in a hacking scandal.', 'A journalist, tasked with monitoring online message boards for potential news stories, becomes involved in a hacking scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kYGwQqDacIgABHTxKtmoLo6CSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137399'),
  ('318324967001552144', 'Silent Dust', 1949, 'Drama', 'Lance Comfort, Wilkie Cooper', 'Michael Pertwee, Roland Pertwee', 'Sally Gray, Derek Farr, Nigel Patrick, Stephen Murray, Beatrice Campbell, George Woodbridge, Seymour Hicks, Marie Lohr', 'NR', 'A wealthy blind man is determined to build a cricket pavilion as a memorial to his dead son, who was killed in battle in World War II. Not long before the dedication ceremony is to be held, the son shows up; it turns out that he wasn''t killed in battle but deserted, and has become a blackmailer and a killer. He wants to get some money to "start a new life", but his blind father senses that something is wrong and sets out to find out what''s going on.', 'A wealthy blind man is determined to build a cricket pavilion as a memorial to his dead son, who was killed in battle in World War II. Not long before the dedication ceremony is to be held, the son shows up; it turns out that he wasn''t killed in battle but deserted, and has become a blackmailer and a killer. He wants to get some money to "start a new life", but his blind father senses that something is wrong and sets out to find out what''s going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zU2Fj3dzewKsjZ33T7lYk61qLS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198338'),
  ('36772682925242159', 'Silent Fall', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Bruce Beresford, Peter James', 'Akiva Goldsman', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Linda Hamilton, John Lithgow, J.T. Walsh, Ben Faulkner, Liv Tyler, Zahn McClarnon, Brandon Stouffer', 'R', 'Having seen the double murder of his parents, autistic youth Tim Warden is sent to therapy with controversial therapist Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake tries to probe the silent child about what he saw, but he gets more details about the Wardens'' household dynamics from Tim''s teenage sister, Sylvie. As he spends more time with the siblings, Jake learns that the Wardens'' marriage was not as perfect as it seemed, and he uncovers other new details that might help solve the crime.', 'Having seen the double murder of his parents, autistic youth Tim Warden is sent to therapy with controversial therapist Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake tries to probe the silent child about what he saw, but he gets more details about the Wardens'' household dynamics from Tim''s teenage sister, Sylvie. As he spends more time with the siblings, Jake learns that the Wardens'' marriage was not as perfect as it seemed, and he uncovers other new details that might help solve the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nek7oeAURO3dr3AdKe4Yi3zPNTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39473'),
  ('843688461623323364', 'Silent Friend', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ildikó Enyedi, Gergely Pálos, Edina Galgócz', 'Ildikó Enyedi', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Léa Seydoux, Luna Wedler, Enzo Brumm, Sylvester Groth, Yun Huang, Luca Valentini, Marlene Burow', null, 'On the grounds of a medieval German university town looms an imposing Ginkgo biloba, a tree whose longevity stands in marked contrast to three intimate, human-scaled stories. In 1908, the university’s first female student gains admission into the prestigious botany department, confronting the sexism of both professors and peers. In 1972, amidst counterculture movements, a reserved student finds his attention captured by a fellow housemate and the geranium plant she studies. In 2020, during the COVID-19 pandemic, a neuroscientist from Hong Kong secures the help of a renowned botanist for an experiment on the old ginkgo tree.', 'On the grounds of a medieval German university town looms an imposing Ginkgo biloba, a tree whose longevity stands in marked contrast to three intimate, human-scaled stories. In 1908, the university’s first female student gains admission into the prestigious botany department, confronting the sexism of both professors and peers. In 1972, amidst counterculture movements, a reserved student finds his attention captured by a fellow housemate and the geranium plant she studies. In 2020, during the COVID-19 pandemic, a neuroscientist from Hong Kong secures the help of a renowned botanist for an experiment on the old ginkgo tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r52BdT1QKYBbJv6OJfqJCAdDqfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168719'),
  ('74942522354231361', 'Silent Hill', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Christophe Gans, Dan Laustsen, Simon Board', 'Roger Avary', 'Radha Mitchell, Sean Bean, Jodelle Ferland, Laurie Holden, Deborah Kara Unger, Kim Coates, Tanya Allen, Alice Krige', 'R', 'Rose, a desperate mother, takes her adopted daughter, Sharon, to the town of Silent Hill in an attempt to cure her of her ailment. After a violent car crash, Sharon disappears, and Rose embarks on a horrific journey to get her back and begins to uncover the truth behind the apocalyptic disaster that burned the town 30 years earlier.', 'Rose, a desperate mother, takes her adopted daughter, Sharon, to the town of Silent Hill in an attempt to cure her of her ailment. After a violent car crash, Sharon disappears, and Rose embarks on a horrific journey to get her back and begins to uncover the truth behind the apocalyptic disaster that burned the town 30 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0bEDWO2w4a43K2xTNSF284qOsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588'),
  ('965061895324530868', 'Silent Hill: Revelation 3D', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Maxime Alexandre, Sorin Popescu, MJ Bassett', 'MJ Bassett', 'Adelaide Clemens, Sean Bean, Radha Mitchell, Carrie-Anne Moss, Malcolm McDowell, Kit Harington, Deborah Kara Unger, Martin Donovan', 'R', 'Heather Mason and her father have been on the run, always one step ahead of dangerous forces that she doesn''t fully understand. Now on the eve of her 18th birthday, plagued by horrific nightmares and the disappearance of her father, Heather discovers she''s not who she thinks she is. The revelation leads her deeper into a demonic world that threatens to trap her forever.', 'Heather Mason and her father have been on the run, always one step ahead of dangerous forces that she doesn''t fully understand. Now on the eve of her 18th birthday, plagued by horrific nightmares and the disappearance of her father, Heather discovers she''s not who she thinks she is. The revelation leads her deeper into a demonic world that threatens to trap her forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkAh9cPkb5PoTzEGWfBkhdFNIsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61012'),
  ('441211363754944877', 'Silent Hours', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Mark Greenstreet, Alfie Biddle', 'Mark Greenstreet', 'James Weber Brown, Indira Varma, Dervla Kirwan, Annie Cooper, Hugh Bonneville, Tom Beard, Susie Amy, Alistair Petrie', null, 'Private detective John Duval, an ex-lieutenant commander in the Royal Navy and Naval Intelligence, finds himself the prime suspect in a police hunt for a sexual killer when three women are brutally murdered.', 'Private detective John Duval, an ex-lieutenant commander in the Royal Navy and Naval Intelligence, finds himself the prime suspect in a police hunt for a sexual killer when three women are brutally murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaz7LlPq92tm4eCquZg1c3P68YL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882251'),
  ('311769906786433508', 'Silent House', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Thomas Fatone, Patrick D. Gibbons, Kim Thompson', 'Gustavo Hernández', 'Elizabeth Olsen, Adam Trese, Eric Sheffer Stevens, Julia Chan, Haley Murphy, Adam Barnett, Sergey Ershov', 'R', 'Sarah returns with her father and uncle to fix up the family''s longtime summerhouse after it was violated by squatters in the off-season. As they work in the dark, Sarah begins to hear sounds from within the walls of the boarded-up building. Although she barely remembers the place, Sarah senses the past may still haunt the home.', 'Sarah returns with her father and uncle to fix up the family''s longtime summerhouse after it was violated by squatters in the off-season. As they work in the dark, Sarah begins to hear sounds from within the walls of the boarded-up building. Although she barely remembers the place, Sarah senses the past may still haunt the home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbkvYlx1scovMi80rOOkNBvgU11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92182'),
  ('202630055119544519', 'Silent Legacy', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Jenni Kivistö, Jussi Rastas', 'Jenni Kivistö, Jussi Rastas', 'Sibiry Konate', null, 'A Burkinabe choreographer in Finland yearns for his village while seeking genuine connection. He chooses to combat inequality using only a minibus.', 'A Burkinabe choreographer in Finland yearns for his village while seeking genuine connection. He chooses to combat inequality using only a minibus.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZjRkOGRhYmEtMzA5ZS00OGVjLWFkYmYtOGY0YzlhMDliZjZlXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:silent-legacy-2026'),
  ('140015183255811532', 'Silent Light', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Reygadas, Alexis Zabé, Alex Ezpeleta', 'Carlos Reygadas', 'Cornelio Wall, Miriam Toews, Maria Pankratz, Peter Wall, Jacobo Klassen, Elizabeth Fehr, Irmo Thiessen, Alfredo Thiessen', null, 'Johan and his family are Mennonites from the north of Mexico. Against the law of God and Man, Johan falls in love with another woman.', 'Johan and his family are Mennonites from the north of Mexico. Against the law of God and Man, Johan falls in love with another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kniOoQky3GX9ljyzobwRUGFgQUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2012'),
  ('114972738806234534', 'Silent Love', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Eiji Uchida, Naoya Ito, Shinya Kimura', 'Eiji Uchida', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Minami Hamabe, Ayumu Nakajima, Shuhei Nomura, Wan Marui, Arata Furuta, SWAY, Takuro Tatsumi', null, 'A silent love story of a young man who wishes to make the dream come true of a young woman who lost her light.', 'A silent love story of a young man who wishes to make the dream come true of a young woman who lost her light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdV2jUZuSThWZsmjgEsZk0vp9NW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1176848'),
  ('1860143025483755', 'Silent Madness', 1984, 'Horror', 'Simon Nuchtern, Gerald Feil, Matthew Carlisle', 'Bob Zimmerman, Nelson DeMille, Bill Milling', 'Viveca Lindfors, Belinda Montgomery, Solly Marx, Rick Aiello, Elizabeth Kaitan, Daisy White, Sydney Lassick, David Greenan', 'R', 'A psychiatrist poses as an ex-sorority sister to stop a slasher freed by a computer error.', 'A psychiatrist poses as an ex-sorority sister to stop a slasher freed by a computer error.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8lvz6KQPdiswL57AlNyZeoLi54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42710'),
  ('366091405588748984', 'Silent Möbius', 1991, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Tetsuro Aoki, Michitaka Kikuchi, Kazuo Tomizawa', 'Kei Shigema, Michitaka Kikuchi', 'Toshiko Fujita, Masako Ikeda, Kiyoshi Kawakubo, Naoko Matsui, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kōji Nakata, Chieko Honda, Gara Takashima', null, 'In a futuristic Tokyo, several policewomen fight a monster. One of them, Katsumi Liqueur, remembers where she saw it before... Katsumi Liqueur, an American-born woman of Japanese descent, travels to Tokyo to visit her mother, Fuyuka, who is sick in the hospital. She takes a shortcut through an alley after her taxi gets stuck in traffic, only to encounter a monster and two policewomen fighting it. Later, she meets their chief, Rally Cheyenne, who, it seems, has been expecting her, though Katsumi has never met her before. The policewomen want Katsumi to help them fight the monster, but Katsumi, who does not want to believe in magic, resists.', 'In a futuristic Tokyo, several policewomen fight a monster. One of them, Katsumi Liqueur, remembers where she saw it before... Katsumi Liqueur, an American-born woman of Japanese descent, travels to Tokyo to visit her mother, Fuyuka, who is sick in the hospital. She takes a shortcut through an alley after her taxi gets stuck in traffic, only to encounter a monster and two policewomen fighting it. Later, she meets their chief, Rally Cheyenne, who, it seems, has been expecting her, though Katsumi has never met her before. The policewomen want Katsumi to help them fight the monster, but Katsumi, who does not want to believe in magic, resists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM25cJLJeNvutDUpjltmAgss9t7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51415'),
  ('210875195104096830', 'Silent Movie', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Mel Brooks, Paul Lohmann', 'Mel Brooks, Ron Clark, Rudy De Luca', 'Mel Brooks, Marty Feldman, Dom DeLuise, Sid Caesar, Harold Gould, Ron Carey, Bernadette Peters, Carol Arthur', 'PG', 'Aspiring filmmakers Mel Funn, Marty Eggs and Dom Bell go to a financially troubled studio with an idea for a silent movie. In an effort to make the movie more marketable, they attempt to recruit a number of big name stars to appear, while the studio''s creditors attempt to thwart them.', 'Aspiring filmmakers Mel Funn, Marty Eggs and Dom Bell go to a financially troubled studio with an idea for a silent movie. In an effort to make the movie more marketable, they attempt to recruit a number of big name stars to appear, while the studio''s creditors attempt to thwart them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeaoOSqEU3elkpDAlKbIWcdKLJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10970'),
  ('141966794181113816', 'Silent Night', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Eric Cayla, Rodney Gibbons', 'Roger Aylward', 'Linda Hamilton, Matthew Harbour, Romano Orzari, Alain Goulem, Michael Elkin, Martin Neufeld, Mark Antony Krupa, Cassian Bopp', 'PG', 'Fact-based World War II story set on Christmas Eve, 1944, finds a German Mother and her son seeking refuge in a cabin on the war front. When she is invaded by three American soldiers and then three German soldiers, she successfully convinces the soldiers to put aside their differences for one evening and share a Christmas dinner.', 'Fact-based World War II story set on Christmas Eve, 1944, finds a German Mother and her son seeking refuge in a cabin on the war front. When she is invaded by three American soldiers and then three German soldiers, she successfully convinces the soldiers to put aside their differences for one evening and share a Christmas dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exN9rOtB1JGBmT6d3R9aylwnHmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17639'),
  ('109612457833752502', 'Silent Night', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Trevor Cunningham, Richard Duffy, Markian Saray', 'Jayson Rothwell', 'Malcolm McDowell, Jaime King, Donal Logue, Ellen Wong, Lisa Marie, Courtney-Jane White, Cortney Palm, John B. Lowe', 'R', 'As their small Midwestern town prepares for its annual Christmas Eve parade, a sheriff and his deputy discover that a maniac in a Santa suit is murdering those he judges as naughty.', 'As their small Midwestern town prepares for its annual Christmas Eve parade, a sheriff and his deputy discover that a maniac in a Santa suit is murdering those he judges as naughty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ippySSXam9UHw6j8g3aH8WxC9LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139455'),
  ('133572500119649295', 'Silent Night', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Piotr Domalewski, Piotr Sobociński Jr., Kacper Habisiak', 'Piotr Domalewski', 'Dawid Ogrodnik, Tomasz Ziętek, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Agnieszka Suchora, Tomasz Schuchardt, Paweł Nowisz, Magdalena Żak, Amelia Tyszkiewicz', null, 'Adam unexpectedly visits his family house at Christmas after a few years of working abroad. No family member knows about his secret plans and the real reasons of his visit.', 'Adam unexpectedly visits his family house at Christmas after a few years of working abroad. No family member knows about his secret plans and the real reasons of his visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yQ2ZVmNFCbAXRbDLiFmZikkYtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478326'),
  ('753893875978671361', 'Silent Night', 2021, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Sam Renton, Paddy Paddison, Giles Barron', 'Camille Griffin', 'Keira Knightley, Matthew Goode, Roman Griffin Davis, Annabelle Wallis, Lily-Rose Depp, Lucy Punch, Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, Kirby Howell-Baptiste', 'R', 'Nell, Simon, and their boy Art are ready to welcome friends and family for what promises to be a perfect Christmas gathering. Perfect except for one thing: everyone is going to die.', 'Nell, Simon, and their boy Art are ready to welcome friends and family for what promises to be a perfect Christmas gathering. Perfect except for one thing: everyone is going to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfUO1SBTfgcK77em3lOuRFY2uLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664574'),
  ('381175322197342199', 'Silent Night', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Sharone Meir, Julieta Jiménez, René Villarreal', 'Robert Archer Lynn', 'Joel Kinnaman, Kid Cudi, Harold Torres, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Valeria Santaella, Vinny O''Brien, Acoyani Chacon, Angeles Woo', 'R', 'A tormented father witnesses his young son die when caught in a gang''s crossfire on Christmas Eve. While recovering from a wound that costs him his voice, he makes vengeance his life''s mission and embarks on a punishing training regimen in order to avenge his son''s death.', 'A tormented father witnesses his young son die when caught in a gang''s crossfire on Christmas Eve. While recovering from a wound that costs him his voice, he makes vengeance his life''s mission and embarks on a punishing training regimen in order to avenge his son''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlcuhdNMKNGEVpGqBZrAaOOf1A6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891699'),
  ('531079971894018886', 'Silent Night, Deadly Night', 1984, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Henning Schellerup, Denis L. Stewart, Charles E. Sellier Jr.', 'Michael Hickey', 'Robert Brian Wilson, Lilyan Chauvin, Gilmer McCormick, Charles Dierkop, Toni Nero, Randy Stumpf, Linnea Quigley, Britt Leach', 'R', 'After a man dressed as Santa Claus brutally murders Billy Chapman''s parents, little Billy then endures the cruelty of a sadistic nun at his orphanage. Years later, when adult Billy has to fill in for an absent in-store Santa, his childhood trauma brings him to the breaking point.', 'After a man dressed as Santa Claus brutally murders Billy Chapman''s parents, little Billy then endures the cruelty of a sadistic nun at his orphanage. Years later, when adult Billy has to fill in for an absent in-store Santa, his childhood trauma brings him to the breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIaMyxc1yyZj4341roqP8Gr1Qxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27414'),
  ('1035983960204510926', 'Silent Night, Deadly Night', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mike P. Nelson, Nick Junkersfeld, Reed Makayev', 'Michael Hickey, Mike P. Nelson', 'Rohan Campbell, Ruby Modine, Mark Acheson, David Lawrence Brown, David Tomlinson, Logan Sawyer, Erik Athavale, Rick Skene', 'NR', 'After witnessing his parents'' brutal murder on Christmas Eve, Billy transforms into a Killer Santa, delivering a yearly spree of calculated, chilling violence. This year, his blood-soaked mission collides with love, as a young woman challenges him to confront his darkness.', 'After witnessing his parents'' brutal murder on Christmas Eve, Billy transforms into a Killer Santa, delivering a yearly spree of calculated, chilling violence. This year, his blood-soaked mission collides with love, as a young woman challenges him to confront his darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCdSd7NnRdnL8DGLVhI95WhUNoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801937'),
