  ('415752545010581439', 'Silent Night, Deadly Night III: Better Watch Out!', 1989, 'Horror', 'Thomas Herod Jr., Bob Everson, Gregg Goldstone', 'Rex Weiner', 'Richard Beymer, Bill Moseley, Samantha Scully, Eric DaRe, Laura Harring, Elizabeth Hoffman, Robert Culp, Richard C. Adams', 'R', 'Ricky Caldwell, the notorious ''Killer Santa Claus'', awakens from a six-year coma after being kept alive on life-support by a slightly crazed doctor experimenting with ESP and other special abilities. Ricky targets a young, clairvoyant blind woman, named Laura, whom is traveling with her brother Chris, and his girlfriend Jerri to their grandmother''s house for Christmas Eve, and Ricky decides to go after her, leaving a trail of dead bodies in his wake.', 'Ricky Caldwell, the notorious ''Killer Santa Claus'', awakens from a six-year coma after being kept alive on life-support by a slightly crazed doctor experimenting with ESP and other special abilities. Ricky targets a young, clairvoyant blind woman, named Laura, whom is traveling with her brother Chris, and his girlfriend Jerri to their grandmother''s house for Christmas Eve, and Ricky decides to go after her, leaving a trail of dead bodies in his wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lLDhF1hlXeM37TLGsFZyw1LLAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42709'),
  ('436708646194336518', 'Silent Night, Deadly Night Part 2', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lee Harry, Harvey Genkins, Joseph H. Earle', 'Lee Harry, Joseph H. Earle', 'Eric Freeman, James Newman, Elizabeth Kaitan, Jean Miller, Darrel Guilbeau, Brian Michael Henley, Corrine Gelfan, Michael Combatti', 'R', 'Ricky is released from a mental hospital, taking with him the memory of his brother Billy''s death and embarking on a journey of relentless revenge.', 'Ricky is released from a mental hospital, taking with him the memory of his brother Billy''s death and embarking on a journey of relentless revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bg2wBjg5zNoVxZnt7RarVQBxUuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50719'),
  ('135806503505671136', 'Silent Night, Zombie Night', 2009, 'Horror, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Sean Cain, Jim Wright', 'Sean Cain', 'Jack Forcinito, Andy Hopper, Nadine Stenovitch, Lew Temple, Vernon Wells, Felissa Rose, Timothy Muskatell, Jimmy Williams', 'R', 'A week before Christmas a viral outbreak turns the citizens of Los Angeles into the walking dead. On the brink of severing ties with both his wife and longtime partner, L.A.P.D. officer Frank Talbot finds himself trapped with them. As death closes in their survival is further threatened by the fact that both men love the same woman.', 'A week before Christmas a viral outbreak turns the citizens of Los Angeles into the walking dead. On the brink of severing ties with both his wife and longtime partner, L.A.P.D. officer Frank Talbot finds himself trapped with them. As death closes in their survival is further threatened by the fact that both men love the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vE64RhEl8ZqTaiwbKCAdmydb0Mp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28565'),
  ('18891380694784559', 'Silent Parade', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Hideo Yamamoto, Hideaki Murakami', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Ko Shibasaki, Kazuki Kitamura, Kippei Shiina, Rei Dan, Yoh Yoshida, Hiromasa Taguchi, Naho Toda', null, 'Physicist Manabu Yukawa returns to Japan from America. Detective Kaoru Utsumi visits him and talks about a case. The case is about a popular girl in a town who disappeared and, several years later, her body was found. A suspect was arrested for her murder. That suspect was previously arrested for another girl''s murder, but he was released due to a lack of evidence. Detective Shunpei Kusanagi investigated the prior murder case. The same suspect was then released due to a lack of evidence for the most recent murder case. The released man returned to his town, where everybody hated him. On the day of the autumn festival parade, the man was killed. Physicist Manabu Yukawa, Detective Kaoru Utsumi and Detective Shunpei Kusanagi work together on his case.', 'Physicist Manabu Yukawa returns to Japan from America. Detective Kaoru Utsumi visits him and talks about a case. The case is about a popular girl in a town who disappeared and, several years later, her body was found. A suspect was arrested for her murder. That suspect was previously arrested for another girl''s murder, but he was released due to a lack of evidence. Detective Shunpei Kusanagi investigated the prior murder case. The same suspect was then released due to a lack of evidence for the most recent murder case. The released man returned to his town, where everybody hated him. On the day of the autumn festival parade, the man was killed. Physicist Manabu Yukawa, Detective Kaoru Utsumi and Detective Shunpei Kusanagi work together on his case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cn8NGwXTgnr3kGD2VuDmpw7BiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956564'),
  ('5916246365712592', 'Silent Predators', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Action', 'Noel Nosseck, John Stokes', null, 'Harry Hamlin, Shannon Sturges, David Spielberg, Patty McCormack, Beau Billingslea, Phillip Troy Linger, Jack Scalia, David Whitney', null, 'In 1979, a delivery truck makes its way up a lonely southern California highway in a storm, bound for the San Diego Zoo with a deadly tropical rattlesnake as cargo. When the truck suffers a blowout, the driver loses control and hits a tree, shattering the snake''s aquarium in the back and the window separating the snake from the driver. The snake slithers into the front of the truck, kills the driver with its bite and then moves off into the forest. Flash forward to 1999. The small southern California town of San Vicente has grown from 6,000 to 30,000, and the rattler, which escaped nearby years ago, has bred. There are now 25,000 of these hybrid rattlesnakes, and they are slowly making their way downhill into the town, attracted by the movement of the blasting as the town paves its way toward progress. Progress, in this case, brings terror, in this tale originally penned by John Carpenter.', 'In 1979, a delivery truck makes its way up a lonely southern California highway in a storm, bound for the San Diego Zoo with a deadly tropical rattlesnake as cargo. When the truck suffers a blowout, the driver loses control and hits a tree, shattering the snake''s aquarium in the back and the window separating the snake from the driver. The snake slithers into the front of the truck, kills the driver with its bite and then moves off into the forest. Flash forward to 1999. The small southern California town of San Vicente has grown from 6,000 to 30,000, and the rattler, which escaped nearby years ago, has bred. There are now 25,000 of these hybrid rattlesnakes, and they are slowly making their way downhill into the town, attracted by the movement of the blasting as the town paves its way toward progress. Progress, in this case, brings terror, in this tale originally penned by John Carpenter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1rYsziZnMRzBLBv8LCU6YNzf4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109174'),
  ('136524931426504821', 'Silent Rage', 1982, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Michael Miller, Robert C. Jessup, Neil Roach', 'Joseph Fraley', 'Chuck Norris, Ron Silver, Toni Kalem, Brian Libby, Steven Keats, William Finley, Stephen Furst, Stephanie Dunnam', 'R', 'A mentally ill man in a small Texas town goes on a killing rampage and is fatally wounded by police. When doctors use an experimental serum to bring him back to life, the killer develops superhuman strength and the town sheriff must pursue him.', 'A mentally ill man in a small Texas town goes on a killing rampage and is fatally wounded by police. When doctors use an experimental serum to bring him back to life, the killer develops superhuman strength and the town sheriff must pursue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LwR6SFLuzbbzYgXdGnVHahBqrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27150'),
  ('797665751941416514', 'Silent Running', 1972, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Douglas Trumbull, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Deric Washburn, Michael Cimino, Steven Bochco', 'Bruce Dern, Cliff Potts, Ron Rifkin, Jesse Vint, Mark Persons, Steven Brown, Cheryl Sparks, Larry Whisenhunt', 'G', 'After the entire flora goes extinct, ecologist Lowell maintains a greenhouse aboard a space station for the future with his android companions. However, he rebels after being ordered to destroy the greenhouse in favor of carrying cargo, a decision that puts him at odds with everyone but his mechanical companions.', 'After the entire flora goes extinct, ecologist Lowell maintains a greenhouse aboard a space station for the future with his android companions. However, he rebels after being ordered to destroy the greenhouse in favor of carrying cargo, a decision that puts him at odds with everyone but his mechanical companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahasZ5HILZHtlrl6cbXgpfk0y8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811'),
  ('977359810026154926', 'Silent Scream', 1979, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Denny Harris', 'Denny Harris, Wallace C. Bennett, Jim Wheat', 'Rebecca Balding, Barbara Steele, Yvonne De Carlo, Avery Schreiber, Steve Doubet, Brad Rearden, Juli Andelman, John Widelock', null, 'Scotty moves into Mrs. Engels'' seaside mansion where three other college students are boarding. Mrs. Engels prefers to stay in her room in the attic, but her son Mason helps the students get settled. Soon one of the students is killed. The policemen on the case begin uncovering the Engels family secret as the remaining students become endangered', 'Scotty moves into Mrs. Engels'' seaside mansion where three other college students are boarding. Mrs. Engels prefers to stay in her room in the attic, but her son Mason helps the students get settled. Soon one of the students is killed. The policemen on the case begin uncovering the Engels family secret as the remaining students become endangered', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9si55E97ooMEBtzLYK4v7yAuLCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28380'),
  ('603253128926037581', 'Silent Souls', 2010, 'Drama', 'Alexey Fedorchenko, Olga Gileva, Nelly Ivanova', 'Denis Osokin', 'Yuliya Aug, Igor Sergeev, Viktor Sukhorukov, Yuriy Tsurilo, Vyacheslav Melekhov, Yulia Tushina, Ivan Tushin, Leisan Sitdikova', null, 'Miron Alekseevich, director of a paper and pulp mill, goes to bury his wife Tanya in the place where they once spent their honeymoon. He goes not alone, but with a photographer named Stork, to whom he tells touching details of his life with Tanya. The narrative weaves together the memories of the characters, as well as the rituals and beliefs of the Meri people, a small Finnish tribe that once lived in the Northern Volga region and dissolved among the Russians.', 'Miron Alekseevich, director of a paper and pulp mill, goes to bury his wife Tanya in the place where they once spent their honeymoon. He goes not alone, but with a photographer named Stork, to whom he tells touching details of his life with Tanya. The narrative weaves together the memories of the characters, as well as the rituals and beliefs of the Meri people, a small Finnish tribe that once lived in the Northern Volga region and dissolved among the Russians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ29b3lxfXSPyR3P48yNWfD6tTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51276'),
  ('1070589163800395855', 'Silent Tongue', 1993, 'Western, Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Jack Conroy, Sam Shepard', 'Sam Shepard', 'Alan Bates, Richard Harris, River Phoenix, Dermot Mulroney, Tantoo Cardinal, Bill Irwin, Sheila Tousey, Jeri Arredondo', null, 'Mad with grief after the death of his Kiowa wife, Roe awaits death under a tree with her body beside him. She begins to haunt him because he won''t bury her. His father, who bought him the wife, thinks her sister might reason with Roe.', 'Mad with grief after the death of his Kiowa wife, Roe awaits death under a tree with her body beside him. She begins to haunt him because he won''t bury her. His father, who bought him the wife, thinks her sister might reason with Roe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BqpMgVDdvfCK68cgcZGSpf7IzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143547'),
  ('852856164586910779', 'Silent Trigger', 1996, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Russell Mulcahy, David Franco', 'Sergio Altieri', 'Dolph Lundgren, Gina Bellman, Conrad Dunn, Christopher Heyerdahl, Emma Stevens, Alexandria Haber, Erin Simms, Tim Post', null, 'Waxman is a former Special Forces soldier who is now working as a heavily armed assassin for a top secret government agency. When a covert mission goes terribly wrong, Waxman and fellow assassin Clegg become that agency''s prime targets.', 'Waxman is a former Special Forces soldier who is now working as a heavily armed assassin for a top secret government agency. When a covert mission goes terribly wrong, Waxman and fellow assassin Clegg become that agency''s prime targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PQAJWnirngVzBUSYNkD128eoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24206'),
  ('696978808894299478', 'Silent Voice', 2009, 'Drama', 'Léa Fehner, Jean-Louis Vialard', 'Léa Fehner', 'Farida Rahouadj, Reda Kateb, Pauline Étienne, Marc Barbé, Vincent Rottiers, Julien Lucas, Delphine Chuillot, Dinara Drukarova', null, 'An elderly woman wants to meet her son’s murderer. A sixteen-year-old girl who has crossed paths with a young hoodlum needs an adult to accompany her to the prison visiting room. A young medical supplies delivery man is offered a deal to take the place of a gangster inmate so that the latter may escape. Two women, one man, three destinies that come together in the visiting room of a prison…', 'An elderly woman wants to meet her son’s murderer. A sixteen-year-old girl who has crossed paths with a young hoodlum needs an adult to accompany her to the prison visiting room. A young medical supplies delivery man is offered a deal to take the place of a gangster inmate so that the latter may escape. Two women, one man, three destinies that come together in the visiting room of a prison…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMyp2vCF9nAs3qQbp13WlbuH9vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60045'),
  ('102420042795718232', 'Silent Warnings', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Christian McIntire, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Christian McIntire, Bill Lundy', 'Stephen Baldwin, A.J. Buckley, Billy Zane, Callie De Fabry, David O''Donnell, Michelle Borth, Ransford Doherty, Kim Onasch', null, 'In a small Oregon town, mysterious crop circles have begun appearing in Joe''s corn fields. When Joe''s cousin, his five college friends and local Sheriff Willingham happen upon the otherworldly designs, they unleash unfathomable terror.', 'In a small Oregon town, mysterious crop circles have begun appearing in Joe''s corn fields. When Joe''s cousin, his five college friends and local Sheriff Willingham happen upon the otherworldly designs, they unleash unfathomable terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiQrZqQncvKmy73AXZwEMGT9U1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44020'),
  ('340196583355500027', 'Silent Wedding', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Horațiu Mălăele, Vivi Drăgan Vasile', 'Adrian Lustig, Horațiu Mălăele', 'Meda Andreea Victor, Alexandru Potocean, Valentin Teodosiu, Alexandru Bindea, Ioana Anastasia Anton, Luminița Gheorghiu, Dan Condurache, Șerban Pavlu', null, 'In a small village of Communist-era Romania a young couple wish to marry, but Joseph Stalin dies the night prior to their wedding ceremony forcing the bride and groom to marry in silence.', 'In a small village of Communist-era Romania a young couple wish to marry, but Joseph Stalin dies the night prior to their wedding ceremony forcing the bride and groom to marry in silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lnJtOSbLtrYs7K0SRqCLUq3J6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26752'),
  ('997076571666320544', 'Silent Youth', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Diemo Kemmesies, Albrecht von Grünhagen', 'Diemo Kemmesies', 'Martin Bruchmann, Josef Mattes, Linda Schüle, Mathias Neubert', null, 'Two young students bump into each other in Berlin and feel attracted to each other. They tentatively get to know each other, which only adds to their confusion as they are torn between shame and desire.', 'Two young students bump into each other in Berlin and feel attracted to each other. They tentatively get to know each other, which only adds to their confusion as they are torn between shame and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7OvnHCej8NPXkcL20G4sAK6CvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224404'),
  ('1092069643764216183', 'Silent Zone', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Deak, Balázs Dobóczi', 'Viktor Csák, Krisztián Illés', 'Matt Devere, Luca Papp, Nikolett Barabas, Declan Hannigan, Alexis Latham, Julian Krenn, Roderick Hill, Anders Grundberg', 'R', 'In a zombie-ravaged world, a resourceful teen and her protector fight for survival, facing relentless dangers and testing the limits of hope and loyalty.', 'In a zombie-ravaged world, a resourceful teen and her protector fight for survival, facing relentless dangers and testing the limits of hope and loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YZ0JRRD7mt8Ov9eIEGWMbDybx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1419229'),
  ('862274956906206335', 'Silentium', 2004, 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Peter von Haller', 'Josef Hader, Wolfgang Murnberger, Wolf Haas', 'Josef Hader, Simon Schwarz, Joachim Król, Maria Köstlinger, Udo Samel, Jürgen Tarrach, Rosie Alvarez, Georg Friedrich', null, 'A man who accused a catholic bishop of abusing him when he was a child dies in the Austrian city Salzburg. Everyone except his widow and the eccentrical detective Simon Brenner keeps silent and believes that the man killed himself.', 'A man who accused a catholic bishop of abusing him when he was a child dies in the Austrian city Salzburg. Everyone except his widow and the eccentrical detective Simon Brenner keeps silent and believes that the man killed himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uca8Pb96wSgcTuUYaT5Nb3IIAzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9010'),
  ('847591634106001558', 'Silhouette of Your Voice', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Daisuke Kamijo, Naoyoshi Kawamatsu, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Hideya Tawada, Onodera Akira, Ami Yamazaki, Hiroe Igeta, Rima Matsuda, Ryō Mitsuya, Yuki Fukumoto, Norihisa Hiranuma', 'NR', 'Kohei, a deaf university student, meets lively Taichi and finds rare connection. But as their bond deepens, Kohei must confront his fear of growing too close.', 'Kohei, a deaf university student, meets lively Taichi and finds rare connection. But as their bond deepens, Kohei must confront his fear of growing too close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s04wIbssnjIUiUqXCXDYhl3Ap7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431988'),
  ('501542513201519850', 'Silicon Cowboys', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Jason Cohen', 'Jason Cohen, Steven Leckart', 'Rod Canion, Bill Murto, Jim Harris, Bill Fargo, Hugh Barnes, Gary Stimac, Steve Flannigan, Mike Swavely', 'NR', 'Launched in 1982 by three friends in a Houston diner, Compaq Computer set out to build a portable PC to take on IBM, the world’s most powerful tech company. Many had tried cloning the industry leader’s code, only to be trounced by IBM and its high-priced lawyers. Explore the remarkable David vs. Goliath story, and eventual demise, of Compaq, an unlikely upstart who altered the future of computing and helped shape the world as we know it today.', 'Launched in 1982 by three friends in a Houston diner, Compaq Computer set out to build a portable PC to take on IBM, the world’s most powerful tech company. Many had tried cloning the industry leader’s code, only to be trounced by IBM and its high-priced lawyers. Explore the remarkable David vs. Goliath story, and eventual demise, of Compaq, an unlikely upstart who altered the future of computing and helped shape the world as we know it today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfyXTQ3KmSmdp8EyRhPhvAVOxZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381058'),
  ('81684318260303180', 'Silip Sa Apoy', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mac Alejandre, Daniel Uy', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Angeli Khang, Sid Lucero, Paolo Gumabao, Jela Cuenca, Dexter Doria, Massimo Scofield, John Drey Guevarra, Juvz Tesalona', null, 'Take a peek at the life of an unhappy housewife who finds passionate love from her neighbor and how their affair brings them closer to fire.', 'Take a peek at the life of an unhappy housewife who finds passionate love from her neighbor and how their affair brings them closer to fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9grG4PVppBWqKs2hrKMEr6j3RWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931599'),
  ('1149023758570851217', 'Silk', 1986, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'Frederick Bailey', 'Cec Verrell, Bill McLaughlin, Joe Mari Avellana, Frederick Bailey, Nick Nicholson, Berto Spoor, Najid Jadali, Sam Lombardo', 'R', 'Silk, the toughest cop in Honolulu, busts small time smugglers only to reveal a larger syndicate smuggling Asian mobsters into the States by buying the identities of Hawaiian citizens.', 'Silk, the toughest cop in Honolulu, busts small time smugglers only to reveal a larger syndicate smuggling Asian mobsters into the States by buying the identities of Hawaiian citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlENZzbGU092R5uTi1IuqPfcHVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107412'),
  ('846062372553295359', 'Silk', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Su Chaobin, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Je-Yi An', 'Su Chaobin', 'Chang Chen, Yosuke Eguchi, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Barbie Hsu, Chen Bolin, Leon Dai, Kevin S. Smith, Janine Chang Chun-Ning', null, 'A scientist uses his invention - the "Menger Sponge" - to capture the energy of a dead child''s spirit in an old building. In trying to determine why the energy of the ghost does not dissipate, the team discovers the identity and the dramatic story of the boy.', 'A scientist uses his invention - the "Menger Sponge" - to capture the energy of a dead child''s spirit in an old building. In trying to determine why the energy of the ghost does not dissipate, the team discovers the identity and the dramatic story of the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpfPg7MuQLaDeteKLMgopE9eozG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25875'),
  ('853764746354110164', 'Silk', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Girard, Alain Dostie', 'François Girard, Michael Golding', 'Keira Knightley, Michael Pitt, Alfred Molina, Koji Yakusho, Sei Ashina, Miki Nakatani, Kenneth Welsh, Callum Keith Rennie', 'R', 'French silkworm trader Hervé is married to the beautiful Hélène. When an outbreak of disease ravages European silkworms, Hervé must travel to Japan to retrieve healthy eggs. After a long journey, Hervé finally arrives at a village where he can buy them. He becomes infatuated with a young concubine and goes to great lengths to see her again. But, when war breaks out in Japan, the concubine flees, forcing Hervé to return home to his wife.', 'French silkworm trader Hervé is married to the beautiful Hélène. When an outbreak of disease ravages European silkworms, Hervé must travel to Japan to retrieve healthy eggs. After a long journey, Hervé finally arrives at a village where he can buy them. He becomes infatuated with a young concubine and goes to great lengths to see her again. But, when war breaks out in Japan, the concubine flees, forcing Hervé to return home to his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQyTooR8UthIcRRmBsY9ROxQWJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14753'),
  ('29706692667956991', 'Silk Road', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Peter Flinckenberg, Sarah Lemmon, Joey Bufalino', 'Tiller Russell', 'Jason Clarke, Nick Robinson, Daniel David Stewart, Alexandra Shipp, Paul Walter Hauser, Jimmi Simpson, Lexi Rabe, Katie Aselton', 'R', 'Philosophical twenty-something Ross Ulbricht creates Silk Road, a dark net website that sells drugs, while DEA agent Rick Bowden goes undercover to bring him down.', 'Philosophical twenty-something Ross Ulbricht creates Silk Road, a dark net website that sells drugs, while DEA agent Rick Bowden goes undercover to bring him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KxiEWyIDpz1ikmD7nv3GTX4Uoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579051'),
  ('858796522338438730', 'Silk Stockings', 1957, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Al Jennings, Robert J. Bronner', 'Melchior Lengyel, George S. Kaufman', 'Fred Astaire, Cyd Charisse, Janis Paige, Wim Sonneveld, Peter Lorre, George Tobias, Jules Munshin, Joseph Buloff', 'NR', 'After three bumbling Soviet agents fail in their mission to retrieve a straying Soviet composer from Paris, the beautiful, ultra-serious Ninotchka is sent to complete their mission and to retrieve them. She starts out condemning the decadent West, but gradually falls under its spell—with the help of an American movie producer. A remake of Ninotchka (1939).', 'After three bumbling Soviet agents fail in their mission to retrieve a straying Soviet composer from Paris, the beautiful, ultra-serious Ninotchka is sent to complete their mission and to retrieve them. She starts out condemning the decadent West, but gradually falls under its spell—with the help of an American movie producer. A remake of Ninotchka (1939).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuV34rCOrcDt6Ii3149AlJs9bpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43239'),
  ('804962687316677802', 'Silkwood', 1983, 'Drama', 'Mike Nichols, Miroslav Ondříček, Michael Hausman', 'Alice Arlen, Nora Ephron', 'Meryl Streep, Kurt Russell, Cher, Craig T. Nelson, Fred Ward, Diana Scarwid, Ron Silver, Charles Hallahan', 'R', 'Like most of the people in her town, Karen Silkwood works at the local nuclear plant producing highly radioactive plutonium. Exposed one day to a lethal dose of radiation, Karen faces the blank walls of corporate indifference and denial. As her illness increases, her protest grows louder and she becomes an obvious danger to the powers that be.', 'Like most of the people in her town, Karen Silkwood works at the local nuclear plant producing highly radioactive plutonium. Exposed one day to a lethal dose of radiation, Karen faces the blank walls of corporate indifference and denial. As her illness increases, her protest grows louder and she becomes an obvious danger to the powers that be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Piz5R5dB6d7v1OWNaIn9GB4qZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12502'),
  ('595739209773482933', 'Sillunu Oru Kaadhal', 2006, 'Family, Romance', 'Obeli N Krishna, R. D. Rajasekhar', 'Obeli N Krishna', 'Suriya, Jyothika, Bhumika Chawla, Santhanam, Vadivelu, Shriya Sharma', null, 'Gowtham and Kundhavi married then she finds a diary from his time at college, five years earlier. She thinks he would rather be married to Aishwarya, his college sweetheart, so she makes arrangements for them to meet again.', 'Gowtham and Kundhavi married then she finds a diary from his time at college, five years earlier. She thinks he would rather be married to Aishwarya, his college sweetheart, so she makes arrangements for them to meet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMReGYKwnxSqmItDRKYiOiqmyku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69635'),
  ('366852148928650355', 'Silly Scandals', 1931, 'Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Billy Murray, Mae Questel, Gus Wicke', null, 'In a vaudeville act, Betty Boop (with dog''s ears) sings "You''re Drivin'' Me Crazy;" Bimbo sneaks into the show and runs afoul of a stage hypnotist.', 'In a vaudeville act, Betty Boop (with dog''s ears) sings "You''re Drivin'' Me Crazy;" Bimbo sneaks into the show and runs afoul of a stage hypnotist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQNngDwFUiuP9gteKB0UQpfNkDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162581'),
  ('558399774148662104', 'Silmido', 2003, 'Action, Drama', 'Kang Woo-suk, Kim Sung-bok, Shin Hak-sung', 'Kim Hee-jae', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Ahn Sung-ki, Huh Joon-ho, Jung Jae-young, Im Won-hee, Kang Shin-il, Kang Seong-jin, Lee Jeong-heon', null, 'On 31 January 1968, 31 North Korean commandos infiltrated South Korea in a failed mission to assassinate President Park Chung-hee. In revenge, the South Korean military assembled a team of 31 criminals on the island of Silmido to kill Kim Il-sung for a suicide mission to redeem their honor, but was cancelled, leaving them frustrated. It is loosely based on a military uprising in the 1970s.', 'On 31 January 1968, 31 North Korean commandos infiltrated South Korea in a failed mission to assassinate President Park Chung-hee. In revenge, the South Korean military assembled a team of 31 criminals on the island of Silmido to kill Kim Il-sung for a suicide mission to redeem their honor, but was cancelled, leaving them frustrated. It is loosely based on a military uprising in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwE6cVIoJ4JP397yMGfBBpHMJmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19644'),
  ('166625930526014642', 'Silsila', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yash Chopra, K.G. Koregaonkar', 'Yash Chopra', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Rekha, Jaya Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Sanjeev Kumar, Sudha Chopra, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Deven Verma', null, 'When his brother''s tragic death leaves his pregnant fiancée devastated, playwright Amit selflessly marries her to protect her from societal contempt. However, when fate brings him face-to-face with his former flame, love proves to be stronger than marital vows.', 'When his brother''s tragic death leaves his pregnant fiancée devastated, playwright Amit selflessly marries her to protect her from societal contempt. However, when fate brings him face-to-face with his former flame, love proves to be stronger than marital vows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uzX38mxGZBBEdbxB4yxEw2vFvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28472'),
  ('618682737582461736', 'Silver', 1999, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike', 'Hisao Maki, Saburô Takemoto', 'Atsuko Sakuraba, Kenji Haga, Shinobu Kandori, Rumi Kazama, Hisao Maki, Fujio Matsushima, Kôji Tsukamoto, Yasukaze Motomiya', null, 'The story in "Silver" is about a female wrestler who is really an undercover agent. Disguised as a wrestling warrior, heroine Jun Shirogane (Atsuko Sakuraba) goes after the gang that killed her family in Takashi Miike''s action-packed thriller. Aided by secret service colleague Yusuke Minamida (Kenji Haga), Jun goes undercover as Silver, a formidable fighter in the professional women''s wrestling circuit. But Jun''s success in the ring doesn''t distract her from her primary mission: exacting revenge on the Paradise gang.', 'The story in "Silver" is about a female wrestler who is really an undercover agent. Disguised as a wrestling warrior, heroine Jun Shirogane (Atsuko Sakuraba) goes after the gang that killed her family in Takashi Miike''s action-packed thriller. Aided by secret service colleague Yusuke Minamida (Kenji Haga), Jun goes undercover as Silver, a formidable fighter in the professional women''s wrestling circuit. But Jun''s success in the ring doesn''t distract her from her primary mission: exacting revenge on the Paradise gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WYlfvVkPcB5SXnEs8K9JSeLlle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38068'),
  ('742499054105866391', 'Silver and the Book of Dreams', 2023, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Helena Hufnagel, Andreas Berger', 'Sina Flammang', 'Jana McKinnon, Rhys Mannion, Chaneil Kular, Josephine Blazier, Théo Augier, Efeosa Afolabi, Riva Krymalowski, Nicolette Krebitz', null, 'When Liv moves to London, she meets the mysterious Henry and his group of friends, who pull her into the enthralling world of dream-travel. She and her newfound band of dream-wanderers conduct a ritual to make their biggest dream come true, but it demands the gravest sacrifice.', 'When Liv moves to London, she meets the mysterious Henry and his group of friends, who pull her into the enthralling world of dream-travel. She and her newfound band of dream-wanderers conduct a ritual to make their biggest dream come true, but it demands the gravest sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycpxvpNyrkzsydwvLTUNixRWrdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023845'),
  ('781603017392685760', 'Silver Bears', 1977, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ivan Passer, Kenneth Ryan, Bob Howard', 'Peter Stone', 'Michael Caine, Cybill Shepherd, Louis Jourdan, Stéphane Audran, David Warner, Tom Smothers, Martin Balsam, Jay Leno', 'PG', 'Financial wizard "Doc" Fletcher is sent by crime boss Joe Fiore to buy a bank in Switzerland in order to more easily launder their profits. When he arrives, Fletcher finds that the bank, acquired by his associate Prince di Siracusa, consists of some shabby offices above a restaurant. To make up for this, the Prince suggests that Fletcher invests in a silver mine owned by Shireen and Agha Firdausi. This solves one problem, but the mine also attracts the attention of some of the most powerful people in the silver business. Fletcher must pull out all his wheeler-dealing skills in order to keep hold of everything he''s worked for, in the process romancing a banker''s discontented wife.', 'Financial wizard "Doc" Fletcher is sent by crime boss Joe Fiore to buy a bank in Switzerland in order to more easily launder their profits. When he arrives, Fletcher finds that the bank, acquired by his associate Prince di Siracusa, consists of some shabby offices above a restaurant. To make up for this, the Prince suggests that Fletcher invests in a silver mine owned by Shireen and Agha Firdausi. This solves one problem, but the mine also attracts the attention of some of the most powerful people in the silver business. Fletcher must pull out all his wheeler-dealing skills in order to keep hold of everything he''s worked for, in the process romancing a banker''s discontented wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaJgZ1IDZToI3mB9MqY80pQm9la.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61642'),
  ('1099800854982009944', 'Silver Bells', 2005, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'Dick Lowry, Allen Kupetsky, Eric Van Haren Noman', null, 'Anne Heche, Tate Donovan, Courtney Jines, Michael Mitchell, Victoria Justice, Max Martini, Max Martini, John Benjamin Hickey', 'NR', 'Manhattanite Catherine O''Mara (Heche) bonds with a young man who has run away from his father. When the father returns to New York a year later to sell his Christmas trees, he and Catherine cross paths.', 'Manhattanite Catherine O''Mara (Heche) bonds with a young man who has run away from his father. When the father returns to New York a year later to sell his Christmas trees, he and Catherine cross paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14XQZ1m0e1rvdT2tcLZ5yOwj6an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55653'),
  ('560861402472913561', 'Silver Blaze', 1937, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Thomas Bentley', null, 'Arthur Wontner, Ian Fleming, John Turnbull, Lawrence Grossmith, Robert Horton, Lyn Harding, Arthur Macrae, Judy Gunn', 'NR', 'Holmes takes a vacation and visits his old friend Sir Henry Baskerville. His vacation ends when he suddenly finds himself in the middle of a double-murder mystery. Now he''s got to find Professor Moriarty and the horse Silver Blaze before the great cup final horse race.', 'Holmes takes a vacation and visits his old friend Sir Henry Baskerville. His vacation ends when he suddenly finds himself in the middle of a double-murder mystery. Now he''s got to find Professor Moriarty and the horse Silver Blaze before the great cup final horse race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc2Ck8YNB7cbvVYS2K4oZwjWp2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44579'),
  ('515488215802744843', 'Silver Bullet', 1985, 'Horror', 'Dan Attias, Armando Nannuzzi, John T. Kretchmer', 'Stephen King', 'Gary Busey, Everett McGill, Tovah Feldshuh, Megan Follows, Corey Haim, Terry O''Quinn, Robin Groves, Leon Russom', 'R', 'The small city of Tarker''s Mills is startled by a series of sadistic murders. The population fears the work of a maniac, but sightings of a mysterious, hairy creature soon spread. People lock themselves up at night, but there''s one boy who''s still outside…', 'The small city of Tarker''s Mills is startled by a series of sadistic murders. The population fears the work of a maniac, but sightings of a mysterious, hairy creature soon spread. People lock themselves up at night, but there''s one boy who''s still outside…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52CvWYuJyWcMTPvsfcmsxaVHi7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17898'),
  ('583479185871942247', 'Silver City', 1951, 'Western', 'Byron Haskin, Ray Rennahan', 'Frank Gruber', 'Edmond O''Brien, Yvonne De Carlo, Richard Arlen, Barry Fitzgerald, Gladys George, Kasey Rogers, Edgar Buchanan, Michael Moore', null, 'Having masterminded the hold up of his company office, a mining engineer is barred from the industry. He then sets up shop as an assayer, scheming to acquire a rich silver mine lease from its operators.', 'Having masterminded the hold up of his company office, a mining engineer is barred from the industry. He then sets up shop as an assayer, scheming to acquire a rich silver mine lease from its operators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LOzmwPpqwBa2x2A266NAEiYaMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336495'),
  ('1029231074630130871', 'Silver City', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Sayles, Sandy McLeod, Brian Moon', 'John Sayles', 'Maria Bello, Thora Birch, David Clennon, Chris Cooper, Alma Delfina, Richard Dreyfuss, Miguel Ferrer, James Gammon', null, 'The discovery of a corpse and the ensuing probe by an idealistic journalist threatens to unravel a bumbling local politician''s campaign for governor of Colorado.', 'The discovery of a corpse and the ensuing probe by an idealistic journalist threatens to unravel a bumbling local politician''s campaign for governor of Colorado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WNpjGCUTCC21fIcUpZ9lX0PJyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18711'),
  ('315935815313571949', 'Silver Dream Racer', 1980, 'Drama, Action', 'David Wickes', 'David Wickes', 'David Essex, Beau Bridges, Cristina Raines, Clarke Peters, Harry H. Corbett, Diane Keen, Lee Montague, Sheila White', null, 'Nick Freeman is a motorcycle racer who, following the death of his brother, inherits a revolutionary prototype motorcycle, and is determined to race it at the British Grand Prix at Silverstone.', 'Nick Freeman is a motorcycle racer who, following the death of his brother, inherits a revolutionary prototype motorcycle, and is determined to race it at the British Grand Prix at Silverstone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54qkFYgoMVeDBjUAgccm2g4TXyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31972'),
  ('587200607507242072', 'Silver Hawk', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Chan Chi-Ying', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Michelle Yeoh, Richie Jen, Luke Goss, Brandon Chang, Li Bingbing, Michael Jai White, Max Ruddock, Brandon Rhea', 'PG-13', 'Lulu Wong, a rock star and philanthropist, fights injustice as her superhero alter-ego Silver Hawk. When the criminal baddie Wolfe sets a plan in motion to dominate the world through cell phone signals, Silver Hawk joins forces with police detective Richman to save the world.', 'Lulu Wong, a rock star and philanthropist, fights injustice as her superhero alter-ego Silver Hawk. When the criminal baddie Wolfe sets a plan in motion to dominate the world through cell phone signals, Silver Hawk joins forces with police detective Richman to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxV3zVOcEPPqH09CnQQQS68z8f4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41392'),
  ('732809481716054127', 'Silver Haze', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sacha Polak, Tibor Dingelstad', 'Sacha Polak', 'Vicky Knight, Esmé Creed-Miles, Charlotte Knight, Archie Brigden, Angela Bruce, Brandon Bendell, Alfie Deegan, TerriAnn Cousins', null, '23-year-old Franky is a nurse who lives with her large family in an East London borough. Obsessed with a thirst for revenge and a need to assign guilt for a traumatic event that happened 15 years before, she is unable to build any meaningful relationship until she falls in love with one of her patients – Florence. They escape to the coast where Florence lives with her more open-minded patchwork family. There, Franky finds the emotional shelter to deal with the grudges of the past.', '23-year-old Franky is a nurse who lives with her large family in an East London borough. Obsessed with a thirst for revenge and a need to assign guilt for a traumatic event that happened 15 years before, she is unable to build any meaningful relationship until she falls in love with one of her patients – Florence. They escape to the coast where Florence lives with her more open-minded patchwork family. There, Franky finds the emotional shelter to deal with the grudges of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mSdBEUjmkCytuEmCuTCvkZIF0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936385'),
  ('695950235577156969', 'Silver Linings Playbook', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'David O. Russell, Masanobu Takayanagi, Michele Ziegler', 'David O. Russell', 'Bradley Cooper, Jennifer Lawrence, Robert De Niro, Jacki Weaver, Anupam Kher, Chris Tucker, Julia Stiles, Shea Whigham', 'R', 'After losing his job and wife, and spending time in an institution, a former teacher winds up living with his parents. He wants to rebuild his life and reconcile with his wife, but his father would be happy if he shared his obsession with the Philadelphia Eagles. Things get complicated when he meets Tiffany Maxwell who offers to help him reconnect with his wife if he will do something very important for her in exchange.', 'After losing his job and wife, and spending time in an institution, a former teacher winds up living with his parents. He wants to rebuild his life and reconcile with his wife, but his father would be happy if he shared his obsession with the Philadelphia Eagles. Things get complicated when he meets Tiffany Maxwell who offers to help him reconnect with his wife if he will do something very important for her in exchange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhHB1uvfFKKFbj6bTKE8xdtsjKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82693'),
  ('1027056966098204648', 'Silver Lode', 1954, 'Western', 'Allan Dwan, John Alton, Lee Lukather', 'Karen DeWolf', 'John Payne, Lizabeth Scott, Dan Duryea, Dolores Moran, Emile Meyer, Robert Warwick, John Hudson, Harry Carey, Jr.', null, 'Dan Ballard, a respected citizen in the western town of Silver Lode, has his wedding interrupted by four men led by Ned McCarty, an old acquaintance who, as a US Marshal, arrests Ballard for the murder of his brother and the theft of $20,000. Ballard seeks to stall McCarty while tracking down evidence that will prove his innocence.', 'Dan Ballard, a respected citizen in the western town of Silver Lode, has his wedding interrupted by four men led by Ned McCarty, an old acquaintance who, as a US Marshal, arrests Ballard for the murder of his brother and the theft of $20,000. Ballard seeks to stall McCarty while tracking down evidence that will prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVIDVhgbtQ6mAsihqzD8opW9uga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27443'),
  ('267454178865939508', 'Silver River', 1948, 'Western, Romance, Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Stephen Longstreet, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Errol Flynn, Ann Sheridan, Thomas Mitchell, Bruce Bennett, Tom D''Andrea, Barton MacLane, Monte Blue, Jonathan Hale', 'NR', 'Unjustly booted out of the cavalry, Mike McComb strikes out for Nevada, and deciding never to be used again, ruthlessly works his way up to becoming one of the most powerful silver magnates in the west. His empire begins to fall apart as the other mining combines rise against him and his stubbornness loses him the support of his wife and old friends.', 'Unjustly booted out of the cavalry, Mike McComb strikes out for Nevada, and deciding never to be used again, ruthlessly works his way up to becoming one of the most powerful silver magnates in the west. His empire begins to fall apart as the other mining combines rise against him and his stubbornness loses him the support of his wife and old friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWjndd9IUwLTA0a26Mps1VRDI9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65581'),
  ('881114464251273077', 'Silver Saddle', 1978, 'Action, Western', 'Lucio Fulci, Sergio Salvati', 'Adriano Bolzoni', 'Giuliano Gemma, Sven Valsecchi, Gianni De Luigi, Licinia Lentini, Philippe Hersent, Karine Stampfer, Agnes Kalpagos, Maria Tinelli', null, 'Young boy who sees his father gunned down kills the assassin. Years later, he has grown up to be a successful bounty hunter who is feared by many. And then one day he discovers secrets to his past...', 'Young boy who sees his father gunned down kills the assassin. Years later, he has grown up to be a successful bounty hunter who is feared by many. And then one day he discovers secrets to his past...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4nteGcnHnhw0hAVHhj7LzsoCPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42326'),
  ('392682274595608985', 'Silver Skates', 2020, 'Romance, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Michael Lockshin, Igor Grinyakin', 'Roman Kantor', 'Fedor Fedotov, Sonia Priss, Aleksey Guskov, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Severija Janušauskaitė, Kirill Zaytsev, Yura Borisov, Aleksandra Revenko', 'NR', '1899, the Christmas-time St.Petersburg. Ice-covered rivers and canals of the capital seethe with festive activities. On the eve of the new century those who should not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.', '1899, the Christmas-time St.Petersburg. Ice-covered rivers and canals of the capital seethe with festive activities. On the eve of the new century those who should not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576920'),
  ('452985622403093426', 'Silver Spoon', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Kensuke Tsukuda', 'Ryo Takada, Keisuke Yoshida', 'Kento Nakajima, Alice Hirose, Tomohiro Ichikawa, Kazue Fukiishi, Riki Takeuchi, Show Aikawa, Renji Ishibashi, Haru Kuroki', null, 'Ooejo Agricultural High School is located in Hokkaido. Most students are from families involved in agriculture and their dreams are to continue working in agriculture. Meanwhile, Yuugo (Kento Nakajima), who graduated from a prestigious middle school, applied to the Ooejo Agricultural High School just because the school has a dormitory. Yuugo, who grew up in the city, finds himself in an unfamiliar environment at Ooejo Agricultural High School, surrounded by nature and animals. Yuugo is also the only one who doesn''t know what type of career he wants to pursue. Yuugo becomes impatient. He goes through struggles everyday, but he also gets to know the other students and rural life in general. He begins to grow as a person.', 'Ooejo Agricultural High School is located in Hokkaido. Most students are from families involved in agriculture and their dreams are to continue working in agriculture. Meanwhile, Yuugo (Kento Nakajima), who graduated from a prestigious middle school, applied to the Ooejo Agricultural High School just because the school has a dormitory. Yuugo, who grew up in the city, finds himself in an unfamiliar environment at Ooejo Agricultural High School, surrounded by nature and animals. Yuugo is also the only one who doesn''t know what type of career he wants to pursue. Yuugo becomes impatient. He goes through struggles everyday, but he also gets to know the other students and rural life in general. He begins to grow as a person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etNc3MyOccnjvkcSNgNTOfc3Kkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297825'),
  ('1114961778999590151', 'Silver Spoon', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Andrey Venkov, Tatevik Zalinyan, Igor Inshakov', 'Sergey Kaluzhanov, Oleg Malovichko', 'Pavel Priluchnyy, Pavel Chinaryov, Darina Ervin, Evgeniy Stychkin, Igor Jijikine, Daniil Vorobyov, Dmitriy Shevchenko, Aleksandr Oblasov', null, 'The silver spoon masterfully escapes from prison and starts a new life. New sweet life! Sokolovsky joins the secular crowd, where everyone is sitting on a new synthetic drug, and he is again surrounded by cars, villas and top models. Friends, enemies and the FSB are following the trail of the silver spoon, trying to understand what game he has started and on whose side he is. Igor is trying to understand who he is - a traitor, a saint or is it the same ... silver spoon?', 'The silver spoon masterfully escapes from prison and starts a new life. New sweet life! Sokolovsky joins the secular crowd, where everyone is sitting on a new synthetic drug, and he is again surrounded by cars, villas and top models. Friends, enemies and the FSB are following the trail of the silver spoon, trying to understand what game he has started and on whose side he is. Igor is trying to understand who he is - a traitor, a saint or is it the same ... silver spoon?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VYlPe4ZfcHkesZ3ZJR24xy1pR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761332'),
  ('1012396281323467067', 'Silver Streak', 1976, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance, Thriller, Action', 'Arthur Hiller, David M. Walsh', 'Colin Higgins', 'Gene Wilder, Jill Clayburgh, Richard Pryor, Patrick McGoohan, Ned Beatty, Clifton James, Ray Walston, Stefan Gierasch', 'PG', 'A somewhat daffy book editor on a rail trip from Los Angeles to Chicago thinks that he sees a murdered man thrown from the train. When he can find no one who will believe him, he starts doing some investigating of his own. But all that accomplishes is to get the killer after him.', 'A somewhat daffy book editor on a rail trip from Los Angeles to Chicago thinks that he sees a murdered man thrown from the train. When he can find no one who will believe him, he starts doing some investigating of his own. But all that accomplishes is to get the killer after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gY1a4k9dalGx83D7TJ2C76xBprS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11558'),
  ('249023680188374359', 'Silver Wolf', 1999, 'Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Peter Svatek, Ivana Siska, Jordan Roberts', 'Michael Amo', 'Michael Biehn, Roy Scheider, Shane Meier, Kimberley Warnat, Lynda Boyd, Shaun Johnston, Jade Pawluk, Don MacKay', 'G', 'A boy learns to deal with personal loss by making friends with a wild animal in this drama for the entire family. Jesse is a 16-year-old who is trying to put his life back together after the death of his father, who died while trying to rescue him in the wilderness. Jesse goes to live with his Uncle Roy, who lives in the rugged mountains of Washington State. While exploring, Jesse finds and rescues a wolf who has been seriously wounded; Jesse bonds with the animal, and while Roy understands the dangers of trying to tend to a wild animal, reluctantly allows Jesse to keep him. Jesse, who is fond of snowboarding, teaches the wolf to be his partner in skijoring, a sport in which a dog is used to haul a man on skis. John Rockwell the owner of a ranch, has different plans for the animal; he sees the wolf as a threat to his stock and is determined to see that the animal is put down.', 'A boy learns to deal with personal loss by making friends with a wild animal in this drama for the entire family. Jesse is a 16-year-old who is trying to put his life back together after the death of his father, who died while trying to rescue him in the wilderness. Jesse goes to live with his Uncle Roy, who lives in the rugged mountains of Washington State. While exploring, Jesse finds and rescues a wolf who has been seriously wounded; Jesse bonds with the animal, and while Roy understands the dangers of trying to tend to a wild animal, reluctantly allows Jesse to keep him. Jesse, who is fond of snowboarding, teaches the wolf to be his partner in skijoring, a sport in which a dog is used to haul a man on skis. John Rockwell the owner of a ranch, has different plans for the animal; he sees the wolf as a threat to his stock and is determined to see that the animal is put down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSDT6UzAHLbmJe5VErvyfaERFJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85951'),
  ('878518339792844623', 'Silverado', 1985, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Lawrence Kasdan, John Bailey, Stephen P. Dunn', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Mark Kasdan', 'Kevin Kline, Scott Glenn, Danny Glover, Kevin Costner, Brian Dennehy, Rosanna Arquette, John Cleese, Linda Hunt', 'PG-13', 'Four unwitting heroes cross paths on their journey to the sleepy town of Silverado. Little do they know the town where their family and friends reside has been taken over by a corrupt sheriff and a murderous posse. It''s up to the sharp-shooting foursome to save the day, but first they have to break each other out of jail, and learn who their real friends are.', 'Four unwitting heroes cross paths on their journey to the sleepy town of Silverado. Little do they know the town where their family and friends reside has been taken over by a corrupt sheriff and a murderous posse. It''s up to the sharp-shooting foursome to save the day, but first they have to break each other out of jail, and learn who their real friends are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6zurzegRKsNGMICXZ57VJDUzXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11509'),
  ('149770892404435457', 'Silvered Water', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Ossama Mohammed, Wiam Bedirxan', 'Ossama Mohammed, Wiam Bedirxan', null, null, 'Shot by a reported “1,001 Syrians” according to the filmmakers, SILVERED WATER, SYRIA SELF-PORTRAIT impressionistically documents the destruction and atrocities of the civil war through a combination of eye-witness accounts shot on mobile phones and posted to the internet, and footage shot by Bedirxan during the siege of Homs. Bedirxan, an elementary school teacher in Homs, had contacted Mohammed online to ask him what he would film, if he was there. Mohammed, working in forced exile in Paris, is tormented by feelings of cowardice as he witnesses the horrors from afar, and the self-reflexive film also chronicles how he is haunted in his dreams by a Syrian boy once shot to death for snatching his camera on the street.', 'Shot by a reported “1,001 Syrians” according to the filmmakers, SILVERED WATER, SYRIA SELF-PORTRAIT impressionistically documents the destruction and atrocities of the civil war through a combination of eye-witness accounts shot on mobile phones and posted to the internet, and footage shot by Bedirxan during the siege of Homs. Bedirxan, an elementary school teacher in Homs, had contacted Mohammed online to ask him what he would film, if he was there. Mohammed, working in forced exile in Paris, is tormented by feelings of cowardice as he witnesses the horrors from afar, and the self-reflexive film also chronicles how he is haunted in his dreams by a Syrian boy once shot to death for snatching his camera on the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmx5XsOQvozFDOcnww5R6FVoHM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272075'),
  ('658852699592306862', 'Silverlake Life: The View from Here', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Tom Joslin, Peter Friedman', null, 'Tom Joslin, Mark Massi, Peter Friedman, Mary Joslin, Charles Joslin, Bo Huston, Elaine Mayes, Liane Bonin', null, 'An extraordinary video diary about living with AIDS documenting, with guts and humor, the love and dedication of longtime companions Tom Joslin and Mark Massi, from the emotional challenge of living with a fatal illness to the frustration of maintaining daily routines,.', 'An extraordinary video diary about living with AIDS documenting, with guts and humor, the love and dedication of longtime companions Tom Joslin and Mark Massi, from the emotional challenge of living with a fatal illness to the frustration of maintaining daily routines,.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efwOc959ht9BSCBqZpBCehwQyKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133436'),
  ('162397485693552139', 'Silverton Siege', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Mandlakayise Walter Dube, Jr., Shaun Harley Lee, Bonnie Lee Bouman', 'Sabelo Mgidi', 'Thabo Rametsi, Noxolo Dlamini, Stefan Erasmus, Arnold Vosloo, Tumisho Masha, Sarah Kozlowski, Clayton Boyd, Jacques Gombault', 'PG-13', 'After a failed sabotage mission, a trio of anti-apartheid freedom fighters ends up in a tense bank hostage situation. Based on a true story.', 'After a failed sabotage mission, a trio of anti-apartheid freedom fighters ends up in a tense bank hostage situation. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HruMN0vvl84AqD7sCDXFNO4RhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951470'),
  ('396649036184118031', 'Silvestre', 1982, 'History, Drama', 'João César Monteiro, Acácio de Almeida', 'João César Monteiro', 'Maria de Medeiros, Teresa Madruga, Luis Miguel Cintra, Jorge Silva Melo, João Guedes, Xosé Maria Straviz, Ruy Furtado, Raquel Maria', null, 'A bewitching combinatory adaptation of the Bluebeard tale and a 15th century Portuguese fable of a damsel who disguises herself as a knight errant.', 'A bewitching combinatory adaptation of the Bluebeard tale and a 15th century Portuguese fable of a damsel who disguises herself as a knight errant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5bEJGhbOUeZoP2NrJ0oCxihBIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83233'),
  ('76922140352663434', 'Silvia Prieto', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martín Rejtman, Alejandro Hartmann, Daniel Barone', 'Martín Rejtman', 'Rosario Bléfari, Valeria Bertuccelli, Vicentico, Marcelo Zanelli, Susana Pampín, Mucio Manchini, Mirta Busnelli, Mario Rubinacci', null, 'After her 27th birthday, Silvia Prieto decides to take charge of her life and make some changes. At the same time, she suddenly finds herself intertwined in the life of another woman who is also named Silvia Prieto.', 'After her 27th birthday, Silvia Prieto decides to take charge of her life and make some changes. At the same time, she suddenly finds herself intertwined in the life of another woman who is also named Silvia Prieto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmnAjgJ6z495FTcPg9iOzAH1wKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49984'),
  ('357784250127245889', 'Silvio', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Marcelo Antunez, Uli Burtin', 'Anderson Almeida, Newton Cannito, Ana Luiza Savassi', 'Rodrigo Faro, João Bourbonnais, Ana Paula Lopez, Polliana Aleixo, Duda Mamberti, Marjorie Gerardi, Johnnas Oliva, Paulo Gorgulho', null, 'Just 12 hours after having his daughter in the custody of a kidnapper, the influential communicator Sílvio Santos faces an even more complicated obstacle: his home is invaded and he is held hostage for seven hours. Realizing that his life is at risk, he seeks refuge in the distant thoughts of his entire trajectory, which began when he was just a 14 year old teenager working as a street vendor.', 'Just 12 hours after having his daughter in the custody of a kidnapper, the influential communicator Sílvio Santos faces an even more complicated obstacle: his home is invaded and he is held hostage for seven hours. Realizing that his life is at risk, he seeks refuge in the distant thoughts of his entire trajectory, which began when he was just a 14 year old teenager working as a street vendor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ft36ggqoFPYPO3qFBaEJlOT5Epn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760147'),
  ('432469192062075459', 'Silvio Forever', 2011, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Roberto Faenza, Filippo Macelloni', null, 'Silvio Berlusconi, Neri Marcorè', null, 'Lawsuit-proof satirical "unauthorized biography" of Silvio Berlusconi told using only words spoken by the man himself in interviews, rallies, or other public statements.', 'Lawsuit-proof satirical "unauthorized biography" of Silvio Berlusconi told using only words spoken by the man himself in interviews, rallies, or other public statements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpfhmQ6z6JruXN4P5GMzEalDN1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59264'),
  ('904197131177289956', 'Simão - The Goofy Ghost', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Paulo Aragão, César Moraes', 'Renato Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Roberto Guilherme, Fernanda Rodrigues, Marcelo Augusto, Dirce Migliaccio, Eloísa Mafalda, Oswaldo Loureiro', null, 'Two jumbled and coward drivers join a rich family that moves to an ancient castle inhabited by a resented, but friendly ghost.', 'Two jumbled and coward drivers join a rich family that moves to an ancient castle inhabited by a resented, but friendly ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjPqGw1TjIrfNgtTGy0g56CkpHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128449'),
  ('817715649124090166', 'Simba', 1955, 'Romance, Drama', 'Brian Desmond Hurst, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'John Baines', 'Dirk Bogarde, Donald Sinden, Virginia McKenna, Basil Sydney, Marie Ney, Joseph Tomelty, Earl Cameron, Orlando Martins', null, 'A European family in East Africa finds itself caught up in an uprising by local black Africans against their white colonial masters. Based on the Mau-Mau rebellion in Kenya in the early 1950s.', 'A European family in East Africa finds itself caught up in an uprising by local black Africans against their white colonial masters. Based on the Mau-Mau rebellion in Kenya in the early 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRTVDdXXZZbwX4dvlNvATMgIRTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76119'),
  ('480535563430965172', 'Simbad el Mareado', 1950, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', null, 'Germán Valdés, Marcelo Chávez, Ramón Valdés', null, 'The Mexican comedy Simbad el Mareado stars the popular comic Tin-Tan. The story concerns the adventurer Sinbad who becomes sidetracked from his quest for riches and love when he suffers from a psychotic belief that his best friend is a commoner who may be in line to receive a financial windfall.', 'The Mexican comedy Simbad el Mareado stars the popular comic Tin-Tan. The story concerns the adventurer Sinbad who becomes sidetracked from his quest for riches and love when he suffers from a psychotic belief that his best friend is a commoner who may be in line to receive a financial windfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUxPDtZTNIm4VYYNqnLM7oeG5Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220483'),
