  ('1115598582184702902', 'Simitrio', 1960, 'Drama', 'Jack Draper, Mario Llorca, Emilio Gómez Muriel', 'Jesús Cárdenas, Emilio Gómez Muriel', 'José Elías Moreno, Javier Tejeda, Carlos López Moctezuma, María Teresa Rivas, Emma Roldán, Julio Alemán, Irma Dorantes, Roberto Álvarez', null, 'A blind teacher is the victim of endless pranks and pranks from his students.', 'A blind teacher is the victim of endless pranks and pranks from his students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3lYczmKagTcFlOksyJxcmf0tXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342177'),
  ('1050621927731631332', 'Simmba', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Rohit Shetty, Sanchit Bedre, Shetty Riyan', 'Rohit Shetty, Sajid Samji, Yunus Sajawal', 'Ranveer Singh, Sara Ali Khan, Sonu Sood, Ashutosh Rana, Ashwini Kalsekar, Vijay Patkar, Neha Mahajan, Arun Nalawade', null, 'A corrupt police officer enjoys all the perks of being an immoral and unethical police officer until an event which transforms his life completely and forces him to choose the righteous path.', 'A corrupt police officer enjoys all the perks of being an immoral and unethical police officer until an event which transforms his life completely and forces him to choose the righteous path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulQO4XJ1xlWdl4vX8Lr3SbWRfZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496524'),
  ('1029306739227391041', 'Simon', 1980, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Marshall Brickman, Robert Barth, Michael Rauch', 'Marshall Brickman', 'Alan Arkin, Madeline Kahn, William Finley, Wallace Shawn, Max Wright, Fred Gwynne, Austin Pendleton, Judy Graubart', 'PG', 'A group of scientists take Simon, a psychology professor, as a test person for a brainwashing experiment and try to convince him that he is a living being from another planet.', 'A group of scientists take Simon, a psychology professor, as a test person for a brainwashing experiment and try to convince him that he is a living being from another planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thdQGmhthIxYgJmyucXBozMgIP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55792'),
  ('944845218919445617', 'Simon', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Eddy Terstall, Willem Nagtglas', 'Eddy Terstall', 'Cees Geel, Marcel Hensema, Rifka Lodeizen, Eddy Kariti, Nadja Hüpscher, Eva Duijvestein, Daan Ekkel, Dirk Zeelenberg', null, 'A mild-mannered gay dentist and a womanizing bar owner rekindle their unlikely friendship when, upon meeting by chance after a decade apart, the latter turns out to be severely ill.', 'A mild-mannered gay dentist and a womanizing bar owner rekindle their unlikely friendship when, upon meeting by chance after a decade apart, the latter turns out to be severely ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwU2qVIqHkvzsjUxMf3GEWAsobl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19398'),
  ('498002271026216914', 'Simón', 2023, 'Drama', 'Arturo Manuitt, Diego Vincentini, Horacio Martinez', 'Diego Vincentini', 'Christian McGaffney, Jana Nawartschi, Luis Silva, Roberto Jaramillo, Franklin Vírgüez, Prakriti Maduro, Pedro Pablo Borras, Sallie Glaner', 'PG-13', 'Simón, a Venezuelan freedom fighter exiled in Miami, copes not only with trauma, but also deep guilt over a choice he must make: stay in Miami and start a new life, or return home to the losing fight against a tyrannical regime.', 'Simón, a Venezuelan freedom fighter exiled in Miami, copes not only with trauma, but also deep guilt over a choice he must make: stay in Miami and start a new life, or return home to the losing fight against a tyrannical regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ltmI5Mef0NHWm4Nxcpm6hT8VhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105832'),
  ('385723235873834492', 'Simon & the Oaks', 2011, 'Drama, History, War', 'Lisa Ohlin, Dan Laustsen', 'Marnie Blok', 'Bill Skarsgård, Helen Sjöholm, Jan Josef Liefers, Katharina Schüttler, Stefan Gödicke, Jonatan S. Wächter, Karl Martin Eriksson, Karl Linnertorp', null, 'Epic story about two families and their friendship and common destiny in Sweden''s Gothenburg in the 1940s and 1950s. Told from the perspective of young Simon Larsson, who learns that he''s an adopted child who has a Jewish father from Germany. After WWII Simon travels to explore his roots - a journey that leads to the basic mysteries of the human life. After the bestselling novel by Marianne Fredriksson.', 'Epic story about two families and their friendship and common destiny in Sweden''s Gothenburg in the 1940s and 1950s. Told from the perspective of young Simon Larsson, who learns that he''s an adopted child who has a Jewish father from Germany. After WWII Simon travels to explore his roots - a journey that leads to the basic mysteries of the human life. After the bestselling novel by Marianne Fredriksson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBkvsfDMXntHITI2VzhRYxXPGJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82448'),
  ('183577042657220767', 'Simon and Laura', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Muriel Box, Ernest Steward, Stanley Hosgood', 'Peter Blackmore', 'Peter Finch, Kay Kendall, Muriel Pavlow, Hubert Gregg, Maurice Denham, Ian Carmichael, Richard Wattis, Thora Hird', null, 'A couple of bickering, married performers agree to star in a "Mr. and Mrs." TV show.', 'A couple of bickering, married performers agree to star in a "Mr. and Mrs." TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu8VnF56ua1U0vLgwkz2Dbpu8mV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153327'),
  ('404948453583495252', 'Simon Birch', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Mark Steven Johnson, Aaron Schneider', 'Mark Steven Johnson', 'Ashley Judd, Ian Michael Smith, Joseph Mazzello, Oliver Platt, David Strathairn, Dana Ivey, Beatrice Winde, Jan Hooks', 'PG', 'Simon Birch and Joe Wenteworth are boys who have a reputation for being oddballs. Joe never knew his father, and his mother, Rebecca, is keeping her lips sealed no matter how much he protests. Simon, meanwhile, is an 11-year-old dwarf whose outsize personality belies his small stature. Indeed, he often assails the local reverend with thorny theological questions and joins Joe on his quest to find his biological father.', 'Simon Birch and Joe Wenteworth are boys who have a reputation for being oddballs. Joe never knew his father, and his mother, Rebecca, is keeping her lips sealed no matter how much he protests. Simon, meanwhile, is an 11-year-old dwarf whose outsize personality belies his small stature. Indeed, he often assails the local reverend with thorny theological questions and joins Joe on his quest to find his biological father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRJcV9l3tLFoUWZel9RikS3nfJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22796'),
  ('69404904887904905', 'Simon Killer', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Campos, Joe Anderson, Tomas Deckaj', 'Antonio Campos', 'Brady Corbet, Mati Diop, Constance Rousseau, Lila Salet, Solo, Michaël Abiteboul, Nicolas Ronchi, Etienne Rotha Moeng', 'NR', 'A recent college graduate flees to Paris after a break-up, where his involvement with a prostitute begins to reveal a potentially dark recent past.', 'A recent college graduate flees to Paris after a break-up, where his involvement with a prostitute begins to reveal a potentially dark recent past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32SUAJ7JP9Jvb251J8tf9U2Si6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84338'),
  ('709862749192706056', 'Simon Konianski', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Micha Wald, Jean-Paul De Zaeytijd', 'Micha Wald', 'Jonathan Zaccaï, Popeck, Nassim Ben Abdelmoumen, Abraham Leber, Nassim Ben Abdeloumen, Irène Herz, Marta Domingo, Ivan Fox', null, 'Simon, 35, has returned to live temporarily with his father. They make life unbearable for each other. To add spice to this situation, Uncle Maurice and Aunt Mala, Ernest''s brother and sister, meddle in everything and, notably, try to find a "nice little Jewish girl" for Simon to marry. When Ernest passes away, Simon fulfils his father''s last request: bury him in the village where he was born, in the depths of Ukraine. And so Simon finds himself caught up in an event-packed road movie in the company of his paranoid old uncle, his aunt who nags him endlessly about his "Goy dancer", his six-years-old son, his father''s body and his ghost, and also a rabbit. Not to mention his ex who hassles him by phone. The journey will be nothing like a cruise down the Nile!', 'Simon, 35, has returned to live temporarily with his father. They make life unbearable for each other. To add spice to this situation, Uncle Maurice and Aunt Mala, Ernest''s brother and sister, meddle in everything and, notably, try to find a "nice little Jewish girl" for Simon to marry. When Ernest passes away, Simon fulfils his father''s last request: bury him in the village where he was born, in the depths of Ukraine. And so Simon finds himself caught up in an event-packed road movie in the company of his paranoid old uncle, his aunt who nags him endlessly about his "Goy dancer", his six-years-old son, his father''s body and his ghost, and also a rabbit. Not to mention his ex who hassles him by phone. The journey will be nothing like a cruise down the Nile!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGMzbBylGZHUCOakMxohbG3kQM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44531'),
  ('132650920635327228', 'Simon Magus', 1999, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Ben Hopkins, Nicholas D. Knowland, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Ben Hopkins', 'Noah Taylor, Stuart Townsend, Sean McGinley, Embeth Davidtz, Amanda Ryan, Rutger Hauer, Ian Holm, Terence Rigby', null, 'Simon is an outcast from his Jewish community because he claims that the devil talks to him and he has the ability to put curses on crops. When Dovid asks the ''Squire'' to sell him some land so he can build a railway station, a ruthless businessman from the neighbouring gentile community uses Simon to find out who wants to buy the land so he can ''persuade'' him otherwise', 'Simon is an outcast from his Jewish community because he claims that the devil talks to him and he has the ability to put curses on crops. When Dovid asks the ''Squire'' to sell him some land so he can build a railway station, a ruthless businessman from the neighbouring gentile community uses Simon to find out who wants to buy the land so he can ''persuade'' him otherwise', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXnFY4W719JokP3raXkILfM3jKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54968'),
  ('196307672685158660', 'Simon of the Desert', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Luis Buñuel, Ignacio Villareal, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Julio Alejandro, Luis Buñuel', 'Claudio Brook, Silvia Pinal, Hortensia Santoveña, Enrique Álvarez Félix, Francisco Reiguera, Luis Aceves Castañeda, Antonio Bravo, Enrique del Castillo', null, 'Simon, a deeply religious man living in the 4th century, wants to be nearer to God so he climbs a column. The Devil wants him come down to Earth and is trying to seduce him.', 'Simon, a deeply religious man living in the 4th century, wants to be nearer to God so he climbs a column. The Devil wants him come down to Earth and is trying to seduce him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysTa1FtL9DvQ90F6VGVoiOdp5NM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36265'),
  ('924619204041266191', 'Simon of the Mountain', 2024, 'Drama', 'Federico Luis, Marcos Hastrup, Bruno Mantoani', 'Federico Luis, Tomás Murphy, Agustín Toscano', 'Lorenzo Ferro, Pehuén Pedre, Kiara Supini, Laura Nevole, Agustín Toscano, Camila Hirane, Alma Echenique, Víctor López', null, 'Simon is 21 years old. He introduces himself as a mover''s helper. He claims not to know how to cook or clean the bathroom, but he does know how to make a bed. Recently, he seems to have become a different person…', 'Simon is 21 years old. He introduces himself as a mover''s helper. He claims not to know how to cook or clean the bathroom, but he does know how to make a bed. Recently, he seems to have become a different person…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BA0Vr9UBVI3k6QRgdRSQkgyCeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1274686'),
  ('84284324232248261', 'Simon Says', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Dear, Bryan Greenberg, Colin Michael Kitchens', 'William Dear', 'Crispin Glover, Margo Harshman, Greg Cipes, Kelly Vitz, Carrie Finklea, Artie Baxter, Lori Lively, Bruce Glover', null, 'Five college friends choose to spend their vacation debauching at the riverside. They find the perfect place to camp out, but end up crossing paths with twin brothers, Simon and Stanley. The twins then begins to knock off the campers in some extremely creative (and extremely gruesome) ways.', 'Five college friends choose to spend their vacation debauching at the riverside. They find the perfect place to camp out, but end up crossing paths with twin brothers, Simon and Stanley. The twins then begins to knock off the campers in some extremely creative (and extremely gruesome) ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr3gOhNVXmb5mFWxw3d257NOvcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21141'),
  ('259453182168276264', 'Simon Sez', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Kevin Alyn Elders, Avraham Karpick, Luc Etienne', 'Andrew Miller, Andrew Lowery', 'Dennis Rodman, Dane Cook, John Pinette, Ricky Harris, Filip Nikolic, Natalia Cigliuti, Emma Wiklund, Jérôme Pradon', 'PG-13', 'A tattooed Interpol agent helps an old classmate find the kidnapped daughter of a computer software tycoon.', 'A tattooed Interpol agent helps an old classmate find the kidnapped daughter of a computer software tycoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJG7oSRQxacXC2GvzPF2nDoWXIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32305'),
  ('266791942204642351', 'Simon, King of the Witches', 1971, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy', 'Bruce Kessler, David L. Butler, Art Levinson', 'Robert Phippeny', 'Andrew Prine, Brenda Scott, George Paulsin, Gerald York, Norman Burton, Ultra Violet, Richmond Shepard, Sharon Berryhill', 'R', 'Simon is a modern day warlock. Though he lives in a storm drain and sometimes talks to trees, he''s deadly serious about his witchcraft. After being picked up for vagrancy, Simon spends a night in jail with Turk, a young hustler with connections to powerful people such as Hercules, an aging hipster who hires Simon to work one of his groovy parties. There he meets Linda, the DA''s pill-popping daughter. In between romanic dalliances and colorful sex magic ceremonies, Simon must contend with those who dare to challenge his magical prowess causing him to summon the dark world for his revenge.', 'Simon is a modern day warlock. Though he lives in a storm drain and sometimes talks to trees, he''s deadly serious about his witchcraft. After being picked up for vagrancy, Simon spends a night in jail with Turk, a young hustler with connections to powerful people such as Hercules, an aging hipster who hires Simon to work one of his groovy parties. There he meets Linda, the DA''s pill-popping daughter. In between romanic dalliances and colorful sex magic ceremonies, Simon must contend with those who dare to challenge his magical prowess causing him to summon the dark world for his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFMOWWJb3EpnEG5QzzDqSmpgPKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74072'),
  ('1120378972882794846', 'Simon''s Got a Gift', 2020, 'Fantasy, Romance, Family', 'Léo Karmann, Julien Poupard', 'Léo Karmann, Sabrina B. Karine', 'Benjamin Voisin, Martin Karmann, Camille Claris, Nicolas Wanczycki, Julie-Anne Roth, Albert Geffrier, Simon Susset, Vicki Andren', null, 'Simon, a young orphan, has an extraordinary power : he can take on the appearance of people he’s already touched. When his best friend dies in an accident, there is no witness. Simon decides to steal his place in his family. Ten years later, the truth will get more and more difficult to bear and to hide...', 'Simon, a young orphan, has an extraordinary power : he can take on the appearance of people he’s already touched. When his best friend dies in an accident, there is no witness. Simon decides to steal his place in his family. Ten years later, the truth will get more and more difficult to bear and to hide...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhUTHDBdjr7YYQ8D7yhpWlL51Ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616461'),
  ('348671095889445986', 'Simonal', 2019, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Domingues, Pablo Baião, Leticia Prisco', 'Victor Atherino, Leonardo Domingues', 'Fabrício Boliveira, Isis Valverde, Sílvio Guindane, Bruce Gomlevsky, Cláudio Mendes, João Velho, Rafael Sieg, Dani Ornellas', null, 'A phenomenon of popularity in the 1960s, Wilson Simonal saw his meteoric career fall apart when he was accused of collaborating with the Brazilian military dictatorship.', 'A phenomenon of popularity in the 1960s, Wilson Simonal saw his meteoric career fall apart when he was accused of collaborating with the Brazilian military dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRRCQnbL4ovGuPf4EZIakyCWqzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510314'),
  ('445292794678878474', 'Simonal: No One Knows How Tough It Was', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Calvito Leal, Micael Langer, Cláudio Manoel', 'Cláudio Manoel', 'Wilson Simonal, Max de Castro, Wilson Simoninha, Bárbara Heliodora, Luis Carlos Miele, Nelson Motta, Paulo Moura, Ricardo Cravo Albin', null, 'In a time of timeless and revolutionary talents, Wilson Simonal shined as nobody before and innovated as only a few could. All of a sudden, everything vanished. This film maps the spectacular trajectory of the ex-Army corporal that ruled as a monarch, and was condemned to ostracism for an offense to which he pleaded not guilty.', 'In a time of timeless and revolutionary talents, Wilson Simonal shined as nobody before and innovated as only a few could. All of a sudden, everything vanished. This film maps the spectacular trajectory of the ex-Army corporal that ruled as a monarch, and was condemned to ostracism for an offense to which he pleaded not guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2r6kvAwauymYbLkyLcnFGTG0S5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126097'),
  ('188544544650550770', 'Simone Barbès or Virtue', 1980, 'Drama', 'Marie-Claude Treilhou, Didier Lenain, Gérard Frot-Coutaz', 'Michel Delahaye, Marie-Claude Treilhou', 'Ingrid Bourgoin, Martine Simonet, Michel Delahaye, Sonia Saviange, Max Amyl, Noël Simsolo, Elli Medeiros, Pascal Bonitzer', null, 'Simone, a leather-clad porn theater worker, spends her shifts bantering with her coworker and observing eccentric customers in the cinema’s lobby. Tonight, she clocks out and heads off to meet her girlfriend, a waitress at a lesbian club. Later, she’ll encounter a lonely man on the prowl.', 'Simone, a leather-clad porn theater worker, spends her shifts bantering with her coworker and observing eccentric customers in the cinema’s lobby. Tonight, she clocks out and heads off to meet her girlfriend, a waitress at a lesbian club. Later, she’ll encounter a lonely man on the prowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwSQsOf65nk0OHt4cRy1MPWq1w3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246649'),
  ('216687544476039217', 'SiMP', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Don Tjernagel', 'Don Tjernagel', 'Dee Dee Benton, Clint Boevers, Krystal Eastman Bright, Jillian Brown, Sam Cota', null, 'SiMP (2026) released on February 7, 2026 starring Kyle Wayne Baker, Dee Dee Benton, Clint Boevers and directed by Don Tjernagel. Get notified when SiMP is available to stream!', 'SiMP (2026) released on February 7, 2026 starring Kyle Wayne Baker, Dee Dee Benton, Clint Boevers and directed by Don Tjernagel. Get notified when SiMP is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMmQ4MTAzZDItNGMxMi00YjRmLWI1MGMtNTMxZTNkOTc4OGFmXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:simp-2026'),
  ('827260753047434695', 'Simpatici & antipatici', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Christian De Sica, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Enrico Vanzina, Christian De Sica, Carlo Vanzina', 'Christian De Sica, Gianfranco Funari, Leo Gullotta, Alessandro Haber, Simona Izzo, Marco Messeri, Monica Scattini, Angelo Bernabucci', null, 'In the Tiber sports club, Alberto, a ruthless property developer, the cynical surgeon who makes thirty million dollars after a prostate operation, the actor exhausted by failure and the failed salesman who sells caviar by discounting prices and who tries to make up for continuous overdrafts in the bank, meet. There is also the starlet with a Venetian accent and the hateful scion with a Ferrari, the waiter who dreams of being the scion and the jeweler who loses his house, wife and wealth because of the hot Spanish woman.', 'In the Tiber sports club, Alberto, a ruthless property developer, the cynical surgeon who makes thirty million dollars after a prostate operation, the actor exhausted by failure and the failed salesman who sells caviar by discounting prices and who tries to make up for continuous overdrafts in the bank, meet. There is also the starlet with a Venetian accent and the hateful scion with a Ferrari, the waiter who dreams of being the scion and the jeweler who loses his house, wife and wealth because of the hot Spanish woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qiftOWa74wgsnNWX9NUk0ZLrJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58519'),
  ('632233470163089918', 'Simpatico', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthew Warchus, John Toll', 'Matthew Warchus, David Nicholls', 'Nick Nolte, Jeff Bridges, Sharon Stone, Catherine Keener, Albert Finney, Shawn Hatosy, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Liam Waite', 'R', 'As youths in Azusa, Vinnie, Carter, and Rosie pull off a racing scam, substituting winners for plodders and winning big bucks on long odds. When an official uncovers the scam, they set him up for blackmail. Jump ahead twenty years, Carter and Rosie are married, successful racers in Kentucky about to sell their prize stallion, Simpatico. Vinnie is a drunk in Pomona. Vinnie decides to make a play for Rosie, lures Carter to California, steals his wallet and heads for Kentucky with the original blackmail material. Carter begs Vinnie''s friend, a grocery clerk named Cecilia, to follow Vinnie and get the stuff back that he has in a box. Will she succeed?', 'As youths in Azusa, Vinnie, Carter, and Rosie pull off a racing scam, substituting winners for plodders and winning big bucks on long odds. When an official uncovers the scam, they set him up for blackmail. Jump ahead twenty years, Carter and Rosie are married, successful racers in Kentucky about to sell their prize stallion, Simpatico. Vinnie is a drunk in Pomona. Vinnie decides to make a play for Rosie, lures Carter to California, steals his wallet and heads for Kentucky with the original blackmail material. Carter begs Vinnie''s friend, a grocery clerk named Cecilia, to follow Vinnie and get the stuff back that he has in a box. Will she succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6JglpvM6ERbZAYEW31gwvNprVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50116'),
  ('1024659524928280906', 'Simple Men', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller, Gregory Jacobs', 'Hal Hartley', 'Robert John Burke, Bill Sage, Karen Sillas, Elina Löwensohn, Martin Donovan, Mark Chandler Bailey, Christopher Cooke, Jeffrey Howard', 'R', 'Two diametrically opposite brothers set off on a journey to reunite with their estranged father but when their motorcycle breaks down while passing through a small town, they become entangled in local life.', 'Two diametrically opposite brothers set off on a journey to reunite with their estranged father but when their motorcycle breaks down while passing through a small town, they become entangled in local life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB03zN890CYjNvp9iqe8f9HC3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47802'),
  ('112391547967661050', 'Simple mortel', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Jolivet, Bertrand Chatry, François Basset', 'Pierre Jolivet', 'Philippe Volter, Christophe Bourseiller, Nathalie Roussel, Roland Giraud, Maaike Jansen, Marcel Maréchal, Arlette Thomas, Michel Lengliney', null, 'A young man, a researcher in ancient languages, begins to receive strange radio messages in a language only he knows. The messages ask him for very bizarre missions. Eventually, he understands that he''s just a pawn in an intergalactic game, and that the fate of Earth depends on him.', 'A young man, a researcher in ancient languages, begins to receive strange radio messages in a language only he knows. The messages ask him for very bizarre missions. Eventually, he understands that he''s just a pawn in an intergalactic game, and that the fate of Earth depends on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wsK6O4IYI1i4EFilxf77Qqzf3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45131'),
  ('639934393998413822', 'Simple Passion', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Danielle Arbid, Pascale Granel', 'Danielle Arbid', 'Laetitia Dosch, Sergei Polunin, Lou-Teymour Thion, Caroline Ducey, Grégoire Colin, Slimane Dazi', null, 'A man and a woman are brought together by chance for several months. He is younger than she is, married, Russian, officially a diplomat stationed in Paris. She is a beautiful teacher and researcher, with her feet firmly on the ground. The film follows the evolution of their love, from the beginning to end.', 'A man and a woman are brought together by chance for several months. He is younger than she is, married, Russian, officially a diplomat stationed in Paris. She is a beautiful teacher and researcher, with her feet firmly on the ground. The film follows the evolution of their love, from the beginning to end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbecuqHDcF8MyllcOBS4YO9oJBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526811'),
  ('1091613825076707908', 'Simple Simon', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andreas Öhman, Niklas Johansson', 'Jonathan Sjöberg, Andreas Öhman', 'Bill Skarsgård, Martin Wallström, Cecilia Forss, Sofie Hamilton, Susanne Thorson, Kristoffer Berglund, Jimmi Edlund, Mats Qviström', null, 'Simon has Asperger''s syndrome and doesn''t like changes in his life. He lives with his big brother Sam and Sam''s girlfriend Frida. When Frida can''t stand having to adapt to Simon''s peculiarities anymore she takes off, leaving Simon with having to find a new, perfect, girlfriend for his brother.', 'Simon has Asperger''s syndrome and doesn''t like changes in his life. He lives with his big brother Sam and Sam''s girlfriend Frida. When Frida can''t stand having to adapt to Simon''s peculiarities anymore she takes off, leaving Simon with having to find a new, perfect, girlfriend for his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVVWBgQtLy9gIZE4PXe2rt7ShNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55165'),
  ('189414299376943944', 'Simply Black', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Brémond, Jean-Pascal Zadi, John Wax', 'Kamel Guemra, Jean-Pascal Zadi', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Fary Lopes, Caroline Anglade, Omar Sy, Mathieu Kassovitz, Kareen Guiock, Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia', null, 'A failed 40 year old comedian wants to organize the first Black protests in France but meeting with other French celebrities of the Black community will make it a whole new adventure.', 'A failed 40 year old comedian wants to organize the first Black protests in France but meeting with other French celebrities of the Black community will make it a whole new adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRjcKOBOnSZpLRn5vYjIacG98Km.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679989'),
  ('789543911423012809', 'Simply Irresistible', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Tarlov, Robert M. Stevens', 'Judith Roberts', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Sean Patrick Flanery, Dylan Baker, Patricia Clarkson, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Christopher Durang, Betty Buckley, Olek Krupa', 'PG-13', 'After her mother''s death, mediocre chef Amanda Shelton is having trouble attracting customers to her family''s restaurant. While shopping for ingredients, she is given a magical crab by mysterious Gene O''Reilly. Afterward, Amanda''s dishes suddenly become excellent, inducing strong emotional reactions in everyone who eats them. Tom Bartlett, who is preparing to open his own eatery, tries her cooking and falls in love.', 'After her mother''s death, mediocre chef Amanda Shelton is having trouble attracting customers to her family''s restaurant. While shopping for ingredients, she is given a magical crab by mysterious Gene O''Reilly. Afterward, Amanda''s dishes suddenly become excellent, inducing strong emotional reactions in everyone who eats them. Tom Bartlett, who is preparing to open his own eatery, tries her cooking and falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFsqqPQUz69wPaLBqQeiGbGiW7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16172'),
  ('730449718954856156', 'Simran', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Hansal Mehta, Anuj Dhawan', 'Apurva Asrani', 'Kangana Ranaut, Sohum Shah, Esha Tewari, Rupinder Nagra, Aneesha Joshi, Catherine Dyer, Rusty Meyers, Jeff Rose', null, 'A Gujarati housekeeper working in the United States, allows her ambitions to overpower her which leads her to get involved in the world of crime.', 'A Gujarati housekeeper working in the United States, allows her ambitions to overpower her which leads her to get involved in the world of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc28w6EW198EB5NHKmmfDpiOkqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444011'),
  ('171473599632402022', 'Simulant', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'April Mullen, Russ De Jong, Markian Saray', 'Ryan Christopher Churchill', 'Robbie Amell, Jordana Brewster, Simu Liu, Sam Worthington, Alicia Sanz, Masa Lizdek, Christine L. Nguyen, Emmanuel Kabongo', null, 'Faye attempts to replace her newly deceased husband, Evan, with an android simulant (SIM). Although SIM Evan appears like human Evan in every way, Faye does not feel the same love for SIM Evan as it does for her. SIM Evan tries to win Faye back while at the same time being on-the-run from a government agent chasing down SIMs who have become “conscious” and could potentially be a threat to humankind.', 'Faye attempts to replace her newly deceased husband, Evan, with an android simulant (SIM). Although SIM Evan appears like human Evan in every way, Faye does not feel the same love for SIM Evan as it does for her. SIM Evan tries to win Faye back while at the same time being on-the-run from a government agent chasing down SIMs who have become “conscious” and could potentially be a threat to humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7ZwH93eoSf4Cv1ZXJeUgjw4grF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942199'),
  ('861123310623228820', 'Sin', 2003, 'Crime', 'Michael Stevens', 'Tim Willocks', 'Ving Rhames, Gary Oldman, Brian Cox, Kerry Washington, Alicia Coppola, Bill Sage, James Lew, Daniel Dae Kim', null, 'Retired cop Eddie Burns gave 15 years and the use of his left arm to the Reno homicide squad. When his wayward sister, Kassie, goes missing Eddie Burns finds himself subjected to a fiendish and ingenious campaign of revenge by the mysterious Charlie Strom. In order to protect his sister, Eddie - disabled, betrayed and alone - journeys into the heart of his own darkness: where he discovers that the reason for his ordeal lies in his own past sins and those of his adversary Charlie Strom.', 'Retired cop Eddie Burns gave 15 years and the use of his left arm to the Reno homicide squad. When his wayward sister, Kassie, goes missing Eddie Burns finds himself subjected to a fiendish and ingenious campaign of revenge by the mysterious Charlie Strom. In order to protect his sister, Eddie - disabled, betrayed and alone - journeys into the heart of his own darkness: where he discovers that the reason for his ordeal lies in his own past sins and those of his adversary Charlie Strom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juNwK0xRUZlQxCU9f5KDgBfFclF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37946'),
  ('74223948419852269', 'Sin', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Paolo Giacomo Marino, Nathalia Lyashenko, Massimiliano Battistella', 'Elena Kiseleva, Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Alberto Testone, Umberto Orsini, Nicola Adobati, Massimo De Francovich, Nicola De Paola, Glen Blackhall, Orso Maria Guerrini, Alexandra Deynega', null, 'The life of Michelangelo Buonarroti.', 'The life of Michelangelo Buonarroti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1AoTiokDbsyrsGBCGVvPWq5pJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497835'),
  ('469739889522540089', 'Sin City', 2005, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez, Frank Miller', null, 'Bruce Willis, Jessica Alba, Clive Owen, Mickey Rourke, Rutger Hauer, Benicio del Toro, Alexis Bledel, Michael Madsen', 'R', 'Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it dark… Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home — Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.', 'Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it dark… Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home — Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i66G50wATMmPrvpP95f0XP6ZdVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187'),
  ('207620744075912757', 'Sin City: A Dame to Kill For', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Frank Miller, Robert Rodriguez', 'Frank Miller', 'Jessica Alba, Bruce Willis, Mickey Rourke, Josh Brolin, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Eva Green, Rosario Dawson, Powers Boothe', 'R', 'Some of Sin City''s most hard-boiled citizens cross paths with a few of its more reviled inhabitants.', 'Some of Sin City''s most hard-boiled citizens cross paths with a few of its more reviled inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50kALxDX4mmzIRljbNbPY0u4cie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189'),
