  ('268465297117193538', 'Sin compasión', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Francisco J. Lombardi', 'Augusto Cabada', 'Diego Bertie, Adriana Dávila, Coco Chiarella, Marcello Rivera, Ricardo Fernández, Carlos Oneto, Hernán Romero, Mariella Trejos', null, 'Ramón, a psychologically unstable university student from Lima, murders his landlords, who constantly demanded the payment of the monthly rent for the hovel in which he lives. From here, remorse and the fear of being arrested will eat you inside.', 'Ramón, a psychologically unstable university student from Lima, murders his landlords, who constantly demanded the payment of the monthly rent for the hovel in which he lives. From here, remorse and the fear of being arrested will eat you inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/felCDe6E0puKMJEmDfyPVD7126x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106877'),
  ('217826704905660602', 'Sin in the Suburbs', 1964, 'Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno, James J. Markos', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Judy Young, W.B. Parker, Audrey Campbell, Dyanne Thorne, Marla Ellis, Richard Tatro, Derek Crane, Ella Daphni', 'NR', 'After discovering that her mother is involved in an adulterous affair, a pretty high school student seeks help from a neighbor. While their trusting bond grows into a deep relationship, a secret sex club for the area''s pleasure-seeking women is started. Soon, Mom discovers that her daughter is a member!', 'After discovering that her mother is involved in an adulterous affair, a pretty high school student seeks help from a neighbor. While their trusting bond grows into a deep relationship, a secret sex club for the area''s pleasure-seeking women is started. Soon, Mom discovers that her daughter is a member!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSgWE2EuLD1h64XuwnHUVsBpB2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98167'),
  ('717709548710593259', 'Sin Nombre', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga, Adriano Goldman', 'Cary Joji Fukunaga', 'Paulina Gaitán, Edgar Flores, Kristyan Ferrer, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Gerardo Taracena, Memo Villegas, Luis Fernando Peña, Diana García', 'R', 'Sayra, a Honduran teen, hungers for a better life. Her chance for one comes when she is reunited with her long-estranged father, who intends to emigrate to Mexico and then enter the United States. Sayra''s life collides with a pair of Mexican gangmembers who have boarded the same American-bound train.', 'Sayra, a Honduran teen, hungers for a better life. Her chance for one comes when she is reunited with her long-estranged father, who intends to emigrate to Mexico and then enter the United States. Sayra''s life collides with a pair of Mexican gangmembers who have boarded the same American-bound train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dubZwiGWp6TwYNGYtyGEUC7XAin.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21191'),
  ('600471536456722691', 'Sin remitente', 1995, null, 'Carlos Carrera', null, 'Luis Felipe Tovar, Tiaré Scanda, Fernando Torre Laphame, Luisa Huertas, Guillermo Gil, Gina Morett, Nora Velázquez, Juan Carlos Colombo', null, 'A lonely, aging postal worker finds himself the victim of a cruel practical joke in this pessimistic Mexican drama. The trouble begins when crotchety postman Andre begins complaining about his young neighbor Marianna''s propensity for playing loud music every time she entertains a lover. To get back at him, Marianna begins sending him anonymous love letters. The old man is intrigued by the mysterious letters and hires a cheap detective to find their author. The detective is convinced the perpetrator is Teresita, a veteran hooker who joins in on the scheme to earn a little extra cash. Andre''s friend and colleague tries to warn Andre that it is all a game, but his friend is in love and will not listen. Meanwhile, Marianna attempts to woo Luis Felipe, a hard, unfeeling tabloid journalist who has her take grisly pictures of murder victims for him. Both Marianna and Andre are destined to meet an unpleasant fate at the story''s end.', 'A lonely, aging postal worker finds himself the victim of a cruel practical joke in this pessimistic Mexican drama. The trouble begins when crotchety postman Andre begins complaining about his young neighbor Marianna''s propensity for playing loud music every time she entertains a lover. To get back at him, Marianna begins sending him anonymous love letters. The old man is intrigued by the mysterious letters and hires a cheap detective to find their author. The detective is convinced the perpetrator is Teresita, a veteran hooker who joins in on the scheme to earn a little extra cash. Andre''s friend and colleague tries to warn Andre that it is all a game, but his friend is in love and will not listen. Meanwhile, Marianna attempts to woo Luis Felipe, a hard, unfeeling tabloid journalist who has her take grisly pictures of murder victims for him. Both Marianna and Andre are destined to meet an unpleasant fate at the story''s end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/na7RPhAPEeq0Z0VoBhqkgJRlIhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203950'),
  ('587247090227519954', 'Sin Takes a Holiday', 1930, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Paul L. Stein, John J. Mescall, Francis Gromon', 'Horace Jackson', 'Constance Bennett, Kenneth MacKenna, Basil Rathbone, Rita La Roy, Louis John Bartels, John Roche, Zasu Pitts, Kendall Lee', 'NR', 'Dowdy Sylvia accepts her boss'' marriage proposal, even though he only asked her to avoid marriage to another woman. As a wealthy wife, Sylvia changes from plain to uninhibited swan and even contemplates having an affair.', 'Dowdy Sylvia accepts her boss'' marriage proposal, even though he only asked her to avoid marriage to another woman. As a wealthy wife, Sylvia changes from plain to uninhibited swan and even contemplates having an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQPawHenOwMcR6K7QRuSUliOozZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166589'),
  ('861956618506918927', 'Sin tetas no hay paraíso', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gustavo Bolívar', 'Gustavo Bolívar', 'Isabel Cristina Cadavid, Linda Lucía Callejas, Juan Sebastián Calero, Linda Baldrich, Fabio Restrepo, Ramiro Meneses, Miguel Varoni, Francisco Bolívar', null, 'Catalina is a young, beautiful girl living in extreme poverty with her brother Bayron and her mother Hilda. She becomes obsessed with getting breast implants to get social status and money. She leaves her boyfriend Albeira and becomes a prostitute for drug dealers. In this way she will enjoy all the luxuries that she lacks. Meanwhile, her ex-boyfriend Albeira and her mother Hilda begin a relationship behind her back.', 'Catalina is a young, beautiful girl living in extreme poverty with her brother Bayron and her mother Hilda. She becomes obsessed with getting breast implants to get social status and money. She leaves her boyfriend Albeira and becomes a prostitute for drug dealers. In this way she will enjoy all the luxuries that she lacks. Meanwhile, her ex-boyfriend Albeira and her mother Hilda begin a relationship behind her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fIx3BgiU7u9ZuMG74JYidIVboM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107748'),
  ('951553764547635877', 'Sin: The Movie', 2000, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Yasunori Urata, Yasunori Urata, Kobun Shizuno', 'Kensei Date, Ryoma Kaneko', 'Kaori Yamagata, Kikuko Inoue, Koji Ishii, Ayako Kawasumi, Hiroya Ishimaru, Junji Murayama, Katsuhiro Harasawa, Masako Katsuki', 'NR', 'It is the near future, and the city of Freeport teeters on the verge of total collapse. The twin tides of rampant crime and ruinous graft face only one barrier: the elite strike force HARDCORPS. Led by Colonel John Blade, HARDCORPS is the last force for justice in the darkening city.', 'It is the near future, and the city of Freeport teeters on the verge of total collapse. The twin tides of rampant crime and ruinous graft face only one barrier: the elite strike force HARDCORPS. Led by Colonel John Blade, HARDCORPS is the last force for justice in the darkening city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pzbXzP7KAiwgrnrCbrxjQaNBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34772'),
  ('724697120507189463', 'Sinbad', 1971, 'Drama', 'Zoltán Huszárik, János Tamási, Sára Sándor', 'Zoltán Huszárik, János Tóth', 'Zoltán Latinovits, Éva Ruttkai, Dajka Margit, Györgyi Andai, Éva Pap, Anna Nagy, Eva Leelossy, Erika Szegedi', null, 'Based on the stories of Hungarian writer Gyula Krúdy, this film is a lush and sensuous depiction of the life, loves and memories of serial seducer Szindbád. As the protagonist looks back on his life, past and present, imagination and reality flow inseparably into one another.', 'Based on the stories of Hungarian writer Gyula Krúdy, this film is a lush and sensuous depiction of the life, loves and memories of serial seducer Szindbád. As the protagonist looks back on his life, past and present, imagination and reality flow inseparably into one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHLBICwaeDy6rdrYwml3UwjZyv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86431'),
  ('102001226387417143', 'Sinbad', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Diane Eskenazi', 'Jack Olesker', 'Cam Clarke', null, 'A brave young man fights with courage against all enemies to earn his wealth.', 'A brave young man fights with courage against all enemies to earn his wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m01y1AQieKorJA6hR8NO2RKxrtV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72870'),
  ('689902129561442409', 'Sinbad - The Trapalhão Sailor', 1976, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'J.B. Tanko, Antônio Gonçalves', 'Victor Lustosa, J.B. Tanko', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Jorge Cherques, Carlos Kurt, Rosina Malbouisson, Edson Rabello, Vera Setta, Claudio D''Oliani', null, 'Kiko and Duda, circus workers, get into a big mess when Kiko is mistaken for the trampist Sinbad. The bumbling boy is then abducted by the minions of the magician Ali Tuffi, who already has in his power the genius of the magic bottle, but they need the trapeze artist, descendant of the true sailor, to locate the philosopher''s stone with which he will become a man very rich, with lots of fortune and power. In an attempt to help his friends, the real trampist Simbad and his girlfriend Luciana also end up being held prisoner on the bandits'' ship. After a confusion, everyone will stop on an island full of dangers, where the stone is hidden.', 'Kiko and Duda, circus workers, get into a big mess when Kiko is mistaken for the trampist Sinbad. The bumbling boy is then abducted by the minions of the magician Ali Tuffi, who already has in his power the genius of the magic bottle, but they need the trapeze artist, descendant of the true sailor, to locate the philosopher''s stone with which he will become a man very rich, with lots of fortune and power. In an attempt to help his friends, the real trampist Simbad and his girlfriend Luciana also end up being held prisoner on the bandits'' ship. After a confusion, everyone will stop on an island full of dangers, where the stone is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxrYij1gxwIakNrrVP5LNPrEMV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409232'),
  ('238356703446681299', 'Sinbad and the Cyclops Island', 2003, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Animation, Action, Family, Adventure', 'Patrick Gilmore', 'Patrick Gilmore', 'Brad Pitt, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Dennis Haysbert', 'NR', 'Marina, Sinbad and his crew are resting on a small island. They soon find out they''re not alone.', 'Marina, Sinbad and his crew are resting on a small island. They soon find out they''re not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZTLMDMHTlZnd6q6AAJRlJEGBNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381690'),
  ('141330710556127043', 'Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger', 1977, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Sam Wanamaker, Ted Moore', 'Beverley Cross', 'Patrick Wayne, Taryn Power, Jane Seymour, Patrick Troughton, Kurt Christian, Nadim Sawalha, Damien Thomas, Bruno Barnabe', 'G', 'Princess Farah refuses to marry Sinbad until Prince Kassim, her brother, is able to give his consent. However, the Prince''s wicked stepmother, Queen Zenobia, has changed Kassim into a baboon in order to have her own son crowned as caliph. Sinbad, his crew, the Princess and the transformed Prince travel to a distant land, fighting every obstacle Zenobia places in their path, to seek the advice of a legendary wise man who can possibly tell how to end the spell.', 'Princess Farah refuses to marry Sinbad until Prince Kassim, her brother, is able to give his consent. However, the Prince''s wicked stepmother, Queen Zenobia, has changed Kassim into a baboon in order to have her own son crowned as caliph. Sinbad, his crew, the Princess and the transformed Prince travel to a distant land, fighting every obstacle Zenobia places in their path, to seek the advice of a legendary wise man who can possibly tell how to end the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMP5bg26ac1FmNCamOC5WZece6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11940'),
  ('350420740456723561', 'Sinbad of the Seven Seas', 1989, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Luigi Cozzi, Blasco Giurato', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Tito Carpi', 'Lou Ferrigno, John Steiner, Roland Wybenga, Ennio Girolami, Hal Yamanouchi, Yehuda Efroni, Alessandra Martines, Teagan Clive', 'PG-13', 'Sinbad returns from the sea to find his country subjected to the will of two unscrupulous sorcerers.', 'Sinbad returns from the sea to find his country subjected to the will of two unscrupulous sorcerers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXntPpDQeqvW7wl3B7B32SaaJPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44126'),
  ('15705378829600462', 'Sinbad the Sailor', 1947, 'Adventure', 'Richard Wallace, George Barnes, Lloyd Richards', 'John Twist', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Maureen O''Hara, Walter Slezak, Anthony Quinn, George Tobias, Jane Greer, Mike Mazurki, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'Daredevil sailor Sinbad embarks on a voyage across the Seven Seas to find the lost riches of Alexander the Great. His first stop is the port of Basra, where his ship is seized and scheduled for auction. In his attempt to win it back, he befriends beautiful concubine Shireen. But when her master, the nefarious Emir, calls her back to duty, Sinbad must interrupt his adventure to save the "Jewel of Persia."', 'Daredevil sailor Sinbad embarks on a voyage across the Seven Seas to find the lost riches of Alexander the Great. His first stop is the port of Basra, where his ship is seized and scheduled for auction. In his attempt to win it back, he befriends beautiful concubine Shireen. But when her master, the nefarious Emir, calls her back to duty, Sinbad must interrupt his adventure to save the "Jewel of Persia."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGR0NXdzfUEtokDLvKj7IFn4RFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43464'),
  ('716371224708153973', 'Sinbad: Afros and Bellbottoms', 1993, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Debbie Allen', 'Sinbad', 'Sinbad', 'PG-13', 'Sinbad brings the ''70s back with a nostalgic stand-up special dedicated to the films, fashion and other flashbacks from that era.', 'Sinbad brings the ''70s back with a nostalgic stand-up special dedicated to the films, fashion and other flashbacks from that era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAYv6aZ7i4aQ9FztzM26Fx7KreZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63050'),
