  ('705331174574290240', 'Sing Sing', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Alessandro D''Eva, Giorgio Ubaldi', 'Enrico Oldoini, Franco Ferrini, Sergio Corbucci', 'Enrico Montesano, Adriano Celentano, Marina Suma, Franco Giacobini, Angela Goodwin, Désirée Nosbusch, Gianni Minà, Ugo Bologna', null, 'Eduardo accidentally discovers that he is adopted. His real father is dying, but before his death he said that his mother was the "Queen of England", failing to clarify that this is the nickname of Italian prostitute. But Eduardo is already rushing to the capital of England...', 'Eduardo accidentally discovers that he is adopted. His real father is dying, but before his death he said that his mother was the "Queen of England", failing to clarify that this is the nickname of Italian prostitute. But Eduardo is already rushing to the capital of England...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNyHcK1jypvWmHpI8ykZsyAeNlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81666'),
